values
  ('869145278269076558', 'Going in Style', 1979, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Martin Brest, Billy Williams', 'Martin Brest', 'George Burns, Art Carney, Lee Strasberg, Charles Hallahan, Pamela Payton-Wright, Siobhan Keegan, Brian Neville, Constantine Hartofolis', 'PG', 'Three kindly old men decide to light up the dimming twilight of their lives with a last blaze of glory – by sticking up a Manhattan bank in broad daylight.', 'Three kindly old men decide to light up the dimming twilight of their lives with a last blaze of glory – by sticking up a Manhattan bank in broad daylight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZz2yRiydgksy1eEDDlVRXZIenO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65066'),
  ('958919350404762885', 'Going in Style', 2017, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Rodney Charters, G.A. Aguilar, Christopher Surgent', 'Martin Brest', 'Morgan Freeman, Michael Caine, Alan Arkin, Ann-Margret, John Ortiz, Peter Serafinowicz, Joey King, Kenan Thompson', 'PG-13', 'Desperate to pay the bills and come through for their loved ones, three lifelong pals risk it all by embarking on a daring bid to knock off the very bank that absconded with their money.', 'Desperate to pay the bills and come through for their loved ones, three lifelong pals risk it all by embarking on a daring bid to knock off the very bank that absconded with their money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nfWsdsJfO5srRZgxiWC9xHub0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353070'),
  ('993490114216816826', 'Going My Way', 1944, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Lionel Lindon, Leo McCarey', 'Frank Butler, Frank Cavett', 'Bing Crosby, Barry Fitzgerald, Frank McHugh, James Brown, Gene Lockhart, Jean Heather, Porter Hall, Fortunio Bonanova', 'NR', 'Youthful Father Chuck O''Malley led a colorful life of sports, song, and romance before joining the Roman Catholic clergy. After being appointed to a run-down New York parish, O''Malley''s worldly knowledge helps him connect with a gang of boys looking for direction, eventually winning over the aging, conventional Parish priest.', 'Youthful Father Chuck O''Malley led a colorful life of sports, song, and romance before joining the Roman Catholic clergy. After being appointed to a run-down New York parish, O''Malley''s worldly knowledge helps him connect with a gang of boys looking for direction, eventually winning over the aging, conventional Parish priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/838yNJnOk6iZj5YK1MoKiN2n1hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17661'),
  ('97847780339801655', 'Going Overboard', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Valerie Breiman, Ron Jacobs', 'Valerie Breiman', 'Adam Sandler, Scott LaRose, Tom Hodges, Lisa Collins, Adam Rifkin, Peter Berg, Billy Zane, Burt Young', 'R', 'A struggling young comedian takes a menial job on a cruise ship where he hopes for his big chance to make it in the world of cruise ship comedy.', 'A struggling young comedian takes a menial job on a cruise ship where he hopes for his big chance to make it in the world of cruise ship comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRyhUrLDhVYie2GBX3rXF64Jom1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19157'),
  ('972201862476513143', 'Going Places', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruno Nuytten, Bertrand Blier', 'Bertrand Blier, Philippe Dumarçay', 'Gérard Depardieu, Miou-Miou, Patrick Dewaere, Jeanne Moreau, Christian Alers, Brigitte Fossey, Michel Peyrelon, Gérard Boucaron', 'R', 'Two whimsical, aimless thugs harass and assault women, steal, murder, and alternately charm, fight, or sprint their way out of trouble. They take whatever the bourgeoisie holds dear, whether it’s cars, peace of mind, or daughters. Marie-Ange, a jaded, passive hairdresser, joins them as lover, cook, and mother confessor. She’s on her own search for seemingly unattainable sexual pleasure.', 'Two whimsical, aimless thugs harass and assault women, steal, murder, and alternately charm, fight, or sprint their way out of trouble. They take whatever the bourgeoisie holds dear, whether it’s cars, peace of mind, or daughters. Marie-Ange, a jaded, passive hairdresser, joins them as lover, cook, and mother confessor. She’s on her own search for seemingly unattainable sexual pleasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1evmnMMSgUXORoECRwiMiqjwmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4031'),
  ('612707730699367719', 'Going South', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Lifshitz, Claire Mathon', 'Stéphane Bouquet, Vincent Poymiro, Sébastien Lifshitz', 'Yannick Renier, Léa Seydoux, Nicole Garcia, Pierre Perrier, Micheline Presle, Théo Frilet, Gérard Watkins, Marie Matheron', null, 'In the summer, 27 year-old Sam drives towards the south of France in his Ford. He meets Matthieu and his sister Léa and takes them along in his apparently aimless journey. Matthieu has a crush on Sam and tries to seduce him. Léa is a beautiful, young, provocative girl who likes men so much that she got pregnant. She soon brings along Jérémie with them. Throughout the trip, they learn to know, fight and love each other. In spite of a blooming relationship with Matthieu, Sam isolates himself because of his secret: he is headed for Spain to find his long-lost mother.', 'In the summer, 27 year-old Sam drives towards the south of France in his Ford. He meets Matthieu and his sister Léa and takes them along in his apparently aimless journey. Matthieu has a crush on Sam and tries to seduce him. Léa is a beautiful, young, provocative girl who likes men so much that she got pregnant. She soon brings along Jérémie with them. Throughout the trip, they learn to know, fight and love each other. In spite of a blooming relationship with Matthieu, Sam isolates himself because of his secret: he is headed for Spain to find his long-lost mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbRu3zFmkvFxCyjYg8yT5oTWkZs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56263'),
  ('119840939746840931', 'Going Steady', 1979, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ronni Ackerman, Boaz Davidson, Adam Greenberg', 'Boaz Davidson, Eli Tavor', 'Yftach Katzur, Yvonne Michaels, Zachi Noy, Rachel Steiner, Jonathan Sagall, Dafna Armoni, Dvora Kedar, Menashe Warshavsky', null, 'It''s the greasy 50''s, and girls are still causing problems for the Lemon Popsicle boys! Benji falls head over heels in love with new girl Tammy but manages to ruin the relationship by pushing her to go all the way. Benji is the object of Martha''s affections, even though she is dating Huey, and as usual Bobby is finding it hard to stay faithful to just one girl! Going Stead is set against a backdrop of sunlit beaches, moonlit nights... and Rock ''n'' Roll!', 'It''s the greasy 50''s, and girls are still causing problems for the Lemon Popsicle boys! Benji falls head over heels in love with new girl Tammy but manages to ruin the relationship by pushing her to go all the way. Benji is the object of Martha''s affections, even though she is dating Huey, and as usual Bobby is finding it hard to stay faithful to just one girl! Going Stead is set against a backdrop of sunlit beaches, moonlit nights... and Rock ''n'' Roll!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHvOqYo5dqkT3PwcnyvzHvTuIdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10581'),
  ('973947313653612147', 'Going the Distance', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Griffiths, Gregory Middleton, Noel Harris', 'Eric Goodman, Kelly Senecal', 'Christopher Jacot, Joanne Kelly, Shawn Roberts, Katheryn Winnick, Ryan Belleville, Mayko Nguyen, August Schellenberg, Matt Frewer', 'R', 'Nick is a successful young man whose comfortable West Coast life couldn''t be better. However, when his girlfriend falls under the influence of lecherous music producer Lenny Swackhammer, Nick impulsively decides to travel to Toronto to intervene. Nick''s buddies Tyler and Dime opt to turn the quest into a cross-country road trip that''s complete with wacky antics and encounters with beautiful women.', 'Nick is a successful young man whose comfortable West Coast life couldn''t be better. However, when his girlfriend falls under the influence of lecherous music producer Lenny Swackhammer, Nick impulsively decides to travel to Toronto to intervene. Nick''s buddies Tyler and Dime opt to turn the quest into a cross-country road trip that''s complete with wacky antics and encounters with beautiful women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shmF571Ph6U5E03ahuuzOPi6rl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19423'),
  ('890194368234343787', 'Going the Distance', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nanette Burstein, Eric Steelberg, Yumiko Takeya', 'Geoff LaTulippe', 'Drew Barrymore, Justin Long, Charlie Day, Jason Sudeikis, Christina Applegate, Ron Livingston, Natalie Morales, Kelli Garner', 'R', 'Erin and Garrett are very much in love. When Erin moves to San Francisco to finish her journalism degree and Garrett stays behind in New York to work in the music industry, they gamely keep the romance alive with webcams and frequent-flyer miles. But just when it seems the lovers will soon be reunited, they each score a big break that could separate them for good.', 'Erin and Garrett are very much in love. When Erin moves to San Francisco to finish her journalism degree and Garrett stays behind in New York to work in the music industry, they gamely keep the romance alive with webcams and frequent-flyer miles. But just when it seems the lovers will soon be reunited, they each score a big break that could separate them for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTllmSew3nsizpzWNWKUkOuANhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38073'),
  ('347910041085180816', 'Going to Bed Under Difficulties', 1900, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A man takes off his clothes in preparation for bed, only for new clothes to spontaneously generate, leading to comical consternation.', 'A man takes off his clothes in preparation for bed, only for new clothes to spontaneously generate, leading to comical consternation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OOH1exeqx6IfLGL3UcQsGVJa6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106809'),
  ('264935553206133133', 'Going to Brazil', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Mille, André Szankowski', 'Patrick Mille, Sabrina Amara, Julien Lambroschini', 'Vanessa Guide, Alison Wheeler, Margot Bancilhon, Philippine Stindel, Patrick Mille, Christine Citti, Joseph Malerba, Chico Diaz', null, 'Four childhood friends are reunited at a wedding in Rio. But when they accidentally kill a young man during a party that gets out of hand, they are forced to flee the city in a crazy adventure.', 'Four childhood friends are reunited at a wedding in Rio. But when they accidentally kill a young man during a party that gets out of hand, they are forced to flee the city in a crazy adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyPK9U08dVSBUWjaI5LFIGXXfZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416398'),
  ('656174923855120612', 'Going to Pieces: The Rise and Fall of the Slasher Film', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Jeff McQueen, Michael Fimognari, Armando Salas', 'J. Albert Bell, Rudy Scalese, Rachel Belofsky', 'Ed Green, Lilyan Chauvin, John Carpenter, Rob Zombie, Betsy Palmer, Malek Akkad, Wes Craven, Sean S. Cunningham', 'NR', 'This historical and critical look at slasher films, which includes dozens of clips, begins with Halloween, Friday the 13th, and Prom Night. The films'' directors, writers, producers, and special effects creators comment on the films'' making and success. During the Reagan years, the films get gorier, budgets get smaller, and their appeal wanes. Then, Nightmare on Elm Street revives the genre. Jump to the late 90s, when Scream brings humor and TV stars into the mix.', 'This historical and critical look at slasher films, which includes dozens of clips, begins with Halloween, Friday the 13th, and Prom Night. The films'' directors, writers, producers, and special effects creators comment on the films'' making and success. During the Reagan years, the films get gorier, budgets get smaller, and their appeal wanes. Then, Nightmare on Elm Street revives the genre. Jump to the late 90s, when Scream brings humor and TV stars into the mix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yztO70IoLnK5bRhRUn8gJ7meiGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50787'),
  ('1143867809868809429', 'Going to the Mat', 2004, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family', 'Stuart Gillard, Thomas Burstyn, Matias Alvarez', 'Chris Nolan, Steve Bloom, Stu Krieger', 'Andrew Lawrence, Khleo Thomas, Alessandra Torresani, Billy Aaron Brown, Brenda Strong, Brian Wimmer, D. B. Sweeney, Wayne Brady', 'G', 'Jace Newfield has a problem. Besides being blind and being the new kid at school, his problem is that the kids at his new school thinks he''s a jerk. Jace has to find a way to be accepted into his new school. Joining the wrestling team just might work.', 'Jace Newfield has a problem. Besides being blind and being the new kid at school, his problem is that the kids at his new school thinks he''s a jerk. Jace has to find a way to be accepted into his new school. Joining the wrestling team just might work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCETZz4SBfIBdidCTcRozR37DF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122987'),
  ('111072397243004993', 'Going Under', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Mark W. Travis, Victor Hammer', 'Randolph Davis, Darryl Zarubica', 'Bill Pullman, Ned Beatty, Wendy Schaal, Robert Vaughn, Roddy McDowall, Chris Demetral, Ty Granderson Jones, Dennis Redfield', 'PG', 'An American submarine races to get a nuclear weapon before a Russian submarine.', 'An American submarine races to get a nuclear weapon before a Russian submarine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/439SBxDGNledvQp3Bo75qt34PB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169953'),
  ('977155890079052368', 'Going! Going! Gosh!', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian', 'NR', 'The Coyote makes various attempts to get the Road Runner with an explosive-tipped arrow, by shooting himself out of a sling shot and by covering the road with quick drying cement.', 'The Coyote makes various attempts to get the Road Runner with an explosive-tipped arrow, by shooting himself out of a sling shot and by covering the road with quick drying cement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st5fRcObajrDQgWhRTc4s1ScMBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118312'),
  ('1058346240543474102', 'Goitia: A God for Himself', 1989, 'Drama', 'Diego López Rivera, Arturo de la Rosa, Jorge Suárez Coellar', 'Diego López Rivera, Javier Sicilia, Jorge González de León', 'José Carlos Ruiz, Angélica Aragón, Ana Ofelia Murguía, Socorro Avelar, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Fernando Balzaretti, Alonso Echánove, Martin LaSalle', null, 'The Mexican painter Francisco Goitia, feeling his death approaching, manages to make a memory of his life: the reunion with his country and his people, his permanent search for identity as a man and as an artist and his struggle against the demons of the body and his subsequent religious conversion.', 'The Mexican painter Francisco Goitia, feeling his death approaching, manages to make a memory of his life: the reunion with his country and his people, his permanent search for identity as a man and as an artist and his struggle against the demons of the body and his subsequent religious conversion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLAaWcgcdtQosYCwFG3DVA3sFRs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363384'),
  ('1012367496891735313', 'Gojoe: Spirit War Chronicle', 2001, 'Action, History', 'Gakuryu Ishii', 'Gorô Nakajima, Gakuryu Ishii', 'Tadanobu Asano, Masatoshi Nagase, Daisuke Ryū, Masakatsu Funaki, Jun Kunimura, Ryo Kase, Urara Awata, Naruki Matsukawa', null, 'Benkei, a master fighter and killer, vows never to take another life after his conversion to Buddhism. His faith in pacifism, however, is shaken and ultimately broken by the attacks from a trio of fighters known only as the demons. Taking up his sword once more, he sets out to end their murderous terror.', 'Benkei, a master fighter and killer, vows never to take another life after his conversion to Buddhism. His faith in pacifism, however, is shaken and ultimately broken by the attacks from a trio of fighters known only as the demons. Taking up his sword once more, he sets out to end their murderous terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNajPeSjHomB3RyjswbUEFyyCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32248'),
  ('353313794112265425', 'Gokaiger Goseiger Super Sentai 199 Hero Great Battle', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Noboru Takemoto, Fumie Arakawa, Hirofumi Ishigaki', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ryota Ozawa, Yuki Yamada, Mao Ichimichi, Kazuki Shimizu, Yui Koike, Yukari Tamura, Yudai Chiba, Rika Satoh', null, 'The Space Empire Zangyack forms an alliance with the Black Cross King, the resurrected form of the Gorengers'' enemy the Black Cross Führer, in order to invade Earth with other revived Super Sentai enemies. The Gokaigers, along with the Goseigers, who have lost their powers from the Legend War, must team up in order to fight against the new enemy.', 'The Space Empire Zangyack forms an alliance with the Black Cross King, the resurrected form of the Gorengers'' enemy the Black Cross Führer, in order to invade Earth with other revived Super Sentai enemies. The Gokaigers, along with the Goseigers, who have lost their powers from the Legend War, must team up in order to fight against the new enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQPXFTcXhSxsegkwVj8OlJMCj4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160939'),
  ('482742600909491249', 'Goké, Body Snatcher from Hell', 1968, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hajime Sato, Shizuo Hirase, Keiji Shiraki', 'Kyuzo Kobayashi, Susumu Takaku', 'Teruo Yoshida, Tomomi Satō, Hideo Kō, Masaya Takahashi, Nobuo Kaneko, Eizō Kitamura, Yūko Kusunoki, Kazuo Katō', 'NR', 'The survivors of a plane crash in a remote area are attacked by blob-like alien creatures that turn their victims into blood-thirsty vampires.', 'The survivors of a plane crash in a remote area are attacked by blob-like alien creatures that turn their victims into blood-thirsty vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjBZ1HdYBskrsRMacQHmmv9uQ2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42628'),
  ('1050819971224286964', 'Goku II: Midnight Eye', 1989, 'Thriller, Action, Animation', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri', 'Buichi Terasawa', 'Juji Matsuda, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Issei Futamata, Daisuke Gori, Toshiko Fujita, Kazumi Tanaka, Kimie Hantani, Koji Totani', null, 'Goku, the lone wolf private detective is back, contracted by Yoshiko, a mysterious, beautiful and very afraid woman, to find and save her brother, Ryu. Will Goku be able to protect Yoshiko from her step father''s soldiers long enough to find her brother? Meanwhile Ryu, the unfortunate subject of a military experiment gone bad, leaves a trail of bodies behind him and has no intention of being found or saved by anyone. Will Goku have to kill the man he is supposed to save? Will even his omniscient cybernetic eye and sceptre be enough to help him defeat this indestructible killing machine?', 'Goku, the lone wolf private detective is back, contracted by Yoshiko, a mysterious, beautiful and very afraid woman, to find and save her brother, Ryu. Will Goku be able to protect Yoshiko from her step father''s soldiers long enough to find her brother? Meanwhile Ryu, the unfortunate subject of a military experiment gone bad, leaves a trail of bodies behind him and has no intention of being found or saved by anyone. Will Goku have to kill the man he is supposed to save? Will even his omniscient cybernetic eye and sceptre be enough to help him defeat this indestructible killing machine?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVglNxYtCJNjjylFs3tzs2B70Eh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160778'),
  ('979072369859294114', 'Goku: Midnight Eye', 1989, 'Animation, Action, Thriller', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri', 'Buichi Terasawa', 'Juji Matsuda, Mami Koyama, Norio Wakamoto, Daisuke Gori, Ichiro Nagai, Juji Matsuda, Iemasa Kayumi, Koichi Yamadera', null, 'Tokyo, 2014: a city balancing on the razor''s edge between financial prosperity and seismic destruction. It is a place where the lights are bright, the stakes are high, and where the threat of imminent destruction breeds crime like a disease. But for Gokuu Furinji, ex-cop and super-powered private detective, crime is money...', 'Tokyo, 2014: a city balancing on the razor''s edge between financial prosperity and seismic destruction. It is a place where the lights are bright, the stakes are high, and where the threat of imminent destruction breeds crime like a disease. But for Gokuu Furinji, ex-cop and super-powered private detective, crime is money...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LdpUqDcOZu9o503BRrU3LKeEEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77674'),
  ('871719288066101250', 'Gokusen: The Movie', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tōya Satō', null, 'Yukie Nakama, Katsuhisa Namase, Yuta Tamamori, Haruma Miura, Shun Oguri, Yuma Ishigaki, Kenji Anan, Riki Takeuchi', 'PG-13', 'A passionate teacher, Kumiko Yamaguchi, a.k.a. Yankumi, is now overseeing the new students of Class 3D of Akado High School, who still have not opened up to her and are giving her a hard time. Current and former Class 3D students collide in this epic finale to the Japanese TV series.', 'A passionate teacher, Kumiko Yamaguchi, a.k.a. Yankumi, is now overseeing the new students of Class 3D of Akado High School, who still have not opened up to her and are giving her a hard time. Current and former Class 3D students collide in this epic finale to the Japanese TV series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MaWPFMVGkCijyaNHDFzyxBJ6k1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78013'),
  ('835919616661405819', 'Gol Maal', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Ram Gopal Sharma, Saroj Banerjee', 'Sachin Bhowmick', 'Amol Palekar, Utpal Dutt, Bindiya Goswami, Dina Pathak, Deven Verma, Manju Singh, David Abraham Cheulkar, Shubha Khote', null, 'A man''s simple lie to secure his job escalates into more complex lies when his orthodox boss becomes suspicious.', 'A man''s simple lie to secure his job escalates into more complex lies when his orthodox boss becomes suspicious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPW269Qx8VxfiQI2PFHcSJkGOI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30066'),
  ('455834808598856431', 'Gol!a', 2023, 'Drama', 'Roberto Marra, Stefano Salvatori', 'Roberto Marra', 'Lucia Batassa, Giorgio Colangeli, Giobbe Covatta, Pietro De Silva, Mirko Frezza, Roberta Anna', null, 'Golia is a former rugby champion suffering from dementia. every day he wakes up convinced that he is still young and is away with his team, only to learn that he is living inside a nursing home and has lost all contact with his wife and children. alessandro, another guest of the nursing home, is a former professor of ancient literature suffering from paraplegia. alessandro has one last ambition left: to help golia break out of the nursing home and reunite him with his family, overcoming the defense lines of the institution’s mean-spirited staff and showing the institutions how senility and illness are not valid pretexts for defining the social worthlessness of man.', 'Golia is a former rugby champion suffering from dementia. every day he wakes up convinced that he is still young and is away with his team, only to learn that he is living inside a nursing home and has lost all contact with his wife and children. alessandro, another guest of the nursing home, is a former professor of ancient literature suffering from paraplegia. alessandro has one last ambition left: to help golia break out of the nursing home and reunite him with his family, overcoming the defense lines of the institution’s mean-spirited staff and showing the institutions how senility and illness are not valid pretexts for defining the social worthlessness of man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQJHAN41QP6O8ubGCJIIObb9Gi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1138745'),
  ('748320140531987619', 'Golam', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Samjad P S, Binoy Nambala, Vijay', 'Samjad P S, Praveen Viswanath', 'Ranjith Sajeev, Dileesh Pothan, Alencier Ley Lopez, Chinnu Chandini Nair, Siddique, Srikant Murali, Sunny Wayne, Ansal Palluruthy', null, 'A mysterious death during work hours in an office puzzles all but only Investigator ASP Sandeep Krishna observes it as a murder.', 'A mysterious death during work hours in an office puzzles all but only Investigator ASP Sandeep Krishna observes it as a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa30QzjokChiDOtuV27cfOSSVOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1222140'),
  ('363921925204648099', 'Gold', 1934, 'Crime, Science Fiction', 'Karl Hartl, Otto Baecker, Werner Bohne', 'Rolf E. Vanloo', 'Hans Albers, Brigitte Helm, Michael Bohnen, Lien Deyers, Friedrich Kayssler, Ernst Karchow, Eberhard Leithoff, Rudolf Platte', null, 'Using an atomic reactor, two scientists try to create gold.', 'Using an atomic reactor, two scientists try to create gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzURC7xi3NApgYp2EMolWsZK2hC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170309'),
  ('575213613345117978', 'Gold', 1974, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Peter R. Hunt, John Glen, Ousama Rawi', 'Wilbur Smith, Stanley Price', 'Roger Moore, Susannah York, Ray Milland, John Gielgud, Bradford Dillman, Tony Beckley, Simon Sabela, Marc Smith', null, 'Rod Slater is the newly appointed general manager of the Sonderditch gold mine, but he stumbles across an ingenious plot to flood the mine, by drilling into an underground lake, so the unscrupulous owners can make a killing in the international gold market.', 'Rod Slater is the newly appointed general manager of the Sonderditch gold mine, but he stumbles across an ingenious plot to flood the mine, by drilling into an underground lake, so the unscrupulous owners can make a killing in the international gold market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HncdDCSSeJQLIz3bAOocigqDqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47737'),
  ('569900638377013647', 'Gold', 2013, 'Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Thomas Arslan, Patrick Orth', 'Thomas Arslan', 'Nina Hoss, Lars Rudolph, Uwe Bohm, Marko Mandić, Peter Kurth, Wolfgang Packhäuser, Rosa Enskat, Kindall Charters', null, 'Canada, the summer of 1898. A group of German settlers travel towards the far north in covered wagons with packhorses and their few possessions in tow. The seven travellers set off from Ashcroft, the final railway station. Along with their leader, flamboyant businessman Wilhelm Laser, they are hoping to find their fortune in the recently discovered goldfields of Dawson, but they have no idea of the stresses and dangers which lie ahead on their 2,500 kilometre journey. Before long uncertainty, cold weather and exhaustion begin to take their toll and conflicts escalate. The journey leads these men and women deeper and deeper into a menacing wilderness. (Berlinale.de)', 'Canada, the summer of 1898. A group of German settlers travel towards the far north in covered wagons with packhorses and their few possessions in tow. The seven travellers set off from Ashcroft, the final railway station. Along with their leader, flamboyant businessman Wilhelm Laser, they are hoping to find their fortune in the recently discovered goldfields of Dawson, but they have no idea of the stresses and dangers which lie ahead on their 2,500 kilometre journey. Before long uncertainty, cold weather and exhaustion begin to take their toll and conflicts escalate. The journey leads these men and women deeper and deeper into a menacing wilderness. (Berlinale.de)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2hrjECXfZ29CZqQBcm1ze3VOMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159344'),
  ('725353604592890166', 'Gold', 2016, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Stephen Gaghan, Robert Elswit, Tobin Ost', 'Patrick Massett, John Zinman', 'Matthew McConaughey, Bryce Dallas Howard, Edgar Ramírez, Timothy Simons, Michael Landes, Stacy Keach, Rachael Taylor, Bruce Greenwood', 'R', 'Kenny Wells, a modern-day prospector, hustler, and dreamer, is desperate for a lucky break. Left with few options, Wells teams up with an equally luckless geologist to execute a grandiose, last-ditch effort: to find gold deep in the uncharted jungle of Indonesia.', 'Kenny Wells, a modern-day prospector, hustler, and dreamer, is desperate for a lucky break. Left with few options, Wells teams up with an equally luckless geologist to execute a grandiose, last-ditch effort: to find gold deep in the uncharted jungle of Indonesia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukMXAdr325Tn1mLGkxdG8Lab16l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334524'),
  ('689216821926541372', 'Gold', 2017, 'Adventure, History, Drama, Action', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes, Paco Femenía, Antonio Ordóñez', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes, Arturo Pérez-Reverte', 'Raúl Arévalo, Bárbara Lennie, Óscar Jaenada, Jose Coronado, José Manuel Cervino, Antonio Dechent, Juan José Ballesta, Luis Callejo', null, 'Spanish soldiers battle indigenous tribes and their own brutal natures as they search for a legendary city built of gold.', 'Spanish soldiers battle indigenous tribes and their own brutal natures as they search for a legendary city built of gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nHoRPAjQIo3IdnflGK9vaFQDoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436830'),
  ('425389986332158337', 'Gold', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Reema Kagti, Alvaro Gutierrez', 'Rajesh Devraj, Reema Kagti', 'Akshay Kumar, Mouni Roy, Kumud Pant, Kunal Kapoor, Amit Sadh, Vineet Kumar Singh, Sunny Kaushal, Abdul Quadir Amin', null, 'Set in 1948, the historic story of India''s first Olympic medal post their independence.', 'Set in 1948, the historic story of India''s first Olympic medal post their independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCcdW6nHRcrKWraErYV5g3tut7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478682'),
  ('620317290237996540', 'Gold', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Julian Ryan, Jani Häkli, Ross Giardina', 'Anthony Hayes, Polly Smyth', 'Zac Efron, Anthony Hayes, Susie Porter, Andreas Sobik, Akuol Ngot, Thiik Biar', 'R', 'In the not-too-distant future, two drifters traveling through the desert stumble across the biggest gold nugget ever found and the dream of immense wealth and greed takes hold. They hatch a plan to excavate their bounty, with one man leaving to secure the necessary tools while the other remains with the gold. The man who remains must endure harsh desert elements, ravenous wild dogs, and mysterious intruders, while battling the sinking suspicion that he has been abandoned to his fate.', 'In the not-too-distant future, two drifters traveling through the desert stumble across the biggest gold nugget ever found and the dream of immense wealth and greed takes hold. They hatch a plan to excavate their bounty, with one man leaving to secure the necessary tools while the other remains with the gold. The man who remains must endure harsh desert elements, ravenous wild dogs, and mysterious intruders, while battling the sinking suspicion that he has been abandoned to his fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0r75XaNHA4QMlDcitEscQW2Fn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760926'),
  ('474392122042636392', 'Gold Brick', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Jérémie Rozan, Mathieu Plainfossé, Catalina Justo Haber', 'Jérémie Rozan', 'Raphaël Quenard, Igor Gotesman, Agathe Rousselle, Antoine Gouy, Nina Meurisse, Grégoire Colin, Youssef Hajdi, Stéphan Wojtowicz', 'R', 'Determined to even the scales and profit from his thankless job, a factory worker schemes to traffic luxury perfumes from under his employer''s nose.', 'Determined to even the scales and profit from his thankless job, a factory worker schemes to traffic luxury perfumes from under his employer''s nose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBnY6elyOlEk6bKfxEoaHFaqwai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140056'),
  ('392434418088459676', 'Gold Diggers of ''49', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Joe Dougherty, Bernice Hansen', null, 'Porky and Beans are prospectors during the Gold Rush. When a villain steals Porky''s bag of loot, Beans races to get it back so he can marry Porky''s daughter Little Kitty.', 'Porky and Beans are prospectors during the Gold Rush. When a villain steals Porky''s bag of loot, Beans races to get it back so he can marry Porky''s daughter Little Kitty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcK492mBgDZfZXGfVbiMRVGhcFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184666'),
  ('505333226909440950', 'Gold Diggers of 1933', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Sol Polito, Arthur Lueker', 'Erwin S. Gelsey, James Seymour', 'Warren William, Joan Blondell, Aline MacMahon, Ruby Keeler, Dick Powell, Guy Kibbee, Ned Sparks, Ginger Rogers', 'NR', 'When all Broadway shows are shut down during the Depression, a trio of desperate showgirls scheme to bilk a repugnant high society man of his money to keep their show going.', 'When all Broadway shows are shut down during the Depression, a trio of desperate showgirls scheme to bilk a repugnant high society man of his money to keep their show going.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXsUJsW9fcVT15hfBu9LyU22qmG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31511'),
  ('1121461044708133619', 'Gold Diggers of 1935', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Busby Berkeley', 'Peter Milne, Manuel Seff', 'Dick Powell, Adolphe Menjou, Gloria Stuart, Alice Brady, Hugh Herbert, Glenda Farrell, Frank McHugh, Joseph Cawthorn', 'G', 'Romance strikes when a vacationing millionairess and her daughter and son spend their vacation at a posh New England resort.', 'Romance strikes when a vacationing millionairess and her daughter and son spend their vacation at a posh New England resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utP30vhi3le9X3STgoUIKaOLIqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43892'),
  ('426905455995832983', 'Gold Diggers of 1937', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Lloyd Bacon, Arthur Edeson, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Warren Duff', 'Dick Powell, Joan Blondell, Glenda Farrell, Victor Moore, Lee Dixon, Osgood Perkins, Charles D. Brown, Rosalind Marquis', null, 'The partners of stage-producer J. J. Hobart gamble away the money for his new show. They enlist a gold-digging chorus girl to help get it back by conning an insurance company. But they don’t count on the persistence of insurance man Rosmer Peck and his secretary Norma Perry.', 'The partners of stage-producer J. J. Hobart gamble away the money for his new show. They enlist a gold-digging chorus girl to help get it back by conning an insurance company. But they don’t count on the persistence of insurance man Rosmer Peck and his secretary Norma Perry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m02wlrOrt61BXskXVeyHFi8pwN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57698'),
  ('226865166606945059', 'Gold Diggers: The Secret of Bear Mountain', 1995, 'Drama, Adventure, Family, Mystery', 'Allan Wertheim, Morgan Beggs, Ella Kutschera', 'Barry Glasser', 'Christina Ricci, Anna Chlumsky, Polly Draper, Brian Kerwin, Diana Scarwid, David Keith, Gillian Barber, Ashleigh Aston Moore', 'PG', 'Two teen girls, one from the city, one from the country, try to find the hidden gold of Bear Mountain learning about friendship, loyalty and courage on the way.', 'Two teen girls, one from the city, one from the country, try to find the hidden gold of Bear Mountain learning about friendship, loyalty and courage on the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6USWKkOjS40KY19Q0gPEelEiDhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35645'),
  ('1113367576372295882', 'Gold Dust', 2020, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'David Wall', 'David Wall', 'Darin Brooks, Chris Romano, David Wallace, David Wall, Derek Severson', null, 'Along the Mexico border, two friends search for a ghost ship rumored to be buried in the desert sand. In the same area, drug lords employ children; the duo must decide between going after the ship or saving a young girl held captive.', 'Along the Mexico border, two friends search for a ghost ship rumored to be buried in the desert sand. In the same area, drug lords employ children; the duo must decide between going after the ship or saving a young girl held captive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUHehzemVYTd4mByJJVMnyvhqy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441316'),
  ('304438246482098371', 'Gold for Dogs', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Anna Cazenave Cambet, Kristy Baboul', 'Marie-Stéphane Imbert, Anna Cazenave Cambet', 'Tallulah Cassavetti, Ana Neborac, Corentin Fila, Romain Guillermic, Carole Franck, Claire Duburcq, Julie Depardieu, Jean-Louis Coulloc''h', null, 'Esther, a young woman from the South of France moves to Paris at the end of the summer to look for her summer crush. She is in for an intense and romantic journey.', 'Esther, a young woman from the South of France moves to Paris at the end of the summer to look for her summer crush. She is in for an intense and romantic journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddKw4pKIlN93M9GOLwt0VMKqFaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508479'),
  ('554124013661654287', 'Gold Kingdom and Water Kingdom', 2023, 'Animation, Romance, Fantasy', 'Kotono Watanabe, Kotono Watanabe, Mitsuyuki Masuhara', 'Fumi Tsubota', 'Kento Kaku, Minami Hamabe, Banjo Ginga, Masaki Terasoma, Keiko Toda, Hiroshi Kamiya, Chafurin, Takeshi Maruyama', null, 'Once upon a time, there were two neighboring countries that did not get along. They bickered over trivial things day in and day out. Finally, they went to war over the issue of cleaning up dog feces. God intervened in a hurry and said to the chiefs of the two countries. Country A gives its most beautiful girl to Country B as a bride and Country B gives its wisest young man to Country A as a bridegroom. Then, the princess of country A, Saara, happens to meet a young man from country B...!', 'Once upon a time, there were two neighboring countries that did not get along. They bickered over trivial things day in and day out. Finally, they went to war over the issue of cleaning up dog feces. God intervened in a hurry and said to the chiefs of the two countries. Country A gives its most beautiful girl to Country B as a bride and Country B gives its wisest young man to Country A as a bridegroom. Then, the princess of country A, Saara, happens to meet a young man from country B...!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZo0wYhHvniCqVHMcCV7z1qB1XY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:991190'),
  ('581359486627668920', 'Gold of the Seven Saints', 1961, 'Adventure, Western', 'Gordon Douglas, William Kissell, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Leigh Brackett, Leonard Freeman', 'Clint Walker, Roger Moore, Letícia Román, Robert Middleton, Chill Wills, Gene Evans, Roberto Contreras, Jack Williams', 'NR', 'Fur-trapping partners stumble across a cache of gold, but their discovery quickly attracts every greedy villain in the territory.', 'Fur-trapping partners stumble across a cache of gold, but their discovery quickly attracts every greedy villain in the territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3tQYEyduv7pfk5DcYRKja6hiRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102199'),
  ('288659554512221790', 'Gold Run', 2022, 'War, Thriller, Drama', 'Lina Remeikaite, Hallvard Bræin, Sebastian Ekeland Meneeley', 'Thomas Moldestad, Jørgen Storm Rosenberg, Sofia Lersol Lund', 'Jon Øigarden, Ida Elise Broch, Sven Nordin, Eivind Sander, Axel Bøyum, Morten Svartveit, Anatole Taubman, Thorbjørn Harr', null, 'Fredrik isn’t the bravest of men, but now he is faced with a great responsibility and an enormous task - to get the entire Norwegian gold reserve away from the Nazis during the invasion of Norway.', 'Fredrik isn’t the bravest of men, but now he is faced with a great responsibility and an enormous task - to get the entire Norwegian gold reserve away from the Nazis during the invasion of Norway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6E4LopmCMUXcMLIv7o3jw1xQrgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964426'),
  ('739657374142899840', 'Gold Rush Gang', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Wisit Sasanatieng, Surasak Wongthai, Chidchanok Chumwan', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Wisit Sasanatieng, Pipat Jomkoh', 'Petchtai Wongkamlao, Thiti Mahayotaruk, Chingduang Duijkers, Ophaphoom Chitapan, Nachat Juntapun, Punpreedee Khumprom Rodsawat, Myria Benedetti, Keita Arai', 'R', 'At the tail end of World War II, a bandit leader and his crew go up against his sworn enemy and the Japanese army to rob a train full of gold.', 'At the tail end of World War II, a bandit leader and his crew go up against his sworn enemy and the Japanese army to rob a train full of gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j6jZNhCTnsZy5QItpruDwyBWoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429739'),
  ('503013813543371648', 'Gold, Silver, Death', 1982, 'War, Drama', 'Peque Gallaga, Rody Lacap, Rafael Jimenez', 'Jose Javier Reyes', 'Manny Ojeda, Liza Lorena, Joel Torre, Sandy Andolong, Cherie Gil, Fides Cuyugan-Asensio, Mitch Valdez, Lorli Villanueva', null, 'The story follows the Lorenzos and the Ojedas, the two land-owning clans in the island province of Negros, who were trying to cope and survive the war that lasted three tumultuous years, where they experienced or witnessed violence, blood, horror, and death. It is structured into three parts: Oro, a life of luxury and comfort in the city; Plata, a still-luxurious time of refuge in a provincial hacienda; and finally, Mata, a toilsome retreat deeper into the mountains. A war not only turned them into miserable people but also turned them into animals.', 'The story follows the Lorenzos and the Ojedas, the two land-owning clans in the island province of Negros, who were trying to cope and survive the war that lasted three tumultuous years, where they experienced or witnessed violence, blood, horror, and death. It is structured into three parts: Oro, a life of luxury and comfort in the city; Plata, a still-luxurious time of refuge in a provincial hacienda; and finally, Mata, a toilsome retreat deeper into the mountains. A war not only turned them into miserable people but also turned them into animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tV1o5lZp9x8z39ognVQ9ISjrcXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208370'),
  ('797101917566547509', 'Golda', 2023, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jasper Wolf, Andrew Munro, Boadicea Shouls', 'Nicholas Martin', 'Helen Mirren, Camille Cottin, Liev Schreiber, Lior Ashkenazi, Rami Heuberger, Rotem Keinan, Dvir Benedek, Ellie Piercy', 'PG-13', 'Set during the tense 19 days of the Yom Kippur War in 1973, Israeli Prime Minister Golda Meir is faced with the potential of Israel’s complete destruction. She must navigate overwhelming odds, a skeptical cabinet and a complex relationship with US Secretary of State Henry Kissinger, with millions of lives in the balance. Her tough leadership and compassion would ultimately decide the fate of her nation and leave her with a controversial legacy around the world.', 'Set during the tense 19 days of the Yom Kippur War in 1973, Israeli Prime Minister Golda Meir is faced with the potential of Israel’s complete destruction. She must navigate overwhelming odds, a skeptical cabinet and a complex relationship with US Secretary of State Henry Kissinger, with millions of lives in the balance. Her tough leadership and compassion would ultimately decide the fate of her nation and leave her with a controversial legacy around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqOOLq12rOMCTcWzxaJ5VUROxp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899524'),
  ('490386921588717815', 'Goldbeak', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Dong Long, Nigel Tierney', 'Robert N. Skir, Jeff Sloniker, Vivian Yoon Lee', 'Liu Xingzuo, Xingliner, Chen Hao, Park Shi-yoon', 'PG', 'Raised among chicken, and sheltered by his adoptive mother and sister Ratchet, little eagle Goldbeak thinks he can’t fly, or at least has been told so. Eager to be recognised and learn how to fly, Goldbeak and his sister embark on an adventure to Bird City to solve the mystery of his birth.', 'Raised among chicken, and sheltered by his adoptive mother and sister Ratchet, little eagle Goldbeak thinks he can’t fly, or at least has been told so. Eager to be recognised and learn how to fly, Goldbeak and his sister embark on an adventure to Bird City to solve the mystery of his birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRMUtbICllNbK994bzE3gqvJDKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879913'),
  ('1068354201638666322', 'Goldbuster', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Jake Pollock', 'Zha Muchun', 'Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Teng Shen, Yue Yunpeng, Zhang Yi, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Jiao Junyan, Pan Binlong', null, 'A quirky internet star, a pair of retired gangsters, and the black sheep of a prolific family of herbalists are a few of the oddball tenants that call the dilapidated apartments of Humble Grove home. Fearful of being locked out by a ruthless property developer with his eye on the building, they’ve stayed inside for years. So, when supernatural incidents befall them all on one night, instead of running, they turn to flamboyant ghost hunter Golden Ling to perform a most unusual exorcism.', 'A quirky internet star, a pair of retired gangsters, and the black sheep of a prolific family of herbalists are a few of the oddball tenants that call the dilapidated apartments of Humble Grove home. Fearful of being locked out by a ruthless property developer with his eye on the building, they’ve stayed inside for years. So, when supernatural incidents befall them all on one night, instead of running, they turn to flamboyant ghost hunter Golden Ling to perform a most unusual exorcism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mntMdowcA9AN18TnJyl8ULqNyV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491937'),
  ('560982380592450975', 'Golden Balls', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bigas Luna, José Luis Alcaine', 'Bigas Luna, Cuca Canals', 'Javier Bardem, Maria de Medeiros, Maribel Verdú, Elisa Tovati, Benicio del Toro, Alessandro Gassmann, Ángel de Andrés López, Alicia Moro', null, 'A libidinous construction worker uses his charm and bravado in an attempt to attain enough finances to build his dream project.', 'A libidinous construction worker uses his charm and bravado in an attempt to attain enough finances to build his dream project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wxZTo2GZCiEmo6NIFxtqichly4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47707'),
  ('769928396256175443', 'Golden Boy', 1939, 'Drama, Romance', 'Karl Freund, Rouben Mamoulian, Nicholas Musuraca', 'Lewis Meltzer, Victor Heerman, Sarah Y. Mason', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Adolphe Menjou, William Holden, Lee J. Cobb, Joseph Calleia, Sam Levene, Edward Brophy, Beatrice Blinn', 'NR', 'Despite his talent as a musician, a city boy decides to become a boxer. He''s successful as a fighter — much to the dismay of his father. When gangsters try to buy a piece of him, he begins to have second thoughts.', 'Despite his talent as a musician, a city boy decides to become a boxer. He''s successful as a fighter — much to the dismay of his father. When gangsters try to buy a piece of him, he begins to have second thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSbDPwCSXpJ6OuUQ2T2vsGzBU2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43529'),
  ('55824948141065488', 'Golden Boy', 2025, 'Drama, Action', 'Joe Chan, Chan Chi-Ying', 'Shing Mo Chang, Toni Shum Sek-Yin', 'Louis Cheung, Leander Lau, Rosa Maria Velasco, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Lam Suet, Tommy Chu Pak-Hong, Dough-Boy, Gladys Li', null, 'A decade ago, Cheung Lek was the brightest rising boxing star—known as “Golden Boy”—until a tragic incident stripped him of his freedom. Ten years later, released from prison, he comes face to face with Fong Yuen, the son he has never met. To claim the inheritance left by Fong Yuen’s mother, Cheung must learn to live with and take care of the boy. Thrust into fatherhood and confronted by past regrets, Cheung’s life is turned upside down once more. Through conflict and gradual reconciliation with his son, he begins to understand his true purpose. Confronting the ghosts of his past, Cheung decides to return to the ring—not only to reclaim his dream, but to become the role model his son deserves.', 'A decade ago, Cheung Lek was the brightest rising boxing star—known as “Golden Boy”—until a tragic incident stripped him of his freedom. Ten years later, released from prison, he comes face to face with Fong Yuen, the son he has never met. To claim the inheritance left by Fong Yuen’s mother, Cheung must learn to live with and take care of the boy. Thrust into fatherhood and confronted by past regrets, Cheung’s life is turned upside down once more. Through conflict and gradual reconciliation with his son, he begins to understand his true purpose. Confronting the ghosts of his past, Cheung decides to return to the ring—not only to reclaim his dream, but to become the role model his son deserves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEm7CbnPAX2jpDTUXz6FExK41cL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421071'),
  ('551415460482474000', 'Golden Chicken', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Samson Chiu Leung-Chun, Jacky Tang Hon-Pong', 'Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Samson Chiu Leung-Chun', 'Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Eason Chan Yik-Shun, Hu Jun, Andy Lau, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Chapman To Man-Chat', null, 'After his attempted robbery runs aground, a thief takes a shine to his would-be victim, a charming prostitute, who begins to tell him her life story.', 'After his attempted robbery runs aground, a thief takes a shine to his would-be victim, a charming prostitute, who begins to tell him her life story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPZmgF2PNCUr9Tz3U7VeAOCqwwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52730'),
  ('882153758251125053', 'Golden Door', 2006, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Emanuele Crialese, Agnès Godard', 'Emanuele Crialese', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Vincenzo Amato, Aurora Quattrocchi, Francesco Casisa, Filippo Pucillo, Vincent Schiavelli, Federica De Cola, Isabella Ragonese', 'PG-13', 'The story is set at the beginning of the 20th century in Sicily. Salvatore, a very poor farmer, and a widower, decides to emigrate to the US with all his family, including his old mother. Before they embark, they meet Lucy. She is supposed to be a British lady and wants to come back to the States. Lucy, or Luce as Salvatore calls her, for unknown reasons wants to marry someone before to arrive to Ellis Island in New York. Salvatore accepts the proposal. Once they arrive in Ellis Island they spend the quarantine period trying to pass the examinations to be admitted to the States. Tests are not so simple for poor farmers coming from Sicily. Their destiny is in the hands of the custom officers.', 'The story is set at the beginning of the 20th century in Sicily. Salvatore, a very poor farmer, and a widower, decides to emigrate to the US with all his family, including his old mother. Before they embark, they meet Lucy. She is supposed to be a British lady and wants to come back to the States. Lucy, or Luce as Salvatore calls her, for unknown reasons wants to marry someone before to arrive to Ellis Island in New York. Salvatore accepts the proposal. Once they arrive in Ellis Island they spend the quarantine period trying to pass the examinations to be admitted to the States. Tests are not so simple for poor farmers coming from Sicily. Their destiny is in the hands of the custom officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjSK4pyVDt8Pwt9KpB8OtC246DC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1993'),
  ('277268892576674874', 'Golden Double', 2026, 'Drama, Sport, Family', 'Mher Mkrtchyan, Fedor Lyass, Artur Karayan', 'Valery Saaryan, Eduard Ayanyan, Eduard Ananyan, Valeriy Saharyan', 'Egor Beroev, Kseniya Alfyorova, Babken Chobanyan, Anahit Kirakosyan, Sofya Doniants', null, 'Legendary Spartak player Nikita Simonyan becomes the coach of Yerevan''s Ararat and sets himself an impossible task: he aims for a "golden double" - a championship medal and victory in the USSR Cup - but the team does not accept the new coach, and the main opponent is ready to do anything to win.', 'Legendary Spartak player Nikita Simonyan becomes the coach of Yerevan''s Ararat and sets himself an impossible task: he aims for a "golden double" - a championship medal and victory in the USSR Cup - but the team does not accept the new coach, and the main opponent is ready to do anything to win.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjG7n6rW3Mz4XrFHd9zZDrR3vhAO.jpg', 'plex:movie:zolotoy-dubl'),
  ('1060546062190384563', 'Golden Earrings', 1947, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Mitchell Leisen, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Abraham Polonsky, Frank Butler, Helen Deutsch', 'Ray Milland, Marlene Dietrich, Murvyn Vye, Bruce Lester, Dennis Hoey, Quentin Reynolds, Reinhold Schünzel, Ivan Triesault', 'NR', 'A British colonel escapes from the Gestapo to the Black Forest and poses as a Gypsy''s mate.', 'A British colonel escapes from the Gestapo to the Black Forest and poses as a Gypsy''s mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZMKfwdgqV1AfqmOK5Qykgr96n2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121357'),
  ('993506124697117957', 'Golden Eggs', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Clarence Nash, Florence Gill, Margaret Wright', 'NR', 'Donald reads in his newspaper that eggs are really going up in value and the price is skyrocketing. Donald realizes that if he had some eggs, he would be quite the wealthy duck so he breaks into a nearby hen-house and collects as many eggs as possible putting them all in a huge basket. Unfortunately, a rooster standing guard makes his presence known and ejects Donald. The inventive duck is able to get back in disguised as a female chicken who the rooster falls for and dances with. Unfortunately, with the rubber glove comb constantly coming loose and a caterpillar falling down the back of his suit, he is ever at the risk of being discovered.', 'Donald reads in his newspaper that eggs are really going up in value and the price is skyrocketing. Donald realizes that if he had some eggs, he would be quite the wealthy duck so he breaks into a nearby hen-house and collects as many eggs as possible putting them all in a huge basket. Unfortunately, a rooster standing guard makes his presence known and ejects Donald. The inventive duck is able to get back in disguised as a female chicken who the rooster falls for and dances with. Unfortunately, with the rubber glove comb constantly coming loose and a caterpillar falling down the back of his suit, he is ever at the risk of being discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsynMGcNqaJFX7nZwv3FAA9ff3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57908'),
  ('669546657372531552', 'Golden Eighties', 1986, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Chantal Akerman, Gilberto Azevedo', 'Jean Gruault, Leora Barish, Chantal Akerman', 'Myriam Boyer, Delphine Seyrig, Fanny Cottençon, Lio, Pascale Salkin, Charles Denner, Jean-François Balmer, John Berry', null, 'In a lively shopping center, proprietors and customers are bustling, including three women vying for a man''s heart with song and dance.', 'In a lively shopping center, proprietors and customers are bustling, including three women vying for a man''s heart with song and dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLkHUqNzpoppeuxWy7uyuPTkwwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63763'),
  ('167416340633455336', 'Golden Escape', 2022, 'Crime', 'Yi Huang', null, 'Justin Cheung Kin-Sing, Ray Lui, Ricky Chan Po-Yuen, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Sam Lee, Qiu Zijian, Cai Deheng', null, 'A small film scriptwriter found a treasure map among his grandfather''s belongings by accident, and the location of the treasure is underneath the prison in Chilang Bay.', 'A small film scriptwriter found a treasure map among his grandfather''s belongings by accident, and the location of the treasure is underneath the prison in Chilang Bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5ml4gox6r4WJ7Xn5ZAkgLC1VZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008640'),
  ('143309776696644736', 'Golden Gate', 1994, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Madden, Bobby Bukowski', 'David Henry Hwang', 'Matt Dillon, Teri Polo, Tzi Ma, Joan Chen, Bruno Kirby, Cully Fredricksen, Keone Young, Jack Shearer', 'R', 'A brash 22-year-old FBI agent trumps up charges of Communist-spying against a Chinese laundryman. 10 years later, he wants to make amends to the man and his teenage daughter.', 'A brash 22-year-old FBI agent trumps up charges of Communist-spying against a Chinese laundryman. 10 years later, he wants to make amends to the man and his teenage daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAVd9XcGEAUaby42pPKX7g4h22M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63097'),
  ('373472289965647253', 'Golden Horns', 1973, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Aleksandr Rou, Yuriy Dyakonov, Vladimir Okunev', 'Lev Potyomkin, Aleksandr Rou', 'Georgi Millyar, Raisa Ryazanova, Aleksei Smirnov, Mikhail Pugovkin, Vera Altayskaya, Aleksandr Khvylia, Savely Kramarov, Lev Potyomkin', null, 'A long time ago a splendid deer with golden antlers lived in the woods, always protecting the poor and weak and disdaining evil. In a little village nearby the woods widow Yevdokya lived with her twin daughters Mashenka and Dashenka, her son and her old father. One day the girls observe robbers hunting the deer. Shortly after they are lured into the woods by forest spirits. Infuriated about their presence, witch Baba Yaga turns them into fawns. Meanwhile, Yevdokya searches for her daughters. For protecting the deer of robbers she gets a magical ring to protect her from danger. The deer advises her to set off to the red sun or the clear moon. But both cannot reach the magic woods with their light. Finally, the boy accompanied by his cat goes in search for sisters and mother.', 'A long time ago a splendid deer with golden antlers lived in the woods, always protecting the poor and weak and disdaining evil. In a little village nearby the woods widow Yevdokya lived with her twin daughters Mashenka and Dashenka, her son and her old father. One day the girls observe robbers hunting the deer. Shortly after they are lured into the woods by forest spirits. Infuriated about their presence, witch Baba Yaga turns them into fawns. Meanwhile, Yevdokya searches for her daughters. For protecting the deer of robbers she gets a magical ring to protect her from danger. The deer advises her to set off to the red sun or the clear moon. But both cannot reach the magic woods with their light. Finally, the boy accompanied by his cat goes in search for sisters and mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwHvokrFwcOz84uh4WWv3dXjffk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14482'),
  ('526649594572236143', 'Golden Job', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Chin Ka-Lok, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man', 'Erica Li, Heiward Mak Hei-Yan, Kwok Kin-Lok', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Chin Ka-Lok, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Yasuaki Kurata, Billy Chow Bei-Lei', null, 'A group of former mercenaries reunite to plan an epic heist: boosting a truck full of medicine held by a foreign intelligence agency to supply a refugee camp in need. But when they find the truck is actually filled with stolen gold, the band of brothers realize they’ve been double-crossed by one of their own - and putting the situation right will be all out war.', 'A group of former mercenaries reunite to plan an epic heist: boosting a truck full of medicine held by a foreign intelligence agency to supply a refugee camp in need. But when they find the truck is actually filled with stolen gold, the band of brothers realize they’ve been double-crossed by one of their own - and putting the situation right will be all out war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66mlGssgzn6ZCJBPYf1zCmJSHhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531380'),
  ('1063114766920918469', 'Golden Kamuy', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Shigeaki Kubo, Yuji Shimomura, Sokoku Lee', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Kento Yamazaki, Anna Yamada, Gordon Maeda, Asuka Kudo, Shuntaro Yanagi, Yuki Izumisawa, Yuma Yamoto, Ryohei Otani', 'R', 'On the Hokkaido frontier, a war veteran and Ainu girl race against misfits and military renegades to find treasure mapped out on tattooed outlaws.', 'On the Hokkaido frontier, a war veteran and Ainu girl race against misfits and military renegades to find treasure mapped out on tattooed outlaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLcRGIJqlJeoGGk88CtA8Ida5aq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171462'),
  ('947875917909594092', 'Golden Men', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Umberto Vergano, Federica Ciciarelli, Fabrizio Imparato', 'Giuseppe G. Stasi, Renato Sannio, Alessandro Aronadio', 'Fabio De Luigi, Edoardo Leo, Giampaolo Morelli, Giuseppe Ragone, Mariela Garriga, Matilde Gioli, Susy Laude, Gianmarco Tognazzi', null, 'A group of desperate men, unsatisfied by their lives, decides to attempt a heist to a postal armored truck guard.', 'A group of desperate men, unsatisfied by their lives, decides to attempt a heist to a postal armored truck guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqqJh2mL0woJdUFYXNmVrgcPhVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605278'),
  ('1107055666836137451', 'Golden Needles', 1974, 'Action, Drama', 'Robert Clouse, Gil Hubbs', 'S. Lee Pogostin, Sylvia Schneble', 'Joe Don Baker, Elizabeth Ashley, Roy Chiao, Jim Kelly, Burgess Meredith, Tony Lee Wan-Miu, Frances Fong, Ann Sothern', 'PG', 'An ancient Asian statue with the power to grant health and long life via secret acupuncture points is being pursued by a wealthy criminal, but his plans are put in peril when a slovenly detective is tasked with protecting the relic.', 'An ancient Asian statue with the power to grant health and long life via secret acupuncture points is being pursued by a wealthy criminal, but his plans are put in peril when a slovenly detective is tasked with protecting the relic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLx7VcX1L2jn8uCKBKWi4ZjOPFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149464'),
  ('478457297740942353', 'Golden Night', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'André Neau, Serge Moati', 'Serge Moati, Françoise Verny', 'Klaus Kinski, Marie Dubois, Bernard Blier, Maurice Ronet, Anny Duperey, Charles Vanel, Jean-Luc Bideau, Elisabeth Flickenschildt', null, 'After his family tries to kill him and he has been pronounced dead, Michel returns from the dead and sets about getting revenge on his family members. He sends each one a voodoo doll, warning of their fate. Wandering over the streets of Paris, Michel is the haunted and hunted, as he himself hunts his villainous kin.', 'After his family tries to kill him and he has been pronounced dead, Michel returns from the dead and sets about getting revenge on his family members. He sends each one a voodoo doll, warning of their fate. Wandering over the streets of Paris, Michel is the haunted and hunted, as he himself hunts his villainous kin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKzzamsaDKVys2MEVXfXWoyBC0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12272'),
  ('313334941469226545', 'Golden Ninja Warrior', 1987, 'Action', 'Joseph Lai San-Lun, Godfrey Ho, Milton Yue', 'AAV Creative Unit', 'Richard Harrison, Ming Tien, Donald Owen, Yang Hui-Chih', null, 'A rivalry between the Golden Ninja Warriors and the Red Ninja Warriors. The Red Ninja Warriors want a Golden Ninja Statue that the Golden Ninjas Have, which is never seen by the audience. Then, the action moves to Hong Kong where we see a criminal organization running a prostitution racket, made up of kidnapped women, out of a hotel. An English dub of the 1985 Taiwanese film "霹靂女王蜂 " (Thunder Cat Woman) with an added opening credits sequence.', 'A rivalry between the Golden Ninja Warriors and the Red Ninja Warriors. The Red Ninja Warriors want a Golden Ninja Statue that the Golden Ninjas Have, which is never seen by the audience. Then, the action moves to Hong Kong where we see a criminal organization running a prostitution racket, made up of kidnapped women, out of a hotel. An English dub of the 1985 Taiwanese film "霹靂女王蜂 " (Thunder Cat Woman) with an added opening credits sequence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59YkN8PhuYDBHf3TqghFpXBax6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105619'),
  ('332562035874014012', 'Golden Oldies', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Hugo Carvana, Lauro Escorel, Julio Carvana', 'Paulo Halm', 'Paulo Betti, José Wilker, Antonio Pedro, Pedro Cardoso, Laura Cardoso, Juliana Paes, Malu Mader, Fernanda de Freitas', null, 'Four friends who only think about enjoying life, with big parties, women and drinks, are surprised by an eviction. In need of money, the group is forced to think about what they hate most: working! Confusion arises when everyone looks for an easy way to get money, with minimum effort. The days pass and the hilarious confusion only increases!', 'Four friends who only think about enjoying life, with big parties, women and drinks, are surprised by an eviction. In need of money, the group is forced to think about what they hate most: working! Confusion arises when everyone looks for an easy way to get money, with minimum effort. The days pass and the hilarious confusion only increases!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGUoy9Cb4KzAoRKp1dsxLcYV6Li.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16821'),
  ('1054837916578885625', 'Golden Orchestra', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Toru Hosokawa', 'Toru Hosokawa', 'Anne Watanabe, Yuina Kuroshima, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Takashi Sasano, Tonpei Hidari, Masao Komatsu, Yumiko Fujita, Saburo Ishikura', null, 'When Chizuru joins as a teacher at Umega High School, she hears an amateur orchestra perform. Reminiscing her old days of playing the violin, she decides to enroll in one.', 'When Chizuru joins as a teacher at Umega High School, she hears an amateur orchestra perform. Reminiscing her old days of playing the violin, she decides to enroll in one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MdUG36csmvqmIyOXD7lCJKywbv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456571'),
  ('1140366224172407786', 'Golden Parable', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vittorio De Seta', 'Vittorio De Seta', null, null, 'Filming amid the flaxen wheat fields of Sicily, Vittorio De Seta documents the everyday rituals of farmers during harvest time.', 'Filming amid the flaxen wheat fields of Sicily, Vittorio De Seta documents the everyday rituals of farmers during harvest time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pl5I00JRmqfZanUFYwZ6lPvEiQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148118'),
  ('689871428977947769', 'Golden Salamander', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Adventure', 'Ronald Neame, Oswald Morris', 'Lesley Storm, Ronald Neame, Victor Canning', 'Trevor Howard, Anouk Aimée, Herbert Lom, Walter Rilla, Miles Malleson, Jacques Sernas, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Peter Copley', null, 'An archaeologist stumbles into the territory of an evil crime syndicate and struggles to set things right.', 'An archaeologist stumbles into the territory of an evil crime syndicate and struggles to set things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGbEcUJnGnuUmIPOfIKe9YCVTBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79399'),
  ('901614929722768008', 'Golden Slumber', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Takashi Komatsu, Megumu Sawada', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Kenichi Suzuki, Tamio Hayashi', 'Masato Sakai, Yuko Takeuchi, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Gekidan Hitori, Gaku Hamada, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Akira Emoto, Bengal', null, 'When easy-going Aoyagi meets an old friend for a fishing trip, he ends up drugged, framed for the Prime Minister''s assassination, and on the run from corrupt cops. It''s only the beginning of what quickly becomes the worst, weirdest day of his life. But he''ll get by with a little help from his friends, who include a famous pop diva, a rockabilly deliveryman, a crippled old gangster, and the world''s most cheerful serial killer.', 'When easy-going Aoyagi meets an old friend for a fishing trip, he ends up drugged, framed for the Prime Minister''s assassination, and on the run from corrupt cops. It''s only the beginning of what quickly becomes the worst, weirdest day of his life. But he''ll get by with a little help from his friends, who include a famous pop diva, a rockabilly deliveryman, a crippled old gangster, and the world''s most cheerful serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4I38BO1TnwiJhzPrJReDKa9cxCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46911'),
  ('792587025177369745', 'Golden Slumber', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kim Jung-wook, Kim Gyeong-seok, Park Si-hwan', 'Noh Dong-seok, Lee Hae-jun, Cho Ui-seok', 'Gang Dong-won, Kim Eui-sung, You Chea-myung, Han Hyo-joo, Kim Sung-kyun, Kim Dae-myung, Yoon Kye-sang, Kim Yoo-jung', null, 'A delivery man has to flee for his life when he is framed for the assassination of a political candidate and the evidence against him begins to accumulate.', 'A delivery man has to flee for his life when he is framed for the assassination of a political candidate and the evidence against him begins to accumulate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFYz5wFMBlksWTxIZV2JDSDgE7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500699'),
  ('469785917220191556', 'Golden Slumbers', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Davy Chou', null, 'Dy Saveth, Ly Bun Yim, Yvon Hem, Liv Sreng', null, 'Over three million Cambodians died in the genocide between 1975 and 1979. The Khmer Rouge’s reign of terror also decimated a homegrown film industry that had flourished since 1960: movie theaters were bombed, film prints were destroyed and artists were executed. In Golden Slumbers, French-Cambodian filmmaker Davy Chou mourns this loss of lives and culture, but balances the somber material with a playfulness that honors the lush melodramas and mythic adventures of the glory years.', 'Over three million Cambodians died in the genocide between 1975 and 1979. The Khmer Rouge’s reign of terror also decimated a homegrown film industry that had flourished since 1960: movie theaters were bombed, film prints were destroyed and artists were executed. In Golden Slumbers, French-Cambodian filmmaker Davy Chou mourns this loss of lives and culture, but balances the somber material with a playfulness that honors the lush melodramas and mythic adventures of the glory years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wf0CsamCJaPlZGL3XiEbe5zXtbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102857'),
  ('694660920267598759', 'Golden Swallow', 1968, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Chang Cheh, Pao Hsueh-Li, Huang Yuan-Shen', 'Chang Cheh, Tu Yun-Chih', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Cheng Pei-Pei, Lo Lieh, Chiu Sam-Yin, Wu Ma, Yang Chi-Ching, Hoh Ban, Liu Gang', null, 'Golden Swallow revolves around the further adventures of its title character. This time around, she is forced into violence when a figure from her mysterious past goes on a killing rampage while leaving evidence that holds her responsible. Golden Swallow also makes room for a love triangle involving a mad, but righteous, swordsman named Silver Roc and a gentle warrior named Golden Whip. The three team up to conquer the evil forces of the martial world, but their joint venture only lasts so long, due to the two men''s egos. Ultimately, a duel to the death is planned between them, leaving Golden Swallow caught between two men, both of whom she admires.', 'Golden Swallow revolves around the further adventures of its title character. This time around, she is forced into violence when a figure from her mysterious past goes on a killing rampage while leaving evidence that holds her responsible. Golden Swallow also makes room for a love triangle involving a mad, but righteous, swordsman named Silver Roc and a gentle warrior named Golden Whip. The three team up to conquer the evil forces of the martial world, but their joint venture only lasts so long, due to the two men''s egos. Ultimately, a duel to the death is planned between them, leaving Golden Swallow caught between two men, both of whom she admires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaLjoOIJhJD8SdLS70g5dGzB8oR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32388'),
  ('797230985085459742', 'Golden Temple Amazons', 1986, 'Adventure', 'Alain Payet, Jesús Franco', 'Georges Friedland', 'Analía Ivars, William Berger, Antonio Mayans, Stanley Kapoul, Eva León, Olivier Mathot, Françoise Blanchard, Emilio Linder', null, 'A woman, raised by an Amazon tribe after they killed her parents, seeks revenge on the tribe for their deaths by joining an expedition looking for the tribe''s secret golden temple.', 'A woman, raised by an Amazon tribe after they killed her parents, seeks revenge on the tribe for their deaths by joining an expedition looking for the tribe''s secret golden temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhbOXljuVRIdXYlVneHOHkiVTFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28815'),
  ('777592802048576878', 'Golden Time', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Takuya Inaba', 'Takuya Inaba', null, null, 'In Japan, during the eighties, a recently discarded old television set refuses to accept its fate and tries to break out of the junkyard where it has been sent.', 'In Japan, during the eighties, a recently discarded old television set refuses to accept its fate and tries to break out of the junkyard where it has been sent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CGhgoisgZX7Oe3j7mve2kQ60wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484645'),
  ('67641483767999169', 'Golden Twenties', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Kluge, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Sophie Kluge', 'Henriette Confurius, Inga Busch, Franziska Machens, Hanna Hilsdorf, Seyneb Saleh, Anton von Lucke, Blixa Bargeld, Michael Maertens', null, 'Ava is far from happy about having to move in with her mother again after finishing college. A lot has changed since she was a child. Her old room is occupied by her mother''s home exercise machine, and Ava''s friends have their own lives to worry about. However, her mother has found a new boyfriend who is not much older than Ava herself. Ava finds herself without any prospects for the future and doesn''t quite know what to do with her life.', 'Ava is far from happy about having to move in with her mother again after finishing college. A lot has changed since she was a child. Her old room is occupied by her mother''s home exercise machine, and Ava''s friends have their own lives to worry about. However, her mother has found a new boyfriend who is not much older than Ava herself. Ava finds herself without any prospects for the future and doesn''t quite know what to do with her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23nZY5y38v4r8ctX40u1mENNMrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608602'),
  ('186438485660162257', 'Golden Years', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Michael Gornick, Kenneth Fink, Allen Coulter', 'Josef Anderson, Stephen King', 'Keith Szarabajka, Felicity Huffman, Ed Lauter, R. D. Call, Bill Raymond, Frances Sternhagen, Philip Lenkowsky, Tim Guinee', 'PG', 'When an explosion at a top-secret government lab injures an elderly janitor, no one could have expected the terrifying results. Exposure to mysterious chemicals causes him to undergo a bizarre transformation. He is slowly... incredibly... growing younger every day. Now, a ruthless CIA assassin will stop at nothing to take him prisoner and turn him into a government guinea pig. With his future on the line, the janitor goes on the run with his wife and a feisty female agent. All the while, he continues to transform... into a being with powers that are as deadly as they are unimaginable.', 'When an explosion at a top-secret government lab injures an elderly janitor, no one could have expected the terrifying results. Exposure to mysterious chemicals causes him to undergo a bizarre transformation. He is slowly... incredibly... growing younger every day. Now, a ruthless CIA assassin will stop at nothing to take him prisoner and turn him into a government guinea pig. With his future on the line, the janitor goes on the run with his wife and a feisty female agent. All the while, he continues to transform... into a being with powers that are as deadly as they are unimaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bO2jXElkXGkEWPHRToQqcXGc3xS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36560'),
  ('720512435339514450', 'Golden Years', 2017, 'Drama, War', 'André Téchiné, Julien Hirsch', 'André Téchiné, Cédric Anger', 'Céline Sallette, Pierre Deladonchamps, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Michel Fau, Clotilde Le Roy, Nicolas de Lavergne, Virginie Pradal, Clara Eon', null, 'The true story of a French WW1 deserter who, with the support of his wife, spends a decade in disguise as a woman.', 'The true story of a French WW1 deserter who, with the support of his wife, spends a decade in disguise as a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdRKb8x8jDRDrL8vsSjnbQznTp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428365'),
  ('889576000627389780', 'Golden Years', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Barbara Kulcsar', 'Petra Biondina Volpe', 'Esther Gemsch, Stefan Kurt, Gundi Ellert, Ueli Jäggi, Isabelle Barth, Martin Vischer, André Jung, Monica Budde', null, 'A newly retired couple embarks on a cruise, but they find themselves drifting further apart. When things don’t go as planned, they learn to evolve their relationship in this affectionate comedy about self-discovery and developing new ways to spend one’s golden years.', 'A newly retired couple embarks on a cruise, but they find themselves drifting further apart. When things don’t go as planned, they learn to evolve their relationship in this affectionate comedy about self-discovery and developing new ways to spend one’s golden years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqTYv5wKbm5qcGQvteTVssQKjE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998684'),
  ('49942552406038835', 'Golden Yeggs', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'On Porky Pig''s farm, a goose lays a golden egg and says that Daffy Duck laid it. Daffy, now the most sought-after duck in the world, is quite willing to take the credit and resultant fame- until Rocky the gangster kidnaps Daffy and orders him at gunpoint to lay more.', 'On Porky Pig''s farm, a goose lays a golden egg and says that Daffy Duck laid it. Daffy, now the most sought-after duck in the world, is quite willing to take the credit and resultant fame- until Rocky the gangster kidnaps Daffy and orders him at gunpoint to lay more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KzyOcXhBs2AuKkymBdlJS1iovR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151447'),
  ('763756224493420335', 'Golden Youth', 2019, 'Drama', 'Éva Ionesco, Agnès Godard, Molly Ledoux', 'Simone Liberati, Éva Ionesco', 'Isabelle Huppert, Galatea Bellugi, Melvil Poupaud, Lukas Ionesco, Alain-Fabien Delon, Nassim Guizani, Judith Zins, Manal Issa', null, 'Paris, France, 1979. Rose, a rebellious orphaned teenager, and Michel, a young aspiring painter, enjoy their crazy love under the neon lights of the decadent nightclub Le Palace, where they establish an ambiguous relationship with Lucille and Hubert, two bohemian bourgeois who will change their lives.', 'Paris, France, 1979. Rose, a rebellious orphaned teenager, and Michel, a young aspiring painter, enjoy their crazy love under the neon lights of the decadent nightclub Le Palace, where they establish an ambiguous relationship with Lucille and Hubert, two bohemian bourgeois who will change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSWlxs6EmfnjYwqHZD9xn3RAB4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487416'),
  ('682396239891829655', 'Goldeneye', 1989, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Don Boyd, Richard Greatrex, Waldo Roeg', 'Reg Gadney, John Pearson', 'Charles Dance, Phyllis Logan, Patrick Ryecart, Marsha Fitzalan, Ed Devereaux, Richard Griffiths, Lynsey Baxter, Julian Fellowes', null, 'British writer Ian Fleming''s life and loves suggest that of his spy-novel hero, secret agent James Bond.', 'British writer Ian Fleming''s life and loves suggest that of his spy-novel hero, secret agent James Bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uAaswPrUlAtd4bxvxrHIasbF6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141859'),
  ('634803786764763657', 'GoldenEye', 1995, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Phil Meheux, Martin Campbell, Neil Lamont', 'Bruce Feirstein, Jeffrey Caine', 'Pierce Brosnan, Sean Bean, Izabella Scorupco, Famke Janssen, Joe Don Baker, Judi Dench, Robbie Coltrane, Tchéky Karyo', 'PG-13', 'When a powerful satellite system falls into the hands of Alec Trevelyan, AKA Agent 006, a former ally-turned-enemy, only James Bond can save the world from a dangerous space weapon that -- in one short pulse -- could destroy the earth! As Bond squares off against his former compatriot, he also battles Xenia Onatopp, an assassin who uses pleasure as her ultimate weapon.', 'When a powerful satellite system falls into the hands of Alec Trevelyan, AKA Agent 006, a former ally-turned-enemy, only James Bond can save the world from a dangerous space weapon that -- in one short pulse -- could destroy the earth! As Bond squares off against his former compatriot, he also battles Xenia Onatopp, an assassin who uses pleasure as her ultimate weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0ljRnNxIO7CRBhLEO0DvLgAFPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710'),
  ('971964169220466797', 'Goldengirl', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Joseph Sargent, Carla Brand Breitner, Michael J. Kane', 'John Kohn', 'Susan Anton, James Coburn, Curd Jürgens, Leslie Caron, Robert Culp, James A. Watson, Jr, Harry Guardino, Ward Costello', 'PG', 'A neo-Nazi Doctor tries to make a superwoman of his daughter who has been specially fed, exercised &amp; Conditioned since she was a child to run in the Olympics.', 'A neo-Nazi Doctor tries to make a superwoman of his daughter who has been specially fed, exercised &amp; Conditioned since she was a child to run in the Olympics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8m4Zy3IWULXGE17IHKKd5uM5Ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98130'),
  ('181883773114890189', 'Goldfinger', 1964, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Guy Hamilton, Ted Moore, Frank Ernst', 'Paul Dehn, Richard Maibaum', 'Sean Connery, Gert Fröbe, Honor Blackman, Harold Sakata, Shirley Eaton, Tania Mallet, Bernard Lee, Martin Benson', 'PG', 'Special agent 007 comes face to face with one of the most notorious villains of all time, and now he must outwit and outgun the powerful tycoon to prevent him from cashing in on a devious scheme to raid Fort Knox -- and obliterate the world''s economy.', 'Special agent 007 comes face to face with one of the most notorious villains of all time, and now he must outwit and outgun the powerful tycoon to prevent him from cashing in on a devious scheme to raid Fort Knox -- and obliterate the world''s economy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKNFzaqQgPzsGXnsMc4kJH5hFIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658'),
  ('638372298081760556', 'Goldfish Memory', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Elizabeth Gill', 'Elizabeth Gill', 'Fiona O''Shaughnessy, Flora Montgomery, Fiona Glascott, Jean Butler, Sean Campion, Stuart Graham, Keith McErlean, Peter Gaynor', null, 'A small group of friends experience relationships which grow and stumble, involving everything from straight, gay, lesbian, and bisexual relationships. The speed with which these relationships last leads to the Goldfish memory effect, the belief that a Goldfish only has a 3 second memory is a metaphor for the transient nature of the characters relationships.', 'A small group of friends experience relationships which grow and stumble, involving everything from straight, gay, lesbian, and bisexual relationships. The speed with which these relationships last leads to the Goldfish memory effect, the belief that a Goldfish only has a 3 second memory is a metaphor for the transient nature of the characters relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suAI6GzznyVrMpd3esgzOP906jI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12802'),
  ('673374516198323585', 'Goldilocks and the Jivin'' Bears', 1944, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Ruby Dandridge, Vivian Dandridge, Lillian Randolph, Ernest Whitman', null, 'The stories of "Goldilocks" and "Little Red Riding Hood" collide with the world of jazz, resulting in three jiving bears and a jitterbugging Big Bad Wolf. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'The stories of "Goldilocks" and "Little Red Riding Hood" collide with the world of jazz, resulting in three jiving bears and a jitterbugging Big Bad Wolf. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWCB56mMVAVingbvp2u0qiyWwDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205878'),
  ('42903977558434398', 'Goldilocks and the Three Bares', 1963, 'Comedy, Music', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'William R. Johnson', 'Rex Marlow, Allison Louise Downe, William Kerwin, Netta Mallina, Gene Berk, Judy Parsons, Craig Maudslay Jr., William R. Johnson', null, 'Nightclub singer Eddie and comedian Tommy, working in a roaring twenties style club, meet and being dating publicist Allison and photographer Cynthia, respectively. They soon discover that the women spend weekends at a nudist club which the guys disapprove.', 'Nightclub singer Eddie and comedian Tommy, working in a roaring twenties style club, meet and being dating publicist Allison and photographer Cynthia, respectively. They soon discover that the women spend weekends at a nudist club which the guys disapprove.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rP4Jl0RhXKR9hgqghsVnIR90gQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92719'),
  ('306198672674545444', 'Goldimouse and the Three Cats', 1960, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Sylvester, his wife, and son go for a walk while their porridge cools, when Goldimouse wanders by to eat the porridge and sleep in their beds. Sylvester then tries to catch her for his "spoiled brat" of a son to eat.', 'Sylvester, his wife, and son go for a walk while their porridge cools, when Goldimouse wanders by to eat the porridge and sleep in their beds. Sylvester then tries to catch her for his "spoiled brat" of a son to eat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqV1ZingxGApbnyyUJX8tGvBJ2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195868'),
  ('568923712491194338', 'Goldjungs', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christoph Schnee, Stephan Klose, Dorothea Popovic', 'Eva Zahn, Volker A. Zahn', 'Michelle Barthel, Tim Oliver Schultz, Ulrich Brandhoff, Jan Krauter, Waldemar Kobus, Martin Brambach, Leslie Malton, Judith Engel', null, 'Cologne in the 1970s. To all appearances, things could hardly go better for Iwan Herstatt and his bank. Above all, a group of young currency traders ensures brilliant balance sheets. The fact that they are called gold boys is no coincidence.', 'Cologne in the 1970s. To all appearances, things could hardly go better for Iwan Herstatt and his bank. Above all, a group of young currency traders ensures brilliant balance sheets. The fact that they are called gold boys is no coincidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OMJDKSBQMWRkQTR4OzTYAwVfUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824487'),
  ('118148350261120217', 'Goldman Sachs: The Bank That Runs the World', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Bréchat, Jérôme Fritel', 'Jérôme Fritel, Marc Roche', null, null, 'This documentary is a case study of the multinational tentacles of the world''s biggest bank, how it started and what its power means to everyone.', 'This documentary is a case study of the multinational tentacles of the world''s biggest bank, how it started and what its power means to everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrCTtNNUnsypM6pi8UGK8xZX2ms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188928'),
  ('919334384558566360', 'Goldman v Silverman', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Benny Safdie, Josh Safdie, Ronald Bronstein', null, 'Adam Sandler, Benny Safdie', 'NR', 'Rod Goldman and Al Silverman are street performers who work the tourist scene of Times Square. Goldman gets no respect and Silverman is the first one to make sure of that.', 'Rod Goldman and Al Silverman are street performers who work the tourist scene of Times Square. Goldman gets no respect and Silverman is the first one to make sure of that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leslGAKPG0HS37gt3Zr6vu8MM3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664394'),
  ('1029135927713007245', 'Goldstone', 2016, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ivan Sen, Ivan Sen, Richard McGrath', 'Ivan Sen', 'Alex Russell, Aaron Pedersen, Jacki Weaver, Kate Beahan, David Wenham, David Gulpilil, Cheng Pei-Pei, Michelle Lim Davidson', 'R', 'Indigenous Detective Jay Swan arrives in the frontier town of Goldstone on a missing persons inquiry. What seems like a simple investigation unearths an intricate web of crime, corruption, human trafficking, and coordinated exploitation of indigenous people’s land. Jay must bury his differences with young local cop Josh, so together they can bring justice to Goldstone.', 'Indigenous Detective Jay Swan arrives in the frontier town of Goldstone on a missing persons inquiry. What seems like a simple investigation unearths an intricate web of crime, corruption, human trafficking, and coordinated exploitation of indigenous people’s land. Jay must bury his differences with young local cop Josh, so together they can bring justice to Goldstone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awXoAUuehhsOnCEdB7BYAetdK6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393834'),
  ('187499354292218454', 'Gole Ruggenti', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Pier Francesco Pingitore, Sergio D''Offizi', 'Pier Francesco Pingitore, Carla Vistarini', 'Pippo Franco, Pamela Prati, Leo Gullotta, Stefano Antonucci, Gianfranco Barra, Martufello, Maurizio Mattioli, Jo Squillo', null, 'In the run-up to a song festival, all kinds of intrigues and pressures are unleashed behind the scenes: the script must be continually adapted depending on who momentarily prevails in the backroom maneuvers, with record companies, politicians and schemers of various calibers intent on fighting each other without holds barred to grab victory in advance. In the meantime, the organization is falling apart. Having recruited the almost complete Bagaglino cast, under the parody of Sanremo we see yet another rehash of "Champagne" or "Bucce di banana".', 'In the run-up to a song festival, all kinds of intrigues and pressures are unleashed behind the scenes: the script must be continually adapted depending on who momentarily prevails in the backroom maneuvers, with record companies, politicians and schemers of various calibers intent on fighting each other without holds barred to grab victory in advance. In the meantime, the organization is falling apart. Having recruited the almost complete Bagaglino cast, under the parody of Sanremo we see yet another rehash of "Champagne" or "Bucce di banana".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZZ3LcMqkVcj0odnK5t5mWkLkLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495543'),
  ('1128039060458314980', 'Golem', 1980, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Piotr Szulkin, Zygmunt Samosiuk, Jacek Dzik', 'Tadeusz Sobolewski, Piotr Szulkin', 'Marek Walczewski, Krystyna Janda, Joanna Żółkowska, Anna Jaraczówna, Mariusz Dmochowski, Wiesław Drzewicz, Henryk Bąk, Jan Nowicki', null, 'Pernat finds himself in a police interrogation, accused of a murder, and unable to recall any details of the crime, or even his own life. He''s released back into a world of raving lunatics and deranged dentists, murderous doctors and scientists who believe the secret of human creation is inside the walls of a cast-iron oven.', 'Pernat finds himself in a police interrogation, accused of a murder, and unable to recall any details of the crime, or even his own life. He''s released back into a world of raving lunatics and deranged dentists, murderous doctors and scientists who believe the secret of human creation is inside the walls of a cast-iron oven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvae3Jqex1PTGEq3s3PLvU9dPcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107983'),
  ('152578706963361043', 'Golgo 13', 1973, 'Action, Crime', 'Junya Satō, Masahiko Iimura', 'K. Motomitsu, Takao Saito', 'Ken Takakura, Yasuo Yamada, Pouri Banaei, Nosratollah Karimi, Ahmad Ghadakchian, Mohsen Sohrabi, Jaleh Sam, Tahere Ghaffari', null, 'Live-action adaptation of the hit manga. Golgo 13, also known by the pseudonym Duke Togo, is a professional assassin. His age and birthplace are unknown and there is no consensus in the worldwide intelligence community as to his true identity. Most of his jobs are completed through the use of a customized, scoped M16 rifle. Golgo 13 is contracted to kill Boss Goa, the head of a worldwide crime syndicate responsible for drugs, weapons, and human trafficking.', 'Live-action adaptation of the hit manga. Golgo 13, also known by the pseudonym Duke Togo, is a professional assassin. His age and birthplace are unknown and there is no consensus in the worldwide intelligence community as to his true identity. Most of his jobs are completed through the use of a customized, scoped M16 rifle. Golgo 13 is contracted to kill Boss Goa, the head of a worldwide crime syndicate responsible for drugs, weapons, and human trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKjVPHFfvEUvoAXefTHEEBR59I8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54862'),
  ('269194918482723699', 'Golgo 13: Assignment Kowloon', 1977, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Yukio Noda, Shigeru Akatsuka', 'Isao Matsumoto, Nobuaki Nakajima', 'Sonny Chiba, Lun Chia, Etsuko Shihomi, Emi Shindō, Elaine Sung, Dana, Nick Lam Wai-Kei, Jerry Itō', null, 'Duke Togo (codename: Golgo 13) is a ruthless assassin who''s accepted a tricky assignment from an American drug syndicate. His mission is to "rub out" Hong Kong''s underworld kingpin. His main obstacle is the relentless Detective ''Smitty'' Smith, determined to stop Togo no matter the cost. The result is an explosive adventure through the seamy, violent streets of Hong Kong.', 'Duke Togo (codename: Golgo 13) is a ruthless assassin who''s accepted a tricky assignment from an American drug syndicate. His mission is to "rub out" Hong Kong''s underworld kingpin. His main obstacle is the relentless Detective ''Smitty'' Smith, determined to stop Togo no matter the cost. The result is an explosive adventure through the seamy, violent streets of Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBFR0T4uTfZTNV5kzCYggPxkubf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48361'),
  ('1118755646626910898', 'Golgo 13: Queen Bee', 1998, 'Action, Animation', 'Osamu Dezaki, Hajime Noguchi, Hirokata Takahashi', 'Akihiro Tago', 'Masako Katsuki, Kinryu Arimoto, Ryusei Nakao, Daiki Nakamura, Hideyuki Umezu, Kosei Tomita, Mugihito, Naoya Uchida', null, 'Golgo 13, Japan''s most celebrated and notorious assassin, meets his match in Queen Bee, the leader of a South American liberation army, whom he must kill before she can assassinate a popular presidential candidate. However, once Golgo 13 penetrates the Queen''s hive, he realizes that the machinations behind the planned assassination are more complex than he could have imagined.', 'Golgo 13, Japan''s most celebrated and notorious assassin, meets his match in Queen Bee, the leader of a South American liberation army, whom he must kill before she can assassinate a popular presidential candidate. However, once Golgo 13 penetrates the Queen''s hive, he realizes that the machinations behind the planned assassination are more complex than he could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TAqCOT5L7HHw9mD2q7alhZ5JiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47567'),
  ('722966506066027258', 'Golgo 13: The Professional', 1983, 'Crime, Animation, Action', 'Wataru Date, Osamu Dezaki, Akio Sugino', 'Shūkei Nagasaka', 'Tetsurō Sagawa, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Kei Tomiyama, Kumiko Takizawa, Reiko Mutoh, Toshiko Fujita, Ichirô Murakoshi, Kazue Komiya', null, 'Indestructible to his enemies and irresistible to women, the professional assassin codenamed Golgo 13 is shrouded in mystery and anonymity. If you''re on his hit list, you''re already dead. Always hired on his reputation alone, Golgo never breaks a contract. Can he survive the combined forces of the FBI, CIA, the Pentagon and the U.S. Army? Has the nameless agent finally met his match against the superhuman powers of the Snake and the twin evils of the psychopathic mercenaries, Gold and Silver?', 'Indestructible to his enemies and irresistible to women, the professional assassin codenamed Golgo 13 is shrouded in mystery and anonymity. If you''re on his hit list, you''re already dead. Always hired on his reputation alone, Golgo never breaks a contract. Can he survive the combined forces of the FBI, CIA, the Pentagon and the U.S. Army? Has the nameless agent finally met his match against the superhuman powers of the Snake and the twin evils of the psychopathic mercenaries, Gold and Silver?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOTFmar2FyhDEDFNIMQL97K5Pcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17922'),
  ('759099029181387631', 'Goliath', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Frédéric Tellier, Renaud Chassaing, Christian Alzieu', 'Frédéric Tellier, Simon Moutaïrou', 'Gilles Lellouche, Pierre Niney, Emmanuelle Bercot, Laurent Stocker, Yannick Renier, Chloé Stefani, Marie Gillain, Jacques Perrin', null, 'Patrick is a tenacious lawyer specializing in environmental law. France is a schoolteacher who becomes an activist after her husband develops cancer from exposure to a pesticide. Mathias is an ambitious lobbyist working for an international chemical corporation. The paths of these characters collide as the lives of thousands are affected by a tragic act that sparks a powerful movement while the corporation fights to prevent the truth from being revealed.', 'Patrick is a tenacious lawyer specializing in environmental law. France is a schoolteacher who becomes an activist after her husband develops cancer from exposure to a pesticide. Mathias is an ambitious lobbyist working for an international chemical corporation. The paths of these characters collide as the lives of thousands are affected by a tragic act that sparks a powerful movement while the corporation fights to prevent the truth from being revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjoOtXctgy2TeonJ66STfukizTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884971'),
  ('852877901490865889', 'Goliath and the Barbarians', 1959, 'Adventure, Action', 'Carlo Campogalliani, Romolo Guerrieri, Sergio Bergonzelli', 'Nino Stresa, Giuseppe Taffarel, Carlo Campogalliani', 'Steve Reeves, Chelo Alonso, Bruce Cabot, Giulia Rubini, Arturo Dominici, Livio Lorenzon, Andrea Checchi, Luciano Marin', null, 'When barbarians invade his village and kill his father, a local man wages a one-man war against them.', 'When barbarians invade his village and kill his father, a local man wages a one-man war against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcYDQdzSkJ4xGoQrXXeq2pTJUCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158157'),
  ('812370267217716000', 'Goliath II', 1960, 'Animation', 'John Lounsbery, Wolfgang Reitherman', null, 'Sterling Holloway, Mel Blanc, J. Pat O''Malley, Barbara Jo Allen, Verna Felton, Paul Frees, Kevin Corcoran', 'NR', 'Goliath II is a 6-inch-tall elephant (son of the huge Goliath). He''s a big disappointment to his father, but mom is proud of Goliath II anyway. Goliath II is constantly getting into trouble because he''s so small. In particular, the tiger Raja looks for every opportunity to try a bite-size taste of elephant. After one incident where he ran away and his mother scolded him, he runs away. After he''s rescued, the rest of the elephants are terrified of a mouse, but Goliath II stands his ground.', 'Goliath II is a 6-inch-tall elephant (son of the huge Goliath). He''s a big disappointment to his father, but mom is proud of Goliath II anyway. Goliath II is constantly getting into trouble because he''s so small. In particular, the tiger Raja looks for every opportunity to try a bite-size taste of elephant. After one incident where he ran away and his mother scolded him, he runs away. After he''s rescued, the rest of the elephants are terrified of a mouse, but Goliath II stands his ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10SnRCGYANzX3QeY9fSEPIc1p2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55566'),
  ('913694467027962486', 'Goliath96', 2019, 'Drama', 'Marcus Richardt, Wedigo von Schultzendorff', 'Thomas Grabowsky, Marcus Richardt', 'Katja Riemann, Nils Rovira-Muñoz, David Wurawa, Elisa Schlott, Jasmin Tabatabai, Erwin Leder, Marie Nasemann, Tobias Kay', null, 'In her desperate longing for sympathy and understanding, a single mother tries to get back in touch with her grown-up son, who locked himself up in his room since two years. She doesn''t sense that she runs the risk of loosing him forever.', 'In her desperate longing for sympathy and understanding, a single mother tries to get back in touch with her grown-up son, who locked himself up in his room since two years. She doesn''t sense that she runs the risk of loosing him forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SWxiu11MzvJ1S6H99ntBDQ9t5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531312'),
  ('417967194594341973', 'Goliyon Ki Raasleela Ram-Leela', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Khyati Gosar, Sanjay Paraswani', 'Garima Wahal, Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Siddharth Singh', 'Ranveer Singh, Deepika Padukone, Richa Chadha, Supriya Pathak, Sharad Kelkar, Gulshan Devaiah, Abhimanyu Singh, Jameel Khan', 'PG-13', 'Ran and Leela are passionately in love with each other. The only problem is that their respective clans have been enemies for 500 years.', 'Ran and Leela are passionately in love with each other. The only problem is that their respective clans have been enemies for 500 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Pph0xbOJvNPhWh1fdeWGHppSPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235984'),
  ('1118901552857958959', 'Golmaal – Fun Unlimited', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rohit Shetty, Aseem Bajaj', 'Neeraj Vora', 'Ajay Devgn, Arshad Warsi, Sharman Joshi, Tusshar Kapoor, Paresh Rawal, Sushmita Mukherjee, Rimi Sen, Mukesh Tiwari', null, 'Four runaway cons take shelter in a bungalow owned by an old blind couple.', 'Four runaway cons take shelter in a bungalow owned by an old blind couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ubefqLk26Gy0lXCfGIu8hQrBak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19670'),
  ('523433276879618556', 'Golmaal 3', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Rohit Shetty', 'Sajid Samji, Farhad Samji', 'Ajay Devgn, Arshad Warsi, Shreyas Talpade, Tusshar Kapoor, Kunal Khemu, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Mithun Chakraborty, Ratna Pathak Shah', 'PG', 'Cupid strikes when Pritam, a single father, comes across his college sweetheart, Geeta, in Goa. However, when their respective children go to war with each other, the two find it difficult to reunite.', 'Cupid strikes when Pritam, a single father, comes across his college sweetheart, Geeta, in Goa. However, when their respective children go to war with each other, the two find it difficult to reunite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S2BE87q5g8HWDVfoEU8QN9UXfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44978'),
  ('354047513345326770', 'Golmaal Again', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Rohit Shetty, Jomon T. John, Sanchit Bedre', 'Yunus Sajawal', 'Ajay Devgn, Arshad Warsi, Tusshar Kapoor, Shreyas Talpade, Kunal Khemu, Tabu, Parineeti Chopra, Prakash Raj', null, 'Gopal and his best friends are back again, and this time they move back to their old neighborhood in a new palatial house where they learn that it is being haunted by a ghost.', 'Gopal and his best friends are back again, and this time they move back to their old neighborhood in a new palatial house where they learn that it is being haunted by a ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGx26PL1v658T8XbOk5MfmNpHU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472123'),
  ('414430581097953556', 'Golmaal Returns', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Rohit Shetty, Natarajan Subramaniam', 'Farhad Samji, Sajid Samji', 'Ajay Devgn, Arshad Warsi, Shreyas Talpade, Tusshar Kapoor, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Amrita Arora, Celina Jaitly, Anjana Sukhani', 'PG', 'Stuck all night on a yacht with a damsel in distress, Gopal lies to his soap opera junkie wife to avoid drama. This sets off a chain of chaotic events that ultimately land him smack dab in the middle of a police case.', 'Stuck all night on a yacht with a damsel in distress, Gopal lies to his soap opera junkie wife to avoid drama. This sets off a chain of chaotic events that ultimately land him smack dab in the middle of a police case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2X6ZSlnBpgsOpH0ELDraWTD4QO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14546'),
