  ('573413117698909468', 'Gomez vs Tavarès', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner, Cyril Sebas', 'Eben, Stéphane Grisard, Raphael', 'Stomy Bugsy, Titoff, Jean Benguigui, Noémie Lenoir, Fernanda Tavares, Jean-Rachid Kallouche, Thimothée Prince, Alexandre Prince', null, 'Two crooked lawmen (Stomy Bugsy, Titoff) search for a precious stone to collect an inheritance.', 'Two crooked lawmen (Stomy Bugsy, Titoff) search for a precious stone to collect an inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u78YucmMt5ouwPlQDLynuIUNVYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49590'),
  ('438918902439678284', 'Gomorrah', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Matteo Garrone, Marco Onorato, Gianluigi Toccafondo', 'Maurizio Braucci, Ugo Chiti, Gianni Di Gregorio', 'Toni Servillo, Gianfelice Imparato, Maria Nazionale, Salvatore Cantalupo, Gigio Morra, Marco Macor, Salvatore Abruzzese, Ciro Petrone', 'NR', 'An inside look at Italy''s modern-day crime families, the Camorra in Naples and Caserta. Based on a book by Roberto Saviano. Power, money and blood: these are the "values" that the residents of the Province of Naples and Caserta have to face every day. They hardly ever have a choice and are forced to obey the rules of the Camorra. Only a lucky few can even think of leading a normal life.', 'An inside look at Italy''s modern-day crime families, the Camorra in Naples and Caserta. Based on a book by Roberto Saviano. Power, money and blood: these are the "values" that the residents of the Province of Naples and Caserta have to face every day. They hardly ever have a choice and are forced to obey the rules of the Camorra. Only a lucky few can even think of leading a normal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XcCTqSovFZE5GRebJmh1kHwziw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8882'),
  ('880675847651139288', 'Gomorroide', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Francesco De Fraia, Raffaele Ferrante, Mimmo Manfredi', 'Francesco De Fraia, Mimmo Manfredi, Raffaele Ferrante', 'Francesco De Fraia, Raffaele Ferrante, Mimmo Manfredi, Lavinia Biagi, Francesco Procopio, Titti Cerrone, Nicola Nocella, Mariano Bruno', null, 'The Camorra is on its knees and the credit goes to Gomorroide, an unexpectedly successful television series that mocks the ruthless criminal organization. Thanks to the TV series, people are less afraid of bosses and the underworld and have found the courage to rebel against abuses. The three main actors are real stars but one day the television station receives an envelope with three bullets addressed to them. However, no one takes the intimidation seriously, at least until a series of events and misunderstandings force the trio to enter a protection program that will toss them up and down Italy. Unjustly accused, the Camorra will not stand by and watch.', 'The Camorra is on its knees and the credit goes to Gomorroide, an unexpectedly successful television series that mocks the ruthless criminal organization. Thanks to the TV series, people are less afraid of bosses and the underworld and have found the courage to rebel against abuses. The three main actors are real stars but one day the television station receives an envelope with three bullets addressed to them. However, no one takes the intimidation seriously, at least until a series of events and misunderstandings force the trio to enter a protection program that will toss them up and down Italy. Unjustly accused, the Camorra will not stand by and watch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5TyKHsxztJDEIzsYShDU7wJgoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445948'),
  ('1099662754054680889', 'Gon, the Little Fox', 2019, 'Animation', 'Takeshi Yashiro', 'Takaaki Honda', 'Masato Tanaka, Miyu Irino', null, 'When Gon, a playful orphaned fox, finds that young Hyoju has lost his mother, he tries to comfort him and make amends for his own earlier mischiefs by secretly bringing small gifts to the boy every day. But Hyoju doesn''t realize who is behind the anonymous gifts, and the two are headed for a heartbreaking climax. Original Story by Niimi Nankichi', 'When Gon, a playful orphaned fox, finds that young Hyoju has lost his mother, he tries to comfort him and make amends for his own earlier mischiefs by secretly bringing small gifts to the boy every day. But Hyoju doesn''t realize who is behind the anonymous gifts, and the two are headed for a heartbreaking climax. Original Story by Niimi Nankichi', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjRsrkRb8mGtvxBtn91sn2AO564.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654871'),
  ('697211095731847900', 'Gondola', 2024, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Veit Helmer, Goga Devdariani', 'Veit Helmer', 'Mathilde Irrmann, Nini Soselia, Zviad Papuashvili, Naira Chichinadze, Vachagan Papovian, Luka Tsetskladze, Elene Shavadze, Darejan Geperidze', null, 'In the Georgian mountains, a cable car connects a village with a smaller town in the valley. Iva started working for the cable car as a conductor and is now in charge of handling the gondolas. While one gondola goes up to the village, the other goes down to the valley. Halfway down, the gondolas meet every half hour. This is exactly the moment when Iva and Nina, the conductor of the other gondola, meet each time. Where at the beginning only collegial greetings were exchanged, over time a flirtation develops. What follows is the big love and stress with the boss.', 'In the Georgian mountains, a cable car connects a village with a smaller town in the valley. Iva started working for the cable car as a conductor and is now in charge of handling the gondolas. While one gondola goes up to the village, the other goes down to the valley. Halfway down, the gondolas meet every half hour. This is exactly the moment when Iva and Nina, the conductor of the other gondola, meet each time. Where at the beginning only collegial greetings were exchanged, over time a flirtation develops. What follows is the big love and stress with the boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8o7xiLvwk3gFUzeGg3alTejKqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186679'),
  ('422405611352642226', 'Gone', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ben Seresin, Ringan Ledwidge', 'Andrew Upton, James Watkins', 'Scott Mechlowicz, Amelia Warner, Shaun Evans, Yvonne Strahovski, Jessica Lemon, Victoria Thaine, Zoe Tuckwell-Smith, Kelly Rutherford', 'R', 'A contemporary psychological thriller in which a young British couple travelling through the Australian outback become involved with a mysterious and charismatic American whose motive for imposing his friendship upon them becomes increasingly suspect and sinister.', 'A contemporary psychological thriller in which a young British couple travelling through the Australian outback become involved with a mysterious and charismatic American whose motive for imposing his friendship upon them becomes increasingly suspect and sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOqehYqxkjwx7dxZw9HJyxdtLmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10094'),
  ('1128309510618106354', 'Gone', 2012, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Heitor Dhalia, George Bamber, Gregory J. Pawlik Jr.', 'Allison Burnett', 'Amanda Seyfried, Daniel Sunjata, Sebastian Stan, Socratis Otto, Jennifer Carpenter, Wes Bentley, Kate Moennig, Nick Searcy', 'PG-13', 'Jill Conway is trying to rebuild her life after escaping a terrifying kidnapping. Though she is having a difficult time, she takes small steps toward normalcy by starting a new job and inviting her sister, Molly, to move in with her. Returning home from work one morning, Jill discovers that Molly has vanished, and she is certain that the same man who previously abducted her has returned for revenge.', 'Jill Conway is trying to rebuild her life after escaping a terrifying kidnapping. Though she is having a difficult time, she takes small steps toward normalcy by starting a new job and inviting her sister, Molly, to move in with her. Returning home from work one morning, Jill discovers that Molly has vanished, and she is certain that the same man who previously abducted her has returned for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GcbQhm0Qbbf1qt24spUpqX5tfP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79548'),
  ('868207590657109014', 'Gone Baby Gone', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'John Toll, Ben Affleck, Christopher Surgent', 'Aaron Stockard, Ben Affleck', 'Casey Affleck, Michelle Monaghan, Morgan Freeman, Ed Harris, John Ashton, Amy Ryan, Amy Madigan, Titus Welliver', 'R', 'When 4 year old Amanda McCready disappears from her home and the police make little headway in solving the case, the girl''s aunt, Beatrice McCready hires two private detectives, Patrick Kenzie and Angie Gennaro. The detectives freely admit that they have little experience with this type of case, but the family wants them for two reasons—they''re not cops and they know the tough neighborhood in which they all live.', 'When 4 year old Amanda McCready disappears from her home and the police make little headway in solving the case, the girl''s aunt, Beatrice McCready hires two private detectives, Patrick Kenzie and Angie Gennaro. The detectives freely admit that they have little experience with this type of case, but the family wants them for two reasons—they''re not cops and they know the tough neighborhood in which they all live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rm3Dl8DWYGO3UQ3w2kju62L9rkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4771'),
  ('132725002652712020', 'Gone Fishin''', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Dean Semler, Christopher Cain', 'Jill Mazursky, J.J. Abrams', 'Joe Pesci, Danny Glover, Rosanna Arquette, Lynn Whitfield, Willie Nelson, Nick Brimble, Gary Grubbs, Carol Kane', 'PG', 'Two fishing fanatics get in trouble when their fishing boat gets stolen while on a trip.', 'Two fishing fanatics get in trouble when their fishing boat gets stolen while on a trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGRHE7s2iGgJ0JNO9gxm8BJKelt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9054'),
  ('324619328990590317', 'Gone Fishing', 2012, 'Drama, Family', 'Julián Apezteguia, Fabiana Tiscornia, Carlos Sorin', 'Carlos Sorin', 'Alejandro Awada, Victoria Almeida, Oscar Ayala, Diego Caballero, Daniel Keller, Martín Galíndez, Santiago Sorín, Romina Medina', null, 'A recovering alcoholic travels to the untamed coast of Patagonia to reconnect with his estranged daughter in this gentle yet deeply resonant drama from Argentine writer-director Carlos Sorin.', 'A recovering alcoholic travels to the untamed coast of Patagonia to reconnect with his estranged daughter in this gentle yet deeply resonant drama from Argentine writer-director Carlos Sorin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arQGwCQYfiHNu4U1TERRjNgR5LK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128070'),
  ('134986788388477735', 'Gone Girl', 2014, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Jeff Cronenweth, David Fincher, Mark Robert Taylor', 'Gillian Flynn', 'Ben Affleck, Rosamund Pike, Neil Patrick Harris, Tyler Perry, Carrie Coon, Kim Dickens, Patrick Fugit, David Clennon', 'R', 'With his wife''s disappearance having become the focus of an intense media circus, a man sees the spotlight turned on him when it''s suspected that he may not be innocent.', 'With his wife''s disappearance having become the focus of an intense media circus, a man sees the spotlight turned on him when it''s suspected that he may not be innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ts996lKsxvjkO2yiYG0ht4qAicO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210577'),
  ('788659118335685093', 'Gone in 60 Seconds', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'H.B. Halicki, Scott Lloyd-Davies, Jack Vacek', 'H.B. Halicki', 'H.B. Halicki, Marion Busia, Jerry Daugirda, James McIntyre, George Cole, Ronald Halicki, Markos Kotsikos, Butch Stockton', 'PG', 'Insurance investigator Maindrian Pace and his team lead double-lives as unstoppable car thieves. When a South American drug lord pays Pace to steal 48 cars for him, all but one, a 1973 Ford Mustang, are in the bag. As Pace prepares to rip-off the fastback, codenamed "Eleanor", in Long Beach, he is unaware that his boss has tipped off the police after a business dispute.', 'Insurance investigator Maindrian Pace and his team lead double-lives as unstoppable car thieves. When a South American drug lord pays Pace to steal 48 cars for him, all but one, a 1973 Ford Mustang, are in the bag. As Pace prepares to rip-off the fastback, codenamed "Eleanor", in Long Beach, he is unaware that his boss has tipped off the police after a business dispute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3n1hYXD21Ofa7Br10AE8Dtv7Q37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16246'),
  ('397632753333164810', 'Gone in Sixty Seconds', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Steve Danton, David H. Venghaus Jr., Phil Hardage', 'H.B. Halicki', 'Nicolas Cage, Angelina Jolie, Giovanni Ribisi, Robert Duvall, Delroy Lindo, Timothy Olyphant, Chi McBride, Christopher Eccleston', 'PG-13', 'Ex-car thief Randall Raines is forced out of retirement to save his brother Kip after a boost gone wrong. With the help of allies old and new, they race to meet the demands of notorious crime boss Raymond Calitri as the police are in hot pursuit.', 'Ex-car thief Randall Raines is forced out of retirement to save his brother Kip after a boost gone wrong. With the help of allies old and new, they race to meet the demands of notorious crime boss Raymond Calitri as the police are in hot pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fToQDmkBtiXYGh9xfgAh3gpo6GZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9679'),
  ('794340001370974234', 'Gone in the Night', 1996, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Bill L. Norton, Robert Draper', 'Brian L. Ross', 'Shannen Doherty, Kevin Dillon, Ed Asner, Dixie Carter, Michael Harney, Billy Burke, James Handy', null, 'A couple is unjustly accused of the murder of their daughter. Based on a true story and book of the same title.', 'A couple is unjustly accused of the murder of their daughter. Based on a true story and book of the same title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZ5UhZ4wMXEfmkiwI2mdQrtcmPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174411'),
  ('125912779399707340', 'Gone in the Night', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Eli Horowitz, David Bolen, Travis LaSalle', 'Matthew Derby, Eli Horowitz', 'Winona Ryder, Dermot Mulroney, John Gallagher Jr., Brianne Tju, Owen Teague, Alain Uy, Dustin Ingram, Yvonne Senat Jones', 'R', 'Upon arriving at a remote cabin in the redwoods, Kath and her boyfriend find a mysterious younger couple already there — the rental has apparently been double-booked. They decide to share the cabin with these strangers until the next morning, but her boyfriend disappears with the young woman, which sends Kath in a spiral to find an explanation for their sudden breakup — but the truth is far stranger than she could have imagined.', 'Upon arriving at a remote cabin in the redwoods, Kath and her boyfriend find a mysterious younger couple already there — the rental has apparently been double-booked. They decide to share the cabin with these strangers until the next morning, but her boyfriend disappears with the young woman, which sends Kath in a spiral to find an explanation for their sudden breakup — but the truth is far stranger than she could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1F9RpyLNbYyE9nE4INrVQh0b7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874355'),
  ('526395911395889230', 'Gone Kesh', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Qasim Khallow', 'Qasim Khallow', 'Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Vipin Sharma, Deepika Amin, Jitendra Kumar, Brijendra Kala, Kumar Kanchan Ghosh, Kalyani Jha', null, 'Enakshi is diagnosed with Alopecia, where she begins to lose hair from her scalp. Although she finds her temporary fix to this, it begins to steal previous years of her youth and takes her life by a storm. Will she be able to find a cure?', 'Enakshi is diagnosed with Alopecia, where she begins to lose hair from her scalp. Although she finds her temporary fix to this, it begins to steal previous years of her youth and takes her life by a storm. Will she be able to find a cure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPFTQOlc5R1RsKxypqw9umwlDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592108'),
  ('5876474800639964', 'Gone Mom: The Disappearance of Jennifer Dulos', 2021, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Gail Harvey, Amy Belling, Paul Turner', 'Richard Blaney, Gregory Small', 'Annabeth Gish, Warren Christie, Laura Harris, Michelle Morgan, Kendra Westwood, Jayce Barreiro, Michael Dodek, Esther Chao', null, 'The story of Jennifer Dulos, the wealthy Connecticut mother-of-five who mysteriously vanished on May 24, 2019. Jennifer believed that she had found her Prince Charming in Fotis Dulos, but by the time of her disappearance, their 13-year marriage had disintegrated and they were engaged in a bitter divorce and a contentious custody dispute for their five children. When she disappeared without a trace after dropping off her children at school, the police turned the spotlight on Fotis, who claimed that Jennifer had staged her own disappearance a la Gone Girl.', 'The story of Jennifer Dulos, the wealthy Connecticut mother-of-five who mysteriously vanished on May 24, 2019. Jennifer believed that she had found her Prince Charming in Fotis Dulos, but by the time of her disappearance, their 13-year marriage had disintegrated and they were engaged in a bitter divorce and a contentious custody dispute for their five children. When she disappeared without a trace after dropping off her children at school, the police turned the spotlight on Fotis, who claimed that Jennifer had staged her own disappearance a la Gone Girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzTNGnLG6LTHmrqrY0IADHDuyOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831223'),
  ('221717851967858132', 'Gone Nutty', 2004, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Carlos Saldanha', null, 'Chris Wedge', null, 'Scrat tries to finish his rather large collection of acorns when things start going nutty.', 'Scrat tries to finish his rather large collection of acorns when things start going nutty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNdHlJEnrGXy5mmdm1KAu3QWmdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17963'),
  ('377763634657155532', 'Gone to Earth', 1950, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emeric Pressburger, Michael Powell, Christopher Challis', 'Michael Powell, Emeric Pressburger', 'Jennifer Jones, David Farrar, Cyril Cusack, Sybil Thorndike, Edward Chapman, Esmond Knight, Hugh Griffith, George Cole', 'NR', 'Hazel Woods, a beautiful and young Welsh girl, lives a wild, rustic life and loves animals — in particular, her pet fox. She is hotly desired by Jack Reddin, a fox hunting squire who vies for her affection and pursues her, despite the purer amorous intentions of the local pastor.', 'Hazel Woods, a beautiful and young Welsh girl, lives a wild, rustic life and loves animals — in particular, her pet fox. She is hotly desired by Jack Reddin, a fox hunting squire who vies for her affection and pursues her, despite the purer amorous intentions of the local pastor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj3rKQuB3cfc4Px1JnHAL9maxno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79401'),
  ('924921763141846417', 'Gone to Ground', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Phil Peel', 'Phil Peel', 'Alan Breck, Alastair Thomson Mills, Alex Reece, Candis Nergaard, Peter Edge-Partington', null, 'A reclusive WWII veteran rescues a traumatized Polish woman from a crash. Her abrasive nature clashes with his old-world routines, but as a fragile bond forms, they must combine forces to fight the violent past that has tracked her down.', 'A reclusive WWII veteran rescues a traumatized Polish woman from a crash. Her abrasive nature clashes with his old-world routines, but as a fragile bond forms, they must combine forces to fight the violent past that has tracked her down.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:gone-to-ground-2026'),
  ('280256857041792814', 'Gone with the Boat', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Yichuan Huang, Su Jiayi, Chen Xiaoyu', 'Chen Xiaoyu', 'Ge Zhaomei, Liu Dan, Wu Zhoukai, Brent Haas, He Zhenyu, Liu Fenghuang, Wang Zhikang, Carmen Chow', null, 'Jin, a widowed mother living alone in a village, is diagnosed with a brain tumor. Her daughter fights tooth and nail to get her the best treatment while her son encourages the family to embrace the reality of death. Circumstances send the three characters on an existential journey on the rivers of the past. Chen''s sensitive debut feature is a film about homecoming and farewells, and was awarded Best Screenplay at the Shanghai International Film Festival.', 'Jin, a widowed mother living alone in a village, is diagnosed with a brain tumor. Her daughter fights tooth and nail to get her the best treatment while her son encourages the family to embrace the reality of death. Circumstances send the three characters on an existential journey on the rivers of the past. Chen''s sensitive debut feature is a film about homecoming and farewells, and was awarded Best Screenplay at the Shanghai International Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92pAMgwlXDXIjjgfldY9ZpT8E2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1141102'),
  ('605377979137980803', 'Gone with the Bullets', 2014, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Action', 'Jiang Wen, Xie Zhengyu, Li Qiang', 'Jiang Wen', 'Jiang Wen, Shu Qi, Ge You, Zhou Yun, Wang Zhiwen, Wen Zhang, Na Ying, Niu Ben', null, 'Set in 1920s Shanghai, Ma Zouri and Xiang Feitian establish a notorious beauty pageant called the Flowers Competition. All of the city''s elite attend the gala event, but when Wanyan Ying unexpectedly wins, it sets into motion a series of tragic events that change their destinies.', 'Set in 1920s Shanghai, Ma Zouri and Xiang Feitian establish a notorious beauty pageant called the Flowers Competition. All of the city''s elite attend the gala event, but when Wanyan Ying unexpectedly wins, it sets into motion a series of tragic events that change their destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11cY7FN26dqTyYAQXLzclxg1mz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312408'),
