  ('523515744022687075', 'Gone with the West', 1975, 'Western', 'Bernard Girard, Gerald Perry Finnerman', 'Marcus Demian, Monroe Manning, Douglas Day Stewart', 'James Caan, Stefanie Powers, Aldo Ray, Barbara Werle, Robert Walker Jr., Sammy Davis Jr., Heather Angel, Chuck Hayward', 'G', 'After being framed, a cowboy is sent to jail. After his time is served, he leaves with vengeance in his heart. Soon he meets a young Native American woman and together they go to settle their score with a small town and its corrupt leader.', 'After being framed, a cowboy is sent to jail. After his time is served, he leaves with vengeance in his heart. Soon he meets a young Native American woman and together they go to settle their score with a small town and its corrupt leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njaCpPyuem2QHBfPDROLY7MV8uy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68089'),
  ('2916349677286031', 'Gone with the Wind', 1939, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Victor Fleming, Ernest Haller, Eric Stacey', 'Sidney Howard', 'Vivien Leigh, Clark Gable, Olivia de Havilland, Leslie Howard, Hattie McDaniel, Thomas Mitchell, Barbara O''Neil, Evelyn Keyes', 'G', 'The spoiled daughter of a Georgia plantation owner conducts a tumultuous romance with a cynical profiteer during the American Civil War and Reconstruction Era.', 'The spoiled daughter of a Georgia plantation owner conducts a tumultuous romance with a cynical profiteer during the American Civil War and Reconstruction Era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNz2Ow0wGCAvzckW7EOjE03KcYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:770'),
  ('366022843592935079', 'Gone With the Wind', 2003, 'Music, Western, War', 'Kamel Ouali', null, 'Laura Presgurvic, Vincent Niclo, Sophie Delmas, Sandra Léane, Dominique Magloire, Arié Itah, Cyril Niccolaï, Joël O''Cangha', null, 'Autant en emporte le vent is a French musical adaptation of the 1936 Margaret Mitchell novel Gone with the Wind produced by Dove Attia and Albert Cohen in 2003, with music and lyrics by Gérard Presgurvic and staging and choreography by Kamel Ouali.', 'Autant en emporte le vent is a French musical adaptation of the 1936 Margaret Mitchell novel Gone with the Wind produced by Dove Attia and Albert Cohen in 2003, with music and lyrics by Gérard Presgurvic and staging and choreography by Kamel Ouali.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M9sP841HpNTEmtJbliv3KvZvYj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494233'),
