  ('504696182698578197', 'Gonger', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Christian Theede', 'Ben Bernschneider, Christian Theede', 'Sebastian Ströbel, Teresa Weißbach, Dario Stankewitz, Vadim Glowna, Bela B., Hildegard Schroedter, Daniel Zillmann, Hannes Wegener', null, 'A man decides to sell his grandparents'' house when he finds out that the death of his parents seems to be connected to a legend about a murdered child.', 'A man decides to sell his grandparents'' house when he finds out that the death of his parents seems to be connected to a legend about a murdered child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6e0lLjHuPkPb4VezaWvOwdSmOE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61199'),
  ('619875127917629312', 'Gonger - Das Böse kehrt zurück', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Philipp Osthus', 'Ben Bernschneider, Erol Yesilkaya', 'Sebastian Ströbel, Christian Blümel, Marco Feeser, Vijessna Ferkic, Hildegard Schroedter, Markus Graf, Teresa Weißbach, Daniela Schulz', null, 'After Helma is lured into an abandoned villa by the voice of her boyfriend Philipp and brutally murdered there, his friends and family hold him responsible for Helma''s death—and for further deaths. But the truth is quite different, because: The "Gonger" is back!', 'After Helma is lured into an abandoned villa by the voice of her boyfriend Philipp and brutally murdered there, his friends and family hold him responsible for Helma''s death—and for further deaths. But the truth is quite different, because: The "Gonger" is back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OBqR7GvbwIGhAdLI87cDEwIWn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253398'),
  ('777493024408878928', 'Gongofer', 1992, 'Adventure, Horror, Mystery', 'Bakhyt Kilibayev, Дмитрий Передня, Evgeniy Fyodorov', 'Bakhyt Kilibayev, Aleksei Samoryadov, Pyotr Lutsik', 'Viktor Stepanov, Ivan Martynov, Yekaterina Kmit, Mariya Vinogradova, Aleksandr Trofimov, Vladimir Timofeev, Aleksandr Kovalyov, Aleksandr Lebedev', null, 'Group of Cossacks are coming to Moscow to buy an ox. Moscow turns out to be a devilish hole crowded with witches. Some local witch seduces one of the Cossacks, Kolka Smagin and robs him of his eyes, giving him alien blue ones instead. Now Kolka and his uncle Zarubin are ready to start World War III in order to get the eyes back. The quest begins.', 'Group of Cossacks are coming to Moscow to buy an ox. Moscow turns out to be a devilish hole crowded with witches. Some local witch seduces one of the Cossacks, Kolka Smagin and robs him of his eyes, giving him alien blue ones instead. Now Kolka and his uncle Zarubin are ready to start World War III in order to get the eyes back. The quest begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6DkMQJ0VTp0GuS9pqyAbYDxbmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142802'),
  ('452330075665923363', 'Gonin', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Takashi Ishii, Yasushi Sasakibara', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Koichi Sato, Masahiro Motoki, Takeshi Kitano, Jinpachi Nezu, Kippei Shiina, Naoto Takenaka, Kazuya Kimura, Chiaki Kuriyama', null, 'Five men plot to steal a large sum of money from the local yakuza, but everything does not go as planned and the men find themselves hunted down by contract killers.', 'Five men plot to steal a large sum of money from the local yakuza, but everything does not go as planned and the men find themselves hunted down by contract killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgecD8RqekDEmj1EaRrvti3TPsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26830'),
  ('926127537853397103', 'Gonin 2', 1996, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Takashi Ishii, Yasushi Sasakibara, Masaharu Take', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Ken Ogata, Shinobu Otake, Kimiko Yo, Mai Kitajima, Yui Natsukawa, Yumi Nishiyama, Yumi Takigawa, Shunsuke Matsuoka', null, 'Five women snatch one billion yen in jewellery from the yakuza, while construction manager Toyama burns for revenge against the mobsters who raped and caused the death of his wife. Before long, the yakuza and Toyama arrive at the women''s hideout.', 'Five women snatch one billion yen in jewellery from the yakuza, while construction manager Toyama burns for revenge against the mobsters who raped and caused the death of his wife. Before long, the yakuza and Toyama arrive at the women''s hideout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCnqOR0Ea7Ljmkt2XPZW5zUObG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67071'),
  ('159601436050246047', 'Gonin Saga', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Masahiro Higashide, Kenta Kiritani, Anna Tsuchiya, Tasuku Emoto, Masanobu Ando, Jinpachi Nezu, Naoto Takenaka, Rila Fukushima', null, 'Seiji is a third generation "Gosei kai" gang member. He works to build up the group''s strength. Meanwhile, a journalist investigates a case that occurred 19 years ago. He meets Hayato, Daisuke and Asami.', 'Seiji is a third generation "Gosei kai" gang member. He works to build up the group''s strength. Meanwhile, a journalist investigates a case that occurred 19 years ago. He meets Hayato, Daisuke and Asami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPq1O3wfSxYFy8rOESDcd8GxyIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363283'),
  ('349705390393209574', 'Gonjiam: Haunted Asylum', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jung Bum-shik, Yun Jong-ho', 'Park Sang-min, Jung Bum-shik', 'Wi Ha-jun, Park Ji-hyun, Oh Ah-yeon, Moon Ye-won, Park Sung-hoon, Lee Seung-wook, Yoo Je-yoon, Park Ji-a', null, 'The crew of a horror web series travels to an abandoned asylum for a live broadcast, but they encounter much more than expected as they move deeper inside the nightmarish old building.', 'The crew of a horror web series travels to an abandoned asylum for a live broadcast, but they encounter much more than expected as they move deeper inside the nightmarish old building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNqlsmu2tiI1bXcpU31yjHPkiJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508642'),
  ('861690338830346448', 'Gonza the Spearman', 1986, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Taeko Tomioka', 'Hiromi Go, Shōhei Hino, Misako Tanaka, Hideji Ōtaki, Takashi Tsumura, Haruko Katō, Kuniko Miyake, Eiji Shima', null, 'The tragic story of Gonza, a handsome ladies man, set in the Tokugawa Period, a time in which appearances are very important. Gonza competes with Bannojō for the honor to perform the tea ceremony to celebrate the birth of an heir to the lord of their clan. To see the sacred tea scrolls Gonza promises to marry the daughter of the family which possesses them, even though he is unofficially engaged to another. When studying the scrolls with Osai, the mother of the house, Bannojō sneaks into the house and steals their obis and runs through the town proclaiming the two as adulterers.', 'The tragic story of Gonza, a handsome ladies man, set in the Tokugawa Period, a time in which appearances are very important. Gonza competes with Bannojō for the honor to perform the tea ceremony to celebrate the birth of an heir to the lord of their clan. To see the sacred tea scrolls Gonza promises to marry the daughter of the family which possesses them, even though he is unofficially engaged to another. When studying the scrolls with Osai, the mother of the house, Bannojō sneaks into the house and steals their obis and runs through the town proclaiming the two as adulterers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqApEji5pk2RaU6joMCP2P5pyvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102146'),
  ('571556893202849891', 'Gonzaga: From Father to Son', 2012, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Breno Silveira, Adrian Teijido', 'Patrícia Andrade', 'Adélio Lima, Chambinho do Acordeon, Land Vieira, Júlio Andrade, Giancarlo Di Tommaso, Alison Santos, Nanda Costa, Magdale Alves', null, 'Luiz Gonzaga decides to change his destiny and leaves his childhood home for the big city to overcome a romance. When he arrives, he meets a woman he falls in love with, the Odaleia (Nanda Costa). After the birth of his son and his wife''s health complications, he decides to return to the road to ensure a better future for his son. He has a friend in Rio de Janeiro and with him leaves the little one and heads to Brazil. He didn''t imagine that this distance between them would develop into a complicated relationship, enhanced by the strong personalities of both. Based on conversations between father and son, this is the story of Luiz Gonzaga, a singer and accordion player known as Rei do Baião or Gonzagão.', 'Luiz Gonzaga decides to change his destiny and leaves his childhood home for the big city to overcome a romance. When he arrives, he meets a woman he falls in love with, the Odaleia (Nanda Costa). After the birth of his son and his wife''s health complications, he decides to return to the road to ensure a better future for his son. He has a friend in Rio de Janeiro and with him leaves the little one and heads to Brazil. He didn''t imagine that this distance between them would develop into a complicated relationship, enhanced by the strong personalities of both. Based on conversations between father and son, this is the story of Luiz Gonzaga, a singer and accordion player known as Rei do Baião or Gonzagão.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LRWQiq43cIc03sC5ZLGB8zYrjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129705'),
  ('199007007550784505', 'Gonzaga: The Slipper Still Fits', 2026, 'Documentary, Sport', 'David Check', null, 'Mark Few, Steve Kerr, John Stockton, Adam Morrison, Chet Holmgren', null, 'Documentary centers on how head coach Mark Few turned the small college program into a national powerhouse that became a regular contender in the NCAA Division I men’s basketball tournament known as March Madness.', 'Documentary centers on how head coach Mark Few turned the small college program into a national powerhouse that became a regular contender in the NCAA Division I men’s basketball tournament known as March Madness.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaCMnco0bzj74lqz9hhG6I7kAyP7.jpg', 'plex:movie:gonzaga-the-slipper-still-fits'),
  ('468849218727871374', 'Gonzales'' Tamales', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Male Mexican mice are jealous of Speedy Gonzales for taking their girlfriends. So, they set Sylvester Cat after Speedy by issuing a challenge to Sylvester in Speedy''s name.', 'Male Mexican mice are jealous of Speedy Gonzales for taking their girlfriends. So, they set Sylvester Cat after Speedy by issuing a challenge to Sylvester in Speedy''s name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqT1opCQLP5ZswlFzbXijFpE2ml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201641'),
  ('473581241990586225', 'González: The False Prophet', 2014, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Christian Díaz Pardo', 'Christian Díaz Pardo, Fernando del Razo', 'Carlos Bardem, Harold Torres, Olga Segura-Gall, Gaston Peterson', null, 'González lives in a dilapidated room in Mexico City, a lost soul in one of the world’s biggest metropolises. Desperate to be someone in life—and to pay off his debts—he embarks on a journey into the increasingly magnetic world of big-box Christianity. Religion seems to offer a quick path to becoming rich and soon González is willing to do anything in his power in order to make it happen. A thriller that evokes the gritty style of Martin Scorsese’s Taxi Driver, Gonzalez: The False Prophet is a suspenseful ride through the darker side of charismatic preachers and upstart religions that flourish on the hardearned money of desperate people in need of hope.', 'González lives in a dilapidated room in Mexico City, a lost soul in one of the world’s biggest metropolises. Desperate to be someone in life—and to pay off his debts—he embarks on a journey into the increasingly magnetic world of big-box Christianity. Religion seems to offer a quick path to becoming rich and soon González is willing to do anything in his power in order to make it happen. A thriller that evokes the gritty style of Martin Scorsese’s Taxi Driver, Gonzalez: The False Prophet is a suspenseful ride through the darker side of charismatic preachers and upstart religions that flourish on the hardearned money of desperate people in need of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pV2uoaYJgYUok9ZmE1VlDpD2orU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225629'),
  ('795017786542416992', 'Gonzo: The Life and Work of Dr. Hunter S. Thompson', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Maryse Alberti', 'Alex Gibney', 'Hunter S. Thompson, Johnny Depp, Sonny Barger, Muhammad Ali, Warren Beatty, George W. Bush, Edmund Muskie', 'R', 'Fueled by a raging libido, Wild Turkey, and superhuman doses of drugs, Thompson was a true "free lance, " goring sacred cows with impunity, hilarity, and a steel-eyed conviction for writing wrongs. Focusing on the good doctor''s heyday, 1965 to 1975, the film includes clips of never-before-seen (nor heard) home movies, audiotapes, and passages from unpublished manuscripts.', 'Fueled by a raging libido, Wild Turkey, and superhuman doses of drugs, Thompson was a true "free lance, " goring sacred cows with impunity, hilarity, and a steel-eyed conviction for writing wrongs. Focusing on the good doctor''s heyday, 1965 to 1975, the film includes clips of never-before-seen (nor heard) home movies, audiotapes, and passages from unpublished manuscripts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8cRVJTTofxF7TgCGEvC5Yr4GnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13003'),
  ('1005723224642115668', 'Goo Goo Goliath', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Norman Nesbitt, Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', null, 'A drunken stork delivers the baby of a giant to a normal-sized couple instead, and they try to raise him as well as they can.', 'A drunken stork delivers the baby of a giant to a normal-sized couple instead, and they try to raise him as well as they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8tyWy25FjVVwaNqLelwcSD963R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202641'),
  ('297408530554622764', 'Gooby', 2009, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Wilson Coneybeare, Michael Storey, Jonnie Katz', 'Wilson Coneybeare', 'Robbie Coltrane, David James Elliott, Ingrid Kavelaars, Eugene Levy, Matthew Knight, Derek Scott, Mary Haney, Martin Roach', null, 'Imagine if you''d had a six-foot tall monster to help you through the rough times when you were 11! Willy is terrified about moving into the family''s new house. He''s convinced it''s filled with evil space aliens out to get him. In response to his wish for someone to save him, Gooby comes to life as a loveable, full-size, scraggly, orange, furry creature who in fact seems more frightened of the world than Willy. The two have hair-raising adventures and learn something about the power of friendship. In the end, Gooby fulfills Willy''s initial wish by bringing Willy and his dad together in a touching and exciting climax.', 'Imagine if you''d had a six-foot tall monster to help you through the rough times when you were 11! Willy is terrified about moving into the family''s new house. He''s convinced it''s filled with evil space aliens out to get him. In response to his wish for someone to save him, Gooby comes to life as a loveable, full-size, scraggly, orange, furry creature who in fact seems more frightened of the world than Willy. The two have hair-raising adventures and learn something about the power of friendship. In the end, Gooby fulfills Willy''s initial wish by bringing Willy and his dad together in a touching and exciting climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDrTiHOjle1768AQVVLDUth3TcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21293'),
  ('344990647875704212', 'Good', 2008, 'Drama', 'Vicente Amorim, Andrew Dunn, Andreas Olshausen', 'John Wrathall', 'Viggo Mortensen, Jason Isaacs, Mark Strong, Steven Mackintosh, Jodie Whittaker, Gemma Jones, Anastasia Hille, Ruth Gemmell', 'R', 'When John Halder''s latest novel is enlisted by powerful political figures in the Nazi party to push their agenda, his career and social standing instantly advance. But after learning of the Reich''s horrific plans for the future and the devastating effects they will have on people close to him, John must decide whether or not to take a stand and risk losing everything.', 'When John Halder''s latest novel is enlisted by powerful political figures in the Nazi party to push their agenda, his career and social standing instantly advance. But after learning of the Reich''s horrific plans for the future and the devastating effects they will have on people close to him, John must decide whether or not to take a stand and risk losing everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgNssumEnPaT6kzzJyj4oLypOOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12410'),
  ('737141037423114420', 'Good', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Patrick Mario Bernard', null, 'Rodolphe Burger', null, 'Rodolphe Burger is a free musician, complex but accessible, without taboos, he mixes with others without ever losing himself on the road. He is a man who shares everything, including the stage. Including his friends and they are numerous, poets, writers, rockers, painters and philosophers.', 'Rodolphe Burger is a free musician, complex but accessible, without taboos, he mixes with others without ever losing himself on the road. He is a man who shares everything, including the stage. Including his friends and they are numerous, poets, writers, rockers, painters and philosophers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q73MBHWA4835DTW7GTb9HWkYry3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560120'),
  ('184404546114100762', 'Good', 2020, 'Drama', 'Justin Etheredge', 'Justin Etheredge', 'Keith David, Nefetari Spencer, Justin Etheredge, Sarah Scott Davis, Ken Colquitt, Aroon Nayer, Jeff G. Mungai', null, 'Payton becomes the caretaker of Gregory Devereaux, a wealthy man facing his final months. As they become close, Gregory''s past sins force Payton to decide between his dreams and a pregnancy that could squander them all.', 'Payton becomes the caretaker of Gregory Devereaux, a wealthy man facing his final months. As they become close, Gregory''s past sins force Payton to decide between his dreams and a pregnancy that could squander them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQKlnLBUDoW8HuuuKBwrXWpOLZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750597'),
  ('359990575696906738', 'Good Advice', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Steve Rash, Ruth A. Redfern, Daryn Okada', 'Daniel Margosis, Robert Horn', 'Charlie Sheen, Angie Harmon, Denise Richards, Jon Lovitz, Rosanna Arquette, Meredith Salenger, Francoise Surel, Estelle Harris', 'R', 'An investment banker loses everything and must discover what''s really important in life.', 'An investment banker loses everything and must discover what''s really important in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RDn658gFZiz9iVD3QonTufuZh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26014'),
  ('8082863929767210', 'Good Bad Ugly', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Adhik Ravichandran, Abinandhan Ramanujam, Ravi Kandasamy', 'Adhik Ravichandran, B. Hari Krishna, S. J. Arjun', 'Ajith Kumar, Trisha Krishnan, Arjun Das, Sunil Varma, Prabhu, Prasanna, Jackie Shroff, Karthikeya Dev', 'NR', 'AK, a powerful gangster, surrenders to the police, in hopes that his wife and son will live a peaceful life. When he is released 17 years later, he learns that his son is falsely accused of serious crimes. To protect him, he is forced to go back to his old ways, facing enemies, both old and new.', 'AK, a powerful gangster, surrenders to the police, in hopes that his wife and son will live a peaceful life. When he is released 17 years later, he learns that his son is falsely accused of serious crimes. To protect him, he is forced to go back to his old ways, facing enemies, both old and new.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DbYYluzdiGDAZzsaP7DWGbwfLd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1259024'),
  ('437096138282023520', 'Good Boy', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David McGrory, Tyler MacIntyre', 'Aaron Eisenberg, Will Eisenberg', 'Judy Greer, Ellen Wong, McKinley Freeman, Steve Guttenberg, Elise Neal, María Conchita Alonso, Aaron Eisenberg, Vincent Foster', 'NR', 'When Maggie gets an emotional support dog to help quell some of her anxiety, she finds him to be even more effective than she imagined... because unbeknownst to her, he kills anyone who adds stress to her life.', 'When Maggie gets an emotional support dog to help quell some of her anxiety, she finds him to be even more effective than she imagined... because unbeknownst to her, he kills anyone who adds stress to her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMFAKPH7AaUJ76oLqWz9OxU7s6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710717'),
  ('27392553725278519', 'Good Boy', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Viljar Bøe, Viljar Bøe', 'Viljar Bøe', 'Gard Løkke, Katrine Lovise Øpstad Fredriksen, Amalie Willoch Njaastad, Nicolai Narvesen Lied, Viljar Bøe, Marie Waade Grønning', 'R', 'Christian, a millionaire heir, meets Sigrid, a young student, on a dating app. They hit it off quickly, but there''s only one problem: Christian lives with Frank, a man who dresses up and constantly acts like a dog.', 'Christian, a millionaire heir, meets Sigrid, a young student, on a dating app. They hit it off quickly, but there''s only one problem: Christian lives with Frank, a man who dresses up and constantly acts like a dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzluRg3Jnm2YPs7CQyCrFJ8JADl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983507'),
  ('473178459929208997', 'Good Boy', 2025, 'Horror', 'Ben Leonberg, Wade Grebnoel, Scott Riehs', 'Alex Cannon, Ben Leonberg', 'Indy, Shane Jensen, Arielle Friedman, Larry Fessenden, Stuart Rudin, Anya Krawcheck, Hunter Goetz, Bandit', 'PG-13', 'A loyal dog moves to a rural family home with his owner Todd, only to discover supernatural forces lurking in the shadows. As dark entities threaten his human companion, the brave pup must fight to protect the one he loves most.', 'A loyal dog moves to a rural family home with his owner Todd, only to discover supernatural forces lurking in the shadows. As dark entities threaten his human companion, the brave pup must fight to protect the one he loves most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daInKxjoRNLFWIus64fHAy91V0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422096'),
  ('1075492115430017927', 'Good Boy', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Jan Komasa, Michał Dymek, Michał Piłat', 'Bartek Bartosik, Naqqash Khalid', 'Stephen Graham, Andrea Riseborough, Anson Boon, Kit Rakusen, Monika Frajczyk, Savannah Steyn, Mila Jankowska, Callum Booth-Ford', null, 'Tommy, a volatile 19-year-old, revels in drugs, parties and violence. After getting separated from his friends on a drunken bender, he is abducted by a shadowy figure. He wakes to find himself imprisoned in the basement of a remote Yorkshire house, inhabited by a very strange family. But what unfolds is not what he could possibly expect.', 'Tommy, a volatile 19-year-old, revels in drugs, parties and violence. After getting separated from his friends on a drunken bender, he is abducted by a shadowy figure. He wakes to find himself imprisoned in the basement of a remote Yorkshire house, inhabited by a very strange family. But what unfolds is not what he could possibly expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0wD4Qxe0wulV0bxarsQ05PqDNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1381027'),
  ('899427275086446825', 'Good Boy, Bad Boy', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ashwini Chaudhary, Manoj Soni', null, 'Tusshar Kapoor, Emraan Hashmi, Isha Sharvani, Tanushree Dutta, Paresh Rawal, Rakesh Bedi, Navni Parihar, Anang Desai', null, 'Two college students exchange their classes after the college management mixed their identical names by mistake.', 'Two college students exchange their classes after the college management mixed their identical names by mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNXjhPcHC5XBVJlSjfhmCdKYAPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159434'),
  ('925460028405950964', 'Good Boy!', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'John Hoffman, James Glennon', 'Zeke Richardson, John Hoffman', 'Molly Shannon, Liam Aiken, Matthew Broderick, Donald Faison, Cheech Marin, Brittany Murphy, Vanessa Redgrave, Carl Reiner', 'PG', 'An intergalactic dog pilot from Sirius (the dog star), visits Earth to verify the rumors that dogs have failed to take over the planet.', 'An intergalactic dog pilot from Sirius (the dog star), visits Earth to verify the rumors that dogs have failed to take over the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZDXSPfeKNtai6l8yE4J5LwVQMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21765'),
