  ('106044557782579618', 'Good Burger', 1997, 'Family, Comedy', 'Brian Robbins, Evan Gilner, Mac Ahlberg', 'Dan Schneider, Kevin Kopelow, Heath Seifert', 'Kel Mitchell, Kenan Thompson, Sinbad, Abe Vigoda, Shar Jackson, Dan Schneider, Jan Schwieterman, Ron Lester', 'PG', 'Two L.A. teens with summer jobs at Good Burger try to save their small restaurant when a corporate giant burger franchise moves in across the street.', 'Two L.A. teens with summer jobs at Good Burger try to save their small restaurant when a corporate giant burger franchise moves in across the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imFLUF2TYkm13GpFYTKYF7T27sP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14817'),
  ('870562983958517561', 'Good Burger 2', 2023, 'Family, Comedy', 'Samantha Gilbert, Jared Hartley, Jacob Grubb', 'Kevin Kopelow, Heath Seifert, James III', 'Kel Mitchell, Kenan Thompson, Lil Rel Howery, Kamaia Fairburn, Jillian Bell, Alex R. Hibbert, Fabrizio Guido, Elizabeth Hinkler', 'PG', 'Dexter Reed is down on his luck after another one of his inventions fails. Ed welcomes Dex back to Good Burger with open arms and gives him his old job back. With a new crew working at Good Burger, Dex devises a plan to get back on his feet but unfortunately puts the fate of Good Burger at risk once again.', 'Dexter Reed is down on his luck after another one of his inventions fails. Ed welcomes Dex back to Good Burger with open arms and gives him his old job back. With a new crew working at Good Burger, Dex devises a plan to get back on his feet but unfortunately puts the fate of Good Burger at risk once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcwOHNTIy6pVOLj6Tjp8tSL9bwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101582'),
  ('767936319362817467', 'Good But Not Great', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Marco Miscione, Saverio Di Biagio, Fiorenza Salvador', 'Fabio Troiano, Vincenzo Terracciano, Laura Sabatino', 'Euridice Axén, Giordano De Plano, Gioele Dix, Francesca Giordano, Ugo Conti, Rosario Terranova, Yan Shevchenko, Emanuele Succa', null, 'Candida is a fifteen year old from Sicily, who lives with her father Salvo. When he loses his job, they leave for Turin. Candida has to integrate in a new school where she is bullied, as does her partner Jacopo. But thanks to her positivity, it will be Candida who will let Jacopo out of his isolation, making him discover that everything is good, even when it is not great.', 'Candida is a fifteen year old from Sicily, who lives with her father Salvo. When he loses his job, they leave for Turin. Candida has to integrate in a new school where she is bullied, as does her partner Jacopo. But thanks to her positivity, it will be Candida who will let Jacopo out of his isolation, making him discover that everything is good, even when it is not great.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39OKp2by9ZMBCqqPqTDmQeOXTjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581940'),
  ('390220251737279379', 'Good Bye, Lenin!', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Martin Kukula, Wolfgang Becker, Birgit Guðjónsdóttir', 'Wolfgang Becker, Bernd Lichtenberg, Chris Silber', 'Daniel Brühl, Katrin Sass, Chulpan Khamatova, Maria Simon, Florian Lukas, Alexander Beyer, Burghart Klaußner, Michael Gwisdek', 'R', 'Alex Kerner''s mother was in a coma while the Berlin wall fell. When she wakes up he must try to keep her from learning what happened (as she was an avid communist supporter) to avoid shocking her which could lead to another heart attack.', 'Alex Kerner''s mother was in a coma while the Berlin wall fell. When she wakes up he must try to keep her from learning what happened (as she was an avid communist supporter) to avoid shocking her which could lead to another heart attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHk1oGEbnvQGLnyiiYxTslZLoog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338'),
  ('206060400914321530', 'Good Bye, Till Tomorrow', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Janusz Morgenstern, Mieczysław Waśkowski, Maria Starzeńska', 'Zbigniew Cybulski, Bogumił Kobiela, Wilhelm Mach', 'Zbigniew Cybulski, Teresa Tuszyńska, Grażyna Muszyńska, Barbara Baranowska, Włodzimierz Bielicki, Jacek Fedorowicz, Roman Polanski, Eleonora Kałużyńska', null, 'Jacek is a handsome, charming young Pole who belongs to a drama company. One day, in the streets of Gdansk, he meets Marguerite, a beautiful, charming French girl. He falls for her but the young lady is whimsical...', 'Jacek is a handsome, charming young Pole who belongs to a drama company. One day, in the streets of Gdansk, he meets Marguerite, a beautiful, charming French girl. He falls for her but the young lady is whimsical...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P2WQuRtgHCqMgPez6mZNGSD5Er.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118566'),
  ('796019785656991636', 'Good Day for a Hanging', 1959, 'Western, Action', 'Nathan Juran, Sam Nelson, Henry Freulich', 'Daniel B. Ullman, Maurice Zimm', 'Fred MacMurray, Margaret Hayes, Robert Vaughn, Joan Blackman, James Drury, Wendell Holmes, Edmon Ryan, Stacy Harris', 'NR', 'When the local sheriff is killed after a bank robbery, ex-lawman Ben Cutler collars the apparent killer, Eddie Campbell. Because of his background as a local youth who spent time living with the Cutlers, Eddie gets the benefit of the doubt from Ben''s daughter and his wife-to-be. Ben is firm in his belief that Eddie is guilty, and as the matter is debated in a divisive court battle, it will soon become clear whether he''s right.', 'When the local sheriff is killed after a bank robbery, ex-lawman Ben Cutler collars the apparent killer, Eddie Campbell. Because of his background as a local youth who spent time living with the Cutlers, Eddie gets the benefit of the doubt from Ben''s daughter and his wife-to-be. Ben is firm in his belief that Eddie is guilty, and as the matter is debated in a divisive court battle, it will soon become clear whether he''s right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFuuHwlCrsj4xFXu0CBH6fpOUY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60647'),
  ('36618670940753825', 'Good Day, Ramon', 2013, 'Drama', 'Carlos Hidalgo, Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Kristyan Ferrer, Ingeborg Schöner, Rüdiger Evers, Adriana Barraza, Arcelia Ramírez, Hector Kotsifakis, Karl Friedrich, Marcel Batangtaris', null, 'After five failed attempts to go to the United States, 18-year-old Ramón decides to look for a friend’s aunt in Germany, but never finds her. With no papers or money, and without knowing the language, he barely survives living on the street until he meets Ruth, an old retired nurse who doesn’t speak Spanish. Beyond language barriers and prejudices, they discover that solidarity and humanity make life bearable.', 'After five failed attempts to go to the United States, 18-year-old Ramón decides to look for a friend’s aunt in Germany, but never finds her. With no papers or money, and without knowing the language, he barely survives living on the street until he meets Ruth, an old retired nurse who doesn’t speak Spanish. Beyond language barriers and prejudices, they discover that solidarity and humanity make life bearable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xaQAc01TZOHEku2uC520OIENWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242575'),
  ('525745701666313507', 'Good Deeds', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tyler Perry, Alexander Gruszynski, H.H. Cooper', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Thandiwe Newton, Gabrielle Union, Brian J. White, Phylicia Rashād, Eddie Cibrian, Rebecca Romijn, Ylian Alfaro Snyder', 'PG-13', 'For all his life, wealthy businessman Wesley Deeds has done what''s expected of him and has settled into a predictable routine. His scripted life begins to change, however, when he meets Lindsey Wakefield, a struggling single mother who works as a night janitor for his corporation and has just been evicted. He offers to help Lindsey get back on her feet and, though he''s already engaged, romantic sparks begin to fly. Suddenly, he finds himself torn between what is expected of him and what he really wants.', 'For all his life, wealthy businessman Wesley Deeds has done what''s expected of him and has settled into a predictable routine. His scripted life begins to change, however, when he meets Lindsey Wakefield, a struggling single mother who works as a night janitor for his corporation and has just been evicted. He offers to help Lindsey get back on her feet and, though he''s already engaged, romantic sparks begin to fly. Suddenly, he finds himself torn between what is expected of him and what he really wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIiWJq4WPcTfaIH8VkVlU2irzXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62008'),
  ('1151260149901084995', 'Good Evening to You', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Stathis Psaltis, Panos Mihalopoulos, Stamatis Gardelis, Kaiti Finou, Efi Pikoula, Yorgos Rigas, Rena Pagrati, Sofia Aliberti', null, 'Stathis is a teenager who owns a pirate radio station that broadcasts at the same frequency used by another pirate radio station, owned by Stamatis and his friends. This leads to many conflicts between them, and as if this wasn''t enough, Stathis is also desperately in love with Koula and has to face her huge boyfriend Kyriakos...', 'Stathis is a teenager who owns a pirate radio station that broadcasts at the same frequency used by another pirate radio station, owned by Stamatis and his friends. This leads to many conflicts between them, and as if this wasn''t enough, Stathis is also desperately in love with Koula and has to face her huge boyfriend Kyriakos...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDH6QuzSeytYjzzYoLktgWRzm13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185105'),
  ('657758794998244193', 'Good Evening, Mr. Wallenberg', 1990, 'Drama, War, History', 'Kjell Grede, Esa Vuorinen', 'Kjell Grede', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Katharina Thalbach, Károly Eperjes, Erland Josephson, Székely B. Miklós, Jesper Christensen, Ivan Desny, Franciszek Pieczka', null, 'Swedish account of Raoul Wallenberg, the man responsible for the largest rescue of Jews during World War II.', 'Swedish account of Raoul Wallenberg, the man responsible for the largest rescue of Jews during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unWo9e3VrfnT6vfb3PKtzjvBfC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80849'),
  ('190704984372425785', 'Good Fences', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Ernest R. Dickerson', 'Trey Ellis', 'Danny Glover, Whoopi Goldberg, Marie V. Cruz, Munro Chambers, Mo''Nique, Ryan Michelle Bathe, Marlyne Barrett, Thomas Chambers', 'R', 'Set in the 1970s, Tom Spader is an attorney who is determined to end what he has dubbed "the colored man''s losing streak." When his winning of a high-profile case thrusts him into the limelight, he decides to move his wife and their two kids out of their mixed lower-middle-class town and into the posh enclave of Greenwich, Connecticut.', 'Set in the 1970s, Tom Spader is an attorney who is determined to end what he has dubbed "the colored man''s losing streak." When his winning of a high-profile case thrusts him into the limelight, he decides to move his wife and their two kids out of their mixed lower-middle-class town and into the posh enclave of Greenwich, Connecticut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilYmsYBI6jnWjIcltBkit3sl1q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61902'),
  ('390473778207194728', 'Good For Nothing', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Gian Enrico Bianchi, Michele Barbagallo', 'Danilo Bellomo, Massimo Del Signore, Pietro Albino Di Pasquale', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Marco Marzocca, Marco Messeri, Valentina Lodovini, Daniela Giordano, Gianfelice Imparato, Camilla Filippi, Anna Bonaiuto', null, 'Easygoing Gianni looks forward to retirement - until he is informed that a change in the law obliges him to work three more years. Faced with the outrageous possibility of having to do a full day''s work, he sets about finding a way to achieve a quiet life', 'Easygoing Gianni looks forward to retirement - until he is informed that a change in the law obliges him to work three more years. Faced with the outrageous possibility of having to do a full day''s work, he sets about finding a way to achieve a quiet life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBZeccMJ1N9AYYzVRZayMxJla20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297288'),
  ('356547421655541007', 'Good Fortune', 2025, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Aziz Ansari, Carmen Cuba, Adam Newport-Berra', 'Aziz Ansari', 'Keanu Reeves, Aziz Ansari, Seth Rogen, Keke Palmer, Sandra Oh, Sherry Cola, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Blanca Araceli', 'R', 'A well-meaning but rather inept angel named Gabriel meddles in the lives of a struggling gig worker and a wealthy capitalist.', 'A well-meaning but rather inept angel named Gabriel meddles in the lives of a struggling gig worker and a wealthy capitalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rywxUbd4zvHiRP7nOHeDzuQSLIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114967'),
