  ('541770873454963789', 'Good Girl', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gyeong Seok-Ho', null, 'Joo Yeon-seo, Park Geon-hoo, Jang Seok-min, Jung Yun, Kim Moon-jong, Bae Geon-sik, Kim Keum-soon, Choi Doo-yeong', null, 'Boon-nyeo is a nice girl who works to pay off the debt her father left behind before he disappeared. The only light in her miserable life is Kang, the teacher at the house she keeps. Then one day, co-worker Myeong-joon confesses his love for her and goes after her body. However, she enjoys the intimacy of skin touching skin. She thinks about Myeong-joon''s hands but she''s not satisfied. In the end, she starts to seduce Man-gap, the richest man in the market, Cheon-soo, a man working for him and Kang who she has longed for so long...', 'Boon-nyeo is a nice girl who works to pay off the debt her father left behind before he disappeared. The only light in her miserable life is Kang, the teacher at the house she keeps. Then one day, co-worker Myeong-joon confesses his love for her and goes after her body. However, she enjoys the intimacy of skin touching skin. She thinks about Myeong-joon''s hands but she''s not satisfied. In the end, she starts to seduce Man-gap, the richest man in the market, Cheon-soo, a man working for him and Kang who she has longed for so long...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4AunUN05AuuYkBjJtxsTDdH9V3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436019'),
  ('972631339102779701', 'Good Girl Gone Bad', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Petra Lüschow, Jutta Pohlmann', 'Petra Lüschow', 'Anna Florkowski, Florian Stetter, Christina Große, Hermann Beyer, Oskar Bökelmann, Thorsten Merten, Heide Ackermann, Britta Hammelstein', null, 'West Germany, 1983. Seventeen-year-old Ursula wants it all and is thus too much, although all she''s looking for is love. Enter Siegfried Grimm, the charismatic new teacher who finally recognizes Ursula''s true potential. She falls for him, head over heels. A pity that Grimm sexually liberates the entire village - except Ursula. While the Grimm acolytes fight for the favor of their idol, Ursula resorts to more radical measures. Whatever it takes, she''ll get back at Grimm.', 'West Germany, 1983. Seventeen-year-old Ursula wants it all and is thus too much, although all she''s looking for is love. Enter Siegfried Grimm, the charismatic new teacher who finally recognizes Ursula''s true potential. She falls for him, head over heels. A pity that Grimm sexually liberates the entire village - except Ursula. While the Grimm acolytes fight for the favor of their idol, Ursula resorts to more radical measures. Whatever it takes, she''ll get back at Grimm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7s0g4HaUz1rC3W8ZoB9vZ3vftT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567015'),
  ('379086468881115288', 'Good Girls Go to Paris', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Alexander Hall', 'Gladys Lehman, Ken Englund', 'Melvyn Douglas, Joan Blondell, Walter Connolly, Alan Curtis, Joan Perry, Isabel Jeans, Stanley Brown, Alexander D''Arcy', 'NR', 'Jenny Swanson, a waitress on a college campus, is dying to visit Paris. Thanks to English professor Ronald Brooke, she manages to make her dream come true. Besides seeing the sights in the French capital she makes friends with a wealthy family there, the Brands.', 'Jenny Swanson, a waitress on a college campus, is dying to visit Paris. Thanks to English professor Ronald Brooke, she manages to make her dream come true. Besides seeing the sights in the French capital she makes friends with a wealthy family there, the Brands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMjjMwbid84QYUNGieKhdB7dLy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151104'),
  ('648251542650315845', 'Good Glue Sticks', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A peddler of "the best glue" sets up his outdoor stall. A crowd gathers for a demonstration. As he gives his pitch, two observant cops decide drive off his customers and close him down, much to his fury. He seeks revenge as they sit on a park bench.', 'A peddler of "the best glue" sets up his outdoor stall. A crowd gathers for a demonstration. As he gives his pitch, two observant cops decide drive off his customers and close him down, much to his fury. He seeks revenge as they sit on a park bench.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6jleXQNb9GBGaluqw0Weabg5NE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49298'),
  ('739180635880965108', 'Good Grief', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ole Bratt Birkeland, Thalia Ecclestone, Etienne Olchewsky', 'Dan Levy', 'Dan Levy, Ruth Negga, Himesh Patel, Luke Evans, Celia Imrie, Arnaud Valois, David Bradley, Mehdi Baki', 'R', 'When his husband unexpectedly dies, Marc''s world shatters, sending him and his two best friends on a soul-searching trip to Paris that reveals some hard truths they each needed to face.', 'When his husband unexpectedly dies, Marc''s world shatters, sending him and his two best friends on a soul-searching trip to Paris that reveals some hard truths they each needed to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJFHUglmh7xlY7g9Ql85QAJBZ6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036619'),
  ('313321312467192098', 'Good Guys Go to Heaven, Bad Guys Go to Pattaya', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Franck Gastambide, Renaud Chassaing, Ali Cherkaoui', 'Stéphane Kazandjian, Franck Gastambide', 'Franck Gastambide, Malik Bentalha, Anouar Toubali, Ramzy Bedia, Gad Elmaleh, Sabrina Ouazani, Sissi Duparc, Melha Bedia', null, 'Franky and Krimo dream of leaving the grey grime of their neighborhood behind and of traveling to the famous and diabolical Thai beach resort of Pattaya. To get there cheaply, the two friends have the crazy idea of registering, unbeknownst to him, the local little person for the Thai Dwarf Boxing World Championship. But what was supposed to be a dream vacation will transform into the most insane and dangerous adventure of their lives.', 'Franky and Krimo dream of leaving the grey grime of their neighborhood behind and of traveling to the famous and diabolical Thai beach resort of Pattaya. To get there cheaply, the two friends have the crazy idea of registering, unbeknownst to him, the local little person for the Thai Dwarf Boxing World Championship. But what was supposed to be a dream vacation will transform into the most insane and dangerous adventure of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6KJ8OwoP7CbsDgxKnaRfIMm6Yc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277839'),
  ('814706947023281306', 'Good Guys Wear Black', 1978, 'Action', 'Robert Steadman, Ted Post', 'Mark Medoff, Bruce Cohn', 'Chuck Norris, Anne Archer, Lloyd Haynes, James Franciscus, Dana Andrews, Soon-Tek Oh, Jim Backus, Lawrence P. Casey', 'PG', 'The former leader of a commando rescue attempt into Vietnam tries to discover why his squad members are being murdered, one-by-one, after the war is over.', 'The former leader of a commando rescue attempt into Vietnam tries to discover why his squad members are being murdered, one-by-one, after the war is over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qe6YEwpegOGzXhmGS7Xkwz9XxVR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42205'),
  ('342075504534801481', 'Good Hair', 2009, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Jeff Stilson, Cliff Charles, Mark Henderson', 'Lance Crouther, Chris Rock, Jeff Stilson', 'Maya Angelou, Chris Rock, Nia Long, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Ice-T, Tanya Crumel, Kevin Kirk, Derek J', 'PG-13', 'An exposé of comic proportions that only Chris Rock could pull off, GOOD HAIR visits beauty salons and hairstyling battles, scientific laboratories and Indian temples to explore the way hairstyles impact the activities, pocketbooks, sexual relationships, and self-esteem of the black community.', 'An exposé of comic proportions that only Chris Rock could pull off, GOOD HAIR visits beauty salons and hairstyling battles, scientific laboratories and Indian temples to explore the way hairstyles impact the activities, pocketbooks, sexual relationships, and self-esteem of the black community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ru6vIG2Omq8HKgDBe4o02BtySWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22800'),
  ('999542036583570090', 'Good Housewives', 2020, 'Romance', 'Jo Tae-ho', null, 'Tae Hee, Yeon Joo, Yoon Yool, Min Do-yoon, Kang Min-woo', null, 'An erotic film about the affairs of three married women. So-jeong, Hyeon-joo, and Da-eun, who are college classmates, are each dissatisfied with their husbands. So-jeong, an extrovert, enjoys sexual affair with her photographer while working as model, and Hyeon-joo enjoys sexual affair with her male client while working in real estate. Da-eun, a full-time housewife, happens to meet an attractive pizza delivery man. A few days later, Da-eun calls her friends to her house and orders them pizza, and the three friends seduce the delivery man.', 'An erotic film about the affairs of three married women. So-jeong, Hyeon-joo, and Da-eun, who are college classmates, are each dissatisfied with their husbands. So-jeong, an extrovert, enjoys sexual affair with her photographer while working as model, and Hyeon-joo enjoys sexual affair with her male client while working in real estate. Da-eun, a full-time housewife, happens to meet an attractive pizza delivery man. A few days later, Da-eun calls her friends to her house and orders them pizza, and the three friends seduce the delivery man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isb7uWf08M7Z1o4QARrr2rBg0Ww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229446'),
  ('330231328702157478', 'Good Kids', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Chris McCoy, Jimmy Lindsey', 'Chris McCoy', 'Nicholas Braun, Zoey Deutch, Mateo Arias, Israel Broussard, Julia Garner, Ashley Judd, Virginia Gardner, Randy Couture', 'R', 'Four high school students look to redefine themselves after graduation.', 'Four high school students look to redefine themselves after graduation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R3hZnqFNyFmG10qwKzaUntlUbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352186'),
  ('603621606716386184', 'Good Kill', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Andrew Niccol, Amir Mokri, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Ethan Hawke, January Jones, Zoë Kravitz, Jake Abel, Bruce Greenwood, Alma Sisneros, Kristen DeVore Rakes, Dylan Kenin', 'R', 'In the shadowy world of drone warfare, combat unfolds like a video game–only with real lives at stake. After six tours of duty, Air Force pilot Tom Egan now fights the Taliban from an air-conditioned bunker in the Nevada desert. But as he yearns to get back in the cockpit of a real plane and becomes increasingly troubled by the collateral damage he causes each time he pushes a button, Egan’s nerves—and his relationship with his wife—begin to unravel.', 'In the shadowy world of drone warfare, combat unfolds like a video game–only with real lives at stake. After six tours of duty, Air Force pilot Tom Egan now fights the Taliban from an air-conditioned bunker in the Nevada desert. But as he yearns to get back in the cockpit of a real plane and becomes increasingly troubled by the collateral damage he causes each time he pushes a button, Egan’s nerves—and his relationship with his wife—begin to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oO9nK1bqssxRdNHFSFGiucffiA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253626'),
  ('727242456296175213', 'Good King Dagobert', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Armando Nannuzzi, Claudio Risi', 'Gérard Brach, Agenore Incrocci, Dino Risi', 'Coluche, Michel Serrault, Ugo Tognazzi, Carole Bouquet, Isabella Ferrari, Michael Lonsdale, Sabrina Siani, John Karlsen', null, 'King''s Dagobert I intestinal and sexual problems loom large as he survives an attack on his royal caravan then barely makes it to Rome to personally give thanks to the Pope. After he arrives at the Vatican, he becomes involved in the battle between two contenders for the papacy and has to face the machinations of a ruthless Byzantine princess.', 'King''s Dagobert I intestinal and sexual problems loom large as he survives an attack on his royal caravan then barely makes it to Rome to personally give thanks to the Pope. After he arrives at the Vatican, he becomes involved in the battle between two contenders for the papacy and has to face the machinations of a ruthless Byzantine princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk5EuTYrRlY0WMC0dnkh4j5O8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63229'),
  ('77069137238582369', 'Good Life Delivery', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Leonardo Di Cesare', null, 'Ignacio Toselli, Mariana Anghileri, Oscar Núñez, Alicia Palmes, Sofía da Silva, Ariel Staltari, Pablo Ribba, Marcelo Nacci', null, 'A young guy''s home is taken over by his girlfriend''s parents and their doughnut business.', 'A young guy''s home is taken over by his girlfriend''s parents and their doughnut business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuespGH0SQjMO7AnHXhJZrJmq56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111089'),
  ('398365103416381631', 'Good Luck', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Richard LaBrie', 'Bob Comfort', 'Gregory Hines, Vincent D''Onofrio, Sarah Trigger, James Earl Jones, Robert O''Reilly, Maria O''Brien, Kathryn Howell, Dennis Dun', null, 'Bernard "Bern" Lemly is fed up with being in a wheelchair and wants more out of life. Meanwhile, former football player Tony "Ole" Olezniak is stewing after recently losing his sight. The men soon realize they can put their frustrated energy to good use by competing in a whitewater rafting race on Oregon''s Rouge River. In the process, they discover their disabilities don''t have to destroy their dreams.', 'Bernard "Bern" Lemly is fed up with being in a wheelchair and wants more out of life. Meanwhile, former football player Tony "Ole" Olezniak is stewing after recently losing his sight. The men soon realize they can put their frustrated energy to good use by competing in a whitewater rafting race on Oregon''s Rouge River. In the process, they discover their disabilities don''t have to destroy their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SUtbt5yt0Aou5fkt6QBtDjSPG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97568'),
  ('112608817024747865', 'Good Luck', 2014, 'Drama', 'Carolina Jabor, Bárbara Álvarez, Claudia Castro', 'Jorge Furtado, Pedro Furtado', 'Deborah Secco, João Pedro Zappa, Fernanda Montenegro, Cássia Kis, Gisele Fróes, Felipe Camargo, Pablo Sanábio, Enrique Díaz', null, 'After several behavior problems, teenager John is admitted to a psychiatric clinic by his family. There he meets Judith, for who he soon falls in love. The problem is that she does not have long to live and they know it. This shall not prevent the emergence of a great romance in the clinic.', 'After several behavior problems, teenager John is admitted to a psychiatric clinic by his family. There he meets Judith, for who he soon falls in love. The problem is that she does not have long to live and they know it. This shall not prevent the emergence of a great romance in the clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xSdSVOtSqmqCmerYsxuLYyHdep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248543'),
  ('655834293149431106', 'Good Luck Charlie, It''s Christmas!', 2011, 'Comedy, Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Arlene Sanford, Kenneth Zunder', 'Geoff Rodkey', 'Bridgit Mendler, Leigh-Allyn Baker, Jason Dolley, Eric Allan Kramer, Bradley Steven Perry, Mia Talerico, Debra Monk, Michael Kagan', 'G', 'Teddy Duncan''s middle-class family embarks on a road trip from their home in Denver to visit Mrs. Duncans Parents, the Blankenhoopers, in Palm Springs. When they find themselves stranded between Denver and Utah, they try to hitch a ride to Las Vegas with a seemingly normal older couple in a station wagon from Roswell, New Mexico. It turns out that the couple believes they are the victims of alien abduction. The Duncan''s must resort to purchasing a clunker Yugo to get to Utah, have their luggage stolen in Las Vegas, and survive a zany Christmas with Grandpa and Grandma Blankenhooper.', 'Teddy Duncan''s middle-class family embarks on a road trip from their home in Denver to visit Mrs. Duncans Parents, the Blankenhoopers, in Palm Springs. When they find themselves stranded between Denver and Utah, they try to hitch a ride to Las Vegas with a seemingly normal older couple in a station wagon from Roswell, New Mexico. It turns out that the couple believes they are the victims of alien abduction. The Duncan''s must resort to purchasing a clunker Yugo to get to Utah, have their luggage stolen in Las Vegas, and survive a zany Christmas with Grandpa and Grandma Blankenhooper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecuJMYZM3HQ96mnWtmyXoHb7s7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81440'),
  ('1038149190229345328', 'Good Luck Chuck', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Helfrich, Anthony B. Richmond, Glenn Bottomley', 'Josh Stolberg', 'Dane Cook, Jessica Alba, Dan Fogler, Ellia English, Lonny Ross, Troy Gentile, Chelan Simmons, Mackenzie Mowat', 'R', 'Cursed since childhood, dentist Charlie Logan cannot find the right woman. Even worse, he learns that each of his ex-girlfriends finds true love with the man she meets after her relationship with him ends. Hearing of Charlie''s reputation as a good-luck charm, women from all over line up for a quick tryst. But when Charlie meets the woman of his dreams, he must find a way to break the curse or risk losing her to the next man she meets.', 'Cursed since childhood, dentist Charlie Logan cannot find the right woman. Even worse, he learns that each of his ex-girlfriends finds true love with the man she meets after her relationship with him ends. Hearing of Charlie''s reputation as a good-luck charm, women from all over line up for a quick tryst. But when Charlie meets the woman of his dreams, he must find a way to break the curse or risk losing her to the next man she meets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2VgUoXR9iAtAf8nA0mvdTr7cOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10030'),
  ('360294092603703637', 'Good Luck Jerry', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Rangarajan Rambadran, Siddharth Sen', 'Pankaj Matta', 'Janhvi Kapoor, Deepak Dobriyal, Mita Vashisht, Neeraj Sood, Sushant Singh, Sahil Mehta, Jaswant Singh Dalal, Samta Sudiksha', null, 'In dire need of money, Jerry gets drawn into the dangerous world of drug trafficking. Things go awry when she decides to quit.', 'In dire need of money, Jerry gets drawn into the dangerous world of drug trafficking. Things go awry when she decides to quit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abcG0hQJVwCdloTTTwrY0jfJ1Em.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784940'),
  ('396725381737787106', 'Good Luck Sam', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Farid Bentoumi', 'Farid Bentoumi', 'Sami Bouajila, Franck Gastambide, Chiara Mastroianni, Hélène Vincent, Bouchakor Chakor Djaltia, Coralie Avril, Fadila Belkebla, Valérie Crouzet', null, 'Samir has given much of his time and money developing ski equipments for a Swedish Olympic athlete. When the contract fails, his business partner and closest friend plans to save their company by sending Samir to represent Algeria at the Winter Olympics! Already broke, and expecting his second child, Samir trains to become the first Algerian cross-country skiing male athlete to participate in the winter games. Samir, the eldest son of an Algerian emigrant must first go back to his father''s homeland in order to achieve this goal.', 'Samir has given much of his time and money developing ski equipments for a Swedish Olympic athlete. When the contract fails, his business partner and closest friend plans to save their company by sending Samir to represent Algeria at the Winter Olympics! Already broke, and expecting his second child, Samir trains to become the first Algerian cross-country skiing male athlete to participate in the winter games. Samir, the eldest son of an Algerian emigrant must first go back to his father''s homeland in order to achieve this goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttsEDwS5xIH40XTlCKtvyDOJZ1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380830'),
  ('46094600090960519', 'Good Luck to You, Leo Grande', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ellie Jones, Bryan Mason, Amy Hubbard', 'Katy Brand', 'Emma Thompson, Daryl McCormack, Isabella Laughland, Les Mabaleka, Lennie Beare, Carina Lopes, Charlotte Ware', 'R', 'Nancy Stokes, a retired schoolteacher, is pretty sure she has never had good sex. Now that her husband has died, she is determined to take a tour of sexual vistas that until now she has only imagined. She even has a plan; it involves an anonymous hotel room, and a sex worker who calls himself Leo Grande.', 'Nancy Stokes, a retired schoolteacher, is pretty sure she has never had good sex. Now that her husband has died, she is determined to take a tour of sexual vistas that until now she has only imagined. She even has a plan; it involves an anonymous hotel room, and a sex worker who calls himself Leo Grande.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxxOmTq4LgQxiyU4rW53qdj9FoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758330'),
  ('9788655877378441', 'Good Luck, Have Fun, Don''t Die', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Gore Verbinski, Liz Ludwitzke, James Whitaker', 'Matthew Robinson', 'Sam Rockwell, Juno Temple, Haley Lu Richardson, Michael Peña, Zazie Beetz, Asim Chaudhry, Tom Taylor, Georgia Goodman', 'R', 'A ''Man from the Future'' arrives at an LA diner where he must recruit the precise combination of disgruntled patrons to join him on a one-night quest to save the world from the terminal threat of a rogue artificial intelligence.', 'A ''Man from the Future'' arrives at an LA diner where he must recruit the precise combination of disgruntled patrons to join him on a one-night quest to save the world from the terminal threat of a rogue artificial intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWcfOdY7TU6lTdazWj0ebDZnAfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119449'),
  ('697636394235648236', 'Good Luck, Kekec', 1963, 'Drama, Family', 'Jože Gale, Ivan Marinček', 'Ivan Ribič', 'Velimir Gjurin, Ruša Bojc, Blanka Florjanc, Marija Goršič, Martin Mele, Stane Sever, Bert Sotlar', null, 'Two boys, Kekec and Rozle, come to serve a farmer, with a blind daughter Mojca, as shepherds. As the night falls, the two boys start talking about a woman who lives in the mountains and is supposed to steal children. Her name is Pehta. In the morning, Kekec, Rozle and Mojca go to an Alpine cottage and Kekec promises Mojca that he will find her a remedy for her eyes. As the girl is picking flowers, Pehta arrives and takes Mojca into her cottage. She wants to keep Mojca because of her singing.', 'Two boys, Kekec and Rozle, come to serve a farmer, with a blind daughter Mojca, as shepherds. As the night falls, the two boys start talking about a woman who lives in the mountains and is supposed to steal children. Her name is Pehta. In the morning, Kekec, Rozle and Mojca go to an Alpine cottage and Kekec promises Mojca that he will find her a remedy for her eyes. As the girl is picking flowers, Pehta arrives and takes Mojca into her cottage. She wants to keep Mojca because of her singing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVAjTcwO80UyRRkzPjsKIA0TKiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69354'),
  ('364349153954374235', 'Good Luck, Miss Wyckoff', 1979, 'Drama', 'Marvin J. Chomsky, Álex Phillips Jr., Michael Kusley', 'Polly Platt', 'Anne Heywood, Donald Pleasence, Robert Vaughn, Earl Holliman, Carolyn Jones, Ronee Blakley, Dorothy Malone, Doris Roberts', 'R', 'An abusive sexual relationship between a white spinster schoolteacher and a young black janitor in 1956 Kansas complicates her struggle to come to grips with her sexuality and emotions.', 'An abusive sexual relationship between a white spinster schoolteacher and a young black janitor in 1956 Kansas complicates her struggle to come to grips with her sexuality and emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kz7tRg1gNS0QVJ4N5fkpHQnFJdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155797'),
  ('924520635778344768', 'Good Manners', 2017, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Marco Dutra, Juliana Rojas, Rui Poças', 'Marco Dutra, Juliana Rojas', 'Isabél Zuaa, Marjorie Estiano, Miguel Lobo, Cida Moreira, Felipe Kenji, Nina Medeiros, Andréa Marquee, Germano Melo', null, 'Clara, a lonely nurse from the outskirts of São Paulo, is hired by mysterious and wealthy Ana as the nanny for her unborn child. The two women develop a strong bond, but soon Clara discovers a terrifying secret about the child.', 'Clara, a lonely nurse from the outskirts of São Paulo, is hired by mysterious and wealthy Ana as the nanny for her unborn child. The two women develop a strong bond, but soon Clara discovers a terrifying secret about the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFGfmI9tIWCpEZbGUhI40uznL1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315205'),
  ('419305711073232216', 'Good Manners', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vanesa Sola, Marta Díaz de Lope Díaz, Marc Mateu', 'Marta Díaz de Lope Díaz, Zebina Guerra', 'Elena Irureta, Gloria Muñoz, Carmen Flores Sandoval, Pepa Aniorte, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Ricard Farré, Inma Cuesta, Rubèn Serrano', null, 'Manuela and Rosario are two sisters who, after years of not speaking because of a family secret, find each other unexpectedly in the birthday party of their grandchildren. The kids have met thanks to their nannies, Trini and Milagros, best friends and neighbours. When they discover the conflict that separates the children, the nosy housekeepers will try, clumsily, lovingly and through silly shenanigans, to reconcile the families.', 'Manuela and Rosario are two sisters who, after years of not speaking because of a family secret, find each other unexpectedly in the birthday party of their grandchildren. The kids have met thanks to their nannies, Trini and Milagros, best friends and neighbours. When they discover the conflict that separates the children, the nosy housekeepers will try, clumsily, lovingly and through silly shenanigans, to reconcile the families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7fAmDcHwfru0dQdJOVF2RzOEvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800104'),
  ('470448672304226365', 'Good Men, Good Women', 1995, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chen Hwai-En', 'Chu Tien-Wen', 'Annie Shizuka Inoh, Jack Kao, Lim Giong, King Jieh-wen, Grace Chen, Tsai Chen-nan, Vicky Wei, Chan San-Yee', null, 'An actress preparing to play in a historical epic is terrorized by someone faxing her pages from her stolen diary; has colorful flashbacks of her affair with a now-deceased man; and imagines black-and-white film-within-a-film scenes of the movie she is about to appear in.', 'An actress preparing to play in a historical epic is terrorized by someone faxing her pages from her stolen diary; has colorful flashbacks of her affair with a now-deceased man; and imagines black-and-white film-within-a-film scenes of the movie she is about to appear in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMmjIymprpdHrSoentdTaUNqgMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99600'),
  ('951210660610955640', 'Good Morning Christmas!', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Dan Dumouchel, Paul Ziller', 'Riley Weston', 'Alison Sweeney, Marc Blucas, Ian Collins, Nicole Oliver, Jillian Walchuck, Matthew James Dowden, Jay Brazeau, Kayla Heller', null, 'Two competing TV hosts are sent to a festive small town over Christmas. While pretending to get along for the sake of appearances, they discover that there’s more to each other than they thought.', 'Two competing TV hosts are sent to a festive small town over Christmas. While pretending to get along for the sake of appearances, they discover that there’s more to each other than they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbdAuRd893TvCiX4PGOLJLNMuhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746043'),
  ('289026663613542185', 'Good Morning President', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jang Jin, Choi Sang-ho', 'Jang Jin', 'Lee Soon-jae, Jang Dong-gun, Goh Doo-shim, Im Ha-ryong, Han Chae-young, Gong Ho-seok, Gong Hyung-jin, Park Hae-il', null, 'Good Morning President is an abridged version of the politics and life of three different presidents. The three are: the older President Kim Jung-ho at the end of his term, the young President Cha Ji-wook, a skillful manipulator of foreign policy and with great determination, and a female President Han Kyuong-ja. They are distressed over the choices they have to make between politics and ethics. The affliction of Kim Jung-ho who wins the lottery, the agony of Cha Ji-wook who donates an organ, and the troubles of Han Kyuong-ja who faces the crisis of divorce.', 'Good Morning President is an abridged version of the politics and life of three different presidents. The three are: the older President Kim Jung-ho at the end of his term, the young President Cha Ji-wook, a skillful manipulator of foreign policy and with great determination, and a female President Han Kyuong-ja. They are distressed over the choices they have to make between politics and ethics. The affliction of Kim Jung-ho who wins the lottery, the agony of Cha Ji-wook who donates an organ, and the troubles of Han Kyuong-ja who faces the crisis of divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guv5TtLdb3lb2ydEU4c8KR8arNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136707'),
  ('778317024214734374', 'Good Morning, Babylon', 1987, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani', 'Vincent Spano, Joaquim de Almeida, Greta Scacchi, Désirée Nosbusch, Omero Antonutti, Bérangère Bonvoisin, David Brandon, Brian Freilino', null, 'After the bankruptcy of their father''s stonemasonry firm, brothers Nicola and Andrea emigrate to America to restore their fortunes. After many adventures and near-disasters, they end up in Hollywood, designing sets for D.W. Griffith, and marry beautiful actresses. However, tragedy strikes with the arrival of World War I, which finds the brothers fighting on opposite sides...', 'After the bankruptcy of their father''s stonemasonry firm, brothers Nicola and Andrea emigrate to America to restore their fortunes. After many adventures and near-disasters, they end up in Hollywood, designing sets for D.W. Griffith, and marry beautiful actresses. However, tragedy strikes with the arrival of World War I, which finds the brothers fighting on opposite sides...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQmPgRyabH8HUmtda0JbpEsaK1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48149'),
  ('906297592781996195', 'Good Morning, Boys!', 1937, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Marcel Varnel', 'Leslie Arliss, Marriott Edgar, Val Guest', 'Will Hay, Martita Hunt, Fewlass Llewellyn, Mark Daly, C. Denier Warren, Will Hay Jr., Basil McGrail, Jacques Brown', null, 'Dr. Benjamin Twist (Hay) and his pupils become involved with art thieves on a trip to Paris. Hay’s seamy schoolmaster act is supported by a fine cast including Charles Hawtrey and Lilli Palmer.', 'Dr. Benjamin Twist (Hay) and his pupils become involved with art thieves on a trip to Paris. Hay’s seamy schoolmaster act is supported by a fine cast including Charles Hawtrey and Lilli Palmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzhCKcafvXI5duB2OcmRON3Mww2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78459'),
  ('517916099210979730', 'Good Morning, Miss Dove', 1955, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Henry Koster, Leon Shamroy', 'Eleanore Griffin', 'Jennifer Jones, Robert Stack, Kipp Hamilton, Robert Douglas, Peggy Knudsen, Marshall Thompson, Chuck Connors, Biff Elliot', null, 'Miss Dove is a prim New England school teacher who is treasured by her students in the small town of Liberty Hill. When she falls ill, a kindly doctor, who is a former student of Miss Dove''s, comes to her aid. As many of her pupils, present and past, come to see her in the hospital, they reveal how Miss Dove has greatly impacted their lives over the years. These visitors include a police officer, a playwright, a banker, a convict, and an unmarried mother.', 'Miss Dove is a prim New England school teacher who is treasured by her students in the small town of Liberty Hill. When she falls ill, a kindly doctor, who is a former student of Miss Dove''s, comes to her aid. As many of her pupils, present and past, come to see her in the hospital, they reveal how Miss Dove has greatly impacted their lives over the years. These visitors include a police officer, a playwright, a banker, a convict, and an unmarried mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kd4pzpDplw41t92n56rh9blR78b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4809'),
  ('524269785971423690', 'Good Morning, Mr Fotis', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Dimitra Kouzi', 'Dimitra Kouzi', 'Fotis Psyharis', null, 'Fotis Psyharis is a teacher working at a central-Athens public elementary school for the last 30 years. The large majority of his students are children of immigrants and refugees.The lack of a common language and cultural code prompts Fotis to develop different teaching Methods. Theater, which combines several other arts, is only one of his tools.', 'Fotis Psyharis is a teacher working at a central-Athens public elementary school for the last 30 years. The large majority of his students are children of immigrants and refugees.The lack of a common language and cultural code prompts Fotis to develop different teaching Methods. Theater, which combines several other arts, is only one of his tools.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UaGlt5YhnKIaBKr52r30qTqKuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707035'),
  ('900926283893267419', 'Good Morning, Night', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'Marco Bellocchio, Pasquale Mari, Daniela Ceselli', 'Marco Bellocchio, Daniela Ceselli', 'Maya Sansa, Luigi Lo Cascio, Roberto Herlitzka, Paolo Briguglia, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Giovanni Calcagno, Giulio Bosetti, Gianni Schicchi', null, 'The 1978 kidnapping and murder of Aldo Moro, president of the most important political party in Italy at the time, Democrazia Cristiana, as seen from the perspective of one of his assailants -- a conflicted young woman in the ranks of the Red Brigade.', 'The 1978 kidnapping and murder of Aldo Moro, president of the most important political party in Italy at the time, Democrazia Cristiana, as seen from the perspective of one of his assailants -- a conflicted young woman in the ranks of the Red Brigade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5r6JAD9E6BUCfpN8At52a0TJbaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24164'),
  ('856472212498715568', 'Good Morning, Vietnam', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Barry Levinson, Peter Sova', 'Mitch Markowitz', 'Robin Williams, Forest Whitaker, Tom T. Tran, Chintara Sukapatana, Bruno Kirby, Robert Wuhl, J.T. Walsh, Noble Willingham', 'R', 'A disk jockey goes to Vietnam to work for the Armed Forces Radio Service. While he becomes popular among the troops, his superiors disapprove of his humor.', 'A disk jockey goes to Vietnam to work for the Armed Forces Radio Service. While he becomes popular among the troops, his superiors disapprove of his humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sreISlFUn5TyR41QNjlfAdX5SEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801'),
  ('497800487260717660', 'Good Morning... and Goodbye!', 1967, 'Crime, Drama', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer', 'Jack Moran', 'Alaina Capri, Stuart Lancaster, Patrick Wright, Haji, Karen Ciral, Tom Howland, Don Johnson, Megan Timothy', null, 'Tales of eleven losers are told and interwoven. Burt can''t satisfy Angel, so she seeks the arms of another man, who is caught by Angel in the arms of another woman. Angel ends up with Justin, who ends up with a co-worker''s wife. As Angel and Burt argue, a sorceress watches, and eventually seduces Burt while Angel gets to know Ray, who had previously chased a blonde girl down on the coast. You get the idea.', 'Tales of eleven losers are told and interwoven. Burt can''t satisfy Angel, so she seeks the arms of another man, who is caught by Angel in the arms of another woman. Angel ends up with Justin, who ends up with a co-worker''s wife. As Angel and Burt argue, a sorceress watches, and eventually seduces Burt while Angel gets to know Ray, who had previously chased a blonde girl down on the coast. You get the idea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5m1VDiF5ljwuRfcVI90Fs20Qjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5748'),
  ('277421379367736222', 'Good Mother', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hafsia Herzi, Jérémie Attard', 'Hafsia Herzi', 'Sabrina Benhamed, Halima Benhamed, Justine Grégory, Noémie Casari, Jawed Hannachi Herzi, Malik Bouchenaf, Maria Benhamed, Denise Giullo', null, 'Nora, a cleaning lady in her fifties, looks after her small family in a housing estate in the northern part of Marseille. She is worried about her grandson Ellyes, who has been in prison for several months for robbery and is awaiting his trial with a mixture of hope and anxiety. Nora does everything she can to make this wait as painless as possible.', 'Nora, a cleaning lady in her fifties, looks after her small family in a housing estate in the northern part of Marseille. She is worried about her grandson Ellyes, who has been in prison for several months for robbery and is awaiting his trial with a mixture of hope and anxiety. Nora does everything she can to make this wait as painless as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHggGhyUE4njLJ6bcH4VihjmSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820711'),
  ('1119710499332976122', 'Good Mothers', 1942, 'Documentary', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Ebbe Neergaard, Dinah Miller', null, 'The Mothers'' Aid is a state-funded institution with branches all over Denmark. Erna, a young pregnant woman, has asked a doctor to carry out an abortion, but instead he advised her to go to the Mothers'' Aid for consultation.', 'The Mothers'' Aid is a state-funded institution with branches all over Denmark. Erna, a young pregnant woman, has asked a doctor to carry out an abortion, but instead he advised her to go to the Mothers'' Aid for consultation.', null, 'tmdb:movie:163222'),
  ('873586361404204961', 'Good Mourning', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Micky Froehlich, mgk, Mod Sun', 'mgk, Mod Sun', 'mgk, Mod Sun, Becky G, Dove Cameron, Pete Davidson, Whitney Cummings, Megan Fox, GaTa', 'R', 'Movie star London Clash gets his world turned upside down when he must choose between pursuing his one true love and landing a life-changing starring role in a major motion picture.', 'Movie star London Clash gets his world turned upside down when he must choose between pursuing his one true love and landing a life-changing starring role in a major motion picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCKD2tbldX3jDtsOVU2QVGTw6Ua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865686'),
  ('939998198189651824', 'Good Neighbor Sam', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Burnett Guffey, David Swift, R. Robert Rosenbaum', 'David Swift, James Fritzell, Everett Greenbaum', 'Jack Lemmon, Romy Schneider, Dorothy Provine, Mike Connors, Edward Andrews, Louis Nye, Robert Q. Lewis, Joyce Jameson', null, 'To help his divorced neighbor claim a substantial inheritance, a family man poses as her husband. The ruse spills over into his career in advertising, and his recent promotion relies on his wholesome and moral appearance.', 'To help his divorced neighbor claim a substantial inheritance, a family man poses as her husband. The ruse spills over into his career in advertising, and his recent promotion relies on his wholesome and moral appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLyFlaMOZ998xitLiOEMur2FyrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3011'),
  ('864439057264861347', 'Good Neighbours', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jacob Tierney, Guy Dufaux', 'Jacob Tierney', 'Jay Baruchel, Scott Speedman, Emily Hampshire, Gary Farmer, Xavier Dolan, Kaniehtiio Horn, Anne-Marie Cadieux, Micheline Lanctôt', 'R', 'Neighbors Spencer and Louise have bonded over their fascination with a recent string of murders terrorizing their community. When a new tenant named Victor moves into the building, all three quickly hit it off. However, they soon discover each has his or her own dark secret. As the violence outside mounts, the city retreats indoors for safety. But the more time these three neighbors spend together in their apartment building, the clearer it becomes that what they once thought of as a safe haven is as dangerous as any outside terrors they could imagine.', 'Neighbors Spencer and Louise have bonded over their fascination with a recent string of murders terrorizing their community. When a new tenant named Victor moves into the building, all three quickly hit it off. However, they soon discover each has his or her own dark secret. As the violence outside mounts, the city retreats indoors for safety. But the more time these three neighbors spend together in their apartment building, the clearer it becomes that what they once thought of as a safe haven is as dangerous as any outside terrors they could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i2YBTnZyC71TuJXq4RQWPGSbvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64320'),
  ('994084317521495788', 'Good News', 1947, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Walters, Lennie Hayton, Charles Schoenbaum', 'Betty Comden, Adolph Green', 'June Allyson, Peter Lawford, Patricia Marshall, Joan McCracken, Ray McDonald, Mel Tormé, Robert E. Strickland, Donald MacBride', 'NR', 'At fictitious Tait University in the Roaring ''20s, co-ed and school librarian Connie Lane falls for football hero Tommy Marlowe. Unfortunately, he has his eye on gold-digging vamp Pat McClellan. Tommy''s grades start to slip, which keeps him from playing in the big game. Connie eventually finds out Tommy really loves her and devises a plan to win him back and to get him back on the field.', 'At fictitious Tait University in the Roaring ''20s, co-ed and school librarian Connie Lane falls for football hero Tommy Marlowe. Unfortunately, he has his eye on gold-digging vamp Pat McClellan. Tommy''s grades start to slip, which keeps him from playing in the big game. Connie eventually finds out Tommy really loves her and devises a plan to win him back and to get him back on the field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9pwo2RskZkeTk0H0dce253RNpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31513'),
  ('987269674394064589', 'Good News', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Elio Petri, Tonino Nardi, Gianni Arduini', 'Elio Petri', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Ángela Molina, Aurore Clément, Paolo Bonacelli, Ombretta Colli, Ritza Brown, Ninetto Davoli, Franco Javarone', null, 'A disaffected media executive spends his days watching violent programming on the television screens in his office and his evenings neglecting his frustrated wife at home. The monotonicity is disturbed when he is contacted by an old friend who confides in him he is being threatened by mysterious assassins.', 'A disaffected media executive spends his days watching violent programming on the television screens in his office and his evenings neglecting his frustrated wife at home. The monotonicity is disturbed when he is contacted by an old friend who confides in him he is being threatened by mysterious assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3CoBhpDVlmmHAg0KfRd5LE5cGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129568'),
  ('94814729545122415', 'Good News', 2025, 'Thriller, Comedy, History', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Cho Hyoung-rae, Lee Gil-gyu', 'Byun Sung-hyun, Lee Jin-seong', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Hong Kyung, Ryoo Seung-bum, Takayuki Yamada, Kippei Shiina, Kim Seung-o, Show Kasamatsu, Nairu Yamamoto', 'R', 'When hijackers seize a Japanese flight and demand to fly to Pyongyang, a mysterious mastermind hatches a zany scheme to reroute the plane to Seoul.', 'When hijackers seize a Japanese flight and demand to fly to Pyongyang, a mysterious mastermind hatches a zany scheme to reroute the plane to Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA3o8q7JTym6lUM8pnITwQDfvhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1296404'),
  ('770588870697532371', 'Good Newwz', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Raj Mehta, Baljeet Singh Marwah, Vishnu Rao', 'Jyoti Kapoor, Rishabh Sharma', 'Akshay Kumar, Diljit Dosanjh, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Kiara Advani, Tisca Chopra, Adil Hussain, Anjana Sukhani, Mohit Raina', null, 'Two couples with the same surnames pursue in-vitro fertilisation and wait for their upcoming babies. Trouble ensues when they find that the sperms of each couple have been mixed with each other.', 'Two couples with the same surnames pursue in-vitro fertilisation and wait for their upcoming babies. Trouble ensues when they find that the sperms of each couple have been mixed with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YWp8MdXZAZvXgnWyv2RgMaG3Ps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643534'),
  ('134191468682956518', 'Good Night', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vinayak Chandrasekaran, Jayanth Sethu Mathavan', 'Vinayak Chandrasekaran', 'Manikandan, Meetha Raghunath, Ramesh Thilak, Bagavathi Perumal, Balaji Sakthivel, Raichal Rabecca Philip, Nikhila Sankar, Priyalaya', null, 'Mohan, an IT youngster with a snoring issue starts his life with Anu, the girl of his dreams, hiding his issue. However, trouble begins, when his snoring starts affecting his life and the health of his partner.', 'Mohan, an IT youngster with a snoring issue starts his life with Anu, the girl of his dreams, hiding his issue. However, trouble begins, when his snoring starts affecting his life and the health of his partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFTO0tCTxXazstWfhOQHPb3kcMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090969'),
  ('488941565241624028', 'Good Night Beijing', 2021, 'Romance', 'Jaycee Chan, Zhang Xioalei, Mi Hao', 'Leo Zhang, Erica Xia-Hou', 'Chen Bolin, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Jiang Chao, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Jackie Chan, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Ying Da, Erica Xia-Hou', null, 'Beijing is the place where dreams come true or at least that’s what a group of young and ambitious people from different parts are hoping for. Romance could be in their future but also heartbreak as well, leading them to question just where they stand in such a city. Will they find the career and partner of their dreams or have to make a choice between one of the other?', 'Beijing is the place where dreams come true or at least that’s what a group of young and ambitious people from different parts are hoping for. Romance could be in their future but also heartbreak as well, leading them to question just where they stand in such a city. Will they find the career and partner of their dreams or have to make a choice between one of the other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7svHUceTi15bgFB8yupvgtNa0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917319'),
  ('249279964825412963', 'Good Night Oppy', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ryan White, David Paul Jacobson', 'Helen Kearns, Ryan White', 'Angela Bassett, Steve Squyres, Jennifer Trosper, Rob Manning, Kobie Boykins, Ashitey Trebi-Ollennu, Doug Ellison, Abigail Fraeman', 'PG', 'The inspirational true story of Opportunity, a rover that was sent to Mars for a 90-day mission but ended up surviving for 15 years. Follow Opportunity’s groundbreaking journey on Mars and the remarkable bond forged between a robot and her humans millions of miles away.', 'The inspirational true story of Opportunity, a rover that was sent to Mars for a 90-day mission but ended up surviving for 15 years. Follow Opportunity’s groundbreaking journey on Mars and the remarkable bond forged between a robot and her humans millions of miles away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DTWN79hsN5AZEhW8w4SOquSI4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972545'),
  ('1146075093445919966', 'Good Night, and Good Luck.', 2005, 'Drama, History', 'George Clooney, Robert Elswit, Melissa V. Barnes', 'Grant Heslov, George Clooney', 'David Strathairn, Patricia Clarkson, George Clooney, Jeff Daniels, Robert Downey Jr., Frank Langella, Ray Wise, Robert John Burke', 'PG', 'The story of journalist Edward R. Murrow''s stand against Senator Joseph McCarthy''s anti-communist witch-hunts in the early 1950s.', 'The story of journalist Edward R. Murrow''s stand against Senator Joseph McCarthy''s anti-communist witch-hunts in the early 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4QSEno2xxHqMtSr3mPUhJpO3F2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3291'),
