  ('186634412472888043', 'Good night… lawyer!', 1955, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Giorgio Bianchi, Mario Bava, Silvana Mangini Colizzi', 'Ruggero Maccari, Giovanni Grimaldi, Ettore Scola', 'Alberto Sordi, Giulietta Masina, Mara Berni, Andrea Checchi, Tina Pica, Vittorio Caprioli, Massimo Randisi, Turi Pandolfini', null, 'A lawyer, married but temporarily alone at home, finds himself in the house a beautiful lady who tries to escape from her jealous husband. Fascinated by the beauty of the unexpected guest, the lawyer is determined to conquer her, in vain. But when the woman leaves, she discovers that she has been stolen some money.', 'A lawyer, married but temporarily alone at home, finds himself in the house a beautiful lady who tries to escape from her jealous husband. Fascinated by the beauty of the unexpected guest, the lawyer is determined to conquer her, in vain. But when the woman leaves, she discovers that she has been stolen some money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQesumnGR44AA6x5rbpyiIJqQCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59103'),
  ('849729161377068922', 'Good Ol'' Freda', 2013, 'Music, Documentary, History', 'Ryan White, Austin Hargrave', 'Ryan White, Jessica Hargrave', 'Freda Kelly, Tony Barrow, Billy Hatton, Ringo Starr, John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison', 'PG', 'The story of Freda Kelly, a shy Liverpudlian teenager asked to work for a young local band hoping to make it big: The Beatles. Their loyal secretary from beginning to end, Freda tells her tales for the first time in 50 years.', 'The story of Freda Kelly, a shy Liverpudlian teenager asked to work for a young local band hoping to make it big: The Beatles. Their loyal secretary from beginning to end, Freda tells her tales for the first time in 50 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZylt896XL9JEr8dJvjlDAZZChl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173301'),
  ('106375196590702273', 'Good Old Daze', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cédric Klapisch, Dominique Colin', 'Cédric Klapisch, Santiago Amigorena', 'Romain Duris, Vincent Elbaz, Nicolas Koretzky, Julien Lambroschini, Joachim Lombard, Julie-Anne Roth, Hélène de Fougerolles, Lisa Faulkner', null, 'Ten years after their Upper Sixth, Bruno, Momo, Leon and Alain meet together in the waiting room of a maternity hospital. The father of the awaited baby is Tomasi, their best friend at that time, who died one month before due to an overdose. They remember their teenage, their laughs, their dreams, their stupid pranks... a description of the French youth in the middle of the seventies.', 'Ten years after their Upper Sixth, Bruno, Momo, Leon and Alain meet together in the waiting room of a maternity hospital. The father of the awaited baby is Tomasi, their best friend at that time, who died one month before due to an overdose. They remember their teenage, their laughs, their dreams, their stupid pranks... a description of the French youth in the middle of the seventies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/encyBuX8ZdO2qijlROGAJPqsT0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33095'),
