  ('141174133041188618', 'Good Scouts', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is leading a scout troop consisting of his nephews on a hike in the woods. Donald isn''t nearly the expert on the woods that he thinks he is, much to the amusement of the boys. In a bid for sympathy, he douses himself in catsup and fakes injury; the boys bandage him so thoroughly he can''t see, and he stumbles into a pot of honey, and is soon getting all too much attention from a bear.', 'Donald is leading a scout troop consisting of his nephews on a hike in the woods. Donald isn''t nearly the expert on the woods that he thinks he is, much to the amusement of the boys. In a bid for sympathy, he douses himself in catsup and fakes injury; the boys bandage him so thoroughly he can''t see, and he stumbles into a pot of honey, and is soon getting all too much attention from a bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXU4dxY97FwGkUOSWk0zEHvIUZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69099'),
  ('208900054486888231', 'Good Taste Made Bad Taste', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Tony Hiles', null, 'Peter Vere-Jones, Peter Jackson, Craig Smith, Dean Lawrie, Ken Hammon, Terry Potter, Pete O''Herne, Mike Minett', null, 'A very informative documentary on the making of Peter Jackson''s gore classic Bad Taste. Highlights include behind-the-scenes footage, detailed explanations of the special effects, an interview with Peter''s mom and dad, and interviews with the cast and crew.', 'A very informative documentary on the making of Peter Jackson''s gore classic Bad Taste. Highlights include behind-the-scenes footage, detailed explanations of the special effects, an interview with Peter''s mom and dad, and interviews with the cast and crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RLxc7byDSguGkEIW3aQQ9b5CgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25229'),
  ('144126264720354015', 'Good Time', 2017, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Benny Safdie, Josh Safdie, Sean Price Williams', 'Josh Safdie, Ronald Bronstein', 'Robert Pattinson, Benny Safdie, Buddy Duress, Taliah Webster, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Barkhad Abdi, Necro, Peter Verby', 'R', 'After a botched bank robbery lands his younger brother in prison, Connie Nikas embarks on a twisted odyssey through New York City''s underworld to get his brother Nick out of jail.', 'After a botched bank robbery lands his younger brother in prison, Connie Nikas embarks on a twisted odyssey through New York City''s underworld to get his brother Nick out of jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE1c9hj5Hf8a9KplAdRdhADqUro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429200'),
