  ('165094619628232968', 'Good Times', 1967, 'Comedy, Music', 'William Friedkin, Robert Wyckoff, David Salven', 'Tony Barrett, William Friedkin', 'Sonny Bono, Cher, George Sanders, Norman Alden, Larry Duran, Kelly Thordsen, Lennie Weinrib, Peter Robbins', null, 'Given the opportunity to headline their own feature film by studio executive Mr. Mordicus, Sonny and Cher have three days to come up with an idea for a hit movie or they''ll have to use the studio''s hackneyed script.', 'Given the opportunity to headline their own feature film by studio executive Mr. Mordicus, Sonny and Cher have three days to come up with an idea for a hit movie or they''ll have to use the studio''s hackneyed script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38ztQs2pElyDAgemltVpS58asyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154266'),
  ('1102091296906695511', 'Good Vibrations', 2012, 'Music, Drama', 'Lisa Barros D''Sa, Glenn Leyburn, Ivan McCullough', 'Colin Carberry, Glenn Patterson', 'Richard Dormer, Jodie Whittaker, Karl Johnson, Michael Colgan, Liam Cunningham, Dylan Moran, Ruth McCabe, Mark Ryder', null, 'The story of music legend Terri Hooley, a key figure in Belfast''s punk rock scene. Hooley founded the Good Vibrations store from which a record label sprung, representing bands such as The Undertones, Rudi and The Outcasts.', 'The story of music legend Terri Hooley, a key figure in Belfast''s punk rock scene. Hooley founded the Good Vibrations store from which a record label sprung, representing bands such as The Undertones, Rudi and The Outcasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3C0o05CE1zumEB6XTwLI5yLSA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130593'),
  ('419018567294547855', 'Good Will Hunting', 1997, 'Drama', 'Gus Van Sant, Jean-Yves Escoffier, Andrew Shea', 'Matt Damon, Ben Affleck', 'Matt Damon, Robin Williams, Ben Affleck, Stellan Skarsgård, Minnie Driver, Casey Affleck, Cole Hauser, Vik Sahay', 'R', 'Will Hunting is a headstrong, working-class genius who is failing the lessons of life. After one too many run-ins with the law, Will''s last chance is a psychology professor, who might be the only man who can reach him.', 'Will Hunting is a headstrong, working-class genius who is failing the lessons of life. After one too many run-ins with the law, Will''s last chance is a psychology professor, who might be the only man who can reach him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2FnLKpFi1HPO7BEJxdkv6hpJSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489'),
  ('96470159959183257', 'Good Will to Men', 1955, 'Animation, Drama, War', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler', null, 'A group of young mice is in the ruins of a church, practicing singing for an upcoming service. After singing an adulterated version of "Hark! The Herald Angels Sing," the mice wonder about the last line, "Good will to men." One of them asks the choirmaster, an old mouse, "What are men?" The old mouse explains that they all killed each other off by building bigger and more destructive weapons, first guns, then missiles, then bombs.', 'A group of young mice is in the ruins of a church, practicing singing for an upcoming service. After singing an adulterated version of "Hark! The Herald Angels Sing," the mice wonder about the last line, "Good will to men." One of them asks the choirmaster, an old mouse, "What are men?" The old mouse explains that they all killed each other off by building bigger and more destructive weapons, first guns, then missiles, then bombs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVkDblHYQC3B2KeJecjqzo6DlRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46244'),
  ('680133423137965797', 'Good-for-Nothing', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Yoshishige Yoshida', 'Masahiko Tsugawa, Yūsuke Kawazu, Hizuru Takachiho, Junichiro Yamashita, Yosuke Hayashi, Kakuko Chino, Fumio Watanabe, Masao Mishima', null, 'Yoshida''s first feature follows the lives of young students against a background of jazz, emptiness and boredom. The plot is fairly simple: a "good-for-nothing" from a poor background falls in love with the young secretary of his rich friend''s father. The woman senses good in him and tries to lead him on the right path.', 'Yoshida''s first feature follows the lives of young students against a background of jazz, emptiness and boredom. The plot is fairly simple: a "good-for-nothing" from a poor background falls in love with the young secretary of his rich friend''s father. The woman senses good in him and tries to lead him on the right path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zIPy4eH4icKKMagoVVwVqZAhfM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88529'),
