  ('785599471783534706', 'Goodbye to All That', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Angus MacLachlan, Corey Walter, Scott Larkin', 'Angus MacLachlan', 'Paul Schneider, Anna Camp, Michael Chernus, Heather Graham, Ashley Hinshaw, Heather Lawless, Melanie Lynskey, Audrey P. Scott', 'R', 'Otto Wall is just a little unlucky in life, and unbeknownst to him, in love. When his wife suddenly asks for a divorce, he bounces between a search for answers, desperate attempts to stay connected to his daughter, and his fateful reentry into the dating pool.', 'Otto Wall is just a little unlucky in life, and unbeknownst to him, in love. When his wife suddenly asks for a divorce, he bounces between a search for answers, desperate attempts to stay connected to his daughter, and his fateful reentry into the dating pool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykrO7Cj1QGjfhXISOxV78UrXVxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261820'),
  ('722360803132674338', 'Goodbye to Language', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Fabrice Aragno, Jean-Paul Battaggia', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jessica Erickson, Héloïse Godet, Zoé Bruneau, Kamel Abdeli, Richard Chevallier, Alexandre Païta, Christian Gregori, Marie Ruchat', 'NR', '"The idea is simple / A married woman and a single man meet / They love, they argue, fists fly / A dog strays between town and country / The seasons pass / The man and woman meet again / The dog finds itself between them / The other is in one, / the one is in the other / and they are three / The former husband shatters everything / A second film begins: / the same as the first, / and yet not / From the human race we pass to metaphor / This ends in barking / and a baby''s cries / In the meantime, we will have seen people talking of the demise of the dollar, of truth in mathematics and of the death of a robin." -JLG', '"The idea is simple / A married woman and a single man meet / They love, they argue, fists fly / A dog strays between town and country / The seasons pass / The man and woman meet again / The dog finds itself between them / The other is in one, / the one is in the other / and they are three / The former husband shatters everything / A second film begins: / the same as the first, / and yet not / From the human race we pass to metaphor / This ends in barking / and a baby''s cries / In the meantime, we will have seen people talking of the demise of the dollar, of truth in mathematics and of the death of a robin." -JLG', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ0qBocOIz5VgoEPQDptOXRwWEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114982'),
  ('193740713854435732', 'Goodbye to Our Kindergarten', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Nobuo Mizuta', 'Yuji Sakamoto', 'Mana Ashida, Hikari Mitsushima, Ruiki Sato, Ryoka Ihara, Hiroyuki Kuroda, Miyu Honda, Tomoya Hashimoto, Megumi Yokoyama', null, 'One day, five kindergarten children suddenly disappear from a kindergarten in Tokyo, sending their teachers and parents into a panic. The five of them are connecting on trains and headed to an unfamiliar place for some purpose.', 'One day, five kindergarten children suddenly disappear from a kindergarten in Tokyo, sending their teachers and parents into a panic. The five of them are connecting on trains and headed to an unfamiliar place for some purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sn34K68YrZqAbMOIDpNqMr8cFnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265597'),
