  ('107934221368561595', 'Goodbye World', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Denis Hennelly, Jeff Bollman', 'Sarah Adina Smith, Denis Hennelly', 'Caroline Dhavernas, Adrian Grenier, Ben McKenzie, Gaby Hoffmann, Mark Webber, Kerry Bishé, Kid Cudi, Mckenna Grace', null, 'When a mysterious cyber-attack cripples civilization, a group of old college friends and lovers retreat to a remote country cabin, where they must cope with an uncertain future while navigating the minefield of their shared past.', 'When a mysterious cyber-attack cripples civilization, a group of old college friends and lovers retreat to a remote country cabin, where they must cope with an uncertain future while navigating the minefield of their shared past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WEzts5eapNbxglUSNUXUrs98CR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201066'),
  ('379017486481642638', 'Goodbye, 20th Century', 1998, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Aleksandar Popovski, Darko Mitrevski, Vladimir Samoilovski', 'Aleksandar Popovski, Petra Hačkova', 'Lazar Ristovski, Nikola Ristanovski, Vlado Jovanovski, Dejan Aćimović, Petar Temelkovski, Sofija Kunovska, Toni Mihajlovski, Zvezda Angelovska', null, 'In the year 2019, after global destruction and descent into savagery, the immortal Kuzman tried to discover his destiny in order to learn how to die. As he enters the whirling circles of time, we discover the blasphemy of our century, and how it is to close its circle.', 'In the year 2019, after global destruction and descent into savagery, the immortal Kuzman tried to discover his destiny in order to learn how to die. As he enters the whirling circles of time, we discover the blasphemy of our century, and how it is to close its circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjnrA4qUsngxk3sXrMDVblRuJ9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90762'),
  ('294995741763663965', 'Goodbye, Boys!', 1966, 'Drama', 'Mikhail Kalik, Levan Paatashvili, Viktor Zorin', 'Mikhail Kalik', 'Evgeniy Steblov, Nikolay Dostal, Mikhail Kononov, Nataliya Bogunova, Viktoriya Fyodorova, Angelina Stepanova, Yevgeniya Melnikova, Elza Lezhdey', null, 'Goodbye, Boys! is the coming-of-age tale of three teenagers graduating from a Communist school during World War II. It''s summer, and their main goals are swimming in the Black Sea and wooing the girl all three of them love. However, they are asked to become officers in the military, and slowly their worlds begin changing forever. Their parents oppose them, they begin fearing losing each other and their families, and the military tricks and maneuvers them into joining the army instead of the navy.', 'Goodbye, Boys! is the coming-of-age tale of three teenagers graduating from a Communist school during World War II. It''s summer, and their main goals are swimming in the Black Sea and wooing the girl all three of them love. However, they are asked to become officers in the military, and slowly their worlds begin changing forever. Their parents oppose them, they begin fearing losing each other and their families, and the military tricks and maneuvers them into joining the army instead of the navy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deSoPIQkyRzjmEAdstpKPnvob18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146432'),
  ('89146684390899256', 'Goodbye, Columbus', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Larry Peerce, Stephen J. Barnett, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Arnold Schulman', 'Richard Benjamin, Ali MacGraw, Jack Klugman, Nan Martin, Michael Meyers, Lori Shelle, Monroe Arnold, Kay Cummings', 'PG', 'A Jewish man and a Jewish woman meet, and while attracted to each other, find that their worlds are very different. She is the archetypal Jewish American Princess — very emotionally involved with her parents'' world and the world they have created for her, while he is much less dependent on his family. They begin an affair which brings more differences to the surface.', 'A Jewish man and a Jewish woman meet, and while attracted to each other, find that their worlds are very different. She is the archetypal Jewish American Princess — very emotionally involved with her parents'' world and the world they have created for her, while he is much less dependent on his family. They begin an affair which brings more differences to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEfA6HiXipVZdHvxiagV6MxuDNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42604'),
  ('758404563944412164', 'Goodbye, Don Glees!', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama', 'Taku Kimura, Takahiro Yoshimatsu, Kunihiko Hamada', 'Atsuko Ishizuka', 'Natsuki Hanae, Yuki Kaji, Ayumu Murase, Kana Hanazawa, Rino Sashihara, Atsushi Tamura', 'PG', 'Teen misfits Roma, Toto, and Drop call themselves the “Don Glees,” an informal name for their backyard adventures. One day, when the trio gets blamed for a nearby forest fire, they set off into the woods to prove their innocence. As disaster strikes their expedition, tensions flare between the friends as they realize that growing up has taken them on wildly different paths in life.', 'Teen misfits Roma, Toto, and Drop call themselves the “Don Glees,” an informal name for their backyard adventures. One day, when the trio gets blamed for a nearby forest fire, they set off into the woods to prove their innocence. As disaster strikes their expedition, tensions flare between the friends as they realize that growing up has taken them on wildly different paths in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42bRH1aEUge6Iia7yS18XV3Wpjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846993'),
  ('592014898959073599', 'Goodbye, Dragon Inn', 2003, 'Drama', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Liao Pen-jung, Vincent Wang', 'Tsai Ming-liang', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Chen Shiang-Chyi, Kiyonobu Mitamura, Miao Tian, Shih Chun, Chen Chao-jung, Yang Kuei-mei', null, 'On a dark, wet night in Taipei City, a cavernous old picture palace is about to close its doors forever. A meager audience, the remaining few staff, and perhaps even a ghost or two, watch King Hu’s wuxia classic "Dragon Inn", each haunted by memories and desires evoked by cinema itself.', 'On a dark, wet night in Taipei City, a cavernous old picture palace is about to close its doors forever. A meager audience, the remaining few staff, and perhaps even a ghost or two, watch King Hu’s wuxia classic "Dragon Inn", each haunted by memories and desires evoked by cinema itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/js1uTY2FuKspVRQWLudFkEteFI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56616'),
  ('520960103060627781', 'Goodbye, Father', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luís Filipe Rocha, João Abel Aboim', 'Luís Filipe Rocha', 'Afonso Pimentel, João Lagarto, Laura Soveral, Natália Luiza, Lourdes Norberto, José Fanha, Adriana Aboim, João Aboim', null, 'For a 13-year-old boy like Filipe, the prospect of a summer vacation in the Azores with his father is like a dream come true. But dreams are sometimes just a way to avoid facing reality.', 'For a 13-year-old boy like Filipe, the prospect of a summer vacation in the Azores with his father is like a dream come true. But dreams are sometimes just a way to avoid facing reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIoaCMjOLKW1sCZWLX6NJRzJqgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53294'),
  ('168831482301679227', 'Goodbye, Miss Turlock', 1948, 'Family', 'Edward L. Cahn, Charles Salerno Jr.', 'John Nesbitt', 'John Nesbitt, Nana Bryant, Norman Ollestad, Fred Fisher', 'NR', 'Narrator John Nesbitt laments the disappearance of the rural one-room schoolhouse in America. He reminisces about his own days as a student in such a school and how his teacher, Miss Turlock, influenced so many students. Many of them reunite at the school on Miss Turlock''s last day, when the school was closed in 1940.', 'Narrator John Nesbitt laments the disappearance of the rural one-room schoolhouse in America. He reminisces about his own days as a student in such a school and how his teacher, Miss Turlock, influenced so many students. Many of them reunite at the school on Miss Turlock''s last day, when the school was closed in 1940.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg2HeA4R4zv8vx4itPYbZZMgOhx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240429'),
  ('471835539499872318', 'Goodbye, Mr. Chips', 1939, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sam Wood, Freddie Young, E.M. Smedley-Aston', 'R.C. Sherriff, Claudine West, Eric Maschwitz', 'Robert Donat, Greer Garson, Terry Kilburn, John Mills, Paul Henreid, Judith Furse, Lyn Harding, Milton Rosmer', 'NR', 'Over several decades throughout the late 19th-century and early 20th-century, Mr Arthur Chipping rises from a shy, nervous teacher to the beloved, revered headmaster of Brookfield School, with his life and career shaped by his love for his wife and his unwavering dedication to his students.', 'Over several decades throughout the late 19th-century and early 20th-century, Mr Arthur Chipping rises from a shy, nervous teacher to the beloved, revered headmaster of Brookfield School, with his life and career shaped by his love for his wife and his unwavering dedication to his students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1M8yXsSglaW3CdUSX7uAxurwLtp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42852'),
  ('506467402606178620', 'Goodbye, Mr. Chips', 1969, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, Dickie Bamber, Dominic Fulford', 'Terence Rattigan', 'Peter O''Toole, Petula Clark, Michael Redgrave, George Baker, Siân Phillips, Michael Bryant, Jack Hedley, Alison Leggatt', 'G', 'Academy Award-honoree Peter O''Toole stars in this musical classic about a prim English schoolmaster who learns to show his compassion through the help of an outgoing showgirl. O''Toole, who received his fourth Oscar-nomination for this performance, is joined by ''60s pop star Petula Clark and fellow Oscar-nominee Michael Redgrave.', 'Academy Award-honoree Peter O''Toole stars in this musical classic about a prim English schoolmaster who learns to show his compassion through the help of an outgoing showgirl. O''Toole, who received his fourth Oscar-nomination for this performance, is joined by ''60s pop star Petula Clark and fellow Oscar-nominee Michael Redgrave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFCn4Tq9L8cASfkwRqSLwsy9JNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42607'),
  ('1130190151696732583', 'Goodbye, My Fancy', 1951, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vincent Sherman, Ted D. McCord, Ray Heindorf', 'Ben Roberts, Ivan Goff', 'Joan Crawford, Robert Young, Eve Arden, Lurene Tuttle, Frank Lovejoy, Janice Rule, Howard St. John, Ellen Corby', 'NR', 'Agatha has fond memories of her romance with college president Dr. James Merrill, when she was a student and he was her professor, and wants to see if there is still a spark between them.', 'Agatha has fond memories of her romance with college president Dr. James Merrill, when she was a student and he was her professor, and wants to see if there is still a spark between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8qgZySMXeCJh4MweCATohuXYvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115111'),
  ('670578512508619887', 'Goodbye, My Friend', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cécilia Rouaud, Constance Demontoy, Mathilde Cavillan', 'Laurent Tirard', 'Hakim Jemili, Constance Labbé, Nora Hamzawi, Alice David, Gustave Kervern, Thibault de Montalembert, Fanny Sidney, Maxime Bregowy', null, 'At 35, Étienne still hasn''t forgiven his ''friend'' Jean-Pat, who made his life miserable throughout his childhood. When he learns of Jean-Pat''s death, Étienne isn''t exactly devastated... Yet, despite himself, he finds himself organising the funeral of his worst enemy. One thing is certain: Jean-Pat isn''t done ruining his life yet.', 'At 35, Étienne still hasn''t forgiven his ''friend'' Jean-Pat, who made his life miserable throughout his childhood. When he learns of Jean-Pat''s death, Étienne isn''t exactly devastated... Yet, despite himself, he finds himself organising the funeral of his worst enemy. One thing is certain: Jean-Pat isn''t done ruining his life yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhk9QdjYWqLICx5pcvgeCp7oU87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266813'),
  ('220486803738419146', 'Goodbye, Someday', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'John H. Lee', 'John H. Lee, Lee Man-hee', 'Miho Nakayama, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Yuriko Ishida, Takehiro Hira, Magi, Takahiro Nishijima, Masayo Umezawa', null, 'Higashigaito Yutaka is transferred to the Bangkok branch of Eastern Airlines. In three months, he will marry Michiko, a relative of the airline''s founder, and though he doesn''t love her, he knows he could be CEO one day if they wed. In Thailand, Yutaka meets Touko at a bar and is instantly drawn to her. His relationship with her only intensifies as the wedding date approaches. Eventually, he decides to break up with her and calls Michiko in front of her. Touko is disappointed, and the next day she leaves for New York. Yutaka and Michiko reunite in Thailand and proceed with their wedding. Twenty-five years later, Yutaka and Michiko are married with two sons. But Yutaka still harbors memories of Touko in his heart. Yutaka visits Bangkok on business and goes to the Oriental Hotel where he had stayed with Touko-and finds she is now in charge of VIP guests there. They realize their love for each other remains, but reality pulls them apart once again.', 'Higashigaito Yutaka is transferred to the Bangkok branch of Eastern Airlines. In three months, he will marry Michiko, a relative of the airline''s founder, and though he doesn''t love her, he knows he could be CEO one day if they wed. In Thailand, Yutaka meets Touko at a bar and is instantly drawn to her. His relationship with her only intensifies as the wedding date approaches. Eventually, he decides to break up with her and calls Michiko in front of her. Touko is disappointed, and the next day she leaves for New York. Yutaka and Michiko reunite in Thailand and proceed with their wedding. Twenty-five years later, Yutaka and Michiko are married with two sons. But Yutaka still harbors memories of Touko in his heart. Yutaka visits Bangkok on business and goes to the Oriental Hotel where he had stayed with Touko-and finds she is now in charge of VIP guests there. They realize their love for each other remains, but reality pulls them apart once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93HO0YdR5Gf7LH6uWJSIkIf5Q3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51297'),
  ('425322147757409335', 'Goodbye, Trainmen', 1992, 'Drama', 'Kari Paljakka, Timo Heinänen, Pauli Pentti', 'Juha Lehtovuori', 'Santeri Kinnunen, Samuli Edelmann, Liisa Mustonen, Joona Lindberg, Toni Limnell, Kalle Chydenius, Jussi Chydenius, Niko Saarela', null, 'Small-town boys Vähy and Hapa are best friends who swear an eternal blood oath. As they grow up, however, their paths drift apart and they both find themselves searching for their place in the world.', 'Small-town boys Vähy and Hapa are best friends who swear an eternal blood oath. As they grow up, however, their paths drift apart and they both find themselves searching for their place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1plgUtYD66SNiLiT94g1kS9yHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102249'),
  ('156479422586414879', 'GoodFellas', 1990, 'Drama, Crime', 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Ballhaus, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Nicholas Pileggi, Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Ray Liotta, Joe Pesci, Lorraine Bracco, Paul Sorvino, Frank Sivero, Tony Darrow, Mike Starr', 'R', 'The true story of Henry Hill, a half-Irish, half-Sicilian Brooklyn kid who is adopted by neighbourhood gangsters at an early age and climbs the ranks of a Mafia family under the guidance of Jimmy Conway.', 'The true story of Henry Hill, a half-Irish, half-Sicilian Brooklyn kid who is adopted by neighbourhood gangsters at an early age and climbs the ranks of a Mafia family under the guidance of Jimmy Conway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OkCLM73MIU2CrKZbqiT8Ln1wY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769'),
  ('645733482666617582', 'Goodnight Mommy', 2015, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Severin Fiala, Veronika Franz, Martin Gschlacht', 'Veronika Franz, Severin Fiala', 'Elias Schwarz, Lukas Schwarz, Susanne Wuest, Hans Escher, Elfriede Schatz, Karl Purker, Georg Deliovsky, Christian Steindl', 'R', 'In the heat of the summer lays a lonesome house in the countryside where nine year old twin brothers await their mother’s return. When she comes home, bandaged after cosmetic surgery, nothing is like before and the children start to doubt whether this woman is actually who she says she is.', 'In the heat of the summer lays a lonesome house in the countryside where nine year old twin brothers await their mother’s return. When she comes home, bandaged after cosmetic surgery, nothing is like before and the children start to doubt whether this woman is actually who she says she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3G2gF7M9dmH4Vcs54PUjieOi0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284303'),
  ('16297055584911138', 'Goodnight Mommy', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Matt Sobel, Alexander Dynan', 'Kyle Warren, Severin Fiala, Veronika Franz', 'Naomi Watts, Cameron Crovetti, Nicholas Crovetti, Peter Hermann, Jeremy Bobb, Crystal Lucas-Perry', 'R', 'When twin brothers arrive home to find their mother’s demeanor altered and face covered in surgical bandages, they begin to suspect the woman beneath the gauze might not be their mother.', 'When twin brothers arrive home to find their mother’s demeanor altered and face covered in surgical bandages, they begin to suspect the woman beneath the gauze might not be their mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHhD5jD4S5ElPNNFCDKXJAzMZ5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814800'),
  ('320421663832667662', 'Goodnight, Ladies and Gentlemen', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Claudio Ragona, Luigi Comencini, Nanni Loy', 'Agenore Incrocci, Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi', 'Senta Berger, Adolfo Celi, Vittorio Gassman, Nino Manfredi, Marcello Mastroianni, Ugo Tognazzi, Paolo Villaggio, Felice Andreasi', null, 'An episodic satire of the political and social status of Italy in the seventies, through the shows of one day of a television channel.', 'An episodic satire of the political and social status of Italy in the seventies, through the shows of one day of a television channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LMtB7ogDvx2ywRbzjZARLHQ6V1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82114'),
  ('910187432932475149', 'Goodnight, Mister Tom', 1998, 'Drama, History, War, TV Movie', 'Jack Gold, Chris O''Dell', null, 'John Thaw, Nick Robinson, Annabelle Apsion, Thomas Orange, William Armstrong, Geoffrey Beevers, Mossie Smith, Peter England', null, 'A shy and quiet World War II evacuee is housed by a disgruntled old man, and they soon develop a close bond.', 'A shy and quiet World War II evacuee is housed by a disgruntled old man, and they soon develop a close bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxlqWxL5dgZuSS2XicVt1WNRq8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20546'),
  ('272933031057812219', 'Goodrich', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hallie Meyers-Shyer, Jamie D. Ramsay', 'Hallie Meyers-Shyer', 'Michael Keaton, Mila Kunis, Carmen Ejogo, Michael Urie, Kevin Pollak, Vivien Lyra Blair, Nico Hiraga, Jacob Kopera', 'R', 'Andy Goodrich''s life is upended when his wife enters a rehab program, leaving him on his own with their young kids. Goodrich leans on his daughter from his first marriage, Grace, as he ultimately evolves into the father Grace never had.', 'Andy Goodrich''s life is upended when his wife enters a rehab program, leaving him on his own with their young kids. Goodrich leans on his daughter from his first marriage, Grace, as he ultimately evolves into the father Grace never had.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/silxnsoelZ0qXp4Bm2spBY949iP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088096'),
  ('1097854958123936168', 'Goof Troop Christmas', 1992, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Mircea Mantta, Bob Zamboni, Charles August Nichols', 'Jymn Magon', 'Nancy Cartwright, Jim Cummings, Bill Farmer, Dana Hill, Rob Paulsen, Frank Welker, April Winchell', null, 'Big-hearted Goofy tries to go all out to give Max a great Christmas but as usual catastrophe follows Goofy''s intentions. Excellent Christmas message of Family, Friends and Love conveyed.', 'Big-hearted Goofy tries to go all out to give Max a great Christmas but as usual catastrophe follows Goofy''s intentions. Excellent Christmas message of Family, Friends and Love conveyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bj1AK4JLOjOveMZe6KcIyIYx7m9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26988'),
  ('952025406766573404', 'Goofy and Wilbur', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Huemer', 'Otto Englander', 'Danny Webb, Olcott Vail', 'NR', 'Goofy goes fishing with his best friend, Wilbur, a grasshopper.', 'Goofy goes fishing with his best friend, Wilbur, a grasshopper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8enK1J4tNFeO2YLZq99LmjTYe3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66866'),
  ('1033852876380428300', 'Goofy Groceries', 1941, 'Animation', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Elvia Allman, Bea Benaderet, Mel Blanc, Kent Rogers', 'NR', 'Grocery store products come to life, along with caricatures of Jack Benny, Rochester and Ned Sparks, and take-offs on Superman and King Kong.', 'Grocery store products come to life, along with caricatures of Jack Benny, Rochester and Ned Sparks, and take-offs on Superman and King Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJwk1Iur5wsHfxHOU5hqX9WcBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123756'),
  ('1152629660137105172', 'Goofy Gymnastics', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, John McLeish', 'NR', 'Inspired by a magazine ad, Goofy sends for a mail order body building course. First is weight lifting; after Goofy finally gets the weights up, a fly lands and sends him crashing through several floors in the apartment building. Chinups: the bar itself goes up and down. Then a rubber-band stretch device, which Goofy quickly tangles up in, sending him crashing through the building and several other pieces of equipment.', 'Inspired by a magazine ad, Goofy sends for a mail order body building course. First is weight lifting; after Goofy finally gets the weights up, a fly lands and sends him crashing through several floors in the apartment building. Chinups: the bar itself goes up and down. Then a rubber-band stretch device, which Goofy quickly tangles up in, sending him crashing through the building and several other pieces of equipment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p22koUwPj9fhGSAYiCig3MZN0xs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66867'),
  ('707352620924765453', 'Goofy''s Glider', 1940, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'George Johnson, John McLeish, Florence Gill', 'NR', 'Yet another sport is made ''easy'' for us by Goofy''s demonstration how- never, ever, to try anything for real, least of all with a glider-flying machine he launches in ways that would kill anything but a cartoon character, such as a giant catapult and even a canon. Meanwhile Goofy proves totally incapable to control any of its movements in the air, let alone the ''landing'' which is too messy even for a bombshell.', 'Yet another sport is made ''easy'' for us by Goofy''s demonstration how- never, ever, to try anything for real, least of all with a glider-flying machine he launches in ways that would kill anything but a cartoon character, such as a giant catapult and even a canon. Meanwhile Goofy proves totally incapable to control any of its movements in the air, let alone the ''landing'' which is too messy even for a bombshell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTy7O1odFFukimYHHUomX5LOK9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66868'),
  ('310061116783749967', 'Goon', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Dowse, Bobby Shore, Dana Warren', 'Evan Goldberg, Jay Baruchel', 'Seann William Scott, Marc-André Grondin, Alison Pill, Jay Baruchel, Liev Schreiber, Eugene Levy, Kim Coates, Nicholas Campbell', 'R', 'Doug Glatt, a slacker who discovers he has a talent for brawling, is approached by a minor league hockey coach and invited to join the team as the "muscle." Despite the fact that Glatt can''t skate, his best friend, Pat, convinces him to give it a shot, and Glatt becomes a hero to the team and their fans, until the league''s reigning goon becomes threatened by Glatt''s success and decides to even the score.', 'Doug Glatt, a slacker who discovers he has a talent for brawling, is approached by a minor league hockey coach and invited to join the team as the "muscle." Despite the fact that Glatt can''t skate, his best friend, Pat, convinces him to give it a shot, and Glatt becomes a hero to the team and their fans, until the league''s reigning goon becomes threatened by Glatt''s success and decides to even the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLmZCfJici1SdT6zmhDtGVWsXXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74387'),
  ('19212351721237690', 'Goon: Last of the Enforcers', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jay Baruchel, Paul Sarossy', 'Jesse Chabot, Jay Baruchel', 'Seann William Scott, Alison Pill, Marc-André Grondin, Wyatt Russell, Callum Keith Rennie, Liev Schreiber, Kim Coates, Richard Clarkin', 'R', 'During a pro lockout, Doug "The Thug" Glatt is injured and must choose whether to defend his team against a dangerous new enemy, or be there for his wife as she prepares to give birth to his daughter.', 'During a pro lockout, Doug "The Thug" Glatt is injured and must choose whether to defend his team against a dangerous new enemy, or be there for his wife as she prepares to give birth to his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVpqXYZ3X1YYnVQ7aj8jEm88vHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336890'),
  ('221278385121620505', 'Goonland', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Jack Mercer', null, 'Popeye sails to Goon Island in search of his Pappy. He finds the place populated by the imposing, but ugly, goons, and a "no humans" sign. His imprisoned pappy at first ignores him, but when Popeye is caught by the goons and carried off, his can of spinach lands near Pappy and it works just as well on him as it does on Popeye.', 'Popeye sails to Goon Island in search of his Pappy. He finds the place populated by the imposing, but ugly, goons, and a "no humans" sign. His imprisoned pappy at first ignores him, but when Popeye is caught by the goons and carried off, his can of spinach lands near Pappy and it works just as well on him as it does on Popeye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajw7qQw7O3rFNXRAVcxRBzcO0KA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146634'),
  ('315229760881026319', 'Goopy Geer', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Johnny Murray', null, 'Goopy, a dog of no particular personality, but a crackerjack piano player, plays several songs on the stage of a nightclub. We spend a fair amount of time watching the patrons and staff of the nightclub.', 'Goopy, a dog of no particular personality, but a crackerjack piano player, plays several songs on the stage of a nightclub. We spend a fair amount of time watching the patrons and staff of the nightclub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOJ9MEnvgKwETnFjeB9QtGvrxUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161586'),
  ('124632030737040366', 'Goopy Gyne Bagha Byne', 1969, 'Comedy, Music, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Tapan Chatterjee, Rabi Ghosh, Santosh Dutta, Harindranath Chattopadhyay, Ajoy Bandyopadhyay, Iva Banerjee, Ratan Banerjee, Durgadas Bandyopadhyay', null, 'Goopy Gyne and Bagha Byne are banished from their respective villages for being bad musicians. However, with their skills, they succeed in pleasing the king of ghosts who grants them three boons. How will they succeed in preventing the war between Halla and Shundi which is looming large?', 'Goopy Gyne and Bagha Byne are banished from their respective villages for being bad musicians. However, with their skills, they succeed in pleasing the king of ghosts who grants them three boons. How will they succeed in preventing the war between Halla and Shundi which is looming large?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0egWQPJH4MlrZJUa3rDpzuKZkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135092'),
  ('743369481618150520', 'Goosebumps', 2015, 'Adventure, Horror, Comedy', 'Rob Letterman, G.A. Aguilar, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Darren Lemke', 'Jack Black, Dylan Minnette, Odeya Rush, Amy Ryan, Ryan Lee, Jillian Bell, Halston Sage, Ken Marino', 'PG', 'After moving to a small town, Zach Cooper finds a silver lining when he meets next door neighbor Hannah, the daughter of bestselling Goosebumps series author R.L. Stine. When Zach unintentionally unleashes real monsters from their manuscripts and they begin to terrorize the town, it’s suddenly up to Stine, Zach and Hannah to get all of them back in the books where they belong.', 'After moving to a small town, Zach Cooper finds a silver lining when he meets next door neighbor Hannah, the daughter of bestselling Goosebumps series author R.L. Stine. When Zach unintentionally unleashes real monsters from their manuscripts and they begin to terrorize the town, it’s suddenly up to Stine, Zach and Hannah to get all of them back in the books where they belong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeZT9pqEgrmXOGdESFkAuVjX6kw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257445'),
  ('703305474152766241', 'Goosebumps 2: Haunted Halloween', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Family', 'Joe Camp III, Kevin Lum, Sean Ryan Jennings', 'Rob Lieber', 'Madison Iseman, Jeremy Ray Taylor, Caleel Harris, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Ken Jeong, Chris Parnell, Bryce Cass, Peyton Wich', 'PG', 'Be careful what you wish for. With their after school junk business, best friends Sonny and Sam hope to find treasure in other people’s trash. But when cleaning out the old Stine house, they open a locked book that frees a supernatural nightmare – Slappy! Now, with the help of Sonny’s sister Sarah, they’re in a race against time to get the sinister dummy and all the creatures he’s brought to life back into the pages before he unleashes total pandemonium!', 'Be careful what you wish for. With their after school junk business, best friends Sonny and Sam hope to find treasure in other people’s trash. But when cleaning out the old Stine house, they open a locked book that frees a supernatural nightmare – Slappy! Now, with the help of Sonny’s sister Sarah, they’re in a race against time to get the sinister dummy and all the creatures he’s brought to life back into the pages before he unleashes total pandemonium!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2wy38iiMpB8WsgJi3lYeDnGh2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442062'),
  ('255674287163010318', 'Goosebumps: Stay Out of the Basement', 1996, 'Horror, Fantasy, Family', 'William Fruet', 'Sean Kelly, R.L. Stine', 'Beki Lantos, Blake McGrath, Lucy Peacock, Judah Katz, Hrant Alianak', null, 'When her mother leaves town to visit a sick relative, Margaret''s concern for her father grows. She does not know what he is working on in the basement and cannot figure out why his behavior has changed.', 'When her mother leaves town to visit a sick relative, Margaret''s concern for her father grows. She does not know what he is working on in the basement and cannot figure out why his behavior has changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBeqn8pbLVptKi4G5YtIKPjBLcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427747'),
  ('476798874865872662', 'Gopher Broke', 1958, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'The Goofy Gophers are about to harvest the vegetables on the farm when the farmhands beat them to the punch. Worried that their food source is being "vandalized," they follow the truck to the barn so they can recover what they consider to be their food.', 'The Goofy Gophers are about to harvest the vegetables on the farm when the farmhands beat them to the punch. Worried that their food source is being "vandalized," they follow the truck to the barn so they can recover what they consider to be their food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avSi6TXsPENZtvzgU0qiViL3L0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234978'),
  ('526094710969640201', 'Gopher Broke', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jeff Fowler', 'Jeff Fowler', 'Greg Berg', 'G', 'A gopher finds himself on a road where trucks are hauling produce to market. He hits on the idea of shaking some of the produce loose for himself, but other animals always beat him to the booty. That is, until a truck comes along with a cow...', 'A gopher finds himself on a road where trucks are hauling produce to market. He hits on the idea of shaking some of the produce loose for himself, but other animals always beat him to the booty. That is, until a truck comes along with a cow...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nckYGHuwUYsyRivyaZCYRRXwqDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25223'),
  ('1115713799686227697', 'Gor', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Fritz Kiersch, Hans Kühle Jr.', 'Rick Marx, Harry Alan Towers', 'Urbano Barberini, Rebecca Ferratti, Jack Palance, Paul L. Smith, Oliver Reed, Larry Taylor, Graham Clarke, Janine Denison', 'PG', 'American professor Tarl Cabot is transported via a magical ring to planet Gor, where he must help an oppressed country overthrow its evil king and his barbarian henchmen.', 'American professor Tarl Cabot is transported via a magical ring to planet Gor, where he must help an oppressed country overthrow its evil king and his barbarian henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aENzdgQX4xkxOwUQMSWY9JiMoNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86337'),
  ('514990959279471797', 'Gorath', 1962, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Hajime Koizumi, Ishirō Honda, Eiji Tsuburaya', 'Takeshi Kimura', 'Ryō Ikebe, Yumi Shirakawa, Akira Kubo, Kumi Mizuno, Hiroshi Tachikawa, Akihiko Hirata, Kenji Sahara, Jun Tazaki', null, 'In 1976, a drifting star named Gorath is discovered to be on a collision course with Earth. Although it is smaller than Earth, its enormous mass is enough to destroy the planet totally. A mission sent to observe Gorath is destroyed after the ship is drawn into the star, with a later mission barely escaping the same fate. However, Astronaut Tatsuma Kanai is left in a catatonic state due to his near death experience. Unable to destroy the invading star, Earth''s scientists undertake a desperate plan to build giant rockets at the South Pole to move the planet out of Gorath''s path before it is too late.', 'In 1976, a drifting star named Gorath is discovered to be on a collision course with Earth. Although it is smaller than Earth, its enormous mass is enough to destroy the planet totally. A mission sent to observe Gorath is destroyed after the ship is drawn into the star, with a later mission barely escaping the same fate. However, Astronaut Tatsuma Kanai is left in a catatonic state due to his near death experience. Unable to destroy the invading star, Earth''s scientists undertake a desperate plan to build giant rockets at the South Pole to move the planet out of Gorath''s path before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/390PCxjm9GSuMUZ0nIMMCMFJgbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49163'),
  ('928210780950594159', 'Gorbaciof', 2010, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Stefano Incerti, Pasquale Mari, Lorenzo Molossi', 'Diego De Silva, Stefano Incerti', 'Toni Servillo, Yang Mi, Nello Mascia, Geppy Gleijeses, Salvatore Ruocco, Hal Yamanouchi, Gaetano Bruno, Antonio Buonomo', null, 'Marino Pacileo has a soft spot for gambling. When he discovers that Lila''s father, the young Chinese girl that he is in love with cannot pay a debt, the gambler steals money from the jail he is in to help the love of his life.', 'Marino Pacileo has a soft spot for gambling. When he discovers that Lila''s father, the young Chinese girl that he is in love with cannot pay a debt, the gambler steals money from the jail he is in to help the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZkT8oNsRdfxQfiSDszGoM1VddW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56040'),
  ('280245857558420039', 'Gordy', 1995, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Richard Michalak, Jerram A. Swartz, Robin A. Warren', 'Jay Sommers, Leslie Stevens, Dick Chevillat', 'Doug Stone, Kristy Young, James Donadio, Deborah Hobart, Tom Lester, Michael Roescher, Tom Key, Jon Kohler', 'G', 'A talking pig named Gordy becomes involved in a quest to save his family from the slaughterhouse.', 'A talking pig named Gordy becomes involved in a quest to save his family from the slaughterhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sLmghaiAIYXh320qCvZWY4avVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47867'),
  ('398369248452367768', 'Görevimiz Tatil', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Şeker, Ali Tanrıverdi', 'Demet Akbağ, Zafer Algöz, Deniz Altan, Ali Keçeli, Hakan Bilgin, Özlem Türkad, Enis Arıkan, Sinan Çalışkanoğlu', null, 'Sıtkı, the head of the four-member Mutlu family, is a man known for his stinginess. His wife Türkan is tired of her life and complains about her husband''s indifference to the family. The couple, who have not been on vacation for years, rent a caravan after their therapist''s persuasion. As the couple sets off toward Antalya, they encounter some mishaps along the way. Their car breaks down, forcing them to head to Yavaşlar Village. The urban couple, now guests of the villagers, realize there are things they can teach the villagers. This partnership will not only bridge the two cultures but also support a just cause.', 'Sıtkı, the head of the four-member Mutlu family, is a man known for his stinginess. His wife Türkan is tired of her life and complains about her husband''s indifference to the family. The couple, who have not been on vacation for years, rent a caravan after their therapist''s persuasion. As the couple sets off toward Antalya, they encounter some mishaps along the way. Their car breaks down, forcing them to head to Yavaşlar Village. The urban couple, now guests of the villagers, realize there are things they can teach the villagers. This partnership will not only bridge the two cultures but also support a just cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niKQ3ui24dGRt2PY46ro7cXmg2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507295'),
  ('518668449330397612', 'Gorgeous', 1999, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Cheung Man-Po', 'Jackie Chan, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Law Yiu-Fai', 'Shu Qi, Jackie Chan, Emil Chau, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Richie Jen, Bradley James Allan, Tats Lau Yee-Tat, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong', 'PG-13', 'When Ah Bu, a girl from a small fishing town in Taiwan, finds a glass bottle with a romantic message, she travels to Hong Kong to find her prince charming. As it turns out, her prince charming, Albert, happens to be gay. But all is not lost when Ah Bu meets the dashing Chi Wu. Meanwhile, Ah Bu''s boyfriend from Taiwan comes looking for her, as the action and romance follow Ah Bu back to Taiwan.', 'When Ah Bu, a girl from a small fishing town in Taiwan, finds a glass bottle with a romantic message, she travels to Hong Kong to find her prince charming. As it turns out, her prince charming, Albert, happens to be gay. But all is not lost when Ah Bu meets the dashing Chi Wu. Meanwhile, Ah Bu''s boyfriend from Taiwan comes looking for her, as the action and romance follow Ah Bu back to Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGPVTg7Gwsd5FMrjenW8RRcEdsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10951'),
  ('1091902349705929195', 'Gorgo', 1961, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Eugène Lourié, Freddie Young', 'Robert L. Richards, Daniel James', 'Bill Travers, William Sylvester, Vincent Winter, Christopher Rhodes, Joseph O''Conor, Bruce Seton, Martin Benson, Maurice Kaufmann', null, 'Greedy sailors capture a giant lizard off the coast of Ireland and sell it to a London circus. Then its mother shows up.', 'Greedy sailors capture a giant lizard off the coast of Ireland and sell it to a London circus. Then its mother shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC27POiM5HB08oDxVedPNkGAKUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40804'),
  ('714594740352662527', 'Gorgonà', 2026, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Evi Kalogiropoulou, Giorgos Valsamis', 'Evi Kalogiropoulou', 'Melissanthi Mahut, Aurora Marion, Christos Loulis', null, 'Greece. A small, impoverished city-state dominated by a massive refinery—its only source of income: oil. The men, all armed, hold absolute power. Their leader, Nikos, is gravely ill and must arrange his succession. Shock spreads when he includes his protégé, Maria, among the contenders. The fate of this young woman—unaware of the most tragic part of her family’s past—will be turned upside down by the arrival of Eleni, a singer at the town’s bar.', 'Greece. A small, impoverished city-state dominated by a massive refinery—its only source of income: oil. The men, all armed, hold absolute power. Their leader, Nikos, is gravely ill and must arrange his succession. Shock spreads when he includes his protégé, Maria, among the contenders. The fate of this young woman—unaware of the most tragic part of her family’s past—will be turned upside down by the arrival of Eleni, a singer at the town’s bar.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjfUEQa8ipwd1q0HIF2447987Z2O.jpg', 'plex:movie:gorgona-2026'),
  ('73963629111868758', 'Gori Tere Pyaar Mein', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Punit Malhotra, Jogi Malang, Rohit D''Souza', 'Punit Malhotra, Arshad Sayed', 'Kareena Kapoor Khan, Imran Khan, Anupam Kher, Nizhalgal Ravi, Kalyani Natarajan, Shraddha Kapoor, Esha Gupta, Vineet Kumar Singh', null, 'Sriram Venkat is the most shallow guy on earth who doesn''t value relationships, family, friends, life or the country. Not necessarily in that order. Because he couldn''t care less about the order. This makes him the clear ''black'' sheep of the family.', 'Sriram Venkat is the most shallow guy on earth who doesn''t value relationships, family, friends, life or the country. Not necessarily in that order. Because he couldn''t care less about the order. This makes him the clear ''black'' sheep of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icfBtvHEYI99OE8KYfLoEwMrm80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237305'),
  ('691456867758876360', 'Gorilla at Large', 1954, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Harmon Jones, Lloyd Ahern Sr.', 'Leonard Praskins, Barney Slater', 'Cameron Mitchell, Anne Bancroft, Lee J. Cobb, Raymond Burr, Charlotte Austin, Peter Whitney, Lee Marvin, Warren Stevens', 'NR', 'At a carnival called the Garden of Evil, a man is murdered, apparently by a gorilla...or someone in a gorilla suit.', 'At a carnival called the Garden of Evil, a man is murdered, apparently by a gorilla...or someone in a gorilla suit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifkjheVuzJ30imrCQ9kfofWX0vC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72313'),
  ('638751045186494482', 'Gorilla Gang', 1968, 'Crime', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb, Michael Erdmann', 'Alfred Vohrer, Horst Wendlandt', 'Horst Tappert, Uschi Glas, Uwe Friedrichsen, Hubert von Meyerinck, Herbert Fux, Inge Langen, Beate Hasenau, Albert Lieven', null, 'When another dead elderly gentleman is fished out of the Thames, Inspector David Perkins is convinced that the gorilla gang is active again. On a doll found with the body, characters of an African language are discovered. Together with Sergeant Pepper and language specialist Susan MacPherson, the search for the head of the gang begins.', 'When another dead elderly gentleman is fished out of the Thames, Inspector David Perkins is convinced that the gorilla gang is active again. On a doll found with the body, characters of an African language are discovered. Together with Sergeant Pepper and language specialist Susan MacPherson, the search for the head of the gang begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJcl1LzQzmN9J7RemrAFYYeiABt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70480'),
  ('205929832560887956', 'Gorilla My Dreams', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny is sailing the South Seas when a gorilla mother, desperate for a child, hijacks his barrel and presents Bugs to her husband. Bugs decides to play along, but quickly discovers his new "father" plays a bit rough.', 'Bugs Bunny is sailing the South Seas when a gorilla mother, desperate for a child, hijacks his barrel and presents Bugs to her husband. Bugs decides to play along, but quickly discovers his new "father" plays a bit rough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBRIwgpobks6v0X9ycy9mxbrlGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115024'),
  ('570782144330483480', 'Gorillas in the Mist', 1988, 'Drama, History', 'Michael Apted, John Seale, Tim Lewis', 'Anna Hamilton Phelan', 'Sigourney Weaver, Bryan Brown, Julie Harris, John Omirah Miluwi, Iain Cuthbertson, Konstantin Aleksandrov, Waigwa Wachira, Iain Glen', 'PG-13', 'The story of Dian Fossey, a scientist who came to Africa to study the vanishing mountain gorillas, and later fought to protect them.', 'The story of Dian Fossey, a scientist who came to Africa to study the vanishing mountain gorillas, and later fought to protect them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utptKpx6cXxmbEGu4N4HIoSZ6IS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10130'),
  ('575391840088245016', 'Gorillaz: Reject False Icons', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Denholm Hewlett, Denholm Hewlett', null, 'Damon Albarn, Jamie Hewlett, Phil Cornwell, Jehnny Beth, Little Simz, Snoop Dogg, Graham Coxon, Yasiin Bey', null, 'Focused on the life of the band and their collaborators over the 3 vital years in which they developed critically acclaimed albums, ''Humanz'' and ''The Now Now'', and undertook their most ambitious world tour to date.', 'Focused on the life of the band and their collaborators over the 3 vital years in which they developed critically acclaimed albums, ''Humanz'' and ''The Now Now'', and undertook their most ambitious world tour to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnw5su7OZM8mF7HrU2FAIu0ALEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649761'),
  ('105087608290718865', 'Gorky Park', 1983, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ralf D. Bode, Michael Apted, Anders Hedin', 'Dennis Potter', 'William Hurt, Lee Marvin, Brian Dennehy, Ian Bannen, Joanna Pacula, Michael Elphick, Richard Griffiths, Rikki Fulton', 'R', 'Police Inspector Renko tries to solve the case of three bodies found in Moscow''s Gorky Park but finds his attempts to solve the crime impeded by his superiors. Working on his own, Renko seeks out more information and stumbles across a conspiracy involving the highest levels of the government.', 'Police Inspector Renko tries to solve the case of three bodies found in Moscow''s Gorky Park but finds his attempts to solve the crime impeded by his superiors. Working on his own, Renko seeks out more information and stumbles across a conspiracy involving the highest levels of the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQFH7XlMk8pLPDzK5XVEj5McsRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8289'),
  ('993061450098148108', 'Gorky Resort', 2026, 'Drama, History, Thriller, War', 'Łukasz Palkowski, Piotr Sobociński Jr., Lukasz Palkowski', 'Agatha Dominik, Dżamila Ankiewicz, Robert Gliński', 'Jakub Gierszał, Aidan Gillen, Julia Pietrucha, Bogusław Linda, Wojciech Mecwaldowski', null, 'Confronted with a malevolent interrogator in a Soviet prisoner-of-war camp, a young Polish lieutenant fights for his life and the soul of his country.', 'Confronted with a malevolent interrogator in a Soviet prisoner-of-war camp, a young Polish lieutenant fights for his life and the soul of his country.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Foj1tjoaPugZ15gOu2B1xZGNCblv.jpg', 'plex:movie:gorky-resort'),
  ('127475788835032860', 'Gorp', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Joseph Ruben, David Schermerhorn, Chuck Russell', 'Jeffrey Konvitz', 'Michael Lembeck, Dennis Quaid, Philip Casnoff, Fran Drescher, David Huddleston, Rosanna Arquette, Dale Robinette, John Reilly', 'R', 'Pranksters cause trouble at a summer camp for rich kids.', 'Pranksters cause trouble at a summer camp for rich kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBUGuTdcxQtSugPXucClaIfYNy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31086'),
  ('470206388609119970', 'Gosford Park', 2001, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Altman, Andrew Dunn, Richard Styles', 'Julian Fellowes', 'Maggie Smith, Michael Gambon, Kristin Scott Thomas, Camilla Rutherford, Charles Dance, Geraldine Somerville, Tom Hollander, Natasha Wightman', 'R', 'In 1930s England, a group of pretentious rich and famous gather together for a weekend of relaxation at a hunting resort. But when a murder occurs, each one of these interesting characters becomes a suspect.', 'In 1930s England, a group of pretentious rich and famous gather together for a weekend of relaxation at a hunting resort. But when a murder occurs, each one of these interesting characters becomes a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7r8DeZuaaHCiOEbkqZC6MFmwJ69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5279'),
  ('4311669036657621', 'GoShogun: The Time Étranger', 1985, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Noriyoshi Matsuura, Yutaka Kawasuji', 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Kaneto Shiozawa, Daisuke Gori, Shojiro Kihara, Hideyuki Tanaka, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Mami Koyama, Fumio Matsuoka, Chiyoko Kawashima', null, 'Forty years after the events of the TV series, Remy Shimada, ex-pilot of the GoShogun, suffers a terrible accident while on her way to a meeting with her former robot-piloting comrades. While they rush to the hospital, Remy floats between life and death. She sees visions of her life when she was young, and stranger still, experiences a hallucination of being with her friends, all of them young again, in a mysterious city filled with hostile fanatics. Far from being the reunion Remy hoped for, a ghastly letter arrives for each member of the team that predicts their gruesome deaths. Slated to die in two days, both in reality and in her dream, Remy struggles to find a way out of the City of Fate, relying on the memories of her friends to see her through, even as they surround her death bed in the waking world.', 'Forty years after the events of the TV series, Remy Shimada, ex-pilot of the GoShogun, suffers a terrible accident while on her way to a meeting with her former robot-piloting comrades. While they rush to the hospital, Remy floats between life and death. She sees visions of her life when she was young, and stranger still, experiences a hallucination of being with her friends, all of them young again, in a mysterious city filled with hostile fanatics. Far from being the reunion Remy hoped for, a ghastly letter arrives for each member of the team that predicts their gruesome deaths. Slated to die in two days, both in reality and in her dream, Remy struggles to find a way out of the City of Fate, relying on the memories of her friends to see her through, even as they surround her death bed in the waking world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cl283GIzzoYHrdq2hnJb1CFCoJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117347'),
  ('1102892771746196778', 'Gosnell: The Trial of America''s Biggest Serial Killer', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Documentary', 'Nick Searcy', 'Andrew Klavan, Phelim McAleer, Ann McElhinney', 'Dean Cain, Nick Searcy, Earl Billings, Janine Turner, Grace Montie, Kent Jones, Michael Beach, Sarah Jane Morris', 'PG-13', 'The story of the investigation and trial of abortion provider Dr Kermit Gosnell.', 'The story of the investigation and trial of abortion provider Dr Kermit Gosnell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9QpdXTPwyFZX0T9UodiheGprTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537751'),
  ('1151003441154694001', 'Gospel According to Mary', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Paolo Zucca, Simone D''Arcangelo', 'Paolo Zucca, Amedeo Pagani, Barbara Alberti', 'Benedetta Porcaroli, Alessandro Gassmann, Lidia Vitale, Leonardo Capuano, Giulio Pranno, Maurizio Lombardi, Fortunato Cerlino, Andrea Pittorino', null, 'The story of Mary is reinvented, no longer a spectator but a courageous architect of her own existence.', 'The story of Mary is reinvented, no longer a spectator but a courageous architect of her own existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lG2hGNbyZPMjp7b1vyswK4Ez3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026499'),
  ('526514451163774446', 'Gospel Hill', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Giancarlo Esposito, David Tumblety', 'Jeffrey Pratt Gordon, Jeff Stacy, Terrell Tannen', 'Adam Baldwin, Angela Bassett, Tom Bower, Giancarlo Esposito, Danny Glover, Taylor Kitsch, Nia Long, RZA', null, 'Gospel Hill tells the intersecting story of two men in the fictional South Carolina town of Julia. Danny Glover plays John Malcolm, the son of a slain civil rights activist. Jack Herrod (Tom Bower) is the former sheriff who never got to the bottom of the murder. Their paths begin to cross when a development corporation comes to town with plans to raze Julia''s historic Gospel Hill.', 'Gospel Hill tells the intersecting story of two men in the fictional South Carolina town of Julia. Danny Glover plays John Malcolm, the son of a slain civil rights activist. Jack Herrod (Tom Bower) is the former sheriff who never got to the bottom of the murder. Their paths begin to cross when a development corporation comes to town with plans to raze Julia''s historic Gospel Hill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOt8cn4EFvwAxNRElJHFRnqC1WT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20933'),
  ('1140431267462731981', 'Gossip', 2000, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Davis Guggenheim, Andrzej Bartkowiak', 'Gregory Poirier', 'James Marsden, Lena Headey, Norman Reedus, Kate Hudson, Eric Bogosian, Edward James Olmos, Joshua Jackson, Sharon Lawrence', 'R', 'For a class project, three college students decide to invent an unfounded rumor about the most popular girl on campus. But as the rumor spreads, it begins to spiral out of control.', 'For a class project, three college students decide to invent an unfounded rumor about the most popular girl on campus. But as the rumor spreads, it begins to spiral out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fyQiQyBFlqjeqgT6sAEh5vo4Fe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18041'),
  ('1384706764797850', 'Gossip Over the Nile', 1971, 'Drama', 'Hussein Kamal, Mohamed Abdelaziz', 'Mamdouh El Leithy', 'Emad Hamdy, Adel Adham, Ahmed Ramzy, Mervat Amin, Magda El Khatib, Sohier Ramzy, Salah Nazmi, Ahmed Tawfiq', null, 'Set against the backdrop of the 1967 Six-Day War, the movie adaptation of Naguib Mahfouz''s novel follows the escapist, drug-fueled riverboat meetings of a group of frustrated Egyptians from various walks of life.', 'Set against the backdrop of the 1967 Six-Day War, the movie adaptation of Naguib Mahfouz''s novel follows the escapist, drug-fueled riverboat meetings of a group of frustrated Egyptians from various walks of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYujhYY2EDCvrQTxBmlsI5G37JA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253458'),
  ('911105169274531859', 'Gostanza da Libbiano', 2000, 'Drama, History, Horror', 'Paolo Benvenuti, Aldo Di Marcantonio', 'Paolo Benvenuti, Stefano Bacci, Mario Cereghino', 'Lucia Poli, Renzo Cerrato, Lele Biagi, Teresa Soldaini, Valentino Davanzati, Paolo Spaziani, Nadia Capocchini', null, 'The trial of a woman in San Miniato accused of witchcraft in 1594.', 'The trial of a woman in San Miniato accused of witchcraft in 1594.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qicjFS0HKxVosDIjLa8SsXNwF1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24175'),
  ('140203064260066695', 'Gosto se Discute', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Rhebling Junior, André Pellenz', 'André Pellenz', 'Cássio Gabus Mendes, Kéfera Buchmann, Gabriel Godoy, Paulo Miklos, Robson Nunes, Rodrigo Lopéz, Ronaldo Reis, Sílvia Lourenço', null, 'Augusto is the chef of a fine restaurant, established for years, which is down due to the success of a former pupil, Patrick, who works in a food truck right in the square in front of the establishment. . Due to the situation, the bank, which is also a partner in the restaurant, appoints the strict Cristina to be the new manager. She immediately runs into Augusto, as she wants to change the local routine in order to make it profitable. But, amidst the pressure to create a new menu, Augusto starts to have a rare syndrome that makes him lose his taste buds.', 'Augusto is the chef of a fine restaurant, established for years, which is down due to the success of a former pupil, Patrick, who works in a food truck right in the square in front of the establishment. . Due to the situation, the bank, which is also a partner in the restaurant, appoints the strict Cristina to be the new manager. She immediately runs into Augusto, as she wants to change the local routine in order to make it profitable. But, amidst the pressure to create a new menu, Augusto starts to have a rare syndrome that makes him lose his taste buds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7NEj5uPMd9r6cS5uAcKxd48Dhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482016'),
  ('134221487566430344', 'Gostosas, Lindas e Sexies', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Ernani Nunes, Marcelo Brasil', 'Vinícius Marques', 'Carolinie Figueiredo, Mariana Xavier, Cacau Protásio, Lyv Ziese, André Bankoff, Juliana Alves, Carlos Bonow, Paulo Silvino', null, 'In Rio de Janeiro there live four great and inseparable friends: Beatriz, Tânia, Ivone and Marilu. They wear a plus size mannequin and face all the adventures and love and professional mismatches that four young women can face in the capital of Rio de Janeiro, (almost) always in a good mood.', 'In Rio de Janeiro there live four great and inseparable friends: Beatriz, Tânia, Ivone and Marilu. They wear a plus size mannequin and face all the adventures and love and professional mismatches that four young women can face in the capital of Rio de Janeiro, (almost) always in a good mood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZSferLm5pYVl9ufYHsazXxEAQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440460'),
  ('519269316014975766', 'Gotcha!', 1985, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Jeff Kanew, King Baggot', 'Dan Gordon', 'Anthony Edwards, Linda Fiorentino, Jsu Garcia, Alex Rocco, Marla Adams, Klaus Löwitsch, Christopher Rydell, Christie Claridge', 'PG-13', 'A student on a trip to France is tricked into smuggling secrets across the Iron Curtain by a sexy spy.', 'A student on a trip to France is tricked into smuggling secrets across the Iron Curtain by a sexy spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qHvL1w0NYemVeppB1UKlAd1pS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27590'),
  ('190656447905761456', 'Goth', 2008, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Gen Takahashi, Shinji Kugimiya, Ryuji Ishikura', 'Gen Takahashi, Midori Saito, Gram', 'Kanata Hongo, Rin Takanashi, Toshinobu Matsuo, Miyu Yagyu, Sôtarô, Maari, Keishi Nagatsuka, Kei Nakata', null, 'Itsuki and Yoru share a passion for the dark and death, making them the perfect choice to track down a serial killer who is roaming the streets.', 'Itsuki and Yoru share a passion for the dark and death, making them the perfect choice to track down a serial killer who is roaming the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KpdGuoogEp4dsI1YLfG3PUfcLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39493'),
  ('40754472217141475', 'Gotham', 1988, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Lloyd Fonvielle, Michael Chapman', 'Lloyd Fonvielle', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Virginia Madsen, Colin Bruce, Denise Stephenson, Kevin Jarre, Frederic Forrest, J.B. White, Michael Chapman', 'R', 'A New York private eye searches for a socialite who supposedly drowned 10 years before.', 'A New York private eye searches for a socialite who supposedly drowned 10 years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tH4mlVf9sbvgnzBbLsQHZwzPjDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41875'),
  ('17764829322815770', 'Gothic', 1987, 'Horror', 'Ken Russell, Iain Patrick, Callum McDougall', 'Stephen Volk', 'Gabriel Byrne, Julian Sands, Natasha Richardson, Myriam Cyr, Timothy Spall, Alec Mango, Andreas Wisniewski, Dexter Fletcher', 'R', 'Living on an estate on the shores of Lake Geneva, Lord Byron is visited by Percy and Mary Shelley. Together with Byron''s lover Claire Clairmont, and aided by hallucinogenic substances, they devise an evening of ghoulish tales. However, when confronted by horrors, ostensibly of their own creation, it becomes difficult to tell apparition from reality.', 'Living on an estate on the shores of Lake Geneva, Lord Byron is visited by Percy and Mary Shelley. Together with Byron''s lover Claire Clairmont, and aided by hallucinogenic substances, they devise an evening of ghoulish tales. However, when confronted by horrors, ostensibly of their own creation, it becomes difficult to tell apparition from reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGXj6wpJimmWkQMahZryM7xB9EX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33516'),
  ('945676138638138206', 'Gothika', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Matthew Libatique, Nicolas Lepage', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Halle Berry, Robert Downey Jr., Charles S. Dutton, John Carroll Lynch, Bernard Hill, Penélope Cruz, Dorian Harewood, Bronwen Mantel', 'R', 'After a car crash, criminal psychologist Dr. Miranda Grey regains consciousness only to find that she''s a patient in the same mental institution that currently employs her. She''s been accused of murdering her husband Dr. Douglas Grey — but she has no memory of committing the crime. As she tries to regain her memory and convince her co-worker, Dr. Pete Graham, of her innocence, a vengeful spirit uses her as an earthly pawn, which further convinces everyone of her guilt.', 'After a car crash, criminal psychologist Dr. Miranda Grey regains consciousness only to find that she''s a patient in the same mental institution that currently employs her. She''s been accused of murdering her husband Dr. Douglas Grey — but she has no memory of committing the crime. As she tries to regain her memory and convince her co-worker, Dr. Pete Graham, of her innocence, a vengeful spirit uses her as an earthly pawn, which further convinces everyone of her guilt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frSGNQcWx1ek8dCduFYCux1ho7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4970'),
  ('873800546173605445', 'Goto, Island of Love', 1969, 'Drama', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Guy Durban, Patrick Saglio', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Pierre Brasseur, Ligia Branice, Jean-Pierre Andréani, Ginette Leclerc, Fernand Bercher, Michel Charrel, Pierre Collet, Raoul Darblay', null, 'A petty thief works his way up the absurd hierarchy of Goto, an archipelago cut off from civilisation by a tumultuous earthquake. His dream is to possess Glossia, a stifled beauty trapped in a loveless marriage to a melancholic dictator.', 'A petty thief works his way up the absurd hierarchy of Goto, an archipelago cut off from civilisation by a tumultuous earthquake. His dream is to possess Glossia, a stifled beauty trapped in a loveless marriage to a melancholic dictator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMRPogdoSp7wmEUs9BL9xGy7D3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105843'),
  ('671839966872458329', 'Gotta Kick It Up!', 2002, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Clark Mathis, Robert Brooks Mendel, Babu Subramaniam', null, 'Camille Guaty, America Ferrera, Jhoanna Flores, Suilma Rodriguez, Sabrina Wiener, Miguel Sandoval, Erik Alexander Gavica, Susan Egan', 'G', 'This was going to be the first year that Marshal Middle School was not going to have a dance team. All that changes when the new Biology teacher, Ms. Bartlett, agrees to be the coach. Now the girls need to prove that they are ready to compete and are able to win; not only to themselves, but to their parents and coach. Using the chant "si, se puede" or "yes, I can" the Dance team builds their confidence to perform.', 'This was going to be the first year that Marshal Middle School was not going to have a dance team. All that changes when the new Biology teacher, Ms. Bartlett, agrees to be the coach. Now the girls need to prove that they are ready to compete and are able to win; not only to themselves, but to their parents and coach. Using the chant "si, se puede" or "yes, I can" the Dance team builds their confidence to perform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pTKPtHKcVAMjHmRbUOV3Lu5Ljy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124108'),
  ('377899385397321192', 'Gotta Run!', 1982, 'Drama', 'Mikko Niskanen, Keijo Venho, Henrik Paersch', 'Mikko Niskanen, Matti Ijäs', 'Timo Torikka, Heikki Paavilainen, Tero Niva, Sanna Majanlahti, Paavo Pentikäinen, Tuulikki Kuorikoski, Vesa Vierikko, Kauko Hynninen', null, 'Juuso, Late, and Pyry return from military service to their small village in the Finnish countryside. Finding work is difficult there, so Juuso decides to take a job on a Norwegian oil drilling platform. Late could start working on his family''s chicken farm but wants to break free from his father who has a new wife. Looking for work in Gothenburg, Sweden, he only runs into more problems and is deported back to Finland. Pyry would like to take over his late father''s farm but family quarrels over the estate make him quit his agricultural studies and, together with drifter Late, take a job in a steel mill in southern Finland.', 'Juuso, Late, and Pyry return from military service to their small village in the Finnish countryside. Finding work is difficult there, so Juuso decides to take a job on a Norwegian oil drilling platform. Late could start working on his family''s chicken farm but wants to break free from his father who has a new wife. Looking for work in Gothenburg, Sweden, he only runs into more problems and is deported back to Finland. Pyry would like to take over his late father''s farm but family quarrels over the estate make him quit his agricultural studies and, together with drifter Late, take a job in a steel mill in southern Finland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtVEeg4etbmYmNaA8HgBDhfh6KT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435604'),
  ('653459682938707861', 'Gotti', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Harmon, Alar Kivilo', null, 'Armand Assante, William Forsythe, Frank Vincent, Vincent Pastore, Anthony Quinn, Richard C. Sarafian, Dominic Chianese, Robert Miranda', null, 'John Gotti, the head of a small New York mafia crew breaks a few of the old family rules. He rises to become the head of the Gambino family and the most well-known mafia boss in America. Life is good, but suspicion creeps in, and greed, rule-breaking and his high public profile all threaten to topple him.', 'John Gotti, the head of a small New York mafia crew breaks a few of the old family rules. He rises to become the head of the Gambino family and the most well-known mafia boss in America. Life is good, but suspicion creeps in, and greed, rule-breaking and his high public profile all threaten to topple him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZeKN0jnXHlyloMFba1Xe4C1ell.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14786'),
  ('886067654103567412', 'Gotti', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Michael Barrett, Kevin Connolly, Alex Foreman', 'Leo Rossi, Lem Dobbs', 'John Travolta, Spencer Rocco Lofranco, Kelly Preston, Pruitt Taylor Vince, William DeMeo, Leo Rossi, Chris Kerson, Stacy Keach', 'R', 'John Gotti rises to the top of the New York underworld to become the boss of the Gambino crime family. His life takes a tumultuous turn as he faces tragedy, multiple trials and a prison sentence.', 'John Gotti rises to the top of the New York underworld to become the boss of the Gambino crime family. His life takes a tumultuous turn as he faces tragedy, multiple trials and a prison sentence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUCX6B0FGTsHC5D8L2CF0gJrQCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339103'),
