  ('820471178266815079', 'Gourmet Detective', 2015, 'TV Movie, Mystery', 'James Liston, Matthew Blecha, Catherine Kretz', 'Dylan Neal, Becky Southwell', 'Dylan Neal, Brooke Burns, Alissa Skovbye, Kimberley Sustad, Matthew Kevin Anderson, Marc Senior, Samantha Ferris, Shannon Chan-Kent', null, 'Famed culinary consultant Henry Ross is a charming food industry insider in San Francisco. When suspicious sabotage ends in a shocking murder at his friend’s five-star restaurant, Henry is put on the case with strong-willed police detective and single mom, Maggie Price. Despite Maggie’s protests, they must work together to decipher the clues and investigate all of San Francisco’s top culinary pros.', 'Famed culinary consultant Henry Ross is a charming food industry insider in San Francisco. When suspicious sabotage ends in a shocking murder at his friend’s five-star restaurant, Henry is put on the case with strong-willed police detective and single mom, Maggie Price. Despite Maggie’s protests, they must work together to decipher the clues and investigate all of San Francisco’s top culinary pros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eLeSmEcBQOv6hkl5tXx14Q60ed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330161'),
  ('809728772227384830', 'Gourmet Detective: Roux the Day', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Mark Jean, Adam Sliwinski', 'Dylan Neal, Becky Southwell', 'Brooke Burns, Dylan Neal, Alissa Skovbye, Lane Edwards, Jennifer Copping, Myrasol Martinez, Noel Johansen, Alex Barima', null, 'Henry is hired to authenticate and purchase a long lost and very valuable recipe book. Soon Henry and Maggie find themselves in a murder mystery where secrets hidden within a treasured book have dire consequences for all who own it.', 'Henry is hired to authenticate and purchase a long lost and very valuable recipe book. Soon Henry and Maggie find themselves in a murder mystery where secrets hidden within a treasured book have dire consequences for all who own it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPgeRdjSI4fbJIOhXKdPDn1jQET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648597'),
  ('818941494180622968', 'Governance', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Zampino', 'Michael Zampino, Heidrun Schleef, Giampaolo Rugo', 'Massimo Popolizio, Vinicio Marchioni, Sarah Denys, Claudio Spadaro, Maria Cristina Heller, Désirée Giorgetti', null, 'Renzo Petrucci is forced to leave his job as general manager of a multinational oil company after corruption charges. Convinced that the woman who has taken his place has betrayed him, Renzo takes his revenge by killing her. Reinstated by the Board, he works his way up to the top, driving his company to new heights despite the growing suspicion and mistrust...', 'Renzo Petrucci is forced to leave his job as general manager of a multinational oil company after corruption charges. Convinced that the woman who has taken his place has betrayed him, Renzo takes his revenge by killing her. Reinstated by the Board, he works his way up to the top, driving his company to new heights despite the growing suspicion and mistrust...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkFyyZtWjfS2F8V14wLoVS7zQui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659715'),
  ('277703452955916577', 'Government Woman', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Sermiyan Midyat, Hayk Kirakosyan', 'Sermiyan Midyat', 'Demet Akbağ, Sermiyan Midyat, Mahir İpek, Ercan Kesal, Gülhan Tekin, Burcu Gönder, Cezmi Baskın, Renan Bilek', null, 'Xate is an ordinary woman from Midyat with eight children in tow. The only thing that sets her apart is her husband''s job as Mayor of Midyat. Until, that is, an extraordinary day changes her life - and the lives of everyone else in Midyat. For the illiterate, uneducated Xate becomes Mayor of Midyat! While she takes on her mayoral duties much as she does those in her house, the infantile rivalry between her children in municipal matters leads to adventures that have the Midyat folk howling with laughter.', 'Xate is an ordinary woman from Midyat with eight children in tow. The only thing that sets her apart is her husband''s job as Mayor of Midyat. Until, that is, an extraordinary day changes her life - and the lives of everyone else in Midyat. For the illiterate, uneducated Xate becomes Mayor of Midyat! While she takes on her mayoral duties much as she does those in her house, the infantile rivalry between her children in municipal matters leads to adventures that have the Midyat folk howling with laughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOjnfISRtU9pJinlJxHX3YrPVQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171158'),
  ('98559663347597332', 'Government Woman 2', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Sermiyan Midyat, Hayk Kirakosyan', 'Sermiyan Midyat', 'Demet Akbağ, Sermiyan Midyat, Mahir İpek, Ercan Kesal, Gülhan Tekin, Burcu Gönder, Mine Teber, Osman Alkaş', null, 'Seven years before the first film, Xate, still living in her husband Aziz Veysel’s shadow, is about to become the region’s first female mayor when a routine morning send-off for Aziz turns explosive, reigniting the fierce rivalry between Xate and the power-hungry Faruk. Their conflict escalates further when there’s an unexpected call for snap elections.', 'Seven years before the first film, Xate, still living in her husband Aziz Veysel’s shadow, is about to become the region’s first female mayor when a routine morning send-off for Aziz turns explosive, reigniting the fierce rivalry between Xate and the power-hungry Faruk. Their conflict escalates further when there’s an unexpected call for snap elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNBXCxibM262iHQgHlLuQKmDTQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255156'),
  ('1004642877883767910', 'Govinda Naam Mera', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mukesh Chhabra, Vidushi Tiwari, Shashank Khaitan', 'Shashank Khaitan', 'Vicky Kaushal, Kiara Advani, Bhumi Pednekar, Trupti Khamkar, Dayanand Shetty, Sayaji Shinde, Viraj Ghelani, Amey Wagh', null, 'An abusive wife, a hot girlfriend and a court case, Govinda Waghmare is just not able to catch a break. The icing on top of that horrible cake - a murder.', 'An abusive wife, a hot girlfriend and a court case, Govinda Waghmare is just not able to catch a break. The icing on top of that horrible cake - a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c93pb87QTyMIdzV6ufUZSQfVMFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663457'),
  ('373631306811489524', 'Goya in Bordeaux', 1999, 'Drama, History', 'Carlos Saura, Vittorio Storaro', 'Carlos Saura', 'Francisco Rabal, Jose Coronado, Dafne Fernández, Maribel Verdú, Eulalia Ramón, Joaquín Climent, Josep Maria Pou, Saturnino García', null, 'Francisco Goya (1746-1828), deaf and ill, lives the last years of his life in voluntary exile in Bordeaux, a Liberal protesting the oppressive rule of Ferdinand VII. He''s living with his much younger wife Leocadia and their daughter Rosario. He continues to paint at night, and in flashbacks stirred by conversations with his daughter, by awful headaches, and by the befuddlement of age, he relives key times in his life.', 'Francisco Goya (1746-1828), deaf and ill, lives the last years of his life in voluntary exile in Bordeaux, a Liberal protesting the oppressive rule of Ferdinand VII. He''s living with his much younger wife Leocadia and their daughter Rosario. He continues to paint at night, and in flashbacks stirred by conversations with his daughter, by awful headaches, and by the befuddlement of age, he relives key times in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCn4Sz3uYy6a1aObs80hzMHp7hM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170767'),
  ('967896045765487088', 'Goya: Or the Hard Way to Enlightenment', 1971, 'Drama, History', 'Konrad Wolf, Konstantin Ryzhov, Werner Bergmann', 'Konrad Wolf, Angel Vagenshtain', 'Donatas Banionis, Olivera Katarina, Fred Düren, Rolf Hoppe, Ernst Busch, Gustaw Holoubek, Wolfgang Kieling, Günter Schubert', null, 'As a painter in the court of King Carlos IV, Goya has attained wealth and reputation. He believes in King and Church, yet he is also a Spaniard who dearly loves his people. This contradiction presents him with a dilemma.', 'As a painter in the court of King Carlos IV, Goya has attained wealth and reputation. He believes in King and Church, yet he is also a Spaniard who dearly loves his people. This contradiction presents him with a dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47Si2cGXydi4tB8k7iTDYdEMzwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219484'),
  ('598252715949207982', 'Goya''s Ghosts', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Miloš Forman, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Miloš Forman', 'Javier Bardem, Natalie Portman, Stellan Skarsgård, Randy Quaid, José Luis Gómez, Michael Lonsdale, Blanca Portillo, Mabel Rivera', 'R', 'Painter Francisco Goya becomes involved with the Spanish Inquisition after his muse, Inés, is arrested by the church for heresy. Her family turns to him, hoping that his connection with fanatical Inquisitor Lorenzo, whom he is painting, can secure her release.', 'Painter Francisco Goya becomes involved with the Spanish Inquisition after his muse, Inés, is arrested by the church for heresy. Her family turns to him, hoping that his connection with fanatical Inquisitor Lorenzo, whom he is painting, can secure her release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyZhS8kA07oU5fO3ruamJkgAC0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11515'),
  ('139922640033765300', 'Goyo', 2024, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Marcos Carnevale, Federico Peña, Anabella Etchegaray', 'Marcos Carnevale', 'Nicolás Furtado, Nancy Dupláa, Soledad Villamil, Pablo Rago, Cecilia Roth, Diego Alonso, Milo Zeus Lis, Balthazar Murillo', null, 'A young autistic museum guide lives by a strict routine — until he falls in love with his coworker and must confront a whirlwind of new, intense emotions.', 'A young autistic museum guide lives by a strict routine — until he falls in love with his coworker and must confront a whirlwind of new, intense emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCjC1RRbEJUpDjM55RNUMXQen0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191610'),
  ('802271522943584715', 'Goyokin', 1969, 'Drama, Action', 'Kōzō Okazaki, Kazuaki Atsumi, Hideo Gosha', 'Kei Tasaka, Hideo Gosha', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Tetsuro Tamba, Yōko Tsukasa, Kinnosuke Nakamura, Ruriko Asaoka, Kunie Tanaka, Isao Natsuyagi, Ben Hiura', null, 'A guilt-haunted samurai warrior attempts to stop a massacre taking place.', 'A guilt-haunted samurai warrior attempts to stop a massacre taking place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5X0oO5Lg5OmYRd2zsGfxTaSFXEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49355'),
  ('14781063963205833', 'Gozu', 2003, 'Horror, Comedy, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Takashi Miike, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Sakichi Sato', 'Show Aikawa, Yūta Sone, Kimika Yoshino, Shōhei Hino, Keiko Tomita, Harumi Sone, Renji Ishibashi, Kenichi Endo', null, 'Minami mistakenly kills a gangster associate of his named Brother. Almost as soon as the murder takes place, the body of the deceased man is gone, prompting Minami to conduct a search. While looking, he finds a mysterious isolated hotel where he decides to take a rest. Not only are the front desk clerks a bit strange, but even the ambiance feels unusual. Minami soon realizes he may have gotten more than he bargained for.', 'Minami mistakenly kills a gangster associate of his named Brother. Almost as soon as the murder takes place, the body of the deceased man is gone, prompting Minami to conduct a search. While looking, he finds a mysterious isolated hotel where he decides to take a rest. Not only are the front desk clerks a bit strange, but even the ambiance feels unusual. Minami soon realizes he may have gotten more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mo5L0XzMYmLhdsvgA40qlYiHhAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12487'),
  ('638661861833301762', 'Grabbers', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Jon Wright, Trevor Forrest, Gillian Devenney', 'Kevin Lehane', 'Richard Coyle, Ruth Bradley, Russell Tovey, Bronagh Gallagher, David Pearse, Lalor Roddy, Clelia Murphy, Louis Dempsey', 'R', 'Something sinister has come to the shores of Erin Island, unbeknownst to the quaint population of this sleepy fishing village resting somewhere off Ireland’s coast. First, some fishermen go missing. Then there is the rash of whale carcasses suddenly washing up on the beach. When the murders start, it’s up to two mismatched cops – an irresponsible alcoholic and his new partner, a by-the-book woman from the mainland – to protect the townsfolk from the giant, bloodsucking, tentacled aliens that prey upon them. Their only weapon, they discover, is booze. If they want to survive the creatures’ onslaught, everyone will have to get very, very drunk!', 'Something sinister has come to the shores of Erin Island, unbeknownst to the quaint population of this sleepy fishing village resting somewhere off Ireland’s coast. First, some fishermen go missing. Then there is the rash of whale carcasses suddenly washing up on the beach. When the murders start, it’s up to two mismatched cops – an irresponsible alcoholic and his new partner, a by-the-book woman from the mainland – to protect the townsfolk from the giant, bloodsucking, tentacled aliens that prey upon them. Their only weapon, they discover, is booze. If they want to survive the creatures’ onslaught, everyone will have to get very, very drunk!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1CkFfuDCh4NDZgaXmyna3V0Hxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84204'),
  ('388783906845079799', 'Grace', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Solet, Zoran Popović', 'Paul Solet', 'Jordan Ladd, Samantha Ferris, Gabrielle Rose, Stephen Park, Serge Houde, Kate Herriot, Troy Skog, Malcolm Stewart', 'R', 'In the wake of a horrific car accident that kills her husband, Michael, expectant mother Madeline Matheson discovers that her daughter, Grace, has died in the womb. Ignoring her doctor''s warnings that the fetus must be removed from her body, a grief-stricken Matheson demands to carry the child to term -- even if it endangers her own life to do so. Curiously, little Grace emerges undead -- and with a craving for human blood.', 'In the wake of a horrific car accident that kills her husband, Michael, expectant mother Madeline Matheson discovers that her daughter, Grace, has died in the womb. Ignoring her doctor''s warnings that the fetus must be removed from her body, a grief-stricken Matheson demands to carry the child to term -- even if it endangers her own life to do so. Curiously, little Grace emerges undead -- and with a craving for human blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aygXzr6TaeC9jaPC6FfbKxNwZsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21398'),
  ('789721625153140497', 'Grace', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jeff Chan', 'Jeff Chan, Chris Paré', 'Alexia Fast, Joel David Moore, Lin Shaye, Alexis Knapp, Brett Dier, Alan Dale, John Emmet Tracy, Daniel Arnold', 'R', 'A unique horror film told from the first-person perspective of Grace - a naive, virginal college freshman trying to deal with campus culture and her outgoing roommate as an evil entity takes over her body and unleashes chaos.', 'A unique horror film told from the first-person perspective of Grace - a naive, virginal college freshman trying to deal with campus culture and her outgoing roommate as an evil entity takes over her body and unleashes chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ikvuPIo1kGuRQz70l3ecissZLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289416'),
  ('980915063756930475', 'Grace Is Gone', 2007, 'Drama', 'Jim Strouse, Jean-Louis Bompoint, Donald Dowd', 'Jim Strouse', 'John Cusack, Alessandro Nivola, Gracie Bednarczyk, Shélan O''Keefe, Doug Dearth, Doug James, Emily Churchill, Rebecca Spence', 'PG-13', 'Upon hearing his wife was killed in the Iraq war, a father takes his two daughters on a road trip, all the while searching for the right time and place to tell them about their mother''s fate.', 'Upon hearing his wife was killed in the Iraq war, a father takes his two daughters on a road trip, all the while searching for the right time and place to tell them about their mother''s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRRpa2YNkBTb8i36PmwnV6H8kyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11161'),
  ('998577373495917948', 'Grace of Monaco', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Olivier Dahan, Éric Gautier, Boëdec Cramesnil Maëla', 'Arash Amel', 'Nicole Kidman, Milo Ventimiglia, Paz Vega, Tim Roth, Parker Posey, Frank Langella, Derek Jacobi, Geraldine Somerville', null, 'The story of former Hollywood star Grace Kelly''s crisis of marriage and identity, during a political dispute between Monaco''s Prince Rainier III and France''s Charles De Gaulle, and a looming French invasion of Monaco in the early 1960s.', 'The story of former Hollywood star Grace Kelly''s crisis of marriage and identity, during a political dispute between Monaco''s Prince Rainier III and France''s Charles De Gaulle, and a looming French invasion of Monaco in the early 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHiiS7rG7VMTp5a5fbH0WCKs9mS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215211'),
  ('884749034075723012', 'Grace of My Heart', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Allison Anders, Jean-Yves Escoffier', 'Allison Anders', 'Illeana Douglas, Matt Dillon, Eric Stoltz, Patsy Kensit, John Turturro, Bruce Davison, Jennifer Leigh Warren, David Clennon', 'R', 'Philadelphia teenager Edna Buxton wins a talent contest during the early rock ''n'' roll era, changes her name to Denise Waverly and moves to New York City to make it big. Though she flops as a recording artist, fast-talking record producer Joel Millner recognizes her songwriting talent and teams her with struggling songsmith Howard Caszatt.', 'Philadelphia teenager Edna Buxton wins a talent contest during the early rock ''n'' roll era, changes her name to Denise Waverly and moves to New York City to make it big. Though she flops as a recording artist, fast-talking record producer Joel Millner recognizes her songwriting talent and teams her with struggling songsmith Howard Caszatt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkgVjmbN9VdBxguNi6tz6lb3sDu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58985'),
  ('45858775272748148', 'Grace Quigley', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Harvey, Larry Pizer, Michael Haley', 'A. Martin Zweiback', 'Katharine Hepburn, Nick Nolte, Walter Abel, William Duell, Elizabeth Wilson, Chip Zien, Frances Pole, Truman Gaige', 'PG', 'Grace Quigley is nearing the end of her life, living alone in her New York apartment. On the day she''s being evicted, she witnesses a murder being committed by a top hit-man, Seymour Flint. She proposes to blackmail him into killing her, however, she has one or two friends she wants him to get rid of first.', 'Grace Quigley is nearing the end of her life, living alone in her New York apartment. On the day she''s being evicted, she witnesses a murder being committed by a top hit-man, Seymour Flint. She proposes to blackmail him into killing her, however, she has one or two friends she wants him to get rid of first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7NzheKqDIYOFCqCKMOPCSfipkJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85572'),
  ('1080562523409794414', 'Grace Unplugged', 2013, 'Drama, Music', 'Brad J. Silverman', 'Brad J. Silverman, Brandon Rice', 'AJ Michalka, James Denton, Kevin Pollak, Shawnee Smith, Michael Welch, Jamie Grace, Emma Catherwood, Zane Holtz', 'PG', 'A talented young singer and aspiring songwriter’s Christian faith and family ties are tested when she defies her worship-pastor father and pursues pop-music stardom in GRACE UNPLUGGED, a moving and inspiring new film that explores the true meaning of success.', 'A talented young singer and aspiring songwriter’s Christian faith and family ties are tested when she defies her worship-pastor father and pursues pop-music stardom in GRACE UNPLUGGED, a moving and inspiring new film that explores the true meaning of success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1woGP3DCEyfPuifRPSkrwDanOQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206284'),
  ('545951799803680966', 'Gracie', 2007, 'Drama', 'Davis Guggenheim, Christopher Manley', 'Davis Guggenheim', 'Carly Schroeder, Christopher Shand, Jesse Lee Soffer, Karl Girolamo, Vasilios Mantagas, Donny Gray, Dermot Mulroney, Hunter Schroeder', 'PG-13', 'A teenager faces an uphill battle when she fights to give women the opportunity to play competitive soccer.', 'A teenager faces an uphill battle when she fights to give women the opportunity to play competitive soccer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPmRGO7iwVRWNd0n5ePWLfSHeuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15568'),
  ('961898406366894441', 'Gracie & Pedro: Pets to the Rescue', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Kevin Donovan, Gottfried Roodt', 'Jaisa C. Bishop, Bruce A. Taylor, Kelly Peters', 'Claire Alan, Cory Doran, Susan Sarandon, Brooke Shields, Alicia Silverstone, Bill Nighy, Danny Trejo, Bianca Alongi', 'PG', 'Family frenemies, Gracie and Pedro, must put their differences aside, embarking on a thrilling quest packed with perilous escapades in order to reunite with their owners.', 'Family frenemies, Gracie and Pedro, must put their differences aside, embarking on a thrilling quest packed with perilous escapades in order to reunite with their owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1agSI7NGvagr720za8XAubtqUoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1207830'),
  ('684249719078833363', 'Gracie''s Choice', 2004, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Peter Werner, Neil Roach', null, 'Kristen Bell, Diane Ladd, Shedrack Anderson III, Anne Heche, Roberta Maxwell, Kristin Fairlie, Robert Seeliger, Roger Dunn', null, 'For as long as she can remember, 16 year-old Gracie has been raising her four siblings, each of whom has a different, absent father and their mother is on the fast track to self-destruction. When these children''s lives are about to be pulled apart, Gracie will have to do the impossible and make the ultimate sacrifices to keep her family together.', 'For as long as she can remember, 16 year-old Gracie has been raising her four siblings, each of whom has a different, absent father and their mother is on the fast track to self-destruction. When these children''s lives are about to be pulled apart, Gracie will have to do the impossible and make the ultimate sacrifices to keep her family together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mECvCiSy8nsdMtGNAxlupMjIug7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70476'),
  ('325355454139662904', 'Gracinha', 2021, 'Music', 'Gabriel Dietrich, Manu Gavassi, Nicholas Bluff', 'Manu Gavassi', 'Manu Gavassi, Ícaro Silva, João Côrtes, Paulo Miklos, Amaro João de Freitas Neto, Samuel de Saboia, João Mandarino, Titi Ewbank Gagliasso', null, 'After the death of what Gracinha - a ballerina - thought to be the soul of art, she faces a dilemma: can she carry on doing what she''s always done, or should she start a search for something that could set her heart free?', 'After the death of what Gracinha - a ballerina - thought to be the soul of art, she faces a dilemma: can she carry on doing what she''s always done, or should she start a search for something that could set her heart free?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qS47nqfqRzdXXsEsGhxi2i7VLoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893656'),
  ('709511987824406522', 'Graduate First', 1978, 'Drama', 'Maurice Pialat, Pierre-William Glenn, Jean-Marie Duhart', 'Maurice Pialat', 'Sabine Haudepin, Philippe Marlaud, Annick Alane, Michel Caron, Bernard Tronczak, Patrick Lepcynski, Agnès Makowiak, Charline Bourré', null, 'A slice of life of a group of young working class friends in a Northern French village coming to the end of their school years and embarking upon adult life. The film follows the choices and decisions made for their futures.', 'A slice of life of a group of young working class friends in a Northern French village coming to the end of their school years and embarking upon adult life. The film follows the choices and decisions made for their futures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPVyS9qLJsc8PU0ZkmVgfdNl6YK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63214'),
  ('428781008976637749', 'Graduation', 2007, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Mayer, Matthew Uhry', 'D. Cory Turner', 'Shannon Lucio, Riley Smith, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, Chris Lowell, Adam Arkin, Aimee Garcia, Robert Haley, Tommy Lafitte', null, 'Four best friends, about to graduate from high school, must find a way to raise money to help a family member in need. When one of them discovers her banker father having an affair, the foursome plots to rob his bank during graduation ceremonies. When things don''t go according to plan, they end up learning more about themselves in one day than they ever did in school.', 'Four best friends, about to graduate from high school, must find a way to raise money to help a family member in need. When one of them discovers her banker father having an affair, the foursome plots to rob his bank during graduation ceremonies. When things don''t go according to plan, they end up learning more about themselves in one day than they ever did in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idw9ugBWMuBYfnzebxfTU7pl54X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19203'),
  ('392138599554748360', 'Graduation', 2016, 'Drama', 'Cristian Mungiu, Tudor Vladimir Panduru', 'Cristian Mungiu', 'Adrian Titieni, Maria Dragus, Lia Bugnar, Vlad Ivanov, Emanuel Pârvu, Lucian Ifrim, Gheorghe Ifrim, Adrian Văncică', 'R', 'After his daughter is assaulted and left with an injury that may jeopardize her opportunity to study in the UK, a Romanian doctor decides to do whatever it takes to secure her future.', 'After his daughter is assaulted and left with an injury that may jeopardize her opportunity to study in the UK, a Romanian doctor decides to do whatever it takes to secure her future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FLocEtNx189qFvqRpaYArNK8w2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374458'),
  ('349660325310317871', 'Graduation Day', 1981, 'Horror', 'Herb Freed, Daniel Yarussi, Hal Schwartz', 'Anne Marisse, Herb Freed', 'Christopher George, Patch Mackenzie, E. Danny Murphy, E.J. Peaker, Michael Pataki, Richard Balin, Carmen Argenziano, Linnea Quigley', 'R', 'After the death of a high school track star during a race, a mysterious killer in a fencing mask begins murdering her friends and teachers.', 'After the death of a high school track star during a race, a mysterious killer in a fencing mask begins murdering her friends and teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbNtkM0oFTCnFfblOzeEuaDUaZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27420'),
  ('179826693730632491', 'Graduation Party', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Pasquale Rachini, Pupi Avati', 'Antonio Avati, Pupi Avati, Cesare Bornazzini', 'Carlo Delle Piane, Aurore Clément, Lidia Broccolino, Nik Novecento, Dario Parisini, Cesare Barbetti, Fiorenza Tessari, Adriana Innocenti', null, 'The endearing efforts of a divorced, simple baker to capture the attentions of a bourgeois society woman.', 'The endearing efforts of a divorced, simple baker to capture the attentions of a bourgeois society woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXH2fdUQqSGgBIUP0WF5dQonJt5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199011'),
  ('1051310089523655244', 'Graduation Trip: Mallorca', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Paco Caballero, David Valldepérez, Ana Sainz-Trápaga', 'Eric Navarro, Natalia Durán', 'Yolanda Ramos, Berta Castañé, Sara Vidorreta, Claudia Roset, Nadia Vilaplana, Diego Garisa, Martí Cordero, Aiden Botía', null, '2021. After spending a year in confinement, a group of high school students and their two teachers begin an end-of-year trip to Mallorca. This great plan is the last opportunity they have to all be together, make up for lost time, be able to have fun like they have never had before and say goodbye to this crazy stage of their lives. However, a new coronavirus outbreak disrupts all their plans and forces them to stay locked in their hotel rooms. More than 50 students, 2 teachers, a hotel and many, many minibars... What could go wrong?', '2021. After spending a year in confinement, a group of high school students and their two teachers begin an end-of-year trip to Mallorca. This great plan is the last opportunity they have to all be together, make up for lost time, be able to have fun like they have never had before and say goodbye to this crazy stage of their lives. However, a new coronavirus outbreak disrupts all their plans and forces them to stay locked in their hotel rooms. More than 50 students, 2 teachers, a hotel and many, many minibars... What could go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejYX4ygRoupGRjFgmmtnK0sMxhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245165'),
  ('1014556518543392438', 'Graf Porno und seine Mädchen', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Günter Hendel, Klaus Beckhausen', 'Alois Brummer', 'Rinaldo Talamonti, Doris Arden, Marianne Manthey, Eva Brückl, Ellen Umlauf, Heinz Plate, Terry Neciel, Erich Fritze', null, 'Graf Porno is a real playboy who makes money out of everything that falls into his hands. During great sex parties he puts his girls on and afterwards everything that is not nailed down is missing. Harry Holst, on the other hand, is a young man who has successfully completed a correspondence course as a private detective and is now waiting for clients...waiting and waiting.', 'Graf Porno is a real playboy who makes money out of everything that falls into his hands. During great sex parties he puts his girls on and afterwards everything that is not nailed down is missing. Harry Holst, on the other hand, is a young man who has successfully completed a correspondence course as a private detective and is now waiting for clients...waiting and waiting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98bbEkdh9CBHREgZKWzdSxXlLqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248509'),
  ('12073778543364757', 'Graffiti Bridge', 1990, 'Drama, Music', 'Prince, Lee Alan McConnell, Kelly Schroeder', 'Prince', 'Prince, Ingrid Chavez, Morris Day, Jerome Benton, Michael Bland, Phillip C, Rosie Gaines, Levi Seacer Jr.', 'PG-13', 'It''s got that Purple Rain feeling through and though. And it''s got The Kid, too! For the first time since Purple Rain, Prince is back as The Kid. And where he goes, there''s music! With Thieves in the Temple, New Power Generation, Elephants and Flowers and more red-hot Prince tunes from the Platinum-selling Graffiti Bridge soundtrack. What time is it? Party time! Morris Day and the Time play Release It, Shake! and more. And you''ll also see and hear George Clinton, Tevin Campbell, Robin Power, Mavis Staples and other hot performers, too. Graffiti Bridge is where the movie meets the music. Cross over on it now.', 'It''s got that Purple Rain feeling through and though. And it''s got The Kid, too! For the first time since Purple Rain, Prince is back as The Kid. And where he goes, there''s music! With Thieves in the Temple, New Power Generation, Elephants and Flowers and more red-hot Prince tunes from the Platinum-selling Graffiti Bridge soundtrack. What time is it? Party time! Morris Day and the Time play Release It, Shake! and more. And you''ll also see and hear George Clinton, Tevin Campbell, Robin Power, Mavis Staples and other hot performers, too. Graffiti Bridge is where the movie meets the music. Cross over on it now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiZ9vWZfHtdtMxnx14Dgeo5aH91.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41762'),
  ('1097401313547607254', 'Grafted', 2024, 'Horror', 'Elizabeth Cotching, Sasha Rainbow, Jimmy Scott', 'Mia Maramara, Lee Murray, Hweiling Ow', 'Joyena Sun, Jess Hong, Eden Hart, Jared Turner, Sepi Toa, Xiao Hu, Gideon Smith, Ginette McDonald', null, 'When an awkward but brilliant Chinese student wins a scholarship into a prestigious New Zealand University, she finds a new way of achieving the popularity she craves one bloody body at a time.', 'When an awkward but brilliant Chinese student wins a scholarship into a prestigious New Zealand University, she finds a new way of achieving the popularity she craves one bloody body at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u53wFzLoJD7om52Hjma8G27LS2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201262'),
