  ('160894379625958721', 'Gramps Is in the Resistance', 1983, 'Comedy, War', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Catherine Dailleux, Philippe Berger', 'Martin Lamotte, Christian Clavier, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Christian Clavier, Michel Galabru, Roland Giraud, Gérard Jugnot, Martin Lamotte, Dominique Lavanant, Jacqueline Maillan, Jacques Villeret', null, 'It is 1943 in Paris. Like so many others, the Bourbelle family''s home has been taken over by the Germans and they now live in their cellar. Little do they know that the son, Guy-Hubert Bourdelle, is far from being the cowardly hairdresser he pretends. He is in truth the Germans’ most feared opponent: le super-résistant!', 'It is 1943 in Paris. Like so many others, the Bourbelle family''s home has been taken over by the Germans and they now live in their cellar. Little do they know that the son, Guy-Hubert Bourdelle, is far from being the cowardly hairdresser he pretends. He is in truth the Germans’ most feared opponent: le super-résistant!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYAaRDKCHSofMnUDqjg6AIAmTfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48769'),
  ('812232798413383353', 'Gran Casino', 1947, 'Music, Drama', 'Luis Buñuel, Jack Draper, Moises M. Delgado', null, 'Jorge Negrete, Libertad Lamarque, Meche Barba, Agustín Isunza, Julio Villarreal, José Baviera, Alfonso Bedoya, Francisco Jambrina', null, 'After the mysterious disappearance of an oil well owner, one of his workers, Gerardo assumes the business management. Soon, the owner''s sister arrives from Argentina, and, believing that Gerardo killed her brother to keep the wells for himself, she starts working as a singer under a false name in the same casino her brother disappeared, in order to find out what exactly happened.', 'After the mysterious disappearance of an oil well owner, one of his workers, Gerardo assumes the business management. Soon, the owner''s sister arrives from Argentina, and, believing that Gerardo killed her brother to keep the wells for himself, she starts working as a singer under a false name in the same casino her brother disappeared, in order to find out what exactly happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZRKncWwHGlGl8loCdKjeU8VAw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48484'),
  ('310529779829501589', 'Gran Hotel', 1944, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Américo Fernández, Howard E. Randall', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Jacqueline Dalya, Luis G. Barreiro, Fernando Soto, Vicente Padula, Conchita Gentil Arcos, Rafael Icardo, Luz María Núñez', null, 'Cantinflas is a vagrant being evicted for not paying rent, after wandering gets a job at the ''Grand Hotel'' through a friend, that''s confused by Count Zapatini, who is undercover in the hotel, stealing a gem making this funny movie more complicated.', 'Cantinflas is a vagrant being evicted for not paying rent, after wandering gets a job at the ''Grand Hotel'' through a friend, that''s confused by Count Zapatini, who is undercover in the hotel, stealing a gem making this funny movie more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voU0hRrH7ILy6VYZ9cDe0sEK3WK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41296'),
