  ('811837678535612472', 'Gran Turismo', 2023, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Neill Blomkamp, Jacques Jouffret, Justin O''Neal Miller', 'Jason Hall, Zach Baylin', 'Archie Madekwe, David Harbour, Orlando Bloom, Djimon Hounsou, Darren Barnet, Maeve Courtier-Lilley, Geri Halliwell-Horner, Daniel Puig', 'PG-13', 'The ultimate wish-fulfillment tale of a teenage Gran Turismo player whose gaming skills won him a series of Nissan competitions to become an actual professional racecar driver.', 'The ultimate wish-fulfillment tale of a teenage Gran Turismo player whose gaming skills won him a series of Nissan competitions to become an actual professional racecar driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51tqzRtKMMZEYUpSYkrUE7v9ehm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980489'),
  ('375721422062361753', 'Grand Blue', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Shinya Nagano', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Manabu Uda', 'Ryo Ryusei, Atsuhiro Inukai, Yuki Yoda, Aya Asahina, Yuka Ogura, Ren Ishikawa, Masahiro Takashima, Ririka', null, 'Iori’s only dream is to go to college on a remote island—but when he gets roped into the school’s debaucherous, alcohol-indulgent diving club his hope for a sparkling campus life is thrown into chaos.', 'Iori’s only dream is to go to college on a remote island—but when he gets roped into the school’s debaucherous, alcohol-indulgent diving club his hope for a sparkling campus life is thrown into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZGnDnstcdorT0zJRpWzSQlMNz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677602'),
  ('32448726210855439', 'Grand Canyon', 1958, 'Documentary', 'James Algar, Ernst A. Heiniger', null, null, null, 'Grand Canyon is a 1958 American short documentary film directed by James Algar and produced by Walt Disney Productions. It is a pictorial interpretation of Ferde Grofé''s Grand Canyon Suite. Grand Canyon is one of Walt Disney''s more unconventional and experimental works, as it has musical accompaniment, but no dialogue or narration. The short won an Oscar at the 31st Academy Awards in 1959 for Best Short Subject (Live Action).', 'Grand Canyon is a 1958 American short documentary film directed by James Algar and produced by Walt Disney Productions. It is a pictorial interpretation of Ferde Grofé''s Grand Canyon Suite. Grand Canyon is one of Walt Disney''s more unconventional and experimental works, as it has musical accompaniment, but no dialogue or narration. The short won an Oscar at the 31st Academy Awards in 1959 for Best Short Subject (Live Action).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8Umb0ON8O9edbbtN9IMWtj4awu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47384'),
  ('334535706700589430', 'Grand Canyon', 1991, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Owen Roizman', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Meg Kasdan', 'Danny Glover, Kevin Kline, Steve Martin, Mary McDonnell, Mary-Louise Parker, Alfre Woodard, Jeremy Sisto, Tina Lifford', 'R', 'Grand Canyon revolved around six residents from different backgrounds whose lives intertwine in modern-day Los Angeles. At the center of the film is the unlikely friendship of two men from different races and classes brought together when one finds himself in jeopardy in the other''s rough neighborhood.', 'Grand Canyon revolved around six residents from different backgrounds whose lives intertwine in modern-day Los Angeles. At the center of the film is the unlikely friendship of two men from different races and classes brought together when one finds himself in jeopardy in the other''s rough neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpqLukoUXAXkyMZ0jPSuAbWf5Nx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13697'),
  ('860852725211207583', 'Grand Canyonscope', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Clarence Nash, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'Come along with Donald Duck as he visits one of nature''s masterpieces. After a little ragtime rain dance, Donald strikes up a conversation with himself at Echo Cliff, then teeters along the edge of a precarious trail while riding a sure-footed burrow. It''s a tough job for park ranger J. Audubon Woodlore to keep Donald in check, but it gets even tougher when they run afoul of a napping mountain lion.', 'Come along with Donald Duck as he visits one of nature''s masterpieces. After a little ragtime rain dance, Donald strikes up a conversation with himself at Echo Cliff, then teeters along the edge of a precarious trail while riding a sure-footed burrow. It''s a tough job for park ranger J. Audubon Woodlore to keep Donald in check, but it gets even tougher when they run afoul of a napping mountain lion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z102kZSu4hBsPkgndHhwkN2ifwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61447'),
  ('1066432402552518850', 'Grand Central', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Georges Lechaptois', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Gaëlle Macé', 'Léa Seydoux, Tahar Rahim, Olivier Gourmet, Denis Ménochet, Johan Libéreau, Nozha Khouadra, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Camille Lellouche', null, 'A young unemployed man finds work at a nuclear power plant and begins an illicit affair with the fiancée of one of his senior workmates.', 'A young unemployed man finds work at a nuclear power plant and begins an illicit affair with the fiancée of one of his senior workmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qH0LA0KJNr6f98agFNxJ8OvrY7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186991'),
  ('75830211738926087', 'Grand Central Murder', 1942, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy', 'George J. Folsey, S. Sylvan Simon, Hayes Goetz', 'Peter Ruric', 'Van Heflin, Patricia Dane, Cecilia Parker, Virginia Grey, Samuel S. Hinds, Sam Levene, Connie Gilchrist, Mark Daniels', 'NR', 'Conniving Broadway starlet Mida King has plenty of enemies, so when she''s found murdered at Grand Central Station, Inspector Gunther calls together a slew of suspects for questioning. Mida''s shady ex-flame, Turk, seems the most likely culprit, but when smart-mouthed private eye Rocky Custer -- also a suspect himself -- begins to piece together the crime, a few clues that Gunther has overlooked come to light.', 'Conniving Broadway starlet Mida King has plenty of enemies, so when she''s found murdered at Grand Central Station, Inspector Gunther calls together a slew of suspects for questioning. Mida''s shady ex-flame, Turk, seems the most likely culprit, but when smart-mouthed private eye Rocky Custer -- also a suspect himself -- begins to piece together the crime, a few clues that Gunther has overlooked come to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGQLo19scnQAkb0XAV0aCoGUwuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65546'),
  ('59238178824128782', 'Grand Expectations', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sylvain Desclous, Julien Hirsch, Nicolas Saubost', 'Pierre Erwan Guillaume, Sylvain Desclous, Olivier Lorelle', 'Rebecca Marder, Benjamin Lavernhe, Emmanuelle Bercot, Marc Barbé, Pascal Elso, Thomas Thévenoud, Cédric Appietto, Jean-Emmanuel Pagni', null, 'Summer 2019. Just graduated from Sciences Po, Madeleine leaves to prepare the orals of the ENA in Corsica with Antoine, her lover with whom she shares very left-wing political convictions. On a small deserted road, an unexpected encounter will seal their fate.', 'Summer 2019. Just graduated from Sciences Po, Madeleine leaves to prepare the orals of the ENA in Corsica with Antoine, her lover with whom she shares very left-wing political convictions. On a small deserted road, an unexpected encounter will seal their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DVeyl9SwZMuZf09bdJaRqYDsWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977349'),
  ('141723585041341848', 'Grand Froid', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gérard Pautonnier, Philippe Guilbert', 'Joël Egloff, Gérard Pautonnier', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Arthur Dupont, Olivier Gourmet, Stéphane Bissot, Féodor Atkine, Marie Berto, Philippe Duquesne, Sam Karmann', null, 'In a small town lost in the middle of nowhere, Edmond Zweck''s funeral business is on the wing. The company now has only two employees: Georges, Zweck''s right-hand man, and Eddy, a young man still a novice in the trade. One fine morning, however, a dead man pointed his nose. Hope is born again. Georges and Eddy are responsible for leading the deceased to his last abode. But in search of the cemetery that can not be found, the funeral convoy goes astray and the journey turns into a fiasco.', 'In a small town lost in the middle of nowhere, Edmond Zweck''s funeral business is on the wing. The company now has only two employees: Georges, Zweck''s right-hand man, and Eddy, a young man still a novice in the trade. One fine morning, however, a dead man pointed his nose. Hope is born again. Georges and Eddy are responsible for leading the deceased to his last abode. But in search of the cemetery that can not be found, the funeral convoy goes astray and the journey turns into a fiasco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTHXSrpz9HzAScM8OcfGlYhFiJ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438790'),
  ('65312619497651418', 'Grand Guignol', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean Marbœuf, Gérard Simon', 'Jean Marbœuf', 'Caroline Cellier, Marie Dubois, Jean-Claude Brialy, Guy Marchand, Michel Galabru', null, 'Sarah, the wife of a theater director, decides to leave her mutt of a husband because she is tired of his morbid fantasies. It is true that Baptiste has a rather unstable troupe that rehearses horror plays in a dance hall. Sarah comes out of the wings for life, but it turns out to be as incongruous and phantasmagorical as her husband''s plays. This is why she returns to him. "The real grand guignol is life. The other is the farce."', 'Sarah, the wife of a theater director, decides to leave her mutt of a husband because she is tired of his morbid fantasies. It is true that Baptiste has a rather unstable troupe that rehearses horror plays in a dance hall. Sarah comes out of the wings for life, but it turns out to be as incongruous and phantasmagorical as her husband''s plays. This is why she returns to him. "The real grand guignol is life. The other is the farce."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGaCy9VCtW8f6RjAdBNEjRvIoq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64421'),
  ('927065922489847721', 'Grand Hotel', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edmund Goulding, Charles Dorian, Douglas Shearer', 'Béla Balázs, Edgar Allan Woolf', 'Greta Garbo, John Barrymore, Joan Crawford, Wallace Beery, Lionel Barrymore, Lewis Stone, Jean Hersholt, Robert McWade', null, 'Guests at a posh Berlin hotel struggle through worry, scandal, and heartache.', 'Guests at a posh Berlin hotel struggle through worry, scandal, and heartache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2j7dxqIlGHdTaaUW9s4Z5zfp9qS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33680'),
  ('985881042880549336', 'Grand Hotel', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Waldemar Szmidt, Sławomir Kryński', 'Sławomir Kryński', 'Katarzyna Figura, Jan Frycz, Jacek Borusiński, Tomasz Kot, Małgorzata Buczkowska, Sławomir Orzechowski, Michał Bajor, Jerzy Schejbal', null, 'Handsome, wealthy neurosurgeon Philip Morawski decides to spend the weekend with a sinful young nurse, Dominica. Unfortunately, these romantic plans could upset his doctor wife, who is also staying at the same hotel on business. But for a man who works daily with a scalpel in his hand, there are no insurmountable obstacles.', 'Handsome, wealthy neurosurgeon Philip Morawski decides to spend the weekend with a sinful young nurse, Dominica. Unfortunately, these romantic plans could upset his doctor wife, who is also staying at the same hotel on business. But for a man who works daily with a scalpel in his hand, there are no insurmountable obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCjj1NG4icnJ30TPVXxsgjppbFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68793'),
  ('117733791893606297', 'Grand Hotel Excelsior', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Pipolo, Castellano, Danilo Desideri', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Adriano Celentano, Enrico Montesano, Diego Abatantuono, Carlo Verdone, Eleonora Giorgi, Aldina Martano, Isabella Amadeo, Franco Diogene', null, 'Taddeus is the manager of the Grand Hotel Excelsior. The Summer season begins in May and since then many odd persons frequent the hotel. There is Ilde Vivaldi, in love with Taddeus and the boxer Pericle Coccia who has an important match and falls in love with Maria. There is the Mago di Segrate trying to win world fame by levitating thirty meters high. And there is the waiter Egisto whose daughter is in a Swiss College believing her father is a man of importance.', 'Taddeus is the manager of the Grand Hotel Excelsior. The Summer season begins in May and since then many odd persons frequent the hotel. There is Ilde Vivaldi, in love with Taddeus and the boxer Pericle Coccia who has an important match and falls in love with Maria. There is the Mago di Segrate trying to win world fame by levitating thirty meters high. And there is the waiter Egisto whose daughter is in a Swiss College believing her father is a man of importance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PEoY5oquthqwZdOrt2996ETast.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38271'),
  ('1010979000309263629', 'Grand Isle', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Eric Moynier, Stephen S. Campanelli, Lisa Mall', 'Rich Ronat, Iver William Jallah', 'Nicolas Cage, KaDee Strickland, Luke Benward, Kelsey Grammer, Zulay Henao, Emily Marie Palmer, Oliver Trevena, Beatrice Hernandez', null, 'Walter and his neglected wife lure a young man into their Victorian home to escape a hurricane. When the man is charged with murder by Det. Jones, he must reveal the couple''s wicked secrets to save himself.', 'Walter and his neglected wife lure a young man into their Victorian home to escape a hurricane. When the man is charged with murder by Det. Jones, he must reveal the couple''s wicked secrets to save himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mcXb3km7hZ8aJKpxxgnvvxt9gW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560192'),
  ('361757402518139085', 'Grand Jete', 2022, 'Drama', 'Isabelle Stever, Constantin Campean', 'Anna Melikova', 'Sarah Grether, Emil von Schönfels, Susanne Bredehöft, Stefan Rudolf, Ellen Müller, Maya Kornev, Jule Böwe, Eva Medusa Gühne', 'NR', 'Dance teacher and mother Nadja left her son Mario with her own mother when he was little. Now she has reappeared on his doorstep, seeking a closeness that knows fewer and fewer boundaries. An uncompromising film about family relationships.', 'Dance teacher and mother Nadja left her son Mario with her own mother when he was little. Now she has reappeared on his doorstep, seeking a closeness that knows fewer and fewer boundaries. An uncompromising film about family relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awpPWrE5kqIURHotysiR2yBg9Ty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928358'),
  ('980219204730141466', 'Grand Masti', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Indra Kumar, Rituraj Narain', 'Milap Zaveri, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Riteish Deshmukh, Vivek Oberoi, Aftab Shivdasani, Suresh Menon, Karishma Tanna, Manjari Fadnnis, Bruna Abdullah, Maryam Zakaria', null, 'Meet, Prem, and Amar look to have a blast at their college reunion, though they soon find themselves in another predicament.', 'Meet, Prem, and Amar look to have a blast at their college reunion, though they soon find themselves in another predicament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DtPtMWZqotqvBlMwHlTxXc6xPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220714'),
  ('836486029903557727', 'Grand Paris', 2023, 'Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Martin Jauvat, Vincent Peugnet, Romy Engels', 'Martin Jauvat', 'Mahamadou Sangaré, Martin Jauvat, Sébastien Chassagne, William Lebghil, Garance Kim, Anaïde Rozam, Marguerite Thiam, Erwin Aureillan', null, 'Leslie, a young and idle suburbanite, drags his best friend Fox into a shady scheme across the Île-de-France. On a construction site for the future metro line of the Grand Paris, they discover a mysterious artefact. Another opportunity to make a little money. But along their journey, the Parisian suburbs become the scene of strange phenomena.', 'Leslie, a young and idle suburbanite, drags his best friend Fox into a shady scheme across the Île-de-France. On a construction site for the future metro line of the Grand Paris, they discover a mysterious artefact. Another opportunity to make a little money. But along their journey, the Parisian suburbs become the scene of strange phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIqs0UnlILWV7ODxwewN1XogDPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964831'),
  ('264481449883494053', 'Grand Piano', 2013, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Rodrigo Cortés, Eugenio Mira, Unax Mendia', 'Damien Chazelle', 'Elijah Wood, John Cusack, Tamsin Egerton, Allen Leech, Kerry Bishé, Alex Winter, Dee Wallace, Don McManus', 'R', 'Tom Selznick, the most talented pianist of his generation, stopped performing in public because of his stage fright. Years after a catastrophic performance, he reappears in public in a long awaited concert in Chicago. Just moments after starting his performance in the packed theater, in front of an expectant audience, Tom finds a threatening message written on the score: ''Play one wrong note and you die''. Without leaving the piano, Tom must discover the anonymous sniper''s motives and look for help without anyone realizing.', 'Tom Selznick, the most talented pianist of his generation, stopped performing in public because of his stage fright. Years after a catastrophic performance, he reappears in public in a long awaited concert in Chicago. Just moments after starting his performance in the packed theater, in front of an expectant audience, Tom finds a threatening message written on the score: ''Play one wrong note and you die''. Without leaving the piano, Tom must discover the anonymous sniper''s motives and look for help without anyone realizing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srDej4diwXriw1127ccpUfXRyeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220286'),
  ('425036150576137972', 'Grand Prix', 1966, 'Action, Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, Lionel Lindon, Sam Itzkovitch', 'John Frankenheimer', 'James Garner, Eva Marie Saint, Yves Montand, Toshirō Mifune, Brian Bedford, Jessica Walter, Antonio Sabàto, Françoise Hardy', 'NR', 'The most daring drivers in the world have gathered to compete for the 1966 Formula One championship. After a spectacular wreck in the first of a series of races, American wheelman Pete Aron is dropped by his sponsor. Refusing to quit, he joins a Japanese racing team. While juggling his career with a torrid love affair involving an ex-teammate''s wife, Pete must also contend with Jean-Pierre Sarti, a French contestant who has previously won two world titles.', 'The most daring drivers in the world have gathered to compete for the 1966 Formula One championship. After a spectacular wreck in the first of a series of races, American wheelman Pete Aron is dropped by his sponsor. Refusing to quit, he joins a Japanese racing team. While juggling his career with a torrid love affair involving an ex-teammate''s wife, Pete must also contend with Jean-Pierre Sarti, a French contestant who has previously won two world titles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEXrf09o8wVRFSptYFr6VcqLjPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20379'),
  ('477231053623420980', 'Grand Prix of Europe', 2025, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Waldemar Fast', 'Jeffrey Hylton, Kirstie Falkous, John T. Reynolds', 'Gemma Arterton, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Hayley Atwell, Lenny Henry, Rob Beckett, Colin McFarlane, David Menkin, Joseph Balderrama', 'PG', 'Edda, a young mouse and the daughter of fairground operator Erwin, dreams of becoming a race car driver. Ahead of the 50th anniversary of the European Grand Prix, Edda gets the opportunity to meet her idol, racing star Ed, and to help her father save his failing business. But to do so, she''ll have to get behind the wheel herself.', 'Edda, a young mouse and the daughter of fairground operator Erwin, dreams of becoming a race car driver. Ahead of the 50th anniversary of the European Grand Prix, Edda gets the opportunity to meet her idol, racing star Ed, and to help her father save his failing business. But to do so, she''ll have to get behind the wheel herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGGEqRaHAJ1pKJBj35WVxDyQBNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1316147'),
  ('221091768907173778', 'Grand Slam', 1967, 'Crime', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Antonio Macasoli, Carlos Couto', 'Mino Roli, Augusto Caminito, Marcello Coscia', 'Janet Leigh, Robert Hoffmann, Klaus Kinski, Riccardo Cucciolla, George Rigaud, Adolfo Celi, Edward G. Robinson, Jussara', null, 'Professor James Anders is a seemingly mild-mannered teacher, an American working in Rio De Janeiro. Anders, bored with years of teaching, decides to put together a team to pull off a diamond heist during the Rio Carnival. Four international experts are brought together to carry out the robbery: a safe cracking expert, a master thief, a mechanical genius, and a playboy.', 'Professor James Anders is a seemingly mild-mannered teacher, an American working in Rio De Janeiro. Anders, bored with years of teaching, decides to put together a team to pull off a diamond heist during the Rio Carnival. Four international experts are brought together to carry out the robbery: a safe cracking expert, a master thief, a mechanical genius, and a playboy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o99F6fqGihBrfPS9CW6xDas34vI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76851'),
  ('407092758515173730', 'Grand Slam Opera', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont, Gus Peterson, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Charles Lamont', 'Buster Keaton, Diana Lewis, Harold Goodwin, John Ince, Melrose Coakley, Bud Jamison', null, 'Elmer Butts is a contestant in a radio amateur hour show hoping to win the first price -- by dancing and juggling!', 'Elmer Butts is a contestant in a radio amateur hour show hoping to win the first price -- by dancing and juggling!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtg2r8qOkWifB5QcpJtBDKHlNUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51377'),
  ('357985719218021263', 'Grand Theft Auto', 1977, 'Comedy, Action, Crime, Adventure, Romance, Thriller', 'Ron Howard, Cal Naylor, Allan Arkush', 'Rance Howard, Ron Howard', 'Ron Howard, Nancy Morgan, Elizabeth Rogers, Barry Cahill, Rance Howard, Paul Linke, Marion Ross, Don Steele', 'PG', 'A rich girl steals her dad''s Rolls Royce and heads off to Las Vegas to get married. However, her angry parents, a jealous suitor, and a bunch of reward seekers are determined to stop her.', 'A rich girl steals her dad''s Rolls Royce and heads off to Las Vegas to get married. However, her angry parents, a jealous suitor, and a bunch of reward seekers are determined to stop her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EiL5frCBC9BQV9LHau4bAzgMOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19731'),
  ('796586336633871174', 'Grand Theft Hamlet', 2024, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Pinny Grylls, Sam Crane, Mark Oosterveen', 'Pinny Grylls, Sam Crane', 'Sam Crane, Pinny Grylls, Jen Cohn, Tilly Steele, Dipo Ola, Mark Oosterveen, Gareth Turkington, Lizzie Wofford', 'R', 'Two unemployed friends have a fresh idea: they want to stage Shakespeare''s ''Hamlet'' in Grand Theft Auto. But even in a virtual world, reality intrudes in a wild and trippy film shot entirely inside the ultra-violent video game.', 'Two unemployed friends have a fresh idea: they want to stage Shakespeare''s ''Hamlet'' in Grand Theft Auto. But even in a virtual world, reality intrudes in a wild and trippy film shot entirely inside the ultra-violent video game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61pws82KZEssg883HG3kwN16cRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1234397'),
  ('954826994275034460', 'Grand Theft Parsons', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'David Caffrey, Alexa Sheehan, Robert Hayes', 'Jeremy Drysdale', 'Johnny Knoxville, Christina Applegate, Gabriel Macht, Marley Shelton, Robert Forster, Michael Shannon, Mary Pat Gleason, Wesley Mann', 'PG-13', 'There are times when it''s right and proper to simply bury the dead. This is not one of those times... Gram Parsons was one of the most influential musicians of his time; a bitter, brilliant, genius who knew Elvis, tripped with the Stones and fatally overdosed on morphine and tequila in 1973. And from his dying came a story. A story from deep within folklore; a story of friendship, honour and adventure; a story so extraordinary that if it didn''t really happen, no one would believe it. Two men, a hearse, a dead rock star, five gallons of petrol, and a promise. And the most extraordinary chase of modern times.', 'There are times when it''s right and proper to simply bury the dead. This is not one of those times... Gram Parsons was one of the most influential musicians of his time; a bitter, brilliant, genius who knew Elvis, tripped with the Stones and fatally overdosed on morphine and tequila in 1973. And from his dying came a story. A story from deep within folklore; a story of friendship, honour and adventure; a story so extraordinary that if it didn''t really happen, no one would believe it. Two men, a hearse, a dead rock star, five gallons of petrol, and a promise. And the most extraordinary chase of modern times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sWWj5tlTDyAi2yiEjQZUmJCoKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16433'),
  ('314365065900123717', 'Grand Tour', 2024, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Rui Poças, Miguel Gomes, Catarina Alves', 'Telmo Churro, Maureen Fazendeiro, Mariana Ricardo', 'Gonçalo Waddington, Crista Alfaiate, Cláudio da Silva, Lang Khê Tran, Jorge Andrade, João Pedro Vaz, João Pedro Bénard, Teresa Madruga', null, 'In 1917 Burma (now Myanmar), a British diplomat is set to marry his fiancée, but after a sudden panic, escapes to Singapore, sending her on what evolves into a chase across Asia.', 'In 1917 Burma (now Myanmar), a British diplomat is set to marry his fiancée, but after a sudden panic, escapes to Singapore, sending her on what evolves into a chase across Asia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dc21nMtakPqF5BvWozaaOWpmDR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1098709'),
  ('621021648324241438', 'Grande école', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Salis, Emmanuel Soyer', null, 'Grégori Baquet, Jocelyn Quivrin, Alice Taglioni, Arthur Jugnot, Salim Kéchiouche, Éva Darlan, Élodie Navarre, Yasmine Belmadi', null, 'Paul and Agnes have been going out for quite a while and Agnes is shocked to learn that he''d rather live with two roommates on campus than move in with her. As soon as he meets one of his roommates, Louis-Anault, Paul''s behavior changes - he is attracted to Louis without realizing so himself. Agnes, on the other hand, gets quite jealous and offers a bet: Whoever gets to have Louis-Anault first, wins... If she does, Paul will no longer explore his homosexual desires, if he does - she''ll walk away. Meanwhile, Paul meets Mecir, a young Arab worker, who shows him there''s more to life than elite colleges...', 'Paul and Agnes have been going out for quite a while and Agnes is shocked to learn that he''d rather live with two roommates on campus than move in with her. As soon as he meets one of his roommates, Louis-Anault, Paul''s behavior changes - he is attracted to Louis without realizing so himself. Agnes, on the other hand, gets quite jealous and offers a bet: Whoever gets to have Louis-Anault first, wins... If she does, Paul will no longer explore his homosexual desires, if he does - she''ll walk away. Meanwhile, Paul meets Mecir, a young Arab worker, who shows him there''s more to life than elite colleges...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etGBmCDIfXWSFrb4wplSsOxAfSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4676'),
  ('1090390257376538112', 'Grande Maison Paris', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ayuko Tsukahara, Naoki Sakakibara', 'Tsutomu Kuroiwa', 'Takuya Kimura, Kyoka Suzuki, Ok Taec-yeon, Masakado Yoshinori, Patrick Descamps, Yannick Renier, Victor Pontecorvo, Yuta Tamamori', null, 'Famous Japanese chef Obana opens a new restaurant in Paris in the quest for his elusive third Michelin star. But Obana finds life as an outsider in Paris difficult, and even has trouble sourcing ingredients. His ambition causes tension with his team, including pâtissier Yuan, and sous chef Rinko. When his menu for a gala proves a disaster, Obana promises his former mentor that if he doesn''t get three stars, he will leave Paris. Can he pull it off?', 'Famous Japanese chef Obana opens a new restaurant in Paris in the quest for his elusive third Michelin star. But Obana finds life as an outsider in Paris difficult, and even has trouble sourcing ingredients. His ambition causes tension with his team, including pâtissier Yuan, and sous chef Rinko. When his menu for a gala proves a disaster, Obana promises his former mentor that if he doesn''t get three stars, he will leave Paris. Can he pull it off?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7ohquT4wyXPW7mNXgmQqQIBt51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306061'),
  ('142097251938687041', 'Grande, grosso e... Verdone', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Verdone, Danilo Desideri', 'Piero De Bernardi, Pasquale Plastino, Carlo Verdone', 'Carlo Verdone, Claudia Gerini, Geppi Cucciari, Eva Riccobono, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Andrea Miglio Risi, Martina Pinto, Clizia Fornasier', null, 'A comic movie divided in three episodes.', 'A comic movie divided in three episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1uFyN8W9xvC2BcGNZRGc545ZeD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20414'),
  ('416739900514142062', 'Grandfathers', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Santiago Requejo', 'Santiago Requejo, Javier Lorenzo', 'Carlos Iglesias, Ramón Barea, Roberto Álvarez, Mercedes Sampietro, Ana Fernández, Clara Alonso, Raúl Fernández de Pablo, Eva Santolaria', null, 'In a globalized world where youth and technology reign supreme, three aged friends refuse to give up and dare to launch a business from scratch: a daycare center. But is modern society ready enough to embrace their venture?', 'In a globalized world where youth and technology reign supreme, three aged friends refuse to give up and dare to launch a business from scratch: a daycare center. But is modern society ready enough to embrace their venture?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tv4ph71K8N8LjFnKlIVyk8AELzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631883'),
  ('828700263369354974', 'Grandma', 1979, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Héctor Olivera, Víctor Hugo Caula, Hugo Lescano', 'Roberto Cossa, Héctor Olivera', 'Pepe Soriano, Juan Carlos Altavista, Graciela Alfano, Osvaldo Terranova, Eva Franco, Guillermo Battaglia, Nya Quesada, Nelly Tesolín', null, 'The story about a family that must maintain an insatiable grandmother.', 'The story about a family that must maintain an insatiable grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sxVZhbda3u7sTDdPiiIjKfvMxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118195'),
  ('920008462521823060', 'Grandma', 2004, 'Drama', 'Lidiya Bobrova, Maksim Belovolov, Valery Revich', 'Lidiya Bobrova', 'Nina Shubina, Olga Onishchenko, Anna Ovsyannikova, Vladimir Kulakow, Sergey Anufriev, Yuriy Ovsyanko, Valentina Cherkozyanova, Mariya Lobachyova', null, 'An old Russian grandmother or "babushka", who took part in the Battle of Stalingrad, sacrificed everything for her children and even sold her house to get money for her grandchildren, is shuttled among those very grandchildren--products of the "new" Russia--none of whom want her to stay with them since she''s too much of a "burden" for them.', 'An old Russian grandmother or "babushka", who took part in the Battle of Stalingrad, sacrificed everything for her children and even sold her house to get money for her grandchildren, is shuttled among those very grandchildren--products of the "new" Russia--none of whom want her to stay with them since she''s too much of a "burden" for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXGxWs2SauIF2SLgw6DJGUoxL1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199283'),
  ('494845127603142168', 'Grandma', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Weitz, Tobias Datum', 'Paul Weitz', 'Lily Tomlin, Julia Garner, Marcia Gay Harden, Judy Greer, Laverne Cox, Elizabeth Peña, Sarah Burns, Colleen Camp', 'R', 'Self-described misanthrope Elle Reid has her protective bubble burst when her 18-year-old granddaughter, Sage, shows up needing help. The two of them go on a day-long journey that causes Elle to come to terms with her past and Sage to confront her future.', 'Self-described misanthrope Elle Reid has her protective bubble burst when her 18-year-old granddaughter, Sage, shows up needing help. The two of them go on a day-long journey that causes Elle to come to terms with her past and Sage to confront her future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LW20TF4NfQgHj5rZs0d0cgxRjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309304'),
  ('239791138314531675', 'Grandma and Her Ghosts', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Wang Hsiao-Ti, Je-Yi An', 'HUANG Li-Ming', 'Wen Ying, Hsu Chieh-Hui, Helena Law Lan, Michael Huang, Lo Pei-an, Chen Yu-hsun, Wang Ming-tai, David Chao', null, 'A 5-year-old kid moves to stay with his grandma in a small town in Taiwan. Soon after, he discovers that not only is his grandma a food vendor, but she''s also good at catching spectres. One day, he accidentally releases the most ferocious ghost, who sets loose the others...', 'A 5-year-old kid moves to stay with his grandma in a small town in Taiwan. Soon after, he discovers that not only is his grandma a food vendor, but she''s also good at catching spectres. One day, he accidentally releases the most ferocious ghost, who sets loose the others...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhQrECJmUMpQEnlRcOJNb9hCrqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232468'),
  ('130149719661103793', 'Grandma Goes South', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Vinči Vogue Anžlovar', null, 'Majolka Šuklje, Vinči Vogue Anžlovar, Nataša Matjašec Rošker, Bojan Emeršič, Urška Božič, Igor Koršič, Aljoša Rebolj, Andrej Rozman', null, 'An 86 year old lady escapes from nursing home, picks up two musicians in the process and they all drive off south to a new life in a Mercedes convertible.', 'An 86 year old lady escapes from nursing home, picks up two musicians in the process and they all drive off south to a new life in a Mercedes convertible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycNbOQFDyi7n6dvuAkyawG1G5KV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150144'),
  ('597392224172414119', 'Grandma Got Run Over by a Reindeer', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman', 'Fred A. Rappoport, Jim Staahl, Jim Fisher', 'Susan Blu, Alex Doduk, Michele Lee, Elmo Shropshire, Cam Clarke, Jim Staahl, Kathleen Barr, Maggie O''Hara', 'G', 'When his beloved Grandma appears to be missing on Christmas Eve, young Jake Spankenheimer goes on the misadventure of a lifetime to try and prove that Santa Claus is indeed real. With his spirit, smarts and determination, Jake must outmaneuver his greedy and curvaceous Cousin Mel and the all-powerful businessman Austin Bucks to the disbelief of his doting parents, rebellious sister and goofy Grandpa. All the while, it is up to Jake to save Santa from his fretful fate in this colorful Christmas mystery.', 'When his beloved Grandma appears to be missing on Christmas Eve, young Jake Spankenheimer goes on the misadventure of a lifetime to try and prove that Santa Claus is indeed real. With his spirit, smarts and determination, Jake must outmaneuver his greedy and curvaceous Cousin Mel and the all-powerful businessman Austin Bucks to the disbelief of his doting parents, rebellious sister and goofy Grandpa. All the while, it is up to Jake to save Santa from his fretful fate in this colorful Christmas mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9g46hyB2tobGWaIeOJxNXlIUA39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51531'),
  ('402477824945736890', 'Grandma''s Boy', 1922, 'Comedy', 'Fred C. Newmeyer, Walter Lundin', 'H.M. Walker, Thomas J. Crizer', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, Anna Townsend, Charles Stevenson, Dick Sutherland, Noah Young', 'NR', 'A meek young man must find the courage within when a rogue tramp menaces his hometown.', 'A meek young man must find the courage within when a rogue tramp menaces his hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9St2NINbr0zVwcMqyPvTDAKKXUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22592'),
  ('681590988233951677', 'Grandma''s Boy', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Nicholaus Goossen, Mark Irwin, John Collins', 'Allen Covert, Nick Swardson, Barry Wernick', 'Allen Covert, Doris Roberts, Linda Cardellini, Joel David Moore, Shirley Knight, Shirley Jones, Nick Swardson, Jonah Hill', 'R', 'Even though he''s 35, Alex acts more like he''s 13, spending his days as the world''s oldest video game tester and his evenings developing the next big Xbox game. But when he gets kicked out of his apartment, he''s forced to move in with his grandmother.', 'Even though he''s 35, Alex acts more like he''s 13, spending his days as the world''s oldest video game tester and his evenings developing the next big Xbox game. But when he gets kicked out of his apartment, he''s forced to move in with his grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSRdHBtisU0zhks4OjKezI3jnt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9900'),
