  ('70855806794423193', 'Grandma''s Wedding', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Javier Colinas', 'Adriana Pelusi', 'Susana Alexander, Luis Ernesto Franco, Marimar Vega, Macaria, Tiaré Scanda, Rodrigo Murray, Luis Arrieta, Dino García', null, 'A dysfunctional family travels to Cuernavaca to celebrate their grandmother’s wedding.', 'A dysfunctional family travels to Cuernavaca to celebrate their grandmother’s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eA0QVLSymgfTgqAtB6AdWAU5t6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638605'),
  ('1076843387683060462', 'Grandmother''s House', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Rader, Perry Husman', 'Peter Jensen', 'Eric Foster, Kim Valentine, Len Lesser, Ida Lee, Brinke Stevens, Angela O''Neill, R.J. Walker, Nico Mastorakis', null, 'Recently orphaned teenagers David and Lynn are sent to California to live with their grandparents who they discover are harboring a terrifying secret.', 'Recently orphaned teenagers David and Lynn are sent to California to live with their grandparents who they discover are harboring a terrifying secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHSST0TCHUGEg00dVaKhyvhLuZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69158'),
  ('809848628967231742', 'Grandpa Walrus', 2018, 'Drama, Animation', 'Lucrèce Andreae', 'Lucrèce Andreae', 'Lucas Garance, Emilie Blon-Metzinger, Chann Aglat, Ilona Bachelier, Charles Albiol, Catherine Artigala', null, 'On the windy and cloudy beach, Granny is praying, Mum is shouting, the sisters don’t care, Lucas is alone. Grandpa was a weird guy, now he''s dead.', 'On the windy and cloudy beach, Granny is praying, Mum is shouting, the sisters don’t care, Lucas is alone. Grandpa was a weird guy, now he''s dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZstMh13djFGsuIEuuKmTYCAMYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457215'),
  ('772500118360834322', 'Grandview, U.S.A.', 1984, 'Drama', 'Randal Kleiser, Reynaldo Villalobos, Jane Jenkins', 'Ken Hixon', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, C. Thomas Howell, Patrick Swayze, Jennifer Jason Leigh, William Windom, Troy Donahue, Carole Cook, M. Emmet Walsh', 'R', 'Life in the small town of Grandview, Illinois is one that is just like any other city or town. Tim Pearson, soon to be graduating high school wants to go to Florida to study oceanography. He meets Michelle "Mike" Cody and is attracted to her. She runs the local Demolition Derby place. Ernie "Slam" Webster is one of the drivers in the derby whose wife is cheating on him and wants to later on be with Mike. Tim falls for Mike and a big love triangle is about to happen.', 'Life in the small town of Grandview, Illinois is one that is just like any other city or town. Tim Pearson, soon to be graduating high school wants to go to Florida to study oceanography. He meets Michelle "Mike" Cody and is attracted to her. She runs the local Demolition Derby place. Ernie "Slam" Webster is one of the drivers in the derby whose wife is cheating on him and wants to later on be with Mike. Tim falls for Mike and a big love triangle is about to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjwdW85VNLuNxAutlGRHtoY0srR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84116'),
  ('939577840081939888', 'Granit', 2021, 'Action, War', 'Denis Neimand', null, 'Aleksandr Baranovskiy, Oleg Chernov, Mark Gavrilov, Evgeny Dobryakov, Elvira Sinelnik, Sergey Garusov, Igor Filippov, Evgeny Terskikh', null, 'Mozambique requests from Russia is being helped in the fight against militants of the "Islamic State" and a special group led by a commander with the call sign Granit is coming to the country.', 'Mozambique requests from Russia is being helped in the fight against militants of the "Islamic State" and a special group led by a commander with the call sign Granit is coming to the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLJn4U2qlWIzlFP5SsyFJUDQjfs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:918692'),
  ('39763831611931946', 'Granite Spring', 2000, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nicola Porcu, Ignazio Frogheri', null, 'Chiara Loi, Alessandro Frogheri, Adriana Gaddari, Johnny Boi, Giandomenico Antonio Ledda, Emanuele Mureddu, Salvatore Deledda, Ignazio Sias', null, 'Fiancées Alberto and Vittoria lead a quiet life, despite Alberto''s good-for-nothing friends always dragging him into their petty thefts. The group falls under the spell of the mysterious Monsieur Le Blanc, a shady character who has just came into town, and offers them a fair amount of money and drugs to rob an armored truck. It''s a dangerous job and it''ll be Alberto who''ll pay the ultimate price. His father then enters the picture, determined to get revenge on Le Blanc and his associates.', 'Fiancées Alberto and Vittoria lead a quiet life, despite Alberto''s good-for-nothing friends always dragging him into their petty thefts. The group falls under the spell of the mysterious Monsieur Le Blanc, a shady character who has just came into town, and offers them a fair amount of money and drugs to rob an armored truck. It''s a dangerous job and it''ll be Alberto who''ll pay the ultimate price. His father then enters the picture, determined to get revenge on Le Blanc and his associates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEvl272z4xPGKQYVK0LOjoi3rc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537605'),
  ('448237908175367004', 'Grannfejden', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ulf Malmros', 'Ulf Malmros', 'Kjell Bergqvist, Robert Gustafsson, Tuva Novotny, Ida Hallquist, Johanna Bohm Hermansson', null, 'Hanna moves home to the country and ends up in the middle of a neighborhood feud between the ex-prime minister Stefan Carlsson and the stubborn Harry Flodman, who are arguing about a smelly outhouse. As Harry''s live-in supporter, she is forced to choose a side; the power or the stubborn neighbor. The story is inspired by real events.', 'Hanna moves home to the country and ends up in the middle of a neighborhood feud between the ex-prime minister Stefan Carlsson and the stubborn Harry Flodman, who are arguing about a smelly outhouse. As Harry''s live-in supporter, she is forced to choose a side; the power or the stubborn neighbor. The story is inspired by real events.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fav5zcyeIi0UR5Dy5MTztJMQWnjZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:grannfejden-2026'),
  ('884539531329617219', 'Granny Nanny', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Andreas Berger, Wolfgang Groos', 'Robert Löhr', 'Maren Kroymann, Günther Maria Halmer, Maxime Diemer, Barbara Sukowa, Heiner Lauterbach, Serkan Kaya, Paula Kalenberg, Tim Oliver Schultz', null, 'Retirees Karin, Gerhard and Philippa are not in the mood for Nordic walking and seniors'' courses at the university. When Philippa, who is living life to the full as Leonie''s godmother, helps the two to unexpected grandparenthood, they suddenly have two "lively" god-grandchildren to look after, a huge bouncy castle standing in the garden and Lego bricks stuck to their feet.', 'Retirees Karin, Gerhard and Philippa are not in the mood for Nordic walking and seniors'' courses at the university. When Philippa, who is living life to the full as Leonie''s godmother, helps the two to unexpected grandparenthood, they suddenly have two "lively" god-grandchildren to look after, a huge bouncy castle standing in the garden and Lego bricks stuck to their feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tB1SfucvTWamNjsbyEdlaczrc2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649755'),
  ('145620822140839337', 'Granny O''Grimm''s Sleeping Beauty', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Nicky Phelan', 'Kathleen O''Rourke', 'Kathleen O''Rourke', null, 'Granny O''Grimm, a seemingly sweet old lady, loses the plot as she tells her version of Sleeping Beauty to her terrified granddaughter.', 'Granny O''Grimm, a seemingly sweet old lady, loses the plot as she tells her version of Sleeping Beauty to her terrified granddaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKI08TSmqLyQXbUkLizSmoZy9jo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57091'),
  ('17138138539787332', 'Granny''s Funeral', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Bruno Podalydès, Denis Podalydès', 'Valérie Lemercier, Denis Podalydès, Isabelle Candelier, Bruno Podalydès, Pierre Arditi, Benoît Hamon, Claire Denis, Catherine Hiegel', null, 'A provincial chemist in the throes of a mid-life crisis must choose between burying his dearly departed grandmother and cremating her in this quirky comedy of manners starring Valerie Lemercier, Denis Podalydes, and Isabelle Candelier.', 'A provincial chemist in the throes of a mid-life crisis must choose between burying his dearly departed grandmother and cremating her in this quirky comedy of manners starring Valerie Lemercier, Denis Podalydes, and Isabelle Candelier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1SqnHJJHNN6pODEs50m5IkEfkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123243'),
  ('1007267881988211840', 'Granny''s Got Talent', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Shin Han-sol', 'Shin Han-sol, Cho Samuel', 'Kim Soo-mi, Jeong Man-sik, Kim Jung-tae, Lee Tae-ran, Jung Ae-yeun, Jung Yi-rang, Lee Eun-mi, Ji Dae-han', null, 'A national cussing battle audition is the nation''s hype. People from all over the country audition in becoming the "Cussing King." However, redundant cussing auditioners cause viewership to drop dramatically. The producer decides to revive the show by introducing a regular looking grandmother...', 'A national cussing battle audition is the nation''s hype. People from all over the country audition in becoming the "Cussing King." However, redundant cussing auditioners cause viewership to drop dramatically. The producer decides to revive the show by introducing a regular looking grandmother...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roF65fCQKxQIvrtdDVeDFzwRtFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333713'),
  ('1016013153603117756', 'Granny''s Sexual Life', 2021, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Urška Djukić, Emilie Pigeard', 'Maria Bohr, Urška Djukić', 'Doroteja Nadrah, Jure Henigman, Mara Vilar, Božena Zabret, Bojana Ciglič', null, 'A trip into grandma''s intimate life shows the status of Slovenian women in the first half of the 20th century.', 'A trip into grandma''s intimate life shows the status of Slovenian women in the first half of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42GJn2yjupw9Imxuv6QsJdkObxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860727'),
