  ('295100105521731376', 'Grapes', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Tomáš Bařina, Martin Preiss', 'Tomáš Bařina, Rudolf Merkner', 'Kryštof Hádek, Tereza Ramba, Lukáš Langmajer, Lubomír Lipský, Václav Postránecký, Jiří Bábek, Tomáš Matonoha, Lucie Benešová', null, 'This unofficial Czech remake of Alexander Payne''s blockbuster seriocomedy Sideways (2004) concerns Jirka and Honza, two friends who check in as complete opposites on every level; Honza is a polished urbanite, Jirka a nickel-and-dime crook with a flair for wooing women. The men''s friendship is characterized by an unending series of wild schemes and escapades. When Honza learns of his grandfather''s impending death, it brings him face-to-face with his own mortality and encourages him to fulfill his long-held dream, while he still has the opportunity: to embark on a dream vacation to the vineyards of Morovia, with buddy Jirka in tow.', 'This unofficial Czech remake of Alexander Payne''s blockbuster seriocomedy Sideways (2004) concerns Jirka and Honza, two friends who check in as complete opposites on every level; Honza is a polished urbanite, Jirka a nickel-and-dime crook with a flair for wooing women. The men''s friendship is characterized by an unending series of wild schemes and escapades. When Honza learns of his grandfather''s impending death, it brings him face-to-face with his own mortality and encourages him to fulfill his long-held dream, while he still has the opportunity: to embark on a dream vacation to the vineyards of Morovia, with buddy Jirka in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7ygTw1kNKIDBiDMKLAF725tbun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20779'),
  ('497546898250218431', 'Graphic Desires', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Andy Edwards, Vince Knight', 'Andy Edwards', 'David Wayman, Sian Altman, May Kelly, Ocean M Harris, Valis Volkova, Jack Edwards, Caidney Simone, Eva Ray', null, 'When reclusive Franklin cheats on his partner with a mysterious girl he meets on a dating app, it becomes the start of a deadly obsession.', 'When reclusive Franklin cheats on his partner with a mysterious girl he meets on a dating app, it becomes the start of a deadly obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BjLdTWRiHc1ISIZMFvToOmghOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976912'),
  ('1151946291188164377', 'Grappler Baki: The Ultimate Fighter', 1994, 'Animation, Action', 'Yuji Asada, Yoshihiko Umakoshi, Nobuhiro Kobayashi', 'Yoshihisa Araki', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Kaneto Shiozawa, Kazumi Tanaka, Koji Totani, Michio Nakao, Naoki Tatsuta, Sanae Takagi, Shozo Iizuka', null, 'His name is Baki Hanma. No one knows where he came from or where he learned his unique fighting style. When it comes to Karate, Baki Hanma is just plain GOOD. He can defeat an opponent with a single blow and he''s taking the Karate Championship by storm. In a prestigious match, he defeats competitor after competitor even though he''s totally unknown and barely even ranked. But now he''s in for the fight of his life and he may have just met his match. Anything goes and his opponent can rip his nerves out -- literally. If he wins, he''s the BEST. If he loses... he''s DEAD.', 'His name is Baki Hanma. No one knows where he came from or where he learned his unique fighting style. When it comes to Karate, Baki Hanma is just plain GOOD. He can defeat an opponent with a single blow and he''s taking the Karate Championship by storm. In a prestigious match, he defeats competitor after competitor even though he''s totally unknown and barely even ranked. But now he''s in for the fight of his life and he may have just met his match. Anything goes and his opponent can rip his nerves out -- literally. If he wins, he''s the BEST. If he loses... he''s DEAD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2vheIGpvG4qvUfXmKvJGy70FLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68449'),
  ('665355551395717625', 'Grass', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Ron Mann, Robert Fresco', 'Solomon Vesta', 'Woody Harrelson, Tommy Chong, Cheech Marin, John Lennon, Ronald Reagan, Jimmy Carter, Richard Nixon, Gerald Ford', null, 'Marijuana is the most controversial drug of the 20th Century. Smoked by generations to little discernible ill effect, it continues to be reviled by many governments on Earth. In this Genie Award-winning documentary veteran Canadian director Ron Mann and narrator Woody Harrelson mix humour and historical footage together to recount how the United States has demonized a relatively harmless drug.', 'Marijuana is the most controversial drug of the 20th Century. Smoked by generations to little discernible ill effect, it continues to be reviled by many governments on Earth. In this Genie Award-winning documentary veteran Canadian director Ron Mann and narrator Woody Harrelson mix humour and historical footage together to recount how the United States has demonized a relatively harmless drug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkWa0nrel8a1I5xDNHOX8S5q4zu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22010'),
  ('15561094085867719', 'Grass', 2018, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Kim Hyung-koo, Shin Seok-ho', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Kim Min-hee, Jung Jin-young, Ki Joo-bong, Seo Young-hwa, Kim Sae-byuk, Ahn Jae-hong, Gong Min-jeung, Shin Seok-ho', null, 'Ahreum sits in a small café, typing on her laptop. Around her, customers enact various dramas from their lives. Is she writing what she hears or is she hearing what''s been written?', 'Ahreum sits in a small café, typing on her laptop. Around her, customers enact various dramas from their lives. Is she writing what she hears or is she hearing what''s been written?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22fPEFs3fdJnJuMDBinHaOwnRFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499255'),
  ('824708786947638725', 'Grass Labyrinth', 1979, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Shūji Terayama, Shinji Sōmai, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Rio Kishida, Shūji Terayama', 'Hiroshi Mikami, Takeshi Wakamatsu, Keiko Niitaka, Jūzō Itami, Miho Fukuya, Ryoko Kinoyama, Akiko Suetsugu, Yoko Ran', null, 'Akira is haunted by a "bouncing ball" song that he remembers his mother singing when he was a small child, and now on the verge of a sexually active adulthood, he wants to find the origins of the song. The young man ostensibly wanders into a time-warp in which aspects from his childhood and adulthood mix together. In this never-never land he comes across a beautiful woman/witch who is lost inside the labyrinth of her mansion, just as the young man is lost in the labyrinth of time — and on some levels, perhaps the labyrinth of his subconscious.', 'Akira is haunted by a "bouncing ball" song that he remembers his mother singing when he was a small child, and now on the verge of a sexually active adulthood, he wants to find the origins of the song. The young man ostensibly wanders into a time-warp in which aspects from his childhood and adulthood mix together. In this never-never land he comes across a beautiful woman/witch who is lost inside the labyrinth of her mansion, just as the young man is lost in the labyrinth of time — and on some levels, perhaps the labyrinth of his subconscious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUz8lcCCirKXvD511FkUJ19ATGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49695'),
  ('482793508011625369', 'Grass: A Nation''s Battle for Life', 1925, 'Documentary', 'Merian C. Cooper, Ernest B. Schoedsack', null, 'Merian C. Cooper, Ernest B. Schoedsack, Marguerite Harrison, Haidar Khan, Lufta', null, 'A silent documentary which follows a branch of the Bakhtiari tribe of Persia as they and their herds make their epic seasonal journey to better pastures.', 'A silent documentary which follows a branch of the Bakhtiari tribe of Persia as they and their herds make their epic seasonal journey to better pastures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djZ2jwO0C0ZFq0rGSBACMjW3qF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115132'),
  ('890218976494500554', 'Grasshopper', 2015, 'Crime, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Tomoyuki Takimoto, Yoshitaka Sakamoto, Seitaro Kai', 'Kotaro Isaka, Takeshi Aoshima', 'Tadanobu Asano, Toma Ikuta, Ryosuke Yamada, Kumiko Aso, Nanao, Renji Ishibashi, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Jun Murakami', null, 'Movie contains the stories of three people: Suzuki (Toma Ikuta), Kujira (Tadanobu Asano) and Semi (Ryosuke Yamada). Suzuki is a former middle school teacher. His girlfriend was killed, which led him to quit his job and attempt to take revenge on her murderer. To do so, Suzuki has to infiltrate the underground world of criminals. Kujira is a contract killer for hire. He makes his targets fall into confusion and eventually commit suicide. Semi is a contract killer who uses the knife to take out his targets.', 'Movie contains the stories of three people: Suzuki (Toma Ikuta), Kujira (Tadanobu Asano) and Semi (Ryosuke Yamada). Suzuki is a former middle school teacher. His girlfriend was killed, which led him to quit his job and attempt to take revenge on her murderer. To do so, Suzuki has to infiltrate the underground world of criminals. Kujira is a contract killer for hire. He makes his targets fall into confusion and eventually commit suicide. Semi is a contract killer who uses the knife to take out his targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9YkeTwcSnep0ZvEA6U5KtqCzb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313219'),
  ('1008151311299101303', 'Grasshoppers', 1990, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Bruno Bozzetto', null, null, null, 'An animated short by Bruno Bozzetto which condenses the whole of human civilization into 9 minutes, focusing primarily on the human race''s predilection for warfare and the vanity of war. It was an Oscar Nominee for Best Animated Short in 1991. Each piece of history is presented as a simple vignette, usually depicting a few simply-drawn characters arguing and making war, over and over again. Generally, a single figure is meant to stand in for an entire group (i.e., a single Caesar-like caricature for the entire line of Roman Emperors). There is very little spoken dialogue; instead, most of the cartoon is accompanied by a bouncy piano-driven score, which frequently changes style to suit the particular historical era. However, the score is all based around a single simple theme, to which it frequently returns in between vignettes.', 'An animated short by Bruno Bozzetto which condenses the whole of human civilization into 9 minutes, focusing primarily on the human race''s predilection for warfare and the vanity of war. It was an Oscar Nominee for Best Animated Short in 1991. Each piece of history is presented as a simple vignette, usually depicting a few simply-drawn characters arguing and making war, over and over again. Generally, a single figure is meant to stand in for an entire group (i.e., a single Caesar-like caricature for the entire line of Roman Emperors). There is very little spoken dialogue; instead, most of the cartoon is accompanied by a bouncy piano-driven score, which frequently changes style to suit the particular historical era. However, the score is all based around a single simple theme, to which it frequently returns in between vignettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9X8JmtzrKT1JyWjaWY24jR2wsQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48611'),
  ('901409824829705654', 'Grave Decisions', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller, Stefan Biebl', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller, Christian Lerch', 'Markus Krojer, Fritz Karl, Jule Ronstedt, Jürgen Tonkel, Franz Xaver Brückner, Saskia Vester, Johann Schuler, Sepp Schauer', null, 'In this black comedy set in small-town Bavaria, 11-year-old Sebastian thinks you can never be too young to be a murderer. He''s convinced that he killed his mother on the day he was born and is certain he''s already been condemned to purgatory. Deciding he might be able to knock off a few years of his sentence by doing good deeds, Sebastian sets out to find a wife for his father Lorenz. When Lorenz and Sebastian''s schoolteacher Veronika fall madly in love with each other, it seems the heavens must be smiling. There''s just one hitch: Veronika is married.', 'In this black comedy set in small-town Bavaria, 11-year-old Sebastian thinks you can never be too young to be a murderer. He''s convinced that he killed his mother on the day he was born and is certain he''s already been condemned to purgatory. Deciding he might be able to knock off a few years of his sentence by doing good deeds, Sebastian sets out to find a wife for his father Lorenz. When Lorenz and Sebastian''s schoolteacher Veronika fall madly in love with each other, it seems the heavens must be smiling. There''s just one hitch: Veronika is married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y0DMk2QEbPJZcNnvBE34DlJoiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1697'),
  ('342060146741197970', 'Grave Encounters', 2011, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Tony Mirza, Emma Higgins, Stuart Ortiz', 'Stuart Ortiz, Colin Minihan', 'Sean Rogerson, Ashleigh Gryzko, Merwin Mondesir, Mackenzie Gray, Juan Riedinger, Arthur Corber, Luis Javier, Shawn Macdonald', null, 'A crew from a paranormal reality television show lock themselves in a haunted psychiatric hospital. They search for evidence of paranormal activity as they shoot what ends up becoming their final episode.', 'A crew from a paranormal reality television show lock themselves in a haunted psychiatric hospital. They search for evidence of paranormal activity as they shoot what ends up becoming their final episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vnsB3Rg9Gb91UOaecXRb7dYB37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50698'),
  ('716784566876341803', 'Grave Encounters 2', 2012, 'Horror', 'John Poliquin, Tony Mirza', 'Colin Minihan, Stuart Ortiz', 'Richard Harmon, Stephanie Bennett, Sean Rogerson, Dylan Playfair, Leanne Lapp, Howie Lai, Sean Tyson, Benjamin Wilkinson', 'R', 'Tortured by the ghosts of the demonized insane asylum that killed the crew of GRAVE ENCOUNTERS, film students fight to escape death as their own paranormal investigation goes terribly wrong in this horrifying sequel.', 'Tortured by the ghosts of the demonized insane asylum that killed the crew of GRAVE ENCOUNTERS, film students fight to escape death as their own paranormal investigation goes terribly wrong in this horrifying sequel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzq1JCjsk7buXVOA0mwRH7zbHOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134366'),
  ('267435724543000244', 'Grave Halloween', 2013, 'TV Movie, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Steven R. Monroe, Michael C. Blundell', 'Sheldon Wilson, Ryan W. Smith', 'Cassi Thomson, Graham Wardle, Kaitlyn Leeb, Jesse Wheeler, Tom Stevens, Dejan Loyola, Jeffrey Ballard, Hiro Kanagawa', 'R', 'After inadvertently unleashing an ancient curse, a documentary crew of American exchange students is haunted by angry spirits in Japan''s infamous Suicide Forest.', 'After inadvertently unleashing an ancient curse, a documentary crew of American exchange students is haunted by angry spirits in Japan''s infamous Suicide Forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SSr17CBHhh0gmno7rThPaDrcsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229839'),
  ('838641627775545074', 'Grave of the Fireflies', 2005, 'Drama', 'Tōya Satō', 'Yumiko Inoue', 'Hoshi Ishida, Mao Sasaki, Ikki Sawamura, Yui Natsukawa, Nanako Matsushima, Mao Inoue, Mayuko Fukuda, Jun Kaname', null, 'Hisako loses her home in Tokyo to Allied bombing. With her husband fighting somewhere in Asia, she and her two children evacuate to a suburb of Kobe, where they share a house with Hisako''s cousin, Kyoko. Kobe is bombed and Kyoko is killed. Hisako is forced to take care of Kyoko''s two children in addition to her own, but there is not enough food for everyone.', 'Hisako loses her home in Tokyo to Allied bombing. With her husband fighting somewhere in Asia, she and her two children evacuate to a suburb of Kobe, where they share a house with Hisako''s cousin, Kyoko. Kobe is bombed and Kyoko is killed. Hisako is forced to take care of Kyoko''s two children in addition to her own, but there is not enough food for everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/im6u58cPa9HlH5DqSnZGy0O37l5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76826'),
  ('1082257957964260855', 'Grave of the Vampire', 1972, 'Horror', 'John Hayes, Paul Hipp', 'David Chase', 'William Smith, Michael Pataki, Lyn Peters, Diane Holden, Lieux Dressler, Jay Adler, William Guhl, Carmen Argenziano', 'PG', 'Vampire Caleb Croft has awakened from his unholy slumber -- with an insatiable lust for blood and the pleasures of the flesh.', 'Vampire Caleb Croft has awakened from his unholy slumber -- with an insatiable lust for blood and the pleasures of the flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKd02zI8veroJtO2QjIn7FJijI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28160'),
  ('71774624595510481', 'Grave Robbers', 1989, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rubén Galindo Jr., Antonio de Anda', 'Carlos Valdemar', 'Fernando Almada, Edna Bolkan, Erika Buenfil, Ernesto Laguardia, María Rebeca, Toño Infante, Roberto Cañedo, Agustín Bernal', null, 'A group of teenage, treasure seeking, grave robbers accidentally uncover the tomb of a satanic sect leader from the early Spanish colonial age, reawakening the diabolical killer, who promptly sets out to complete his unholy mission of spawning the son of Satan.', 'A group of teenage, treasure seeking, grave robbers accidentally uncover the tomb of a satanic sect leader from the early Spanish colonial age, reawakening the diabolical killer, who promptly sets out to complete his unholy mission of spawning the son of Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30y3dlEaBDIcSqeRoSLa1qGLDnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139008'),
  ('93516159085549299', 'Grave Secrets', 1989, 'Horror', 'Jamie Thompson, Donald P. Borchers', 'Jeffrey Polman, Lenore Wright', 'Paul Le Mat, Renée Soutendijk, Lee Ving, Olivia Barash, David Warner, John Crawford, Bob Herron, Gilbert Lewis', 'R', 'A woman tormented by ghostly apparitions and a professor of psychic phenomena investigate other-worldly disturbances and unlock the secret of a malevolent force reaching out for vengeance from beyond the grave.', 'A woman tormented by ghostly apparitions and a professor of psychic phenomena investigate other-worldly disturbances and unlock the secret of a malevolent force reaching out for vengeance from beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYwMJnv9M2TIGDvN9EKdWPOQzPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124124'),
  ('815374199439128791', 'Grave Secrets: The Legacy of Hilltop Drive', 1992, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'John Patterson', null, 'Patty Duke, David Selby, Kiersten Warren, Blake Clark, Kimberly Cullum, David Soul, Kelly Rowan, Jonelle Allen', null, 'Jean and Shag Williams locate a newly built house and decide it''s perfect for them to buy. One thing the developers forgot to tell them about was that it is built on a graveyard. Within days toilets start to flush by themselves and the garage door moves up and down by its own accord. Will Jean and Shag realize that the place may be haunted by ghosts before it''s too late?', 'Jean and Shag Williams locate a newly built house and decide it''s perfect for them to buy. One thing the developers forgot to tell them about was that it is built on a graveyard. Within days toilets start to flush by themselves and the garage door moves up and down by its own accord. Will Jean and Shag realize that the place may be haunted by ghosts before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9F5m9AFXtpHOT7CvmdgKYAp6p3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70046'),
  ('464282216769757371', 'Graverobbers', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Straw Weisman, Anghel Decca', 'Straw Weisman', 'Elizabeth Mannino, David Gregory, Larry Bockius, Judith Mayes, Kevin Scullin, Kelvin Keraga, Kenneth Giek, Nevada Belle', 'NR', 'Cute waitress/hooker is romanced and wed to handsome stranger/funeral director. He, as well as most of the town prefer their women dead. She is the obvious candidate for that position, as his two previous wives were in terrible shape even for dead persons. She must be fleet of foot indeed to avoid their fate.', 'Cute waitress/hooker is romanced and wed to handsome stranger/funeral director. He, as well as most of the town prefer their women dead. She is the obvious candidate for that position, as his two previous wives were in terrible shape even for dead persons. She must be fleet of foot indeed to avoid their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHWff8bhvYvFdZzY8Kz08YXx6KM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100051'),
  ('1080499057846120396', 'Graveyard Disturbance', 1988, 'Horror, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Lamberto Bava, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Roy Bava', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Lamberto Bava', 'Gregory Lech Thaddeus, Lea Martino, Beatrice Ring, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Lino Salemme, Gianpaolo Saccarola, Lamberto Bava, Karl Zinny', null, 'Five teenage thieves are challenged by a local bartender to stay overnight in the supposedly haunted catacombs of a nearby cemetery, who promises them a rare treasure if they can make it through the night.', 'Five teenage thieves are challenged by a local bartender to stay overnight in the supposedly haunted catacombs of a nearby cemetery, who promises them a rare treasure if they can make it through the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Tu34GjrCCxlSXgHqDCYCWJWlfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25886'),
  ('1015375163542215797', 'Graveyard Horror', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Phontharis Chotkijsadarsopon, Sattawat Sethakorn, Songsak Mongkolthong', 'Songsak Mongkolthong, Adirek Phothong', 'Daycha Konarlo, Ruethaiphat Phatthananapaphangkorn, Alina M. Chang, Chalad Na Songkhla, Auttakorn Boonpeng, Poompat Iam-samang, Latthgarmon Pinrojnkeerathi, Khwanruedi Klomklom', null, 'Defy death in a graveyard where the djinn awaits, Escape death and flee from ghosts in a cemetery marked by violent deaths, Cheat death and bring your beloved back from the grave, A haunted doll leads the kids to the mysterious dead of the deaf kid in the graveyard.', 'Defy death in a graveyard where the djinn awaits, Escape death and flee from ghosts in a cemetery marked by violent deaths, Cheat death and bring your beloved back from the grave, A haunted doll leads the kids to the mysterious dead of the deaf kid in the graveyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGJJhkGnaWS9oG44Mj0c5tfT4jQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1444376'),
  ('730760183666081484', 'Graveyard of Honor', 1975, 'Crime, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Yutaka Kohira, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Fumio Kōnami, Hirō Matsuda, Tatsuhiko Kamoi', 'Tetsuya Watari, Tatsuo Umemiya, Yumi Takigawa, Eiji Gō, Noboru Andō, Reiko Ike, Kunie Tanaka, Hajime Hana', null, 'A self-destructive man becomes a powerful member of the yakuza but quickly loses his self-control. Based on the true story of Rikio Ishikawa.', 'A self-destructive man becomes a powerful member of the yakuza but quickly loses his self-control. Based on the true story of Rikio Ishikawa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akDVDztEBt2SZ1StpPWMDMbVlL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71851'),
  ('43357016206483551', 'Graveyard of Honor', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto, Bunmei Katô', 'Shigenori Takechi', 'Goro Kishitani, Narimi Arimori, Ryôsuke Miki, Yoshiyuki Daichi, Hirotaro Honda, Harumi Inoue, Renji Ishibashi, Shigeo Kobayashi', null, 'A barkeeper saves a Yakuza boss'' life and thus makes his way up in the organization. However, his fear of nothing soon causes problems.', 'A barkeeper saves a Yakuza boss'' life and thus makes his way up in the organization. However, his fear of nothing soon causes problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF25E1OUyISJ4fCwkpUdAG3shgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20646'),
  ('661525576359005292', 'Graveyard Shift', 1987, 'Horror', 'Robert Bergman, Jerry Ciccoritti', 'Jerry Ciccoritti', 'Michael A. Miranda, Helen Papas, Cliff Stoker, Dorin Ferber, Dan Rose, John Haslett Cuff, Don James, Michael Bockner', 'R', 'Night brings out the hunger in people, especially a mysterious NY cab driver. He is a powerful vampire. And working the night shift brings a sultry array of sensuous passengers within his grasp. Embracing those ready to die, he controls an erratic but well-balanced vampire realm. Then unexpectedly, he discovers erotic human passion-unleashing a raging, terrorizing evil. When a slew of innocent citizens are senselessly slaughtered, the baffled police must solve a 350 year old mystery of unsated passion.', 'Night brings out the hunger in people, especially a mysterious NY cab driver. He is a powerful vampire. And working the night shift brings a sultry array of sensuous passengers within his grasp. Embracing those ready to die, he controls an erratic but well-balanced vampire realm. Then unexpectedly, he discovers erotic human passion-unleashing a raging, terrorizing evil. When a slew of innocent citizens are senselessly slaughtered, the baffled police must solve a 350 year old mystery of unsated passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EaX1xIZjwvLBMz35BJaRdpvxgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173080'),
  ('970373516303325633', 'Graveyard Shift', 1990, 'Horror', 'Ralph S. Singleton, Mark Cotone, Gershon Ginsburg', 'John Esposito', 'David Andrews, Kelly Wolf, Stephen Macht, Andrew Divoff, Vic Polizos, Brad Dourif, Robert Alan Beuth, Ilona Margolis', 'R', 'John Hall is a drifter who wanders into a small town in Maine. He needs a job and decides to seek employment at the community''s top business: a large textile mill. He is hired to work the "graveyard shift" -- from around midnight to dawn -- and, along with a few others, he is charged with cleaning out the basement. This task strikes the workers as simple enough, but then, as they proceed deeper underground, they encounter an unspeakable monstrosity intent on devouring them all.', 'John Hall is a drifter who wanders into a small town in Maine. He needs a job and decides to seek employment at the community''s top business: a large textile mill. He is hired to work the "graveyard shift" -- from around midnight to dawn -- and, along with a few others, he is charged with cleaning out the basement. This task strikes the workers as simple enough, but then, as they proceed deeper underground, they encounter an unspeakable monstrosity intent on devouring them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vITvLxFsDbbg6TMgpYWWscMOf0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19158'),
  ('733170550087026122', 'Graveyard Shift', 2005, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Valeri Rozhnov, Roman Vasyanov, Nikita Semenov', 'Valeri Rozhnov', 'Pavel Barshak, Viktor Sukhorukov, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Vyacheslav Razbegaev, Andrey Krasko, Mariya Shalaeva, Andrey Merzlikin, Spartak Mishulin', null, 'A maniac terrorizes a town during rainy nights. And exactly on one rainy night a student has a night shift in a 24-hour shop. And exactly on this night the owner of the shop goes to play in a casino, his wife wants to be entertained, a detective is awaiting for a crime to be committed and certainly... the maniac begins hunting.', 'A maniac terrorizes a town during rainy nights. And exactly on one rainy night a student has a night shift in a 24-hour shop. And exactly on this night the owner of the shop goes to play in a casino, his wife wants to be entertained, a detective is awaiting for a crime to be committed and certainly... the maniac begins hunting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnZsVjmlN72dt9uQNiQgUUP3591.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218443'),
  ('37455813644204584', 'Gravity', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Maximilian Erlenwein, The Chau Ngo', 'Maximilian Erlenwein', 'Fabian Hinrichs, Jürgen Vogel, Nora Waldstätten, Jule Böwe, Jeroen Willems, Thorsten Merten, Eleonore Weisgerber, Olaf Burmeister', null, 'The story of a seemingly settled bank employee who breaks the shackles of his everyday life and becomes a wanderer between worlds. Frederik is an up-and-coming young bank employee who lives an ordinary life. When a bank customer, whom Frederik has denied a loan in the face of the bank crisis, shoots himself in front of Frederik, he snaps. Together with ex-con Vince,he begins to live out a new, dark side of himself. He robs his rich bank customers'' homes and gives the money to the needy. The initial rush of crossing social boundaries soon develops into an addiction to ever greater thrills.', 'The story of a seemingly settled bank employee who breaks the shackles of his everyday life and becomes a wanderer between worlds. Frederik is an up-and-coming young bank employee who lives an ordinary life. When a bank customer, whom Frederik has denied a loan in the face of the bank crisis, shoots himself in front of Frederik, he snaps. Together with ex-con Vince,he begins to live out a new, dark side of himself. He robs his rich bank customers'' homes and gives the money to the needy. The initial rush of crossing social boundaries soon develops into an addiction to ever greater thrills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyjS4KJFC7BFVkkRCVzTC8fogLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47610'),
  ('119309478704032500', 'Gravy', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Amanda Treyz', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Todd Harthan', 'Michael Weston, Jimmi Simpson, Sutton Foster, Lily Cole, Molly Ephraim, Paul Rodríguez, Lothaire Bluteau, Ethan Sandler', 'NR', 'It''s All Hallow''s Eve. A trio of costumed misfits with very special dietary requirements seizes a Mexican cantina and force the staff to engage in a late night of gaming, food and libations. The only caveat is what''s on the menu.', 'It''s All Hallow''s Eve. A trio of costumed misfits with very special dietary requirements seizes a Mexican cantina and force the staff to engage in a late night of gaming, food and libations. The only caveat is what''s on the menu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruskUcYFAy6ctl2ZlTsXqJ7kPCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262169'),
  ('789527147159533085', 'Gray Lady Down', 1978, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'David Greene, Mack Bing, Patrick A. Duffy', 'James Whittaker, Howard Sackler', 'Charlton Heston, David Carradine, Stacy Keach, Ned Beatty, Stephen McHattie, Ronny Cox, Dorian Harewood, Rosemary Forsyth', 'PG', 'The USS Neptune, a nuclear submarine, is sunk off the coast of Connecticut after a collision with a Norwegian cargo ship. The navy must attempt a potentially dangerous rescue in the hope of saving the lives of the crew.', 'The USS Neptune, a nuclear submarine, is sunk off the coast of Connecticut after a collision with a Norwegian cargo ship. The navy must attempt a potentially dangerous rescue in the hope of saving the lives of the crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1k0T9WvLZLyrZZpuhBjpc3uEJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31948'),
  ('655694396849493541', 'Gray Matter', 2023, 'Science Fiction', 'Meko Winbush, Andrew Jeric', 'Philip Gelatt', 'Mia Isaac, Jessica Frances Dukes, Garret Dillahunt, Andrew Liner, Isabella Ferreira, Ezri Walker, Kristian Ventura, Allison Ye', 'PG-13', 'All her life, Aurora has been taught by her mother that the superhuman abilities they possess, the abilities that make them unique, also make them dangerous. Now, on one fateful and deadly night, Aurora will find out if her mother was telling the truth and just what consequences the use of her powers might have.​', 'All her life, Aurora has been taught by her mother that the superhuman abilities they possess, the abilities that make them unique, also make them dangerous. Now, on one fateful and deadly night, Aurora will find out if her mother was telling the truth and just what consequences the use of her powers might have.​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJn1nO2UuS4Oo5Sk49YUHHRcGyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093796'),
  ('383309154879476173', 'Gray Matters', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sue Kramer, John S. Bartley', 'Sue Kramer', 'Heather Graham, Bridget Moynahan, Tom Cavanagh, Alan Cumming, Sissy Spacek, Molly Shannon, Rachel Shelley, Bill Mondy', 'PG-13', 'Sam and Gray are such a well-matched pair that it is difficult to believe they are brother and sister rather than husband and wife. They both share a love of 1940s movies and dancing, and when they meet Charlie, they have something else in common: They both fall in love with her. Sam must deal with unexpected feelings of jealousy, while Gray struggles to come to terms with her sexual orientation.', 'Sam and Gray are such a well-matched pair that it is difficult to believe they are brother and sister rather than husband and wife. They both share a love of 1940s movies and dancing, and when they meet Charlie, they have something else in common: They both fall in love with her. Sam must deal with unexpected feelings of jealousy, while Gray struggles to come to terms with her sexual orientation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dg5kX6v4xbGL0FtNyELGb7wDt9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14845'),
  ('795241277838482640', 'Gray''s Anatomy', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Documentary', 'Steven Soderbergh, Elliot Davis', 'Spalding Gray, Renée Shafransky', 'Spalding Gray, Mike McLaughlin, Melissa Robertson, Alvin Henry, Alyne Hargroder, Buddy Carr, Gerry Urso, Chris Simms', null, 'The film documents, in an often dramatic and humorous fashion, Gray''s investigations into alternative medicine for an eye condition (Macular pucker) he had developed.', 'The film documents, in an often dramatic and humorous fashion, Gray''s investigations into alternative medicine for an eye condition (Macular pucker) he had developed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oe7nbYwJj4gwk5oL0BiQMw7Eb0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32686'),
  ('791405727046311582', 'Grayeagle', 1977, 'Action, Western', 'Charles B. Pierce, James W. Roberson', 'Charles B. Pierce', 'Lana Wood, Iron Eyes Cody, Alex Cord, Ben Johnson, Jack Elam, Paul Fix, Cindy Butler, Cheyenne Rivera', 'PG', 'A young Cheyenne warrior, who goes by the name Grayeagle, kidnaps the daughter of a grizzled frontier man John Colter who goes on an epic search for his daughter Beth, aided by a friendly native...', 'A young Cheyenne warrior, who goes by the name Grayeagle, kidnaps the daughter of a grizzled frontier man John Colter who goes on an epic search for his daughter Beth, aided by a friendly native...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQDchEtq6OBRYN1wfAZrbNiz3De.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41604'),
  ('513138133047349812', 'Grbavica: The Land of My Dreams', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Christine A. Maier, Jasmila Žbanić', 'Jasmila Žbanić, Barbara Albert', 'Mirjana Karanović, Luna Mijović, Leon Lučev, Kenan Ćatić, Jasna Beri, Dejan Aćimović, Bogdan Diklić, Ermin Bravo', null, 'A woman and her daughter struggle to make their way through the aftermath of the Balkan war.', 'A woman and her daughter struggle to make their way through the aftermath of the Balkan war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzLRMGaQ9v3QDMSimCE12aBtJzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317'),
  ('291037497719444741', 'Grease', 1978, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Randal Kleiser, Bill Butler, Paula Marcus', 'Bronté Woodard', 'Olivia Newton-John, John Travolta, Stockard Channing, Jeff Conaway, Barry Pearl, Michael Tucci, Kelly Ward, Didi Conn', 'PG', 'Australian good girl Sandy and greaser Danny fell in love over the summer. But when they unexpectedly discover they''re now in the same high school, will they be able to rekindle their romance despite their eccentric friends?', 'Australian good girl Sandy and greaser Danny fell in love over the summer. But when they unexpectedly discover they''re now in the same high school, will they be able to rekindle their romance despite their eccentric friends?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rM7fQKpb7cs1Iq7IBqub9LFDzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621'),
  ('648156011135576023', 'Grease 2', 1982, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Patricia Birch, Frank Stanley, Gary Daigler', 'Ken Finkleman', 'Maxwell Caulfield, Michelle Pfeiffer, Lorna Luft, Maureen Teefy, Alison Price, Pamela Adlon, Adrian Zmed, Peter Frechette', 'PG', 'It''s 1961, two years after the original Grease gang graduated, and there''s a new crop of seniors and new members of the coolest cliques on campus, the Pink Ladies and T-Birds. Michael Carrington is the new kid in school - but he''s been branded a brainiac. Can he fix up an old motorcycle, don a leather jacket, avoid a rumble with the leader of the T-Birds, and win the heart of Pink Lady Stephanie?', 'It''s 1961, two years after the original Grease gang graduated, and there''s a new crop of seniors and new members of the coolest cliques on campus, the Pink Ladies and T-Birds. Michael Carrington is the new kid in school - but he''s been branded a brainiac. Can he fix up an old motorcycle, don a leather jacket, avoid a rumble with the leader of the T-Birds, and win the heart of Pink Lady Stephanie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufWc8AR5D66lwB2UZvZ9xvGcDSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9037'),
  ('241366079897978144', 'Grease Live', 2016, 'TV Movie, Music', 'Brad Duns, Tom Kitt, Will Gossett', 'Bronté Woodard', 'Julianne Hough, Aaron Tveit, Vanessa Hudgens, Keke Palmer, Carly Rae Jepsen, Mario López, Carlos PenaVega, Kether Donohue', null, 'After enjoying a holiday romance, high school students Danny and Sandy are unexpectedly reunited when she transfers to Rydell High, where she must contend with cynical Rizzo and the Pink Ladies.', 'After enjoying a holiday romance, high school students Danny and Sandy are unexpectedly reunited when she transfers to Rydell High, where she must contend with cynical Rizzo and the Pink Ladies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygzNOhZ4yAbA3QYqFjIFzI6ctwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348089'),
