  ('191144131557953919', 'Great Freedom', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Sebastian Meise, Crystel Fournier', 'Thomas Reider, Sebastian Meise', 'Franz Rogowski, Georg Friedrich, Anton von Lucke, Thomas Prenn, Thomas Stecher, Alfred Hartung, Thomas Wehling, Mex Schlüpfer', null, 'In post-war Germany, liberation by the Allies does not mean freedom for everyone. Hans Hoffmann is repeatedly imprisoned under Paragraph 175, which criminalizes homosexuality. Nevertheless, over the decades, he continues his quest for freedom and love, even if he finds it in the most unusual places.', 'In post-war Germany, liberation by the Allies does not mean freedom for everyone. Hans Hoffmann is repeatedly imprisoned under Paragraph 175, which criminalizes homosexuality. Nevertheless, over the decades, he continues his quest for freedom and love, even if he finds it in the most unusual places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbx3xp83wLo3ocdzhs3BvGHcrsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835975'),
  ('239807997235388359', 'Great Grand Masti', 2016, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Indra Kumar, Prashant Liya, Dipankar Dasgupta', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Riteish Deshmukh, Vivek Oberoi, Aftab Shivdasani, Urvashi Rautela, Mishti Chakravarty, Puja Banerjee, Shraddha Das, Usha Nadkarni', null, 'Amar, Meet and Prem go into a small town where they encounter a ''femme fatale'' in the form of Ragini. Ragini is everything they had dreamed of, but she slowly turns into their worst nightmare!', 'Amar, Meet and Prem go into a small town where they encounter a ''femme fatale'' in the form of Ragini. Ragini is everything they had dreamed of, but she slowly turns into their worst nightmare!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbbH4PoR6SPhVbospP1nFHzHpiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403862'),
  ('1072035202878823207', 'Great Green Valley', 1967, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Merab Kokochashvili, Giorgi Gersamia', 'Merab Eliozishvili', 'David Abashidze, Lia Kapanadze, Mzia Maglakelidze, Ilia Bakakuri, Z. Tseradze, Guram Gegeshidze, Grigol Tkabladze, Dzhumber Dzidzava', null, 'A group of geologists discover oil under the fields where Sosana, the aged and anachronistic father, raises his herd with his unhappy wife, her friend and his growing boy with whom he displays a wonderful rapport. The land is invaded by big machinery that feels remarkably alien to the serene and natural aesthetic of the valley. The family all enjoys the pleasures and storytelling capacity a slide projector grants them, but it too feels distinctly out of place in a town with no plumbing.', 'A group of geologists discover oil under the fields where Sosana, the aged and anachronistic father, raises his herd with his unhappy wife, her friend and his growing boy with whom he displays a wonderful rapport. The land is invaded by big machinery that feels remarkably alien to the serene and natural aesthetic of the valley. The family all enjoys the pleasures and storytelling capacity a slide projector grants them, but it too feels distinctly out of place in a town with no plumbing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izMq7Qr3tiUbLRw1FUnt8gHKPU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256743'),
  ('716101305270836302', 'Great Guns', 1927, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Oswald''s country is at war, like many other volunters he joins the army and finds himself soon in the trenches. A short battle leaves him wounded, but at least in the field hospital where his girlfriend is working.', 'Oswald''s country is at war, like many other volunters he joins the army and finds himself soon in the trenches. A short battle leaves him wounded, but at least in the field hospital where his girlfriend is working.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dzuio90BbLyQeACXdGFGvcIIS1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39823'),
  ('48934471913715892', 'Great Guns', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Monty Banks, Glen MacWilliams', 'Lou Breslow', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Sheila Ryan, Dick Nelson, Edmund MacDonald, Charles Trowbridge, Ludwig Stössel, Kane Richmond', 'NR', 'Laurel and Hardy join the army. They are hardly soldiers, but they believe their employer, (Dick Nelson) will need them now he''s drafted.', 'Laurel and Hardy join the army. They are hardly soldiers, but they believe their employer, (Dick Nelson) will need them now he''s drafted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX5EJy0RataAGM33pKxdvxnxfV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38890'),
  ('71689536081038886', 'Great Guy', 1936, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'John G. Blystone, Jack MacKenzie, Marlin Skiles', 'Henry McCarty, Henry Johnson', 'James Cagney, Mae Clarke, James Burke, Edward Brophy, Henry Kolker, Bernadene Hayes, Edward McNamara, Robert Gleckler', 'NR', 'A meat inspector sets out to rid his town of payoff deals affecting the quality of meat being sold to the public.', 'A meat inspector sets out to rid his town of payoff deals affecting the quality of meat being sold to the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcqtAhoYNFR1kjXvuZiT5ZoY76A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46351'),
  ('192578888713097887', 'Great Mazinger vs. Getter Robo', 1975, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Masayuki Akehi', 'Keisuke Fujikawa', 'Akira Kamiya, Keaton Yamada, Hiroshi Otake, Kazuko Sawada, Kosei Tomita, Rihoko Yoshida, Hidekatsu Shibata, Toku Nishio', null, 'When an UFO delivers a metal-eating monster to the heart of Japan, Getter Robo and Mazinger Z are launched to combat the alien menace. Fighting individually, the space monster''s metal-eating and acid-spitting abilities prove too much for Japan''s super robot forces - only their combined might stands a chance against defeating it! But with Mazinger Z damaged, can Getter Robo defend against the monster long enough for its comrade to be repaired? And even with forces combined, can they defeat the monster before all of Japan is destroyed?', 'When an UFO delivers a metal-eating monster to the heart of Japan, Getter Robo and Mazinger Z are launched to combat the alien menace. Fighting individually, the space monster''s metal-eating and acid-spitting abilities prove too much for Japan''s super robot forces - only their combined might stands a chance against defeating it! But with Mazinger Z damaged, can Getter Robo defend against the monster long enough for its comrade to be repaired? And even with forces combined, can they defeat the monster before all of Japan is destroyed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89YVgEo3wo3PGpVKgiPwzThmqAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74621'),
  ('89638959923909310', 'Great Mazinger vs. Getter Robo G: The Great Space Encounter', 1975, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Masayuki Akehi', 'Keisuke Fujikawa', 'Akira Kamiya, Keaton Yamada, Kazuko Sawada, Kosei Tomita, Rihoko Yoshida, Hidekatsu Shibata, Hiroshi Otake, Toku Nishio', null, 'When a UFO arrives from space and attacks the Getter Institute, Getter Robo is launched to stop it; but the might of the UFO and its giant space monsters prove to be too much for the Getter team. Not only is Getter Robo defeated, but Ouishan is killed in action! With Getter Robo out of commission, the world''s only hope appears to be Great Mazinger, but the aliens'' power might also be too much for even him. Can Dr. Saotome build a new Getter Robo in time to help save Great Mazinger, Japan, and the entire world?', 'When a UFO arrives from space and attacks the Getter Institute, Getter Robo is launched to stop it; but the might of the UFO and its giant space monsters prove to be too much for the Getter team. Not only is Getter Robo defeated, but Ouishan is killed in action! With Getter Robo out of commission, the world''s only hope appears to be Great Mazinger, but the aliens'' power might also be too much for even him. Can Dr. Saotome build a new Getter Robo in time to help save Great Mazinger, Japan, and the entire world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLvRgri9oO5RodZiMwJDgJzAKHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74622'),
  ('941494465164862211', 'GREAT PRETENDER razbliuto', 2024, 'Animation, Crime, Action', 'Hiro Kaburagi, Shoji Hata, Kazuto Izumita', 'Hiro Kaburagi, Taku Kishimoto', 'Yuka Komatsu, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Yasuhiro Mamiya, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Yasuyuki Kase, Mitsuaki Kanuka, Mariya Ise, Chiaki Kobayashi', null, 'Presumed dead, master con artist and recovering amnesiac Dorothy is discovered by Shanghai Longu-bang, a mob who wants payback for her conning them. With no memories and nowhere to go, she must rely on a local crime underboss to elude Taipei''s criminal underworld all while tracking down leads to her mysterious past.', 'Presumed dead, master con artist and recovering amnesiac Dorothy is discovered by Shanghai Longu-bang, a mob who wants payback for her conning them. With no memories and nowhere to go, she must rely on a local crime underboss to elude Taipei''s criminal underworld all while tracking down leads to her mysterious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLNWK22kGDa3JTDKav7bn2pD2Y3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1220441'),
  ('902368085714871789', 'Great White', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Wade Savage, Tony O''Loughlan, Martin Wilson', 'Michael Boughen', 'Katrina Bowden, Aaron Jakubenko, Kimie Tsukakoshi, Tim Kano, Te Kohe Tuhaka, Tatjana Marjanovic, Jason Wilder, Patrick Atchison', 'R', 'A sea plane is destroyed in a freak accident, five people find themselves drifting on a raft. At the mercy of the tide and with no hope of rescue, the helpless situation takes a horrifying turn when they are terrorized by a ravenous great white.', 'A sea plane is destroyed in a freak accident, five people find themselves drifting on a raft. At the mercy of the tide and with no hope of rescue, the helpless situation takes a horrifying turn when they are terrorized by a ravenous great white.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xQroYyf2gMAJDvLiWELHGEHD2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534072'),
  ('528494929230168246', 'Great, My Parents Divorce!', 1991, 'Comedy, Family', 'Patrick Braoudé, Thierry Arbogast', 'Patrick Braoudé', 'Adrien Dirand, Patrick Braoudé, Sonia Vollereaux, Clémentine Célarié, Patrick Bouchitey, Pascal Légitimus, Jean-Paul Lilienfeld, Daniel Russo', null, 'Julien, a boy in the sixth grade, was badly depressed by the divorce of his parents. But he soon found that half of the class had come from broken families.', 'Julien, a boy in the sixth grade, was badly depressed by the divorce of his parents. But he soon found that half of the class had come from broken families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4a7IoY6WR3yUHt4qoYkiKXiBjQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38014'),
