  ('157460202639490186', 'Green Harvest', 1959, 'Drama, War', 'François Villiers, Paul Soulignac', null, 'Pierre Dux, Dany Saval, Jacques Perrin, Francis Lemonnier, Claude Brasseur, Philippe Adrien, Jacques Higelin, Jacques Gencel', null, 'In 1943, a group of high school students decide to take action against the Nazi occupying forces. Showing courage and imagination, they manage to blow up the Kommandantur and to release hostages. But after the killing of a German soldier the Nazi police apparatus strikes back. The young resisters are arrested and two of them are condemned to death.', 'In 1943, a group of high school students decide to take action against the Nazi occupying forces. Showing courage and imagination, they manage to blow up the Kommandantur and to release hostages. But after the killing of a German soldier the Nazi police apparatus strikes back. The young resisters are arrested and two of them are condemned to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zI7POeNDxCszfh0dpA0BODQi8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277199'),
  ('1015038408858858587', 'Green Hat', 2004, 'Drama', 'Liu Fendou', 'Liu Fendou', 'Hai Yitian, Li Congxi, Li Haibin, Li Mei, Liao Fan, Dong Li-Fan', null, 'A sexually frustrated policeman starts investigating the doings of his wife.', 'A sexually frustrated policeman starts investigating the doings of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aK1igZvoff7nlyTqGRVxPp6jsOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48261'),
  ('655717240970476617', 'Green Hell', 1940, 'Adventure, Romance', 'James Whale, Karl Freund, Joseph A. McDonough', 'Frances Marion', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Joan Bennett, John Howard, George Sanders, Alan Hale, George Bancroft, Vincent Price, Gene Garrick', 'NR', 'A group of adventurers head deep into South American jungle in search of an ancient Incan treasure.', 'A group of adventurers head deep into South American jungle in search of an ancient Incan treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alJf4MdHhdPGa0U81CBPafpqidu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139775'),
  ('791906669265401473', 'Green Ice', 1981, 'Adventure, Action', 'Ernest Day, Gilbert Taylor', 'Ray Hassett, Edward Anhalt, Robert De Laurentiis', 'Ryan O''Neal, Anne Archer, Omar Sharif, Domingo Ambriz, John Larroquette, Philip Stone, Miguel Ángel Fuentes, Manuel Ojeda', 'PG', 'A down on his luck engineer gets involved in an adventure with a mysterious woman and an emerald magnate.', 'A down on his luck engineer gets involved in an adventure with a mysterious woman and an emerald magnate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mOmpiaBo0DUWyzqY2YeALVIXMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107028'),
  ('793216951115995402', 'Green Lantern', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Martin Campbell, Dion Beebe, Robert Fechtman', 'Greg Berlanti, Michael Goldenberg, Marc Guggenheim', 'Ryan Reynolds, Blake Lively, Peter Sarsgaard, Mark Strong, Tim Robbins, Angela Bassett, Taika Waititi, Temuera Morrison', 'PG-13', 'For centuries, a small but powerful force of warriors called the Green Lantern Corps has sworn to keep intergalactic order. Each Green Lantern wears a ring that grants him superpowers. But when a new enemy called Parallax threatens to destroy the balance of power in the Universe, their fate and the fate of Earth lie in the hands of the first human ever recruited.', 'For centuries, a small but powerful force of warriors called the Green Lantern Corps has sworn to keep intergalactic order. Each Green Lantern wears a ring that grants him superpowers. But when a new enemy called Parallax threatens to destroy the balance of power in the Universe, their fate and the fate of Earth lie in the hands of the first human ever recruited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fj21HwUprqjjwTdkKC1XZurRSpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44912'),
  ('902264931738000015', 'Green Lantern: Beware My Power', 2022, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jeff Wamester, Matthew Girardi, Mac Whiting', 'Ernie Altbacker, John Semper Jr.', 'Aldis Hodge, Jimmi Simpson, Ike Amadi, Brian Bloom, Jamie Gray Hyder, Mara Junot, Jason J. Lewis, Sunil Malhotra', 'PG-13', 'Recently discharged Marine sniper John Stewart is at a crossroads in his life, one which is only complicated by receiving an extraterrestrial ring which grants him the powers of the Green Lantern of Earth. Unfortunately, the ring doesn''t come with instructions - but it does come with baggage, like a horde of interplanetary killers bent on eliminating every Green Lantern in the universe. Now, with the aid of the light-hearted Green Arrow, Adam Strange and Hawkgirl, this reluctant soldier must journey into the heart of a galactic Rann/Thanagar war and somehow succeed where all other Green Lanterns have failed.', 'Recently discharged Marine sniper John Stewart is at a crossroads in his life, one which is only complicated by receiving an extraterrestrial ring which grants him the powers of the Green Lantern of Earth. Unfortunately, the ring doesn''t come with instructions - but it does come with baggage, like a horde of interplanetary killers bent on eliminating every Green Lantern in the universe. Now, with the aid of the light-hearted Green Arrow, Adam Strange and Hawkgirl, this reluctant soldier must journey into the heart of a galactic Rann/Thanagar war and somehow succeed where all other Green Lanterns have failed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nS41LN1m2HYvVotvgOTcbPW2cjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887357'),
  ('889085953045814061', 'Green Lantern: Emerald Knights', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Jay Oliva, Lauren Montgomery, Christopher Berkeley', 'Geoff Johns, Dave Gibbons, Todd Casey', 'Nathan Fillion, Jason Isaacs, Elisabeth Moss, Henry Rollins, Arnold Vosloo, Tony Amendola, Steve Blum, Grey DeLisle', 'PG', 'As the home planet of the Green Lantern Corps faces a battle with an ancient enemy, Hal Jordan prepares new recruit Arisia for the coming conflict by relating stories of the first Green Lantern and several of Hal''s comrades.', 'As the home planet of the Green Lantern Corps faces a battle with an ancient enemy, Hal Jordan prepares new recruit Arisia for the coming conflict by relating stories of the first Green Lantern and several of Hal''s comrades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8ZGOwcE0aFEpfWdZrVdmdGoFWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65291'),
  ('368158410642824025', 'Green Lantern: First Flight', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Lauren Montgomery', 'Alan Burnett', 'Christopher Meloni, Victor Garber, Michael Madsen, Tricia Helfer, John Larroquette, Kurtwood Smith, Larry Drake, William Schallert', 'PG-13', 'Test pilot Hal Jordan finds himself recruited as the newest member of the intergalactic police force, The Green Lantern Corps.', 'Test pilot Hal Jordan finds himself recruited as the newest member of the intergalactic police force, The Green Lantern Corps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ii48ohKJrDPyrGGOBVJ8XSxr5Xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17445'),
  ('617875479572401277', 'Green Mansions', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Mel Ferrer, Robert E. Relyea, Robert H. Justman', 'Dorothy Kingsley', 'Audrey Hepburn, Anthony Perkins, Lee J. Cobb, Sessue Hayakawa, Henry Silva, Nehemiah Persoff, Michael Pate, Estelle Hemsley', 'NR', 'A young Venezuelan idealist flees his native land to escape a revolution. Hoping to find peace, he goes to the mountains and the forests of the Amazon. There he encounters Rima, the Bird Girl, an orphan living a life of nature, who is feared by a local jungle tribe.', 'A young Venezuelan idealist flees his native land to escape a revolution. Hoping to find peace, he goes to the mountains and the forests of the Amazon. There he encounters Rima, the Bird Girl, an orphan living a life of nature, who is feared by a local jungle tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYkH53CRC6cuQfgeixhswc6geyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66869'),
  ('1004389714740306421', 'Green Night', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kim Hyun-seok, Han Shuai, Matthias Delvaux', 'Han Shuai, Lei Sheng', 'Fan Bingbing, Lee Joo-young, Kim Young-ho, Kim Kang-bin, Yun Ki-chang, Yoo Byung-sun, Eom Ji-man', null, 'Two lone female fighters who have learned to rely on no one but themselves venture into Seoul''s underworld. In search of the big hit that could mean liberation from their useless husbands, these disparate women grow closer.', 'Two lone female fighters who have learned to rely on no one but themselves venture into Seoul''s underworld. In search of the big hit that could mean liberation from their useless husbands, these disparate women grow closer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pb4jesQRCVCcOAiHJ4uqZtetDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075813'),
  ('192555276364077670', 'Green Plaid Shirt', 1997, 'Drama', 'Richard Natale', 'Richard Natale', 'Gregory Phelan, Kevin Spirtas, Richard Israel, Russell Scott Lewis, Jonathan Klein, Crystal Jackson, Tony Campisi, Sierra Pecheur', null, 'This endearing drama depicts the lives of five gay friends — in conflict with themselves and each other — at the dawn of the AIDS era. Back in 1978 everything seemed possible. For Phillip and Guy, there was the thrill and exhilaration of first love. For their friends Devon, Jerry and Todd, life was still an open book with so many pages yet to be filled. Ten years later, his friends are all gone and Phillip is left alone to make sense of the joys and sorrows of his past life — as he looks hopefully to the future. The lives of two ordinary men who find love together only to lose it. In an era of easy sex and open relationships they have only two rules: Don''t fall in love with others and no jealousy. Still rules are made to be broken. Eventually a single act of forgiveness restores their love.', 'This endearing drama depicts the lives of five gay friends — in conflict with themselves and each other — at the dawn of the AIDS era. Back in 1978 everything seemed possible. For Phillip and Guy, there was the thrill and exhilaration of first love. For their friends Devon, Jerry and Todd, life was still an open book with so many pages yet to be filled. Ten years later, his friends are all gone and Phillip is left alone to make sense of the joys and sorrows of his past life — as he looks hopefully to the future. The lives of two ordinary men who find love together only to lose it. In an era of easy sex and open relationships they have only two rules: Don''t fall in love with others and no jealousy. Still rules are made to be broken. Eventually a single act of forgiveness restores their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdOFFFbUtxKpv2f4h7GoWC7NVRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32445'),
  ('780815688274837823', 'Green Room', 2016, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Jeremy Saulnier, Sean Porter, Peter J. Dowd Jr.', 'Jeremy Saulnier', 'Anton Yelchin, Imogen Poots, Patrick Stewart, Alia Shawkat, Joe Cole, Callum Turner, Macon Blair, Mark Webber', 'R', 'A punk rock band is forced to fight for survival after witnessing an act of violence at a skinhead bar.', 'A punk rock band is forced to fight for survival after witnessing an act of violence at a skinhead bar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evZicaR7nXe4LiD9G6QYTorcJGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313922'),
  ('249062528915317397', 'Green Snake', 1993, 'Action, Fantasy, Romance', 'Tsui Hark, Ko Chiu-Lam, Koan Hui', 'Lilian Lee Bik-Wah, Tsui Hark', 'Maggie Cheung, Joey Wong, Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Wu Hsing-Guo, Ma Jingwu, Lau Shun, Tien Feng, Lun Ga-Chun', 'NR', 'Two snake spirits become human and learn about love and suffering. A monk discovers his own weaknesses and finds that morality is not as simple as he had thought.', 'Two snake spirits become human and learn about love and suffering. A monk discovers his own weaknesses and finds that morality is not as simple as he had thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qU5lu66AJFopMd5XxELxCkKzRRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39915'),
  ('892654157413405643', 'Green Street 3: Never Back Down', 2013, 'Action, Drama', 'James Nunn, Jonathan Iles', 'Ronnie Thompson', 'Scott Adkins, Joey Ansah, Kacey Barnfield, Mark Wingett, Roberta Taylor, George Russo, Billy Cook, Marcus Byron Keating', 'R', 'An old firm leader returns to Green Street for revenge after receiving a call that his little brother was killed, but is he able to cope with a new type of hooliganism and can he find his killer?', 'An old firm leader returns to Green Street for revenge after receiving a call that his little brother was killed, but is he able to cope with a new type of hooliganism and can he find his killer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtlDK3r8G282Vi0cGMxLVJJkhke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182873'),
  ('870525490679582501', 'Green Street Hooligans', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lexi Alexander, Alexander Buono, Mark Egerton', 'Lexi Alexander, Josh Shelov, Dougie Brimson', 'Elijah Wood, Charlie Hunnam, Claire Forlani, Marc Warren, Leo Gregory, Geoff Bell, Ross McCall, Henry Goodman', 'R', 'After being wrongfully expelled from Harvard University, American Matt Buckner flees to his sister''s home in England. Once there, he is befriended by her charming and dangerous brother-in-law, Pete Dunham, and introduced to the underworld of British football hooliganism. Matt learns to stand his ground through a friendship that develops against the backdrop of this secret and often violent world. ''Green Street Hooligans'' is a story of loyalty, trust and the sometimes brutal consequences of living close to the edge.', 'After being wrongfully expelled from Harvard University, American Matt Buckner flees to his sister''s home in England. Once there, he is befriended by her charming and dangerous brother-in-law, Pete Dunham, and introduced to the underworld of British football hooliganism. Matt learns to stand his ground through a friendship that develops against the backdrop of this secret and often violent world. ''Green Street Hooligans'' is a story of loyalty, trust and the sometimes brutal consequences of living close to the edge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTxHFRSbFcCWdfJB4ozA41Yq57c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8923'),
  ('977083564505533927', 'Green Street Hooligans 2', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Garrett Warren, Jonathan Hall', 'T. Jay O''Brien', 'Ross McCall, Graham McTavish, Treva Etienne, Luke Massy, Nicky Holender, Marina Sirtis, Timothy V. Murphy, Deobia Oparei', 'R', 'Following the deadly climax of "Green Street Hooligans," several members of the West Ham firm and numerous members of Millwall end up in jail. The GSE quickly discover the brutality of life on the inside, as they are constant targets of the superior numbers and better-financed Millwall crew.', 'Following the deadly climax of "Green Street Hooligans," several members of the West Ham firm and numerous members of Millwall end up in jail. The GSE quickly discover the brutality of life on the inside, as they are constant targets of the superior numbers and better-financed Millwall crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PSLy8Upgj9WhWgoVD5IUtm1sck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15809'),
  ('669074757532916424', 'Green Tea', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zhang Yuan, Christopher Doyle', 'Zhang Yuan', 'Jiang Wen, Vicky Zhao, Fang Lijun, Wang Haizhen, Zhang Yuan, Yang Dong, Fei Fei, Li Li', null, 'A mysterious woman frequents tea shops and other places looking for the right man. A cup of green tea will show you the way to find your true love.', 'A mysterious woman frequents tea shops and other places looking for the right man. A cup of green tea will show you the way to find your true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjeAz3v8aRCORbkgXU5KEuDQhTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40974'),
  ('254659355131416962', 'Green Tide', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pierre Jolivet, Olivier Boonjing, Inès de la Bévière', 'Pierre Jolivet', 'Céline Sallette, Nina Meurisse, Pasquale D''Inca, Adrien Jolivet, Julie Ferrier, Jonathan Lambert, Eric Combernous, Françoise Comacle', null, 'Not less than 3 men and 40 animals were found dead on the Breton beaches. The identity of the killer is an open secret: green algae. Inès Léraud is still a young journalist when, driven by an ecological conscience, she decides to go to Brittany to investigate this phenomenon. Through her encounters with whistleblowers, scientists, farmers and politicians, she elucidates, not without difficulty, half a century of silence: samples that disappear in laboratories, bodies buried before being autopsied, influence games, pressure... Will the truth win?', 'Not less than 3 men and 40 animals were found dead on the Breton beaches. The identity of the killer is an open secret: green algae. Inès Léraud is still a young journalist when, driven by an ecological conscience, she decides to go to Brittany to investigate this phenomenon. Through her encounters with whistleblowers, scientists, farmers and politicians, she elucidates, not without difficulty, half a century of silence: samples that disappear in laboratories, bodies buried before being autopsied, influence games, pressure... Will the truth win?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myWda3aAWVdFsrp73Xak3VI6dtf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007631'),
  ('979563710607526573', 'Green Vinyl', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho, Luciana Veras, Daniel Bandeira', 'Bohdana Smyrnova, Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Gabriela Souza, Verônica Alves, Ivan Soares', null, 'A mother gives her daughter a box full of old, coloured little vinyl records. The daughter may listen to them, but she should never, ever, play the green one.', 'A mother gives her daughter a box full of old, coloured little vinyl records. The daughter may listen to them, but she should never, ever, play the green one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNbDRkPM61SaMb7QEd0qoU5cj5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172513'),
  ('1055802559295021663', 'Green Zone', 2010, 'War, Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Greengrass, Barry Ackroyd, Dan Bradley', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Matt Damon, Greg Kinnear, Brendan Gleeson, Amy Ryan, Khalid Abdalla, Jason Isaacs, Igal Naor, Said Faraj', 'R', 'During the U.S.-led occupation of Baghdad in 2003, Chief Warrant Officer Roy Miller and his team of Army inspectors are dispatched to find weapons of mass destruction believed to be stockpiled in the Iraqi desert. Rocketing from one booby-trapped and treacherous site to the next, the men search for deadly chemical agents but stumble instead upon an elaborate cover-up that threatens to invert the purpose of their mission.', 'During the U.S.-led occupation of Baghdad in 2003, Chief Warrant Officer Roy Miller and his team of Army inspectors are dispatched to find weapons of mass destruction believed to be stockpiled in the Iraqi desert. Rocketing from one booby-trapped and treacherous site to the next, the men search for deadly chemical agents but stumble instead upon an elaborate cover-up that threatens to invert the purpose of their mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czFIaeukSxNEccysQeys1PCkuOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22972'),
  ('451140536553141449', 'Greenberg', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Noah Baumbach, Harris Savides, David Webb', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Ben Stiller, Greta Gerwig, Rhys Ifans, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Mark Duplass, Merritt Wever, Chris Messina, Brie Larson', 'R', 'Roger Greenberg, a failed musician now making a living as a carpenter in New York, returns to Los Angeles to house-sit for his brother. He''s stranded there—since he doesn''t drive—until his brother''s assistant, Florence, comes to his rescue. She''s as much a lost soul as he is, and the pair form a significant connection—giving Roger a much-needed reason to be happy.', 'Roger Greenberg, a failed musician now making a living as a carpenter in New York, returns to Los Angeles to house-sit for his brother. He''s stranded there—since he doesn''t drive—until his brother''s assistant, Florence, comes to his rescue. She''s as much a lost soul as he is, and the pair form a significant connection—giving Roger a much-needed reason to be happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAsN4vPpycVxC89QlA6NYBXRuK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27583'),
  ('910160963376640151', 'Greener Grass', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jocelyn DeBoer, Dawn Luebbe, Lowell A. Meyer', 'Jocelyn DeBoer, Dawn Luebbe', 'Jocelyn DeBoer, Dawn Luebbe, Beck Bennett, Neil Casey, Mary Holland, D''Arcy Carden, Jim Cummings, Lauren Adams', null, 'Suburban soccer moms find themselves constantly competing against each other in their personal lives as their kids settle their differences on the field.', 'Suburban soccer moms find themselves constantly competing against each other in their personal lives as their kids settle their differences on the field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eN56wiM2M84GBOQnp4TAQXcZucg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547009'),
  ('978459022884332607', 'Greenery Will Bloom Again', 2014, 'War', 'Ermanno Olmi, Fabio Olmi, Alessandra Gori', 'Ermanno Olmi', 'Claudio Santamaria, Alessandro Sperduti, Francesco Formichetti, Andrea Di Maria, Camillo Grassi, Niccolò Senni, Domenico Benetti, Andrea Benetti', null, 'World War I, Italian north-eastern front after the 1917 bloody battles on the Altipiano. A group of soldiers face the difficulty of war in a story that unfolds in the space of one night. Events follow one after the other without any kind of pattern: the peaceful mountains suddenly become a place where men die. But every story told in this film is a true story.', 'World War I, Italian north-eastern front after the 1917 bloody battles on the Altipiano. A group of soldiers face the difficulty of war in a story that unfolds in the space of one night. Events follow one after the other without any kind of pattern: the peaceful mountains suddenly become a place where men die. But every story told in this film is a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRj4aGTG4EwU8L0lTWmzJKIhQyA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298986'),
  ('808715337584641518', 'Greenfingers', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Action, Crime, Romance', 'John Daly, Joel Hershman', 'Joel Hershman', 'Clive Owen, Helen Mirren, David Kelly, Warren Clarke, Danny Dyer, Adam Fogerty, Paterson Joseph, Natasha Little', 'R', 'Prison inmate Colin Briggs is introduced to gardening, and when his thriving prison garden attracts the attention of flamboyant gardening expert Georgina Woodhouse, she offers to sponsor the inmates in an upcoming flower show. At the Hampton Court Flower Show, Colin meets Georgina''s daughter and romance is in bloom.', 'Prison inmate Colin Briggs is introduced to gardening, and when his thriving prison garden attracts the attention of flamboyant gardening expert Georgina Woodhouse, she offers to sponsor the inmates in an upcoming flower show. At the Hampton Court Flower Show, Colin meets Georgina''s daughter and romance is in bloom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qk1KSFLOzY6VAt5SRCHUAoqBA5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33379'),
  ('314870778054238628', 'Greenhouse', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lee Sol-hui, Lee Yu-seok', 'Lee Sol-hui', 'Kim Seo-hyung, Yang Jae-seong, Ahn So-yo, Shin Yeon-sook, Won Mi-won, Nam Yeon-woo, Hwang Jeong-min, Kim Gun', null, 'Moon-jung is a caregiver who has a son in middle school. After getting divorced, she can''t bear to bring him to her house, a plastic greenhouse she has converted into a home. She strives to raise the necessary funds to move into a real home for her and her son.', 'Moon-jung is a caregiver who has a son in middle school. After getting divorced, she can''t bear to bring him to her house, a plastic greenhouse she has converted into a home. She strives to raise the necessary funds to move into a real home for her and her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYMvEB4W0XIL0Cb4QrJxdRmtOLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915655'),
  ('82753888463573107', 'Greenland', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Caty Maxey, Elecia Avila, Christopher S. Bryson', 'Chris Sparling', 'Gerard Butler, Morena Baccarin, David Denman, Hope Davis, Roger Dale Floyd, Scott Glenn, Andrew Bachelor, Merrin Dungey', 'PG-13', 'John Garrity, his estranged wife and their young son embark on a perilous journey to find sanctuary as a planet-killing comet hurtles toward Earth. Amid terrifying accounts of cities getting levelled, the Garritys experience the best and worst in humanity. As the countdown to the global apocalypse approaches zero, their incredible trek culminates in a desperate and last-minute flight to a possible safe haven.', 'John Garrity, his estranged wife and their young son embark on a perilous journey to find sanctuary as a planet-killing comet hurtles toward Earth. Amid terrifying accounts of cities getting levelled, the Garritys experience the best and worst in humanity. As the countdown to the global apocalypse approaches zero, their incredible trek culminates in a desperate and last-minute flight to a possible safe haven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNo2mcvSwIvnx8K6y1euAc1TLVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524047'),
  ('1149365916480206404', 'Greenland 2: Migration', 2026, 'Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ric Roman Waugh, Martin Ahlgren, Ben Burt', 'Chris Sparling, Mitchell LaFortune', 'Gerard Butler, Morena Baccarin, Roman Griffin Davis, Tommie Earl Jenkins, Trond Fausa Aurvåg, Amber Rose Revah, Gina Gangar, Antonio De Lima', 'PG-13', 'Having found the safety of the Greenland bunker after the comet Clarke decimated the Earth, the Garrity family must now risk everything to embark on a perilous journey across the wasteland of Europe to find a new home.', 'Having found the safety of the Greenland bunker after the comet Clarke decimated the Earth, the Garrity family must now risk everything to embark on a perilous journey across the wasteland of Europe to find a new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2tqCJLsw6uEJ8nJV8BsQXGa3dr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840464'),
  ('417131099896325462', 'Greetings', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Brian De Palma, Robert Fiore', null, 'Jonathan Warden, Robert De Niro, Gerrit Graham, Richard Hamilton, Megan McCormick, Bettina Kugel, Jack Cowley, Jane Lee Salmons', null, 'Three friends in New York City discuss how to dodge the draft and Vietnam, JFK''s assassination, voyeurism, computer dating, and everything else.', 'Three friends in New York City discuss how to dodge the draft and Vietnam, JFK''s assassination, voyeurism, computer dating, and everything else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saqtwYWMbIAOzWp4Nm8oGEzDUqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73604'),
