  ('517154367893108713', 'Greetings from Fukushima', 2016, 'Drama', 'Karl Neubert, Hanno Lentz, Doris Dörrie', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Rosalie Thomass, Kaori Momoi, Nami Kamata, Kurumi Aizawa, Moshe Cohen, Honsho Hasayaka, Aya Irizuki, Naomi Kamara', null, 'A young German woman bonds with an elderly Japanese woman while touring the Fukushima region of Japan in the aftermath of the 2011 earthquake.', 'A young German woman bonds with an elderly Japanese woman while touring the Fukushima region of Japan in the aftermath of the 2011 earthquake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ID6J91Mi5ZYBDoFtmTuCeJ4sy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377852'),
