  ('1039696044744949040', 'Gregoire Moulin vs. Humanity', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Artus de Penguern', 'Jérôme L''hotsky, Artus de Penguern', 'Artus de Penguern, Didier Bénureau, Clovis Cornillac, Serge Riaboukine, François Levantal, François Berland, Philippe Magnan, Thomas Chabrol', null, 'Grégoire Moulin, a shy accountant, sets up a blind date with a dance teacher at a bar. What he needed to do was just to cross the road. But it didn''t happen to be as easy as it seems especially because of the final game of French soccer championship the very same night!', 'Grégoire Moulin, a shy accountant, sets up a blind date with a dance teacher at a bar. What he needed to do was just to cross the road. But it didn''t happen to be as easy as it seems especially because of the final game of French soccer championship the very same night!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqKgPGhZt4IVgjSsGTKmLNnrxEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45130'),
  ('647037576579549021', 'Gregory''s Girl', 1980, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bill Forsyth, Michael Coulter, Ian Madden', 'Bill Forsyth', 'John Gordon Sinclair, Dee Hepburn, Clare Grogan, Jake D''Arcy, Chic Murray, Alex Norton, John Bett, Dave Anderson', 'PG', 'A teenager falls hard for the female soccer player who has replaced him on the team and attempts to pursue her.', 'A teenager falls hard for the female soccer player who has replaced him on the team and attempts to pursue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVOdKnervWwvxIeJzLCqQzQPs7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21764'),
  ('751937719079280248', 'Gregory''s Two Girls', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Bill Forsyth, John de Borman, Claire Hughes', 'Bill Forsyth', 'John Gordon Sinclair, Dougray Scott, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Kevin Anderson, Martin Schwab, Fiona Bell, Carly McKinnon, Hugh McCue', 'R', 'Twenty years after his teenage crush on a football-mad schoolgirl, Gregory is back at his old school, teaching English. When two of his pupils uncover evil practices at a local factory they want their teacher to help them expose the wrong-doer, who happens to be Greg''s old schoolfriend.', 'Twenty years after his teenage crush on a football-mad schoolgirl, Gregory is back at his old school, teaching English. When two of his pupils uncover evil practices at a local factory they want their teacher to help them expose the wrong-doer, who happens to be Greg''s old schoolfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSqnXWnqveR2bi9JHShdDyjGVL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29108'),
  ('528197388708019900', 'Gremlin', 2017, 'Horror', 'Ryan Bellgardt, Josh McKamie', 'Josh McKamie, Ryan Bellgardt, Andy Swanson', 'Adam Hampton, Kristy K. Boone, Katie Burgess, Christian Bellgardt, Stacy Casaluci, Geoff Barron, Connie Franklin, Aaron Michael', 'NR', 'A man receives a mysterious box containing a terrible secret, a creature that will kill everyone else in his family unless he passes it on to someone he loves to continue its never-ending circulation.', 'A man receives a mysterious box containing a terrible secret, a creature that will kill everyone else in his family unless he passes it on to someone he loves to continue its never-ending circulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsTzpzL1qrh6PSP8kX8f6HDRulo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436496'),
  ('1039633338738260165', 'Gremlins', 1984, 'Fantasy, Horror, Comedy', 'John Hora, Joe Dante, James Quinn', 'Chris Columbus', 'Zach Galligan, Phoebe Cates, Hoyt Axton, Frances Lee McCain, Corey Feldman, Keye Luke, John Louie, Dick Miller', 'PG', 'After receiving an exotic small animal as a Christmas gift, a young man inadvertently breaks three important rules concerning his new pet, which unleashes a horde of malevolently mischievous creatures on a small town.', 'After receiving an exotic small animal as a Christmas gift, a young man inadvertently breaks three important rules concerning his new pet, which unleashes a horde of malevolently mischievous creatures on a small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6m0F7fsXjQvUbCZrPWcJNrjvIui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927'),
  ('774982491273360910', 'Gremlins 2: The New Batch', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'John Hora, Joe Dante, Chuck Jones', 'Charles S. Haas', 'Zach Galligan, Phoebe Cates, John Glover, Robert Prosky, Robert Picardo, Christopher Lee, Haviland Morris, Dick Miller', 'PG-13', 'Young sweethearts Billy and Kate move to the Big Apple, land jobs in a high-tech office park and soon reunite with the friendly and lovable Gizmo. But a series of accidents creates a whole new generation of Gremlins. The situation worsens when the devilish green creatures invade a top-secret laboratory and develop genetically altered powers, making them even harder to destroy!', 'Young sweethearts Billy and Kate move to the Big Apple, land jobs in a high-tech office park and soon reunite with the friendly and lovable Gizmo. But a series of accidents creates a whole new generation of Gremlins. The situation worsens when the devilish green creatures invade a top-secret laboratory and develop genetically altered powers, making them even harder to destroy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35F5yD7MljvBE2AC0NHAVCoPGEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928'),
  ('1145391106606925862', 'Grendizer, Getter Robo G, Great Mazinger: Decisive Battle! The Great Sea Monster', 1976, 'Action, Adventure, Animation', 'Masayuki Akehi', 'Susumu Takaku', 'Akira Kamiya, Hiroya Ishimaru, Keaton Yamada, Kei Tomiyama, Keiichi Noda, Joji Yanami, Rihoko Yoshida, Hiroshi Otake', null, 'A giant sea monster known as Dragonsaurus has emerged from out of nowhere, terrorizing the depths of the oceans. Great Mazinger, Grendizer and the Getter Robo G team join forces to combat the new threat. But their task becomes more complicated when Dragonsaurus swallows up Boss Borot and makes its way towards Tokyo. Source: ANN', 'A giant sea monster known as Dragonsaurus has emerged from out of nowhere, terrorizing the depths of the oceans. Great Mazinger, Grendizer and the Getter Robo G team join forces to combat the new threat. But their task becomes more complicated when Dragonsaurus swallows up Boss Borot and makes its way towards Tokyo. Source: ANN', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qwC670hZ25y9qE374mDXcvivxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74623'),
  ('505023827688261299', 'Grenfell: Uncovered', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Olaide Sadiq, Harry Truman', null, 'David Cameron, Theresa May', 'PG-13', 'Survivors, witnesses, and experts tell the story of the tragic fire that engulfed a residential tower block in London — and the investigation that ensued.', 'Survivors, witnesses, and experts tell the story of the tragic fire that engulfed a residential tower block in London — and the investigation that ensued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acbYuv9ZuO0Rvwi2QV8wQe7e1UP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1452541'),
  ('109422672132783953', 'Greta', 2019, 'Drama', 'Breno Baptista, Armando Praça, Ivo Lopes Araújo', 'Armando Praça', 'Marco Nanini, Denise Weinberg, Démick Lopes, Gretta Starr, Robério Diógenes, Edneia Tutti, Felipe de Paula, Fabiano Rocha', null, 'Pedro, a 70-year-old gay nurse, is taking care of Daniela, his ailing transgender friend. In order to find her a vacant hospital bed, he decides to help an arrested and wounded criminal to escape.', 'Pedro, a 70-year-old gay nurse, is taking care of Daniela, his ailing transgender friend. In order to find her a vacant hospital bed, he decides to help an arrested and wounded criminal to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lU0xVDoIed6ZPeDS0D8WycJlf1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570744'),
  ('1012387013734700899', 'Gretel & Hansel', 2020, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Osgood Perkins, Galo Olivares, Claire Curry', 'Rob Hayes', 'Sophia Lillis, Samuel Leakey, Alice Krige, Jessica De Gouw, Charles Babalola, Fiona O''Shaughnessy, Donncha Crowley, Jonathan Gunning', 'PG-13', 'A long time ago in a distant fairy tale countryside, a young girl leads her little brother into a dark wood in desperate search of food and work, only to stumble upon a nexus of terrifying evil.', 'A long time ago in a distant fairy tale countryside, a young girl leads her little brother into a dark wood in desperate search of food and work, only to stumble upon a nexus of terrifying evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBBBXseq4k4dI63k06XIrsc02j8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542224'),
  ('79752021077529217', 'Grey Eyes', 2018, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Santiago Ventura, Matías ''Lucho'' Viera, Javier Ventura', 'Gonzalo Palermo, Santiago Ventura', 'William Prociuk, Fernando Amaral, Cecilia Milano, Christian Zagia, Rafael Soliwoda, Fiorella Bottaioli, Natalia D''Alena, Néstor Guzzini', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic future, mankind is color blind. A brilliant scientist suddenly dies, leaving his precious briefcase-filled with a highly-addictive synthetic drug that allows people to see colors again-to Ana, a mere 12-year-old girl. Possession of the briefcase makes her the target of a doctor with wicked plans for the drug, and her only hope to escape his pursuit relies on the aid of the dead scientist''s two devoted bodyguards. Together, their epic, perilous journey pivots on a tremendous secret: Ana herself could be the key to salvaging a world in ruins.', 'In a post-apocalyptic future, mankind is color blind. A brilliant scientist suddenly dies, leaving his precious briefcase-filled with a highly-addictive synthetic drug that allows people to see colors again-to Ana, a mere 12-year-old girl. Possession of the briefcase makes her the target of a doctor with wicked plans for the drug, and her only hope to escape his pursuit relies on the aid of the dead scientist''s two devoted bodyguards. Together, their epic, perilous journey pivots on a tremendous secret: Ana herself could be the key to salvaging a world in ruins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5InVYa7CcbGioPvQ6ig4Lz4iLlR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816741'),
  ('674679832795907860', 'Grey Gardens', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Muffie Meyer, David Maysles, Ellen Giffard', null, 'Edith Bouvier Beale, Edith Ewing Bouvier Beale, Brooks Hyers, Norman Vincent Peale, Jack Helmuth, Albert Maysles, David Maysles, Jerry Torre', 'PG', 'Edie Bouvier Beale and her mother, Edith, two aging, eccentric relatives of Jackie Kennedy Onassis, are the sole inhabitants of a Long Island estate. The women reveal themselves to be misfits with outsized, engaging personalities. Much of the conversation is centered on their pasts, as mother and daughter now rarely leave home.', 'Edie Bouvier Beale and her mother, Edith, two aging, eccentric relatives of Jackie Kennedy Onassis, are the sole inhabitants of a Long Island estate. The women reveal themselves to be misfits with outsized, engaging personalities. Much of the conversation is centered on their pasts, as mother and daughter now rarely leave home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFPj6Eh3ijA4ISRujHu4GKKeAWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17346'),
  ('503253327768168852', 'Grey Gardens', 2009, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Sucsy, Mike Eley', null, 'Drew Barrymore, Jessica Lange, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Ken Howard, Kenneth Welsh, Arye Gross, Louis Ferreira, Daniel Baldwin', 'PG', 'Based on the life stories of the eccentric aunt and first cousin of Jackie Onassis raised as Park Avenue débutantes but who withdrew from New York society, taking shelter at their Long Island summer home, "Grey Gardens." As their wealth and contact with the outside world dwindled, so did their grasp on reality.', 'Based on the life stories of the eccentric aunt and first cousin of Jackie Onassis raised as Park Avenue débutantes but who withdrew from New York society, taking shelter at their Long Island summer home, "Grey Gardens." As their wealth and contact with the outside world dwindled, so did their grasp on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iO11PLhIGCzN6n2V92XcANQ8M9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19851'),
  ('978372282191665151', 'Grey Owl', 1999, 'Western, Action, Drama, Romance', 'Richard Attenborough, Roger Pratt, Claude Paré', 'William Nicholson', 'Pierce Brosnan, Stewart Bick, Vlasta Vrana, Annie Galipeau, Neil Kroetsch, Serge Houde, Peter Colvey, Nathaniel Arcand', null, 'Archie Grey Owl is a trapper in Canada in the early 1930s when a young Iroquois woman from town asks him to teach her Indian ways. They live in the woods, where she is appalled at how trapped animals die. She adopts two orphaned beaver kits and helps Archie see his way to stop trapping. Instead, he works as a guide, a naturalist writer, and then the Canadian government hires him to save the beaver in a conserve by Lake Ajawaan in Prince Albert National Park. He writes a biography, which brings him attention in Canada and invitations to lecture in England. Before he leaves, he and Anahareo (Pony) marry. In England, his secret is revealed. Will Anahareo continue to love him?', 'Archie Grey Owl is a trapper in Canada in the early 1930s when a young Iroquois woman from town asks him to teach her Indian ways. They live in the woods, where she is appalled at how trapped animals die. She adopts two orphaned beaver kits and helps Archie see his way to stop trapping. Instead, he works as a guide, a naturalist writer, and then the Canadian government hires him to save the beaver in a conserve by Lake Ajawaan in Prince Albert National Park. He writes a biography, which brings him attention in Canada and invitations to lecture in England. Before he leaves, he and Anahareo (Pony) marry. In England, his secret is revealed. Will Anahareo continue to love him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zreBHtHVAkH8Z2EdAAje1pFuF2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41807'),
  ('609403656152011220', 'Grey Souls', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yves Angelo, Jérôme Alméras, Yves Vandermereen', 'Yves Angelo, Philippe Claudel', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jacques Villeret, Denis Podalydès, Marina Hands, Michel Vuillermoz, Joséphine Japy, Serge Riaboukine, Thomas Blanchard', null, 'In 1917, the old rivalry between a prosecutor and a judge resurfaces during a police investigation into the murder of a child.', 'In 1917, the old rivalry between a prosecutor and a judge resurfaces during a police investigation into the murder of a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFx2z1antb6FaSNzRtnbXs5fqJm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62083'),
  ('239537194949471009', 'Grey Wolf and Little Red Riding Hood', 1990, 'Animation', 'Garri Bardin, Sergey Khlebnikov', 'Garri Bardin, Yury Entin', 'Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Svetlana Stepchenko, Elizaveta Razinova, Yevdokiya Urusova, Vladimir Vinogradov, Garri Bardin', null, 'A Soviet claymation short film created by Garri Bardin in 1990 that retells the story of Red Riding Hood while incorporating political metaphors and themes about the USSR''s demise; the wolf representing communism, devouring innocent creatures who have never known him.', 'A Soviet claymation short film created by Garri Bardin in 1990 that retells the story of Red Riding Hood while incorporating political metaphors and themes about the USSR''s demise; the wolf representing communism, devouring innocent creatures who have never known him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKwbJPbdSxPV3m9EQzGY87VwyhC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72208'),
  ('521001265294267717', 'Greyfriars Bobby', 1961, 'Drama, Family', 'Don Chaffey, Paul Beeson', 'Robert Westerby', 'Donald Crisp, Laurence Naismith, Alex Mackenzie, Duncan Macrae, Andrew Cruickshank, Gordon Jackson, Joan Juliet Buck, Rosalie Crutchley', null, 'In Scotland 1865, An old shepherd and his little Skye terrier go to Edinburgh. But when the shepherd dies of pneumonia, the dog remains faithful to his master, refuses to be adopted by anyone, and takes to sleeping on his master''s grave in the Greyfriars kirkyard, despite a caretaker with a "no dogs" rule. And when Bobby is taken up for being unlicensed, it''s up to the children of Edinburgh and the Lord Provost to decide what''s to be done.', 'In Scotland 1865, An old shepherd and his little Skye terrier go to Edinburgh. But when the shepherd dies of pneumonia, the dog remains faithful to his master, refuses to be adopted by anyone, and takes to sleeping on his master''s grave in the Greyfriars kirkyard, despite a caretaker with a "no dogs" rule. And when Bobby is taken up for being unlicensed, it''s up to the children of Edinburgh and the Lord Provost to decide what''s to be done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2gBOHVK8OIiv7ZVchaZVR92kxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64868'),
  ('842271197549745518', 'Greyhound', 2020, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Aaron Schneider, Shelly Johnson, Kim H. Winther', 'Tom Hanks', 'Tom Hanks, Stephen Graham, Rob Morgan, Josh Wiggins, Tom Brittney, Elisabeth Shue, Will Pullen, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo', 'PG-13', 'A first-time captain leads a convoy of allied ships carrying thousands of soldiers across the treacherous waters of the "Black Pit" to the front lines of WWII. With no air cover protection for 5 days, the captain and his convoy must battle the surrounding enemy Nazi U-boats in order to give the allies a chance to win the war.', 'A first-time captain leads a convoy of allied ships carrying thousands of soldiers across the treacherous waters of the "Black Pit" to the front lines of WWII. With no air cover protection for 5 days, the captain and his convoy must battle the surrounding enemy Nazi U-boats in order to give the allies a chance to win the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjMbDciooTbJPofVXgAoFjfX8Of.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516486'),
  ('353079545507213308', 'Greystoke: The Legend of Tarzan, Lord of the Apes', 1984, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Romance', 'Hugh Hudson, John Alcott, Simon Holland', 'Michael Austin, Robert Towne', 'Christopher Lambert, Andie MacDowell, Ralph Richardson, Ian Holm, James Fox, Cheryl Campbell, Ian Charleson, Nigel Davenport', 'PG', 'A shipping disaster in the 19th Century has stranded a man and woman in the wilds of Africa. The lady is pregnant, and gives birth to a son in their tree house. Soon after, a family of apes stumble across the house and in the ensuing panic, both parents are killed. A female ape takes the tiny boy as a replacement for her own dead infant, and raises him as her son. Twenty years later, Captain Phillippe D''Arnot discovers the man who thinks he is an ape. Evidence in the tree house leads him to believe that he is the direct descendant of the Earl of Greystoke, and thus takes it upon himself to return the man to civilization.', 'A shipping disaster in the 19th Century has stranded a man and woman in the wilds of Africa. The lady is pregnant, and gives birth to a son in their tree house. Soon after, a family of apes stumble across the house and in the ensuing panic, both parents are killed. A female ape takes the tiny boy as a replacement for her own dead infant, and raises him as her son. Twenty years later, Captain Phillippe D''Arnot discovers the man who thinks he is an ape. Evidence in the tree house leads him to believe that he is the direct descendant of the Earl of Greystoke, and thus takes it upon himself to return the man to civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdtEIdzqJTVhSLsjuR4U9t1KKxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11002'),
  ('112124714561873750', 'Gribiche', 1926, 'Drama', 'Charles Barrois, Henri Chomette, Jacques Feyder', 'Jacques Feyder', 'Jean Forest, Françoise Rosay, Cécile Guyon, Rolla Norman, Armand Dufour, Alice Tissot, Charles Barrois, Victor Vina', null, 'Gribiche, a young boy whose mother is a war widow, gets adopted by a rich woman. She wants to turn him into a perfect gentleman, but soon he feels unhappy.', 'Gribiche, a young boy whose mother is a war widow, gets adopted by a rich woman. She wants to turn him into a perfect gentleman, but soon he feels unhappy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cjzpmB37YVQo9hHjeCzu8diPku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189633'),
  ('844796085275263084', 'Gridiron Gang', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'E. Langston Craig, J. Stephen Buck, Jennifer Reiss', 'Jeff Maguire, Jac Flanders', 'Dwayne Johnson, Xzibit, L. Scott Caldwell, Leon Rippy, Kevin Dunn, Jade Yorker, David V. Thomas, Setu Taase', 'PG-13', 'Under the leadership of their counselor, teenagers at a juvenile detention center gain self-esteem by playing football together. Based on a true story.', 'Under the leadership of their counselor, teenagers at a juvenile detention center gain self-esteem by playing football together. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTjDApg546wt8OWazvPbEhygu83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9766'),
  ('111485930440506274', 'Gridlock''d', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Bill Pope, Vondie Curtis-Hall', 'Vondie Curtis-Hall', 'Tim Roth, Tupac Shakur, Thandiwe Newton, Charles Fleischer, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Howard Hesseman, James Pickens Jr., Tom Towles', 'R', 'After a friend overdoses, Spoon and Stretch decide to kick their drug habits and attempt to enroll in a government detox program. Their efforts are hampered by seemingly endless red tape, as they are shuffled from one office to another while being chased by drug dealers and the police.', 'After a friend overdoses, Spoon and Stretch decide to kick their drug habits and attempt to enroll in a government detox program. Their efforts are hampered by seemingly endless red tape, as they are shuffled from one office to another while being chased by drug dealers and the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlOL8fLsG0tGBtkj9qzHgqcHPVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12489'),
  ('748670776237344552', 'Gridlocked', 2016, 'Action', 'Allan Ungar, Pasha Patriki', 'Rob Robol, Allan Ungar', 'Dominic Purcell, Cody Hackman, Saul Rubinek, Stephen Lang, Danny Glover, Steve Byers, Patricia Stratigeas, James A. Woods', 'R', 'Former SWAT leader David Hendrix and hard-partying movie star Brody Walker must cut their ride-along short when a police training facility is attacked by a team of mercenaries.', 'Former SWAT leader David Hendrix and hard-partying movie star Brody Walker must cut their ride-along short when a police training facility is attacked by a team of mercenaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epcK83nqmFZw2MJA6Ia0L5v51gf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356334'),
  ('639796085254876030', 'Gridman Universe', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Akira Amemiya, Noboru Furukawa, Yuichi Shimodaira', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Yuya Hirose, Soma Saito, Yume Miyamoto, Junya Enoki, Shion Wakayama, Yuuichirou Umehara, Chika Anzai', 'PG-13', 'Yuta Hibiki finds himself drawing Gridman, who he seems to have missing memories of. Now in his second year at Tsutsujidai High School, Yuta decides it''s time to confess his feelings for Rikka. But their peaceful days would come to a end as Gridman suddenly returns with a warning: "The balance of this world is collapsing."', 'Yuta Hibiki finds himself drawing Gridman, who he seems to have missing memories of. Now in his second year at Tsutsujidai High School, Yuta decides it''s time to confess his feelings for Rikka. But their peaceful days would come to a end as Gridman suddenly returns with a warning: "The balance of this world is collapsing."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CnD7zRPMpZLxnKygUUjt4Bbiov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915403'),
  ('503554221769784626', 'Grief Street', 1931, 'Crime, Mystery, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, Melville Shyer, M.A. Andersen', null, 'John Holland, Barbara Kent, Raymond Largay, James P. Burtis, Lillian Rich, Lafe McKee, Lloyd Whitlock, Larry Steers', 'NR', 'A reporter helps the police investigate the murder of a disagreeable and philandering actor who is found strangled to death in his theater dressing room with its door and window locked from the inside.', 'A reporter helps the police investigate the murder of a disagreeable and philandering actor who is found strangled to death in his theater dressing room with its door and window locked from the inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLYOQnlpkBUokJQlpSFaZkroeyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156405'),
  ('606691092482703049', 'Griff the Invisible', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Leon Ford, Michael Gibbs, Sam Nield', 'Leon Ford', 'Ryan Kwanten, Maeve Dermody, Patrick Brammall, Toby Schmitz, Marshall Napier, Heather Mitchell, David Webb, Anthony Phelan', 'PG-13', 'Griff, office worker by day, superhero by night, has his world turned upside down when he meets Melody, a beautiful young scientist who shares his passion for the impossible.', 'Griff, office worker by day, superhero by night, has his world turned upside down when he meets Melody, a beautiful young scientist who shares his passion for the impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12DpWfDhBacOE09wJgR75rwCVUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66942'),
  ('175727476538341657', 'Griffin & Phoenix', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ed Stone, David M. Dunlap', 'John Hill', 'Amanda Peet, Dermot Mulroney, Sarah Paulson, Blair Brown, Alison Elliott, Lois Smith, Jonah Meyerson, Max Morris', 'PG-13', 'A terminally ill man falls in love with a woman who has a secret that threatens their time spent together.', 'A terminally ill man falls in love with a woman who has a secret that threatens their time spent together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL1Jh2ahQH62SLDETwD2TpDhljP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15534'),
  ('798552371000006591', 'Grigris', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun, Antoine Héberlé, François Chaillou', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun', 'Souleymane Démé, Anaïs Monory, Cyril Gueï, Marius Yelolo, Hadje Fatime N''Goua, Abakar M''Baïro, Youssouf Djaoro, Rémadji Adèle Ngaradoumbaye', null, 'Souleymane, 25, dreams of being a dancer in spite of having a paralyzed leg. At nightclubs, he transforms into the beloved dancer Grigris, impressing people with his moves. However, when his stepfather falls seriously ill, Souleymane desperately needs money and decides to work for petrol smugglers.', 'Souleymane, 25, dreams of being a dancer in spite of having a paralyzed leg. At nightclubs, he transforms into the beloved dancer Grigris, impressing people with his moves. However, when his stepfather falls seriously ill, Souleymane desperately needs money and decides to work for petrol smugglers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfiIYLRZJehim4ZaCkoKj4dv5do.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186970'),
  ('611539194507379411', 'Grill Point', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Hammon, Andreas Dresen', 'Conny Ziesche', 'Steffi Kühnert, Gabriela Maria Schmeide, Thorsten Merten, Axel Prahl, Janko Brett, Miro De Vittoris, Knut Elstermann, Carmen Engler', null, 'Christian is a presenter at a small radio station. His wife Katrin directs traffic in a car park. Both are friends with Uwe, who runs a fast food kiosk, and Ellen, who works in a perfume shop. Their four lives are stuck in a rut. Until the day Chris and Ellen sleep together and upset the balance of the two couples...', 'Christian is a presenter at a small radio station. His wife Katrin directs traffic in a car park. Both are friends with Uwe, who runs a fast food kiosk, and Ellen, who works in a perfume shop. Their four lives are stuck in a rut. Until the day Chris and Ellen sleep together and upset the balance of the two couples...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMdeYeO8ylTqJDVnEPECdhroEg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316'),
  ('712812445222920487', 'Grilled', 2006, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Lawrence Sher, Jason Ensler', 'William Tepper', 'Ray Romano, Kevin James, Sofía Vergara, Juliette Lewis, Burt Reynolds, Ariel Winter, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Lisa Jane Persky', null, 'Maurice and Dave sell high-end cuts of beef, but after hitting a patch of no sales, they''re facing being fired. Maurice needs money to enroll in his final semester of acupuncture school, and the recently-separated Dave needs money for his daughter''s birthday gift. Their final client card—a beautiful woman—is attracted to Maurice, but a desperate call from a suicidal friend interrupts her signing the contract. Still hoping to close the sale, they offer to drive her to the friend''s house—where their troubles multiply.', 'Maurice and Dave sell high-end cuts of beef, but after hitting a patch of no sales, they''re facing being fired. Maurice needs money to enroll in his final semester of acupuncture school, and the recently-separated Dave needs money for his daughter''s birthday gift. Their final client card—a beautiful woman—is attracted to Maurice, but a desperate call from a suicidal friend interrupts her signing the contract. Still hoping to close the sale, they offer to drive her to the friend''s house—where their troubles multiply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xS38WcGrzTvs5lO3uhKo5EiJxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11701'),
  ('827627012659613819', 'Grillo vs Grillo', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Beppe Grillo', null, 'Outspoken comedian Beppe Grillo reminisces about his long career, including the triumphs and controversies that fueled his rise in Italian politics.', 'Outspoken comedian Beppe Grillo reminisces about his long career, including the triumphs and controversies that fueled his rise in Italian politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNOETRkUYEqucXTpAGK6XUb8SSK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440888'),
  ('886500645798134063', 'Grim', 1985, 'Animation', 'Takashi Ito', null, 'Hiroko Emori', null, '"With this work, I developed/fleshed out the idea I had when making GHOST of peeling only the skin from various objects in the room, floating the skins in midair and then sticking them on different objects. This film was also shot entirely frame-by-frame with long-exposures. Along with GRIM, its meaning is ''as if to do forever.''" - Takashi Ito', '"With this work, I developed/fleshed out the idea I had when making GHOST of peeling only the skin from various objects in the room, floating the skins in midair and then sticking them on different objects. This film was also shot entirely frame-by-frame with long-exposures. Along with GRIM, its meaning is ''as if to do forever.''" - Takashi Ito', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/687AdlU7tLhnjEAQHXP74NQP5VI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283869'),
  ('335591820577260294', 'Grim', 1996, 'Horror', 'Paul Matthews', 'Paul Matthews', 'Emmanuel Xuereb, Jack Chancer, Peter Tregloan, Tres Hanley, Nadia DeLemeny, Louise Hickson, Nesba Crenshaw, Jules de Jongh', 'R', 'A team of spelunkers, when investigating a system of caves beneath a small town, come across a hideous creature that can move through walls.', 'A team of spelunkers, when investigating a system of caves beneath a small town, come across a hideous creature that can move through walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1Tn3Thj6SciSH90T1e9swhnZg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69272'),
  ('780838682183002269', 'Grim Prairie Tales', 1990, 'Western, Horror', 'Janusz Kamiński, Wayne Coe, Chris Bongirne', 'Wayne Coe', 'James Earl Jones, Brad Dourif, William Atherton, Lisa Eichhorn, Marc McClure, Scott Paulin, Will Hare, Michelle Joyner', 'R', 'Two travelers meet on the open prairie, and pass their time together by trading stories with each other. Their tales become a sort of competition, each attempting to relate something which might disturb the other.', 'Two travelers meet on the open prairie, and pass their time together by trading stories with each other. Their tales become a sort of competition, each attempting to relate something which might disturb the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uf59HOhM3GRXt3VQiABgKoca7p8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66706'),
  ('1114814478275741451', 'Grimcutty', 2022, 'Horror', 'John Ross, Bridger Nielson', 'John Ross', 'Sara Wolfkind, Shannyn Sossamon, Usman Ally, Callan Farris, Tate Moore, Joel Ezra Hebner, Alona Tal, Kayden Alexander Koshelev', 'R', 'A suburban teen girl and her little brother must stop a terrifying internet meme brought to life by the hysteria of their parents.', 'A suburban teen girl and her little brother must stop a terrifying internet meme brought to life by the hysteria of their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5z6EinMhVtBUAcFwA3UNnfxeWAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024530'),
  ('956160806097662465', 'Grimm', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Adventure', 'Alex van Warmerdam, Tom Erisman', 'Otakar Votoček, Alex van Warmerdam', 'Halina Reijn, Jacob Derwig, Teresa Berganza, Johan Leysen, Jaap Spijkers, Kees Prins, Frank Lammers, Annet Malherbe', null, 'One cold winter''s day, Jacob and his sister Marie are abandoned in a wood by their out of work father. In his jacket Jacob finds a letter from their mother urging them to go to her brother in Spain. Once in Spain, it turns out that their uncle is dead. Marie meets Diego, a wealthy charming Spanish surgeon, and falls in love with him. Diego lives with his sick, domineering sister, Teresa. To Jacob''s astonishment, Marie wants to marry Diego. Even after the wedding has taken place, jealous Jacob tries to get his sister away from Diego. When this doesn''t succeed, Jacob starts to provoke his brother-in-law. It soon transpires that no one will go unpunished for this.', 'One cold winter''s day, Jacob and his sister Marie are abandoned in a wood by their out of work father. In his jacket Jacob finds a letter from their mother urging them to go to her brother in Spain. Once in Spain, it turns out that their uncle is dead. Marie meets Diego, a wealthy charming Spanish surgeon, and falls in love with him. Diego lives with his sick, domineering sister, Teresa. To Jacob''s astonishment, Marie wants to marry Diego. Even after the wedding has taken place, jealous Jacob tries to get his sister away from Diego. When this doesn''t succeed, Jacob starts to provoke his brother-in-law. It soon transpires that no one will go unpunished for this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQqsGLGjQFMR9lHlQDJyjPMih6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50387'),
  ('773247754141847684', 'Grimm Love', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Crime', 'Martin Weisz, Jonathan Sela', 'T.S. Faull', 'Keri Russell, Thomas Kretschmann, Thomas Huber, Rainier Meissner, Marcus Lucas, Angelika Bartsch, Alexander Martschewski, Nils Dommning', 'R', 'In Germany, as graduate student Katie Armstrong researches cannibal killer Oliver Hagen for her thesis, she becomes obsessed with her subject and ultimately plunges into a lifestyle similar to Hagen''s and the thousands of people like him.', 'In Germany, as graduate student Katie Armstrong researches cannibal killer Oliver Hagen for her thesis, she becomes obsessed with her subject and ultimately plunges into a lifestyle similar to Hagen''s and the thousands of people like him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNDcUgOiiAyjqQSmWbTFvRt2vjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9639'),
  ('161812887186745263', 'Grimm''s Snow White', 2012, 'Fantasy', 'Rachel Lee Goldenberg, Alexander Yellen', 'Naomi L. Selfman', 'Eliza Bennett, Jane March, Jamie Thomas King, Joe Tödtling, Sebastian Wimmer, Alan Burgon, Thomas Nash, Otto Jankovich', 'PG-13', 'When the King is killed by ferocious reptile beasts, his Queen takes control of the kingdom. She tries to kill her beautiful stepdaughter SNOW, but she escapes into the enchanted forest...', 'When the King is killed by ferocious reptile beasts, his Queen takes control of the kingdom. She tries to kill her beautiful stepdaughter SNOW, but she escapes into the enchanted forest...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QTA9ekUmBqRqRsZV8QWMaB89Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92645'),
  ('375352159059722145', 'Grimsby', 2016, 'Action, Comedy', 'Louis Leterrier, Oliver Wood, Fraser Taggart', 'Phil Johnston, Sacha Baron Cohen, Peter Baynham', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Mark Strong, Isla Fisher, Penélope Cruz, Rebel Wilson, Gabourey Sidibe, Annabelle Wallis, Nick Sampson', 'R', 'Wrongfully accused and on the run, a top MI6 assassin joins forces with his long-lost, football hooligan brother to save the world from a sinister plot.', 'Wrongfully accused and on the run, a top MI6 assassin joins forces with his long-lost, football hooligan brother to save the world from a sinister plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jQGFmShpdflApc5oidJZ97m1d1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267193'),
  ('888485145818290049', 'Grin and Bear It', 1954, 'Animation', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'James MacDonald, Clarence Nash, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'Donald Duck arrives at Brownstone National Park. The park''s ranger, J. Audubon Woodlore, asks the bears to participate with the tourists but...no stealing! Humphrey decides to pair with Donald particularly because of the roast ham he has. When Donald doesn''t reward the bear with his food, Humphrey tries a variety of means to get the ham finally getting Donald''s attention by lying down on the road pretending that Donald ran over him. After Donald pays up with food, he sees through the scheme and struggles with Humphrey. After the ranger makes Donald and Humphrey clean up the resulting mess, he too notices the ham and makes off with it but is scolded for it by Donald and Humphrey.', 'Donald Duck arrives at Brownstone National Park. The park''s ranger, J. Audubon Woodlore, asks the bears to participate with the tourists but...no stealing! Humphrey decides to pair with Donald particularly because of the roast ham he has. When Donald doesn''t reward the bear with his food, Humphrey tries a variety of means to get the ham finally getting Donald''s attention by lying down on the road pretending that Donald ran over him. After Donald pays up with food, he sees through the scheme and struggles with Humphrey. After the ranger makes Donald and Humphrey clean up the resulting mess, he too notices the ham and makes off with it but is scolded for it by Donald and Humphrey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmJXPfspP2ibJRqeY8fQJnrF0FP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66870'),
  ('985577436030466263', 'Grin and Share It', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Michael Lah', 'Homer Brightman', 'Bill Thompson', null, 'Butch and Droopy have equal shares in a gold mine. When they finally strike gold, Butch tries to make his share more equal by doing away with Droopy, with no success.', 'Butch and Droopy have equal shares in a gold mine. When they finally strike gold, Butch tries to make his share more equal by doing away with Droopy, with no success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EmSL1IeGtSwSIzKGgqmceqO0CP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144237'),
  ('30763849637955024', 'Grind', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Casey La Scala, Richard Crudo, Richard L. Fox', 'Ralph Sall', 'Mike Vogel, Vince Vieluf, Adam Brody, Joey Kern, Jennifer Morrison, Bam Margera, Jason London, Summer Altice', 'PG-13', 'Four skaters follow their idol on his summer tour in an attempt to get noticed, get sponsored, and become stars themselves.', 'Four skaters follow their idol on his summer tour in an attempt to get noticed, get sponsored, and become stars themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ijvfbWQYLaFQ2PaX6hywnMW3Hv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20210'),
  ('910284229027221920', 'Gringa', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Wilke, E.J. Foerster, Marny Eng', 'Patrick Hasburgh', 'Steve Zahn, Jess Gabor, Roselyn Sánchez, Jorge A. Jimenez, Valentina Buzzurro, Nico Bracewell, Judy Greer, Andrea Paulina Rivera', 'NR', 'Unpopular and down-on-her-luck, Marge is already having a tough time navigating the minefield that is her suburban high school. But Marge’s life is completely upended when her beloved mother and only champion dies in a tragic accident. With nowhere else to turn except her ultra-conservative grandparents, Marge decides instead to hunt down her estranged father, a former soccer star living in rural Mexico as a beach bum and coach to the local women’s team. Neither is ready for such a big change, but the best shot they have at fixing their past and moving forward is together.', 'Unpopular and down-on-her-luck, Marge is already having a tough time navigating the minefield that is her suburban high school. But Marge’s life is completely upended when her beloved mother and only champion dies in a tragic accident. With nowhere else to turn except her ultra-conservative grandparents, Marge decides instead to hunt down her estranged father, a former soccer star living in rural Mexico as a beach bum and coach to the local women’s team. Neither is ready for such a big change, but the best shot they have at fixing their past and moving forward is together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cZfX9WOnLUakFAJANF0nVt2yUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801787'),
  ('650543538471653423', 'Gringo', 2018, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Nash Edgerton, Rod Smith, John Nasraway', 'Matthew Stone, Anthony Tambakis', 'David Oyelowo, Joel Edgerton, Charlize Theron, Amanda Seyfried, Sharlto Copley, Harry Treadaway, Yul Vazquez, Thandiwe Newton', 'R', 'An American businessman with a stake in a pharmaceutical company that''s about to go public finds his life is thrown into turmoil by an incident in Mexico.', 'An American businessman with a stake in a pharmaceutical company that''s about to go public finds his life is thrown into turmoil by an incident in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxeVPklFwng2IowqRPNI4od6aXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340022'),
  ('420670494070782373', 'Gringo: The Dangerous Life of John McAfee', 2016, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Nanette Burstein', null, 'Allison Adonizio, John McAfee, Nanette Burstein', null, 'The strange story of John McAfee, who went from millionaire software mogul to yogi, Kurtz-like jungle recluse to potential murderer, and most recently a prospective presidential candidate for the American Libertarian Party.', 'The strange story of John McAfee, who went from millionaire software mogul to yogi, Kurtz-like jungle recluse to potential murderer, and most recently a prospective presidential candidate for the American Libertarian Party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGFrecdZaWHARMkRD7sr11mWo2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413834'),
  ('153534901979010009', 'Grip of the Strangler', 1958, 'Horror, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Day, Douglas Hickox, Lionel Banes', 'Jan Read, John Croydon', 'Boris Karloff, Jean Kent, Elizabeth Allan, Anthony Dawson, Vera Day, Tim Turner, Diane Aubrey, Max Brimmell', 'NR', 'A researcher investigating a notorious serial killer who was hanged 20 years earlier seemingly becomes possessed by the long dead strangler.', 'A researcher investigating a notorious serial killer who was hanged 20 years earlier seemingly becomes possessed by the long dead strangler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RdrW6vghcqyyEQ8pqeAHSxfy2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86667'),
  ('1110161445552157755', 'Gripes', 1943, 'Animation, War', 'Friz Freleng', 'Phil Eastman, Dr. Seuss', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Private Snafu learns the hard way about the need for military dicipline and procedures to maintain an effective army.', 'Private Snafu learns the hard way about the need for military dicipline and procedures to maintain an effective army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62Lfht7grS1SNwHPRNFuTtoOXWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100743'),
  ('609097673148311586', 'Grips, Grunts and Groans', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Jack White', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Robert McKenzie, Blackie Whiteford, Harry Wilson, Bob Callahan, Sam Lufkin', 'NR', 'The Stooges become trainers of Bustoff, a champion wrestler. The big boss has a lot of money bet on Bustoff and orders the boys to take good care of him. Instead they accidentally knock him out and Curly must disguise himself as Bustoff and wrestle in his place. The match doesn''t go very well until Curly smells "Wild Hyacinth" perfume on a lady fan at ringside. This drives him crazy and he knocks out his opponent and half the people in the stadium.', 'The Stooges become trainers of Bustoff, a champion wrestler. The big boss has a lot of money bet on Bustoff and orders the boys to take good care of him. Instead they accidentally knock him out and Curly must disguise himself as Bustoff and wrestle in his place. The match doesn''t go very well until Curly smells "Wild Hyacinth" perfume on a lady fan at ringside. This drives him crazy and he knocks out his opponent and half the people in the stadium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNfuAM4D9VEnTrw49qMfMIKJ7OE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115812'),
  ('636732307411718304', 'Gripsholm', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pio Corradi, Xavier Koller', 'Stefan Kolditz', 'Ulrich Noethen, Heike Makatsch, Jasmin Tabatabai, Marcus Thomas, Horst Krause, Inger Nilsson, Rudolf Wessely, Leif Liljeroth', null, 'Kurt and Lydia are planning a relaxed vacation at the Gripsholm castle in Sweden . What Lydia does not know is that for Kurt, a well-known publicist, the journey is actually a flight from encroaching fascism and a direct threat from the Nazis.', 'Kurt and Lydia are planning a relaxed vacation at the Gripsholm castle in Sweden . What Lydia does not know is that for Kurt, a well-known publicist, the journey is actually a flight from encroaching fascism and a direct threat from the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elvc8NEXb40CGgfu9YiJr9Ne29j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10561'),
  ('358911120909740918', 'Grisaia: Phantom Trigger the Animation', 2019, 'Action, Animation', 'Motoki Tanaka', 'Hideyuki Kurata', 'Ayane Sakura, Maaya Uchida, Atsumi Tanezaki, Kaori Nazuka, Tsubasa Yonaga, Suzuko Mimori, Mikako Izawa, Toa Yukinari', null, 'Following the Heath Oslo incident, the existence of the US-Japanese anti-terror organization CIRS has become a matter of public knowledge. CIRS has been rebuilt from the ground up, and its most covert functions spun off to a new agency: SORD (Social Ops, Research & Development). The goal of SORD is to train a new generation of operatives to defend the country against future threats. To that end, the organization has established a series of schools up and down the country. Mihama Academy, more-or-less left to rot after its abrupt closure, has been given new purpose as one such ''specialist training school''. It now entrusts the misfit girls who attend it with guns and live ammunition. No matter how much life grinds them down, what future awaits these girls, who''ve themselves chosen the path of the gun?', 'Following the Heath Oslo incident, the existence of the US-Japanese anti-terror organization CIRS has become a matter of public knowledge. CIRS has been rebuilt from the ground up, and its most covert functions spun off to a new agency: SORD (Social Ops, Research & Development). The goal of SORD is to train a new generation of operatives to defend the country against future threats. To that end, the organization has established a series of schools up and down the country. Mihama Academy, more-or-less left to rot after its abrupt closure, has been given new purpose as one such ''specialist training school''. It now entrusts the misfit girls who attend it with guns and live ammunition. No matter how much life grinds them down, what future awaits these girls, who''ve themselves chosen the path of the gun?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cllFRaJmSyWlIYwJNbVslRoR9dP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601980'),
  ('325094501787609742', 'Grisaia: Phantom Trigger the Animation - Stargazer', 2020, 'Animation, Action', 'Ryota Arima, Kosuke Murayama', null, 'Ayane Sakura, Suzuko Mimori, Maaya Uchida, Kaori Nazuka, Atsumi Tanezaki, Tsubasa Yonaga, Mikako Izawa, Yoshino Nanjo', null, 'While Rena and Maki recover from their injuries, the other SORD members jet off overseas for a school trip. Within moments of their arrival, though, the Mihama gang are pulled into a manhunt for a SORD deserter, assisted by student Sylvia and Velvet of St. Aile''s International School. Tohka''s the star of the show this time round, but she''s wrestling with her own issues - old memories of her parents, and a promise to a friend that she wasn''t able to keep...', 'While Rena and Maki recover from their injuries, the other SORD members jet off overseas for a school trip. Within moments of their arrival, though, the Mihama gang are pulled into a manhunt for a SORD deserter, assisted by student Sylvia and Velvet of St. Aile''s International School. Tohka''s the star of the show this time round, but she''s wrestling with her own issues - old memories of her parents, and a promise to a friend that she wasn''t able to keep...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cAjzkKCRDJCkSyZ1aIEItvZg0x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779019'),
  ('50686181632314427', 'Gritos en el pasillo', 2006, 'Horror, Animation', 'Juanjo Ramírez Mascaró', 'Juanjo Ramírez Mascaró', 'Luis Jiménez, Gonzalo Navas, Jaime Vaca, Gaspar Ramírez, Patricia Riquelme, Laura Pons, Mario Parra, César del Álamo', null, 'A prestigious fairytale illustrator is hired by the psychiatric hospital director. His job there will be to decorate the hospital walls with his drawings to improve the place''s atmosphere. It seems like an easy task but things get complicated when the sketcher discovers a dark corridor from where chilling screams come out.', 'A prestigious fairytale illustrator is hired by the psychiatric hospital director. His job there will be to decorate the hospital walls with his drawings to improve the place''s atmosphere. It seems like an easy task but things get complicated when the sketcher discovers a dark corridor from where chilling screams come out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud9HIkpCAPxfZ7Y7jSAdAZMy0TS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75724'),
  ('343204334804726472', 'Gritta of the Rats'' Castle', 1985, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Jürgen Brauer', 'Christa Kožik, Jürgen Brauer', 'Nadja Klier, Hermann Beyer, Suher Saleh, Fred Delmare, Marc Lubosch, Wolf-Dieter Lingk, Peter Sodann, Ilja Kriwoluzky', null, 'The tale of young Gritta who lives with her father, an unsuccessful inventor. When her new stepmother tries to put her away in a convent she discovers some dark secrets there.', 'The tale of young Gritta who lives with her father, an unsuccessful inventor. When her new stepmother tries to put her away in a convent she discovers some dark secrets there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJjxQbJDAtxm8Yc3Ud5qZWNVweR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208363'),
  ('321199872300430216', 'Grizzly', 1976, 'Horror, Adventure, Thriller', 'William Girdler, William L. Asman, J. Patrick Kelly III', 'David Sheldon, Harvey Flaxman', 'Christopher George, Andrew Prine, Richard Jaeckel, Joan McCall, Joe Dorsey, Charles Kissinger, Kermit Echols, Tom Arcuragi', 'PG', 'An eighteen-foot grizzly bear figures out that humans make for a tasty treat. As a park ranger tries rallying his men to bring about the bear''s capture or destruction, his efforts are thwarted by the introduction of dozens of drunken hunters into the area.', 'An eighteen-foot grizzly bear figures out that humans make for a tasty treat. As a park ranger tries rallying his men to bring about the bear''s capture or destruction, his efforts are thwarted by the introduction of dozens of drunken hunters into the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqZK6sL7T2agJeeiM7jWvBxmDgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55784'),
  ('835426101655148295', 'Grizzly Falls', 1999, 'Adventure', 'Stewart Raffill, Thom Best', 'Richard Beattie', 'Bryan Brown, Tom Jackson, Richard Harris, Daniel Clark, Oliver Tobias, Brock Simpson, Chantel Dick, Trevor Lowden', 'PG', 'When a young boy is captured by a grizzly bear, he begins the most incredible journey of a lifetime, full of breathtaking excitement, harrowing danger and thrilling surprises.', 'When a young boy is captured by a grizzly bear, he begins the most incredible journey of a lifetime, full of breathtaking excitement, harrowing danger and thrilling surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuCDyjLH6Jfx2NxnYbEQZ7gJZ71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50416'),
  ('170888556436957855', 'Grizzly II: Revenge', 2020, 'Horror, Music, Thriller', 'László Kovács, André Szöts, Jean Badal', 'David Sheldon, Joan McCall', 'Steve Inwood, Deborah Raffin, John Rhys-Davies, Louise Fletcher, George Clooney, Laura Dern, Charlie Sheen, Dick Anthony Williams', null, 'All hell breaks loose when a giant grizzly, reacting to the slaughter of her cubs by poachers, attacks a massive rock concert in the National Park. [This sequel to "Grizzly" (1976) was left unfinished after production wrapped prematurely in 1983, and was not officially released until 2020, though a bootleg workprint version had been in circulation for some years prior to this.]', 'All hell breaks loose when a giant grizzly, reacting to the slaughter of her cubs by poachers, attacks a massive rock concert in the National Park. [This sequel to "Grizzly" (1976) was left unfinished after production wrapped prematurely in 1983, and was not officially released until 2020, though a bootleg workprint version had been in circulation for some years prior to this.]', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKHoRIicgHLoNPKiRJpRPHd96Gx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38258'),
