  ('347187464420927375', 'Grosse Pointe Blank', 1997, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller, Romance', 'Jamie Anderson, George Armitage', 'Steve Pink, Tom Jankiewicz, D.V. DeVincentis', 'John Cusack, Minnie Driver, Dan Aykroyd, Joan Cusack, Alan Arkin, Hank Azaria, Jeremy Piven, Mitchell Ryan', 'R', 'Hitman Martin Blank becomes a moving target after he rebuffs a fellow assassin''s invitation to form a union. On the advice of his quirky assistant and neurotic psychiatrist, Martin begrudgingly heads out to Grosse Pointe, Michigan for his ten-year high school reunion, where he soon comes across the woman he jilted on prom night.', 'Hitman Martin Blank becomes a moving target after he rebuffs a fellow assassin''s invitation to form a union. On the advice of his quirky assistant and neurotic psychiatrist, Martin begrudgingly heads out to Grosse Pointe, Michigan for his ten-year high school reunion, where he soon comes across the woman he jilted on prom night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lQ0MSNQqBTYpXTTZL82u1n95Z3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9434'),
  ('598512441101152690', 'Grosso guaio all''Esquilino - La leggenda del Kung Fu', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Usbergo, Niccolò Celaia, Cristiano Di Nicola', 'Tommaso Renzoni', 'Lillo Petrolo, Carolina Crescentini, Riccardo Antonaci, Ludovica Nasti, Yoon C. Joyce, Ismaelchrist Carlotti, Mario Luciani, Giorgio Colangeli', null, 'Davide is a shy and nerdy 13-year-old teenager who lives in Rome, in the Esquilino district, with his mum Asia. He spends his days with his friend Yang, constantly trying to escape from the school bully, Nadir, and dreaming of winning Jasmine''s heart. Passionate about movies on martial arts, Davide tries to regain self-confidence when he meets Martino, a broke b-movie actor, pretending to be a kung fu master to make his living.', 'Davide is a shy and nerdy 13-year-old teenager who lives in Rome, in the Esquilino district, with his mum Asia. He spends his days with his friend Yang, constantly trying to escape from the school bully, Nadir, and dreaming of winning Jasmine''s heart. Passionate about movies on martial arts, Davide tries to regain self-confidence when he meets Martino, a broke b-movie actor, pretending to be a kung fu master to make his living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhugmiZd51SRaKGdc3mbqnS3Hoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018941'),
  ('531736302067517596', 'GrossStadtklein', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Tobias Wiemann, Martin Schlecht', 'Tobias Wiemann', 'Jacob Matschenz, Jytte-Merle Böhrnsen, Klaas Heufer-Umlauf, Kostja Ullmann, Pit Bukowski, Markus Hering, Tobias Moretti, Ulrike Krumbiegel', null, 'A comedy about a crazy summer of young provincial guy in Berlin.', 'A comedy about a crazy summer of young provincial guy in Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9ExeWs50z9dYzcvDTDLOKIQpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241706'),
  ('510749872615759515', 'Grotesque', 1988, 'Horror', 'Joe Tornatore, Billy Dickson, Eddy Donno', 'Mikel Angel', 'Linda Blair, Tab Hunter, Donna Wilkes, Brad Wilson, Nels Van Patten, Sharon Hughes, Michelle Bensoussan, Guy Stockwell', 'R', 'A gang of crazed punkers breaks into a family''s vacation home in the mountains and slaughters the entire family, except for one daughter who gets away. As the gang pursues the girl through the snow, they slowly realize that some kind of murderous creature is chasing them...', 'A gang of crazed punkers breaks into a family''s vacation home in the mountains and slaughters the entire family, except for one daughter who gets away. As the gang pursues the girl through the snow, they slowly realize that some kind of murderous creature is chasing them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvVTBx3A6ZofG3dzXzspLl1a4Hy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59744'),
  ('482359316286394677', 'Grotesque', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Koji Shiraishi, Yôhei Fukuda', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Hiroaki Kawatsure, Tsugumi Nagasawa, Shigeo Ôsako, Kotoha Hiroyama', null, 'An unnamed doctor has always had everything he''s ever wanted, but that has only made him develop more extreme and depraved needs. He kidnaps a young couple in the prime of their life together and forces them into a game of torment that slowly extinguishes their hopes for survival.', 'An unnamed doctor has always had everything he''s ever wanted, but that has only made him develop more extreme and depraved needs. He kidnaps a young couple in the prime of their life together and forces them into a game of torment that slowly extinguishes their hopes for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOO0I9quWW26IpkBSMK4BQHsz5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27297'),
  ('646062055652816470', 'Grotto', 2016, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Micol Pallucca, Maxime Alexandre, Mirko Urania', 'Micol Pallucca', 'Samuele Biscossi, Iris Caporuscio, Gabriele Fiore, Christian Roberto, Leonardo Similaro', null, 'Three children force a classmate to a test of courage to get into their group. During the test, which consists in finding a skull in an abandoned church, the child is swallowed by a chasm that opens on the church floor. The other kids, who had stayed out, rush in the church, look in the deep hole, call their friend, but don''t receive answers. The little sister of one of them, who followed them, bursts into the church and lets herself down by a rope, but falls into the abyss, dragging the other kids. All five children find themselves into old caves in search of a way out, helped by Grotto, a creature alike a stalagmite.', 'Three children force a classmate to a test of courage to get into their group. During the test, which consists in finding a skull in an abandoned church, the child is swallowed by a chasm that opens on the church floor. The other kids, who had stayed out, rush in the church, look in the deep hole, call their friend, but don''t receive answers. The little sister of one of them, who followed them, bursts into the church and lets herself down by a rope, but falls into the abyss, dragging the other kids. All five children find themselves into old caves in search of a way out, helped by Grotto, a creature alike a stalagmite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC5Hbk3jAnHRrQpX80cEKrFuMJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393861'),
  ('977549724692168334', 'Ground Control', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Henner Hofmann, Richard Howard, David Allen Cluck', 'Mark Shepherd, Robert Moreland', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Kristy Swanson, Robert Sean Leonard, Kelly McGillis, Margaret Cho, Bruce McGill, Ruben Paul, Charles Fleischer', 'PG-13', 'An air-traffic controller quits after a plane crash but, years later, goes to help an airport that is in the path of a terrible storm.', 'An air-traffic controller quits after a plane crash but, years later, goes to help an airport that is in the path of a terrible storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kub1fmuz61ZjXzS0Wui7beNP3pU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54940'),
  ('491486842803428450', 'Ground Zero', 2021, 'Action', 'Kim Ji-yong, Kim Ji-yong, Cho Gyu-young', 'Kim Ji-yong', 'Don Lee, Kim Min-jae, Park Ji-hwan, Lee Kyu-sung, Lee Kyu-ho, Won Jin, Kim Jin-woo, Lee Sung-woo', null, 'A short action movie depicting the ''1983 Hosan Prison Riot,'' an important event in the ''PUBG Universe''.', 'A short action movie depicting the ''1983 Hosan Prison Riot,'' an important event in the ''PUBG Universe''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WEnI0ilBDG8D9Cn0PfsF4IIVta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845264'),
  ('358464823770546656', 'Grounded for Christmas', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Amyn Kaderali', 'Amyn Kaderali', 'Julianna Guill, Corey Sevier, Cheryl Ladd, Ted Atherton, Paula Brancati, Jacob Blair, Tara Joshi, Aldrin Bundoc', null, 'When a winter storm hits Cleveland and grounds flights, the nearby hotels quickly fill up with stranded travelers. Nina, a pilot, reluctantly agrees to let her arrogant but charming fellow pilot, Brady, stay at her nearby parents'' home. But when they discover her family is hosting a tree trimming party that night and that her ex will be there, Brady pretends to be her boyfriend to help her out.', 'When a winter storm hits Cleveland and grounds flights, the nearby hotels quickly fill up with stranded travelers. Nina, a pilot, reluctantly agrees to let her arrogant but charming fellow pilot, Brady, stay at her nearby parents'' home. But when they discover her family is hosting a tree trimming party that night and that her ex will be there, Brady pretends to be her boyfriend to help her out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SIcl29jOLaiAHxXkHpBsfVZvlz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627478'),
  ('1118807384815918591', 'Groundhog Day', 1993, 'Romance, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Harold Ramis, John Bailey, James J. Murakami', 'Danny Rubin, Harold Ramis', 'Bill Murray, Andie MacDowell, Chris Elliott, Stephen Tobolowsky, Brian Doyle-Murray, Marita Geraghty, Angela Paton, Rick Ducommun', 'PG', 'A cynical TV weatherman, along with his idealistic producer and his sardonic cameraman, is sent to report on Groundhog Day in the small town of Punxsutawney, where he finds himself repeating the same day over and over.', 'A cynical TV weatherman, along with his idealistic producer and his sardonic cameraman, is sent to report on Groundhog Day in the small town of Punxsutawney, where he finds himself repeating the same day over and over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCgt1WARPZaXnq523ySQEUKinCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137'),
  ('658089153922586780', 'Grounding: The Last Days of Swissair', 2006, 'Drama', 'Michael Steiner', 'Jürg Brändli, Michael Steiner, René Lüchinger', 'László I. Kish, Michael Neuenschwander, Gilles Tschudi, Rainer Guldener, Katharina von Bock, Matthias Mölleney, Hanspeter Müller, Helmut Förnbacher', null, 'The demise of airline Swissair in 2001 was a huge blow to Switzerland''s economy and to the country''s morale. It was a sad day for Swiss history when the airline''s fleet was grounded on 2 October 2001. "Grounding" is set during the last days of the doomed airline, and tells the story of manager Mario A. Corti''s unhappy fate, the last, unlucky CEO at the traditional airline company, as well as of all those nameless people who lost almost everything in the maelstrom of Swissair''s downfall: their job, home and their belief in Switzerland.', 'The demise of airline Swissair in 2001 was a huge blow to Switzerland''s economy and to the country''s morale. It was a sad day for Swiss history when the airline''s fleet was grounded on 2 October 2001. "Grounding" is set during the last days of the doomed airline, and tells the story of manager Mario A. Corti''s unhappy fate, the last, unlucky CEO at the traditional airline company, as well as of all those nameless people who lost almost everything in the maelstrom of Swissair''s downfall: their job, home and their belief in Switzerland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmRkwXxqXUSFUVMlPr6uc78Evir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35403'),
