  ('11953711484985254', 'Group Portrait with a Lady', 1977, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Aleksandar Petrović, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Heinrich Böll, Jürgen Kolbe, Aleksandar Petrović', 'Romy Schneider, Brad Dourif, Michel Galabru, Vadim Glowna, Richard Münch, Vitus Zeplichal, Milena Dravić, Rüdiger Vogler', null, 'Leni Gruyetin, a resident of Nazi Germany, lives a tumultuous life as she bears witness to the fascist regime of the Nazis.', 'Leni Gruyetin, a resident of Nazi Germany, lives a tumultuous life as she bears witness to the fascist regime of the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTwu30DFGgDNdUJ6Zwz7OzcbfXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186038'),
  ('935687365743171407', 'Group Sex', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lawrence Trilling, Michael D. O''Shea', 'Greg Grunberg, Lawrence Trilling', 'Josh Cooke, Greg Grunberg, Kathrine Narducci, Sandra Seeling, Lombardo Boyar, Greg Germann, Rob Benedict, Odette Annable', 'R', 'Herman has a weakness for strip clubs. Donny has a thing for condiments and Tiffany is a newly celibate martial artist. These are Andy''s new friends after he unsuspectingly follows his dream girl into a sexual addiction recovery group. At first this seems like the best possible news! However, Andy''s professional and personal life begins to unravel as he deepens his ties to this lovable, but damaged group.', 'Herman has a weakness for strip clubs. Donny has a thing for condiments and Tiffany is a newly celibate martial artist. These are Andy''s new friends after he unsuspectingly follows his dream girl into a sexual addiction recovery group. At first this seems like the best possible news! However, Andy''s professional and personal life begins to unravel as he deepens his ties to this lovable, but damaged group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIm2mHK892iPQlCAoLoNcDUMzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44221'),
  ('827976868912361998', 'Group Sex Addicts', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'EROPING', null, 'So Ra, Im Tae-mok, Yoon Yool, Woo Yeol', null, 'An erotic film about the story of a woman suffering from stress who, after undergoing hypnotherapy, begins to have explicit dreams every night. Tae-ran, who has been struggling both physically and mentally due to the debt left by her parents as soon as she became an adult, decides to seek psychiatric counseling and undergo hypnotherapy. However, from that day on, she starts experiencing explicit dreams every night; one of them is having sex with two men at the same time.', 'An erotic film about the story of a woman suffering from stress who, after undergoing hypnotherapy, begins to have explicit dreams every night. Tae-ran, who has been struggling both physically and mentally due to the debt left by her parents as soon as she became an adult, decides to seek psychiatric counseling and undergo hypnotherapy. However, from that day on, she starts experiencing explicit dreams every night; one of them is having sex with two men at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3K9KgqXjVDBndznRTUfPaLLfTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1459745'),
