  ('548241189609814609', 'Grown-Ups', 1980, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Mike Leigh, Remi Adefarasin', 'Mike Leigh', 'Phil Davis, Brenda Blethyn, Lesley Manville, Sam Kelly, Lindsay Duncan, Janine Duvitski', null, 'Dick and Mandy, a young working class couple, move into a council house in Canterbury, and find Mr. Butcher, one of their former teachers, living next door. Mandy''s unmarried sister, Gloria, is constantly dropping in, and will not take any hints that the couple would prefer to be left alone, until her presence finally goads them to action.', 'Dick and Mandy, a young working class couple, move into a council house in Canterbury, and find Mr. Butcher, one of their former teachers, living next door. Mandy''s unmarried sister, Gloria, is constantly dropping in, and will not take any hints that the couple would prefer to be left alone, until her presence finally goads them to action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uU8oXIXh6W94vTKJrzNFc7ibGNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187565'),
  ('92825093242369300', 'Growth', 2010, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Gabriel Cowan', 'Gabriel Cowan, Devin Zimmerman, John Suits', 'Mircea Monroe, Christopher Shand, Brian Krause, Nora Kirkpatrick, Richard Riehle, Lou Richards, Ian Patrick Williams, Alexi Wasser', 'NR', 'In 1989, a breakthrough in "advanced parasitic research" on Cuttyhunk Island gave scientists a jump in human evolution. Initial tests proved promising, as subjects experienced heightened physical and mental strength and awareness. But - something in the experiment went horribly wrong, and the island mysteriously lost three quarters of its population.', 'In 1989, a breakthrough in "advanced parasitic research" on Cuttyhunk Island gave scientists a jump in human evolution. Initial tests proved promising, as subjects experienced heightened physical and mental strength and awareness. But - something in the experiment went horribly wrong, and the island mysteriously lost three quarters of its population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iI5OYyjCI6Hmy7Uz1W3t1Uhz78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31196'),
  ('627097826700399128', 'Growth of the Soil', 1921, 'Drama', 'Gunnar Sommerfeldt, George Schnéevoigt', 'Gunnar Sommerfeldt, Knut Hamsun', 'Amund Rydland, Karen Poulsen, Ragna Wettergreen, Gunnar Sommerfeldt, Inge Sommerfeldt, Almar Bjoernefjell, Sigurd Berg Bruland', null, 'In rural Norway in the early 20th century, the homesteader Isak makes a farm out of barren soil, together with his wife Inger and their two sons. Life is both harsh and fulfilling.', 'In rural Norway in the early 20th century, the homesteader Isak makes a farm out of barren soil, together with his wife Inger and their two sons. Life is both harsh and fulfilling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzkFnh0dffiAiysvAanHPUOGyOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36126'),
