  ('908733306523926670', 'Grumpier Old Men', 1995, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Howard Deutch, Tak Fujimoto, Bruce Moriarty', 'Mark Steven Johnson', 'Walter Matthau, Jack Lemmon, Ann-Margret, Sophia Loren, Daryl Hannah, Burgess Meredith, Kevin Pollak, Katie Sagona', 'PG-13', 'A family wedding reignites the ancient feud between next-door neighbors and fishing buddies John and Max. Meanwhile, a sultry Italian divorcée opens a restaurant at the local bait shop, alarming the locals who worry she''ll scare the fish away. But she''s less interested in seafood than she is in cooking up a hot time with Max.', 'A family wedding reignites the ancient feud between next-door neighbors and fishing buddies John and Max. Meanwhile, a sultry Italian divorcée opens a restaurant at the local bait shop, alarming the locals who worry she''ll scare the fish away. But she''s less interested in seafood than she is in cooking up a hot time with Max.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FSXpj5e8l4KH6nVFO5SPUeraOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15602'),
  ('764142166741961833', 'Grumpy Cat''s Worst Christmas Ever', 2014, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Thomas M. Harting, Tim Hill', 'Tim Hill, Jeff Morris', 'Aubrey Plaza, Megan Charpentier, Daniel Roebuck, David James Lewis, Russell Peters, Isaac Haig, Evan Todd, Shauna Johannesen', 'G', 'A lonely cat living in a mall pet shop has a sour outlook on life until, in the midst of the holiday rush, she’s swept up into a robbery and a friendship with a human girl.', 'A lonely cat living in a mall pet shop has a sour outlook on life until, in the midst of the holiday rush, she’s swept up into a robbery and a friendship with a human girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GZAMXRkEWs6WhL6M04uSRzF5iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300441'),
