  ('561187107073351234', 'Grumpy Old Men', 1993, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Donald Petrie, Johnny E. Jensen, Molly Muir', 'Mark Steven Johnson', 'Jack Lemmon, Walter Matthau, Ann-Margret, Burgess Meredith, Daryl Hannah, Kevin Pollak, Ossie Davis, Buck Henry', 'PG-13', 'For decades, next-door neighbors and former friends John and Max have feuded, trading insults and wicked pranks. When an attractive widow moves in nearby, their bad blood erupts into a high-stakes rivalry full of naughty jokes and adolescent hijinks.', 'For decades, next-door neighbors and former friends John and Max have feuded, trading insults and wicked pranks. When an attractive widow moves in nearby, their bad blood erupts into a high-stakes rivalry full of naughty jokes and adolescent hijinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMY7yFn4gMvGaQYMGWnyX2QgvHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11520'),
