  ('657595703094073114', 'Guie’dani’s Navel', 2019, 'Drama', 'Martín Boege, Alberto Anaya, Ricardo Garfias', 'Xavi Sala', 'Sótera Cruz, Érika López, Majo Alfaroh, Valentina Buzzurro, Yuriria del Valle, Mónica del Carmen', null, 'Guie’dani, a Zapotec indigenous girl and her mother take up work with an upper-class family in Mexico City. The girl does not fit and is conflicting. Everything changes when she meets Claudia, a rebellious girl with whom she becomes close friends.', 'Guie’dani, a Zapotec indigenous girl and her mother take up work with an upper-class family in Mexico City. The girl does not fit and is conflicting. Everything changes when she meets Claudia, a rebellious girl with whom she becomes close friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjRxgiWjsWiDFMFZIJRk3bYRTIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553780'),
