  ('743955094035025983', 'Guillermo del Toro''s Pinocchio', 2022, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Mark Gustafson, Mary Hidalgo, Guillermo del Toro', 'Guillermo del Toro, Patrick McHale', 'Ewan McGregor, David Bradley, Gregory Mann, Burn Gorman, Ron Perlman, John Turturro, Finn Wolfhard, Cate Blanchett', 'PG', 'During the rise of fascism in Mussolini''s Italy, a wooden boy brought magically to life struggles to live up to his father''s expectations.', 'During the rise of fascism in Mussolini''s Italy, a wooden boy brought magically to life struggles to live up to his father''s expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vx1u0uwxdlhV2MUzj4VlcMB0N6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555604'),
