  ('587405208967335170', 'Guilty As Charged', 1991, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Peggy Hughes, Richard Michalak, J.B. Rogers', 'Charles Gale', 'Rod Steiger, Lauren Hutton, Heather Graham, Lyman Ward, Michael Beach, Irwin Keyes, Zelda Rubinstein, Mitch Pileggi', 'R', 'A female parole officer discovers a secret death row prison under a meat plant, that''s being run by the plant''s unhinged vigilante owner and his reverend friend. A politician with a shady past becomes its latest "guest". But is he guilty?', 'A female parole officer discovers a secret death row prison under a meat plant, that''s being run by the plant''s unhinged vigilante owner and his reverend friend. A politician with a shady past becomes its latest "guest". But is he guilty?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6KPbc3SsWFQrB4b0rKb1VHcREM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200371'),
  ('117102100952678192', 'Guilty as Sin', 1993, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Sidney Lumet', 'Larry Cohen', 'Rebecca De Mornay, Don Johnson, Stephen Lang, Jack Warden, Dana Ivey, Ron White, Norma Dell''Agnese, Sean McCann', 'R', 'Before a criminal lawyer knows what has happened, she is forced to defend a wife killer she knows is guilty.', 'Before a criminal lawyer knows what has happened, she is forced to defend a wife killer she knows is guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5b53cYM23bUA7OyoNyDtIJ38kc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4916'),
  ('1024099613239890852', 'Guilty by Association', 2003, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Po Johns, Sean Morrison, Howard Gibson', 'Howard Gibson', 'Morgan Freeman, Jammie Patton, Bryce Wilson, Queen Pen, Jeff Edward, Daemon Moore, Po Johns, Slime', 'R', 'There is no honor without truth. When gang wars spin out of control in downtown Washington D.C., one man steps onto the battlefirld to hunt down a ruthless killer. A young man has been released from prison and is determined to build a new life for himself. Unfortunately, without any prospects in sight, he gets lured back into the only world he knows....crime. He gets in touch with his former best friend who has since "made it big" as a drug dealer during his time in prison. But what starts out as a partnership which promises to get them both out of the projects, soon turns rotten as money comes between the two. As loyalties are divided, anger and violence erupt... destroying anyone who gets in the way. Innocent victims get caught in the crossfire and its up to one man, Police Lieutenet Redding (Morgan Freeman) to take matters into his own hands and stop the needless deaths before it''s too late.', 'There is no honor without truth. When gang wars spin out of control in downtown Washington D.C., one man steps onto the battlefirld to hunt down a ruthless killer. A young man has been released from prison and is determined to build a new life for himself. Unfortunately, without any prospects in sight, he gets lured back into the only world he knows....crime. He gets in touch with his former best friend who has since "made it big" as a drug dealer during his time in prison. But what starts out as a partnership which promises to get them both out of the projects, soon turns rotten as money comes between the two. As loyalties are divided, anger and violence erupt... destroying anyone who gets in the way. Innocent victims get caught in the crossfire and its up to one man, Police Lieutenet Redding (Morgan Freeman) to take matters into his own hands and stop the needless deaths before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MpeaVbZk7nirk9Jbf2pSB2cRVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38292'),
  ('636535477777582673', 'Guilty by Suspicion', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Irwin Winkler, Jeanne Caliendo, Rob Cowan', 'Irwin Winkler', 'Robert De Niro, Annette Bening, George Wendt, Patricia Wettig, Sam Wanamaker, Luke Edwards, Chris Cooper, Ben Piazza', null, 'Owing to his alleged involvement with communist parties, film director David Merrill is forbidden from working in Hollywood. He decides to fight for his rights and faces numerous challenges.', 'Owing to his alleged involvement with communist parties, film director David Merrill is forbidden from working in Hollywood. He decides to fight for his rights and faces numerous challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUpxydE70PNWr7Tu5WpefNnTv2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22423'),
  ('266047428613107866', 'Guilty Bystander', 1950, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Joseph Lerner, Russell Harlan, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Don Ettlinger', 'Zachary Scott, Faye Emerson, Mary Boland, Sam Levene, J. Edward Bromberg, Kay Medford, Jed Prouty, Harry Landers', 'NR', 'A drunken ex-cop gets a shot at redemption when his young son is kidnapped after a smuggling deal goes belly up.', 'A drunken ex-cop gets a shot at redemption when his young son is kidnapped after a smuggling deal goes belly up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YKtb9Umc788aLJyfnHgJQ3kOOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37485'),
  ('319149969079758458', 'Guilty Conscience', 1985, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Greene, Stevan Larner', 'Richard Levinson, William Link', 'Anthony Hopkins, Blythe Danner, Swoosie Kurtz, Donegan Smith, Wiley Harker, Ruth Manning', 'PG', 'Amid acrimonious divorce proceedings, Louise (Blythe Danner) unwittingly puts her life in danger when she contests the prenuptial agreement she signed before marrying attorney Arthur Jamison (Anthony Hopkins). He plans to kill her to resolve the situation. Armed with information on how her cheating husband conducts his business and personal affairs, she demands more money from him -- but will Arthur have the final word?', 'Amid acrimonious divorce proceedings, Louise (Blythe Danner) unwittingly puts her life in danger when she contests the prenuptial agreement she signed before marrying attorney Arthur Jamison (Anthony Hopkins). He plans to kill her to resolve the situation. Armed with information on how her cheating husband conducts his business and personal affairs, she demands more money from him -- but will Arthur have the final word?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7K2dDRpUkpNdNAvhoFMyC5sOj0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65169'),
  ('7268313457090986', 'Guilty Hands', 1931, 'Crime, Drama', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Douglas Shearer, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Bayard Veiller', 'Lionel Barrymore, Kay Francis, Madge Evans, William Bakewell, C. Aubrey Smith, Polly Moran, Alan Mowbray, Forrester Harvey', 'NR', 'A district attorney commits the perfect murder when he kills his daughter''s womanizing fiancé and then tries framing the fiancé''s lover.', 'A district attorney commits the perfect murder when he kills his daughter''s womanizing fiancé and then tries framing the fiancé''s lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhS05fuQJ2lbtEZKkAXd2vOikY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162284'),
  ('168606727657583566', 'Guilty Men', 2016, 'Western, Drama, Thriller', 'Iván Gaona', 'Iván Gaona', 'René Diaz Calderón, Willington Gordillo, Leidy Herrera, Alfonso López, Heriberto Palacio', null, 'Willington''s only love, Mariana, is about to get married to René, Willington''s cousin. While Willington is trying to get her back, a demobilization process concerning an illegal armed group is underway in the region, and new killings, besides rumors of a thief at large, will endanger Mariana''s new family.', 'Willington''s only love, Mariana, is about to get married to René, Willington''s cousin. While Willington is trying to get her back, a demobilization process concerning an illegal armed group is underway in the region, and new killings, besides rumors of a thief at large, will endanger Mariana''s new family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVRQpGABsEYXd7UTHQjU4yoNfNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412242'),
  ('492486381021920151', 'Guimoon: The Lightless Door', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sim Deok-geun, Na Hui-seok', 'Lee Jong-ho', 'Kim Kang-woo, Kim So-hye, Lee Jung-hyoung, Hong Jin-gi, Um Chae-young, Song Ji-hyun, Han Da-hee, Son Ji-young', null, 'In 1990, at a secluded community center, the custodian murders all the guest lodgers and kills himself. Ever since, on every Old Year''s Night, paranormal events begin to take place within the building. Eventually, the center is shut down and left abandoned for years. A renowned paranormal investigator who had lost his mother during an exorcism and three college students who heard about the rumor of the unexplained phenomena heads over to the building, resolved to uncover the buried secret.', 'In 1990, at a secluded community center, the custodian murders all the guest lodgers and kills himself. Ever since, on every Old Year''s Night, paranormal events begin to take place within the building. Eventually, the center is shut down and left abandoned for years. A renowned paranormal investigator who had lost his mother during an exorcism and three college students who heard about the rumor of the unexplained phenomena heads over to the building, resolved to uncover the buried secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1cZ4LaYv1M1RThyUh1sVi21Loe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844069'),
  ('271279020261395695', 'Guinea Pig Part 2: Flower of Flesh and Blood', 1985, 'Horror', 'Hideshi Hino', 'Hideshi Hino', 'Hiroshi Tamura, Kirara Yugao', null, 'A woman kidnapped in the dead of night awakens in a grisly dungeon, where her deranged assailant prepares her body for a morbid ritual.', 'A woman kidnapped in the dead of night awakens in a grisly dungeon, where her deranged assailant prepares her body for a morbid ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hV4KI3AyknlfGIaVyMq7p66Tc3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36073'),
  ('507468891143849023', 'Guinea Pig Part 3: He Never Dies', 1986, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Masayuki Kusumi', 'Masayuki Kusumi', 'Shinsuke Araki, Eve, Masahiro Sato, Rie Shibata, Keisuke Shinki', null, 'Hideshi, a bored salaryman with no friends, would love nothing more than to die. But when his suicide attempt doesn’t take, he settles for terrorizing a judgmental coworker with his newfound immortality.', 'Hideshi, a bored salaryman with no friends, would love nothing more than to die. But when his suicide attempt doesn’t take, he settles for terrorizing a judgmental coworker with his newfound immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fj6rt8lEG3M9IZmapjl313RiyNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69860'),
  ('1086564979501257498', 'Guinea Pig Part 4: Devil Doctor Woman', 1986, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Hajime Tabe, Junichi Baba', 'Hajime Tabe, Satoru Ogura', 'Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Hayashiya Shōzō IX, Nezumi Imamura, Shinnosuke Ikehata, Masami Hisamoto, Tamio Kageyama, Natsumi Ogawa, Naoto Takenaka', null, 'A doctor conducts experiments on patients which end up in anguish!', 'A doctor conducts experiments on patients which end up in anguish!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmoBVHB2vn9FG6glO3cvFehupn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36231'),
  ('261587851735663588', 'Guinea Pig Part 5: Android of Notre Dame', 1989, 'Horror', 'Kazuhito Kuramoto', 'Kazuhito Kuramoto', 'Toshihiko Hino, Mio Takaki, Tomorowo Taguchi, Yumi Iori', null, 'A dwarf scientist has his dreams frustrated when his sister becomes seriously ill. Determined to find a way to preserve the essence of his sister after the death, the scientist begins to use humans as guinea pigs in a bizarre experiment.', 'A dwarf scientist has his dreams frustrated when his sister becomes seriously ill. Determined to find a way to preserve the essence of his sister after the death, the scientist begins to use humans as guinea pigs in a bizarre experiment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ij1OI6I9pJK8kBxSRlMlHknHdkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36232'),
  ('592844810479921241', 'Guinea Pig: Mermaid in the Manhole', 1988, 'Horror, Romance', 'Hideshi Hino, Naoki Hayashi', 'Hideshi Hino', 'Shigeru Saiki, Mari Somei, Go Riju, Masami Hisamoto, Tsuyoshi Toshishige', null, 'An artist dealing with the grief of his wife leaving him finds solace in painting the squalor of the sewer. He discovers a trapped mermaid, whom he brings home to heal. Her condition worsens, and she asks the artist to paint her before she dies.', 'An artist dealing with the grief of his wife leaving him finds solace in painting the squalor of the sewer. He discovers a trapped mermaid, whom he brings home to heal. Her condition worsens, and she asks the artist to paint her before she dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN2JcO9ZIn00DbuDbNjCWtqwqS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32292'),
  ('250424139341862312', 'Guinevere', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Charles Minsky, Audrey Wells, Jim LaClair', 'Audrey Wells', 'Sarah Polley, Stephen Rea, Jean Smart, Gina Gershon, Paul Dooley, Carrie Preston, Tracy Letts, Emily Procter', 'R', 'A young girl from an affluent family rebels and becomes involved with a much older photographer.', 'A young girl from an affluent family rebels and becomes involved with a much older photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1isgjzl3mwVoxlRd7sqJ7COzwZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60994'),
  ('492182768858246712', 'Guitarras lloren guitarras', 1965, null, 'Miguel M. Delgado', null, 'Cuco Sánchez, Lucha Villa, Fernando Soto, Manuel López Ochoa, Lupe Rivas Cacho, Antonio Raxel, Celia Tejeda, Manuel Alvarado', null, 'Juan from Altamira, Tamaulipas, arrives at the train station in the capital and is assaulted by Gus. As he finds only ten dollars in his wallet, he believes that Juan brings more money and offers him accommodation in his room to pay the rent. Juan is dedicated to singing and Gus makes his representative. Juan is successful singing together with Susana on stage and radio Azteca, but she does not correspond to his love. As she wants to succeed alone, she goes to Guadalajara but without success. Juan helps her and when she gets a heart illness, she agrees to marry him.', 'Juan from Altamira, Tamaulipas, arrives at the train station in the capital and is assaulted by Gus. As he finds only ten dollars in his wallet, he believes that Juan brings more money and offers him accommodation in his room to pay the rent. Juan is dedicated to singing and Gus makes his representative. Juan is successful singing together with Susana on stage and radio Azteca, but she does not correspond to his love. As she wants to succeed alone, she goes to Guadalajara but without success. Juan helps her and when she gets a heart illness, she agrees to marry him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF2YwykFfEHMoU1cutUoqnoGqjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110536'),
  ('1063227688020583054', 'Gulaab Gang', 2014, 'Drama', 'Soumik Sen', null, 'Madhuri Dixit, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Tannishtha Chatterjee, Sudev Nair, Divya Jagdale, Priyanka Bose', null, 'A fearless woman fights social injustice; creating a sanctuary for abused women and battling a crooked politician.', 'A fearless woman fights social injustice; creating a sanctuary for abused women and battling a crooked politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGfRhEbULFryeMdUFuRq8zApsr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254420'),
  ('739631246235298986', 'Gulaal', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Anurag Kashyap, Rajeev Ravi', 'Anurag Kashyap', 'Raj Singh Chaudhary, Kay Kay Menon, Abhimanyu Singh, Piyush Mishra, Jesse Randhawa, Ayesha Mohan, Aditya Srivastava, Deepak Dobriyal', null, 'A law student witnesses the struggles of the Rajputs, deception, homicide and crime after being elected as General Secretary of his college.', 'A law student witnesses the struggles of the Rajputs, deception, homicide and crime after being elected as General Secretary of his college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FT2A8qh3nbqqCLgpkXhPBCVW42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21625'),
  ('184040428817251759', 'Gulabo Sitabo', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shoojit Sircar, Avik Mukhopadhyay', 'Juhi Chaturvedi', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Ayushmann Khurrana, Farrukh Jaffar, Vijay Raaz, Brijendra Kala, Srishti Shrivastava, Tina Bhatia, Naushad', null, 'Set in present-day Lucknow, Gulabo Sitabo is a social satire about two impossibly peculiar human beings, Mirza Chunnan Nawab, who stays in a dilapidated mansion and one of the tenants, Bankey Rastogi.', 'Set in present-day Lucknow, Gulabo Sitabo is a social satire about two impossibly peculiar human beings, Mirza Chunnan Nawab, who stays in a dilapidated mansion and one of the tenants, Bankey Rastogi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ABuPqPqRv2iSDyLf9KJrLoNV2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611356'),
  ('831134314981258177', 'Gulag', 1985, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Roger Young', null, 'David Keith, Malcolm McDowell, Warren Clarke, John McEnery, Nancy Paul, Brian Pettifer, George Pravda, Shane Rimmer', null, 'Mickey Almon is a sports star turned reporter covering the athletics in Moscow. Framed by the KGB and forced to confess that he was spying for America, he is sentenced to detention in a Gulag, a barbaric prison camp in the wilds of Siberia. Unable to prove his innocence, Mickey must either put up with the inhuman conditions or engineer an escape.', 'Mickey Almon is a sports star turned reporter covering the athletics in Moscow. Framed by the KGB and forced to confess that he was spying for America, he is sentenced to detention in a Gulag, a barbaric prison camp in the wilds of Siberia. Unable to prove his innocence, Mickey must either put up with the inhuman conditions or engineer an escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQq4NnrWqNOQoCtB244oTNSr5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75430'),
  ('632917950033238498', 'Güle Güle', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ferenc Pap, Zeki Ökten', 'Fatih Altınöz', 'Metin Akpınar, Zeki Alasya, Şükran Güngör, Yıldız Kenter, Eşref Kolçak, Haluk Bilginer, Güler Ökten, Ayşegül Aldinç', null, 'Car mechanic Şemsi separated from his wife years ago and lives alone, far away from his only child. Celal is a disciplined retired colonel married to Zarife. İsmet is an introverted film buff who has spent his life on the island, while Galip is a faithful platonic lover who has lived a strange "love" with Rosa, a Cuban woman he saw only once, and has never betrayed this woman with whom he has been corresponding for years. Unable to afford to go to Cuba or bring Rosa there, Galip falls ill and learns he has cancer. His friends do everything they can to make him happy before he dies, even putting their homes up for sale. But when the money still isn''t enough, there''s only one thing left to do: To obtain the money needed to send Galip to Cuba, they decide to rob five charming elderly bankers!', 'Car mechanic Şemsi separated from his wife years ago and lives alone, far away from his only child. Celal is a disciplined retired colonel married to Zarife. İsmet is an introverted film buff who has spent his life on the island, while Galip is a faithful platonic lover who has lived a strange "love" with Rosa, a Cuban woman he saw only once, and has never betrayed this woman with whom he has been corresponding for years. Unable to afford to go to Cuba or bring Rosa there, Galip falls ill and learns he has cancer. His friends do everything they can to make him happy before he dies, even putting their homes up for sale. But when the money still isn''t enough, there''s only one thing left to do: To obtain the money needed to send Galip to Cuba, they decide to rob five charming elderly bankers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgCzaF8dYcNFHMApzXdzORNSjYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453482'),
  ('560844240487311023', 'Güler misin Ağlar mısın', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Osman F. Seden, Erdoğan Engin', 'Ahmet Üstel', 'Zeki Alasya, Metin Akpınar, Fatma Belgen, Kadir Savun, Ali Şen, Neriman Köksal, Ali Cağaloğlu, Gönül Genç', null, 'Cemal, from Kayseri, is a prominent businessman. He runs a hotel in Kuşadası. However, this story is about the sacrifices made by two close friends for the people they love. Metin, who works as a receptionist at Cemal Bey''s hotel, and Zeki, who works in construction, are inseparable friends. Cemal Bey decides to build a mini-golf facility to make more money and plans to put Metin in charge of it. At the same time, Metin is planning to marry Aysel, the daughter of Rasim Usta. However, Rasim Usta''s house must be demolished to make way for the facility. As a result, Zeki and Metin oppose Cemal Bey. They build a floating house for Rasim Usta, who is now homeless. Cemal Bey devises plans to get rid of them. However, a guest arriving at the resort will change everything...', 'Cemal, from Kayseri, is a prominent businessman. He runs a hotel in Kuşadası. However, this story is about the sacrifices made by two close friends for the people they love. Metin, who works as a receptionist at Cemal Bey''s hotel, and Zeki, who works in construction, are inseparable friends. Cemal Bey decides to build a mini-golf facility to make more money and plans to put Metin in charge of it. At the same time, Metin is planning to marry Aysel, the daughter of Rasim Usta. However, Rasim Usta''s house must be demolished to make way for the facility. As a result, Zeki and Metin oppose Cemal Bey. They build a floating house for Rasim Usta, who is now homeless. Cemal Bey devises plans to get rid of them. However, a guest arriving at the resort will change everything...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCe0Ls3VFwhzBHyDVtZ8IIxREvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479670'),
  ('61382495156026995', 'Gulliver Mickey', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Clarence Nash', null, 'Mickey is first seen reading Gulliver''s Travels while the mice orphan children are pretending to be sailors. After ruining their game Mickey tries to make it up to them by retelling the Liliput sequences of Gulliver''s Travels pretending it was a real event that happened to him by portraying the role of Gulliver. The story ends with Mickey saving the town from a giant spider (Pete). However after telling the story, one of the children dangles a fake spider attached to a fishing rod which scares Mickey out of his witts.', 'Mickey is first seen reading Gulliver''s Travels while the mice orphan children are pretending to be sailors. After ruining their game Mickey tries to make it up to them by retelling the Liliput sequences of Gulliver''s Travels pretending it was a real event that happened to him by portraying the role of Gulliver. The story ends with Mickey saving the town from a giant spider (Pete). However after telling the story, one of the children dangles a fake spider attached to a fishing rod which scares Mickey out of his witts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Q0IwyLYLHJ3RjaqBGo1iyHF4Je.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132714'),
  ('1125852178935769099', 'Gulliver Returns', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Tony Bonilla, Ilya Maksimov', 'Michael Ryan', 'Tyler Bunch, Wayne Grayson, Alyson Leigh Rosenfeld, Billy Bob Thompson, Tom Wayland', null, 'World traveler and adventurer Gulliver is invited to return to Lilliput, the town he previously saved from the enemy fleet of the neighboring Blefuscu.', 'World traveler and adventurer Gulliver is invited to return to Lilliput, the town he previously saved from the enemy fleet of the neighboring Blefuscu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76ZSoIbdCQuPo2dW6Na7XybL1ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763539'),
  ('1069116172912082888', 'Gulliver''s Travels', 1939, 'Animation, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Orestes Calpini, Roland Crandall, Willard Bowsky', 'Edmond Seward, Jonathan Swift', 'Lanny Ross, Sam Parker, Pinto Colvig, Jack Mercer, Cal Howard, Tedd Pierce, Livonia Warren, Jessica Dragonette', 'G', 'Gulliver washes ashore on Lilliput and attempts to prevent war between that tiny kingdom and its equally-miniscule rival, Blefiscu, as well as smooth the way for the romance between the Princess and Prince of the opposing lands. In this he is alternately aided and hampered by the Lilliputian town crier and general fussbudget, Gabby. A life-threatening situation develops when the bumbling trio of Blefiscu spies, Sneak, Snoop, and Snitch, manage to steal Gulliver''s pistol.', 'Gulliver washes ashore on Lilliput and attempts to prevent war between that tiny kingdom and its equally-miniscule rival, Blefiscu, as well as smooth the way for the romance between the Princess and Prince of the opposing lands. In this he is alternately aided and hampered by the Lilliputian town crier and general fussbudget, Gabby. A life-threatening situation develops when the bumbling trio of Blefiscu spies, Sneak, Snoop, and Snitch, manage to steal Gulliver''s pistol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiwAJIAnSqWbU3JphqN8Y80mFM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42518'),
  ('996168451865683298', 'Gulliver''s Travels', 1977, 'Fantasy, Family, Animation', 'Peter R. Hunt, Alan Hume', 'Don Black', 'Richard Harris, Catherine Schell, Norman Shelley, Meredith Edwards, Julian Glover, Denise Bryer, Michael Bates, Stephen Jack', 'G', 'Based on the novel of the same name by Jonathan Swift and built around the Lilliput and Blefuscu episode. It was made partly in live action and partly animated.', 'Based on the novel of the same name by Jonathan Swift and built around the Lilliput and Blefuscu episode. It was made partly in live action and partly animated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcYceP08FS2h8Dw4AeNyKTECm66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64923'),
  ('14284279730785100', 'Gulliver''s Travels', 2010, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Rob Letterman, Peter Russell, David Tattersall', 'Nicholas Stoller, Joe Stillman', 'Jack Black, Jason Segel, Emily Blunt, Amanda Peet, Billy Connolly, Chris O''Dowd, T.J. Miller, James Corden', 'PG', 'Travel writer Lemuel Gulliver takes an assignment in Bermuda, but ends up on the island of Liliput, where he towers over its tiny citizens.', 'Travel writer Lemuel Gulliver takes an assignment in Bermuda, but ends up on the island of Liliput, where he towers over its tiny citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NoEtuTwZ04luk5H2DpT5ivW7Mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38745'),
  ('235052966600226185', 'Gulliver''s Travels Among the Lilliputians and the Giants', 1902, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès'' adaptation of Jonathan Swift''s "Gulliver''s Travels" is most distinguished, today, for being a color film of the classic story. Color was rare in 1902 (and many years after) as non-tinted color has to be hand painted on the film; this was an arduous task. Also notable is the film''s short running time of approximately five minutes. Much of the original work is not covered, but viewers were expected to be familiar with the story, and enjoy the filmed highlights. There are a couple of scenes missing; according to contemporary reports, Gulliver''s shipwreck was certainly included. You can do a lot in a few minutes, as Mr. Méliès includes a re-make of his own "Une partie de cartes" (1896), which already looked like something previously covered by the Lumière Brothers.', 'Georges Méliès'' adaptation of Jonathan Swift''s "Gulliver''s Travels" is most distinguished, today, for being a color film of the classic story. Color was rare in 1902 (and many years after) as non-tinted color has to be hand painted on the film; this was an arduous task. Also notable is the film''s short running time of approximately five minutes. Much of the original work is not covered, but viewers were expected to be familiar with the story, and enjoy the filmed highlights. There are a couple of scenes missing; according to contemporary reports, Gulliver''s shipwreck was certainly included. You can do a lot in a few minutes, as Mr. Méliès includes a re-make of his own "Une partie de cartes" (1896), which already looked like something previously covered by the Lumière Brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1FUCmz8LtPNzFQ6zzeOBvBYjuk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108292'),
  ('788074733750329597', 'Güllü', 1971, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Çetin Tunca', 'Ayşe Şasa, Atıf Yılmaz', 'Türkan Şoray, Ediz Hun, Süleyman Turan, Hulusi Kentmen, Ali Şen, İhsan Yüce, Muazzez Doğan, Aynur Aydan', null, 'A peasant woman rescues a rich playboy from a car crash. Playboy sets up a fake marriage to get her and leaves. Peasant woman chases him to take revenge.', 'A peasant woman rescues a rich playboy from a car crash. Playboy sets up a fake marriage to get her and leaves. Peasant woman chases him to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajoA2HDUsNGUUSkvHixmi2NtLgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548375'),
  ('797265427292213580', 'Güllü Geliyor Güllü', 1973, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Atıf Yılmaz', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Türkan Şoray, Ediz Hun, Kemal Sunal, Neriman Köksal, Sadettin Erbil, Bülent Kayabaş, Nubar Terziyan, İhsan Yüce', null, 'Güllü and the goddess Taka Nuri come to Istanbul to avenge a bloodshed. Güllü is a Black Sea girl. Nasi is a rich young man who grew up in the same village as Güllü. Nuri is given a gun in his circumcision wedding. The accidental bullet hits a relative of Güllü and thus starts a blood feud.', 'Güllü and the goddess Taka Nuri come to Istanbul to avenge a bloodshed. Güllü is a Black Sea girl. Nasi is a rich young man who grew up in the same village as Güllü. Nuri is given a gun in his circumcision wedding. The accidental bullet hits a relative of Güllü and thus starts a blood feud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65ngL8rTj3FT5DVh6LJHHSci3Yi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110030'),
  ('833058887451098107', 'Gully', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Adriano Goldman, Nabil Elderkin', 'Marcus Guillory', 'Kelvin Harrison Jr., Jacob Latimore, Charlie Plummer, John Corbett, Jonathan Majors, Robin Givens, Amber Heard, Terrence Howard', 'R', 'A slightly dystopian vision of LA, we follow three disaffected teenagers, Jessie, Calvin and Nicky, all victims of extreme childhoods, running supreme hedonistic riot as they try to work out a way in life.', 'A slightly dystopian vision of LA, we follow three disaffected teenagers, Jessie, Calvin and Nicky, all victims of extreme childhoods, running supreme hedonistic riot as they try to work out a way in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nxsPC47Ve07jCqi0PpNJtBlPRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514995'),
