  ('1135072169730848639', 'Gunbuster: The Movie', 2006, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Shoichi Masuo, Masahide Okino, Hidetoshi Watanabe', 'Hiroyuki Yamaga, Hideaki Anno, Toshio Okada', 'Noriko Hidaka, Rei Sakuma, Kazuki Yao, Maria Kawamura, Masako Katsuki, Norio Wakamoto, Tamio Ohki, Tomomichi Nishimura', null, 'Noriko Takaya''s dream is to become a space pilot like her father, who died when she was young after an attack by alien forces in deep space. After entering Okinawa Girls Space Pilot High School, she must persuade everyone, especially herself, that she can fulfill her goal and become an accomplished pilot despite being just an ordinary girl.', 'Noriko Takaya''s dream is to become a space pilot like her father, who died when she was young after an attack by alien forces in deep space. After entering Okinawa Girls Space Pilot High School, she must persuade everyone, especially herself, that she can fulfill her goal and become an accomplished pilot despite being just an ordinary girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCAVPmDDvtdqKmzzQ1Bq7vVjQtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426518'),
  ('364054602652324869', 'Guncrazy', 1992, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, Crime', 'Lisa Rinzler, Tamra Davis, Rod Smith', 'Matthew Bright', 'Drew Barrymore, James Le Gros, Billy Drago, Rodney Harvey, Joe Dallesandro, Michael Ironside, Ione Skye, Robert Greenberg', 'R', 'California teen Anita Minteer struggles in the face of an absentee mother, her mom''s abusive boyfriend, Rooney, and a lack of respect from her classmates. This all changes when a pen-pal school project connects her with convict Howard. Anita secures Howard''s parole and violently squares off against Rooney after he rapes her. Soon enough, the gun-crazy teen is on the run with Howard, with his parole officer in pursuit.', 'California teen Anita Minteer struggles in the face of an absentee mother, her mom''s abusive boyfriend, Rooney, and a lack of respect from her classmates. This all changes when a pen-pal school project connects her with convict Howard. Anita secures Howard''s parole and violently squares off against Rooney after he rapes her. Soon enough, the gun-crazy teen is on the run with Howard, with his parole officer in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYY4Dfg3bJlu5woIz2i7LNMD1bX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24065'),
  ('340957024916411121', 'Gunda', 1998, 'Action', 'Kanti Shah', 'Bashir Babar', 'Mithun Chakraborty, Verna Raj, Ishrat Ali, Rana Jung Bahadur, Bajrangi, Mohan Joshi, Shakti Kapoor, Razak Khan', null, 'Shankar, a coolie, comes in the way of the bad guys, Bulla and his cronies. They kill his father and sister. Shankar vows revenge and eliminates all of them in bizarre and gruesome fashion.', 'Shankar, a coolie, comes in the way of the bad guys, Bulla and his cronies. They kill his father and sister. Shankar vows revenge and eliminates all of them in bizarre and gruesome fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujuHUEzrf0kb0JUIloKjtgKfILY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141603'),
  ('469833649535779440', 'Gunda', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Viktor Kossakovsky, Viktor Kossakovsky, Egil Håskjold Larsen', 'Ainara Vera, Viktor Kossakovsky', null, 'PG', 'A glimpse into the raw and simple power of nature through encounters with farm animals: the eponymous Gunda, a mother pig; two cows, and a one-legged chicken.', 'A glimpse into the raw and simple power of nature through encounters with farm animals: the eponymous Gunda, a mother pig; two cows, and a one-legged chicken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XMlouldLxRt0RkH34GdGst9pxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664601'),
  ('47288983249564651', 'Gundala', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Joko Anwar, Ical Tanjung, Tommy Dewo', 'Joko Anwar', 'Abimana Aryasatya, Tara Basro, Bront Palarae, Ario Bayu, Muzakki Ramdhan, Faris Fadjar Munggaran, Rio Dewanto, Marissa Anita', null, 'Sancaka has lived on the streets since his parents left him. Living a hard life, Sancaka survives by thinking about his own safety. When the condition of the city gets worse and injustice rages throughout the country, Sancaka must decide whether he continues to live to look after himself or rise to become their oppressed hero.', 'Sancaka has lived on the streets since his parents left him. Living a hard life, Sancaka survives by thinking about his own safety. When the condition of the city gets worse and injustice rages throughout the country, Sancaka must decide whether he continues to live to look after himself or rise to become their oppressed hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZCo5qUz3IdIhs6466B9PpFglXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516700'),
  ('709721419769104629', 'Gundam Wing: The Endless Waltz', 1998, 'Drama, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yasunao Aoki, Youichi Ogami, Yoshihito Hishinuma', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Toshihiko Seki, Shigeru Nakahara, Ai Orikasa, Ryuzou Ishino, Akiko Yajima, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Daiki Nakamura', 'NR', 'After Colony (A.C.) 196, one year following the end of the battles between the Earth Sphere and the space colonies, peace has spread throughout. The Gundam pilots find themselves attempting to rebuild their lives. No longer having need of their weapons of war, their Gundams are sent into the sun to be destroyed. But suddenly, Relena Darlian, now a high-ranking government official, is kidnapped by a colony with aspirations of total dominance. The pilots and their allies find themselves called into action once again. The Endless Waltz has resumed...', 'After Colony (A.C.) 196, one year following the end of the battles between the Earth Sphere and the space colonies, peace has spread throughout. The Gundam pilots find themselves attempting to rebuild their lives. No longer having need of their weapons of war, their Gundams are sent into the sun to be destroyed. But suddenly, Relena Darlian, now a high-ranking government official, is kidnapped by a colony with aspirations of total dominance. The pilots and their allies find themselves called into action once again. The Endless Waltz has resumed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbnN0pQwbveJnMi7xKkUEX8rjbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22914'),
  ('787171870888117644', 'Gunday', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ali Abbas Zafar, Tanmay Mohan, Abhiraj Minawala', 'Ali Abbas Zafar', 'Ranveer Singh, Arjun Kapoor, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Irrfan Khan, Saurabh Shukla, Pankaj Tripathi, Victor Banerjee, Anant Vidhaat Sharma', null, 'The lives of Calcutta''s most powerful gangsters - Bikram and Bala, changes when Nandita enters it. Then a counter-force takes charge and a thriller unfolds.', 'The lives of Calcutta''s most powerful gangsters - Bikram and Bala, changes when Nandita enters it. Then a counter-force takes charge and a thriller unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70QlykuyOHn2wO0uw2U2TqvZp10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250551'),
  ('38346743039968935', 'Gundermann', 2018, 'Drama', 'Andreas Dresen, Andreas Höfer', 'Laila Stieler', 'Alexander Scheer, Anna Unterberger, Kathrin Angerer, Milan Peschel, Axel Prahl, Thorsten Merten, Bjarne Mädel, Eva Weißenborn', null, 'The real life story of East German singer and writer Gerhard Gundermann and his struggles with music, life as a coal miner and his dealings with the secret police (STASI) of the GDR.', 'The real life story of East German singer and writer Gerhard Gundermann and his struggles with music, life as a coal miner and his dealings with the secret police (STASI) of the GDR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSzDtOeCVqPIZM80fgvlgwyNFR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484735'),
  ('1025157420818061954', 'Gundress', 1999, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Katsuyoshi Yatabe, Mikio Tsuchiya, Hideo Maru', 'Akira Amasawa', 'Akemi Okamura, Akira Ishida, Aruno Tahara, Chikahachi Tsuji, Hiroshi Naka, Irina Yamazaki, Kazuhiro Nakada, Kenyu Horiuchi', 'R', 'In 2100, the newly built Bayside City serves as Japan''s premier international port. The Angel Arms Company is established by a former policewoman named Takako, to help wage war on terrorism with armed security suits. When the mayor is assassinated, the women of Angel Arms end up protecting the evil crime-lord Hassan, in hopes that his information will help bring down a global terror ring. Takako''s back is to the wall as a band of criminals plot to kill Hassan, and the organization''s leader is revealed to be the former lover of Angel Arms'' own Alisa.', 'In 2100, the newly built Bayside City serves as Japan''s premier international port. The Angel Arms Company is established by a former policewoman named Takako, to help wage war on terrorism with armed security suits. When the mayor is assassinated, the women of Angel Arms end up protecting the evil crime-lord Hassan, in hopes that his information will help bring down a global terror ring. Takako''s back is to the wall as a band of criminals plot to kill Hassan, and the organization''s leader is revealed to be the former lover of Angel Arms'' own Alisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4scnHkhef22PwGyIrFSW3OcULi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42073'),
  ('93884737882711404', 'Gunfight at Comanche Creek', 1963, 'Western', 'Frank McDonald, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Edward Bernds', 'Audie Murphy, DeForest Kelley, Ben Cooper, Colleen Miller, Jan Merlin, Adam Williams, Susan Seaforth Hayes, Mort Mills', 'NR', 'Comanche Creek, Colorado, 1875: Prisoner Jack Mason is broken out of jail by a gang of strangers. They use him in a robbery, then when the dead-or-alive reward is high enough, they shoot him and collect. The National Detective Agency, now knowing the gang''s methods, arranges to have agent Bob Gifford jailed in Comanche Creek for train robbery. The gang takes the bait (not before Gifford catches the eye of lovely saloon-keeper Abbie). But how will the bait get off the hook?', 'Comanche Creek, Colorado, 1875: Prisoner Jack Mason is broken out of jail by a gang of strangers. They use him in a robbery, then when the dead-or-alive reward is high enough, they shoot him and collect. The National Detective Agency, now knowing the gang''s methods, arranges to have agent Bob Gifford jailed in Comanche Creek for train robbery. The gang takes the bait (not before Gifford catches the eye of lovely saloon-keeper Abbie). But how will the bait get off the hook?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lq0b5rYSR7om1rWotXe50AdHEHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95677'),
  ('949418291830278292', 'Gunfight at Red Sands', 1963, 'Romance, Western, Action, Drama', 'Ricardo Blasco, Massimo Dallamano, J. Arambillet', 'Ricardo Blasco, Albert Band', 'Richard Harrison, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Mikaela Wood, Sara Lezana, Daniel Martín, Barta Barri, Aldo Sambrell, Tito García', 'NR', 'An avenging stranger guns down a gang of ruthless bandits in revenge for the murder of his family.', 'An avenging stranger guns down a gang of ruthless bandits in revenge for the murder of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrm8Omr3nqHrKtucGrgoDtGXTA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68088'),
  ('722441189843427770', 'Gunfight at Rio Bravo', 2023, 'Western, Action', 'Joe Cornet, Sam Wilkerson', 'Craig Hamann', 'Alexander Nevsky, Olivier Gruner, Joe Cornet, Matthias Hues, Natalie Denise Sperl, Kerry Goodwin, Lee Dawson, John Marrs', 'NR', 'When mysterious Russian gunslinger Ivan Turchin rides into a small Texas town, he runs afoul of a bloodthirsty outlaw gang known as The Hellhounds. Outmanned and outgunned, the town must put their trust in Turchin to protect them from annihilation at the hands of the bandits. The gunslinger finds allies in the form of Marshal Austin Carter and Sheriff Vernon Kelly, and together the three must make a desperate stand against impossible and violent odds.', 'When mysterious Russian gunslinger Ivan Turchin rides into a small Texas town, he runs afoul of a bloodthirsty outlaw gang known as The Hellhounds. Outmanned and outgunned, the town must put their trust in Turchin to protect them from annihilation at the hands of the bandits. The gunslinger finds allies in the form of Marshal Austin Carter and Sheriff Vernon Kelly, and together the three must make a desperate stand against impossible and violent odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92hYmHw1XpMEF7yZUzjOzcO4zmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835767'),
  ('411975004015301677', 'Gunfight at the O.K. Corral', 1957, 'Western, Drama', 'John Sturges, Charles Lang, Michael D. Moore', 'Leon Uris', 'Burt Lancaster, Kirk Douglas, Jo Van Fleet, Rhonda Fleming, John Ireland, Lyle Bettger, Frank Faylen, Earl Holliman', 'NR', 'Lawman Wyatt Earp and outlaw Doc Holliday form an unlikely alliance which culminates in their participation in the legendary Gunfight at the O.K. Corral.', 'Lawman Wyatt Earp and outlaw Doc Holliday form an unlikely alliance which culminates in their participation in the legendary Gunfight at the O.K. Corral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71AQUFbw49ALCNtKZ69flFmbRhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22201'),
  ('910825913560742292', 'Gunfight in Abilene', 1967, 'Western', 'William Hale, Maury Gertsman', 'John D. F. Black, Berne Giler', 'Bobby Darin, Emily Banks, Leslie Nielsen, Donnelly Rhodes, Don Galloway, Frank McGrath, Michael Sarrazin, Don Dubbins', 'NR', 'Fighting in the Civil War a man accidently kills his friend. Returning to Abilene after the war he finds his former sweetheart about to marry the brother of the man he killed. To pay his debt he not only refuses to win her back but takes the job of Sheriff, a job he doesn''t want, when the brother asks him. Still haunted by the killing he refuses to carry a gun. But there is trouble between the ranchers and the farmers and when he finds the brother murdered he straps on a gun and heads after the killer.', 'Fighting in the Civil War a man accidently kills his friend. Returning to Abilene after the war he finds his former sweetheart about to marry the brother of the man he killed. To pay his debt he not only refuses to win her back but takes the job of Sheriff, a job he doesn''t want, when the brother asks him. Still haunted by the killing he refuses to carry a gun. But there is trouble between the ranchers and the farmers and when he finds the brother murdered he straps on a gun and heads after the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7cAr0fUM2XEJIzNnSUR0vPS8AS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141666'),
  ('578739137073733989', 'Gunfighter''s Moon', 1997, 'Western, Romance', 'Larry Ferguson', 'Larry Ferguson', 'Lance Henriksen, Kay Lenz, David McIlwraith, Nikki DeLoach, Ivan Sergei, James Victor, Brent Stait, Yareli Arizmendi', 'PG-13', 'A notorious gunfighter returns to his ex-wife, who only wants him to save her sheriff husband from being killed by gunmen out to free his condemned prisoner.', 'A notorious gunfighter returns to his ex-wife, who only wants him to save her sheriff husband from being killed by gunmen out to free his condemned prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62T1Ek1TYlCrZ8sabXwQ1RAHn4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236035'),
  ('209774243363681046', 'Gunfighters', 1947, 'Western', 'George Waggner, Fred Jackman Jr.', 'Alan Le May', 'Randolph Scott, Barbara Britton, Dorothy Hart, Bruce Cabot, Charley Grapewin, Steven Geray, Forrest Tucker, Charles Kemper', 'NR', 'Gunfighter "Brazos" Kane lays aside his guns "forever" when he is forced to shoot his best friend, and decides to join another friend, Bob Tyrell, as a cowhand on the Inskip ranch. Upon arriving there he finds the bullet-riddled body of his friend. He carries the body to the Banner ranch, the largest in the territory, and is accused by Banner of murdering Tyrell; Banner orders Deputy Sheriff Bill Yount, who is in Banner''s pay, to arrest Kane. But Kane has the sympathy of Banner''s daughter, Jane, who notifies Inskip of Kane''s plight, and Inskip arrives in time to prevent a lynching. Sheriff Kiscade dismisses the murder charge for lack of evidence. Brazos then sets out to find the killer of his friend. Bess Bannister, Jane''s sister, is in love with the Banner ranch foreman, Bard Macky, and knowing that Bard killed Tyrell and that Kane will track him down, then hampers Kane''s mission somewhat by pretending to be in love with him.', 'Gunfighter "Brazos" Kane lays aside his guns "forever" when he is forced to shoot his best friend, and decides to join another friend, Bob Tyrell, as a cowhand on the Inskip ranch. Upon arriving there he finds the bullet-riddled body of his friend. He carries the body to the Banner ranch, the largest in the territory, and is accused by Banner of murdering Tyrell; Banner orders Deputy Sheriff Bill Yount, who is in Banner''s pay, to arrest Kane. But Kane has the sympathy of Banner''s daughter, Jane, who notifies Inskip of Kane''s plight, and Inskip arrives in time to prevent a lynching. Sheriff Kiscade dismisses the murder charge for lack of evidence. Brazos then sets out to find the killer of his friend. Bess Bannister, Jane''s sister, is in love with the Banner ranch foreman, Bard Macky, and knowing that Bard killed Tyrell and that Kane will track him down, then hampers Kane''s mission somewhat by pretending to be in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmDENgQ11fgWfq4ExnWjVhI94qb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55308'),
  ('504404788339309982', 'Gung Ho', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ron Howard, Donald Peterman', 'Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel', 'Michael Keaton, Gedde Watanabe, George Wendt, Mimi Rogers, John Turturro, So Yamamura, Sab Shimono, Rick Overton', 'PG-13', 'When a western Pennsylvania auto plant is acquired by a Japanese company, brokering auto worker Hunt Stevenson faces the tricky challenge of mediating the assimilation of two clashing corporate cultures. At one end is the Japanese plant manager and the sycophant who is angling for his position. At the other, a number of disgruntled long-time union members struggle with the new exigencies of Japanese quality control.', 'When a western Pennsylvania auto plant is acquired by a Japanese company, brokering auto worker Hunt Stevenson faces the tricky challenge of mediating the assimilation of two clashing corporate cultures. At one end is the Japanese plant manager and the sycophant who is angling for his position. At the other, a number of disgruntled long-time union members struggle with the new exigencies of Japanese quality control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxnlQEb8dugTFK2KyFrq3iv3bHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13698'),
  ('558710466805549857', 'Gung Ho!', 1943, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, War', 'Ray Enright, Milton Krasner, Fred Frank', 'Lucien Hubbard', 'Randolph Scott, Alan Curtis, Noah Beery Jr., J. Carrol Naish, Sam Levene, Robert Mitchum, Louis Jean Heydt, David Bruce', 'NR', 'A true-life epic that revolves around an exclusive bataillon of the U.S. Marine Corps during World War II, "Carlson''s Raiders," whose assignment is to take control of a South Pacific island once possessed by the United States but now under Japanese command.', 'A true-life epic that revolves around an exclusive bataillon of the U.S. Marine Corps during World War II, "Carlson''s Raiders," whose assignment is to take control of a South Pacific island once possessed by the United States but now under Japanese command.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juyMhRpiAsYDfOqeFWjA4qd4Ui5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18562'),
  ('367713025189685046', 'Gunga Din', 1939, 'Adventure, War, Action, Comedy', 'George Stevens, Edward Killy, Perry Ferguson', 'Fred Guiol, Joel Sayre', 'Cary Grant, Victor McLaglen, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Sam Jaffe, Eduardo Ciannelli, Joan Fontaine, Montagu Love, Robert Coote', 'NR', 'British army sergeants Ballantine, Cutter and MacChesney serve in India during the 1880s, along with their native water-bearer, Gunga Din. While completing a dangerous telegraph-repair mission, they unearth evidence of the suppressed Thuggee cult. When Gunga Din tells the sergeants about a secret temple made of gold, the fortune-hunting Cutter is captured by the Thuggees, and it''s up to his friends to rescue him.', 'British army sergeants Ballantine, Cutter and MacChesney serve in India during the 1880s, along with their native water-bearer, Gunga Din. While completing a dangerous telegraph-repair mission, they unearth evidence of the suppressed Thuggee cult. When Gunga Din tells the sergeants about a secret temple made of gold, the fortune-hunting Cutter is captured by the Thuggees, and it''s up to his friends to rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0tcuzMzQJGpTRkGzbg8c4fJ6Ga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24965'),
  ('406152257359600090', 'Gunhed', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Masato Harada, Toshio Miike, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Masahiro Takashima, Brenda Bakke, Eugene Harada, Kaori Mizushima, Randy Reyes, James Brewster Thompson, Aya Enjoji, Yousuke Saito', null, 'High-concept Sci-Fi adventure about an island that actually is a computer called Kyron 5, itself created to design and manufacture super-advanced robots to be used as slaves for the rest of the world. One day Kyron decides that human beings are unnecessary, so it declares war on the world. But Kyron cannot be tamed, and after many lives are lost in the attempt, mankind decides to leave Kyron to its own devices.', 'High-concept Sci-Fi adventure about an island that actually is a computer called Kyron 5, itself created to design and manufacture super-advanced robots to be used as slaves for the rest of the world. One day Kyron decides that human beings are unnecessary, so it declares war on the world. But Kyron cannot be tamed, and after many lives are lost in the attempt, mankind decides to leave Kyron to its own devices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySNPwAzfLwrUz2Yar3HCWK3huLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8415'),
  ('198654153775127850', 'Gunjan Saxena: The Kargil Girl', 2020, 'Action, Drama', 'Manush Nandan, Shanaya Kapoor, Sharan Sharma', 'Nikhil Mehrotra, Sharan Sharma', 'Pankaj Tripathi, Janhvi Kapoor, Angad Bedi, Manav Vij, Ayesha Raza Mishra, Vineet Kumar Singh, Chandan Anand, Riva Arora', null, 'Inspired by the life of a fearless young officer who made history by becoming the first Indian female Air Force officer to fly in a combat zone during the 1999 Kargil War', 'Inspired by the life of a fearless young officer who made history by becoming the first Indian female Air Force officer to fly in a combat zone during the 1999 Kargil War', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llWz6LbVpGPChnNnhAiGJyPMDwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645489'),
  ('819321734975709778', 'Gunless', 2010, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Western', 'William Phillips, Gregory Middleton', 'William Phillips', 'Paul Gross, Sienna Guillory, Tyler Mane, Callum Keith Rennie, Dustin Milligan, Graham Greene, Jay Brazeau, Laura Bertram', null, 'American gunslinger Sean Rafferty—aka The Montana Kid—is unable to find someone to duel in a Canadian town where no one understands the brutal code of the American Wild West.', 'American gunslinger Sean Rafferty—aka The Montana Kid—is unable to find someone to duel in a Canadian town where no one understands the brutal code of the American Wild West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Uda0Hizcl0aDLRP54GYu2soI86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43090'),
  ('454297830731111632', 'Gunman', 2025, 'Thriller, Action', 'Cristian Tapia Marchiori, Martín Sapia, Lautaro Perin', 'Cristian Tapia Marchiori, Clara Ambrosoni', 'Sergio Podeley, Julieta Díaz, Ramiro Blas, Maite Lanata, Mariano Torre, Matías Desiderio, Gonzalo Gravano, Bianca Di Pasquale', null, 'A former hitman accepts a minor job for his former boss. However, in a corrupt neighborhood, nothing is what it seems, and he quickly gets caught in a web of unexpected events. A race against time and his own destiny.', 'A former hitman accepts a minor job for his former boss. However, in a corrupt neighborhood, nothing is what it seems, and he quickly gets caught in a web of unexpected events. A race against time and his own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRd5ifLty4vn1vkWG5oozTlE1iX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450529'),
  ('18449157341514073', 'Gunman Called Nebraska', 1966, 'Western', 'Guglielmo Mancori, Antonio Román, Mario Bava', 'Jesús Navarro Carrión, Antonio Román', 'Ken Clark, Piero Lulli, Yvonne Bastien, Howard Ross, Alfonso Rojas, Antonio Gradoli, Francisco Sanz, Livio Lorenzon', null, 'A drifter helps a ranch couple fend off the approaches of a ruthless landowner.', 'A drifter helps a ranch couple fend off the approaches of a ruthless landowner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fi8rvoQT78p4EIRqabCcFQ0eDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129627'),
  ('257301960415516256', 'Gunman in the Streets', 1950, 'Crime', 'Frank Tuttle, Claude Renoir, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Jacques Companéez, Victor Pahlen', 'Dane Clark, Simone Signoret, Fernand Gravey, Robert Duke, Michel André, Fernand Rauzéna, Pierre Gay, Edmond Ardisson', 'NR', 'An American is on the run in the streets and back alleys of France.', 'An American is on the run in the streets and back alleys of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEe4ZwMHQd9Lmkk7ki07a3ullAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35547'),
  ('218242876037375232', 'Gunman''s Walk', 1958, 'Western', 'Phil Karlson, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'Frank S. Nugent', 'Van Heflin, Tab Hunter, Kathryn Grant, James Darren, Mickey Shaughnessy, Robert F. Simon, Edward Platt, Ray Teal', null, 'A powerful rancher always protects his wild adult son by paying for damages and bribing witnesses, until his crimes become too serious to rectify.', 'A powerful rancher always protects his wild adult son by paying for damages and bribing witnesses, until his crimes become too serious to rectify.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUGEWgmAeup5lh2tJ2f55nUYVSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42871'),
  ('922190959067175516', 'Gunmen', 1988, 'Action, Drama', 'Kirk Wong Chi-Keung, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah', 'Lip Wang-Fung, Law Kam-Fai', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Elizabeth Lee Mei-Fung, David Wu, Andrew Kam Yeung-Wah', null, 'This story follows a cop in Shanghai during the 1930s. His department is overrun with corruption, while gangsters rule the city via the opium trade.', 'This story follows a cop in Shanghai during the 1930s. His department is overrun with corruption, while gangsters rule the city via the opium trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgVvIY6R73y3y4Zn6zie5pE8aXX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173137'),
  ('120835750644128068', 'Gunmen', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Deran Sarafian, Hiro Narita', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Christopher Lambert, Mario Van Peebles, Denis Leary, Patrick Stewart, Sally Kirkland, Brenda Bakke, Rena Riffel, Kadeem Hardison', 'R', 'A New York DEA agent springs an outlaw from jail to lead him to stolen money in South America.', 'A New York DEA agent springs an outlaw from jail to lead him to stolen money in South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9beKwCwSZk8FhRISl9eLILvi3Qo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24231'),
