  ('370388434985068882', 'Gunnar Hede''s Saga', 1923, 'Drama', 'Mauritz Stiller, Julius Jaenzon, Henrik Jaenzon', 'Mauritz Stiller', 'Einar Hanson, Mary Johnson, Hugo Björne, Pauline Brunius, Stina Berg, Adolf Olschansky, Gustav Aronson, Julia Cederblad', null, 'Gunnar Hede is raised by a strict mother, who wants him to become respectable to match his family’s wealth. He is more interested in his grandfather, who started as an itinerant violin player, but got rich by leading a herd of wild reindeer south to market. He falls for a violinist working with a married couple of traveling performers and renounces his fortune to go with them. He then tries to earn a fortune by driving reindeer to market, but it doesn’t work out and he goes insane. He is finally restored to sanity by the violinist when she returns with the performers.', 'Gunnar Hede is raised by a strict mother, who wants him to become respectable to match his family’s wealth. He is more interested in his grandfather, who started as an itinerant violin player, but got rich by leading a herd of wild reindeer south to market. He falls for a violinist working with a married couple of traveling performers and renounces his fortune to go with them. He then tries to earn a fortune by driving reindeer to market, but it doesn’t work out and he goes insane. He is finally restored to sanity by the violinist when she returns with the performers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zChemakpCpy3b1QogjPVOMXUHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119981'),
  ('948214877073495684', 'Gunnar Rehlin - A Small Film About Hurting Someone', 1999, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Tomas Alfredson', 'Robert Gustafsson, Johan Rheborg, Martin Luuk', 'Gunnar Rehlin, Robert Gustafsson, Johan Rheborg, Jonas Inde, Jan-Olov Andersson, Suzanne Reuter, Benny Haag, Henrik Schyffert', null, 'A satiric campaign against the film critic Gunnar Rehlin.', 'A satiric campaign against the film critic Gunnar Rehlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mk457Uye7YmyzJDLbegJRLn4kwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160945'),
  ('54950476031471286', 'Gunner', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Gerardo Madrazo, Dimitri Logothetis', 'Dimitri Logothetis, Gary Scott Thompson', 'Luke Hemsworth, Morgan Freeman, Joseph Baena, Maurice P. Kerry, Mykel Shannon Jenkins, Grant Feely, Connor DeWolfe, Sean Rogers', 'NR', 'While on a camping trip in order to reconnect, war veteran Colonel Lee Gunner must save his two sons from a gang of violent bikers when they''re kidnapped after accidentally stumbling upon to a massive drug operation.', 'While on a camping trip in order to reconnect, war veteran Colonel Lee Gunner must save his two sons from a gang of violent bikers when they''re kidnapped after accidentally stumbling upon to a massive drug operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cS2TXN1YlrCvkZmMxaevC1ZKtEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5492'),
  ('884958238420620419', 'Gunner Palace', 2004, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Michael Tucker, Petra Epperlein, Michael Tucker', null, 'Bryant Davis, Devon Dixon, Javorn Drummond, Elliot Lovett, Nick Moncrief', 'PG-13', 'American soldiers of the 2/3 Field Artillery, a group known as the "Gunners," tell of their experiences in Baghdad during the Iraq War. Holed up in a bombed out pleasure palace built by Sadaam Hussein, the soldiers endured hostile situations some four months after President George W. Bush declared the end of major combat operations in the country.', 'American soldiers of the 2/3 Field Artillery, a group known as the "Gunners," tell of their experiences in Baghdad during the Iraq War. Holed up in a bombed out pleasure palace built by Sadaam Hussein, the soldiers endured hostile situations some four months after President George W. Bush declared the end of major combat operations in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iu1Qydj27eeVu7kvWzAjQGiNdEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30856'),
  ('255443010365134190', 'Gunpoint', 1966, 'Western', 'William Margulies, Earl Bellamy, Phil Bowles', 'Mary Willingham, Willard W. Willingham', 'Audie Murphy, Joan Staley, Warren Stevens, Edgar Buchanan, Denver Pyle, David Macklin, Nick Dennis, Royal Dano', 'NR', 'A young, determined sheriff and his posse chase a gang of murderous train robbers, and a kidnapped woman into New Mexico.', 'A young, determined sheriff and his posse chase a gang of murderous train robbers, and a kidnapped woman into New Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWG8GfnLaw6RDnuEcanEFIpu0Q8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167769'),
  ('1137237279021806357', 'Gunpowder', 1985, 'Drama, War', 'Viktor Aristov, Yuri Mamin, Yuri Vorontsov', 'Artur Makarov, Viktor Aristov', 'Yuri Belyayev, Svetlana Bragarnik, Lyubov Kalyuzhnaya, Vadim Makarovskiy, Nozheri Chonishvili, Vladimir Varentsov, Konstantin Sarynin, Loghman Karimov', null, 'At the end of September 1941, Soviet artillery troops in besieged Leningrad realize that pretty soon they will fire their last shot, and after that the defense of the city will be doomed. The film is based on a true event: a small group of fearless soldiers transported a large supply of gunpowder through enemy lines to Leningrad.', 'At the end of September 1941, Soviet artillery troops in besieged Leningrad realize that pretty soon they will fire their last shot, and after that the defense of the city will be doomed. The film is based on a true event: a small group of fearless soldiers transported a large supply of gunpowder through enemy lines to Leningrad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KtOwT8ovaiJYksiDM14AlW0cul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389556'),
  ('502463270082661994', 'Gunpowder Milkshake', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Seresin, Wolfgang Metschan, Ali Cherkaoui', 'Navot Papushado, Ehud Lavski', 'Karen Gillan, Lena Headey, Chloe Coleman, Carla Gugino, Michelle Yeoh, Angela Bassett, Paul Giamatti, Ralph Ineson', 'R', 'To protect an 8-year-old girl, a dangerous assassin reunites with her mother and her lethal associates to take down a ruthless crime syndicate and its army of henchmen.', 'To protect an 8-year-old girl, a dangerous assassin reunites with her mother and her lethal associates to take down a ruthless crime syndicate and its army of henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56ofGPMOZCwlTjTao5fB7vnGOoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574060'),
  ('672916521394070182', 'Guns', 1990, 'Action, Crime', 'Andy Sidaris, Howard Wexler, Mike Freedman', 'Andy Sidaris', 'Erik Estrada, Dona Speir, Roberta Vasquez, Bruce Penhall, Cynthia Brimhall, William Bumiller, Devin DeVasquez, Michael J. Shane', 'R', 'A South American gunrunner uses an island in Hawaii as his base of operations. A squad of beautiful government agents is sent to put him out of business.', 'A South American gunrunner uses an island in Hawaii as his base of operations. A squad of beautiful government agents is sent to put him out of business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF7FycBB2UKhBtzFfkjsSu9cPaN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46360'),
  ('888742801021433531', 'Guns & Talks', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Jang Jin, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Jang Jin', 'Shin Hyun-jun, Won Bin, Shin Ha-kyun, Jung Jae-young, Jung Jin-young, Oh Seung-hyun, Yun Ju-sang, Go Eun-mi', null, 'Four unlikely assassins question their assignments because they genuinely care about their customers and victims. However, they attract police attention and a prosecutor is on their trail.', 'Four unlikely assassins question their assignments because they genuinely care about their customers and victims. However, they attract police attention and a prosecutor is on their trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnPU3565er2vfhHsHd5jEqOjU3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23609'),
  ('933759032820193228', 'Guns Akimbo', 2020, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Jason Lei Howden, Stefan Ciupek, Robyn Grace', 'Jason Lei Howden', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Samara Weaving, Natasha Liu Bordizzo, Ned Dennehy, Rhys Darby, Grant Bowler, Edwin Wright, Milo Cawthorne', 'R', 'An ordinary guy suddenly finds himself forced to fight a gladiator-like battle for a dark website that streams the violence for viewers. In order to survive and rescue his kidnapped ex-girlfriend, he must battle Nix, a heavily armed and much more experienced fighter.', 'An ordinary guy suddenly finds himself forced to fight a gladiator-like battle for a dark website that streams the violence for viewers. In order to survive and rescue his kidnapped ex-girlfriend, he must battle Nix, a heavily armed and much more experienced fighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vV23MzddmlZJ6TIXpmRUyGV9961.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457335'),
  ('741260705810271640', 'Guns and Guts', 1974, 'Action, Western, Horror', 'René Cardona Jr., José Ortiz Ramos', 'Fernando Galiana', 'Jorge Rivero, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Rogelio Guerra, Zulma Faiad, Quintín Bulnes, René Cardona, Chano Urueta, José Antonio Mena', null, 'An outlaw and a scorned husband both team up to track down and kill the man that wronged them. Along the way, the two men meet a hired gun that loves money just as much as he loves the company of women, so the two men decide to hire him in order to help them on their mission. However, things become complicated when the man they all seek to kill has risen to become a wealthy sheriff with a small army of gunmen at his disposal.', 'An outlaw and a scorned husband both team up to track down and kill the man that wronged them. Along the way, the two men meet a hired gun that loves money just as much as he loves the company of women, so the two men decide to hire him in order to help them on their mission. However, things become complicated when the man they all seek to kill has risen to become a wealthy sheriff with a small army of gunmen at his disposal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdLNGgXG4nuz12JgBuFmAZHjDaN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124441'),
  ('357717782828191249', 'Guns and Roses', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ning Hao, Zhao Fei', 'Yue Xiaojun, Zheng Xiaoyang, Wang Hongwei', 'Lei Jiayin, Guo Tao, Tao Hong, Huang Bo, Liu Hua, Fan Wei, Cheng Yuanyuan, Fu Heng', null, 'The film tells the story of a group of Chinese youths who robbed a bank of the “Manchuguo”, a puppet regime formed in China’s northeastern provinces by Japanese invaders in the 1930s and ’40s.', 'The film tells the story of a group of Chinese youths who robbed a bank of the “Manchuguo”, a puppet regime formed in China’s northeastern provinces by Japanese invaders in the 1930s and ’40s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcq9jVvRFkunQuhImz5ltra35dM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111966'),
  ('375148201854446519', 'Guns at Batasi', 1964, 'Drama, War', 'John Guillermin, Douglas Slocombe', 'Leo Marks, Marshall Pugh, C.M. Pennington-Richards', 'Richard Attenborough, Jack Hawkins, Flora Robson, John Leyton, Mia Farrow, Cecil Parker, Errol John, Graham Stark', 'NR', 'An anachronistic martinet RSM on a remote Colonial African army caught in a local coup d''etat must use his experience to defend those in his care.', 'An anachronistic martinet RSM on a remote Colonial African army caught in a local coup d''etat must use his experience to defend those in his care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUZvtHoqIteUAEeBrNfiR56Tw5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64158'),
  ('409525523412587415', 'Guns for San Sebastian', 1967, 'Western', 'Henri Verneuil, Armand Thirard, Juan Luis Buñuel', 'Miguel Morayta, Ennio De Concini', 'Anthony Quinn, Charles Bronson, Jaime Fernández, Leon Askin, Anjanette Comer, Sam Jaffe, Silvia Pinal, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos', 'NR', 'Leon Alastray is an outlaw who has been given sanctuary by Father John, whom he then escorts to the village of San Sebastian. The village is deserted, with its cowardly residents hiding in the hills from Indians, who regularly attack the village and steal all their supplies. When Father John is murdered, the villagers mistakenly think the outlaw is the priest. Alastray at first tells them he is not a priest, but they don''t believe it, and an apparent miracle seems to prove they are correct. Eventually, he assists them in regaining their confidence and defending themselves.', 'Leon Alastray is an outlaw who has been given sanctuary by Father John, whom he then escorts to the village of San Sebastian. The village is deserted, with its cowardly residents hiding in the hills from Indians, who regularly attack the village and steal all their supplies. When Father John is murdered, the villagers mistakenly think the outlaw is the priest. Alastray at first tells them he is not a priest, but they don''t believe it, and an apparent miracle seems to prove they are correct. Eventually, he assists them in regaining their confidence and defending themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vxVQVdYD25o7oAdp7HQBDZ5Y6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67659'),
  ('274260129311117992', 'Guns of Darkness', 1962, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Anthony Asquith, Robert Krasker', 'John Mortimer', 'Leslie Caron, David Niven, David Opatoshu, James Robertson Justice, Eleanor Summerfield, Ian Hunter, Derek Godfrey, Richard Pearson', null, 'Committed pacifist Tom Jordan''s decision to help former President Rivera escape a military coup is a simple act of mercy that takes him and his wife to the edge of despair. It turns them into outlaws and fugitives, hunted by a vicious South American regime; yet it could also bring them together in a way they have never been before.', 'Committed pacifist Tom Jordan''s decision to help former President Rivera escape a military coup is a simple act of mercy that takes him and his wife to the edge of despair. It turns them into outlaws and fugitives, hunted by a vicious South American regime; yet it could also bring them together in a way they have never been before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DFh1mL9V1a2vo6Z5FMgrusYbX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258037'),
  ('213475613224497664', 'Guns of Diablo', 1964, 'Romance, Western', 'Boris Sagal, John M. Nickolaus Jr.', 'Berne Giler', 'Charles Bronson, Susan Oliver, Kurt Russell, Jan Merlin, John Fiedler, Douglas Fowley, Rayford Barnes, Ron Hagerthy', 'NR', '14-year-old Kurt Russell plays Jamie, an orphaned boy heading westward with a wagon train. Charles Bronson is a wagon scout Linc Murdock, who runs into difficulties when he meets old flame Maria, who is now married to corrupt lawman Rance Macklin. The jealous Macklin has Murdock arrested, but Maria frees him, permitting Murdock and Jamie to embark on a new adventure involving a "lost" gold mine. Edited from TV series, The Travels of Jaimie McPheeters', '14-year-old Kurt Russell plays Jamie, an orphaned boy heading westward with a wagon train. Charles Bronson is a wagon scout Linc Murdock, who runs into difficulties when he meets old flame Maria, who is now married to corrupt lawman Rance Macklin. The jealous Macklin has Murdock arrested, but Maria frees him, permitting Murdock and Jamie to embark on a new adventure involving a "lost" gold mine. Edited from TV series, The Travels of Jaimie McPheeters', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJ968kyCSeVOSwTNfkXKxZ2aXFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96089'),
  ('822538678568105363', 'Guns of the Magnificent Seven', 1969, 'Western', 'Paul Wendkos, Antonio Macasoli, José María Ochoa', 'Herman Hoffman', 'George Kennedy, James Whitmore, Monte Markham, Reni Santoni, Bernie Casey, Scott Thomas, Joe Don Baker, Tony Davis', 'G', 'When Quintero, a Mexican revolutionary leader, is left to rot in jail by the forces of President Diaz, it''s up to his subordinate, Max, to bust him out. With $600 in hand, he crosses the border into America and hires Chris Adams, a mercenary of considerable skill, who uses the rest of the cash on more hired guns. After the team is rounded out by experts on close-combat fighting, explosives, and knife-throwing, they set off to free Quintero.', 'When Quintero, a Mexican revolutionary leader, is left to rot in jail by the forces of President Diaz, it''s up to his subordinate, Max, to bust him out. With $600 in hand, he crosses the border into America and hires Chris Adams, a mercenary of considerable skill, who uses the rest of the cash on more hired guns. After the team is rounded out by experts on close-combat fighting, explosives, and knife-throwing, they set off to free Quintero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moFQCPRHvMGfvoFbF5lqEQw9ETX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12625'),
  ('620464018605427158', 'Guns of the Timberland', 1960, 'Western', 'Dick Moder, Robert D. Webb, Mike Moder', 'Joseph Petracca, Aaron Spelling', 'Alan Ladd, Jeanne Crain, Gilbert Roland, Frankie Avalon, Lyle Bettger, Noah Beery Jr., Verna Felton, Alana Ladd', 'NR', 'Logger Jim Hadley and his lumberjack crew are looking for new forest to cut. They locate a prime prospect outside the town of Deep Wells. The residents of Deep Wells led by Laura Riley are opposed to the felling of the trees, believing that losing them would cause mudslides during the heavy rains. Conflict between the town''s residents and the loggers is inevitable.', 'Logger Jim Hadley and his lumberjack crew are looking for new forest to cut. They locate a prime prospect outside the town of Deep Wells. The residents of Deep Wells led by Laura Riley are opposed to the felling of the trees, believing that losing them would cause mudslides during the heavy rains. Conflict between the town''s residents and the loggers is inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PKhasSgn6CXQQOUxRpko1PPj3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262780'),
  ('238583195611152729', 'Guns of the Trees', 1961, 'Drama', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Frances Stillman, Ben Carruthers, Adolfas Mekas, Argus Spear Juillard, Frank Kuenstler, Louis Brigante, Sudie Bond, Leonard Hicks', null, 'Barbara, a young woman consumed by despair, contemplates suicide, while a man she meets in a church and a married couple struggle to persuade her that life is still worth living. Mekas’s film weaves this intimate drama into a larger reflection on alienation, politics, and the turbulence of early 1960s America.', 'Barbara, a young woman consumed by despair, contemplates suicide, while a man she meets in a church and a married couple struggle to persuade her that life is still worth living. Mekas’s film weaves this intimate drama into a larger reflection on alienation, politics, and the turbulence of early 1960s America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spvecVPcNzXCz68gjr5Q9jVlLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165356'),
  ('170618728171792123', 'Guns Up', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Edward Drake, Brendan Galvin, Hannah Whitney', 'Edward Drake', 'Kevin James, Christina Ricci, Luis Guzmán, Joey Diaz, Melissa Leo, Timothy V. Murphy, Solomon Hughes, Francis Cronin', 'R', 'When a job goes horribly wrong, an ex-cop and family man who moonlights as a mob henchman has one night to get his family out of the city.', 'When a job goes horribly wrong, an ex-cop and family man who moonlights as a mob henchman has one night to get his family out of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RokBWEkQqJRZEVP3DPwGm5MYh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181540'),
  ('635802357580488217', 'Guns, Girls and Gambling', 2012, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Winnick, Jonathan Hale, Roxy Knight', 'Michael Winnick', 'Christian Slater, Powers Boothe, Dane Cook, Jeff Fahey, Chris Kattan, Helena Mattsson, Gary Oldman, Megan Park', 'R', 'The story throws Elvis impersonators, Indians, modern cowboys, a 6-foot-tall blond assassin, a frat boy, a corrupt sheriff and a prostitute into a chase for a priceless American Indian artifact stolen during a poker game at an Indian casino', 'The story throws Elvis impersonators, Indians, modern cowboys, a 6-foot-tall blond assassin, a frat boy, a corrupt sheriff and a prostitute into a chase for a priceless American Indian artifact stolen during a poker game at an Indian casino', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh9nzmODurUN2EtS5wwbdMHJDxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132923'),
  ('613887331851742349', 'Guns, Girls and Gangsters', 1959, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Edward L. Cahn, Kenneth Peach', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Mamie Van Doren, Gerald Mohr, Lee Van Cleef, Grant Richards, Elaine Edwards, John Baer, Paul Fix, Carlo Fiore', null, 'Chuck Wheeler gets out of the Pen and sets up an elaborate heist of Vegas casino money travelling by armored truck. He enlists the help of shady club owner Joe Darren and his ex-cellmate''s wife, Vi. Vi''s husband Mike is a trigger happy and jealous hothead and will not grant her a divorce. Mike escapes from prison right before the armored truck job goes into motion and promises trouble as he tries to locate his associates and his wandering wife.', 'Chuck Wheeler gets out of the Pen and sets up an elaborate heist of Vegas casino money travelling by armored truck. He enlists the help of shady club owner Joe Darren and his ex-cellmate''s wife, Vi. Vi''s husband Mike is a trigger happy and jealous hothead and will not grant her a divorce. Mike escapes from prison right before the armored truck job goes into motion and promises trouble as he tries to locate his associates and his wandering wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfZmusPhX4xb1vZ24plGDqjv6jA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87342'),
  ('706450688734994813', 'Gunshy', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jeff Celentano, John B. Aronson, BJ Davis', 'Larry Gross', 'William Petersen, Michael Wincott, Diane Lane, Kevin Gage, R. Lee Ermey, Meat Loaf, Musetta Vander, John Fleck', 'R', 'When the New York journalist Jake Bridges catches his girlfriend with another guy, he goes to Atlantic City to drink himself to oblivion. He is saved from a bar brawl by a small-time mobster Frankie, and Jake falls in love with Frankie''s girlfriend Melissa. Jake soon also joins Frankie in his money-collecting duties.', 'When the New York journalist Jake Bridges catches his girlfriend with another guy, he goes to Atlantic City to drink himself to oblivion. He is saved from a bar brawl by a small-time mobster Frankie, and Jake falls in love with Frankie''s girlfriend Melissa. Jake soon also joins Frankie in his money-collecting duties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5geXceRP6tTydcMrzRqA3pzu8rq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115373'),
  ('1046145584353902494', 'Gunsight Ridge', 1957, 'Western, Action, Adventure', 'Francis D. Lyon, Ernest Laszlo, Edward Killy', 'Talbot Jennings, Elisabeth Jennings', 'Joel McCrea, Mark Stevens, Joan Weldon, Addison Richards, George Chandler, Slim Pickens, Dan Blocker, Darlene Fields', null, 'An undercover agent takes the job of sheriff in order to find the men responsible for a series of stagecoach robberies.', 'An undercover agent takes the job of sheriff in order to find the men responsible for a series of stagecoach robberies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftOxlardb9XuZumfRg7tp8YTG8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204232'),
  ('759674198877460967', 'Gunslinger', 1956, 'Western, Romance', 'Roger Corman, Frederick E. West, Bartlett A. Carré', 'Charles B. Griffith, Mark Hanna', 'John Ireland, Beverly Garland, Allison Hayes, Martin Kingsley, Jonathan Haze, Margaret Campbell, Bruno VeSota, Chris Alcaide', 'NR', 'After her husband is gunned down, Rose Hood takes his place as sheriff of a small Western town.', 'After her husband is gunned down, Rose Hood takes his place as sheriff of a small Western town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9aBgbq3104nEBJIRmPF1TpLn8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187790'),
  ('109189162413133378', 'Gunslinger''s Revenge', 1998, 'Western, Comedy', 'Giovanni Veronesi, José Luis Alcaine', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Leonardo Pieraccioni', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Harvey Keitel, David Bowie, Sandrine Holt, Alessia Marcuzzi, Jim van der Woude, Yudii Mercredi, Andrew Dunford', 'PG-13', 'The idealistic lifestyle of an old West farmer, his Indian wife, and half-breed son is interrupted when the boy''s old gunslinger father returns. They are not happy with his return despite the old gunslinger''s intention to retire. Things take a turn for the worse when another gunslinger arrives in town, trying to force a battle with the father.', 'The idealistic lifestyle of an old West farmer, his Indian wife, and half-breed son is interrupted when the boy''s old gunslinger father returns. They are not happy with his return despite the old gunslinger''s intention to retire. Things take a turn for the worse when another gunslinger arrives in town, trying to force a battle with the father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXhepFdn3VVNBFSKqsT6koH2XFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62589'),
  ('304678467922663427', 'Gunslingers', 2025, 'Western', 'Brian Skiba, Patrice Lucien Cochet', 'Brian Skiba', 'Stephen Dorff, Heather Graham, Nicolas Cage, Randall Batinkoff, Cooper Barnes, Scarlet Rose Stallone, Tzi Ma, Jeremy Kent Jackson', 'R', 'When the most wanted man in America surfaces in a small Kentucky town, his violent history -- and a blood-thirsty mob seeking vengeance and a king’s ransom -- soon follow. As brothers face off against one another and bullets tear the town to shreds, this lightning-fast gunslinger makes his enemies pay the ultimate price for their greed.', 'When the most wanted man in America surfaces in a small Kentucky town, his violent history -- and a blood-thirsty mob seeking vengeance and a king’s ransom -- soon follow. As brothers face off against one another and bullets tear the town to shreds, this lightning-fast gunslinger makes his enemies pay the ultimate price for their greed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/O7REXWPANWXvX2jhQydHjAq2DV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1293286'),
  ('79940201971733841', 'Gunsmith Cats', 1995, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Kazuya Murata, Toshimitsu Kobayashi, Katsuichi Nakayama', 'Atsuji Kaneko', 'Michiko Neya, Kae Araki, Hochu Otsuka, Aya Hisakawa, Seizo Kato, Michihiro Ikemizu, Yoko Soumi, Akiko Hiramatsu', null, 'Rally Vincent and Minnie May Hopkins are just a pair of gun shop owners who do a bit of bounty hunting to make ends meet when a Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco, Firearms agent comes to them. Using the threat of arresting them for their lack of a retail license for their merchandise and the resulting unpaid taxes, he forces them to agree to cooperate in a sting to break a gun running ring. They have an initial success, but that brings new problems as the ring''s leader brings in a merciless assassin to eliminate these new enemies. It will take all their skill, allies and some luck to come out this crisis alive.', 'Rally Vincent and Minnie May Hopkins are just a pair of gun shop owners who do a bit of bounty hunting to make ends meet when a Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco, Firearms agent comes to them. Using the threat of arresting them for their lack of a retail license for their merchandise and the resulting unpaid taxes, he forces them to agree to cooperate in a sting to break a gun running ring. They have an initial success, but that brings new problems as the ring''s leader brings in a merciless assassin to eliminate these new enemies. It will take all their skill, allies and some luck to come out this crisis alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljo1Nku8OkzYiERNawAq7KHjsWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86791'),
  ('106725768356828200', 'Gunsmoke', 1953, 'Western', 'William Holland, Joseph Gershenson, Nathan Juran', 'D.D. Beauchamp', 'Audie Murphy, Susan Cabot, Paul Kelly, Charles Drake, Mary Castle, Jack Kelly, Jesse White, Donald Randolph', 'NR', 'Kittridge is hired by the villans but turns to defend the rancher Saxon after learning the true situation. Kittrige wins Saxon''s ranch with a cut of the cards but Saxon has other reasons for loosing the gamble. Telford and Lake try everything from bushwacking to setting a wildfire to stop the Saxon/Kittridge herd of cattle from reaching the railhead.', 'Kittridge is hired by the villans but turns to defend the rancher Saxon after learning the true situation. Kittrige wins Saxon''s ranch with a cut of the cards but Saxon has other reasons for loosing the gamble. Telford and Lake try everything from bushwacking to setting a wildfire to stop the Saxon/Kittridge herd of cattle from reaching the railhead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEI67VJbujFNllaRBiIHFIxzBTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128851'),
  ('729375123050453745', 'Gunsmoke: Return to Dodge', 1987, 'TV Movie, Action, Western', 'Vincent McEveety, Charles Correll, Joe Thornton', 'Jim Byrnes', 'James Arness, Amanda Blake, Buck Taylor, Fran Ryan, Earl Holliman, Ken Olandt, Patrice Martinez, Tantoo Cardinal', null, 'Will Mannon, "product of the Devil''s loins", is released from a frontier prison and promptly goes in search of the people who put him there around twelve years ago, Marshal Matt Dillon and Miss Kitty Russell.', 'Will Mannon, "product of the Devil''s loins", is released from a frontier prison and promptly goes in search of the people who put him there around twelve years ago, Marshal Matt Dillon and Miss Kitty Russell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WhLMpGhLVskK6NilaT3XM2avP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59945'),
  ('857155930005140448', 'Gunsmoke: The Last Apache', 1990, 'TV Movie, Western', 'Charles Correll, Jerry G. Callaway, Tom Connors', 'Earl W. Wallace', 'James Arness, Richard Kiley, Amy Stoch, Geoffrey Lewis, Ned Bellamy, Sam Vlahos, Joe Lara, Hugh O''Brian', null, 'James Arness rides again as Matt Dillon, the US Marshal he made popular in the 1955-75 TV series. In this movie he goes after a renegade Apache named Wolf who has taken his daughter captive. As a bargaining chip, Dillon helps two sons of Apache chief Geronimo out of the fort stockade and offers them in trade. Dillon is aided by an Army scout, Chalk Brighton.', 'James Arness rides again as Matt Dillon, the US Marshal he made popular in the 1955-75 TV series. In this movie he goes after a renegade Apache named Wolf who has taken his daughter captive. As a bargaining chip, Dillon helps two sons of Apache chief Geronimo out of the fort stockade and offers them in trade. Dillon is aided by an Army scout, Chalk Brighton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuQt2zSVBRpwOIkdSrI0FkUzTiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166449'),
  ('428847028999432166', 'Guntur Kaaram', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Trivikram Srinivas, Manoj Paramahamsa, Penumarty Prasad', 'Trivikram Srinivas', 'Mahesh Babu, Sreeleela, Ramya Krishnan, Prakash Raj, Jayaram, Rao Ramesh, Murali Sharma, Vennela Kishore', null, 'Years after his mother left him and remarried, Ramana is asked to sign documents denying any relations with his mother, but he refuses and demands answer to why his mother left him.', 'Years after his mother left him and remarried, Ramana is asked to sign documents denying any relations with his mother, but he refuses and demands answer to why his mother left him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvBt4YLy274ZmoMAfVlwmHkjVkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:868660'),
  ('478126490832327830', 'Gupt: The Hidden Truth', 1997, 'Thriller, Action, Romance', 'Rajiv Rai, Ashok Mehta', 'Rajiv Rai', 'Bobby Deol, Kajol, Manisha Koirala, Raj Babbar, Om Puri, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Ashok Saraf, Paresh Rawal', null, 'When Governor Jaisingh Sinha is murdered, the needle of suspicion points towards his estranged step-son, Sahil. Now Sahil must prove his innocence and find out who the real killer is.', 'When Governor Jaisingh Sinha is murdered, the needle of suspicion points towards his estranged step-son, Sahil. Now Sahil must prove his innocence and find out who the real killer is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTRAfzb2p2bAD3QnM34mzE9mp1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21906'),
  ('415796900286982766', 'Gurgaon', 2017, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Shanker Raman, Vivek Shah, Ajitpal Singh', 'Shanker Raman, Sourabh Ratnu', 'Akshay Oberoi, Pankaj Tripathi, Ragini Khanna, Shalini Vatsa, Aamir Bashir, Srinivas Sunderrajan', null, 'A real estate baron Kehri Singh manages ''Preet Real Estate'' which he runs in his daughter''s name whom he consider''s to be his lucky mascot. A sidelined and insulted Nikki Singh is ignored by his father and is considered to be insolent, useless and unlucky. In order to pay off a huge debt to a local criminal, Nikki sets off a chilling event that forces his father to revisit his dark past and confront a brutal truth.', 'A real estate baron Kehri Singh manages ''Preet Real Estate'' which he runs in his daughter''s name whom he consider''s to be his lucky mascot. A sidelined and insulted Nikki Singh is ignored by his father and is considered to be insolent, useless and unlucky. In order to pay off a huge debt to a local criminal, Nikki sets off a chilling event that forces his father to revisit his dark past and confront a brutal truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JI2ghMz3tP5bC96rxpQUluMvfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432140'),
  ('789839699768309404', 'Gurin with the Foxtail', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'John M. Jacobsen, Nille Tystad', 'Kjell Aukrust, Vibeke Idsøe', 'Toralv Maurstad, Grethe Kausland, Pia Borgli, Wenche Foss, Helge Reiss, Frank Robert, Bjørn Jenseg, Anders Hatlo', null, 'A gnome named Gurin wakes up with a foxtail as punishment for his practical jokes.', 'A gnome named Gurin wakes up with a foxtail as punishment for his practical jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJMObUKmWrSdZEU9DK7U4IrZE2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57282'),
  ('78120003175765901', 'Gurren Lagann The Movie: Childhood''s End', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Animation', 'Toyonori Yamada, Toru Nakano, Hiroyuki Imaishi', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Katsuyuki Konishi, Marina Inoue, Yukari Fukui, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Mitsuki Saiga, Masaya Onosaka, Michiko Neya', null, 'Simon and Kamina live in an underground city monitored by the village chief. When Simon stumbles upon an artifact and beastmen invade from the surface, Simon and Kamina rebel against them.', 'Simon and Kamina live in an underground city monitored by the village chief. When Simon stumbles upon an artifact and beastmen invade from the surface, Simon and Kamina rebel against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNjFlv4mJlkGLzfnLoU68YSy9KH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20986'),
  ('196833392638937292', 'Gurren Lagann the Movie: The Lights in the Sky Are Stars', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction, Animation, Adventure', 'Hiroyuki Imaishi, Toru Nakano, Toyonori Yamada', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Yukari Fukui, Marina Inoue, Katsuyuki Konishi, Masaya Onosaka, Mitsuki Saiga, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Shizuka Itoh', null, 'Seven years have passed after the battle of Teppelin... Humans have since reclaimed the surface of the earth and enjoy an unprecedented period of peace and prosperity. However, humanity''s increasing population growth triggers the sudden emergence of an unknown, powerful enemy. The fearsome, manipulative power of the mysterious Anti-Spiral proves too overwhelming for humans to even fight back. When everyone becomes desperate and loses hope, Team Dai-Gurren members reunite to stand up once again!', 'Seven years have passed after the battle of Teppelin... Humans have since reclaimed the surface of the earth and enjoy an unprecedented period of peace and prosperity. However, humanity''s increasing population growth triggers the sudden emergence of an unknown, powerful enemy. The fearsome, manipulative power of the mysterious Anti-Spiral proves too overwhelming for humans to even fight back. When everyone becomes desperate and loses hope, Team Dai-Gurren members reunite to stand up once again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJ1NsL2A7dwY63mBkHdP1K4kD3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23452'),
