  ('147827277574402732', 'Guru, the Mad Monk', 1970, 'Horror', 'Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan, Tom Moten', 'Andy Milligan', 'Neil Flanagan, Jaqueline Webb, Judith Israel, Jack Spencer, Frank Echols, Gerald Jacuzzo, Paul Lieber, Julia Wills', 'R', 'A deranged 15th Century prison colony chaplain exploits his power to get money for his church including murder and grave robbing committed by his vampire mistress and one-eyed hunchback assistant.', 'A deranged 15th Century prison colony chaplain exploits his power to get money for his church including murder and grave robbing committed by his vampire mistress and one-eyed hunchback assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Vbo005gb9kMwWT4vvpdA8CE9ag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81464'),
  ('272705248272610542', 'Guruvayoor Ambalanadayil', 2024, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vipin Das, Neeraj Revi', 'Deepu Pradeep', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran, Basil Joseph, Nikhila Vimal, Anaswara Rajan, Siju Sunny, Jagadish, Rekha, Baiju Santhosh', null, 'Vinu, who is still grieving over his breakup from five years ago, develops a strong relationship with Anandan, his prospective brother-in-law, but his attempts to resolve Anandan''s problems have some unexpected consequences.', 'Vinu, who is still grieving over his breakup from five years ago, develops a strong relationship with Anandan, his prospective brother-in-law, but his attempts to resolve Anandan''s problems have some unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSS17YFooUA33FKsJ0yJhWZzylb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068394'),
  ('545097698503683535', 'Gus', 1976, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vincent McEveety, Frank V. Phillips', 'Arthur Alsberg, Don Nelson', 'Ed Asner, Don Knotts, Gary Grimes, Tim Conway, Louise Williams, Dick Van Patten, Ronnie Schell, Bob Crane', 'G', 'The California Atoms are in last place with no hope of moving up. But by switching the mule from team mascot to team member, (He can kick 100 yard field goals!) they start winning, and move up in the rankings, Hurrah! The competition isn''t so happy.', 'The California Atoms are in last place with no hope of moving up. But by switching the mule from team mascot to team member, (He can kick 100 yard field goals!) they start winning, and move up in the rankings, Hurrah! The competition isn''t so happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p85XLgX858DoH5WjE07iABii7ja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20639'),
  ('429414724443643300', 'Gus', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jessie McCormack, Magela Crosignani', 'Jessie McCormack', 'Radha Mitchell, Michelle Monaghan, Jon Dore, Michael Weston, Mimi Kennedy, Sarah Aldrich, Nuala Campbell, Erik Van Wyck', null, 'Lizzie''s best friend, Andie, becomes pregnant and offers to give the baby to her. Lizzie''s husband, Peter, reluctantly goes along with being the child''s father, and Andie moves into the guest room for the remainder of the pregnancy.', 'Lizzie''s best friend, Andie, becomes pregnant and offers to give the baby to her. Lizzie''s husband, Peter, reluctantly goes along with being the child''s father, and Andie moves into the guest room for the remainder of the pregnancy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WZLSWwEGyaVghoFNCNyq2n5xPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172785'),
