  ('447831291423694486', 'Gushing Prayer', 1971, 'Drama', 'Hideo Itō, Haruhiko Arai, Masao Adachi', 'Masao Adachi', 'Aki Sasaki, Hiroshi Saito, Makiko Kim, Yûji Aoki, Masaaki Hiraoka, Susumu Iwabuchi, Shigenori Noda, Michio Akiyama', null, 'After 15-year-old Yasuko has her first orgasm with a teacher, she and her disillusioned group of friends decide to turn to prostitution to gain a better understanding of what emotions truly are.', 'After 15-year-old Yasuko has her first orgasm with a teacher, she and her disillusioned group of friends decide to turn to prostitution to gain a better understanding of what emotions truly are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxuX7HgY6ewo6aW8Q2LalaoLAil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135237'),
