  ('108954777845093034', 'Guthlee Ladoo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ishrat R Khan', 'Srinivas Abrol', 'Sanjay Mishra, Dhanay Seth, Heet Sharma, Subrat Dutta, Kalyanee Mulay, Kanchan Pagare, Sanjay Sonu, Sunita Shirole', null, 'Guthlee, son of a poor sweeper, has a dream - to go to school. But the obstacle is his caste. A headmaster is sympathetic to him but powerless against caste discrimination. When they develop an unspoken bond, Guthlee''s dream sees hope.', 'Guthlee, son of a poor sweeper, has a dream - to go to school. But the obstacle is his caste. A headmaster is sympathetic to him but powerless against caste discrimination. When they develop an unspoken bond, Guthlee''s dream sees hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fXh8g5YRPoCbYjqcSaKkorf03m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920026'),
  ('902200149536120777', 'Gutland', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Govinda Van Maele, Narayan Van Maele', 'Govinda Van Maele', 'Frederick Lau, Vicky Krieps, Gerdy Zint, Pit Bukowski, Marco Lorenzini, Leo Folschette, Christiane Hoffmann, Martine Kohn', null, 'Early one summer morning a young man, with a secret stashed away in a duffel bag, emerges from the forest. In a nearby village he asks around for work, but the farmers, suspicious to the point of hostility, are not very forthcoming. Only when Lucy, the mayor’s unruly daughter, takes a liking to him, does the village change its attitude: he is promptly offered a job as a farmhand and a caravan to live in. As time passes and he is gradually integrated into the community, it emerges that he’s not the only one with a past to hide. Something sinister is lurking under the immaculate surface of this picturesque little world - and it is slowly drawing him in.', 'Early one summer morning a young man, with a secret stashed away in a duffel bag, emerges from the forest. In a nearby village he asks around for work, but the farmers, suspicious to the point of hostility, are not very forthcoming. Only when Lucy, the mayor’s unruly daughter, takes a liking to him, does the village change its attitude: he is promptly offered a job as a farmhand and a caravan to live in. As time passes and he is gradually integrated into the community, it emerges that he’s not the only one with a past to hide. Something sinister is lurking under the immaculate surface of this picturesque little world - and it is slowly drawing him in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jYfYrarEQwBPK2x0h7uhhnLMLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434362'),
  ('930996190905476485', 'Gutshot Straight', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Justin Steele, Tiago Mesquita', 'Jerry Rapp', 'George Eads, AnnaLynne McCord, Steven Seagal, Ted Levine, Vinnie Jones, Stephen Lang, Tia Carrere, Fiona Dourif', 'R', 'A professional poker player falls deep into underworld when he takes an unexpected wager from a mysterious high roller.', 'A professional poker player falls deep into underworld when he takes an unexpected wager from a mysterious high roller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWtftwehOukt2YIrBqoUj0VplkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297702'),
  ('397202109514743629', 'Gutterballs', 2008, 'Horror', 'Ryan Nicholson', 'Ryan Nicholson', 'Alastair Gamble, Mihola Terzic, Nathan Witte, Wade Gibb, Candice Lewald, Jeremy Beland, Trevor Gemma, Nathan Dashwood', null, 'A brutally sadistic rape leads to a series of bizarre gory murders during a midnight disco bowl-a-rama at a popular bowling alley. One by one, players of two teams meet blood-drenched gruesome deaths at the hand of a black bowling-gloved masked killer. This alley runs red with blood by sunrise.', 'A brutally sadistic rape leads to a series of bizarre gory murders during a midnight disco bowl-a-rama at a popular bowling alley. One by one, players of two teams meet blood-drenched gruesome deaths at the hand of a black bowling-gloved masked killer. This alley runs red with blood by sunrise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djg6uCUSEJ7HdGrgpHx2CsJrfr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16915'),
  ('501170447400218700', 'Guy', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Alex Lutz', 'Alex Lutz', 'Alex Lutz, Tom Dingler, Pascale Arbillot, Brigitte Roüan, Dani, Nicole Calfan, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Sarah Suco', null, 'Gauthier, a young journalist, learns from his mother that he is the illegitimate son of Guy Jamet, a popular French singer whose heyday stretched unevenly from the 1960’s to the nineties. Guy is currently promoting a new album of old material and heads on tour. Armed with a camera, Gauthier decides to follow Guy, recording his daily routine and his concerts to create a documentary portrait.', 'Gauthier, a young journalist, learns from his mother that he is the illegitimate son of Guy Jamet, a popular French singer whose heyday stretched unevenly from the 1960’s to the nineties. Guy is currently promoting a new album of old material and heads on tour. Armed with a camera, Gauthier decides to follow Guy, recording his daily routine and his concerts to create a documentary portrait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWe3P1RIiqjHKW65hF2GW2CGkwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518668'),
  ('207355526829606374', 'Guy and Madeline on a Park Bench', 2010, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Damien Chazelle, Damien Chazelle', 'Damien Chazelle', 'Jason Palmer, Desiree Garcia, Sandha Khin, Frank Garvin, Bernard Chazelle, Eli Gerstenlauer, Andre Hayward, Maureen McCarthy', 'NR', 'After connecting with the shy Madeline, a jazz trumpeter embarks on a quest for a more gregarious paramour, but through a series of twists and turns punctuated by an original score, the two lovers seem destined to be together.', 'After connecting with the shy Madeline, a jazz trumpeter embarks on a quest for a more gregarious paramour, but through a series of twists and turns punctuated by an original score, the two lovers seem destined to be together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bu5XiVNVSlJkdihAv7Bnkdah3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46504'),
  ('173657194759065126', 'Guy Ritchie''s The Covenant', 2023, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Guy Ritchie, Ed Wild, Hazel Keane', 'Guy Ritchie, Ivan Atkinson, Marn Davies', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Dar Salim, Sean Sagar, Jason Wong, Rhys Yates, Christian Ochoa, Bobby Schofield, Emily Beecham', 'R', 'During the war in Afghanistan, a local interpreter risks his own life to carry an injured sergeant across miles of grueling terrain.', 'During the war in Afghanistan, a local interpreter risks his own life to carry an injured sergeant across miles of grueling terrain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVG8zFFYrpyYLoHChuEeOGAd6Ru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882569'),
  ('865305021147991914', 'Guy X', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Saul Metzstein, François Dagenais', 'John Paul Chapple, Steve Attridge', 'Jason Biggs, Natascha McElhone, Jeremy Northam, Sean Tucker, Hilmir Snær Guðnason, Harry Standjofski, Rob deLeeuw, Donny Falsetti', 'R', 'A black comedy set in 1979, about a soldier mistakenly posted to an Arctic military base.', 'A black comedy set in 1979, about a soldier mistakenly posted to an Arctic military base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAruqIkf1GxYyWS03pq7NKdp6dC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14407'),
  ('230276603083711763', 'Guyana: Crime of the Century', 1979, 'Drama, Thriller', 'René Cardona Jr., Leopoldo Villaseñor', 'René Cardona Jr., Carlos Valdemar', 'Stuart Whitman, John Ireland, Joseph Cotten, Bradford Dillman, Gene Barry, Jennifer Ashley, Yvonne De Carlo, Nadiuska', 'R', 'This horrific dramatization of the Guyana tragedy traces the steps of Reverend Jim Jones, a highly charismatic, but profoundly paranoid clergyman, who after years of evangelism and good deeds, begins his own church in the mid-western United States. When Jim Jones becomes increasingly obsessed with the belief that the CIA is "a wicked enemy" who is out to get him, he emigrates with his congregation to Guyana, where he plans to create a utopia. But Jim Jones'' utopia consists of a society where he demands his followers turn their minds, bodies and possessions over to him, one that is rife with orgies, physical violence, mental torture, and sexual abuse of children and adults. Ultimately, Jim Jones'' paranoia reaches a fevered pitch that culminates in him taking savage action against his own congregation. (VCI Home Video)', 'This horrific dramatization of the Guyana tragedy traces the steps of Reverend Jim Jones, a highly charismatic, but profoundly paranoid clergyman, who after years of evangelism and good deeds, begins his own church in the mid-western United States. When Jim Jones becomes increasingly obsessed with the belief that the CIA is "a wicked enemy" who is out to get him, he emigrates with his congregation to Guyana, where he plans to create a utopia. But Jim Jones'' utopia consists of a society where he demands his followers turn their minds, bodies and possessions over to him, one that is rife with orgies, physical violence, mental torture, and sexual abuse of children and adults. Ultimately, Jim Jones'' paranoia reaches a fevered pitch that culminates in him taking savage action against his own congregation. (VCI Home Video)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0xLTL5Cf1vbUw9C1sDAvKOLkGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28354'),
  ('253469469590707561', 'Guys & Balls', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hanno Lentz, Sherry Hormann', 'Benedikt Gollhardt', 'Maximilian Brückner, Dietmar Bär, Saskia Vester, David Rott, Rolf Zacher, Mariele Millowitsch, Christian Berkel, Carlo Ljubek', null, 'Ecki is a sweet, closeted gay man who works in his family’s bakery and plays goalie in his small town’s soccer team. When he both loses the big game, and is caught flirting with another player, his homophobic teammates throw him out. He vows to return one day with an all-gay team that will grind the heteros into the dust, so he sets off to find his “dream team.” With the help of his nurse sister, Ecki scours local gay bars and eventually assembles a hilariously motley but endearing crew of misfits that includes a leather-daddy threesome, a femme Turk with Beckham fantasies, a secret straight guy in love with the sister, and a seriously cute nurse eager for some private play-time with the goalie. Ecki now has two problems – turning this bunch into a team, and facing his own fears regarding his first romance.', 'Ecki is a sweet, closeted gay man who works in his family’s bakery and plays goalie in his small town’s soccer team. When he both loses the big game, and is caught flirting with another player, his homophobic teammates throw him out. He vows to return one day with an all-gay team that will grind the heteros into the dust, so he sets off to find his “dream team.” With the help of his nurse sister, Ecki scours local gay bars and eventually assembles a hilariously motley but endearing crew of misfits that includes a leather-daddy threesome, a femme Turk with Beckham fantasies, a secret straight guy in love with the sister, and a seriously cute nurse eager for some private play-time with the goalie. Ecki now has two problems – turning this bunch into a team, and facing his own fears regarding his first romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/womYVYLOzrGK28E3raSUS8xRtN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5873'),
  ('175418463346398372', 'Guys and Dolls', 1955, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Harry Stradling Sr., Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Marlon Brando, Jean Simmons, Frank Sinatra, Vivian Blaine, Robert Keith, Stubby Kaye, B.S. Pully, Johnny Silver', 'NR', 'In New York, a gambler is challenged to take a cold female missionary to Havana, but they fall for each other, and the bet has a hidden motive to finance a crap game.', 'In New York, a gambler is challenged to take a cold female missionary to Havana, but they fall for each other, and the bet has a hidden motive to finance a crap game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrSM6laJJLBVdMdWfeNRa1innnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4825'),
  ('995044145325426628', 'Guyver: Dark Hero', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Michael G. Wojciechowski, Steve Wang', 'Nathan Long', 'David Hayter, Kathy Christopherson, Bruno Giannotta, Stuart Weiss, Billi Lee, Jim O''Donoghoe, J.D. Smith, Alisa Merline', 'R', 'Sean Barker became the unwilling host to an alien bio-armor known as the Guyver. A year ago he destroyed the Kronos Corporation, an organization of mutants who want the Guyver. Now he is trying to find why the Guyver unit forces him to fight and kill evil.', 'Sean Barker became the unwilling host to an alien bio-armor known as the Guyver. A year ago he destroyed the Kronos Corporation, an organization of mutants who want the Guyver. Now he is trying to find why the Guyver unit forces him to fight and kill evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vbtLS0rdMty6SA1MOCUIqhfWbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11795'),
  ('1070319623180112475', 'Guyver: Out of Control', 1986, 'Horror, Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Watanabe', 'Monta Ibu', 'Yu Mizushima, Michie Tomizawa, Keiko Toda, Jun Hazumi, Norio Wakamoto, Yuji Fujishiro, Jurota Kosugi', null, 'One night, high school student Sho Fukamachi discovers a mysterious metal object. Then in a blinding flash of light, Sho finds that he has accidentally fused with the Guyver, a mecha of mysterious alien design. Now, to save his girlfriend, Mizuki Segawa, along with the entire world, Sho must become the Guyver to fight the Chronos Corporation and their biocreatures, called Zoanoids, who are hell-bent on world domination.', 'One night, high school student Sho Fukamachi discovers a mysterious metal object. Then in a blinding flash of light, Sho finds that he has accidentally fused with the Guyver, a mecha of mysterious alien design. Now, to save his girlfriend, Mizuki Segawa, along with the entire world, Sho must become the Guyver to fight the Chronos Corporation and their biocreatures, called Zoanoids, who are hell-bent on world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5gCSa8YpQeiG7aO6O2poDvEvxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76847'),
  ('118167322795434974', 'Guzaarish', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Amber Lall, Mohankumar Padya', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Bhavani Iyer, Rutvik Oza', 'Hrithik Roshan, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Shernaz Patel, Aditya Roy Kapur, Suhel Seth, Nafisa Ali, Rajit Kapoor, Vijay Crishna', 'PG', 'Ethan, a magician rendered paralyzed in an accident, sets off a furor when he makes a petition to the court to end his own life.', 'Ethan, a magician rendered paralyzed in an accident, sets off a furor when he makes a petition to the court to end his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQgjtBBZ9se2Kcir9xQ9xY2kzyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41518'),
