  ('239480792221608747', 'Gwen', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror, History', 'Adam Etherington, William McGregor, George Every', 'William McGregor', 'Eleanor Worthington-Cox, Maxine Peake, Richard Harrington, Mark Lewis Jones, Kobna Holdbrook-Smith, Richard Elfyn, Gwion Glyn, Jodie Innes', null, 'A mysterious — and suspicious — run of ill fortune plagues a teenage girl and her mother and sister on their hillside farm in this folk story set in the dark hills of Wales during the industrial revolution.', 'A mysterious — and suspicious — run of ill fortune plagues a teenage girl and her mother and sister on their hillside farm in this folk story set in the dark hills of Wales during the industrial revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VeWyKSyWjZ3fMh2VX1UX2dviQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543768'),
  ('298038389294151403', 'Gwen and the Book of Sand', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Jacques Ruisseau, Émile Bourget', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Jean-Paul Gaspari', 'Armand Babel, Raymond Jourdan, Lorella Di Cicco, Michel Robin, Saïd Amadis, Jacques Bouvier, Bertrand Bautheac', null, 'Gwen is a young girl adopted by a nomad tribe in a desert post-apocalyptic world. When Gwen''s friend is kidnapped, she and an old woman called Roseline embark on a trip to bring him back.', 'Gwen is a young girl adopted by a nomad tribe in a desert post-apocalyptic world. When Gwen''s friend is kidnapped, she and an old woman called Roseline embark on a trip to bring him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mC7gBQb2HK3PGwP9wdUAxuNbQk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108048'),
  ('585564062237450810', 'Gwendoline', 1984, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Just Jaeckin, André Domage', 'Just Jaeckin', 'Tawny Kitaen, Brent Huff, Zabou Breitman, Bernadette Lafont, Jean Rougerie, Roland Amstutz, Vernon Dobtcheff, Takashi Kawahara', 'R', 'A beautiful woman hires an intrepid adventurer to help find her father, who has disappeared in the jungle while searching for a rare and priceless butterfly. Along the way they run into cannibals, a race of Amazon warriors and all the usual attractions one would expect to find in a lost jungle.', 'A beautiful woman hires an intrepid adventurer to help find her father, who has disappeared in the jungle while searching for a rare and priceless butterfly. Along the way they run into cannibals, a race of Amazon warriors and all the usual attractions one would expect to find in a lost jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SPFoISga4Ya8S8Be3e58hL9Xou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19400'),
  ('790244768583701473', 'Gyeongju', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choo Kyoung-yeob, Cho Young-jik, Zhang Lu', 'Zhang Lu', 'Park Hae-il, Shin Min-a, Yoon Jin-seo, Kim Tae-hun, Kwak Ja-hyung, Shin So-yul, Bek Hyun-jin, Ryoo Seung-wan', null, 'A Beijing professor returns to his stomping grounds for a friend''s funeral. Reflecting on the past, he meets a tea shop owner who sparks feelings of love in a time of pain.', 'A Beijing professor returns to his stomping grounds for a friend''s funeral. Reflecting on the past, he meets a tea shop owner who sparks feelings of love in a time of pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nN7QQlusEwWp1ObnuZeZzAO2LEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272687'),
  ('722384891433655290', 'Gym Class', 2023, 'Drama', 'Stefano Cipani, Fabio Cianchetti', 'Damiano D''Innocenzo, Fabio D''Innocenzo', 'Angela Finocchiaro, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Raffaella Rea, Sergio Rubini, Claudio Santamaria', null, 'Three middle school parents are summoned by the principal after their children are implicated in a serious incident. In the gym, transformed into an impromptu courtroom, they wage a fierce battle of denials and obfuscations to suppress the truth.', 'Three middle school parents are summoned by the principal after their children are implicated in a serious incident. In the gym, transformed into an impromptu courtroom, they wage a fierce battle of denials and obfuscations to suppress the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsC9ljsEX3IoCHEuNAspx6LnUSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926532'),
  ('165884100533250380', 'Gymkata', 1985, 'Action, Drama', 'Robert Clouse, Godfrey A. Godar, Vladimir Špindler', 'Charles Robert Carner', 'Kurt Thomas, Tetchie Agbayani, Richard Norton, Edward Bell, John Barrett, Conan Lee, Bob Schott, Buck Kartalian', 'R', 'U.S. agents send a gymnastic martial artist to secure a missile-base site in the savage country of Parmistan.', 'U.S. agents send a gymnastic martial artist to secure a missile-base site in the savage country of Parmistan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8RhLH1TTJppX0sr4pHGLdKFbc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14570'),
  ('395718551367405968', 'Gymnopédies', 1965, 'Animation, Music', 'Lawrence Jordan', null, null, null, 'Animation. The theme is Weightlessness. Objects and characters are cut loose from habitual meanings, also from tensions and gravitational limitations. A lyric Eric Satie track accompanies the film. Such a portrait seems necessary from time to time to remind us that equilibrium and harmony are possible, and that we will not dissolve into a jelly if we allow ourselves to relax into them: A horseman rides through the landscape, through the town, but never arrives anywhere in particular. An acrobat swings on a rope above a canal in Venice, and is content just to swing there. Nothing threatens to disturb them. This film is a total contrast to the Kafka-like oddities of Eastern European animation. —Canyon Cinema', 'Animation. The theme is Weightlessness. Objects and characters are cut loose from habitual meanings, also from tensions and gravitational limitations. A lyric Eric Satie track accompanies the film. Such a portrait seems necessary from time to time to remind us that equilibrium and harmony are possible, and that we will not dissolve into a jelly if we allow ourselves to relax into them: A horseman rides through the landscape, through the town, but never arrives anywhere in particular. An acrobat swings on a rope above a canal in Venice, and is content just to swing there. Nothing threatens to disturb them. This film is a total contrast to the Kafka-like oddities of Eastern European animation. —Canyon Cinema', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dMzDN2MmqLa3dEMJqkGL9eYDuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209677'),
  ('326915366911725430', 'Gyo: Tokyo Fish Attack', 2012, 'Animation, Horror', 'Hajime Takakuwa, Takayuki Hirao, Kei Tsunematsu', 'Akihiro Yoshida, Takayuki Hirao', 'Mirai Kataoka, Takuma Negishi, Ami Taniguchi, Masami Saeki, Hiroshi Okazaki, Hidetaka Abe, Mori Kaneko', 'R', 'To celebrate their graduation from university Kaori and her two friends visit Okinawa in southern Japan for a short vacation. At the vacation house, provided by Tadashi''s uncle, a numbing stench awaits the girls, and can be traced to a horrendously deformed, legged fish that Kaori kills. More and more of these creatures appear and portend a horrific change for the animal life in the area. A phone call from Kaori''s fiancé Tadashi in Tokyo quickly shows the scope of this epidemic, when he is also attacked by these mechanized fish. Kaori immediately sets out on an perilous voyage to find out what happened to Tadashi, helped by Shirakawa — a videographer in search of the truth behind all this...', 'To celebrate their graduation from university Kaori and her two friends visit Okinawa in southern Japan for a short vacation. At the vacation house, provided by Tadashi''s uncle, a numbing stench awaits the girls, and can be traced to a horrendously deformed, legged fish that Kaori kills. More and more of these creatures appear and portend a horrific change for the animal life in the area. A phone call from Kaori''s fiancé Tadashi in Tokyo quickly shows the scope of this epidemic, when he is also attacked by these mechanized fish. Kaori immediately sets out on an perilous voyage to find out what happened to Tadashi, helped by Shirakawa — a videographer in search of the truth behind all this...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MUHxk2UicWtCLcfdPPLgxmUrDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94684'),
