  ('1406341744330407', 'H', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Carlos Pardo Ros', 'Carlos Pardo Ros, Pablo Gisbert', 'Itsaso Arana, Leonard Plattner, Julio Carlos Ramos Zapata, Pedro LaDroga, Abelo Valis', null, 'During the San Fermín celebrations in Pamplona in 1969, a man died when the bulls were let loose. There was nothing to identify him, except for the letter “H” on his keyring. Carlos Pardo Ros imagines this man’s last night: a drunken nocturnal stroll with the ghosts of H, at one of the world’s biggest folk festivals.', 'During the San Fermín celebrations in Pamplona in 1969, a man died when the bulls were let loose. There was nothing to identify him, except for the letter “H” on his keyring. Carlos Pardo Ros imagines this man’s last night: a drunken nocturnal stroll with the ghosts of H, at one of the world’s biggest folk festivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9cl3Q0phAdSmGGFg30pYUTnEde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951191'),
