  ('205994058198173143', 'H.G. Wells'' War of the Worlds', 2005, 'Science Fiction', 'Steven Parker, David Michael Latt', 'David Michael Latt, Carlos De Los Rios', 'C. Thomas Howell, Rhett Giles, Jake Busey, Peter Greene, Tinarie Van Wyk-Loots, Dashiell Howell, Kim Little, Leigh Scott', null, 'In this modern retelling of H.G. Wells'' classic sci-fi horror, civilization is laid to ruin when a super race of aliens invades Earth. In a blink of an eye, massive "walkers" cover the planet, annihilating all in their path. As cities crumble and human flesh is ripped from the bone, one man struggles to find the one weapon that will turn the tide for mankind.', 'In this modern retelling of H.G. Wells'' classic sci-fi horror, civilization is laid to ruin when a super race of aliens invades Earth. In a blink of an eye, massive "walkers" cover the planet, annihilating all in their path. As cities crumble and human flesh is ripped from the bone, one man struggles to find the one weapon that will turn the tide for mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPhCFmtnHUwKtzVY7SglwioOnGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34812'),
  ('203949221160992246', 'H.H. Holmes: America''s First Serial Killer', 2004, 'Crime, Documentary, History', 'John Borowski', null, 'Tony Jay, Willy Laszlo', null, 'Torture chambers, acid vats, greased chutes and gassing rooms were just some of the devices of death designed by the Torture Doctor, H.H. Holmes in his castle of horrors. Follows Holmes'' entire life as a criminal mastermind.', 'Torture chambers, acid vats, greased chutes and gassing rooms were just some of the devices of death designed by the Torture Doctor, H.H. Holmes in his castle of horrors. Follows Holmes'' entire life as a criminal mastermind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZOfFhkrwhqBynucPcgXkZ5SFAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13558'),
  ('51510288096318140', 'H.M. Deserters', 1986, 'Comedy, History, War, Adventure', 'Janusz Majewski, Witold Adamek', 'Janusz Majewski, Pavel Hajný', 'Marek Kondrat, Wiktor Zborowski, Krzysztof Kowalewski, Wojciech Pokora, Zoltán Bezerédy, Anna Gornostaj, Kalina Jędrusik, Jerzy Michotek', null, 'Set in 1918, this World War I drama follows a group of Austro-Hungarian soldiers—Czechs, Jews, Italians, and others—confined in a provincial barracks under German officers. Subjected to the cruelty of a sadistic lieutenant, they rebel, humiliate him, and later attempt escape. Disguised as guards for veterinary surgeons in Budapest, the deserters are eventually recaptured and returned for court-martial, forced once more to face their tormentor.', 'Set in 1918, this World War I drama follows a group of Austro-Hungarian soldiers—Czechs, Jews, Italians, and others—confined in a provincial barracks under German officers. Subjected to the cruelty of a sadistic lieutenant, they rebel, humiliate him, and later attempt escape. Disguised as guards for veterinary surgeons in Budapest, the deserters are eventually recaptured and returned for court-martial, forced once more to face their tormentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LkJMXH1MZldHzjaHeTJTuePJP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36264'),
  ('309853221057152113', 'H.M. Pulham, Esq.', 1941, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Ray June', 'Elizabeth Hill, King Vidor', 'Hedy Lamarr, Robert Young, Ruth Hussey, Charles Coburn, Van Heflin, Fay Holden, Bonita Granville, Douglas Wood', 'NR', 'A middle-aged businessman who has lived a conservative life according to the routine conventions of society, still remembers the beautiful young woman who once brought him out of his shell.', 'A middle-aged businessman who has lived a conservative life according to the routine conventions of society, still remembers the beautiful young woman who once brought him out of his shell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usj8p3y51ePMcMoHlNkzqe4A9me.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96107'),
  ('938501446189859057', 'H.M.S. Defiant', 1962, 'Adventure, History, War', 'Lewis Gilbert, Christopher Challis', 'Nigel Kneale, Edmund H. North', 'Alec Guinness, Dirk Bogarde, Anthony Quayle, Maurice Denham, Nigel Stock, Tom Bell, Richard Carpenter, Peter Gill', null, 'Defiant''s crew is part of a fleet-wide movement to present a petition of grievances to the Admiralty. Violence must be no part of it. The continual sadism of Defiant''s first officer makes this difficult, and when the captain is disabled, the chance for violence increases.', 'Defiant''s crew is part of a fleet-wide movement to present a petition of grievances to the Admiralty. Violence must be no part of it. The continual sadism of Defiant''s first officer makes this difficult, and when the captain is disabled, the chance for violence increases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN8zeOsIqsyZGsEHDX403pMkf0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42997'),
  ('1114132009533221340', 'H.O.T.S.', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Seth Sindell, Harvey Genkins', 'Joan Buchanan, Cheri Caffaro', 'Susan Kiger, Lisa London, Pamela Jean Bryant, Kimberly Cameron, Mary Steelsmith, Angela Aames, Marjorie Andrade, Cece Bullard', 'R', 'Four girls spurned by the popular Sorority on campus decide to start their own and steal all the men on campus away from the house that rejected them.', 'Four girls spurned by the popular Sorority on campus decide to start their own and steal all the men on campus away from the house that rejected them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOnW3QMCeJDPoc8VMCkb8sbM19u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59181'),
  ('165408281165316127', 'H.P. Lovecraft''s Witch House', 2022, 'Horror', 'Bobby Easley', 'Bobby Easley, Ken Wallace', 'Portia Chellelynn, Julie Anne Prescott, Andrea Collins, Erin Trimble, Solon Tsangaras, John Johnson, Lee Hale, Tom Alvarez', null, 'Graduate student Alice Gilman is running from an abusive past. She seeks refuge in the infamous Hannah house; a historic home with an ominous past. Determined to prove the possibility of alternate dimensions, she unknowingly unlocks a gateway to unimaginable horror. Based on the H.P. Lovecraft''s short story The Dreams in the Witch House.', 'Graduate student Alice Gilman is running from an abusive past. She seeks refuge in the infamous Hannah house; a historic home with an ominous past. Determined to prove the possibility of alternate dimensions, she unknowingly unlocks a gateway to unimaginable horror. Based on the H.P. Lovecraft''s short story The Dreams in the Witch House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KmscR49WkmuPJKjmK4OUmsRn5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988165'),
  ('134401723583335328', 'H0us3', 2019, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Manolo Munguía, Iñaki Gorraiz', 'Sergio Martínez, Manolo Munguía', 'Rubèn Serrano, Roc Esquius, Míriam Tortosa, Anna Bertran, Mariona Tena, Víctor Gómez, Diana Roig, Bernat Mestre', null, 'A group of former computer University colleagues and their partners meet for dinner after several years only to share one of the most secret files on the Internet.', 'A group of former computer University colleagues and their partners meet for dinner after several years only to share one of the most secret files on the Internet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKKSvaUcZLHW2na5QWnPAf8TR6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586134'),
  ('1098432556009833256', 'H₂O', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Ralph Steiner, Ralph Steiner', null, null, null, 'A cinematic tone poem, showcasing the dynamic nature of water through its various forms.', 'A cinematic tone poem, showcasing the dynamic nature of water through its various forms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBFzCaZgI2US48CwodmbYtW7AWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91210'),
  ('384505805998691734', 'H2S', 1969, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Roberto Faenza, Giulio Albonico, Bruno Nicolai', 'Roberto Faenza', 'Lionel Stander, Denis Gilmore, Carole André, Giancarlo Cobelli, Paolo Poli, Franco Valobra, Alfred Thomas, Massimo Sarchielli', null, 'Young student runs away from a 1984-esque dictatorship, lives for a while with a crazy girl in a surrealistic “igloo” in snowy wilderness and then returns to lead a revolution against the oppressive system. Sci-fi tale consistent with the political climate of May 68.', 'Young student runs away from a 1984-esque dictatorship, lives for a while with a crazy girl in a surrealistic “igloo” in snowy wilderness and then returns to lead a revolution against the oppressive system. Sci-fi tale consistent with the political climate of May 68.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n65YiHrCbiGsts77yBTYJ9Lj0iY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280182'),
  ('861786147272324929', 'H3 - Halloween Horror Hostel', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Michael Karen', null, 'Ivonne Schönherr, Mirjam Weichselbraun, Jennifer Ulrich, Alfonso Losa, Axel Stein, Christian Tramitz, Mike Krüger, Hendrik von Bültzingslöwen', null, 'When the driver manages to crash the car on the road in the middle of nowhere, three guys and a girl seem to have no other choice than to walk through the dark woods to find the nearest hostel...', 'When the driver manages to crash the car on the road in the middle of nowhere, three guys and a girl seem to have no other choice than to walk through the dark woods to find the nearest hostel...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgo6utNadfUPmHNZC9Si7InoJsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272426'),
  ('356603520600570331', 'H6: Diary of a Serial Killer', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Martín Garrido, Sergio Delgado', null, 'Fernando Acaso, María José Bausá, Raquel Arenas, Xènia Reguant, Sonia Moreno, Alejo Sauras, Martín Garrido, Miquel Sitjar', null, 'H6 tells the story of Antonio Frau, a serial killer set free after serving 25 years in jail for the violent murder of his girlfriend. After inheriting and old motel from a relative he never knew, he sees this as a signal and takes to his holy task of relieving the grief of those who have lost the will to live. He takes his victims to room Number 6 in the motel where he ''purifies'' them, while, at the same time, continues his everyday life next to his wife. A mistake leads to his arrest, and his plan to become rich and famous takes relevance.', 'H6 tells the story of Antonio Frau, a serial killer set free after serving 25 years in jail for the violent murder of his girlfriend. After inheriting and old motel from a relative he never knew, he sees this as a signal and takes to his holy task of relieving the grief of those who have lost the will to live. He takes his victims to room Number 6 in the motel where he ''purifies'' them, while, at the same time, continues his everyday life next to his wife. A mistake leads to his arrest, and his plan to become rich and famous takes relevance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf0RC10sWb2C54cMIgGMQfUeKUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39928'),
  ('34764215256010575', 'Ha Ha Ha', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hong Sang-soo, Lee Kwang-kuk, Park Hong-yeol', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Kim Sang-kyung, Yu Jun-sang, Moon So-ri, Ye Ji-won, Kim Kang-woo, Youn Yuh-jung, Kim Gyu-ri, Ki Joo-bong', null, 'Over drinks, two friends agree to swap fond memories of their recent trips to the same seaside town. As the stories unfold in flashback, it becomes evident their accounts take place at the same time and with the same people.', 'Over drinks, two friends agree to swap fond memories of their recent trips to the same seaside town. As the stories unfold in flashback, it becomes evident their accounts take place at the same time and with the same people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YxJAZvjuVxqyW6fthjwXO8JDsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60098'),
  ('605881732702263533', 'Ha llegado un ángel', 1961, 'Drama', 'Luis Lucia', null, 'Marisol, Isabel Garcés, Carlos Larrañaga, José Marco Davó, Ana María Custodio, Raquel Daina, Ángeles Macua, Pilar Sanclemente', null, 'After losing her father at sea, young Marisol leaves Cádiz for Madrid, stepping into a household unraveling under the vanity of her aunt Leonor and the chaos of her spoiled cousins. With Javier facing jail, Churri chasing suitors, Jorge skipping studies, and little Pili lost in cinema dreams, Marisol takes it upon herself to restore order. Armed with grit, a loyal maid, and a friend from the train, she battles dysfunction and deception—earning Leonor’s scorn but fighting for a family worth saving.', 'After losing her father at sea, young Marisol leaves Cádiz for Madrid, stepping into a household unraveling under the vanity of her aunt Leonor and the chaos of her spoiled cousins. With Javier facing jail, Churri chasing suitors, Jorge skipping studies, and little Pili lost in cinema dreams, Marisol takes it upon herself to restore order. Armed with grit, a loyal maid, and a friend from the train, she battles dysfunction and deception—earning Leonor’s scorn but fighting for a family worth saving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHyEXqPHVkk6wwqFfnSna4E1VEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77843'),
  ('61054716787737047', 'Ha-Chan, Shake Your Booty!', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Josef Kubota Wladyka, Daniel Satinoff', 'Josef Kubota Wladyka, Nicholas Huynh', 'Alberto Guerra, Alejandro Edda, YOU, Yoh Yoshida, Cristina Rodlo', null, 'Haru and Luis love competing in Tokyo''s ballroom dance scene, but after tragedy strikes, Haru withdraws into isolation. When friends coax her back to the studio, she develops an infatuation with the new instructor.', 'Haru and Luis love competing in Tokyo''s ballroom dance scene, but after tragedy strikes, Haru withdraws into isolation. When friends coax her back to the studio, she develops an infatuation with the new instructor.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6oy8M0wfNluMSntK3AK3zXoNDG0.jpg', 'plex:movie:ha-chan-shake-your-booty'),
  ('481804891701843855', 'Ha! Ha! Ha!', 1934, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer, Sammy Timberg', null, 'Mae Questel', null, 'After drawing Betty Boop, Max Fleischer (live-action) leaves the studio; Betty and Koko try amateur dentistry, releasing enough laughing gas to convulse the ''real world.''', 'After drawing Betty Boop, Max Fleischer (live-action) leaves the studio; Betty and Koko try amateur dentistry, releasing enough laughing gas to convulse the ''real world.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qibWH37hKe4Mqdy3WDJu8EK9xRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174285'),
  ('236402172594085306', 'Haan Maine Bhi Pyaar Kiya', 2002, 'Romance, Music', 'Dharmesh Darshan', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Karisma Kapoor, Abhishek Bachchan, Shakti Kapoor, Simone Singh, Mohnish Behl, Shweta Menon, Himani Shivpuri', null, 'Shiv (Abhishek Bachchan) and Pooja (Karisma Kapoor) are happily married to each other but sometimes can get into the most petty arguments coming from the way they approach life. Shiv takes each day as it comes whilst Pooja''s imagination sometimes gets the best of her. Pooja falls in love with Shiv so much that she gives up her high rising career for him and settles as a housewife. Their in-difference gets worse and Pooja is soon convinced that Shiv has been unfaithful. Pooja asks for a divorce and leaves him. She carries on with life and meets Raj (Akshay Kumar). Raj has everything anyone could ask for: money, fame but not love something he has craved for some time. He falls for Pooja and she also begins to like him. They get engaged and as the wedding approaches, Shiv re-enters Pooja''s life. Old feelings and emotions come rushing back and she finds herself torn between two men. Who does she choose...?', 'Shiv (Abhishek Bachchan) and Pooja (Karisma Kapoor) are happily married to each other but sometimes can get into the most petty arguments coming from the way they approach life. Shiv takes each day as it comes whilst Pooja''s imagination sometimes gets the best of her. Pooja falls in love with Shiv so much that she gives up her high rising career for him and settles as a housewife. Their in-difference gets worse and Pooja is soon convinced that Shiv has been unfaithful. Pooja asks for a divorce and leaves him. She carries on with life and meets Raj (Akshay Kumar). Raj has everything anyone could ask for: money, fame but not love something he has craved for some time. He falls for Pooja and she also begins to like him. They get engaged and as the wedding approaches, Shiv re-enters Pooja''s life. Old feelings and emotions come rushing back and she finds herself torn between two men. Who does she choose...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFVcLKae1o8mV8xeWTWM9Ej6paJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165979'),
  ('906016759696000538', 'Haasil', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tigmanshu Dhulia', 'Tigmanshu Dhulia', 'Jimmy Shergill, Hrishitaa Bhatt, Irrfan Khan, Ashutosh Rana, Varun Badola, Sudhir Pandey, Tinnu Anand, Sharat Saxena', null, 'Anirudhh, a law-abiding college student, in love with Niharika, gets caught up in college politics and crime, and must fight it out for himself, when friends turn into foes.', 'Anirudhh, a law-abiding college student, in love with Niharika, gets caught up in college politics and crime, and must fight it out for himself, when friends turn into foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7y8PBC2OyhnlJl8O4IPYa1IKmf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114813'),
  ('893704110994752698', 'Haathi Mere Saathi', 1971, 'Drama, Family', 'M. A. Thirumugam', 'Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar', 'Rajesh Khanna, Tanuja Samarth, David Abraham Cheulkar, Sujit Kumar, K.N. Singh, Madan Puri, Mehmood Jr.', null, 'Raju becomes very attached to his four elephants after they save his life. His wife, however, fears for her child and tells him that he must choose between the animals and his family.', 'Raju becomes very attached to his four elephants after they save his life. His wife, however, fears for her child and tells him that he must choose between the animals and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCRXU6bAmUv3ebwlmWwu05sjAFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304701'),
  ('245772753178627236', 'Habana Blues', 2005, 'Drama, Music', 'Benito Zambrano, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Ernesto Chao', 'Alberto Yoel, Roberto San Martín, Yailene Sierra, Mayra Rodríguez, Ernesto Escalona, Marta Calvó, Roger Pera, Osvaldo Doimeadiós', null, 'When Spanish record producers express interest in Cuban musicians Ruy and Tito, the longtime friends are faced with the prospect of leaving their loved ones behind. After years of hoping and dreaming, they''ve finally earned the opportunity to bring their music to the rest of the world. But are the emotional trade-offs worth it in the end?', 'When Spanish record producers express interest in Cuban musicians Ruy and Tito, the longtime friends are faced with the prospect of leaving their loved ones behind. After years of hoping and dreaming, they''ve finally earned the opportunity to bring their music to the rest of the world. But are the emotional trade-offs worth it in the end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNBwz9yAQmMli51RZ6lWMt0v8wi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49256'),
  ('875074055585897696', 'Habanastation', 2011, 'Fantasy, Family, Drama', 'Ian Padrón', 'Felipe Espinet', 'Ernesto Escalona, Andy Fornanis, Ruben Araujo, Blanca Rosa Blanco, Claudia Alvariño, René de la Cruz Jr., Pedro Fernández, Rigoberto Ferrera', null, 'Directed mainly for kids, the film speaks of a Havana that reveals two distinct faces, from the everyday life of a couple of kids.', 'Directed mainly for kids, the film speaks of a Havana that reveals two distinct faces, from the everyday life of a couple of kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEbvyA2jCoplt8BAiBtojFdmbAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106181'),
  ('262777602098729047', 'Habeas Corpus', 1928, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, Leo McCarey', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Richard Carle, Charley Rogers, Chester A. Bachman, Leo Sulky', 'NR', 'Loony scientist hires Laurel and Hardy to raid the cemetery to keep him supplied with dead bodies for his experiments.', 'Loony scientist hires Laurel and Hardy to raid the cemetery to keep him supplied with dead bodies for his experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0hbXZkIneIvDk9rGPOA8rwXhoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50925'),
  ('426071895154218667', 'Habeas Corpus', 1986, 'Drama', 'Jorge Acha, José Luis Celeiro Rodríguez, Daniel Oural', 'Jorge Acha', 'Jorge Díez, Oscar Vernales, Luis Nieto', null, 'Shows four days in the life of a man clandestinely kept in captivity. The images of his naked body alternate with those of a happy moment on a beach and with those of his captor, who spends his time looking at bodybuilding magazines.', 'Shows four days in the life of a man clandestinely kept in captivity. The images of his naked body alternate with those of a happy moment on a beach and with those of his captor, who spends his time looking at bodybuilding magazines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lH3sFOmL6zqE0ZiZXhWnCvkSJht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364940'),
  ('1010112174495142835', 'Había una vez un circo', 1972, 'Family, Music, Comedy', 'Enrique Carreras, Antonio Merayo', 'Enrique Carreras, Abel Santacruz', 'Cristina Alberó, Jorge Barreiro, Olinda Bozán, Osvaldo Brandi, Mercedes Carreras, Andrea Del Boca, Aurora Del Mar, Héctor Fuentes', null, 'A girl who loves going to the circus falls ill. His father will convince some circus clowns to visit her daughter and she gets better, becoming instant friends.', 'A girl who loves going to the circus falls ill. His father will convince some circus clowns to visit her daughter and she gets better, becoming instant friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqENFjVszXRQ4QllgFbkIEb1Xep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144952'),
  ('680203554482457519', 'Habit', 1997, 'Horror, Drama, Romance', 'Larry Fessenden, Frankie DeMarco, Dayton Taylor', 'Larry Fessenden', 'Larry Fessenden, Meredith Snaider, Aaron Beall, Patricia Coleman, Heather Woodbury, Jesse Hartman, Marcos Antonio Miranda, Herb Rogers', 'NR', 'It''s autumn in New York. Sam has broken up with his girlfriend and his father has recently died. World-weary and sloppy drunk, he finds temporary solace in the arms of Anna, a mysterious vampire who draws him away from his friends and into a web of addiction and madness.', 'It''s autumn in New York. Sam has broken up with his girlfriend and his father has recently died. World-weary and sloppy drunk, he finds temporary solace in the arms of Anna, a mysterious vampire who draws him away from his friends and into a web of addiction and madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jUDhHiDtzhQviodUvWBv1MuytA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28671'),
  ('186026951359313930', 'Habit', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Rain Li, Janell Shirtcliff', 'Janell Shirtcliff, Libby Mintz', 'Bella Thorne, Andreja Pejić, Gavin Rossdale, Libby Mintz, Josie Ho, Ione Skye, Hayley Marie Norman, Michael Suppes', 'R', 'The story of a streetwise party girl who gets mixed up in a violent drug deal and finds a possible way out - by masquerading as a Catholic nun.', 'The story of a streetwise party girl who gets mixed up in a violent drug deal and finds a possible way out - by masquerading as a Catholic nun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piDplaWgc73jAuOohiFhTucBSYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682376'),
  ('733860956461108356', 'Habitat', 1997, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'René Daalder, Jean Lépine, Sylvie Perron', 'René Daalder', 'Balthazar Getty, Tchéky Karyo, Alice Krige, Kenneth Welsh, Laura Harris, Brad Austin, Christopher Heyerdahl, Kristen Holden-Ried', null, 'In order to combat the damage caused by the depletion of the ozone layer, maverick biologist Hank Symes unleashes his most ambitious experiment to date: accelerated evolution. Unfortunately, this not only causes the authorities to take notice, but also creates a backlash from his new neighbors--leaving his son caught in the middle.', 'In order to combat the damage caused by the depletion of the ozone layer, maverick biologist Hank Symes unleashes his most ambitious experiment to date: accelerated evolution. Unfortunately, this not only causes the authorities to take notice, but also creates a backlash from his new neighbors--leaving his son caught in the middle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgAze8iOWRpEzYc1QHbhXqQQI5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59309'),
  ('892154841022662727', 'Hablar', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Joaquín Oristrell, Teo Delgado, Angie Paul Risque', 'Cristina Rota', 'Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Estefanía de los Santos, María Botto, Raúl Arévalo, Marta Etura, Juan Diego Botto, Nur Levi, Miguel Ángel Muñoz', null, 'An anthology film with 20 stories on the subject of words, communication, linked to one another over a 400-metre stretch: from Madrid''s Lavapiés Square to the Sala Mirador. A journey between theatre and cinema, filmed in a single fixed shot running continuously over 80 minutes and half a kilometer, in Madrid''s popular Lavapiés district. The characters talk, argue, laugh, cry, threaten, whisper, shout, steal, make dates, get angry with and hug one another, prompting the spectator to reflect on the immense power of words.', 'An anthology film with 20 stories on the subject of words, communication, linked to one another over a 400-metre stretch: from Madrid''s Lavapiés Square to the Sala Mirador. A journey between theatre and cinema, filmed in a single fixed shot running continuously over 80 minutes and half a kilometer, in Madrid''s popular Lavapiés district. The characters talk, argue, laugh, cry, threaten, whisper, shout, steal, make dates, get angry with and hug one another, prompting the spectator to reflect on the immense power of words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KW9CCfCoHRB4sJgaFavcXT0t7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331347'),
  ('689378424279321307', 'Hacen muchas gracias de nada', 1980, 'Comedy, Music', 'Les Luthiers', null, 'Daniel Rabinovich, Jorge Maronna, Marcos Mundstock, Ernesto Acher, Carlos López Puccio, Carlos Núñez Cortés, Les Luthiers', null, '''Muchas Gracias de Nada'', is a show premiered on June 15, 1979 at the Coliseo Theater in the City of Buenos Aires by the Argentinean ensemble of informal instruments, Les Luthiers. Recorded live between October 24th and 25th, 1980 at the same theater. PROGRAM: 1. La Campana Suonerá; 2. El Rey Enamorado; 3. Sinfonía Interrumpida; 4. La Tanda; 5. Canción para Moverse; 6. La Gallina Dijo Eureka; 7. Trío Op. 115; 8. Cartas de Color; 9. Tango Op. 11. In this show ''Antenor'' made its first appearance, an advanced robot (for the time it was built - 1979) that weighed 80 kilos and was equipped with several motors that allowed it to move around the stage, turn its head, etc. The robot caught fire during the last performance of this play (Palacio de Bellas Artes, Mexico - 1980) in the middle of the stage and before the astonished gaze of all those who were there.', '''Muchas Gracias de Nada'', is a show premiered on June 15, 1979 at the Coliseo Theater in the City of Buenos Aires by the Argentinean ensemble of informal instruments, Les Luthiers. Recorded live between October 24th and 25th, 1980 at the same theater. PROGRAM: 1. La Campana Suonerá; 2. El Rey Enamorado; 3. Sinfonía Interrumpida; 4. La Tanda; 5. Canción para Moverse; 6. La Gallina Dijo Eureka; 7. Trío Op. 115; 8. Cartas de Color; 9. Tango Op. 11. In this show ''Antenor'' made its first appearance, an advanced robot (for the time it was built - 1979) that weighed 80 kilos and was equipped with several motors that allowed it to move around the stage, turn its head, etc. The robot caught fire during the last performance of this play (Palacio de Bellas Artes, Mexico - 1980) in the middle of the stage and before the astonished gaze of all those who were there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTHXrKSoSjMRFjdaqTQQDKTqMzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67888'),
  ('370736349436886720', 'Hachi: A Dog''s Tale', 2009, 'Drama, Family', 'Lasse Hallström, Ron Fortunato, Cara Giallanza', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Richard Gere, Joan Allen, Sarah Roemer, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Erick Avari, Robbie Sublett, Davenia McFadden, Jason Alexander', 'G', 'Professor Wilson discovers a lost Akita puppy on his way home. Despite objections from his wife, Hachi endears himself to the family and grows to be Parker''s loyal companion. As their bond grows deeper, a beautiful relationship unfolds.', 'Professor Wilson discovers a lost Akita puppy on his way home. Despite objections from his wife, Hachi endears himself to the family and grows to be Parker''s loyal companion. As their bond grows deeper, a beautiful relationship unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsy3aEsEfYIHdLRk4dontZ4s85h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28178'),
  ('716735827779871919', 'Hachiko', 1987, 'Drama, Family, History', 'Seijiro Koyama, Shinsaku Himeda', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Kaoru Yachigusa, Toshiro Yanagiba, Toshinori Omi, Mako Ishino, Masumi Harukawa, Taiji Tonoyama, Yoshi Katō', null, 'The tragic, true story about Hachikō, an Akita dog who was loyal to his master, Professor Ueno, even after Ueno''s death.', 'The tragic, true story about Hachikō, an Akita dog who was loyal to his master, Professor Ueno, even after Ueno''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g5oG4bQCC4sk9DkVQACK89fa7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31743'),
  ('1111285257611974233', 'Hachiko', 2023, 'Drama, Family', 'Xu Ang, He Shan, Li Danfeng', 'Zhang Hansi, Li Lin, Li Liangwen', 'Feng Xiaogang, Joan Chen, Bai Jugang, Huang Chutong, Qian Bo, Bo Yang, Xue Xuchun, Liu Jun', 'NR', 'This is the story of a puppy that touched hundreds of millions of people around the world. Hachiko is a cute Chinese pastoral dog. He met his destined owner Chen Jingxiu in the vast crowd and became a member of the Chen family. With the passage of time, the once beautiful home is no longer there, but Batong is still waiting where it is, and its fate is closely tied to its family.', 'This is the story of a puppy that touched hundreds of millions of people around the world. Hachiko is a cute Chinese pastoral dog. He met his destined owner Chen Jingxiu in the vast crowd and became a member of the Chen family. With the passage of time, the once beautiful home is no longer there, but Batong is still waiting where it is, and its fate is closely tied to its family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whY9rKS8p9Iw2fR2HTF7JAOTcr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1107387'),
  ('192552008245404142', 'Hack Your Health: The Secrets of Your Gut', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Anjali Nayar', null, 'Giulia Enders, Tim Spector', 'PG-13', 'Delve into the digestive system with this lighthearted and informative documentary that demystifies the role gut health plays in our overall well-being.', 'Delve into the digestive system with this lighthearted and informative documentary that demystifies the role gut health plays in our overall well-being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D7qEdPHCKVHihtaJDAys2HAi0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266701'),
  ('1009209277527924925', 'Hack-O-Lantern', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jag Mundhra, Stephen Ashley Blake', 'Carla Robinson', 'Hy Pyke, Gregory Scott Cummins, Katina Garner, Carla Baron, Jeff Brown, Michael Potts, Patricia Christie, Larry Coven', 'R', 'When Tommy was a boy, he saw his grandpa, the leader of a vicious satanic cult, murder his father in a brutal ritual on Halloween night. Now he is 18, and grandpa is ready to indoctrinate him into the ways of the black arts.', 'When Tommy was a boy, he saw his grandpa, the leader of a vicious satanic cult, murder his father in a brutal ritual on Halloween night. Now he is 18, and grandpa is ready to indoctrinate him into the ways of the black arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6ImVjGNGzDltAafgTGYx7NmwNj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95114'),
  ('878514575164295762', 'Hack!', 2007, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Roger Chingirian, Matt Flynn', 'Matt Flynn', 'Danica McKellar, Jay Kenneth Johnson, William Forsythe, Sean Kanan, Juliet Landau, Tony Burton, Justin Chon, Travis Schuldt', 'R', 'Seven college students are picked to travel to a private island owned by the reclusive Vincent King and his film-obsessed wife Mary Shelley to study island wildlife. But is isn''t long when a mysterious killer begins killing the students one-by-one, and modeling them after gory murder scenes from numerous horror films.', 'Seven college students are picked to travel to a private island owned by the reclusive Vincent King and his film-obsessed wife Mary Shelley to study island wildlife. But is isn''t long when a mysterious killer begins killing the students one-by-one, and modeling them after gory murder scenes from numerous horror films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMYJsQzAObi5m3zcXldSiyLAOaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10432'),
  ('233115067191502430', 'Hacked', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Vikram Bhatt', null, 'Hina Khan, Rohan Shah, Mohit Malhotra, Sid Makkar', null, 'A young woman finds her life turned upside down when she rejects the advances of a teenage hacker.', 'A young woman finds her life turned upside down when she rejects the advances of a teenage hacker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DJdpaqWMznsZbh6jaKxDTGoSjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662231'),
  ('1130306545991850714', 'Hacker', 2002, 'Comedy, Action', 'Janusz Zaorski, Łukasz Kośmicki', 'Janusz Zaorski, Marek Nowowiejski', 'Bartosz Obuchowicz, Kasia Smutniak, Piotr Miazga, Bogusław Linda, Marek Kondrat, Paweł Wilczak, Paweł Deląg, Cezary Morawski', null, 'Two friends make a bet. One of them - an A student and a computer genius Marcin - under the terms of the dispute must be received five days of complete submission to his clever friend Turbo - and he, in turn, guarantees him the easy money and attention to a long-legged beauty.', 'Two friends make a bet. One of them - an A student and a computer genius Marcin - under the terms of the dispute must be received five days of complete submission to his clever friend Turbo - and he, in turn, guarantees him the easy money and attention to a long-legged beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQNHwTdbISXEnj6XiZ2UTYsIOp6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81229'),
  ('932550344728618412', 'Hacker', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Akan Satayev, Pasha Patriki', 'Timur Zhaksylykov', 'Callan McAuliffe, Lorraine Nicholson, Daniel Eric Gold, Clifton Collins Jr., Zachary Bennett, Kristian Truelsen, Vlada Verevko, Genadijs Dolganovs', 'R', 'Alex, an immigrant from Ukraine comes to Canada and becomes involved with an online criminal organization called Darkweb. What starts off as a way to help his parents financially, soon becomes a personal vendetta against the entire banking system, when his mother is fired from her job at the bank', 'Alex, an immigrant from Ukraine comes to Canada and becomes involved with an online criminal organization called Darkweb. What starts off as a way to help his parents financially, soon becomes a personal vendetta against the entire banking system, when his mother is fired from her job at the bank', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpYwKrP6s749b5Nzgm2174jKrpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413052'),
  ('407401421515323222', 'Hacker', 2019, 'Action, Family', 'Poul Berg, Bet Rourich', 'Rune Kalle Bjerkø, Poul Berg', 'Rumle Kærså, Josephine Chavarria Højbjerg, Mille Dinesen, Signe Egholm Olsen, Morten Suurballe, Janus Nabil Bakrawi, Esben Dalgaard Andersen, Claus Riis Østergaard', null, '13-year-old Benjamin discovers that his mother didn’t die in an accident as he was led to believe. The trail leads to high-ranking officials in the Danish Secret Service. "Trust no one!", he is told.', '13-year-old Benjamin discovers that his mother didn’t die in an accident as he was led to believe. The trail leads to high-ranking officials in the Danish Secret Service. "Trust no one!", he is told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6C8EumHuqxUna2Ms7Sj8w5N29pZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545330'),
  ('65555641997321114', 'Hackers', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Iain Softley, Andrzej Sekula', 'Rafael Moreu', 'Jonny Lee Miller, Angelina Jolie, Matthew Lillard, Jesse Bradford, Renoly Santiago, Laurence Mason, Fisher Stevens, Lorraine Bracco', 'PG-13', 'Along with his new friends, a teenager who was arrested by the US Secret Service and banned from using a computer for writing a computer virus discovers a plot by a nefarious hacker, but they must use their computer skills to find the evidence while being pursued by the Secret Service and the evil computer genius behind the virus.', 'Along with his new friends, a teenager who was arrested by the US Secret Service and banned from using a computer for writing a computer virus discovers a plot by a nefarious hacker, but they must use their computer skills to find the evidence while being pursued by the Secret Service and the evil computer genius behind the virus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8H2KpRtpzwlxz5KrvINCVihok1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10428'),
  ('605244755954177233', 'Hacking Democracy', 2006, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Russell Michaels, Simon Ardizzone', null, 'James Naughton, Bev Harris, Harri Hursti, Mark Radke, Ion Sancho, Andy Stephenson', null, 'Documentary film investigating allegations of election fraud during the 2004 U.S. presidential election. Electronic voting machines count approximately 90% of America''s votes in county, state and federal elections. The technology is also increasingly being used across the world, including in Canada, the United Kingdom, Europe and Latin America. The film uncovers incendiary evidence from the trash cans of Texas to the ballot boxes of Ohio, exposing secrecy, votes in the trash, hackable software and election officials rigging the presidential recount.Ultimately proving our votes can be stolen without a trace "Hacking Democracy" culminates in the famous ''Hursti Hack''; a duel between the Diebold voting machines and a computer hacker from Finland - with America''s democracy at stake.', 'Documentary film investigating allegations of election fraud during the 2004 U.S. presidential election. Electronic voting machines count approximately 90% of America''s votes in county, state and federal elections. The technology is also increasingly being used across the world, including in Canada, the United Kingdom, Europe and Latin America. The film uncovers incendiary evidence from the trash cans of Texas to the ballot boxes of Ohio, exposing secrecy, votes in the trash, hackable software and election officials rigging the presidential recount.Ultimately proving our votes can be stolen without a trace "Hacking Democracy" culminates in the famous ''Hursti Hack''; a duel between the Diebold voting machines and a computer hacker from Finland - with America''s democracy at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JsyixMw0i6wVWKToBbRyKZXNJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32013'),
  ('523718639965227434', 'Hacksaw', 2020, 'Horror', 'Anthony Leone', 'Anthony Leone', 'Amy Cay, Brian Patrick Butler, Cortney Palm, Christine Wawira, Michael C. Burgess, Luke Pensabene, Kylie Young-Harper', 'NR', 'A young couple on a road trip takes a detour to the site where a notorious murderer, Ed "Hacksaw" Crowe, became an urban legend on the day he was killed many years before, but they quickly find the legend may not be quite as dead as they were counting on.', 'A young couple on a road trip takes a detour to the site where a notorious murderer, Ed "Hacksaw" Crowe, became an urban legend on the day he was killed many years before, but they quickly find the legend may not be quite as dead as they were counting on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ed5gIhuRSXOD7xgg6eJQUzWscP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572430'),
  ('949106020524434687', 'Hacksaw Ridge', 2016, 'Drama, History, War', 'Mel Gibson, Mark Robins, Simon Duggan', 'Robert Schenkkan, Andrew Knight', 'Andrew Garfield, Sam Worthington, Vince Vaughn, Teresa Palmer, Luke Bracey, Hugo Weaving, Rachel Griffiths, Ryan Corr', 'R', 'WWII American Army Medic Desmond T. Doss, who served during the Battle of Okinawa, refuses to kill people and becomes the first Conscientious Objector in American history to receive the Congressional Medal of Honor.', 'WWII American Army Medic Desmond T. Doss, who served during the Battle of Okinawa, refuses to kill people and becomes the first Conscientious Objector in American history to receive the Congressional Medal of Honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnOMP6mjmOmZwmlC1n0K7ivrzt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324786'),
