  ('604951135171390723', 'Hadh Kar Di Aapne', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Manoj Agrawal', 'Rajeev Kaul', 'Govinda, Rani Mukerji, Johny Lever, Paresh Rawal, Satish Kaushik, Helen Brodie, Gavin Packard, Himani Shivpuri', null, 'Raj, a detective, goes on a Europe trip to investigate his friend''s case. There, he falls in love with Anjali, who is impersonating her best friend.', 'Raj, a detective, goes on a Europe trip to investigate his friend''s case. There, he falls in love with Anjali, who is impersonating her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vf3YOjnTTBrAp7mKqbzkX8nC0bK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46385'),
