  ('873999829922412559', 'Hādo reipu', 1987, 'Drama, Horror', 'Yukio Kitazawa, Tarō Araki, Toshio Shimura', 'Takeshi Saito', 'Tomomi Segawa, Ai Kobayashi, Kazuyo Ezaki, Reina Fujii, Katsuko Takahara, Toru Nakane, Ryota Sakanishi, Miki Yakumaru', null, 'Former members of a high school tennis club receive invitations for a reunion at their old tennis training camp in the woods where a suicide had taken place. But when they arrive someone begins to stalk and attack them… one by one.', 'Former members of a high school tennis club receive invitations for a reunion at their old tennis training camp in the woods where a suicide had taken place. But when they arrive someone begins to stalk and attack them… one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nye0fZoUaEV5mLqEmcGKdshsSrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949734'),
  ('1098015955715339530', 'Haeckel''s Tale', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'John McNaughton', 'Mick Garris, Clive Barker', 'Steve Bacic, Micki Maunsell, Gerard Plunkett, Derek Cecil, Pablo Coffey, Jon Polito, Warren Kimmel, Jill Morrison', null, 'A grieving widower seeking the help of a necromancer is told the terrible tale of Ernst Haeckel, a man obsessed with reanimation.', 'A grieving widower seeking the help of a necromancer is told the terrible tale of Ernst Haeckel, a man obsessed with reanimation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OI9J8polDyz2v3ezEA0TBdpwqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305655'),
