  ('824010646578819830', 'Hagen', 2024, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Cyrill Boss, Philipp Stennert, Philip Peschlow', 'Philipp Stennert, Cyrill Boss, Doron Wisotzky', 'Gijs Naber, Jannis Niewöhner, Lilja van der Zwaag, Dominic Marcus Singer, Rosalinde Mynster, Jördis Triebel, Jörg Hartmann, Béla Gabor Lenz', null, 'Hagen von Tronje, the Burgundian master-at-arms, holds his troubled kingdom together while hiding his dark past. The arrival of the unpredictable dragon slayer Siegfried threatens to upend the old order. As King Gunter seeks Siegfried''s help to win the fierce Valkyrie Brunhild, Hagen faces a tragic choice between loyalty to the king and his own identity.', 'Hagen von Tronje, the Burgundian master-at-arms, holds his troubled kingdom together while hiding his dark past. The arrival of the unpredictable dragon slayer Siegfried threatens to upend the old order. As King Gunter seeks Siegfried''s help to win the fierce Valkyrie Brunhild, Hagen faces a tragic choice between loyalty to the king and his own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ1nTnV6neOhBeDJj87IUHDLwb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209130'),
  ('1058631394713085705', 'Haggard', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bam Margera, Joseph Frantz', 'Chris Aspite, Brandon DiCamillo, Bam Margera', 'Ryan Dunn, Bam Margera, Jennifer Rivell, Rake Yohn, Ann Marie Esposito, Brandon Novak, Brandon DiCamillo, Chris Raab', 'R', 'A young man begins to suspect that his ex-girlfriend, Glauren, has been having a secret affair with Hellboy, so he enlists his friends to help him discover the truth.', 'A young man begins to suspect that his ex-girlfriend, Glauren, has been having a secret affair with Hellboy, so he enlists his friends to help him discover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFcEv1ndHlWlXUG5uaYusibteIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22511'),
  ('1069384911375149182', 'Hai mai avuto paura?', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ambra Principato, Davide Sondelli', 'Ambra Principato, Carmen Danza', 'Justin Alexander Korovkin, Lorenzo Ferrante, Elisa Pierdominici, Mirko Frezza, Sveva Mariani, Alessandro Bedetti, Marta Richeldi, Maurizio Di Carmine', null, 'Inspired by the work of an award-winning Italian novelist, this post-modern noir fantasy is centered on the image of a young poet and his aristocratic family. Set in the 1800s the plot develops around an ancient curse and a series of mysterious and terrifying events occurring on the family country estate. Featuring authentic period sets and costumes, the film is a metaphor of maturing and becoming, where death and rebirth intertwine and perpetuate each other in a continuous flux of life.', 'Inspired by the work of an award-winning Italian novelist, this post-modern noir fantasy is centered on the image of a young poet and his aristocratic family. Set in the 1800s the plot develops around an ancient curse and a series of mysterious and terrifying events occurring on the family country estate. Featuring authentic period sets and costumes, the film is a metaphor of maturing and becoming, where death and rebirth intertwine and perpetuate each other in a continuous flux of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FeRJWloBcRLY8qhfkeh8DzHqo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124158'),
  ('853179227947086315', 'Hai-Alarm am Müggelsee', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Leander Haußmann, Sven Regener, Jana Marsik', 'Sven Regener, Leander Haußmann', 'Henry Hübchen, Michael Gwisdek, Benno Fürmann, Tom Schilling, Uwe Dag Berlin, Annika Kuhl, Leander Haußmann, Sven Regener', null, 'A lifeguard at Lake Müggel has his hand bitten off and the marks indicate a shark attack. The lake is closed to the public by extending a local festival indefinitely while the city council thinks of what can be done to remove the shark. The public becomes restless having their lake closed for so long and come up with a plan to drive the shark from the lake with large quantities of beer.', 'A lifeguard at Lake Müggel has his hand bitten off and the marks indicate a shark attack. The lake is closed to the public by extending a local festival indefinitely while the city council thinks of what can be done to remove the shark. The public becomes restless having their lake closed for so long and come up with a plan to drive the shark from the lake with large quantities of beer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMq0dTmmTUqT5J3sxyTjfeEjHBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185562'),
  ('646142287575554197', 'Haider', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Aditya Nimbalkar, Pankaj Kumar', 'Basharat Peer, Vishal Bhardwaj', 'Shahid Kapoor, Tabu, Kay Kay Menon, Shraddha Kapoor, Narendra Jha, Irrfan Khan, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Lalit Parimoo', null, 'A young man returns to Kashmir after his father''s disappearance to confront his uncle - the man he suspects to have a role in his father''s fate.', 'A young man returns to Kashmir after his father''s disappearance to confront his uncle - the man he suspects to have a role in his father''s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOCotkHPODWdsRDMoLbSdLdVT3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280795'),
  ('319952041225658353', 'Haikara-san: Here Comes Miss Modern Part 1', 2017, 'Animation, Romance, Comedy', 'Yuka Koiso, Hideki Ito, Kazuhiro Furuhashi', 'Kazuhiro Furuhashi', 'Saori Hayami, Unsho Ishizuka, Shizuka Itoh, Yuki Kaji, Kenta Miyake, Mamoru Miyano, Kazuya Nakai, Takahiro Sakurai', null, 'During the Taisho era of 1918, 17-year-old Benio Hanamura thrives on bucking tradition. As a boisterous and quarrelsome tomboy, Miss Hanamura leads a life of kendo and tree-climbing adventure with her best friends Tamaki and Ranmaru. Benio determines to find love on her own, though her family has other plans. Benio will encounter tests of love, independence, and friendship during wartime.', 'During the Taisho era of 1918, 17-year-old Benio Hanamura thrives on bucking tradition. As a boisterous and quarrelsome tomboy, Miss Hanamura leads a life of kendo and tree-climbing adventure with her best friends Tamaki and Ranmaru. Benio determines to find love on her own, though her family has other plans. Benio will encounter tests of love, independence, and friendship during wartime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hT6Y8dm1Mnar7N6nybFRK7THFJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462455'),
  ('408762452610170884', 'Haikara-san: Here Comes Miss Modern Part 2', 2018, 'Animation, Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Noriko Otake, Hideki Ito, Miyuki Nakamura', 'Kazuhiro Furuhashi', 'Saori Hayami, Mamoru Miyano, Yuki Kaji, Takahiro Sakurai, Asami Seto, Kazuya Nakai', null, 'In turn of the 20th Century Japan, a period characterized by widespread innovation and social restructuring, Benio Hanamura endeavors to take modernization to new heights. With a tomboy nature, Benio rails against traditional ideas that women should take care of the home—serving their husbands rather than pursuing their own dreams. Her values as a modern woman come under fire as the one man who supports her independence, Lieutenant Shinobu Ijuin, goes missing in action. Resurfacing back in Japan, Shinobu has lost all memory of his true identity. In this stunning sequel, will Benio be able to reconnect with Shinobu before she is married off to a new man?', 'In turn of the 20th Century Japan, a period characterized by widespread innovation and social restructuring, Benio Hanamura endeavors to take modernization to new heights. With a tomboy nature, Benio rails against traditional ideas that women should take care of the home—serving their husbands rather than pursuing their own dreams. Her values as a modern woman come under fire as the one man who supports her independence, Lieutenant Shinobu Ijuin, goes missing in action. Resurfacing back in Japan, Shinobu has lost all memory of his true identity. In this stunning sequel, will Benio be able to reconnect with Shinobu before she is married off to a new man?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xlCJLPOnYcqVeCOzmXpicyCEOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506643'),
  ('77139641135484561', 'HAIKYU!! The Dumpster Battle', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mariko Ishikawa, Susumu Mitsunaka, Takahiro Chiba', 'Susumu Mitsunaka', 'Ayumu Murase, Kaito Ishikawa, Yuki Kaji, Yuichi Nakamura, Satoshi Hino, Koki Uchiyama, Yuu Hayashi, Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'PG-13', 'Shoyo Hinata joins Karasuno High''s volleyball club to be like his idol, a former Karasuno player known as the ''Little Giant''. But Hinata soon learns that he must team up with his middle school nemesis, Tobio Kageyama. Their clashing styles form a surprising weapon, but can their newfound teamwork defeat their rival Nekoma High in the highly anticipated ''Dumpster Battle'', the long awaited ultimate showdown between two opposing underdog teams?', 'Shoyo Hinata joins Karasuno High''s volleyball club to be like his idol, a former Karasuno player known as the ''Little Giant''. But Hinata soon learns that he must team up with his middle school nemesis, Tobio Kageyama. Their clashing styles form a surprising weapon, but can their newfound teamwork defeat their rival Nekoma High in the highly anticipated ''Dumpster Battle'', the long awaited ultimate showdown between two opposing underdog teams?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntRU0OA4etGGiMMmH1Yw0bnaMdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012201'),
  ('1035785866474254718', 'Haikyu!! The Movie: Battle of Concepts', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', 'Susumu Mitsunaka', 'Taku Kishimoto', 'Ayumu Murase, Kaito Ishikawa, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Toshiki Masuda, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Satoshi Hino, Kaori Nazuka, Miyu Irino', null, 'A recap film depicting the match against Shiratorizawa Academy in the third season of the anime series.', 'A recap film depicting the match against Shiratorizawa Academy in the third season of the anime series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewew32cuPfWjD8QKoHztkV8TS84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461763'),
  ('1127521093729713142', 'Haikyu!! The Movie: Talent and Sense', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', 'Susumu Mitsunaka', 'Taku Kishimoto', 'Ayumu Murase, Kaito Ishikawa, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Toshiki Masuda, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Satoshi Hino, Kaori Nazuka, Miyu Irino', null, 'A compilation film depicting the match against Aoba Johsai High School in the second season of the anime series. It will also include new scenes portraying what happened after the match.', 'A compilation film depicting the match against Aoba Johsai High School in the second season of the anime series. It will also include new scenes portraying what happened after the match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zstCDlJbuLfZYHNCYygI4syDwrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461762'),
  ('690100727621001633', 'Haikyu!! the Movie: The End and the Beginning', 2015, 'Animation, Drama', 'Yumiko Nakata, Yoshiki Kobayashi, Masayuki Honda', 'Takuya Sato, Taku Kishimoto, Toshimitsu Takeuchi', 'Ayumu Murase, Kaito Ishikawa, Koki Uchiyama, Soma Saito, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Toshiki Masuda, Yuu Hayashi, Miyu Irino', null, 'Shouyou Hinata, after losing to Kitagawa Daiichi Junior High''s setter Tobio Kageyama in his first official volleyball match, transfers to Karasuno High, intent on finally having a proper volleyball team and getting his revenge on Kageyama. Upon arrival at Karasuno, however, Hinata finds out Kageyama has also gone to Karasuno. Initially at odds with each other, the two form an oddball combination and fight together with the other members of the volleyball club. Karasuno reunites with a former rival school, Nekoma High, in a practice match and reignites their school rivalry.', 'Shouyou Hinata, after losing to Kitagawa Daiichi Junior High''s setter Tobio Kageyama in his first official volleyball match, transfers to Karasuno High, intent on finally having a proper volleyball team and getting his revenge on Kageyama. Upon arrival at Karasuno, however, Hinata finds out Kageyama has also gone to Karasuno. Initially at odds with each other, the two form an oddball combination and fight together with the other members of the volleyball club. Karasuno reunites with a former rival school, Nekoma High, in a practice match and reignites their school rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HlpuETjDOob8yzddD1MF7QwZwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347183'),
