  ('837982234819204897', 'Hail', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Fred Levinson, William Storz', null, 'Dan Resin, Richard B. Shull, Dick O''Neill, Joseph Sirola, Pat Ripley, Gary Sandy, Willard Waterman, K Callan', null, 'A presidential advisor discovers that the President has assembled a secret army of vigilantes to suppress dissent and is setting up concentration camps in which to imprison protestors, hippies and other "social undesirables."', 'A presidential advisor discovers that the President has assembled a secret army of vigilantes to suppress dissent and is setting up concentration camps in which to imprison protestors, hippies and other "social undesirables."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuRAagXQN7cUiqBxwkks68eNfGy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125662'),
  ('1107528419924844911', 'Hail Caesar', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Adam Kane', 'Bob Mittenthal', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Bobbie Phillips, Leslie Danon, Nicholas Pryor, Robert Downey Jr., Kane Picoy, Samuel L. Jackson, Ilia Volok', 'PG', 'Caesar is having a hard time dividing his time between his band and his rich girlfriend, Buffer. Buffer''s dad doesn''t like Ceasar, so he makes Caesar a bet. If Caesar can make a hundred thousand dollars within six months, he can stay with Buffer... but if he fails, their relationship is over forever. How can Ceasar win the bet if he only knows how jam with his band?', 'Caesar is having a hard time dividing his time between his band and his rich girlfriend, Buffer. Buffer''s dad doesn''t like Ceasar, so he makes Caesar a bet. If Caesar can make a hundred thousand dollars within six months, he can stay with Buffer... but if he fails, their relationship is over forever. How can Ceasar win the bet if he only knows how jam with his band?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zBmCJcGJKGWiCRunAjOC4rqcS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173299'),
  ('731499296115399308', 'Hail Mary', 1985, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Bernard Menoud, Jacques Firmann', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Myriem Roussel, Thierry Rode, Philippe Lacoste, Manon Andersen, Malachi Jara Kohan, Juliette Binoche, Georges Staquet, Anne Gautier', 'NR', 'A college student gets pregnant without having intercourse, affecting people close and unrelated to her in different ways.', 'A college student gets pregnant without having intercourse, affecting people close and unrelated to her in different ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oh1dJ1rlWqRuUa1ceRTBqEikmRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32720'),
  ('326572822658257056', 'Hail Satan?', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Penny Lane, Naiti Gámez', null, 'Nicholas Crowe, Malcolm Jarry, Lucien Greaves, Jesper Aagaard Petersen, Jex Blackmore, Jay D. Wexler, Sadie Satanas, Lynita Killen', 'R', 'The story of The Satanic Temple, a controversial movement that combines religion and activism with the apparent purpose of questioning the basic foundations of US society.', 'The story of The Satanic Temple, a controversial movement that combines religion and activism with the apparent purpose of questioning the basic foundations of US society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwP8CMOfPJhkMyxELgX2D2aDZfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565719'),
  ('696095173958867360', 'Hail the Artist', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yves Robert, Jean Penzer, Daniel Janneau', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Yves Robert', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Jean Rochefort, Françoise Fabian, Evelyne Buyle, Sylvie Joly, Carla Gravina, Maurice Barrier, Maurice Risch', null, 'Marcello Mastrioanni stars as aging actor Nicolas whose career has dwindled to TV commercials. Seeking an anchor in his life, Nicolas attempts a reconciliation with his ex-wife. But in this, as in his professional life, Nicolas is doomed to disillusionment and failure.', 'Marcello Mastrioanni stars as aging actor Nicolas whose career has dwindled to TV commercials. Seeking an anchor in his life, Nicolas attempts a reconciliation with his ex-wife. But in this, as in his professional life, Nicolas is doomed to disillusionment and failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyI95k7XqjxXa7r9i362Mp0YCLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170547'),
  ('170104981259971982', 'Hail the Conquering Hero', 1944, 'Comedy, War', 'Preston Sturges, John F. Seitz, Harve Foster', 'Preston Sturges', 'Eddie Bracken, Ella Raines, Raymond Walburn, William Demarest, Franklin Pangborn, Elizabeth Patterson, Georgia Caine, Al Bridge', 'NR', 'Having been discharged from the Marines for a hayfever condition before ever seeing action, Woodrow Lafayette Pershing Truesmith delays the return to his hometown, feeling that he is a failure. While in a moment of melancholy, he meets up with a group of Marines who befriend him and encourage him to return home to his mother by fabricating a story that he was wounded in battle with honorable discharge.', 'Having been discharged from the Marines for a hayfever condition before ever seeing action, Woodrow Lafayette Pershing Truesmith delays the return to his hometown, feeling that he is a failure. While in a moment of melancholy, he meets up with a group of Marines who befriend him and encourage him to return home to his mother by fabricating a story that he was wounded in battle with honorable discharge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfuK8Ui0o4Z9ATlUT7nOvYI4P0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36498'),
  ('217113408285326154', 'Hail the Judge', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Poon Kin-Kwan, David Chung, Wong Jing', 'Wong Jing', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Sharla Cheung, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Collin Chou, Ku Feng', null, 'Pao Lung Sing, a descendant of the legendary Judge Pao Ching Tin, is a 9th degree corrupt judge who changes his tune when he tries to champion a woman Chi Siu-Lin, who was framed for killing her husband. As a result, Pao is forced to flee and through a series of events becomes a 1st degree judge and comes back to wreak havoc and justice on the guilty.', 'Pao Lung Sing, a descendant of the legendary Judge Pao Ching Tin, is a 9th degree corrupt judge who changes his tune when he tries to champion a woman Chi Siu-Lin, who was framed for killing her husband. As a result, Pao is forced to flee and through a series of events becomes a 1st degree judge and comes back to wreak havoc and justice on the guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29yDD4IMpk6xR6GgcbhvQ9pkOtc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55156'),
  ('933754589076406351', 'Hail, Caesar!', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery, History', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen, Roger Deakins', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Josh Brolin, George Clooney, Alden Ehrenreich, Ralph Fiennes, Scarlett Johansson, Tilda Swinton, Channing Tatum, Frances McDormand', 'PG-13', 'When a Hollywood star mysteriously disappears in the middle of filming, the studio sends their fixer to get him back.', 'When a Hollywood star mysteriously disappears in the middle of filming, the studio sends their fixer to get him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozY79UvbYvJUWFg2UCM1CDQ7rBl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270487'),
  ('879469477039483394', 'Hail, Sarajevo', 1993, 'War', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'A short two-minute rumination on the once volatile situation during the period of the Bosnian War presented in the form of a photo-montage with accompanying text.', 'A short two-minute rumination on the once volatile situation during the period of the Bosnian War presented in the form of a photo-montage with accompanying text.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpB11iFrJhYM2DbkY4Cb9bxsaui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174473'),
  ('836752675329283489', 'Haile: A Family Nightmare', 2023, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi, Ersan Çapan, Enes Subaşı', null, 'Seyran Aksoy, İpek Arkan, Tolga Demircan, Hülya Diken, Rifat Durmus, Ömer Gecü, Emre Kilin, Öznur Kula', null, 'After the girl Kamal loves is married off to his brother, he sets off a series of events that will lead to the destruction of an entire village. 25 years later, the cursed magic intensifies again and the promised violent events occur. In the middle of it all, Damla travels to the village of Baras, where it all began, and confronts her terrible past.', 'After the girl Kamal loves is married off to his brother, he sets off a series of events that will lead to the destruction of an entire village. 25 years later, the cursed magic intensifies again and the promised violent events occur. In the middle of it all, Damla travels to the village of Baras, where it all began, and confronts her terrible past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ryMVYaS0E48OytakguxEDRty4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143839'),
  ('1006078916103011502', 'Haine', 1980, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dominique Goult, Roland Dantigny, Thierry Dumas', 'Dominique Goult', 'Klaus Kinski, Maria Schneider, Patrice Melennec, Évelyne Bouix, Katia Tchenko, Paulette Frantz, Gérard Boucaron, Georges Werler', null, 'Klaus Kinski plays the role of a drifter on a motorcycle who happens to be passing through town immediately after a young school girl has been run over and killed by an unknown person on a motorcycle. The parents of the girl conspire to get rid of Kinski with the help of some of the locals including the town bully who recently had a run-in with Kinski in a pub over a woman. Kinski''s only ally is the woman whose honor he tried to defend. Trapped in the town due to sabotage on his bike and a number of other incidents, Kinski soon realizes he is in real trouble.', 'Klaus Kinski plays the role of a drifter on a motorcycle who happens to be passing through town immediately after a young school girl has been run over and killed by an unknown person on a motorcycle. The parents of the girl conspire to get rid of Kinski with the help of some of the locals including the town bully who recently had a run-in with Kinski in a pub over a woman. Kinski''s only ally is the woman whose honor he tried to defend. Trapped in the town due to sabotage on his bike and a number of other incidents, Kinski soon realizes he is in real trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pleIt1vOtWycrHJVOGpbCalTf0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251133'),
  ('714271929543163747', 'Hair', 1979, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Miloš Forman, Miroslav Ondříček, Richard C. Kratina', 'Gerome Ragni, James Rado', 'John Savage, Treat Williams, Beverly D''Angelo, Annie Golden, Dorsey Wright, Don Dacus, Cheryl Barnes, Richard Bright', 'PG', 'Upon receiving his draft notice and leaving his family ranch in Oklahoma, Claude heads to New York and befriends a tribe of long-haired hippies on his way to boot camp.', 'Upon receiving his draft notice and leaving his family ranch in Oklahoma, Claude heads to New York and befriends a tribe of long-haired hippies on his way to boot camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrZIlVCL9UyEBsgOGbisNzuWjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10654'),
  ('810726380079158963', 'Hair', 2010, 'Drama', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu', 'Ayberk Pekcan, Nazan Kesal, Rıza Akın, Serkan Keskin, Ercan Kesal, Murat Kılıç, Derya Durmaz, Asiye Dinçsoy', null, 'A wig-maker from Istanbul, who suffers from cancer, becomes obsessed with a woman who enters his shop one day.', 'A wig-maker from Istanbul, who suffers from cancer, becomes obsessed with a woman who enters his shop one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46up2xNrrmpzdWSvxgcmq7L7RWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300617'),
  ('264923667635073184', 'Hair High', 2004, 'Horror, Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Bill Plympton, John Donnelly', 'Bill Plympton', 'Eric Gilliland, Sarah Silverman, Dermot Mulroney, Beverly D''Angelo, David Carradine, Keith Carradine, Martha Plimpton, Tom Noonan', 'NR', 'Rod and Cherri are the unmistakable king and queen of Echo High. When new kid Spud arrives, he makes a faux pas so bad that Rod forces him to be his girl''s slave. What unfolds is the tale of Cherri and Spud''s blossoming relationship behind Rod''s back, and their untimely demise on the night of the prom. A tale of tragedy that could only be as irreverent and sensational through the pen (or pencils, if you will) of Bill Plympton.', 'Rod and Cherri are the unmistakable king and queen of Echo High. When new kid Spud arrives, he makes a faux pas so bad that Rod forces him to be his girl''s slave. What unfolds is the tale of Cherri and Spud''s blossoming relationship behind Rod''s back, and their untimely demise on the night of the prom. A tale of tragedy that could only be as irreverent and sensational through the pen (or pencils, if you will) of Bill Plympton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWQdTdUr2KCJ51yrvJI0DTPMDnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27300'),
  ('337973657233365291', 'Hair Love', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Matthew A. Cherry, Everett Downing Jr., Bruce W. Smith', 'Matthew A. Cherry', 'Issa Rae', 'G', 'When dad has to unexpectedly step in for mom to do his daughter Zuri’s hair before a big event, what seems like a simple task is anything but as these locks have a mind of their own!', 'When dad has to unexpectedly step in for mom to do his daughter Zuri’s hair before a big event, what seems like a simple task is anything but as these locks have a mind of their own!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pm9uRa7031Z56unxNE8AqE8f2wg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589739'),
