  ('323395679685987284', 'Hairbrained', 2013, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Billy Kent, Charles Libin, Charles Zalben', 'Adam Wierzbianski', 'Brendan Fraser, Alex Wolff, Julia Garner, Parker Posey, Michael Oberholtzer, Greta Lee, Teddy Bergman, Elisabeth Hower', 'PG-13', 'A fourteen-year-old genius gets rejected by Harvard and ends up at a much lower ranked school where he makes friends with a mature student.', 'A fourteen-year-old genius gets rejected by Harvard and ends up at a much lower ranked school where he makes friends with a mature student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifLjWZ40nf5urj5socB2OMOZglE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239056'),
  ('1117947349382618539', 'Haircut', 1996, 'Drama', 'Joaquim Sapinho, Luis Correia, Amândio Coroado', 'Amândio Coroado, Joaquim Sapinho, Manuela Viegas', 'Carla Bolito, Marco Delgado, Francisco Nascimento, Orlando Sérgio, Manuela de Freitas, Teresa Roby, Yen Sung, José Mora Ramos', null, 'The film is set in Lisbon, and tells the story of a day in the life of Rita and Paulo, a Portuguese young couple of the 90''s. The fast changing city around them makes them wish to break with all traditions and live the day the get married (only civil marriage) like it is an ordinary day.', 'The film is set in Lisbon, and tells the story of a day in the life of Rita and Paulo, a Portuguese young couple of the 90''s. The fast changing city around them makes them wish to break with all traditions and live the day the get married (only civil marriage) like it is an ordinary day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wI0W4UXnukPJ1zLz74zPUUJQRmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243362'),
  ('787488460145164941', 'Hairshirt', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dean Paraskevopoulos', null, 'Dean Paraskevopoulos, Chris Hogan, Evan Glenn, Louise Devar, Leelee Groome, Stephanie Sotomayer, Adriana Morera, Neve Campbell', 'R', 'A self-obsessed man runs through one woman after another in this screwball comedy. One of his rejected former lovers decides to take it upon herself to see to it that he never develops another relationship.', 'A self-obsessed man runs through one woman after another in this screwball comedy. One of his rejected former lovers decides to take it upon herself to see to it that he never develops another relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7i9a1J4moEDW19p3iQI9tRegcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87401'),
  ('906379022944372796', 'Hairspray', 1988, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'John Waters, David Insley, Steve Apicella', 'John Waters', 'Ricki Lake, Divine, Debbie Harry, Vitamin C, Sonny Bono, Leslie Ann Powers, Ruth Brown, Jerry Stiller', 'PG', '''Pleasantly plump'' teenager Tracy Turnblad achieves her dream of becoming a regular on the Corny Collins Dance Show. Now a teen hero, she starts using her fame to speak out for the causes she believes in, most of all integration. In doing so, she earns the wrath of the show''s former star, Amber Von Tussle, as well as Amber''s manipulative, pro-segregation parents. The rivalry comes to a head as Amber and Tracy vie for the title of Miss Auto Show 1963.', '''Pleasantly plump'' teenager Tracy Turnblad achieves her dream of becoming a regular on the Corny Collins Dance Show. Now a teen hero, she starts using her fame to speak out for the causes she believes in, most of all integration. In doing so, she earns the wrath of the show''s former star, Amber Von Tussle, as well as Amber''s manipulative, pro-segregation parents. The rivalry comes to a head as Amber and Tracy vie for the title of Miss Auto Show 1963.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n78VVWG1jsEpMCtcye13wy1RiAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11054'),
  ('748700057292584132', 'Hairspray', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Adam Shankman, Bojan Bazelli, Joanna Moore', 'John Waters', 'Nikki Blonsky, John Travolta, Michelle Pfeiffer, Christopher Walken, Amanda Bynes, James Marsden, Queen Latifah, Brittany Snow', 'PG', 'Pleasantly plump teenager Tracy Turnblad auditions to be on Baltimore''s most popular dance show - The Corny Collins Show - and lands a prime spot. Through her newfound fame, she becomes determined to help her friends and end the racial segregation that has been a staple of the show.', 'Pleasantly plump teenager Tracy Turnblad auditions to be on Baltimore''s most popular dance show - The Corny Collins Show - and lands a prime spot. Through her newfound fame, she becomes determined to help her friends and end the racial segregation that has been a staple of the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgMka3HtFvI5OgW1eYdR9XpySxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2976'),
  ('578473370897195802', 'Hairspray Live!', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie, Music', 'Brad Duns, Amy Wilcox-Barker, Joe Celli', null, 'Maddie Baillio, Dove Cameron, Kristin Chenoweth, Ariana Grande, Garrett Clayton, Harvey Fierstein, Derek Hough, Jennifer Hudson', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl living in Baltimore in the early 1960s dreams of appearing on a popular TV dance show.', 'A teenage girl living in Baltimore in the early 1960s dreams of appearing on a popular TV dance show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3T1u2DzwfDUd5iMNw4gqFWQx3P2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409447'),
  ('216534949157316104', 'Hajen som visste för mycket', 1989, 'Comedy, Music', 'Claes Eriksson, Dan Myhrman, Michael Sevholt', 'Claes Eriksson', 'Anders Eriksson, Claes Eriksson, Håkan Johannesson, Kerstin Granlund, Jan Rippe, Peter Rangmar, Charlott Strandberg, Per Fritzell', null, 'Samuel Plottner is a stockdealer who only wants to get richer, but suddenly things starts to get complicated: His sons meets their longlost mother which not only is after Samuels money, but also can tell them what happened to them the day they were born. The financial expert Benny Hörnsteen is also after Samuels money, and so is the clown Conny Corny and Lennart K. Brons too. How will this end?', 'Samuel Plottner is a stockdealer who only wants to get richer, but suddenly things starts to get complicated: His sons meets their longlost mother which not only is after Samuels money, but also can tell them what happened to them the day they were born. The financial expert Benny Hörnsteen is also after Samuels money, and so is the clown Conny Corny and Lennart K. Brons too. How will this end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jN2jaZlRIn9EYHyRb8skdnuE48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51910'),
  ('373782028994664944', 'Hakkenden', 2024, 'Drama, Fantasy, War', 'Fumihiko Sori, Akira Sako, Masayoshi Deguchi', 'Fumihiko Sori', 'Koji Yakusho, Seiyo Uchino, Tao Tsuchiya, Keisuke Watanabe, Jin Suzuki, Rihito Itagaki, Koshi Mizukami, Koudai Matsuoka', null, 'Takizawa Bakin, a popular Edo period author, begins to recount a story he is planning in front of his friend, the artist Katsushika Hokusai. The story is about eight warriors who, each carrying a jewel, gather together as if guided by fate and embark on a harsh journey to fight the curse of the Satomi family. Hokusai is drawn into the story that Bakin is telling, and visits Bakin on various occasions to hear the rest of the story, and a strange relationship between the two begins. The serialization becomes Bakin''s life''s work, with the idea of ​​"rewarding good and punishing evil in a world where evil is rampant," but after 28 years, as the story finally approaches its climax, Bakin begins to lose his sight. With the completion of the story in doubt, he receives an unexpected proposal from his daughter-in-law. Will the story ever be completed?', 'Takizawa Bakin, a popular Edo period author, begins to recount a story he is planning in front of his friend, the artist Katsushika Hokusai. The story is about eight warriors who, each carrying a jewel, gather together as if guided by fate and embark on a harsh journey to fight the curse of the Satomi family. Hokusai is drawn into the story that Bakin is telling, and visits Bakin on various occasions to hear the rest of the story, and a strange relationship between the two begins. The serialization becomes Bakin''s life''s work, with the idea of ​​"rewarding good and punishing evil in a world where evil is rampant," but after 28 years, as the story finally approaches its climax, Bakin begins to lose his sight. With the completion of the story in doubt, he receives an unexpected proposal from his daughter-in-law. Will the story ever be completed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1f2PwP4qFF8JR7C43GMxJcRTlzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276242'),
  ('498531448119062673', 'Hakob Hovnatanyan', 1967, 'Documentary, History', 'Sergei Parajanov', 'Sergei Parajanov', null, null, 'Exploring the art of Armenian portraitist Hakob Hovnatanyan, Parajanov revives the culture of Tbilisi of the 19th century.', 'Exploring the art of Armenian portraitist Hakob Hovnatanyan, Parajanov revives the culture of Tbilisi of the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc0Swkl9Xq8IRwLF20yFoT6vx83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258738'),
  ('1135937044865286801', 'Hakuouki: Warrior Spirit of the Blue Sky', 2014, 'Action, Animation, Drama, History', 'Osamu Yamasaki, Akira Shimozaki, Takafumi Hoshikawa', 'Osamu Yamasaki, Tsunekiyo Fujisawa', 'Houko Kuwashima, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hiroaki Yoshida, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Kenjiro Tsuda, Koji Yusa, Kohsuke Toriumi, Nobuo Tobita', null, 'The second part of the retelling of the first and second seasons of the anime.', 'The second part of the retelling of the first and second seasons of the anime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6VwIuf9O4FsIwpjfzqtYsaA6Lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380770'),
  ('212606892819623380', 'Hakuouki: Wild Dance of Kyoto', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Osamu Yamasaki, Minoru Yamaoka, Akira Shimozaki', 'Osamu Yamasaki, Tsunekiyo Fujisawa', 'Houko Kuwashima, Shin-ichiro Miki, Showtaro Morikubo, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Nobuo Tobita, Tomohiro Tsuboi, Takayuki Suzuki, Youko Itou', null, 'There''s a war going on in ancient Kyoto. A war fought in shadows, between the forces of the Shogunate''s armed enforcers, the Shinsengumi, and the vampire-like Ronin warriors known as the Rasetsu or Furies. And trapped in the middle is a young woman disguised as a man. Seeking her missing father, Chizuru Yukimura comes to Kyoto only to find her fate forever intertwined with the destinies of Shinsengumi Vice commander Toshizo Hijikata and his elite force of swordsmen. Because Chizuru''s father has created a secret elixir that enhances the user''s strength, speed and healing, and the furies will do anything and kill anyone in order to control that power!', 'There''s a war going on in ancient Kyoto. A war fought in shadows, between the forces of the Shogunate''s armed enforcers, the Shinsengumi, and the vampire-like Ronin warriors known as the Rasetsu or Furies. And trapped in the middle is a young woman disguised as a man. Seeking her missing father, Chizuru Yukimura comes to Kyoto only to find her fate forever intertwined with the destinies of Shinsengumi Vice commander Toshizo Hijikata and his elite force of swordsmen. Because Chizuru''s father has created a secret elixir that enhances the user''s strength, speed and healing, and the furies will do anything and kill anyone in order to control that power!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKPgoFijvq7zsNtPnPvcejNXxYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297676'),
  ('1095258436049864163', 'Hal', 2013, 'Animation, Romance', 'Ryotaro Makihara, Sachiko Matsumoto, Emiko Nishida', 'Tsutomu Izumi, Tokiko Mega', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yoko Hikasa, Mamoru Miyano, Shinpachi Tsuji, Tamio Ohki, Ako Mayama, Hikari Yono, Showko Tsuda', 'NR', 'Kurumi’s heart was broken by the sudden death of her boyfriend in a tragic airplane accident. By melding futuristic technology with the binary equivalent of human emotion, a brilliant scientist created an ultra-lifelike robotic surrogate to take Hal’s place – and lure Kurumi from her shroud of solitude.', 'Kurumi’s heart was broken by the sudden death of her boyfriend in a tragic airplane accident. By melding futuristic technology with the binary equivalent of human emotion, a brilliant scientist created an ultra-lifelike robotic surrogate to take Hal’s place – and lure Kurumi from her shroud of solitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSiBXQGAXfEYjaxUySI53AAFH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196761'),
  ('490768814126483364', 'Hala', 2019, 'Drama', 'Minhal Baig, Carolina Costa', 'Minhal Baig', 'Geraldine Viswanathan, Jack Kilmer, Gabriel Luna, Purbi Joshi, Hatta Azad Khan, Taylor Marie Blim, Anna Chlumsky, Charin Alvarez', 'R', 'Seventeen-year-old Pakistani American teenager Hala struggles to balance desire with her family, cultural, and religious obligations. As she comes into her own, she grapples with a secret that threatens to unravel her family.', 'Seventeen-year-old Pakistani American teenager Hala struggles to balance desire with her family, cultural, and religious obligations. As she comes into her own, she grapples with a secret that threatens to unravel her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMC0S5kpUq5AFIf4e5bZSEVRB7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535308'),
  ('662307949116266578', 'Halal State Security', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Rachid Dhibou, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Éric Judor, Ramzy Bedia', 'Ramzy Bedia, Éric Judor, Jean-Pierre Lazzerini, Anca Radici, Lannick Gautry, Frédéric Chau, Jean-Baptiste Shelmerdine, Christophe Lavalle', null, 'Someone is killing Parisians of Arab ethnicity. When an Algerian diplomat is murdered by the same assailant, two Algerian detectives are sent to help the French with the investigation and they have their own ways of doing things.', 'Someone is killing Parisians of Arab ethnicity. When an Algerian diplomat is murdered by the same assailant, two Algerian detectives are sent to help the French with the investigation and they have their own ways of doing things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84NUzUir6haXE5dqg5vn6Gyx56g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57382'),
  ('978118320914689384', 'Halam Geldi', 2014, 'Drama', 'Erhan Kozan, Emre Konuk', 'Evrim Kanpolat', 'Miray Akay, Melisa Celayir, Tunç Oral, Melis Kara, Görkem Eşgünoğlu, Burçin Terzioğlu, Tugay Mercan, Onuryay Evrentan', null, 'On the border of the Turkish Republic of Northern Cyprus and the Greek village of Limya lies the frontier hamlet of Akıncılar, where the call to prayer mingles with church bells and Turkish music blends with Greek melodies, and people from Diyarbakır and Cyprus live side by side. In this village there are three children, each thirteen years old, bound together by fate and traveling a shared path. Their story unfolds amid a ritual that becomes ever more tangled: the drama of “child brides.”', 'On the border of the Turkish Republic of Northern Cyprus and the Greek village of Limya lies the frontier hamlet of Akıncılar, where the call to prayer mingles with church bells and Turkish music blends with Greek melodies, and people from Diyarbakır and Cyprus live side by side. In this village there are three children, each thirteen years old, bound together by fate and traveling a shared path. Their story unfolds amid a ritual that becomes ever more tangled: the drama of “child brides.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6gQia4ZiB04YuTyCMtLuna8cYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284250'),
  ('1106792904868859813', 'Hale County This Morning, This Evening', 2018, 'Documentary', 'RaMell Ross, RaMell Ross', 'RaMell Ross, Maya Krinsky', null, null, 'Composed of intimate and unencumbered moments of people in a community, this film is constructed in a form that allows the viewer an emotive impression of the Historic South - trumpeting the beauty of life and consequences of the social construction of race, while simultaneously a testament to dreaming.', 'Composed of intimate and unencumbered moments of people in a community, this film is constructed in a form that allows the viewer an emotive impression of the Historic South - trumpeting the beauty of life and consequences of the social construction of race, while simultaneously a testament to dreaming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzso3kOTsilpu25bnDhAkxPWoTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490785'),
  ('793449257585539583', 'Half a Chance', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Steven Poster', 'Patrice Leconte, Patrick Dewolf', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Alain Delon, Vanessa Paradis, Michel Aumont, Eric Defosse, Aleksandr Yakovlev, Valeri Gatayev, Jacques Roman', null, 'Alice Tomaso gets out of jail, and goes looking for Léo and Julien, one of whom, it appears, is her father. On the way, she steals the wrong car - one belonging to the Russian mafia, and arrives at her destination with a gang of thugs out looking for her and the car.', 'Alice Tomaso gets out of jail, and goes looking for Léo and Julien, one of whom, it appears, is her father. On the way, she steals the wrong car - one belonging to the Russian mafia, and arrives at her destination with a gang of thugs out looking for her and the car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXtIuvGLGJTdc4UJEYjUqtlPyIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49938'),
  ('146097195607548787', 'Half a Life', 1982, 'Documentary, History', 'Romain Goupil', 'Romain Goupil', 'Romain Goupil', null, 'Michel Recanati was a militant leader in the May, 1968 riots in Paris, organizing many groups to meet, discuss, and act on leftist principles both before and after the disturbances. He was imprisoned for a short while in 1973. Disillusioned after the failure of the demonstrations and the death of the only woman he had loved, his life seems to have changed from a period of hope and activism to one of bottomless despair. His friend, Romain Goupil wrote and directed this biographical documentary. Death at 30 received the 1982 Cannes Film Festival''s Golden Camera Award for "Best First Feature-Length Film."', 'Michel Recanati was a militant leader in the May, 1968 riots in Paris, organizing many groups to meet, discuss, and act on leftist principles both before and after the disturbances. He was imprisoned for a short while in 1973. Disillusioned after the failure of the demonstrations and the death of the only woman he had loved, his life seems to have changed from a period of hope and activism to one of bottomless despair. His friend, Romain Goupil wrote and directed this biographical documentary. Death at 30 received the 1982 Cannes Film Festival''s Golden Camera Award for "Best First Feature-Length Film."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24cNufb9iRXqNuDy9uEbCHrceow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118136'),
  ('595491972505062715', 'Half a Life', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nikolaus Leytner, Hermann Dunzendorfer', 'Nikolaus Leytner', 'Matthias Habich, Josef Hader, Franziska Walser, Wolfgang Böck, Ingrid Burkhard, Ursula Strauss, Katharina Straßer, Cornelius Obonya', null, 'A young woman is found raped and bludgeoned to death. Her father can’t reconcile himself with her death, and even less with the fact that the murderer was never found. Half of his life he continues the search. Finally, after more than 20 years, as DNA-analysis becomes a factor in forensic medicine, new perspectives open.', 'A young woman is found raped and bludgeoned to death. Her father can’t reconcile himself with her death, and even less with the fact that the murderer was never found. Half of his life he continues the search. Finally, after more than 20 years, as DNA-analysis becomes a factor in forensic medicine, new perspectives open.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdwR6YheRm1u28PgV5DQAiRSe1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55488'),
  ('600564865842802092', 'Half a Loaf of Kung Fu', 1978, 'Comedy, Action', 'Chen Chi-Hwa', 'Tang Ming-Chi', 'Jackie Chan, James Tien Chun, Doris Lung Chun-Erh, Kim Chung-ran, Chin Kang, Lee Hae-ryong, Ma Ju-Lung, Miao Tian', 'R', 'A young daydreamer assumes the identity of a dead martial arts hero and quickly finds himself caught up in a plot by several clans to steal famous martial arts artifacts being transported by an escort company.', 'A young daydreamer assumes the identity of a dead martial arts hero and quickly finds himself caught up in a plot by several clans to steal famous martial arts artifacts being transported by an escort company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lH11m3LC8itFSTWzkS4xVYL6nB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18867'),
  ('960719124029390748', 'Half a Sinner', 1940, 'Mystery, Adventure, Comedy', 'Al Christie, Charles Van Enger', 'Frederick J. Jackson', 'Heather Angel, John ''Dusty'' King, Constance Collier, Tom Dugan, Robert Elliott, Clem Bevans, Henry Brandon, Emma Dunn', 'NR', 'Although young and beautiful, schoolteacher Anne Gladden fears a dull future. She finally decides to take a walk on the wild side, splurging on some fashionable new clothes and setting off to find adventure. Her new confidence inspires her to flirt with complete strangers. When a gangster pays unwanted attention to her, she ditches him and flees in his car, unaware that there''s a corpse in the trunk. Determined to recover his stolen vehicle and its incriminating cargo the thug begins a desperate search. The oblivious Anne, comes to the aid of a handsome young man stranded alongside the road. Romance blooms, but after the shocking discovery of a body in the trunk, the duo decide they have to return the car. The bickering lovebirds head back to the city, trailed by both the angry gangster and the cops, who suspect the young couple of murder.', 'Although young and beautiful, schoolteacher Anne Gladden fears a dull future. She finally decides to take a walk on the wild side, splurging on some fashionable new clothes and setting off to find adventure. Her new confidence inspires her to flirt with complete strangers. When a gangster pays unwanted attention to her, she ditches him and flees in his car, unaware that there''s a corpse in the trunk. Determined to recover his stolen vehicle and its incriminating cargo the thug begins a desperate search. The oblivious Anne, comes to the aid of a handsome young man stranded alongside the road. Romance blooms, but after the shocking discovery of a body in the trunk, the duo decide they have to return the car. The bickering lovebirds head back to the city, trailed by both the angry gangster and the cops, who suspect the young couple of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MgWKBdzAXXhRw5zZpzjLny3hy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216828'),
  ('1150895136584741316', 'Half a Sixpence', 1967, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'George Sidney, Geoffrey Unsworth, Peter Price', 'Beverley Cross', 'Tommy Steele, Julia Foster, Cyril Ritchard, Penelope Horner, Elaine Taylor, Hilton Edwards, James Villiers, Allan Cuthbertson', 'NR', '"If I had the money, I''d buy me a banjo!" says struggling sales clerk Arthur Kipps. Soon he''ll inherit enough to buy a whole bloomin'' orchestra. But can his newfound wealth buy happiness?', '"If I had the money, I''d buy me a banjo!" says struggling sales clerk Arthur Kipps. Soon he''ll inherit enough to buy a whole bloomin'' orchestra. But can his newfound wealth buy happiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vd2qhuZ5FFGv2nx8Nc0HD3kdsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47784'),
  ('79612878514531380', 'Half Baked', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Tamra Davis, Steven Bernstein, Jennifer Deathe', 'Dave Chappelle, Neal Brennan', 'Dave Chappelle, Jim Breuer, Harland Williams, Guillermo Díaz, Rachel True, Tommy Chong, Clarence Williams III, Laura Silverman', 'R', 'Three lovable party buds try to bail their friend out of jail. But just when the guys have mastered a plan, everything comes dangerously close to going up in smoke.', 'Three lovable party buds try to bail their friend out of jail. But just when the guys have mastered a plan, everything comes dangerously close to going up in smoke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14TmEac4bquNaEld9t0uIliYoKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9490'),
  ('114962353721454532', 'Half Brothers', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Christian Alvart, Christof Wahl', 'Doron Wisotzky, Michael Ostrowski', 'Julia Dietze, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Fahri Yardım, Charly Hübner, Michael Mendl, Mavie Hörbiger, Detlev Buck, Niels-Bruno Schmidt', null, 'Julian, Yasin and Addi learn from the executor of their deceased mother''s will that the three men, who had previously been complete strangers, are brothers. The news hits like a bomb. A German family man with a penchant for tricks, a spoiled, ambitious Turk and a rapping African – the three siblings immediately hate each other and it would all be nice if their paths were to separate again soon.', 'Julian, Yasin and Addi learn from the executor of their deceased mother''s will that the three men, who had previously been complete strangers, are brothers. The news hits like a bomb. A German family man with a penchant for tricks, a spoiled, ambitious Turk and a rapping African – the three siblings immediately hate each other and it would all be nice if their paths were to separate again soon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27PaaXyZ87pl3xOhGTCei6gzjIe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328039'),
  ('595095278697476775', 'Half Brothers', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luke Greenfield, Rip Murray', 'Eduardo Cisneros, Jason Shuman', 'José Zúñiga, Luis Gerardo Méndez, Vincent Spano, Alma Sisneros, Shira Scott Astrof, Connor Del Rio, Howard Ferguson Jr., Hayes Hargrove', 'PG-13', 'Mexican aviation exec Renato is shocked to learn that he has an American half-brother he never knew about: free-spirited Asher. They are forced on a road trip together, tracing the path their father took from Mexico to the U.S.', 'Mexican aviation exec Renato is shocked to learn that he has an American half-brother he never knew about: free-spirited Asher. They are forced on a road trip together, tracing the path their father took from Mexico to the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Apl0WFx61trVOoxvc8Erd5cbP8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652962'),
  ('136178606997433600', 'Half Girlfriend', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mohit Suri, Vishnu Rao, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Ishita Moitra, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Arjun Kapoor, Shraddha Kapoor, Rhea Chakraborty, Seema Biswas, Greg Kriek, Vikrant Massey, Anisa Butt, Adam Davenport', null, 'A boy meets a girl named Riya and falls in love. After struggling to convince her to be his girlfriend, she half-heartedly agrees to be his `half-girlfriend''.', 'A boy meets a girl named Riya and falls in love. After struggling to convince her to be his girlfriend, she half-heartedly agrees to be his `half-girlfriend''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvacZc9CVkjCA25ds4UqnOWbSpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413884'),
  ('1073451800560657761', 'Half Human: The Story of the Abominable Snowman', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Lucien N. Andriot, Tadashi Iimura, Hal Klein', 'Takeo Murata', 'John Carradine, Momoko Kôchi, Akira Takarada, Akemi Negishi, Russell Thorson, Robert Karnes, Morris Ankrum, Sachio Sakai', null, 'An American scientist tells two colleagues about the finding of an abominable snowman living in the Japanese alps, where it is worshipped by a remote tribe as a god, and how it was discovered by modern man after it raided a skiers shelter following an avalanche, killing all inside. This is an adaptation of the Japanese film "Jūjin Yuki Otoko" (1955) with added American-made footage, narration, and music.', 'An American scientist tells two colleagues about the finding of an abominable snowman living in the Japanese alps, where it is worshipped by a remote tribe as a god, and how it was discovered by modern man after it raided a skiers shelter following an avalanche, killing all inside. This is an adaptation of the Japanese film "Jūjin Yuki Otoko" (1955) with added American-made footage, narration, and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PdZ52iygJ6AC6wffpnAEXz7fja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116325'),
  ('438041357215180763', 'Half Light', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Craig Rosenberg, Ashley Rowe', 'Craig Rosenberg', 'Demi Moore, Henry Ian Cusick, Jordan El-Balawi, Kate Isitt, Nicholas Gleaves, James Cosmo, Joanna Hole, Thérèse Bradley', 'R', 'Rachel Carson, a best-selling crime novelist, is devastated and filled with guilt over the accidental death of her son. Hoping that a change of scenery will help alleviate her suffering, she leaves her home in the city and moves into a vacant country house owned by a friend and begins a relationship with charming local Angus. But, just as her life is taking a turn for the better, Rachel realizes she''s being romanced by a ghost, leading her to doubt her own sanity.', 'Rachel Carson, a best-selling crime novelist, is devastated and filled with guilt over the accidental death of her son. Hoping that a change of scenery will help alleviate her suffering, she leaves her home in the city and moves into a vacant country house owned by a friend and begins a relationship with charming local Angus. But, just as her life is taking a turn for the better, Rachel realizes she''s being romanced by a ghost, leading her to doubt her own sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c29RoGcznRr14a7fsBYbhJZAK2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9756'),
  ('1020574232264899767', 'Half Moon', 2006, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Bahman Ghobadi, Nigel Bluck, Crighton Bone', 'Behnam Behzadi', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Hedie Tehrani, Ismail Ghaffari, Farzin Sabooni, Hassan Pourshirazi, Kambiz Arshi, Mohamad Nahid, Sadiq Behzadpoor', null, 'Mamo, an old and legendary Kurdish musician living in Iran, plans to give one final concert in Iraqi Kurdistan. After seven months of trying to get a permit and rounding up his ten sons, he sets out for the long and troublesome journey in a derelict bus, denying a recurring vision of his own death at half moon. Halfway the party halts at a small village to pick up female singer Hesho, which will only add to the difficulty of the undertaking, as it is forbidden for Iranian women to sing in public, let alone in the company of men. But Mamo is determined to carry through, if not for the gullible antics of the bus driver.', 'Mamo, an old and legendary Kurdish musician living in Iran, plans to give one final concert in Iraqi Kurdistan. After seven months of trying to get a permit and rounding up his ten sons, he sets out for the long and troublesome journey in a derelict bus, denying a recurring vision of his own death at half moon. Halfway the party halts at a small village to pick up female singer Hesho, which will only add to the difficulty of the undertaking, as it is forbidden for Iranian women to sing in public, let alone in the company of men. But Mamo is determined to carry through, if not for the gullible antics of the bus driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qdjfK7RXxzZi4wmCi8r7ofvpac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43985'),
  ('61877340559472208', 'Half Moon Street', 1986, 'Drama', 'Bob Swaim, Peter Hannan', 'Bob Swaim, Edward Behr', 'Sigourney Weaver, Michael Caine, Patrick Kavanagh, Faith Kent, Ram John Holder, Keith Buckley, Nadim Sawalha, Vincent Lindon', 'R', 'Dr. Lauren Slaughter, a research fellow at the Arab-Anglo Institute in London is utterly frustrated by her job. To supplement her income, she starts moonlighting at the Jasmine Escort Service, where she has more control over men and money than she does at the office. On one of her ''dates'', Lauren meets the politician Lord Bulbeck who is trying to mediate a peace accord between the Arabs and Israelis. Bulbeck falls in love with his escort, and unwittingly, Lauren becomes a pawn in some very dirty politics.', 'Dr. Lauren Slaughter, a research fellow at the Arab-Anglo Institute in London is utterly frustrated by her job. To supplement her income, she starts moonlighting at the Jasmine Escort Service, where she has more control over men and money than she does at the office. On one of her ''dates'', Lauren meets the politician Lord Bulbeck who is trying to mediate a peace accord between the Arabs and Israelis. Bulbeck falls in love with his escort, and unwittingly, Lauren becomes a pawn in some very dirty politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMTmNED6YowXId1WX7ffoKTlSaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36372'),
  ('990950896578132046', 'Half Nelson', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ryan Fleck, Andrij Parekh, Anna Boden', 'Anna Boden, Ryan Fleck', 'Ryan Gosling, Shareeka Epps, Anthony Mackie, Jeff Lima, Monique Gabriela Curnen, Tina Holmes, Nathan Corbett, Tyra Kwao-Vovo', 'R', 'Despite his dedication to the junior-high students who fill his classroom, idealistic teacher Dan Dunne leads a secret life of addiction that the majority of his students will never know. But things change when a troubled student Drey makes a startling discovery of his secret life, causing a tenuous bond between the two that could either end disastrously or provide a catalyst of hope.', 'Despite his dedication to the junior-high students who fill his classroom, idealistic teacher Dan Dunne leads a secret life of addiction that the majority of his students will never know. But things change when a troubled student Drey makes a startling discovery of his secret life, causing a tenuous bond between the two that could either end disastrously or provide a catalyst of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdUCisMpTwy0oJOGwM7NrFFs400.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7859'),
  ('1120125456031596309', 'Half of the World', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jaime Ruiz Ibáñez', 'Jaime Ruiz Ibáñez', 'Luisa Huertas, Hansel Ramírez, Susana Salazar, Ignacio Guadalupe, Paulina Gaitán, Fernando Becerril, Lumi Cavazos, Raúl Adalid', null, 'The story is about a young man suffering mental retardation and sexual awakening, poet is charismatic and has the ability to pay attention to those little insignificant details of everyday life. His new status as a lover will bring popularity and with it problems will expose prejudice and false morality of a blinded people to wash their sins charged with the death of the less guilty.', 'The story is about a young man suffering mental retardation and sexual awakening, poet is charismatic and has the ability to pay attention to those little insignificant details of everyday life. His new status as a lover will bring popularity and with it problems will expose prejudice and false morality of a blinded people to wash their sins charged with the death of the less guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0UR4RJemSU1CizsOfqMmXO65Yu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113182'),
  ('192787765416854145', 'Half Past Dead', 2002, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Don Michael Paul, Michael Slovis, Eva-Maria Schönecker', 'Don Michael Paul', 'Steven Seagal, Morris Chestnut, Ja Rule, Nia Peeples, Alexandra Kamp, Claudia Christian, Tony Plana, Kurupt', 'PG-13', 'A man goes undercover in a hi-tech prison to find out information to help prosecute those who killed his wife. While there, he stumbles onto a plot involving a death-row inmate and his $200 million stash of gold.', 'A man goes undercover in a hi-tech prison to find out information to help prosecute those who killed his wife. While there, he stumbles onto a plot involving a death-row inmate and his $200 million stash of gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJhudecoqyoZLoCwAZvqNPd7MK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10167'),
  ('811074522923752207', 'Half Past Dead 2', 2007, 'Crime, Action', 'Art Camacho, Ken Blakey', 'D. Kyle Johnson, Andrew Stevens', 'Bill Goldberg, Kurupt, Tony Plana, Jack Conley, Robert Madrid, Morocco Omari, Angell Conwell, Art Camacho', null, 'Long time inmate Twitch (Kurupt) gets himself transfered to a tougher prison than the re-opened Alcatraz. He claims it''s to be closer to his lady but his real motives are a bit more grandiose. There he crosses paths with Burke (Bill Goldberg) a bulky prisoner who can take care of himself. Twitch, despite being less muscular, is just as mouthy and is pretty much the same. But there is a gang war brewing between the black and hispanic inmates that explodes into a hostile takeover of the prison when the black''s gang leader is shot dead and the finger points at Burke. But the sh!t really hits the fan when the real killer and leader of the hispanics, Cortez (Robert Madrid) takes Twitch''s girlfriend and Burke''s daughter hostage.', 'Long time inmate Twitch (Kurupt) gets himself transfered to a tougher prison than the re-opened Alcatraz. He claims it''s to be closer to his lady but his real motives are a bit more grandiose. There he crosses paths with Burke (Bill Goldberg) a bulky prisoner who can take care of himself. Twitch, despite being less muscular, is just as mouthy and is pretty much the same. But there is a gang war brewing between the black and hispanic inmates that explodes into a hostile takeover of the prison when the black''s gang leader is shot dead and the finger points at Burke. But the sh!t really hits the fan when the real killer and leader of the hispanics, Cortez (Robert Madrid) takes Twitch''s girlfriend and Burke''s daughter hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w575wZgzzYsHxe47idlzi4nO5Uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13721'),
  ('637690119424189141', 'Half Right Half Left - 2 Footballers Without a Ball', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Federico Zanni, Massimo Manasse, Sergio Martino', 'Maria Perrone Capano, Pier Francesco Pingitore, Sergio Martino', 'Andrea Roncato, Gigi Sammarchi, Milena Vukotić, Leo Gullotta, Silvio Spaccesi, Sandro Ghiani, Pino Insegno, Loredana Romito', null, 'The "Marchigiana" soccer team has been promoted to the Serie A of the national championship, but it is the last in the standings due mainly to two players, Gigi and Andrea.', 'The "Marchigiana" soccer team has been promoted to the Serie A of the national championship, but it is the last in the standings due mainly to two players, Gigi and Andrea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1F7JQHOmWs4AUhZKhNRaANsb5fS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82484'),
  ('196827423324769530', 'Half Shot at Sunrise', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Paul Sloane, Nicholas Musuraca', 'James Ashmore Creelman', 'Bert Wheeler, Robert Woolsey, Dorothy Lee, George MacFarlane, Edna May Oliver, Leni Stengel, Hugh Trevor, Roberta Robinson', null, 'Two soldiers go absent without leave in Paris during World War I.', 'Two soldiers go absent without leave in Paris during World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dR87HholUpWWE5NmB53iaORDxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85610'),
  ('786289258880880227', 'Half Shot Shooters', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Jack White', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Stanley Blystone, Vernon Dent, Heinie Conklin, Ethelreda Leopold, Dick Wessel', 'NR', 'The Stooges are discharged from the army after WW I, and promptly administer some revenge to their mean sergeant. Years later they wind up in the army again, and of course the same sergeant is their superior. The sergeant plays various tricks on them, and when the Stooges go crazy with a cannon, blowing up a house, a bridge, and a smoke stack, he blows them up.', 'The Stooges are discharged from the army after WW I, and promptly administer some revenge to their mean sergeant. Years later they wind up in the army again, and of course the same sergeant is their superior. The sergeant plays various tricks on them, and when the Stooges go crazy with a cannon, blowing up a house, a bridge, and a smoke stack, he blows them up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lRolXJ0LWqRTX0kOYF30OKiCFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115806'),
  ('272424393049480162', 'Half Sister, Full Love', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marion Vernoux, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Lynn Shelton, Marion Vernoux', 'Virginie Efira, Géraldine Nakache, Grégoire Ludig, Mélanie Malhère, Vincent Furic, Alexandra Sallé, Féodor Atkine, Alain Le Doaré', null, 'Mourning his brother''s recent death, Pierrick accepts his best friend Tessa''s invitation to stay in her family home — at last, a week alone. But when her gets there, he finds the house already occupied by Tessa''s sister Marie.', 'Mourning his brother''s recent death, Pierrick accepts his best friend Tessa''s invitation to stay in her family home — at last, a week alone. But when her gets there, he finds the house already occupied by Tessa''s sister Marie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyvMm4iN8Rsii2FgR2SRRZ64rr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375527'),
  ('400898230134090957', 'Half the World', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Florian Flicker, Jerzy Palacz', 'Florian Flicker, Andreas Niedermann, Michael Sturminger', 'Rainer Egger, Dani Levy, Mercedes Echerer, Maria Schrader, Goran Rebić, Proschat Madani, Karl Markovics, Heinrich Strobele', null, 'The sun blazes down from the sky with destructive power; exposing oneself to its light means death. People have transposed everyday existence to the night. In the metropolis of HALF WORLD a culture based on various languages and lifeforms has grown rampant. Everyone is looking for a way to survive.', 'The sun blazes down from the sky with destructive power; exposing oneself to its light means death. People have transposed everyday existence to the night. In the metropolis of HALF WORLD a culture based on various languages and lifeforms has grown rampant. Everyone is looking for a way to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/putkLH2i2C1NvPDiBztQCnBoHV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175380'),
  ('895690564356377116', 'Half-Sister', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Josiane Balasko, Sabine Lancelin, Zazie Carcedo', 'Josiane Balasko', 'Josiane Balasko, Michel Blanc, Brigitte Roüan, Françoise Lépine, Christine Murillo, Grégoire Baujat, Jean-Yves Chatelais, Stéphan Wojtowicz', null, 'When Nénette discovers the identity of her father in a letter, she quickly goes off in search of him. But instead of finding her father, she is met by her half-brother, Paul. Paul, a bitter man who gave up his dream to take over his father’s pharmacy business, is less than thrilled at the arrival of his ‘embarrassing’ half-sister. After refusing to take her in, he soon gets a taste of his own medicine. Under the influence of a potent drug, for one day Paul is generous, happy and sensitive. The next morning, however, once the drug has worn off, his nasty side comes back...', 'When Nénette discovers the identity of her father in a letter, she quickly goes off in search of him. But instead of finding her father, she is met by her half-brother, Paul. Paul, a bitter man who gave up his dream to take over his father’s pharmacy business, is less than thrilled at the arrival of his ‘embarrassing’ half-sister. After refusing to take her in, he soon gets a taste of his own medicine. Under the influence of a potent drug, for one day Paul is generous, happy and sensitive. The next morning, however, once the drug has worn off, his nasty side comes back...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oSfHLDpTkcrikzU6sS8Ad5SgAB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198119'),
  ('799969994847556910', 'Halfaouine: Boy of the Terraces', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Férid Boughedir, Georges Barsky', 'Férid Boughedir, Nouri Bouzid, Maryse León García', 'Selim Boughedir, Mustafa Adouani, Rabia Ben Abdallah, Mohammed Driss, Hélène Catzaras, Fatima Ben Saïdane, Carolyn Chelby, Abdelhamid Guayas', null, 'Twelve-year-old Noura dangles uncertainly in that difficult netherworld between childhood and adulthood. His growing libido has gotten him banned from the women''s baths, where his mother took him when he was younger, but he''s not yet old enough to participate in grown-up discussions with the men of his Tunisian village. Noura''s only real friend is a troublemaker named Salih -- the village political outcast.', 'Twelve-year-old Noura dangles uncertainly in that difficult netherworld between childhood and adulthood. His growing libido has gotten him banned from the women''s baths, where his mother took him when he was younger, but he''s not yet old enough to participate in grown-up discussions with the men of his Tunisian village. Noura''s only real friend is a troublemaker named Salih -- the village political outcast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uI7hb9flZetd0KZoN2BGHLq4uvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44281'),
  ('383809934055296744', 'Halfon Hill Doesn''t Answer', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Assi Dayan', 'Naftali Alter, Assi Dayan', 'Gavri Banai, Shaike Levi, Yisrael Poliakov, Miki Kam, Hana Laslo, Oshik Levi, Tuvia Tzafir, Menahem Zilberman', null, 'Sergio Konstanza, a swindler, owes money to Mr. Hasson. He escapes to the desert where he joins a wacky army reserve unit whose Sergeant is engaged to one of Mr. Hasson''s Daughters.', 'Sergio Konstanza, a swindler, owes money to Mr. Hasson. He escapes to the desert where he joins a wacky army reserve unit whose Sergeant is engaged to one of Mr. Hasson''s Daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7Wv0A0z8CjmzxeddDt0jHBoM0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24611'),
  ('15132658803072077', 'Halftime', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Amanda Micheli, Jason B. Bergh', null, 'Jennifer Lopez, Ben Affleck, Lorene Scafaria, Shakira, Laura Dern, Constance Wu, Keke Palmer, Julia Stiles', 'NR', 'Global superstar Jennifer Lopez reflects on her multifaceted career and the pressure of life in the spotlight in this intimate documentary.', 'Global superstar Jennifer Lopez reflects on her multifaceted career and the pressure of life in the spotlight in this intimate documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUVglxBw7KSkcVEhvfJs1eipPnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962192'),
  ('861334592559250542', 'Halfway', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eriko Kitagawa, Shinichi Tsunoda', 'Eriko Kitagawa', 'Kie Kitano, Masaki Okada, Riisa Naka, Miho Shiraishi, Junpei Mizobata, Hiroki Narimiya, Takao Osawa', null, 'In this high school romance Hiro is dismayed to learn her new love Shu will be going away to college in Tokyo. She asks him not to go.', 'In this high school romance Hiro is dismayed to learn her new love Shu will be going away to college in Tokyo. She asks him not to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgttp3LUO9QVHvJA5sitWjMNhuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104060'),
  ('134184241965803557', 'Hall', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Francesco Giannini', 'Adam Kolodny, Francesco Giannini, Derrick Adams', 'Carolina Bartczak, Yumiko Shaku, Mark Gibson, Julian Richings, Vlasta Vrana, Dawn Ford, Val Mervis, Kathleen Fee', null, 'When a hotel hallway is ravaged by a dreadful airborne virus, pregnant Japanese runaway wife Naomi is tragically thrust into the fight of her life. After getting infected, she is forced to crawl her way through other helpless victims to escape. In the room next door to her is Val, a mother trapped in a toxic marriage, who must also navigate her way out of the hotel corridor through the long and narrow stretch of isolated carnage, desperately looking for her young daughter Kelly. Will these two women avoid the debilitating sickness and get out alive?', 'When a hotel hallway is ravaged by a dreadful airborne virus, pregnant Japanese runaway wife Naomi is tragically thrust into the fight of her life. After getting infected, she is forced to crawl her way through other helpless victims to escape. In the room next door to her is Val, a mother trapped in a toxic marriage, who must also navigate her way out of the hotel corridor through the long and narrow stretch of isolated carnage, desperately looking for her young daughter Kelly. Will these two women avoid the debilitating sickness and get out alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0DikUkLLg4oTFfkXay0HyUxHwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728796'),
  ('397228362751265825', 'Hall Pass', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Pete Jones, Peter Farrelly, Bobby Farrelly', 'Owen Wilson, Jason Sudeikis, Jenna Fischer, Christina Applegate, Nicky Whelan, Richard Jenkins, Stephen Merchant, Larry Joe Campbell', 'R', 'When best buds Rick and Fred begin to show signs of restlessness at home, their wives take a bold approach to revitalize their marriages, they grant the guys a ''hall pass''—one week of freedom to do whatever they want. At first, it seems like a dream come true, but they quickly discover that their expectations of the single life—and themselves—are completely and hilariously out of sync with reality.', 'When best buds Rick and Fred begin to show signs of restlessness at home, their wives take a bold approach to revitalize their marriages, they grant the guys a ''hall pass''—one week of freedom to do whatever they want. At first, it seems like a dream come true, but they quickly discover that their expectations of the single life—and themselves—are completely and hilariously out of sync with reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eol3uD6whQKOKCmmhF7z39fq2Pe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48988'),
  ('205706935558080892', 'Halla Bol', 2008, 'Drama', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Natarajan Subramaniam', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Ajay Devgn, Vidya Balan, Pankaj Kapur, Sana Khaan, Darshan Jariwala, Sanjay Mishra, Abhay Bhargava, Anupam Shyam', null, 'Ashfaque (Ajay Devgan) is a small town boy aspiring to be a film star in the Hindi film industry. He joins a street theatre group run by a reformed dacoit Sidhu (Pankaj Kapur) who uses street theatre as a medium to bring about an awakening in the masses. Ashfaque struggles to give a creative vent to the actor in him in order to realize his dreams.', 'Ashfaque (Ajay Devgan) is a small town boy aspiring to be a film star in the Hindi film industry. He joins a street theatre group run by a reformed dacoit Sidhu (Pankaj Kapur) who uses street theatre as a medium to bring about an awakening in the masses. Ashfaque struggles to give a creative vent to the actor in him in order to realize his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deVwN1G189jS89OSR5gLgg38zs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23848'),
  ('721258906345925884', 'Hallam Foe', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'David Mackenzie, Giles Nuttgens', 'Ed Whitmore, David Mackenzie', 'Jamie Bell, Sophia Myles, Ciarán Hinds, Claire Forlani, Jamie Sives, Maurice Roëves, Ewen Bremner, Lucy Holt', null, 'Hallam''s talent for spying on people reveals his darkest fears-and his most peculiar desires. Driven to expose the true cause of his mother''s death, he instead finds himself searching the rooftops of the city for love.', 'Hallam''s talent for spying on people reveals his darkest fears-and his most peculiar desires. Driven to expose the true cause of his mother''s death, he instead finds himself searching the rooftops of the city for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RzhxbVNu4BaPx0ETCiuNUpjJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2239'),
  ('1040686414555988061', 'Hallelujah', 1929, 'Music, Drama', 'King Vidor, Gordon Avil', 'Wanda Tuchock', 'Daniel L. Haynes, Nina Mae McKinney, William Fountaine, Harry Gray, Fanny Belle DeKnight, Everett McGarrity, Victoria Spivey, Milton Dickerson', null, 'A black laborer turns preacher after accidentally killing a man.', 'A black laborer turns preacher after accidentally killing a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRRhrNMQkYLq90ZvwDqqMMebZWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72856'),
  ('977664125397886984', 'Hallelujah the Hills', 1963, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Adolfas Mekas, Jonas Mekas', 'Adolfas Mekas', 'Peter Beard, Sheila Finn, Martin Greenbaum, Peggy Steffans, Jerome Raphael, Blanche Dee, Jerome Hill, Taylor Mead', null, 'Jack and Leo vie for the affections of Vera – who appears a little differently to each man – over the course of a series of energetic sketches, flashbacks and homages.', 'Jack and Leo vie for the affections of Vera – who appears a little differently to each man – over the course of a series of energetic sketches, flashbacks and homages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGKkn6IWfr43MkgVyscV46jXqdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161741'),
  ('342073645298807179', 'Hallelujah: Leonard Cohen, a Journey, a Song', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Dayna Goldfine, Daniel Geller', null, 'Leonard Cohen, Larry Sloman, Adrienne Clarkson, Judy Collins, Clive Davis, John Lissauer, Nancy Bacal, Rabbi Mordecai Finley', 'PG-13', 'This feature-length documentary explores the life of singer-songwriter Leonard Cohen as seen through the prism of his internationally renowned hymn, Hallelujah.', 'This feature-length documentary explores the life of singer-songwriter Leonard Cohen as seen through the prism of his internationally renowned hymn, Hallelujah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvAjJvpu4EYuByjebjKl3QntQ0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854513'),
  ('672694051679000682', 'Hallelujah!', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Roger Delattre', 'Jean-Marie Bigard, Philippe Giangreco', 'Jean-Marie Bigard, David Strajmayster, Aïssatou Thiam, Jean Dell, Michel Chesneau, Benjamin Feitelson, Jean-Gilles Barbier, Liina Brunelle', null, 'Following his release from a seven-year stretch in prison, Mario Diccara discovers that his affairs with the underworld aren''t completely settled. His brother Patrick, a priest, suggests that he stays with elderly Father Etienne in a small village in Ardeche until the conflict blows over. But their plan takes an unexpected turn when Father Etienne dies.', 'Following his release from a seven-year stretch in prison, Mario Diccara discovers that his affairs with the underworld aren''t completely settled. His brother Patrick, a priest, suggests that he stays with elderly Father Etienne in a small village in Ardeche until the conflict blows over. But their plan takes an unexpected turn when Father Etienne dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGZyAHnGgGTUfABgAd0ZQYH1TKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17417'),
  ('472955742707038505', 'Halley', 2012, 'Horror, Drama', 'Sebastián Hofmann', 'Julio Chavezmontes, Sebastián Hofmann', 'Alberto Trujillo, Lourdes Trueba, Hugo Albores', null, 'Alberto is dead and can no longer hide it. Make-up and perfume can no longer conceal his quickly decomposing body. Dismayed, he decides to withdraw from the world, whilst forming an unusual friendship with Luly, the manager of the 24-hour gym where he works as a night guard.', 'Alberto is dead and can no longer hide it. Make-up and perfume can no longer conceal his quickly decomposing body. Dismayed, he decides to withdraw from the world, whilst forming an unusual friendship with Luly, the manager of the 24-hour gym where he works as a night guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHQvEaH4igUXLd0sOCtyr2bHd8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153853'),
  ('62595856494011490', 'Hallow Road', 2025, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Babak Anvari, Kit Fraser', 'William Gillies', 'Rosamund Pike, Matthew Rhys, Megan McDonnell, Tadhg Murphy, Stephen Jones, Paul Tylak', 'R', 'Two parents enter a race against time when they receive a distressing late-night phone call from their daughter after she caused a tragic car accident.', 'Two parents enter a race against time when they receive a distressing late-night phone call from their daughter after she caused a tragic car accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVsgV7ak6vR5xyXFggooJQinXBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1205656'),
  ('1065318992814607181', 'Hallowed Ground', 2007, 'Horror', 'David Benullo, Keith J. Duggan', 'David Benullo', 'Jaimie Alexander, Brian McNamara, Ethan Phillips, Chloë Grace Moretz, Hudson Leick, Ned Vaughn, Jim Cody Williams, Tamara Clatterbuck', 'NR', 'After she becomes stranded in a small town, a young woman discovers her arrival there was foretold a century earlier by the town''s founding preacher and that she is an integral part of his impending - and terrifying - rebirth.', 'After she becomes stranded in a small town, a young woman discovers her arrival there was foretold a century earlier by the town''s founding preacher and that she is an integral part of his impending - and terrifying - rebirth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yLHghnybsyrofVwHzQdXxiWx4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30579'),
  ('197434818627533324', 'Halloween', 1978, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Carpenter, Dean Cundey, Randy Moore', 'John Carpenter, Debra Hill', 'Donald Pleasence, Jamie Lee Curtis, Nancy Kyes, P. J. Soles, Charles Cyphers, Kyle Richards, Brian Andrews, John Michael Graham', 'R', 'Fifteen years after murdering his sister on Halloween Night 1963, Michael Myers escapes from a mental hospital and returns to the small town of Haddonfield, Illinois to kill again.', 'Fifteen years after murdering his sister on Halloween Night 1963, Michael Myers escapes from a mental hospital and returns to the small town of Haddonfield, Illinois to kill again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wijlZ3HaYMvlDTPqJoTCWKFkCPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948'),
  ('888076155151084756', 'Halloween', 2007, 'Horror', 'Rob Zombie, Phil Parmet, Alexander H. Gayner', 'John Carpenter, Debra Hill', 'Malcolm McDowell, Sheri Moon Zombie, Tyler Mane, Scout Taylor-Compton, Brad Dourif, Danielle Harris, Hanna Hall, Bill Moseley', 'R', 'The early years of young Michael Myers and the events leading up to his fateful Halloween night murder rampage in the quiet town of Haddonfield, Illinois.', 'The early years of young Michael Myers and the events leading up to his fateful Halloween night murder rampage in the quiet town of Haddonfield, Illinois.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cD8JrfSEI4j7WVnKM1GdiYzMoUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2082'),
  ('479735626625446804', 'Halloween', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jake Kuykendall, Max Sturgeon, Atilla Salih Yücer', 'Jeff Fradley', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Judy Greer, Andi Matichak, James Jude Courtney, Nick Castle, Haluk Bilginer, Will Patton, Rhian Rees', 'R', 'Laurie Strode comes to her final confrontation with Michael Myers, the masked figure who has haunted her since she narrowly escaped his killing spree on Halloween night four decades ago.', 'Laurie Strode comes to her final confrontation with Michael Myers, the masked figure who has haunted her since she narrowly escaped his killing spree on Halloween night four decades ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7JAX5EGk4GgsEnus6OxyzwpFp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424139'),
  ('707406149568711545', 'Halloween 4: The Return of Michael Myers', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Lyons Collister, Dwight H. Little, Denis L. Stewart', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Donald Pleasence, Ellie Cornell, Danielle Harris, George P. Wilbur, Michael Pataki, Beau Starr, Kathleen Kinmont, Sasha Jenson', 'R', 'Ten years after his original massacre, the invalid Michael Myers awakens on Halloween Eve and returns to Haddonfield to kill his seven-year-old niece.', 'Ten years after his original massacre, the invalid Michael Myers awakens on Halloween Eve and returns to Haddonfield to kill his seven-year-old niece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFSOkXF9n9hsfGv45MDsPixiOyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11357'),
  ('394655139444989229', 'Halloween 5: The Revenge of Michael Myers', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dominique Othenin-Girard, Robert Draper, Lee Alan McConnell', 'Shem Bitterman, Dominique Othenin-Girard, Michael Jacobs', 'Donald Pleasence, Danielle Harris, Ellie Cornell, Wendy Foxworth, Beau Starr, Don Shanks, Jeffrey Landman, Tamara Glynn', 'R', 'After lying in a coma for a year, Michael Myers awakens and stalks his way back to his small hometown in Illinois, intent on killing his niece, Jamie, who has been confined to a mental institution since his last attempt to slay her.', 'After lying in a coma for a year, Michael Myers awakens and stalks his way back to his small hometown in Illinois, intent on killing his niece, Jamie, who has been confined to a mental institution since his last attempt to slay her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYvP6yMXCIVHnkVtwGaAXFmpzkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11361'),
  ('1134146968830925941', 'Halloween Ends', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Simmonds, Nate Meyer, Kamen Velkovsky', 'Paul Brad Logan, Chris Bernier, David Gordon Green', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Andi Matichak, James Jude Courtney, Rohan Campbell, Will Patton, Jesse C. Boyd, Michael Barbieri, Destiny Mone', 'R', 'Four years after the events of Halloween in 2018, Laurie has decided to liberate herself from fear and rage and embrace life. But when a young man is accused of killing a boy he was babysitting, it ignites a cascade of violence and terror that will force Laurie to finally confront the evil she can’t control, once and for all.', 'Four years after the events of Halloween in 2018, Laurie has decided to liberate herself from fear and rage and embrace life. But when a young man is accused of killing a boy he was babysitting, it ignites a cascade of violence and terror that will force Laurie to finally confront the evil she can’t control, once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q06saepaXeBdkMibuN4R2fXmgIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616820'),
  ('651172416171937744', 'Halloween H20: 20 Years Later', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steve Miner, Daryn Okada, Mark Cotone', 'Matt Greenberg, Robert Zappia', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Adam Arkin, Michelle Williams, Adam Hann-Byrd, Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Janet Leigh, Josh Hartnett, LL Cool J', 'R', 'Two decades after surviving a massacre on October 31, 1978, former baby sitter Laurie Strode finds herself hunted by persistent knife-wielder Michael Myers. Laurie now lives in Northern California under an assumed name, where she works as the headmistress of a private school. But it''s not far enough to escape Myers, who soon discovers her whereabouts. As Halloween descends upon Laurie''s peaceful community, a feeling of dread weighs upon her -- with good reason.', 'Two decades after surviving a massacre on October 31, 1978, former baby sitter Laurie Strode finds herself hunted by persistent knife-wielder Michael Myers. Laurie now lives in Northern California under an assumed name, where she works as the headmistress of a private school. But it''s not far enough to escape Myers, who soon discovers her whereabouts. As Halloween descends upon Laurie''s peaceful community, a feeling of dread weighs upon her -- with good reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqLXUm3oK59sGJKRH2Zjj2m3iMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11675'),
  ('7971291804956093', 'Halloween II', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rick Rosenthal, Dean Cundey, William S. Beasley', 'John Carpenter, Debra Hill', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Donald Pleasence, Charles Cyphers, Jeffrey Kramer, Lance Guest, Pamela Susan Shoop, Hunter von Leer, Dick Warlock', 'R', 'After failing to kill stubborn survivor Laurie and taking a bullet or six from former psychiatrist Dr. Sam Loomis, Michael Myers has followed Laurie to the Haddonfield Memorial Hospital, where she''s been admitted for Myers'' attempt on her life. The institution proves to be particularly suited to serial killers, however, as Myers cuts, stabs and slashes his way through hospital staff to reach his favorite victim.', 'After failing to kill stubborn survivor Laurie and taking a bullet or six from former psychiatrist Dr. Sam Loomis, Michael Myers has followed Laurie to the Haddonfield Memorial Hospital, where she''s been admitted for Myers'' attempt on her life. The institution proves to be particularly suited to serial killers, however, as Myers cuts, stabs and slashes his way through hospital staff to reach his favorite victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyBX7rFmNB4nM2RBW3042RQPFG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11281'),
  ('485738107572695044', 'Halloween II', 2009, 'Horror', 'Rob Zombie, Emily McGovern, Brandon Trost', 'Rob Zombie', 'Scout Taylor-Compton, Malcolm McDowell, Tyler Mane, Sheri Moon Zombie, Brad Dourif, Danielle Harris, Brea Grant, Howard Hesseman', 'R', 'Laurie Strode struggles to come to terms with her brother Michael''s deadly return to Haddonfield, Illinois. Meanwhile, Michael prepares for another reunion with his sister.', 'Laurie Strode struggles to come to terms with her brother Michael''s deadly return to Haddonfield, Illinois. Meanwhile, Michael prepares for another reunion with his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSHPM4LQDpWdQrD5KZWK6wNqSOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24150'),
  ('651044553444297738', 'Halloween III: Season of the Witch', 1982, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Dean Cundey, Tommy Lee Wallace, Ron Wright', 'Tommy Lee Wallace, Nigel Kneale', 'Tom Atkins, Stacey Nelkin, Dan O''Herlihy, Michael Currie, Ralph Strait, Jadeen Barbor, Brad Schacter, Garn Stephens', 'R', 'After a terrified toy salesman is mysteriously attacked and brought to the hospital, clutching the year''s most popular Halloween mask, Dr. Daniel Challis sets out to investigate the strange events and finds himself thrust into a nightmarish conspiracy.', 'After a terrified toy salesman is mysteriously attacked and brought to the hospital, clutching the year''s most popular Halloween mask, Dr. Daniel Challis sets out to investigate the strange events and finds himself thrust into a nightmarish conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WABfdeaThFYXCySGIOvRNv2sSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10676'),
  ('840615026950866082', 'Halloween Is Grinch Night', 1977, 'Fantasy, Family, Animation, Music, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Gerard Baldwin, Barrington Bunce', null, 'Hans Conried, Hal Smith, Gary Shapiro, Irene Tedrow, Jack DeLeon, Henry Gibson', null, 'When the sour-sweet wind starts blowing again, the Whos retreat to their homes because they know the Grinch will soon be a''prowlin. Young Eukariah Who has to make a trip to the Euphemism (outhouse), when the wind blows him away to a confrontation with the gruesome Grinch. Eukariah decides that the Grinch must be stopped, so he faces his fears and confronts the Grinch and his spooks.', 'When the sour-sweet wind starts blowing again, the Whos retreat to their homes because they know the Grinch will soon be a''prowlin. Young Eukariah Who has to make a trip to the Euphemism (outhouse), when the wind blows him away to a confrontation with the gruesome Grinch. Eukariah decides that the Grinch must be stopped, so he faces his fears and confronts the Grinch and his spooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NMJWTNIChzRHWftVprjAc5RCl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52207'),
  ('1029301120448678774', 'Halloween Kills', 2021, 'Horror', 'David Gordon Green, Michael Simmonds, Atilla Salih Yücer', 'David Gordon Green, Danny McBride, Scott Teems', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Judy Greer, Andi Matichak, James Jude Courtney, Nick Castle, Airon Armstrong, Will Patton, Thomas Mann', 'R', 'Michael manages to free himself from Laurie Strode''s trap to resume his ritual bloodbath. As she fights for her life from injuries from their last encounter, she inspires her daughter Karen, her granddaughter Allyson, and all of Haddonfield to rise up against the unstoppable monster.', 'Michael manages to free himself from Laurie Strode''s trap to resume his ritual bloodbath. As she fights for her life from injuries from their last encounter, she inspires her daughter Karen, her granddaughter Allyson, and all of Haddonfield to rise up against the unstoppable monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CclCDyQXBBgz62Qtp3CoflQE5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610253'),
  ('323684500850611400', 'Halloween Night', 2006, 'Horror', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins', 'Michael Gingold', 'Derek Osedach, Rebekah Kochan, Scot Nery, Sean Durrie, Amanda Ward, Amelia Jackson-Gray, Nicholas Daly Clark, Alicia Klein', null, 'A horribly burned man escapes from a mental institution and terrorizes teenagers at a party.', 'A horribly burned man escapes from a mental institution and terrorizes teenagers at a party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1R912NHbp1gWe0oV1eU1qRNH1Ab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36675'),
  ('1034969448244691073', 'Halloween Party', 2020, 'Horror', 'Jay Dahl, Kyle Cameron, Nicole Feriancek', 'Jay Dahl', 'Amy Groening, T. Thomason, Marietta Laan, Shelley Thompson, Jeremy Akerman, Zach Faye, Scott Bailey, Taylor Olson', null, 'A college student unwittingly releases terrifying entities from her school''s past via a Halloween-themed computer meme.', 'A college student unwittingly releases terrifying entities from her school''s past via a Halloween-themed computer meme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GyxiIRV7Sz4YCyUJ5x3kyDzVok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544075'),
