  ('829845706645319945', 'Halloween: 25 Years of Terror', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Stefan Hutchinson', 'Stefan Hutchinson, Anthony Masi', 'P. J. Soles, John Carpenter, Jamie Lee Curtis, Debra Hill, Moustapha Akkad, Dean Cundey, Nick Castle, Greg Nicotero', 'NR', 'Follow the evolution of the ''Halloween'' movies over the past twenty-five years. It examines why the films are so popular and revisits many of the original locations used in the films - seeing the effects on the local community. For the first time, cast, crew, critics and fans join together in the ultimate ''Halloween'' retrospective.', 'Follow the evolution of the ''Halloween'' movies over the past twenty-five years. It examines why the films are so popular and revisits many of the original locations used in the films - seeing the effects on the local community. For the first time, cast, crew, critics and fans join together in the ultimate ''Halloween'' retrospective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmayq2Waak7cqmDLNYnB1lzxEiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28900'),
  ('887146667972296390', 'Halloween: Resurrection', 2002, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rick Rosenthal, David Geddes', 'Larry Brand, Sean Hood', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Brad Loree, Busta Rhymes, Bianca Kajlich, Katee Sackhoff, Thomas Ian Nicholas, Tyra Banks, Sean Patrick Thomas', 'R', 'Reality programmers at DangerTainment select a group of thrill-seeking teenagers to spend one night in the childhood home of serial killer Michael Myers. Their planned live broadcast turns deadly when Michael decides to crash the party.', 'Reality programmers at DangerTainment select a group of thrill-seeking teenagers to spend one night in the childhood home of serial killer Michael Myers. Their planned live broadcast turns deadly when Michael decides to crash the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mlKwbNzJCGzqe4i0ZEJtUUL290.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11442'),
  ('1143444723421776068', 'Halloween: The Curse of Michael Myers', 1995, 'Horror', 'Billy Dickson, Joe Chappelle, Christopher T. Gerrity', 'Daniel Farrands', 'Donald Pleasence, Paul Rudd, Marianne Hagan, Mitchell Ryan, Kim Darby, Bradford English, Keith Bogart, Mariah O''Brien', 'R', 'Six years after being presumed dead in a fire, and just as the town prepares to finally celebrate Halloween again, Michael Myers returns to Haddonfield to continue his reign of terror.', 'Six years after being presumed dead in a fire, and just as the town prepares to finally celebrate Halloween again, Michael Myers returns to Haddonfield to continue his reign of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noCnM8nEI2bEDSdKHh0RKbwBwbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10987'),
  ('832634135810711115', 'Halloweentown', 1998, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Duwayne Dunham, Michael Slovis, Scott Cameron', 'Paul Bernbaum', 'Debbie Reynolds, Kimberly J. Brown, Judith Hoag, Joey Zimmerman, Phillip Van Dyke, Emily Roeske, Robin Thomas, Rino Romano', 'G', 'On her 13th birthday, Marnie learns she''s a witch, discovers a secret portal, and is transported to Halloweentown — a magical place where ghosts and ghouls, witches and werewolves live apart from the human world. But she soon finds herself battling wicked warlocks, evil curses, and endless surprises.', 'On her 13th birthday, Marnie learns she''s a witch, discovers a secret portal, and is transported to Halloweentown — a magical place where ghosts and ghouls, witches and werewolves live apart from the human world. But she soon finds herself battling wicked warlocks, evil curses, and endless surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9RJCxJMbWqhXjkBgC0VXETmHj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27850'),
  ('821441631596429824', 'Halloweentown High', 2004, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Mark A.Z. Dippé, Robert Seaman', null, 'Kimberly J. Brown, Debbie Reynolds, Judith Hoag, Emily Roeske, Lucas Grabeel, Joey Zimmerman, Finn Wittrock, Clifton Davis', 'G', 'Marnie puts her magic on the line to get several Halloweentown teenagers transferred to her high school in the mortal world. But soon, Marnie and her new friends are in trouble and out of luck when the evil Knight Of The Iron Dagger appears. He''s determined to destroy all things magical, and it''s up to Marnie to save her high school, the human world and her magic.', 'Marnie puts her magic on the line to get several Halloweentown teenagers transferred to her high school in the mortal world. But soon, Marnie and her new friends are in trouble and out of luck when the evil Knight Of The Iron Dagger appears. He''s determined to destroy all things magical, and it''s up to Marnie to save her high school, the human world and her magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJsmptwkTWbxk1NwLAKeoYtcTuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34560'),
  ('883332639332894954', 'Halloweentown II: Kalabar''s Revenge', 2001, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Mary Lambert, Tony Westman, Richard Flower', 'Jon Cooksey, Ali Marie Matheson', 'Kimberly J. Brown, Judith Hoag, Daniel Kountz, Joey Zimmerman, Emily Roeske, Phillip Van Dyke, Blu Mankuma, Peter Wingfield', 'G', 'The Cromwell clan lives in the real world, except for their grandmother who lives in Halloweentown, a place where monsters go to escape reality. But now the son of the Cromwells'' old enemy Kalabar has a plan to use the grandmother''s book to turn Halloweentown into a grey dreary version of the real world while transforming the denizens of the real world into monsters.', 'The Cromwell clan lives in the real world, except for their grandmother who lives in Halloweentown, a place where monsters go to escape reality. But now the son of the Cromwells'' old enemy Kalabar has a plan to use the grandmother''s book to turn Halloweentown into a grey dreary version of the real world while transforming the denizens of the real world into monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDnp52aGXxnfU4vqnnc6YpfzjHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34205'),
  ('874448928168832375', 'Halls of Montezuma', 1951, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, War', 'Lewis Milestone, Harry Jackson, Winton C. Hoch', 'Michael Blankfort', 'Richard Widmark, Jack Palance, Reginald Gardiner, Robert Wagner, Karl Malden, Richard Hylton, Richard Boone, Skip Homeier', 'NR', 'Richard Widmark leads an all star cast of marine leathernecks including Jack Palance, Robert Wagner, Karl Malden, Richard Boone and Jack Webb into battle on a heavily fortified island. This action-packed story follows the squad as they pick their way through enemy-infested jungles on a time sensitive mission to find the source of the enemy rockets. As the mission progresses, the squad and leader overcome many challenges as they are transformed into an effective and efficient fighting unit.', 'Richard Widmark leads an all star cast of marine leathernecks including Jack Palance, Robert Wagner, Karl Malden, Richard Boone and Jack Webb into battle on a heavily fortified island. This action-packed story follows the squad as they pick their way through enemy-infested jungles on a time sensitive mission to find the source of the enemy rockets. As the mission progresses, the squad and leader overcome many challenges as they are transformed into an effective and efficient fighting unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXAolbmS7iYXnyk1mgiqv73gjIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38766'),
  ('754474125301533220', 'Hallucinations', 1986, 'Mystery, Horror, Drama', 'Mark Polonia, Todd Michael Smith, John Polonia', null, 'John Polonia, Mark Polonia, Todd Michael Smith', null, 'Three brothers (one who is slow and another who is adopted) have disturbing and violent hallucinations while their mother is at work.', 'Three brothers (one who is slow and another who is adopted) have disturbing and violent hallucinations while their mother is at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFetRP4nwhbO2xsGzVL9kCQiI0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194659'),
  ('1128721979940730666', 'Hallucinations of a Deranged Mind', 1978, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'José Mojica Marins, Crounel Marins, Giorgio Attili', 'Rubens Francisco Lucchetti, José Mojica Marins', 'José Mojica Marins, Jorge Peres, Magda Miller, Lirio Bertelli, Anadir Goe, João da Cruz, Alexa Brandwira, Valter Setembro', null, 'A psychiatric doctor driven to insanity by nightmare visions of Zé do Caixão trying to steal his wife is helped by colleagues who enlist creator José Mojica Marins to convince the patient that he does not exist.', 'A psychiatric doctor driven to insanity by nightmare visions of Zé do Caixão trying to steal his wife is helped by colleagues who enlist creator José Mojica Marins to convince the patient that he does not exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwXYGsLWhkFPxaYJWlBfPwC7aGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113562'),
  ('408266284348049676', 'Halo Legends', 2010, 'Animation, War, Action, Science Fiction', 'Frank O''Connor, Kristofor Mellroth, Joseph Chou', 'Joseph Staten, Frank O''Connor, Eiji Umehara', 'Luci Christian, David Wald, Emily Neves, Shelley Calene-Black, Jessie James Grelle, Brittney Karbowski, Greg Ayres, David Anthony Matranga', 'PG-13', 'The universe of the Halo video game series is expanded in seven short animated films from Japan''s greatest anime directors and studios.', 'The universe of the Halo video game series is expanded in seven short animated films from Japan''s greatest anime directors and studios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cO3iAp2pPNdWE9eqS4pTEY5HghY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573531'),
  ('870955195089587843', 'Halo: Landfall', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction, War', 'Victoria Burkhart, Neill Blomkamp', null, null, null, 'Director Neill Blomkamp explores the lives of Marines and ODSTs on a last, desperate mission in a post-invasion Earth – a mission that may secure the salvation, or usher the destruction of the entire galaxy. Edited together as a standalone piece for the first time, these three shorts are the first glimpse at what a live-action Halo could and should look like and a must-see for Halo fans of every stripe.', 'Director Neill Blomkamp explores the lives of Marines and ODSTs on a last, desperate mission in a post-invasion Earth – a mission that may secure the salvation, or usher the destruction of the entire galaxy. Edited together as a standalone piece for the first time, these three shorts are the first glimpse at what a live-action Halo could and should look like and a must-see for Halo fans of every stripe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vStuoJSMfKfMyE2Mg6tSZMoQpx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394394'),
  ('392060811381495566', 'Halo: Nightfall', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Conor Dennison, Sergio Mimica-Gezzan, Gavin Struthers', 'Paul T. Scheuring', 'Mike Colter, Alexis Rodney, Alexander Bhat, Sarah Armstrong, Shaun Blaney, Christina Chong, Steven Waddington, Luke Neal', 'PG-13', 'Set between the events of Halo 4 and Halo 5: Guardians… Halo: Nightfall tells the dramatic story of legendary man hunter and Naval Intelligence Officer Jameson Locke and his team as they are caught in a horrific biological attack while investigating terrorist activity on the distant colony world of Sedra. As they unravel a plot that draws them to an ancient, hellish artifact, they will be forced to fight for their survival, question everything and ultimately choose between their loyalty and their lives.', 'Set between the events of Halo 4 and Halo 5: Guardians… Halo: Nightfall tells the dramatic story of legendary man hunter and Naval Intelligence Officer Jameson Locke and his team as they are caught in a horrific biological attack while investigating terrorist activity on the distant colony world of Sedra. As they unravel a plot that draws them to an ancient, hellish artifact, they will be forced to fight for their survival, question everything and ultimately choose between their loyalty and their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liLQ8EFzHN06eFZ9KQMDK6cmGaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487186'),
  ('87273278650582620', 'Hamara Dil Aapke Paas Hai', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Satish Kaushik', 'Jainendra Jain, Bhupati Raja', 'Anil Kapoor, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Sonali Bendre, Puru Raaj Kumar, Anupam Kher, Satish Kaushik, Mukesh Rishi, Jaspal Bhatti', null, 'When Preeti testifies against Bhavani Choudhry for a murder, he rapes her. After being humiliated and thrown out by her family, Avinash, a kind man, offers her a place to stay.', 'When Preeti testifies against Bhavani Choudhry for a murder, he rapes her. After being humiliated and thrown out by her family, Avinash, a kind man, offers her a place to stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAmnbYwpSwZjHpZS9UX9RQVT1ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75217'),
  ('89877495633072301', 'Hamari Adhuri Kahani', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mohit Suri', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Shagufta Rafique', 'Vidya Balan, Emraan Hashmi, Rajkummar Rao, Sara Khan, Madhurima Tuli, Suhasini Mulay, Namit Das, Narendra Jha', null, 'A single mother finds solace with a wealthy, but lonely hotel magnate, together they find love until her past comes back to confront her.', 'A single mother finds solace with a wealthy, but lonely hotel magnate, together they find love until her past comes back to confront her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joiHOPFGtmY45YwP7Bnm7KvzL8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339367'),
  ('1039585156132668489', 'Hamateur Night', 1939, 'Animation', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tex Avery, Sara Berner, Phil Kramer', null, 'It''s amateur night at the local theatre, and a procession of bad acts comes and goes: various musicians, a magician, and some actors. But they keep getting interrupted by Egghead singing "She''ll Be Comin'' ''Round the Mountain".', 'It''s amateur night at the local theatre, and a procession of bad acts comes and goes: various musicians, a magician, and some actors. But they keep getting interrupted by Egghead singing "She''ll Be Comin'' ''Round the Mountain".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztZoHr77mF0i361Mpy6qIbfMzBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236211'),
  ('76253433888239313', 'Hambre', 2023, 'Drama', 'Esra Laske, Jennifer Mallmann, Jakob Sinsel', 'Julia Mirjam Cantuária', 'Pauline Fusban, Beniamino Brogi, Alina Vimbai Strähler, Rana Farahani', null, 'Leni and Paul are „all good!“, as Paul likes to emphasise. But on this evening even he realises that this is not true at all. Their new neighbours, Mariam and Ayla, who come over for dinner embody exactly what Leni and Paul have not been for one another as a couple for years. While finishing up dessert, the relationship of the perfect couple, centered on their fluffy dog Amor, unfolds.', 'Leni and Paul are „all good!“, as Paul likes to emphasise. But on this evening even he realises that this is not true at all. Their new neighbours, Mariam and Ayla, who come over for dinner embody exactly what Leni and Paul have not been for one another as a couple for years. While finishing up dessert, the relationship of the perfect couple, centered on their fluffy dog Amor, unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCvHEU3mioUf51DngTBG05JHNYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110859'),
  ('727867232724799057', 'Hamburger Gitter', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Marco Heinig, Steffen Maurer', null, null, null, 'A city seems traumatized. Even a year after the G20 summit, the police are still looking for hundreds of suspects. 17 interviewees from the police, media, science, stock in this film.', 'A city seems traumatized. Even a year after the G20 summit, the police are still looking for hundreds of suspects. 17 interviewees from the police, media, science, stock in this film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGe4RMqecpDonFSaVhmgWukhD0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531956'),
  ('83802638445876187', 'Hamburger Hill', 1987, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Peter MacDonald, John Irvin', 'James Carabatsos', 'Dylan McDermott, Steven Weber, Tim Quill, Michael Boatman, Anthony Barrile, Don Cheadle, Courtney B. Vance, Tommy Swerdlow', 'R', 'The men of Bravo Company are facing a battle that''s all uphill… up Hamburger Hill. Fourteen war-weary soldiers are battling for a mud-covered mound of earth so named because it chews up soldiers like chopped meat. They are fighting for their country, their fellow soldiers and their lives. War is hell, but this is worse. Hamburger Hill tells it the way it was, the way it really was. It''s a raw, gritty and totally unrelenting dramatic depiction of one of the fiercest battles of America''s bloodiest war. This happened. Hamburger Hill - war at its worst, men at their best.', 'The men of Bravo Company are facing a battle that''s all uphill… up Hamburger Hill. Fourteen war-weary soldiers are battling for a mud-covered mound of earth so named because it chews up soldiers like chopped meat. They are fighting for their country, their fellow soldiers and their lives. War is hell, but this is worse. Hamburger Hill tells it the way it was, the way it really was. It''s a raw, gritty and totally unrelenting dramatic depiction of one of the fiercest battles of America''s bloodiest war. This happened. Hamburger Hill - war at its worst, men at their best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a84FDoIm64qcyKq6BEMB9Ycldpt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10652'),
  ('1127333947263653399', 'Hamburger: The Motion Picture', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Mary Ellen Woods, Gregory Goodman, Katie Carmichael', 'Donald Ross', 'Leigh McCloskey, Dick Butkus, Randi Brooks, Jack Blessing, Charles Tyner, Debra Blee, Sandy Hackett, John William Young', 'R', 'Russell has been expelled from several schools for lewd, crude and nude conduct. Busterburger University is his last chance at education and satisfying his disappointed parents.', 'Russell has been expelled from several schools for lewd, crude and nude conduct. Busterburger University is his last chance at education and satisfying his disappointed parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phvXzZDieOOp0eOXBdHBIfqLb8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52117'),
  ('646048011895785033', 'Hamfat Asar', 1965, 'Animation', 'Lawrence Jordan', null, null, null, '"The strangeness of this film is laced with carefully moulded apocalypses as the filmmaker explores a vision of life beyond death – the Elysian fields of Homer, Dante’s Purgatorio, de Chirico’s stitched plain. A moving single picture. Evolving the structure or script for the film involved a process of controlled hallucination, whereby I sat quietly without moving, looking at the background until the pieces began to move without my inventing things for them to do. I found that, given the chance, they really did have important business to attend to, and my job was to furnish them with the power of motion. I never deviated from this plan." —Canyon Cinema', '"The strangeness of this film is laced with carefully moulded apocalypses as the filmmaker explores a vision of life beyond death – the Elysian fields of Homer, Dante’s Purgatorio, de Chirico’s stitched plain. A moving single picture. Evolving the structure or script for the film involved a process of controlled hallucination, whereby I sat quietly without moving, looking at the background until the pieces began to move without my inventing things for them to do. I found that, given the chance, they really did have important business to attend to, and my job was to furnish them with the power of motion. I never deviated from this plan." —Canyon Cinema', null, 'tmdb:movie:209680'),
  ('794192803620972595', 'Hamid', 2019, 'Drama', 'Aijaz Khan', 'Ravinder Radhva', 'Talha Arshad Reshi, Vikas Kumar, Rasika Dugal, Sumit Kaul, Bashir Lone, Gurveer Singh, Ashraf Nagoo, Qazi Faiz', null, 'Eight year-old Hamid learns that 786 is God''s number and decides to try and reach out to God, by dialing this number. He wants to talk to his father, who his mother tells him has gone to Allah. One fine day the phone call is answered.', 'Eight year-old Hamid learns that 786 is God''s number and decides to try and reach out to God, by dialing this number. He wants to talk to his father, who his mother tells him has gone to Allah. One fine day the phone call is answered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35QHuEC4cUP1R7O0XtPIfRPF4mz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559673'),
  ('890031345304600777', 'Hamilton', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Harald Zwart, Ahmed Abounouom', 'William Aldridge, Jonas Cornell', 'Peter Stormare, Lena Olin, Mark Hamill, Mats Långbacka, Terry Carter, Evgeniy Lazarev, Zakia Tahiri, Christer Söderlund', null, 'A government agent leads his team''s effort to stop Russian rebels from smuggling a stolen missile through Sweden.', 'A government agent leads his team''s effort to stop Russian rebels from smuggling a stolen missile through Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fMWOuqom2z7h73LKaGAqdwa3Lg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17629'),
  ('748677328458728168', 'Hamilton', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'Tom Gaito, Robin Mishkin Abrams, Thomas Kail', 'Lin-Manuel Miranda', 'Lin-Manuel Miranda, Leslie Odom Jr., Renée Elise Goldsberry, Phillipa Soo, Daveed Diggs, Christopher Jackson, Jasmine Cephas Jones, Okieriete Onaodowan', 'PG-13', 'Presenting the tale of American founding father Alexander Hamilton, this filmed version of the original Broadway smash hit is the story of America then, told by America now.', 'Presenting the tale of American founding father Alexander Hamilton, this filmed version of the original Broadway smash hit is the story of America then, told by America now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1B7tW0t399VDjAcWJh8m87469b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556574'),
  ('110362206578506482', 'Hamilton 2: But Not If It Concerns Your Daughter', 2012, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tobias Falk, Niklas Siöström, Pontus Klänge', 'Stefan Thunberg', 'Mikael Persbrandt, Steven Waddington, Saba Mubarak, Frida Hallgren, Reuben Sallmander, Nadja Christiansson, Lennart Hjulström, Peter Eggers', null, 'Swedish intelligence officer Carl Hamilton''s 7-year-old goddaughter Nathalie is kidnapped. When the kidnapping''s underlying motive becomes known, the Swedish authorities assume a passive role, forcing Hamilton to action. With the help of international contacts, Hamilton manages to get them on track. Hamilton, along with some military colleagues, plans a daring rescue mission.', 'Swedish intelligence officer Carl Hamilton''s 7-year-old goddaughter Nathalie is kidnapped. When the kidnapping''s underlying motive becomes known, the Swedish authorities assume a passive role, forcing Hamilton to action. With the help of international contacts, Hamilton manages to get them on track. Hamilton, along with some military colleagues, plans a daring rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scJMZBuy8dGBukYDbPLVVzS66X7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147655'),
  ('899128356502882459', 'Hamilton: In the Interest of the Nation', 2012, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Kathrine Windfeld, Jonas Alarik, Malou Schultzberg', 'Stefan Thunberg', 'Mikael Persbrandt, Saba Mubarak, Jason Flemyng, Pernilla August, Gustaf Hammarsten, Ray Fearon, David Dencik, Liv Mjönes', null, 'Carl Hamilton manages to infiltrate an international gang that has stolen advanced Swedish GPS-guided missiles. But the league is subjected to a sudden deadly attack by a well drilled group of mercenaries of unknown clients. Hamilton escapes the massacre, but the rockets have disappeared without a trace.', 'Carl Hamilton manages to infiltrate an international gang that has stolen advanced Swedish GPS-guided missiles. But the league is subjected to a sudden deadly attack by a well drilled group of mercenaries of unknown clients. Hamilton escapes the massacre, but the rockets have disappeared without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlV09Qmr7NKnObi6COPXn13T1Og.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82450'),
  ('10059279540044148', 'Hamlet', 1921, 'Drama', 'Svend Gade, Heinz Schall, Curt Courant', 'Erwin Gepard', 'Asta Nielsen, Heinz Stieda, Eduard von Winterstein, Paul Conradi, Mathilde Brandt, Hans Junkermann, Anton De Verdier, Lilly Jacobson', null, 'A free adaptation of Shakespeare′s drama. The Danish queen masquerades her daughter as a boy, and thus, the girl lives her life as ''Prince'' Hamlet. Her father poisoned by a venomous snake placed by the treacherous Claudius, Hamlet fakes madness to investigate without suspicion.', 'A free adaptation of Shakespeare′s drama. The Danish queen masquerades her daughter as a boy, and thus, the girl lives her life as ''Prince'' Hamlet. Her father poisoned by a venomous snake placed by the treacherous Claudius, Hamlet fakes madness to investigate without suspicion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPX08Mtpk1mtYXNUhMUBUP9v5lh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175341'),
  ('433005097197621837', 'Hamlet', 1948, 'Drama', 'Laurence Olivier, Desmond Dickinson, Peter Bolton', 'Laurence Olivier', 'Laurence Olivier, Basil Sydney, Eileen Herlie, Norman Wooland, Felix Aylmer, Jean Simmons, Terence Morgan, Peter Cushing', 'NR', 'Winner of four Academy Awards, including Best Picture and Best Actor, Sir Laurence Olivier’s Hamlet continues to be the most compelling version of Shakespeare’s beloved tragedy. Olivier is at his most inspired—both as director and as the melancholy Dane himself—as he breathes new life into the words of one of the world’s greatest dramatists.', 'Winner of four Academy Awards, including Best Picture and Best Actor, Sir Laurence Olivier’s Hamlet continues to be the most compelling version of Shakespeare’s beloved tragedy. Olivier is at his most inspired—both as director and as the melancholy Dane himself—as he breathes new life into the words of one of the world’s greatest dramatists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woO9SgU2vTRMZeG0YqOLeoIqlzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23383'),
  ('202632351458209081', 'Hamlet', 1964, 'Drama', 'Grigori Kozintsev, Jonas Gricius, Valentina Kuznetsova', 'Grigori Kozintsev, Boris Pasternak', 'Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Anastasiya Vertinskaya, Mikhail Nazvanov, Elza Radziņa, Yuriy Tolubeev, Igor Dmitriev, Vadim Medvedev, Vladimir Erenberg', null, 'Shakespeare''s 17th century masterpiece about the "Melancholy Dane" was given one of its best screen treatments by Soviet director Grigori Kozintsev. Kozintsev''s Elsinore was a real castle in Estonia, utilized metaphorically as the "stone prison" of the mind wherein Hamlet must confine himself in order to avenge his father''s death. Hamlet himself is portrayed (by Innokenti Smoktunovsky) as the sole sensitive intellectual in a world made up of debauchers and revellers. Several of Kozintsev directorial choices seem deliberately calculated to inflame the purists: Hamlet''s delivers his "To be or not to be" soliloquy with his back to the camera, allowing the audience to fill in its own interpretations.', 'Shakespeare''s 17th century masterpiece about the "Melancholy Dane" was given one of its best screen treatments by Soviet director Grigori Kozintsev. Kozintsev''s Elsinore was a real castle in Estonia, utilized metaphorically as the "stone prison" of the mind wherein Hamlet must confine himself in order to avenge his father''s death. Hamlet himself is portrayed (by Innokenti Smoktunovsky) as the sole sensitive intellectual in a world made up of debauchers and revellers. Several of Kozintsev directorial choices seem deliberately calculated to inflame the purists: Hamlet''s delivers his "To be or not to be" soliloquy with his back to the camera, allowing the audience to fill in its own interpretations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bM7VeWSydVMysUBA77rkNdQ3Icg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71317'),
  ('647267471100223182', 'Hamlet', 1969, 'Drama', 'Tony Richardson, Gerry Fisher', 'Tony Richardson', 'Nicol Williamson, Anthony Hopkins, Judy Parfitt, Marianne Faithfull, Mark Dignam, Gordon Jackson, Ben Aris, Clive Graham', null, 'Tony Richardson''s Hamlet is based on his own stage production. Filmed entirely within the Roundhouse in London (a disused train shed), it is shot almost entirely in close up, focusing the attention on faces and language rather than action.', 'Tony Richardson''s Hamlet is based on his own stage production. Filmed entirely within the Roundhouse in London (a disused train shed), it is shot almost entirely in close up, focusing the attention on faces and language rather than action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfH3D57JkXewQ6rxVtEGJ7vhsFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42605'),
  ('181933598238032472', 'Hamlet', 1980, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rodney Bennett', null, 'Derek Jacobi, Claire Bloom, Patrick Stewart, Eric Porter, Lalla Ward, David Robb, Robert Swann, Patrick Allen', null, 'Hamlet comes home from university to find his uncle married to his mother, and his father''s ghost haunting the battlements and scaring the watch. Then his father''s ghost directs him to seek revenge.', 'Hamlet comes home from university to find his uncle married to his mother, and his father''s ghost haunting the battlements and scaring the watch. Then his father''s ghost directs him to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0KNG2cmDQBkfUGPGEAPpczJceA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106848'),
  ('401784459207950059', 'Hamlet', 1990, 'Drama, History', 'Franco Zeffirelli, David Watkin, Michael Lamont', 'Christopher De Vore, Franco Zeffirelli', 'Mel Gibson, Glenn Close, Alan Bates, Paul Scofield, Ian Holm, Helena Bonham Carter, Stephen Dillane, Nathaniel Parker', 'PG', 'Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, finds out that his uncle Claudius killed his father to obtain the throne, and plans revenge.', 'Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, finds out that his uncle Claudius killed his father to obtain the throne, and plans revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cB5HbaiFoQLLmGeN2eeJjBGrp8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10264'),
  ('46110117648749757', 'Hamlet', 1996, 'Drama', 'Alex Thomson, Kenneth Branagh, Sara Desmond', null, 'Kenneth Branagh, Derek Jacobi, Kate Winslet, Julie Christie, Richard Briers, Nicholas Farrell, Rufus Sewell, Reece Dinsdale', 'PG-13', 'Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, returns home to find his father murdered and his mother now marrying the murderer... his uncle. Meanwhile, war is brewing.', 'Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, returns home to find his father murdered and his mother now marrying the murderer... his uncle. Meanwhile, war is brewing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilurgUOp6SCl4cuhfjctj1qxlfZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10549'),
  ('986241884277308305', 'Hamlet', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John de Borman, Michael Almereyda', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Ethan Hawke, Kyle MacLachlan, Diane Venora, Sam Shepard, Bill Murray, Liev Schreiber, Julia Stiles, Karl Geary', 'R', 'Modern day adaptation of Shakespeare''s immortal story about Hamlet''s plight to avenge his father''s murder in New York City.', 'Modern day adaptation of Shakespeare''s immortal story about Hamlet''s plight to avenge his father''s murder in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yL1rYMHlqZtZVESxEWLsaneXq86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10688'),
  ('905194631279124210', 'Hamlet', 2009, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gregory Doran, Chris Seager', null, 'David Tennant, Patrick Stewart, Penny Downie, Oliver Ford Davies, Mariah Gale, Edward Bennett, Peter de Jersey, Sam Alexander', 'PG', 'David Tennant stars in a film of the Royal Shakespeare Company''s award-winning production of Shakespeare''s great play. Director Gregory Doran''s modern-dress production was hailed by the critics as thrilling, fast-moving and, in parts, very funny.', 'David Tennant stars in a film of the Royal Shakespeare Company''s award-winning production of Shakespeare''s great play. Director Gregory Doran''s modern-dress production was hailed by the critics as thrilling, fast-moving and, in parts, very funny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykluFIkzQocbsZO1F4au8HV8naQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28238'),
  ('449069189717266794', 'Hamlet', 2026, 'Drama', 'Robert Hastie', 'William Shakespeare', 'Hiran Abeysekera, Alistair Petrie, Geoffrey Streatfeild, Ayesha Dharker, Francesca Mills', null, 'Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare’s famous tragedy. Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question–you know the one. National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (Standing at the Sky’s Edge, Operation Mincemeat) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.', 'Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare’s famous tragedy. Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question–you know the one. National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (Standing at the Sky’s Edge, Operation Mincemeat) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FdBjvFG5F4CZlu6fbUkD0qV0hxPj.jpg', 'plex:movie:hamlet-2026'),
  ('332585229106292513', 'Hamlet 2', 2008, 'Comedy, Music', 'Andrew Fleming, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Andrew Fleming, Pam Brady', 'Steve Coogan, Catherine Keener, J. J. Soria, Skylar Astin, Phoebe Strole, Melonie Díaz, Arnie Pantoja, Michael Esparza', 'R', 'Failed actor-turned-worse-high-school-drama-teacher Dana Marschz rallies his Tucson students as he conceives and stages a politically incorrect musical sequel to Shakespeare''s Hamlet.', 'Failed actor-turned-worse-high-school-drama-teacher Dana Marschz rallies his Tucson students as he conceives and stages a politically incorrect musical sequel to Shakespeare''s Hamlet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljdmxGNwhuWZBsCgANlZrruFkJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12621'),
  ('190547424425379666', 'Hamlet Goes Business', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Pauli Pentti', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Pirkka-Pekka Petelius, Esko Salminen, Kati Outinen, Elina Salo, Esko Nikkari, Kari Väänänen, Puntti Valtonen, Mari Rantasila', null, 'When Hamlet discovers his father’s deceased body, he finds himself pulled into a power struggle as his scheming uncle attempts to secure a monopoly on the Scandinavian rubber duck industry. Will Hamlet avenge his father? Will he become the king of rubber ducks? Does any of it really matter?', 'When Hamlet discovers his father’s deceased body, he finds himself pulled into a power struggle as his scheming uncle attempts to secure a monopoly on the Scandinavian rubber duck industry. Will Hamlet avenge his father? Will he become the king of rubber ducks? Does any of it really matter?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OjVh44NDV3m8ePTt2BXMWTzlH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8749'),
  ('469250986566808583', 'Hamlet, Prince of Denmark', 1961, 'Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Franz Peter Wirth, Frank Guthke, Kurt Gewissen', null, 'Maximilian Schell, Hans Caninenberg, Wanda Rotha, Dunja Movar, Franz Schafheitlin, Dieter Kirchlechner, Karl Michael Vogler, Eckart Dux', null, 'Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, returns home to find his father murdered and his mother remarrying the murderer, his uncle.', 'Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, returns home to find his father murdered and his mother remarrying the murderer, his uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xze6f2H7tuvyjD1tu09ryV2ZeJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48209'),
  ('916540837678746612', 'Hammaam in Amsterdam', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ali Idris, Ahmed Samir Farag, Moustafa Ezz El Din', 'Medhat El Adl', 'Mohamed Henedi, Ahmed Al Saqqa, Monalisa, Mahmoud El-Bezzawy, Ahmed Eid, Tarek Abdelaziz, Hani Ramzy, Rehab El Gamal', null, 'Hammaam lives with his big family in a crowded Egyptian alley. As he is jobless, he loses his girl to a rich suitor. He then decides to leave for Amsterdam where his uncle has immigrated long ago. As soon as he arrives he loses his money and passport and gets assaulted in an inn. Adriano the young Egyptian emigrant saves his neck and helps him find his uncle who dumps him. Hence, Hammaam stays with a group of young Arabs. After his tiring journey between failure and success he falls in love with a young lady who helps him fulfill his dream of buying a certain famous restaurant. As his business flourishes, he returns home to visit his family proud of his success.', 'Hammaam lives with his big family in a crowded Egyptian alley. As he is jobless, he loses his girl to a rich suitor. He then decides to leave for Amsterdam where his uncle has immigrated long ago. As soon as he arrives he loses his money and passport and gets assaulted in an inn. Adriano the young Egyptian emigrant saves his neck and helps him find his uncle who dumps him. Hence, Hammaam stays with a group of young Arabs. After his tiring journey between failure and success he falls in love with a young lady who helps him fulfill his dream of buying a certain famous restaurant. As his business flourishes, he returns home to visit his family proud of his success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dguERfqKOPe8zAyxYDNuma5ECZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193440'),
  ('1059764357173102539', 'Hammamet', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Edoardo Petti, Luca Federico, Elena Casnati', 'Gianni Amelio, Alberto Taraglio', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Livia Rossi, Luca Filippi, Silvia Cohen, Alberto Paradossi, Federico Bergamaschi, Roberto De Francesco, Adolfo Margiotta', null, 'The last years of Bettino Craxi, one of the most important and controversial italian leader of the 1980''s.', 'The last years of Bettino Craxi, one of the most important and controversial italian leader of the 1980''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6uLqpGkxBfmdS1qZLWukgmysOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590869'),
  ('843625556634207864', 'Hammarskjöld: Fight for Peace', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Per Fly, John Christian Rosenlund', 'Per Fly, Ulf Ryberg', 'Mikael Persbrandt, Francis Chouler, Cian Barry, Colin Salmon, Sara Soulié, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, Thure Lindhardt, Richard Brake', 'PG-13', 'Set in Cold War in 1961, follows the story of diplomat and economist Dag Hammarskjöld, who boards a plane in a desperate attempt to negotiate a ceasefire from his enemies after he leads UN troops into their first wartime operation.', 'Set in Cold War in 1961, follows the story of diplomat and economist Dag Hammarskjöld, who boards a plane in a desperate attempt to negotiate a ceasefire from his enemies after he leads UN troops into their first wartime operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/948vMAdG66PHRs4PoclPDkixWsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084145'),
  ('1132200837987299383', 'Hammer', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Bruce D. Clark, Robert Steadman, Byron Roberts', 'Charles Eric Johnson', 'Fred Williamson, Vonetta McGee, William Smith, Bernie Hamilton, D''Urville Martin, Stack Pierce, Leon Isaac Kennedy, Mel Stewart', 'R', 'Hotheaded laborer B.J. Hammer can''t go long without ending up in a fight, and, after he comes out on top in a particularly impressive workplace scuffle, word of his brawling skills makes its way to Davis, a top boxing manager. Hammer is hired by Davis and begins a lucrative career in the ring, only to find out that his new employer wants him to throw a fight and take part in other illicit activities. Hammer reacts to this news violently, and the feud is on.', 'Hotheaded laborer B.J. Hammer can''t go long without ending up in a fight, and, after he comes out on top in a particularly impressive workplace scuffle, word of his brawling skills makes its way to Davis, a top boxing manager. Hammer is hired by Davis and begins a lucrative career in the ring, only to find out that his new employer wants him to throw a fight and take part in other illicit activities. Hammer reacts to this news violently, and the feud is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p95gYg9r7FqVlMMWSCu4xRhlVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90728'),
  ('675887883737830570', 'Hammer', 2016, 'Action, Drama', 'Sergey Machilsky, Nurbek Egen, Maxim Osadchy-Korytkovsky', 'Oleg Malovichko', 'Aleksey Chadov, Oksana Akinshina, Anton Shagin, Sergey Chirkov, Igor Sklyar, Nikita Panfilov, Dmitriy Penkov, Melvin Manhoef', null, 'Victor aka Hammer is an MMA champion with the world title fight ahead. After running into the mobster Shark Hammer gets injured but is still determined to win. Victor doesn''t know Shark will stick at nothing to make Victor lose.', 'Victor aka Hammer is an MMA champion with the world title fight ahead. After running into the mobster Shark Hammer gets injured but is still determined to win. Victor doesn''t know Shark will stick at nothing to make Victor lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZwDSEbsaqUN7boVA8txeruh71E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423360'),
  ('356330648063922434', 'Hammer and Sickle', 1994, 'Drama', 'Sergey Machilsky, Sergey Livnev, Leonid Veytkov', 'Vladimir Valutskiy, Sergey Livnev', 'Aleksey Serebryakov, Evdokiya Germanova, Alla Kliouka, Vladimir Steklov, Vera Voronkova, Marina Kaidalova, Avangard Leontyev, Nodar Mgaloblishvili', null, 'A bizarre tale of a fictional experiment performed during the Stalin-controlled years in the USSR. The main character is changed from a woman into a man. This is part of a larger plan to change more women into men and have a stronger workforce.', 'A bizarre tale of a fictional experiment performed during the Stalin-controlled years in the USSR. The main character is changed from a woman into a man. This is part of a larger plan to change more women into men and have a stronger workforce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zv8pmvcLOobtNXfs16IHots1vYj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340653'),
  ('1030985701562735937', 'Hammer of the Gods', 2013, 'History, Action, Adventure', 'Farren Blackburn, Jed Evans, Richard Usher', 'Matthew Read', 'Charlie Bewley, Clive Standen, James Cosmo, Elliot Cowan, Ivan Kaye, Michael Jibson, Guy Flanagan, Theo Barklem-Biggs', 'R', 'Action epic sees a passionate young man transform into a brutal warrior as he travels the unforgiving landscape in search of his long lost brother Hakan The Ferrocious, whose people are relying on him to restore order to their kingdom.', 'Action epic sees a passionate young man transform into a brutal warrior as he travels the unforgiving landscape in search of his long lost brother Hakan The Ferrocious, whose people are relying on him to restore order to their kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qfATvarIf0xlbE9WJRnXP1P37R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192538'),
  ('505353378689830579', 'Hammerhead', 1968, 'Thriller', 'David Miller, Kenneth Talbot, Wilkie Cooper', 'William Bast, Herbert Baker', 'Vince Edwards, Judy Geeson, Peter Vaughan, Diana Dors, Michael Bates, Beverly Adams, Patrick Cargill, Patrick Holt', null, 'An American agent has tracked down the stronghold of an evil criminal mastermind, determined to take over the world (what, another one ?).', 'An American agent has tracked down the stronghold of an evil criminal mastermind, determined to take over the world (what, another one ?).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y7BlOiakjMxnIITvXxEDrfr0LX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139338'),
  ('980144510442818424', 'Hammerhead', 2005, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Emil Topuzov, Michael Oblowitz, Ronaldo Nacionales', 'Howard Zemski, Monty Featherstone', 'William Forsythe, Hunter Tylo, Lydie Denier, Elise Muller, Jeffrey Combs, Arthur Roberts, Yoana Bukovska-Davidova, G.R. Johnson', 'R', 'When he began fusing human and shark DNA, his colleagues laughed at him. Now his creation is taking his revenge, and they aren''t laughing anymore.', 'When he began fusing human and shark DNA, his colleagues laughed at him. Now his creation is taking his revenge, and they aren''t laughing anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5p2wodybxYlhNFYDnr7Up6cb8oB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48333'),
  ('600550136012051497', 'Hammers Over the Anvil', 1994, 'Romance, Drama', 'Monica Pearce, Geoffrey Giuffre, Chris Webb', 'Ann Turner, Peter Hepworth', 'Russell Crowe, Charlotte Rampling, Alexander Outhread, Frankie J. Holden, Jake Frost, Alethea McGrath, John Rafter Lee, Frank Gallacher', null, 'Set in the summer of 1910 in Australia the film follows the story of 14 year old Alan Marshall (Alexander Outhread) as he stumbles out of childhood towards the exciting yet forbidding world of adulthood. For Alan, despite the effects of polio, there is only one passion in life - to become a great horseman just like his hero, the reclusive horse trainer East Driscoll (Russell Crowe). Alan is one of East''s few friends and also one of the few who knows about the affair between East and the aristocratic English woman Grace McAlister (Charlotte Rampling). Things inevitably take a turn towards the tragic when East becomes determined to force Grace to leave her husband and run away with him. Hammers Over The Anvil is an evocative coming of age film from Australian director Ann Turner.', 'Set in the summer of 1910 in Australia the film follows the story of 14 year old Alan Marshall (Alexander Outhread) as he stumbles out of childhood towards the exciting yet forbidding world of adulthood. For Alan, despite the effects of polio, there is only one passion in life - to become a great horseman just like his hero, the reclusive horse trainer East Driscoll (Russell Crowe). Alan is one of East''s few friends and also one of the few who knows about the affair between East and the aristocratic English woman Grace McAlister (Charlotte Rampling). Things inevitably take a turn towards the tragic when East becomes determined to force Grace to leave her husband and run away with him. Hammers Over The Anvil is an evocative coming of age film from Australian director Ann Turner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJ31JmgkiTGc1xFnW9vRfTJjOId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152408'),
  ('655996145439179508', 'Hammett', 1982, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Wim Wenders, Joseph F. Biroc, Ronald Colby', 'Dennis O''Flaherty, Ross Thomas', 'Frederic Forrest, Peter Boyle, Marilu Henner, Roy Kinnear, Lydia Lei, Elisha Cook Jr., David Patrick Kelly, R.G. Armstrong', 'PG', 'Chinatown, San Francisco, 1928. Former private detective Dashiell Hammett, a compulsive drinker with tuberculosis who writes pulp fiction for a living, receives an unexpected visit from an old friend asking for help.', 'Chinatown, San Francisco, 1928. Former private detective Dashiell Hammett, a compulsive drinker with tuberculosis who writes pulp fiction for a living, receives an unexpected visit from an old friend asking for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssaXsTAhAYklEmhhjsMZfeyPCuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28307'),
  ('342945497367340964', 'Hammy''s Boomerang Adventure', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Will Finn', null, 'Bruce Willis, Garry Shandling, Steve Carell, Wanda Sykes, Sami Kirkpatrick, Shane Baumel, Madison Davenport', 'G', 'RJ the raccoon produces a nature video, which turns out to be an excuse for him and the porcupine children to play pranks on Hammy the squirrel.', 'RJ the raccoon produces a nature video, which turns out to be an excuse for him and the porcupine children to play pranks on Hammy the squirrel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2sdbeH3Jp087Au7Ls3UrF3DAnH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85693'),
  ('513524082554590723', 'Hamnet', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Chloé Zhao, Łukasz Żal, Marc A. Wilson', 'Chloé Zhao, Maggie O''Farrell', 'Jessie Buckley, Paul Mescal, Emily Watson, Joe Alwyn, Jacobi Jupe, Noah Jupe, Olivia Lynes, Justine Mitchell', 'PG-13', 'The powerful story of love and loss that inspired the creation of Shakespeare''s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.', 'The powerful story of love and loss that inspired the creation of Shakespeare''s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbeyOZm2bvBXcbgPD3v6o94epPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858024'),
  ('952029926218456335', 'Hamoon', 1990, 'Drama', 'Dariush Mehrjui, Turaj Mansuri', 'Dariush Mehrjui', 'Khosro Shakibai, Bita Farrahi, Ezzatollah Entezami, Sedigheh Kianfar, Turan Mehrzad, Fathali Oveisi, Jalal Moghadam, Amrollah Saberi', null, 'Hamoon''s wife is leaving him. He is also unsuccessfully trying to finish his Ph.D. thesis. He is forced to reexamine his life. In a series of flashbacks and dreams, Hamoon tries to figure out what he did wrong.', 'Hamoon''s wife is leaving him. He is also unsuccessfully trying to finish his Ph.D. thesis. He is forced to reexamine his life. In a series of flashbacks and dreams, Hamoon tries to figure out what he did wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgPMr5r1bwl2T40kKCnh4orHhOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43761'),
  ('570869425580784800', 'Hampstead', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joel Hopkins, Felix Wiedemann', 'Robert Festinger', 'Diane Keaton, Brendan Gleeson, James Norton, Lesley Manville, Jason Watkins, Simon Callow, Alistair Petrie, Phil Davis', 'PG-13', 'Emily Walters is an American widow living a peaceful, uneventful existence in the idyllic Hampstead Village of London, when she meets local recluse, Donald Horner. For 17 years, Donald has lived—wildly yet peacefully—in a ramshackle hut near the edge of the forest. When Emily learns his home is the target of developers who will stop at nothing to remove him, saving Donald and his property becomes her personal mission. Despite his gruff exterior and polite refusals for help, Emily is drawn to him—as he is to her—and what begins as a charitable cause evolves into a relationship that will grow even as the bulldozers close in.', 'Emily Walters is an American widow living a peaceful, uneventful existence in the idyllic Hampstead Village of London, when she meets local recluse, Donald Horner. For 17 years, Donald has lived—wildly yet peacefully—in a ramshackle hut near the edge of the forest. When Emily learns his home is the target of developers who will stop at nothing to remove him, saving Donald and his property becomes her personal mission. Despite his gruff exterior and polite refusals for help, Emily is drawn to him—as he is to her—and what begins as a charitable cause evolves into a relationship that will grow even as the bulldozers close in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svyFdV8QrOyheU2lEDuBnrcCQT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441728'),
  ('365158450318780261', 'Hamster PSA', 1997, 'Comedy', 'James Gunn', 'James Gunn', 'Stephanie Stokes, Lloyd Kaufman, Joseph Anthony', null, 'Public Service Announcement meant only for mother hamsters, warning them against eating their progeny due to the harmful effects it has on the human children who love them. We see one young child, Billy, who commits suicide after he witnesses the gory tragedy of his hamster, Princess, eating her babies. Narrated by an artificially well-endowed Tromette in a bikini, Schiza Frenia.', 'Public Service Announcement meant only for mother hamsters, warning them against eating their progeny due to the harmful effects it has on the human children who love them. We see one young child, Billy, who commits suicide after he witnesses the gory tragedy of his hamster, Princess, eating her babies. Narrated by an artificially well-endowed Tromette in a bikini, Schiza Frenia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/963WzW4EAn99DvnF5VcJcE5LjRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899359'),
  ('849442589451165724', 'Hamsun', 1996, 'Drama', 'Jan Troell, Mischa Gavrjusjov, Jan Troell', 'Jan Troell', 'Max von Sydow, Ghita Nørby, Anette Hoff, Jesper Christensen, Edgar Selge, Ernst Jacobi, Bjørnar Teigen, Åsa Söderling', null, 'Knut Hamsun is Norway''s most famous and admired author. Ever since he was young he has hated the English for the starvation they caused Norway during WWI. When the Germans occupy Norway 9 April 1940 he welcomes them and the protection they can give from Great Britain. He supports the national socialist ideals, but opposes the way these ideals are turned into action - that Norwegians are jailed and executed. His wife Marie travels in Germany during the war as a sign of support from Knut and herself.', 'Knut Hamsun is Norway''s most famous and admired author. Ever since he was young he has hated the English for the starvation they caused Norway during WWI. When the Germans occupy Norway 9 April 1940 he welcomes them and the protection they can give from Great Britain. He supports the national socialist ideals, but opposes the way these ideals are turned into action - that Norwegians are jailed and executed. His wife Marie travels in Germany during the war as a sign of support from Knut and herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2BVh5iAzvDD52b2k2KlYfzvL5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79118'),
  ('977115013046581859', 'Han Gong-ju', 2014, 'Drama', 'Lee Su-jin, Hong Jae-sik', 'Lee Su-jin', 'Chun Woo-hee, Jung In-sun, Kim So-young, Lee Young-ran, Kwon Beom-taek, Jo Dae-hee, Kimchoi Yong-joon, Kim Hyun-joon', null, 'After being involved in a traumatic incident, 17-year-old Gong-ju is forced to change schools. Uncared for by her parents, her previous teacher arranges for her to hide away at his mother''s place. It takes time for her past to catch up with her, but when it does the revelation is devastating.', 'After being involved in a traumatic incident, 17-year-old Gong-ju is forced to change schools. Uncared for by her parents, her previous teacher arranges for her to hide away at his mother''s place. It takes time for her past to catch up with her, but when it does the revelation is devastating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LKjzV4NXV76pF3CuL5YXzZs6zR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229304'),
  ('336621839027455811', 'Han, hun, Dirch og Dario', 1962, 'Comedy, Family', 'Annelise Reenberg', 'Børge Müller', 'Ghita Nørby, Ebbe Langberg, Dirch Passer, Dario Campeotto, Bodil Steen, Hanne Borchsenius, Edouard Mielche, Gabriel Axel', null, 'Director Paul Borg (Ebbe Langberg) neglects his young, beautiful wife Marianne (Ghita Nørby). He even forget their wedding day, in favor of a new fast sports car, a beautiful silver-gray Jaguar. During his drive, he runs out of gas. A young lady Laura Lublinski (Hanne Borchsenius), helps him and he takes an innocent flirtation with her. When Marianne learns this, she moves home and dump into an artist community with Jenny (Bodil Steen), Ovengaden of water 52 in Christianshavn. Here she takes the unrepentant Don Juan, Mario (Dario Campeotto) and the guitar-playing Eigil (Dirch compatible).', 'Director Paul Borg (Ebbe Langberg) neglects his young, beautiful wife Marianne (Ghita Nørby). He even forget their wedding day, in favor of a new fast sports car, a beautiful silver-gray Jaguar. During his drive, he runs out of gas. A young lady Laura Lublinski (Hanne Borchsenius), helps him and he takes an innocent flirtation with her. When Marianne learns this, she moves home and dump into an artist community with Jenny (Bodil Steen), Ovengaden of water 52 in Christianshavn. Here she takes the unrepentant Don Juan, Mario (Dario Campeotto) and the guitar-playing Eigil (Dirch compatible).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZamJaYW4Pi0brW3nnMJGC2UxMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54619'),
  ('625417974182189276', 'Hana', 2006, 'Action, Drama, History, Comedy', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda, Yutaka Yamazaki', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Junichi Okada, Rie Miyazawa, Arata Furuta, Teruyuki Kagawa, Tomoko Tabata, Ryûhei Ueshima, Yuichi Kimura, Ryo Kase', null, 'In a poor district of Edo lives a young samurai named Soza. He has been sent by his clan to avenge the death of his father. He isn''t an accomplished swordsman however, and he prefers sharing the life of the residents, teaching the kids how to write etc. When he finally finds the man he is looking for, he will have to decide whether he follows the way of the samurai or chooses peace and reconciliation.', 'In a poor district of Edo lives a young samurai named Soza. He has been sent by his clan to avenge the death of his father. He isn''t an accomplished swordsman however, and he prefers sharing the life of the residents, teaching the kids how to write etc. When he finally finds the man he is looking for, he will have to decide whether he follows the way of the samurai or chooses peace and reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3Fu1z2BvdjBsD2byyN7g2vp3BF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20525'),
  ('515521839282365344', 'Hana & Alice', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Shunji Iwai, Noboru Shinoda', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Anne Suzuki, Yu Aoi, Kaku Tomohiro, Shoko Aida, Hiroshi Abe, Sei Hiraizumi, Tae Kimura, Takao Osawa', null, 'Two teenage best pals attracted to the same boy end up scrambling his life after he walks into a door and is knocked unconscious.', 'Two teenage best pals attracted to the same boy end up scrambling his life after he walks into a door and is knocked unconscious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkEn15Jm8Edl40ra0qRJny2MYTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27799'),
  ('42959436864944114', 'Hana Yori Dango: Final', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Toshiyasu Yamanaka, Yasuharu Ishii, Toshio Tsuboi', 'Takayuki Takuma', 'Mao Inoue, Jun Matsumoto, Shun Oguri, Shota Matsuda, Tsuyoshi Abe, Mariko Kaga, Nanako Matsushima, Natsuki Kato', null, 'Four years have passed since that emotional marriage proposal at Tsukushi Makino''s high-school prom, and Tsukasa Dōmyōji announced his engagement to Tsukushi to the entire world. At an engagement dinner between their families, Dōmyōji''s mother, who has been strongly against their relationship before, presents Tsukushi a tiara, which is estimated to be worth roughly 10 billion yen, as a token of their engagement. But that night, the tiara is stolen by somebody! Then, Dōmyōji and Tsukushi travel around the globe to Las Vegas, Hong Kong, and even a deserted island to get the tiara back—the legendary tiara that has been believed to "bring eternal love." In the meantime, where and what are the "F4" fellows, who have just gone separate ways, doing now?', 'Four years have passed since that emotional marriage proposal at Tsukushi Makino''s high-school prom, and Tsukasa Dōmyōji announced his engagement to Tsukushi to the entire world. At an engagement dinner between their families, Dōmyōji''s mother, who has been strongly against their relationship before, presents Tsukushi a tiara, which is estimated to be worth roughly 10 billion yen, as a token of their engagement. But that night, the tiara is stolen by somebody! Then, Dōmyōji and Tsukushi travel around the globe to Las Vegas, Hong Kong, and even a deserted island to get the tiara back—the legendary tiara that has been believed to "bring eternal love." In the meantime, where and what are the "F4" fellows, who have just gone separate ways, doing now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6Wekvq9Bxqf6NicZjnRe94tCRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32486'),
  ('94374115207462480', 'Hana''s Miso Soup', 2015, 'Drama, Family', 'Hiroyuki Yokoyama, Shinzo Katayama, Rokurō Terada', 'Tomoaki Akune', 'Hirosue Ryoko, Kenichi Takitoh, Kiwako Harada, Yo Hitoto, Mahiru Konno, Emina Akamatsu, Hitomi Harukaze, Haruhi Ryoga', null, 'Yasutake Shingo is a newspaper reporter whose only redeeming feature is his earnestness. He meets Matsunaga Chie, who attends a music college, and they start dating. Each day becomes all the more bright and enjoyable for Shingo because of the lively Chie. She loves to laugh, sing and eat. After one and a half years, Chie is employed as a music teacher. One day, Shingo is informed that Chie has breast cancer. After thinking about it, he decides to share a lifetime with her and proposes. His proposal gives her the courage to undergo surgery which she had been mulling over. One day, Chie starts to teach 5-year-old Hana the “important things in life” such as laundry, cleaning and cooking. She thinks that even if she is no longer around, her daughter and husband will be able to live.', 'Yasutake Shingo is a newspaper reporter whose only redeeming feature is his earnestness. He meets Matsunaga Chie, who attends a music college, and they start dating. Each day becomes all the more bright and enjoyable for Shingo because of the lively Chie. She loves to laugh, sing and eat. After one and a half years, Chie is employed as a music teacher. One day, Shingo is informed that Chie has breast cancer. After thinking about it, he decides to share a lifetime with her and proposes. His proposal gives her the courage to undergo surgery which she had been mulling over. One day, Chie starts to teach 5-year-old Hana the “important things in life” such as laundry, cleaning and cooking. She thinks that even if she is no longer around, her daughter and husband will be able to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whDs3ndBGLBn3LzIWE5twAgSj3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363117'),
  ('198733187114095809', 'Hanagatami', 2017, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Kujô Sanbongi, Yurugu Matsumoto', 'Chiho Katsura, Nobuhiko Obayashi', 'Shunsuke Kubozuka, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Keishi Nagatsuka, Tokio Emoto, Honoka Yahagi, Hirona Yamazaki, Mugi Kadowaki, Takako Tokiwa', null, 'Spring, 1941. Sixteen-year-old Toshihiko attends school in the coastal town of Karatsu, where his aunt cares for his ailing cousin. Immersed in the seaside''s nature and culture, Toshihiko soon befriends the town''s other extraordinary adolescents as they all contend with the war''s gravitational pull.', 'Spring, 1941. Sixteen-year-old Toshihiko attends school in the coastal town of Karatsu, where his aunt cares for his ailing cousin. Immersed in the seaside''s nature and culture, Toshihiko soon befriends the town''s other extraordinary adolescents as they all contend with the war''s gravitational pull.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk6q7uRWKHgHEnqQLttKy7Bqhee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483542'),
  ('290896180939045620', 'Hanappe Bazooka', 1992, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Fujio Oda, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Yoshisugu Ikegami', 'Fumio Nishikidera', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Kayoko Kawahara, Kenji Utsumi, Kikuko Inoue, Mayumi Terashima, Mina Tominaga, Tomomichi Nishimura, Yumi Takada', null, 'When trickster demons give him the power to seduce any woman he wants, a high school pervert accidentally puts his family, the girl of his dreams, and his very soul on the line.', 'When trickster demons give him the power to seduce any woman he wants, a high school pervert accidentally puts his family, the girl of his dreams, and his very soul on the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khXcoytHiJqfGS0gxvA8QGJNoKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212648'),
  ('345297383655719540', 'Hanasaku Iroha the Movie: Home Sweet Home', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Kanami Sekiguchi, Satoru Hirayanagi, Yoshimasa Yamazaki', 'Mari Okada', 'Kanae Itou, Aki Toyosaki, Ayumi Tsunematsu, Chiaki Omigawa, Haruka Tomatsu, Cho, Takako Honda, Tamie Kubota', 'PG-13', 'While sorting through a mess of books in the staff room, Ohana happens upon one of Denroku''s log books from long ago. Within it, it recounts a story of Ohana''s mom when she was the same age as her.', 'While sorting through a mess of books in the staff room, Ohana happens upon one of Denroku''s log books from long ago. Within it, it recounts a story of Ohana''s mom when she was the same age as her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5RxZfhMEloJdTB4wcsYiCAsUPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229756'),
  ('921277972352941512', 'Hanbando', 2006, 'Mystery, Thriller, History', 'Kang Woo-suk, Shin Hak-sung, Choi Yeong-taek', 'Kim Hee-jae, Lee Hyo-Chul', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Cha In-pyo, Ahn Sung-ki, Moon Sung-keun, Kang Shin-il, Kim Sang-joong, Kang Soo-youn, Baek Il-seob', null, 'The President of South Korea races against time to prove the seal on documents from long dead King Gojong is fake by charging outspoken historian Choi Min-jae, and a descendant of the royal bloodline Kim Yu-shik, to find the long lost seal in order to prove that the Japanese claim to railroads is false, a claim that will stop the reunification of the two Koreas.', 'The President of South Korea races against time to prove the seal on documents from long dead King Gojong is fake by charging outspoken historian Choi Min-jae, and a descendant of the royal bloodline Kim Yu-shik, to find the long lost seal in order to prove that the Japanese claim to railroads is false, a claim that will stop the reunification of the two Koreas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEswrtURzHQUCjzvKQi68VXLTSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32157'),
  ('873464518047073576', 'Hancock', 2008, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Peter Berg, Tobias A. Schliessler, David Sardi', 'Vincent Ngo, Vince Gilligan', 'Will Smith, Charlize Theron, Jason Bateman, Jae Head, Eddie Marsan, David Mattey, Maetrix Fitten, Thomas Lennon', 'PG-13', 'Hancock is a down-and-out superhero who''s forced to employ a PR expert to help repair his image when the public grows weary of all the damage he''s inflicted during his lifesaving heroics. The agent''s idea of imprisoning the antihero to make the world miss him proves successful, but will Hancock stick to his new sense of purpose or slip back into old habits?', 'Hancock is a down-and-out superhero who''s forced to employ a PR expert to help repair his image when the public grows weary of all the damage he''s inflicted during his lifesaving heroics. The agent''s idea of imprisoning the antihero to make the world miss him proves successful, but will Hancock stick to his new sense of purpose or slip back into old habits?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DyuV2G0hLEqHeueDfOqhZ2DVut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8960'),
  ('796398909080842204', 'Hand', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daigo Matsui, Fūta Takagi', 'Sorami Date', 'Akari Fukunaga, Daichi Kaneko, Natsuko Obuchi, Akio Kaneda, Kanji Tsuda, Kentaro Tamura, Sanae Miyata, Ichiro Mikami', null, 'Sawako enjoys taking photos of older men and making scrapbooks with them. Although the men she has dated have always been older than her, she has been unable to speak well with her father and they have grown apart.', 'Sawako enjoys taking photos of older men and making scrapbooks with them. Although the men she has dated have always been older than her, she has been unable to speak well with her father and they have grown apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHKJeKCJh2ZEOD4R9arYNCves7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994739'),
  ('570707165376311008', 'Hand Gun', 1994, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Whitney Ransick, Michael Spiller', 'Whitney Ransick', 'Treat Williams, Seymour Cassel, Anna Thomson, Paul Schulze, Zoë Lund, Frank Vincent, Michael Rapaport, Michael Imperioli', null, 'Jack is in the midst of a major robbery, which leaves him injured and his accomplices dead. Jack manages to hide the $500,000 from the robbery before he makes his way to his death bed.', 'Jack is in the midst of a major robbery, which leaves him injured and his accomplices dead. Jack manages to hide the $500,000 from the robbery before he makes his way to his death bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtxkXCVxCW8l2BI4RqpkFov8GD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291164'),
