  ('998739286913183526', 'Hands of the Ripper', 1971, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Sasdy, Kenneth Talbot, Ariel Levy', 'L.W. Davidson', 'Eric Porter, Angharad Rees, Jane Merrow, Keith Bell, Derek Godfrey, Dora Bryan, Marjorie Rhodes, Barry Lowe', 'R', 'A series of murders occur that mirror those committed by the Whitechapel Ripper. Through his experiments with psychoanalysis Dr Pritchard discovers a deadly violence in one of his young female patients. As he delves into the recesses of her mind he uncovers that Anna is possessed by her dead father''s spirit, willing her to commit acts of gruesome savagery over which she has no control. But the most chilling revelation of all is the identity of her father: Jack the Ripper himself.', 'A series of murders occur that mirror those committed by the Whitechapel Ripper. Through his experiments with psychoanalysis Dr Pritchard discovers a deadly violence in one of his young female patients. As he delves into the recesses of her mind he uncovers that Anna is possessed by her dead father''s spirit, willing her to commit acts of gruesome savagery over which she has no control. But the most chilling revelation of all is the identity of her father: Jack the Ripper himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9S0II7UwL6F7IzZl7Ea7WP710k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53045'),
  ('1103158005857484832', 'Hands Off Me!', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Gero Zambuto, Giacinto Solito, Otello Martelli', 'Guglielmo Giannini', 'Totò, Erzsi Paál, Franco Coop, Tina Pica, Oreste Bilancia, Miranda Bonansea, Luigi Erminio D''Olivo, Alfredo Martinelli', null, 'In his first feature, great Italian clown Totò plays a carefree tramp moving from job to job, in order to provide for himself and his young Shirley Temple-like protégée.', 'In his first feature, great Italian clown Totò plays a carefree tramp moving from job to job, in order to provide for himself and his young Shirley Temple-like protégée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8TZVpNVdJvAuHwZxG6ZFcN51XJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74414'),
  ('206051869357029032', 'Hands off Mississippi', 2007, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Detlev Buck', 'Maggie Peren, Cornelia Funke', 'Zoë Mannhardt, Katharina Thalbach, Karl Alexander Seidel, Christoph Maria Herbst, Margit Carstensen, Heidi Mahler, Heidi Kabel, Ingo Naujoks', null, 'Full of anticipation, ten-year-old Emma goes on vacation to her grandma Dolly in the country. Once there, however, the girl learns that old Klipperbusch has died - and his money-hungry nephew Albert is already in the process of converting the inherited estate for profit. And anything he can''t use for this is thrown out without further ado. At least Emma manages to save Klipperbusch''s beloved mare Mississippi from the slaughterhouse at the last minute: she persuades her grandmother to buy the horse from Albert. Emma is now a proud horse owner. She is all the more surprised when Albert turns up at her door one day and desperately wants Mississippi back. It''s clear to Emma and her friends that this guy can''t be up to no good...', 'Full of anticipation, ten-year-old Emma goes on vacation to her grandma Dolly in the country. Once there, however, the girl learns that old Klipperbusch has died - and his money-hungry nephew Albert is already in the process of converting the inherited estate for profit. And anything he can''t use for this is thrown out without further ado. At least Emma manages to save Klipperbusch''s beloved mare Mississippi from the slaughterhouse at the last minute: she persuades her grandmother to buy the horse from Albert. Emma is now a proud horse owner. She is all the more surprised when Albert turns up at her door one day and desperately wants Mississippi back. It''s clear to Emma and her friends that this guy can''t be up to no good...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiwicaq7pQhEf3bu9J8YkErCG6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52116'),
  ('530353898554613314', 'Hands on a Hardbody: The Documentary', 1997, 'Documentary', 'S.R. Bindler, Chapin Wilson, S.R. Bindler', null, 'Brent Baskin, David Grotheim, Benny Perkins, J.D. Drew, Norma Valverde, Angie Turner, Paul Prince, Ronald McCowan', 'PG', 'Filmmaker S.R. Bindler profiles Texas contestants trying to win a truck by keeping one hand on it longer than everyone else.', 'Filmmaker S.R. Bindler profiles Texas contestants trying to win a truck by keeping one hand on it longer than everyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snyLQ21YGNWHNcDSNUIouzBFObh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18603'),
  ('610641835074754775', 'Hands Over the City', 1963, 'Drama', 'Francesco Rosi, Gianni Di Venanzo, Marco Guarnaschelli', 'Enzo Forcella, Enzo Provenzale, Francesco Rosi', 'Rod Steiger, Salvo Randone, Guido Alberti, Marcello Cannavale, Dante Di Pinto, Alberto Conocchia, Carlo Fermariello, Terenzio Cordova', 'NR', 'Prior to a city council election, the collapse of a building leaves a land developer and his political backers defending themselves against a scandal.', 'Prior to a city council election, the collapse of a building leaves a land developer and his political backers defending themselves against a scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zR9uj0dtm5osrrpM7zwO5ndAtbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58383'),
  ('485691414520450452', 'Hands Up, Dead Man! You''re Under Arrest', 1971, 'Action, Romance, Western', 'León Klimovsky, Antonio Maccoppi, Sergio Bergonzelli', 'Enrico Zuccarini, Sergio Bergonzelli, José Luis Navarro', 'Espartaco Santoni, Peter Lee Lawrence, Aldo Sambrell, Helga Liné, Tomás Blanco, Franco Agostino, Aurora de Alba, Lorenzo Robledo', null, 'Sando Kid is a medic on the battlefields of the civil war and a pacifist. One day he witnesses Yankee captain Grayton ruthlessly killing wounded and unarmed soldiers. He manages to survive thanks to the help of a friend and learns how to use a gun. From now on, he will sign up to the rangers and hunt down bandits. He soon crosses paths with Grayton again, who now has become a ruthless business man, trying to rob farmers of their land. Together with his henchmen, Grayton might be more than Sando Kid can handle, if it wasn''t for Dollar, a black-clad bounty hunter who likes to wear a chain of teeth around his neck, and really likes the Kid.', 'Sando Kid is a medic on the battlefields of the civil war and a pacifist. One day he witnesses Yankee captain Grayton ruthlessly killing wounded and unarmed soldiers. He manages to survive thanks to the help of a friend and learns how to use a gun. From now on, he will sign up to the rangers and hunt down bandits. He soon crosses paths with Grayton again, who now has become a ruthless business man, trying to rob farmers of their land. Together with his henchmen, Grayton might be more than Sando Kid can handle, if it wasn''t for Dollar, a black-clad bounty hunter who likes to wear a chain of teeth around his neck, and really likes the Kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz5Qes7AMzAbUZNtzNQHXlvclH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129856'),
  ('701913220732612816', 'Hands Up, Hitler', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Roviros Manthoulis, Nikos Milas, Dimitris Papageorgiou', 'Dionysis Milas', 'Thanasis Veggos, Vasilis Diamantopoulos, Spyros Kalogirou, Vasilis Andreopoulos, Eleni Karpeta, Mirka Kalatzopoulou, Nasos Kedrakas', null, 'Two friends (Thanasis Vengos and Vasilis Diamantopoulos) meet after many years and recollect the tragi-comic events they went through during the German occupation.', 'Two friends (Thanasis Vengos and Vasilis Diamantopoulos) meet after many years and recollect the tragi-comic events they went through during the German occupation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FCQCAonG9tWUHIbSMyiacMbuVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300140'),
  ('952579068126336856', 'Hands Up!', 1985, 'Drama', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Jacek Dzik, Maria Telenkiewicz', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Andrzej Kostenko', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Joanna Szczerbic, Tadeusz Łomnicki, Adam Hanuszkiewicz, Bogumił Kobiela, Alan Bates, Jane Asher, David Essex', null, 'The reunion of a group of former medical students results in a flood of bitter memories.', 'The reunion of a group of former medical students results in a flood of bitter memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcksElN2QuH2mwToAABrGWNywed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154399'),
