  ('974572821000485902', 'Handsome Devil', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John Butler', 'John Butler', 'Fionn O''Shea, Nicholas Galitzine, Andrew Scott, Ardal O''Hanlon, Amy Huberman, Ruairí O''Connor, Michael McElhatton, Moe Dunford', null, 'A music-mad 16-year-old outcast at a rugby-mad boarding school forms an unlikely friendship with his dashing new roommate.', 'A music-mad 16-year-old outcast at a rugby-mad boarding school forms an unlikely friendship with his dashing new roommate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlHOWQFgcGV4KcZKLzYBZ21gjGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412202'),
  ('1057330995805449936', 'Handsome Guys', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yang Hyun-suk, Choi Jong-ha, Nam Dong-hyub', 'Eli Craig, Morgan Jurgenson', 'Lee Sung-min, Lee Hee-jun, Gong Seung-yeon, Park Ji-hwan, Lee Kyoo-hyung, Woo Hyeon, Jang Dong-ju, Kang Ki-doong', null, 'Brothers Jae-pil and Sang-gu move into their dream rustic-style house in the woods. When unwanted visitors arrive and awaken a sealed evil spirit in the basement, a dark aura begins to envelop the house.', 'Brothers Jae-pil and Sang-gu move into their dream rustic-style house in the woods. When unwanted visitors arrive and awaken a sealed evil spirit in the basement, a dark aura begins to envelop the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8QdSeTe02X8f1EcO7yk90lTGNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736720'),
  ('766490460168507202', 'Handsome Harry', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bette Gordon, Nigel Bluck', 'Nicholas T. Proferes', 'Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi, Mariann Mayberry, Aidan Quinn, John Savage, Campbell Scott, Titus Welliver, Karen Young', 'R', 'An ex-Navy man carrying out the last wish of a dying shipmate renews contact with old friends to break the code of silence around a mysterious, long-buried crime.', 'An ex-Navy man carrying out the last wish of a dying shipmate renews contact with old friends to break the code of silence around a mysterious, long-buried crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkM7PavmHTUrX5DWKFICZUYVJ32.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51933'),
  ('623800848655884357', 'Handsome Poor Bilo', 1979, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'İlyas Salman, Şener Şen, Münir Özkul, Adile Naşit, Sevda Aktolga, İhsan Yüce, Nizam Ergüden, Ekrem Dümer', null, 'Bilo is released from prison..', 'Bilo is released from prison..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPssQdMeGy1KlPenLqFOmmkKiIH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220004'),
  ('606768320279464683', 'Handsome Siblings', 1992, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Cheuk Hon, Stanley Wu', 'Andy Lau, Brigitte Lin, Sharla Cheung, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Deanie Ip, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Fung Hak-On, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai', null, 'One hundred seventy years ago, a wise monk made a section of land known as the Villians Valley, a sanctuary. Anyone who came to the valley was considered protected and safe from the law. The proclamation also stated that they should have a chance at repentance. The Master of Eva Palace, who is now master of the martial arts world, holds no regard for the ancient laws and enters the valley in search of the 10 Untouchable Villians because she has a warrant of justice to destroy them. The remaining 8 villians were actually the 10 Untouchable Heroes until they were framed by two of their own members, The Twin Villians, and used as scapegoats.', 'One hundred seventy years ago, a wise monk made a section of land known as the Villians Valley, a sanctuary. Anyone who came to the valley was considered protected and safe from the law. The proclamation also stated that they should have a chance at repentance. The Master of Eva Palace, who is now master of the martial arts world, holds no regard for the ancient laws and enters the valley in search of the 10 Untouchable Villians because she has a warrant of justice to destroy them. The remaining 8 villians were actually the 10 Untouchable Heroes until they were framed by two of their own members, The Twin Villians, and used as scapegoats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eavA5BY6oFHI1DaX3lotvtsBvcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66161'),
  ('700907341997229681', 'Handsome: A Netflix Mystery Movie', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Ryan Krayser, Richard Gonzales, Ryan Krayser', 'Jeff Garlin, Andrea Seigel', 'Jeff Garlin, Natasha Lyonne, Christine Woods, Steven Weber, Amy Sedaris, Eddie Pepitone, Leah Remini, Timm Sharp', null, 'LA homicide detective Gene Handsome''s knack for solving mysteries is matched only by his inability to make sense of his own problems.', 'LA homicide detective Gene Handsome''s knack for solving mysteries is matched only by his inability to make sense of his own problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yc1GQhNw5MvznrtPmPY52dKsdrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402582'),
  ('33432977245216197', 'Handsworth Songs', 1986, 'Documentary', 'John Akomfrah', null, 'Pervaiz Khan, Meera Syal, Yvonne Weekes', null, 'The Black Audio Film Collective’s acclaimed essay film, ''Handsworth Songs'', examines the 1985 race riots in Handsworth and London. Interweaving archival photographs, newsreel clips, and home movie footage, the film is both an exploration of documentary aesthetics and a broad meditation social and cultural oppression through Britain’s intertwined narratives of racism and economic decline.', 'The Black Audio Film Collective’s acclaimed essay film, ''Handsworth Songs'', examines the 1985 race riots in Handsworth and London. Interweaving archival photographs, newsreel clips, and home movie footage, the film is both an exploration of documentary aesthetics and a broad meditation social and cultural oppression through Britain’s intertwined narratives of racism and economic decline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyw4V9MbUGujMunBj4latxLSVya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124027'),
  ('821878834241506143', 'Handymen, Handymen', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Goran Marković', 'Goran Marković, Miroslav Simić', 'Semka Sokolović-Bertok, Bogdan Diklić, Snežana Nikšić, Predrag Laković, Tanja Bošković, Milivoje ''Mića'' Tomić, Olivera Marković, Zoran Radmilović', null, 'The staff of elementary school prepare the retirement party for their cleaning woman. The complicated relations within the school will emerge to the surface on the same night.', 'The staff of elementary school prepare the retirement party for their cleaning woman. The complicated relations within the school will emerge to the surface on the same night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbTuoODLTH5r9b1yE5S8Zm6qpaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230574'),
  ('684560187126919525', 'Hanezu', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Naomi Kawase, Naomi Kawase', 'Naomi Kawase', 'Tôta Komizu, Hako Ohshima, Tetsuya Akikawa, Kirin Kiki, Akaji Maro, Miyako Yamaguchi, Taiga Komizu, Norio Nishikawa', null, 'Woodwork artist Takumi moves to the small village Asuka in Nara Prefecture. He remodels old homes and lives a peaceful existence with nature. Takumi then meets Kayoko, a woman who went to the same school as Takumi. Kayoko is fascinated with the color crimson. She dyes scarves with the color of hanezu. Kayoko lives with boyfriend Tetsuya, who works as an editor of a PR magazine. They live together. Soon, Kayoko falls in love with Takumi.', 'Woodwork artist Takumi moves to the small village Asuka in Nara Prefecture. He remodels old homes and lives a peaceful existence with nature. Takumi then meets Kayoko, a woman who went to the same school as Takumi. Kayoko is fascinated with the color crimson. She dyes scarves with the color of hanezu. Kayoko lives with boyfriend Tetsuya, who works as an editor of a PR magazine. They live together. Soon, Kayoko falls in love with Takumi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHp8vWOkzfZLCd9faDP5WUn8cd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96811'),
  ('561512579998950429', 'Hang ''em High', 1968, 'Western, Drama', 'Ted Post, Richard H. Kline, Leonard J. South', 'Mel Goldberg, Leonard Freeman', 'Clint Eastwood, Inger Stevens, Ed Begley, Pat Hingle, Ben Johnson, Charles McGraw, Ruth White, Bruce Dern', 'PG-13', 'Marshall Jed Cooper survives a hanging, vowing revenge on the lynch mob that left him dangling. To carry out his oath for vengeance, he returns to his former job as a lawman. Before long, he''s caught up with the nine men on his hit list and starts dispensing his own brand of Wild West justice.', 'Marshall Jed Cooper survives a hanging, vowing revenge on the lynch mob that left him dangling. To carry out his oath for vengeance, he returns to his former job as a lawman. Before long, he''s caught up with the nine men on his hit list and starts dispensing his own brand of Wild West justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J9QEqdJWjL2etOf6Kf7n33PUK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4929'),
  ('87630739126057527', 'Hang on, Doggy', 1977, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Jane Kavčič', 'Vitan Mal', 'Matjaž Gruden, Matija Tavčar, Nino De Gleria, Polona Rajster, Andrej Đorđević, Vesna Jevnikar, Nataša Rojc, Nina Zidarić', null, 'This film takes place in Ljubljana, the capital of Slovenia. Matic lives in a large neighborhood of concrete blocks of flats with his mother. As his father is temporarily working in Libya, they live alone. Matics'' otherwise monotonous life changes dramatically when he is chosen to feature in a film. At the shooting he meets Milena, a girl his own age whom he begins to like. When the shooting is over, the film company gives him a present, a huge black Newfoundlander. Although his mother is not really pleased about it, Matic brings the dog home. And that is just the beginning of their adventures...', 'This film takes place in Ljubljana, the capital of Slovenia. Matic lives in a large neighborhood of concrete blocks of flats with his mother. As his father is temporarily working in Libya, they live alone. Matics'' otherwise monotonous life changes dramatically when he is chosen to feature in a film. At the shooting he meets Milena, a girl his own age whom he begins to like. When the shooting is over, the film company gives him a present, a huge black Newfoundlander. Although his mother is not really pleased about it, Matic brings the dog home. And that is just the beginning of their adventures...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WUTsYbI04nhveHIxvYvxtr6TEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82489'),
  ('322072325915162565', 'Hangar 10', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Daniel Simpson, Daniel Simpson, Frankie Boyle', 'Daniel Simpson, Adam Preston', 'Danny Shayler, Abbie Salt, Robert Curtis', null, '33 years after the infamous Rendlesham Forest UFO incident, three metal detector enthusiasts hunting for Saxon gold in the same region, capture incredible footage of UFO''s whilst filming their expedition. As night falls and with their navigation equipment failing, they find themselves facing a terrifying encounter with an unforgiving alien presence.', '33 years after the infamous Rendlesham Forest UFO incident, three metal detector enthusiasts hunting for Saxon gold in the same region, capture incredible footage of UFO''s whilst filming their expedition. As night falls and with their navigation equipment failing, they find themselves facing a terrifying encounter with an unforgiving alien presence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ios4yceUMuYtiUIetd3Fhbpk4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297680'),
  ('216155388890177903', 'Hangar 18', 1980, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'James L. Conway, Paul Hipp', 'Ken Pettus', 'Darren McGavin, Gary Collins, Robert Vaughn, James Hampton, Philip Abbott, Joseph Campanella, Pamela Bellwood, Tom Hallick', 'PG', 'During a Space Shuttle mission a satellite rams a unidentified flying object. The UFO afterwards performs an emergency landing in the deserts of Arizona. However the White House denies its existence because of the near presidential elections. The UFO is brought to the secret Hangar 18 and the accident is blamed on the incompetence of the astronauts Bancroff and Price. But the two fight against this and try to hunt down the UFO.', 'During a Space Shuttle mission a satellite rams a unidentified flying object. The UFO afterwards performs an emergency landing in the deserts of Arizona. However the White House denies its existence because of the near presidential elections. The UFO is brought to the secret Hangar 18 and the accident is blamed on the incompetence of the astronauts Bancroff and Price. But the two fight against this and try to hunt down the UFO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kORjGwOggAmJb0r5l8xoapXiBTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54287'),
  ('1058409838112366105', 'Hanged Man''s Farm', 1945, 'Drama', 'Jean Dréville', null, 'Charles Vanel, Alfred Adam, Guy Decomble, Bourvil, Georges Bever, Léonce Corne, Henri Génès, Lucienne Laurence', null, 'A large farm in Vendée. The father is dying and the three brothers and sister swear not to marry not to break up the field. Months pass. Francis, the eldest, took things in hand. For him, the promise to their father is sacred. So he does everything for his brothers and his sister Amanda are not tempted. However, the latter lets himself courted by a young man from the neighboring village ...', 'A large farm in Vendée. The father is dying and the three brothers and sister swear not to marry not to break up the field. Months pass. Francis, the eldest, took things in hand. For him, the promise to their father is sacred. So he does everything for his brothers and his sister Amanda are not tempted. However, the latter lets himself courted by a young man from the neighboring village ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4AWT5glQ7vJ9UgQtirzf2w56db.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283813'),
  ('772726134325491067', 'Hanger', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Ryan Nicholson, Jay Gavin', 'Ryan Nicholson, Patrick Coble', 'Debbie Rochon, Nathan Dashwood, Ronald Patrick Thompson, Lloyd Kaufman, Wade Gibb, Alastair Gamble, Candice Lewald, Dan Ellis', null, 'A horrifying tale of revenge that begins with a back-alley abortion, and ends with a bloodbath so vicious that it brings a new meaning to ''an eye for eye.', 'A horrifying tale of revenge that begins with a back-alley abortion, and ends with a bloodbath so vicious that it brings a new meaning to ''an eye for eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDEKz2Ze7P7nY6TusG6d1TETmNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27389'),
  ('931020213092334083', 'Hangin'' Out', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Heinz Hölscher, Wolfgang Büld', 'Wolfgang Büld', 'Nena, Markus Mörl, Enny Gerber, Karl Dall, Peter Lengauer, Cornelia Kraus, Helga Tölle, Cora Roberts', null, 'The pert Tina is sick of school and the muff in her Bavarian village. She wants to go with Tino - attendant of a visiting auto-scooter - who has to leave the place for dubious reasons. However he lets her down and leaves alone. Now Tina persuades fellow student Robby, who has a crush on her, to take her on a random trip with his motor-scooter. It seems only to be a matter of time until he realizes that she''s just using him to follow her boyfriend - or will the shy Robby manage to win her heart on their chaotic journey?', 'The pert Tina is sick of school and the muff in her Bavarian village. She wants to go with Tino - attendant of a visiting auto-scooter - who has to leave the place for dubious reasons. However he lets her down and leaves alone. Now Tina persuades fellow student Robby, who has a crush on her, to take her on a random trip with his motor-scooter. It seems only to be a matter of time until he realizes that she''s just using him to follow her boyfriend - or will the shy Robby manage to win her heart on their chaotic journey?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XCcGD4YGw6XDhzqaPE8lM2EAZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2136'),
  ('433679674442290125', 'Hangin'' with the Homeboys', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joseph B. Vasquez, Anghel Decca', 'Joseph B. Vasquez', 'Doug E. Doug, Mario Joyner, John Leguizamo, Nestor Serrano, Kimberly Russell, Mary B. Ward, Reggie Montgomery, Christine Claravall', 'R', 'Two African-Americans and two Puerto-Ricans (though one pretends to be Italian) go out on the town on a Friday night. They will be forced to get to know each other — and even worse, learn to like each other as friends.', 'Two African-Americans and two Puerto-Ricans (though one pretends to be Italian) go out on the town on a Friday night. They will be forced to get to know each other — and even worse, learn to like each other as friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toGCmWnd4t3vmwOcdV60RH0RUF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74395'),
  ('956509387078911878', 'Hanging Garden', 2005, 'Drama', 'Toshiaki Toyoda, ZAK, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Kyoko Koizumi, Anne Suzuki, Itsuji Itao, Masahiro Hirota, Jun Kunimura, Eita Nagayama, Asami Imajuku, Ryo Katsuji', null, 'On the surface, the Kyobashis appear to be a happy family. Despite a family agreement that they are all open with each other, the entire household knows the opposite is true.', 'On the surface, the Kyobashis appear to be a happy family. Despite a family agreement that they are all open with each other, the entire household knows the opposite is true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlbBJzBFSYcM3mSWQHTQPPgbJAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38013'),
  ('44873520554900111', 'Hanging Offense', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Pierre-William Glenn, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Josiane Balasko, Ange Rodot, Aurélien Recoing, Frédéric Pierrot, Thierry Lhermitte, Éric Caravaca, Didier Abot, Béatrice Chauvin', null, 'A strange investigation doesn’t erase the regrets of a grieving woman cop. Every four years, the past catches up with her. Every four years this woman is very afraid. Her fear is such that she feels it could kill her because in her dreams reality begins.', 'A strange investigation doesn’t erase the regrets of a grieving woman cop. Every four years, the past catches up with her. Every four years this woman is very afraid. Her fear is such that she feels it could kill her because in her dreams reality begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyh6XGYkbZV13HoTTIeILqbmYlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36069'),
  ('144669828972446292', 'Hanging Up', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Howard Atherton, Diane Keaton, K.C. Colwell', 'Delia Ephron, Nora Ephron', 'Meg Ryan, Diane Keaton, Lisa Kudrow, Walter Matthau, Adam Arkin, Jesse James, Shaun Duke, Ann Bortolotti', 'PG-13', 'Three sisters - Georgia, Eve, and Maddy - do what they do best with life, love, and lunacy on the telephone lines that bind - when their curmudgeonly father, Lou, is admitted to a Los Angeles Hospital. After years of wild living, intermittent affection, and constant phoning, he is finally threatening to die.', 'Three sisters - Georgia, Eve, and Maddy - do what they do best with life, love, and lunacy on the telephone lines that bind - when their curmudgeonly father, Lou, is admitted to a Los Angeles Hospital. After years of wild living, intermittent affection, and constant phoning, he is finally threatening to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnnFFGhIXi6ZDU3r29eKHKTHdq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10385'),
  ('519327456246609557', 'Hangman', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Mason, Tobias Demi', 'Adam Mason', 'Jeremy Sisto, Kate Ashfield, Ty Simpkins, Ryan Simpkins, Amy Smart, Ross Partridge, Vincent Ventresca, Bruno Alexander', null, 'Returning from vacation, the Miller family find their home has been broken into. After cleaning up the mess they continue with their lives, shaking off the feeling of being violated. But little do they know the nightmare has just begun.', 'Returning from vacation, the Miller family find their home has been broken into. After cleaning up the mess they continue with their lives, shaking off the feeling of being violated. But little do they know the nightmare has just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFycPIlZahNAodgnOMG9Anv4Hds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324803'),
  ('879505615134760399', 'Hangman', 2017, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Johnny Martin, Marc Dahlstrom, Larry Blanford', 'Michael Caissie, Charles Huttinger', 'Al Pacino, Karl Urban, Brittany Snow, Sarah Shahi, Joe Anderson, Sloane Warren, Chelle Ramos, Steve Coulter', 'R', 'A homicide detective teams up with a criminal profiler to catch a serial killer whose crimes are inspired by the children''s game, Hangman.', 'A homicide detective teams up with a criminal profiler to catch a serial killer whose crimes are inspired by the children''s game, Hangman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7HwjTX9h4B8kuolyKiztYjtqna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323368'),
  ('971277069174636755', 'Hangman''s Curse', 2003, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rafal Zielinski', 'Kathy Mackel, Stan Foster', 'David Keith, Mel Harris, Douglas Smith, Leighton Meester, Jake Richardson, Bobby Brewer, Daniel Farber, Edwin Hodge', 'PG-13', 'Bullying students are becoming deathly ill after screaming the name of a legendary ghost. What''s to blame? An exotic illness? An illicit drug? Or is it the supernatural? The clues are few and time is running out for the students of Rogers High School. The only hope is the Veritas Project, a highly trained investigative team working undercover to expose the truth. Lives hang in the balance as they scramble to unravel the mystery and protect the student body from their own hatred and fear.', 'Bullying students are becoming deathly ill after screaming the name of a legendary ghost. What''s to blame? An exotic illness? An illicit drug? Or is it the supernatural? The clues are few and time is running out for the students of Rogers High School. The only hope is the Veritas Project, a highly trained investigative team working undercover to expose the truth. Lives hang in the balance as they scramble to unravel the mystery and protect the student body from their own hatred and fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x56Xy4QEVXiNXNpogBUebycGjW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45862'),
  ('275930149321307153', 'Hangman''s House', 1928, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'John Ford, George Schneiderman, Philip Ford', 'Marion Orth, Willard Mack', 'Victor McLaglen, June Collyer, Earle Foxe, Hobart Bosworth, Larry Kent, Joseph Burke, Mary Gordon, Brian Desmond Hurst', 'NR', 'Forced by her mean-spirited father, Lord Chief Justice James O''Brien, to marry a man she doesn''t love, Connaught O''Brien gives up hope of ever with her true love, Dermot McDermot. After her father dies and a hunted rebel leader returns to town, however, Connaught finds a renewed hope that the tides of oppression will shift and she might again find happiness. This silent romantic drama, set in Ireland, is the first film in which a then-unknown John Wayne is clearly visible.', 'Forced by her mean-spirited father, Lord Chief Justice James O''Brien, to marry a man she doesn''t love, Connaught O''Brien gives up hope of ever with her true love, Dermot McDermot. After her father dies and a hunted rebel leader returns to town, however, Connaught finds a renewed hope that the tides of oppression will shift and she might again find happiness. This silent romantic drama, set in Ireland, is the first film in which a then-unknown John Wayne is clearly visible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJrrkvxPGf6BpJ1wTI4pEQhmrs1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113788'),
  ('1099241184799115096', 'Hangman''s Knot', 1952, 'Action, Western', 'Roy Huggins, Yakima Canutt, Jack Corrick', 'Roy Huggins', 'Randolph Scott, Donna Reed, Claude Jarman Jr., Frank Faylen, Glenn Langan, Richard Denning, Lee Marvin, Jeanette Nolan', 'NR', 'In 1865, a troop of Confederate soldiers led by Major Matt Stewart attack the wagon of gold escorted by Union cavalry and the soldiers are killed. The only wounded survivor tells that the war ended one month ago, and the group decides to take the gold and meet their liaison that knew that the war ended but did not inform the troop. The harsh Rolph Bainter kills the greedy man and the soldiers flee in his wagon driven by Major Stewart. When they meet a posse chasing them, Stewart gives wrong information to misguide the group; however, they have an accident with the wagon and lose the horses. They decide to stop a stagecoach and force the driver to transport them, but the posse returns and they are trapped in the station with the passenger. They realize that the men are not deputies and have no intention to bring them to justice but take the stolen gold.', 'In 1865, a troop of Confederate soldiers led by Major Matt Stewart attack the wagon of gold escorted by Union cavalry and the soldiers are killed. The only wounded survivor tells that the war ended one month ago, and the group decides to take the gold and meet their liaison that knew that the war ended but did not inform the troop. The harsh Rolph Bainter kills the greedy man and the soldiers flee in his wagon driven by Major Stewart. When they meet a posse chasing them, Stewart gives wrong information to misguide the group; however, they have an accident with the wagon and lose the horses. They decide to stop a stagecoach and force the driver to transport them, but the posse returns and they are trapped in the station with the passenger. They realize that the men are not deputies and have no intention to bring them to justice but take the stolen gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifpv8Tyxg4h33HrkkeDSpBr37ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53651'),
  ('225072983711198907', 'Hangmen', 1987, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'J. Christian Ingvordsen, Steven Kaman', 'J. Christian Ingvordsen, Steven Kaman', 'Rick Washburn, Dog Thomas, Keith Bogart, J. Christian Ingvordsen, Sandra Bullock, David Henry Keller, Dan Lutsky, Dan Golden', null, 'Rob Greene has information about an undercover terror team inside the CIA led by Joe Connelly. To stay alive with the knowledge, he is advised to stay undercover by his supervisor Andrews. Connelly''s men try to kill Greene, but he can escape and warns his son Danny that he also may be in danger and that he should look for Dog Thompson.', 'Rob Greene has information about an undercover terror team inside the CIA led by Joe Connelly. To stay alive with the knowledge, he is advised to stay undercover by his supervisor Andrews. Connelly''s men try to kill Greene, but he can escape and warns his son Danny that he also may be in danger and that he should look for Dog Thompson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtSD18nFsPjOz2AnFVOoiUWHTf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47749'),
  ('264442404480014260', 'Hangmen Also Die!', 1943, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Fritz Lang, James Wong Howe, Walter Mayo', 'John Wexley', 'Brian Donlevy, Walter Brennan, Anna Lee, Gene Lockhart, Dennis O''Keefe, Margaret Wycherly, Nana Bryant, William Roy', 'NR', 'During the Nazi occupation of Czechoslovakia, surgeon Dr. Franticek Svoboda, a Czech patriot, assassinates the brutal "Hangman of Europe", Reichsprotektor Reinhard Heydrich, and is wounded in the process. In his attempt to escape, he is helped by history professor Stephen Novotny and his daughter Mascha.', 'During the Nazi occupation of Czechoslovakia, surgeon Dr. Franticek Svoboda, a Czech patriot, assassinates the brutal "Hangman of Europe", Reichsprotektor Reinhard Heydrich, and is wounded in the process. In his attempt to escape, he is helped by history professor Stephen Novotny and his daughter Mascha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9J86BpP7NLreJJ9VCbr1SDMRii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22178'),
  ('115394242033193893', 'Hangover Square', 1945, 'Thriller', 'John Brahm, Joseph LaShelle', 'Barré Lyndon', 'Laird Cregar, Linda Darnell, George Sanders, Glenn Langan, Faye Marlowe, Alan Napier, J.W. Austin, Ted Billings', null, 'When composer George Harvey Bone wakes with no memory of the previous night and a bloody knife in his pocket, he worries that he has committed a crime. On the advice of Dr. Middleton, Bone agrees to relax, going to a music performance by singer Netta Longdon. Riveted by Netta, Bone agrees to write songs for her rather than his own concerto. However, Bone soon grows jealous of Netta and worries about controlling himself during his spells.', 'When composer George Harvey Bone wakes with no memory of the previous night and a bloody knife in his pocket, he worries that he has committed a crime. On the advice of Dr. Middleton, Bone agrees to relax, going to a music performance by singer Netta Longdon. Riveted by Netta, Bone agrees to write songs for her rather than his own concerto. However, Bone soon grows jealous of Netta and worries about controlling himself during his spells.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKkeuelnX0cr5xZHys2wfpAnbm2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35849'),
  ('392549429220343139', 'Hank and Mike', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Matthiew Klinck', 'Paolo Mancini', 'Thomas Michael, Paolo Mancini, Chris Klein, Maggie Castle, Tony Nappo, Jane McLean, Melanie Mullen, Boyd Banks', null, 'Two blue-collar Easter Bunnies get fired and try their hand at an assortment of odd jobs, failing at each. Fighting depression, debt and eventually each other, their lives start to unravel until they realize that without their job they are nothing.', 'Two blue-collar Easter Bunnies get fired and try their hand at an assortment of odd jobs, failing at each. Fighting depression, debt and eventually each other, their lives start to unravel until they realize that without their job they are nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlHcI3lDMPwaGwiWBWiyk2Buhpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13119'),
  ('810571202038962583', 'Hanky Panky', 1982, 'Mystery, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Sidney Poitier, Candace Allen, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'David Taylor, Henry Rosenbaum', 'Gene Wilder, Gilda Radner, Kathleen Quinlan, Richard Widmark, Robert Prosky, Josef Sommer, Johnny Sekka, Jay O. Sanders', 'PG', 'Naïve Michael Jordon is drawn into a web of government secrets when a girl carrying a mysterious package gets into a taxi with him. When she''s later murdered, Michael becomes the chief suspect and goes on the run.', 'Naïve Michael Jordon is drawn into a web of government secrets when a girl carrying a mysterious package gets into a taxi with him. When she''s later murdered, Michael becomes the chief suspect and goes on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecEgoav8AqNWiPpAr4dZWrPm1d6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25001'),
  ('847535222241562923', 'Hanna', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Joe Wright, Alwin H. Küchler, Richard von Groeling', 'David Farr, Seth Lochhead', 'Saoirse Ronan, Eric Bana, Cate Blanchett, Tom Hollander, Jessica Barden, Olivia Williams, Jason Flemyng, Aldo Maland', 'PG-13', 'Raised by her father, an ex-CIA agent, in the wilds of Finland, Hanna''s upbringing has been geared to making her the perfect assassin. Sent into the world by her father on a mission, Hanna journeys across Europe, eluding agents dispatched after her by a ruthless intelligence operative. As she nears her ultimate target, Hanna faces startling revelations about her existence.', 'Raised by her father, an ex-CIA agent, in the wilds of Finland, Hanna''s upbringing has been geared to making her the perfect assassin. Sent into the world by her father on a mission, Hanna journeys across Europe, eluding agents dispatched after her by a ruthless intelligence operative. As she nears her ultimate target, Hanna faces startling revelations about her existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QDeHwBXDHbCbuzStgUpuUAqnap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50456'),
  ('1019074560169371478', 'Hanna D: The Girl from Vondel Park', 1984, 'Drama', 'Rino Di Silvestro, Franco Delli Colli, Claudio Fragasso', 'Rino Di Silvestro, Hervé Piccini', 'Ann-Gisel Glass, Fausto Lombardi, Sebastiano Somma, Antonio Serrano, Georges Millon, Donatella Damiani, Jacques Stany, Karin Schubert', null, 'Hanna is a girl completely abandoned to herself, is not at all inhibited sexually, and is attracted to the attention of unscrupulous people like Miguel, who takes advantage of Hanna, turning her to prostitution to obtain her drug fix. Until she meets Alex, a young man with a sincere affection for Hanna.', 'Hanna is a girl completely abandoned to herself, is not at all inhibited sexually, and is attracted to the attention of unscrupulous people like Miguel, who takes advantage of Hanna, turning her to prostitution to obtain her drug fix. Until she meets Alex, a young man with a sincere affection for Hanna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNvKUbypRurzLdQvZS8VSOpBeoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86461'),
  ('994529907584693983', 'Hanna K.', 1983, 'Drama', 'Costa-Gavras, Claire Denis, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Costa-Gavras, Franco Solinas', 'Jill Clayburgh, Jean Yanne, Gabriel Byrne, David Clennon, Shimon Finkel, Oded Kotler, Michal Bat-Adam, Dafna Levy', 'R', 'Israeli attorney Hanna Kaufman''s beliefs are challenged when she''s appointed to the defense of Selim Bakri. Kaufman, born in the United States to survivors of the Holocaust, has always accepted Israel''s right to exist. However, she bears witness to some of its sovereign costs when she meets Bakri, a dispossessed Palestinian man facing serious criminal charges who wants the same thing as his supposed enemies: to reclaim his family home.', 'Israeli attorney Hanna Kaufman''s beliefs are challenged when she''s appointed to the defense of Selim Bakri. Kaufman, born in the United States to survivors of the Holocaust, has always accepted Israel''s right to exist. However, she bears witness to some of its sovereign costs when she meets Bakri, a dispossessed Palestinian man facing serious criminal charges who wants the same thing as his supposed enemies: to reclaim his family home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBEpqJYvUYJ5FHG4BK5aZPyNHrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63665'),
  ('451865850764918112', 'Hanna-Barbera''s 50th', 1989, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, Animation, Documentary, TV Movie', 'John McPherson, Marshall Flaum', 'Marshall Flaum', 'Casey Kasem, Tiffany, Valerie Harper, Penny Singleton, Phyllis Diller, Tony Danza, Annie Potts, Victor Borge', null, 'The special is hosted by Tony Danza and Annie Potts celebrating 50 years of William Hanna and Joseph Barbera''s partnership in animation. This is the first animated project to be broadcast in Dolby Surround sound system.', 'The special is hosted by Tony Danza and Annie Potts celebrating 50 years of William Hanna and Joseph Barbera''s partnership in animation. This is the first animated project to be broadcast in Dolby Surround sound system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zusIo9ohmVsopbLfAnd4lQgU53P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366384'),
  ('184261568916413194', 'Hanna''s Homecoming', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Christiane Buchmann, Esther Bialas', 'Lena Krumkamp', 'Valerie Stoll, Milena Tscharntke, Godehard Giese, Sebastian Hülk, Rick Okon, Maximilian Beck, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Anne Lebinsky', null, 'After three years at boarding school, Hanna is returning home to her little village to help her father''s butcher’s shop during her break. Soon she learns that she is not welcome in the village. Everyone remembers the horrific news story about her mother’s death which was followed by the discovery of three dead men in the marsh. Superstition rules the village and everyone believes her mother was a witch that lured the men into the marsh directly to their death. While struggling to make friends, she meets extroverted city girl Eva. Thinking she has finally found a friend, Hanna’s confidence, and with that her "power", starts to grow, while scary accidents begin to happen around her.', 'After three years at boarding school, Hanna is returning home to her little village to help her father''s butcher’s shop during her break. Soon she learns that she is not welcome in the village. Everyone remembers the horrific news story about her mother’s death which was followed by the discovery of three dead men in the marsh. Superstition rules the village and everyone believes her mother was a witch that lured the men into the marsh directly to their death. While struggling to make friends, she meets extroverted city girl Eva. Thinking she has finally found a friend, Hanna’s confidence, and with that her "power", starts to grow, while scary accidents begin to happen around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlkGytp4ceoXORn8EljEi0nbdZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508780'),
  ('75644892626151353', 'Hanna''s Journey', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Julia von Heinz, Daniela Knapp', 'Julia von Heinz, John Quester', 'Karoline Schuch, Doron Amit, Max Mauff, Lore Richter, Trystan Pütter, Lea Koenig, Suzanne von Borsody, Claudia-Sofie Jelinek', null, 'A German girl travels to Israel to help people with disabilities, where she learns a lot about the role of her grandparents in WWII and meets a man who wants to move to Berlin.', 'A German girl travels to Israel to help people with disabilities, where she learns a lot about the role of her grandparents in WWII and meets a man who wants to move to Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHmFv1f3WBpceUVAAzL3y78V7WF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239619'),
  ('605495357214354411', 'Hannah', 2018, 'Drama', 'Andrea Pallaoro, Chayse Irvin, Laura Klein', 'Andrea Pallaoro, Orlando Tirado', 'Charlotte Rampling, André Wilms, Luca Avallone, Stéphanie Van Vyve, Jean-Michel Balthazar, Simon Bisschop, Jessica Fanhan, Fatou Traoré', null, 'A woman grapples with the consequences of her husband''s imprisonment.', 'A woman grapples with the consequences of her husband''s imprisonment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceEP87OvIOlASy2PIiJjaFk9V6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468287'),
  ('712427092208712647', 'Hannah and Her Sisters', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Woody Allen, Carlo Di Palma, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Woody Allen', 'Mia Farrow, Barbara Hershey, Dianne Wiest, Woody Allen, Michael Caine, Lloyd Nolan, Maureen O''Sullivan, Carrie Fisher', 'PG-13', 'Between two Thanksgivings, Hannah''s husband falls in love with her sister Lee, while her hypochondriac ex-husband rekindles his relationship with her sister Holly.', 'Between two Thanksgivings, Hannah''s husband falls in love with her sister Lee, while her hypochondriac ex-husband rekindles his relationship with her sister Holly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gARgIRb2QFRFVrsziwWE389u1pK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5143'),
  ('986240177120637796', 'Hannah Arendt', 2012, 'Drama', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Caroline Champetier', 'Pamela Katz, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Barbara Sukowa, Axel Milberg, Janet McTeer, Julia Jentsch, Nicholas Woodeson, Ulrich Noethen, Leila Schaus, Claire Johnston', 'NR', 'A portrait of the genius that shook the world with her discovery of “the banality of evil.” After she attends the Nazi Adolf Eichmann’s trial in Jerusalem, Arendt dares to write about the Holocaust in terms no one has ever heard before. Her work instantly provokes a furious scandal, and Arendt stands strong as she is attacked by friends and foes alike. But as the German-Jewish émigré also struggles to suppress her own painful associations with the past, the film exposes her beguiling blend of arrogance and vulnerability — revealing a soul defined and derailed by exile.', 'A portrait of the genius that shook the world with her discovery of “the banality of evil.” After she attends the Nazi Adolf Eichmann’s trial in Jerusalem, Arendt dares to write about the Holocaust in terms no one has ever heard before. Her work instantly provokes a furious scandal, and Arendt stands strong as she is attacked by friends and foes alike. But as the German-Jewish émigré also struggles to suppress her own painful associations with the past, the film exposes her beguiling blend of arrogance and vulnerability — revealing a soul defined and derailed by exile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kB4hUbhIYmx7Xdpo1DGn15pstO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121873'),
  ('221895147144351863', 'Hannah Gadsby: Douglas', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Madeleine Parry, Patti Lee', 'Hannah Gadsby', 'Hannah Gadsby', null, 'Hannah Gadsby returns for her second special and digs deep into the complexities of popularity, identity, and her most unusual dog park encounter.', 'Hannah Gadsby returns for her second special and digs deep into the complexities of popularity, identity, and her most unusual dog park encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2xu56AHJBSZv8ZZ9XgJqe9WgOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638706'),
