  ('475811352757993570', 'Hannah Montana & Miley Cyrus: Best of Both Worlds Concert', 2008, 'Documentary, Music', 'Bruce Hendricks, Reed Smoot, Mitchell Amundsen', null, 'Miley Cyrus, Nick Jonas, Joe Jonas, Kevin Jonas, Billy Ray Cyrus, Kenny Ortega, Stacy Jones, Jamie Arentzen', 'G', 'In this concert film, ''Hannah Montana'' star Miley Cyrus performs a slew of hit songs, including ''Just Like You'' and ''Life''s What You Make It.''', 'In this concert film, ''Hannah Montana'' star Miley Cyrus performs a slew of hit songs, including ''Just Like You'' and ''Life''s What You Make It.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrI1LW6RkiClbEV6wKu19spxhQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253353'),
  ('863046340961491393', 'Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special', 2026, 'Documentary, Music', 'Sam Wrench, Nyk Allen', 'Kristen Bartlett', 'Miley Cyrus, Alex Cooper, Tish Cyrus, Billy Ray Cyrus, Selena Gomez, Jamal Sims, Chappell Roan, Noah Cyrus', 'PG', 'Filmed in front of a live studio audience and hosted by Alex Cooper of ''Call Her Daddy'' fame, Miley Cyrus reflects on the creation and impact of the series with never-before-seen archival footage, all the while interacting and reminiscing on some of the show''s most memorable sets ''brought back to life'' — including the Stewart family living room and the legendary Hannah Montana closet.', 'Filmed in front of a live studio audience and hosted by Alex Cooper of ''Call Her Daddy'' fame, Miley Cyrus reflects on the creation and impact of the series with never-before-seen archival footage, all the while interacting and reminiscing on some of the show''s most memorable sets ''brought back to life'' — including the Stewart family living room and the legendary Hannah Montana closet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BZ0bij5ORSvfDepCDD8CqVcpaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1637319'),
  ('568691032962718964', 'Hannah Montana: The Movie', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music, Romance', 'Peter Chelsom, David Hennings', 'Dan Berendsen', 'Miley Cyrus, Billy Ray Cyrus, Emily Osment, Margo Martindale, Jason Earles, Peter Gunn, Melora Hardin, Mitchel Musso', 'G', 'When Miley Stewart (aka pop-star Hannah Montana) gets too caught up in the superstar celebrity lifestyle, her dad decides it''s time for a total change of scenery. But sweet niblets! Miley must trade in all the glitz and glamour of Hollywood for some ol'' blue jeans on the family farm in Tennessee, and question if she can be both Miley Stewart and Hannah Montana.', 'When Miley Stewart (aka pop-star Hannah Montana) gets too caught up in the superstar celebrity lifestyle, her dad decides it''s time for a total change of scenery. But sweet niblets! Miley must trade in all the glitz and glamour of Hollywood for some ol'' blue jeans on the family farm in Tennessee, and question if she can be both Miley Stewart and Hannah Montana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZUKhfpUCFfTy24LGBHdDlK5RLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18126'),
  ('79880645356166224', 'Hannah Takes the Stairs', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joe Swanberg, Joe Swanberg', 'Kent Osborne, Joe Swanberg, Greta Gerwig', 'Greta Gerwig, Kent Osborne, Andrew Bujalski, Ry Russo-Young, Mark Duplass, Todd Rohal, Tipper Newton, Kris Rey', 'NR', 'Hannah is a recent college graduate interning at a Chicago production company. She is crushing on two writers at work, Matt and Paul, who share an office and keep her entertained. Will a relationship with one of them disrupt the delicate balance of their friendship?', 'Hannah is a recent college graduate interning at a Chicago production company. She is crushing on two writers at work, Matt and Paul, who share an office and keep her entertained. Will a relationship with one of them disrupt the delicate balance of their friendship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hy0wRpAtjed2yV1WE78gWj4BLrJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5761'),
  ('969149134474593915', 'Hannah Waddingham: Home for Christmas', 2023, 'Music', 'Hamish Hamilton', null, 'Hannah Waddingham, Juno Temple, Luke Evans, Phil Dunster, Brendan Hunt, Nick Mohammed, Leslie Odom Jr., James Lance', 'PG', 'Ring in the holidays with Emmy-winning star Hannah Waddingham as she welcomes special guests for a musical extravaganza at the London Coliseum.', 'Ring in the holidays with Emmy-winning star Hannah Waddingham as she welcomes special guests for a musical extravaganza at the London Coliseum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc1uof12ZEDMY7VSGmMbo1SBQlb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1192548'),
  ('51239315269510650', 'Hannah, Queen of the Vampires', 1973, 'Horror', 'Julio Salvador, Ray Danton, Juan Gelpí', 'Julio Salvador, Lou Shaw', 'Andrew Prine, Patty Shepard, Mark Damon, Teresa Gimpera, İhsan Gedik, Mariano García Rey, Frank Braña, Edward Walsh', 'R', 'Two archaeologists on a scientific dig come across a vampire burial ground and discover that the creatures are about to awaken and attack a nearby village.', 'Two archaeologists on a scientific dig come across a vampire burial ground and discover that the creatures are about to awaken and attack a nearby village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w76lLGLlFpthlTgXOVulzvk2xRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86748'),
  ('903219597329781058', 'Hannes', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Marohl, Marc Sieger, Alexandra Ortmair', 'Dominikus Steinbichler', 'Leonard Scheicher, Johannes Nussbaum, Hannelore Elsner, Heiner Lauterbach, Gabriela Maria Schmeide, Verena Altenberger, Lisa Vicari, Jeanette Hain', null, 'Born at the same place, on the same day, Hannes and Moritz grow up to be inseparable friends. But one day a tragic motorcycle accident will change their lives forever, leaving Hannes in a coma with a slim chance of recovery. Moritz refuses to give up on his friend and puts his own life aside to ensure Hannes is always loved and surrounded by life and laughter. Trying to stand his ground, Moritz will then embark on an inspiring and life-changing journey, realizing that every day is worth celebrating and proving their friendship is stronger than ever.', 'Born at the same place, on the same day, Hannes and Moritz grow up to be inseparable friends. But one day a tragic motorcycle accident will change their lives forever, leaving Hannes in a coma with a slim chance of recovery. Moritz refuses to give up on his friend and puts his own life aside to ensure Hannes is always loved and surrounded by life and laughter. Trying to stand his ground, Moritz will then embark on an inspiring and life-changing journey, realizing that every day is worth celebrating and proving their friendship is stronger than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNbNZkqih37K4rPWFJGDTpecf31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586813'),
  ('265955099109098046', 'Hanni & Nanni', 2010, 'Family, Comedy', 'Christine Hartmann, Alexander Fischerkoesen', 'Jane Ainscough, Katharina Reschke', 'Sophia Münster, Jana Münster, Hannelore Elsner, Heino Ferch, Anja Kling, Katharina Thalbach, Suzanne von Borsody, Oliver Pocher', null, 'Hanni and Nanni are not only sisters, but also best friends. The twins are inseparable and always up to something. When they cause a wild chase through a department store, their wealthy parents have had it: They send the girls to the posh boarding school Lindenhof in order to teach them some manners. While sweet-tempered Nanni quickly makes new friends, the impulsive Hanni has a hard time accustoming herself.', 'Hanni and Nanni are not only sisters, but also best friends. The twins are inseparable and always up to something. When they cause a wild chase through a department store, their wealthy parents have had it: They send the girls to the posh boarding school Lindenhof in order to teach them some manners. While sweet-tempered Nanni quickly makes new friends, the impulsive Hanni has a hard time accustoming herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68a9VIjL0ZM655HX05VKuJHSjNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49707'),
  ('1104833807050852194', 'Hanni & Nanni 2', 2012, 'Family, Comedy', 'Julia von Heinz, Felix Poplawsky', 'Chris Silber, Jane Ainscough', 'Jana Münster, Sophia Münster, Heino Ferch, Suzanne von Borsody, Anja Kling, Katharina Thalbach, Hannelore Elsner, Barbara Schöneberger', null, 'The summer break is over and the twins returned to Lindenhof. That has now changed a lot. Because Mrs Theobald had to travel, Mademoiselle Bertoux has taken the lead.', 'The summer break is over and the twins returned to Lindenhof. That has now changed a lot. Because Mrs Theobald had to travel, Mademoiselle Bertoux has taken the lead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yqPXbzQi7YO8fZ3YCpKsWUKrV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103630'),
  ('982817068793252436', 'Hanni & Nanni 3', 2013, 'Family, Comedy', 'Felix Poplawsky, Lars Bretschneider, Dagmar Seume', 'Chris Silber', 'Sophia Münster, Jana Münster, Suzanne von Borsody, Katharina Thalbach, Hannelore Elsner, Barbara Schöneberger, Justus von Dohnányi, Konstantin Wecker', null, 'The Lindenhof School is expecting a busload of proper young English ladies as exchange students. The shock is great when the students turn out to be teenage boys! But while Mademoiselle Bertoux is delighted to stage “Romeo and Juliet” with real boys, both Hanni and her sister Nanni fall for their “Romeo,” Clyde.', 'The Lindenhof School is expecting a busload of proper young English ladies as exchange students. The shock is great when the students turn out to be teenage boys! But while Mademoiselle Bertoux is delighted to stage “Romeo and Juliet” with real boys, both Hanni and her sister Nanni fall for their “Romeo,” Clyde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn8W0RtKWOnvUCivQUX2tBVv7G3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225313'),
  ('847348865021591225', 'Hanni & Nanni 4', 2017, 'Family', 'Isabell Šuba', 'Katrin Milhahn, Antonia Rothe-Liermann, Sandra Nettelbeck', 'Laila Meinecke, Rosa Meinecke, Jessica Schwarz, Sascha Vollmer, Katharina Thalbach, Maria Schrader, Henry Hübchen, Julia Koschitz', 'G', 'After plotting a way to get kicked out of boarding school, the twins diverge for the first time in their lives when Nanni starts enjoying her stay.', 'After plotting a way to get kicked out of boarding school, the twins diverge for the first time in their lives when Nanni starts enjoying her stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eN1VFZz4K8dBqliE2cMCF7cpYhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429971'),
  ('131492220925849644', 'Hannibal', 1959, 'History, Adventure, Drama', 'Edgar G. Ulmer, Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Nino Zanchin', 'Sandro Continenza, Mortimer Braus', 'Victor Mature, Gabriele Ferzetti, Rita Gam, Milly Vitale, Rik Battaglia, Franco Silva, Terence Hill, Mirko Ellis', 'NR', 'A Carthaginian general attempts to cross the Alps with an army of elephants in order to conquer Rome.', 'A Carthaginian general attempts to cross the Alps with an army of elephants in order to conquer Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KGA7vHcdcNiEQG4WADCUcYuhAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169818'),
  ('154613079000480118', 'Hannibal', 1972, 'Drama', 'Xavier Koller', null, 'Marcus Mislin, Fred Tanner, Anestis Vlahos, Maria Giourousi, Frangoulis Frangoulis, Werner Lässer, Hans-Rudolf Twerenbold, René Seiler', null, 'A young man happens upon a strange, isolated village which is oppressively ruled by foreign soldiers. When he tries to inquire into what is going on, he is forced to flee to an island where a renegade medical doctor tries to force him into submission.', 'A young man happens upon a strange, isolated village which is oppressively ruled by foreign soldiers. When he tries to inquire into what is going on, he is forced to flee to an island where a renegade medical doctor tries to force him into submission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dnBp9NlOpz8LNN9yUw2qpI2YZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388859'),
  ('755188005618204129', 'Hannibal', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Mathieson, Ridley Scott, Halina Gebarowicz', 'David Mamet, Steven Zaillian', 'Anthony Hopkins, Julianne Moore, Gary Oldman, Ray Liotta, Giancarlo Giannini, Željko Ivanek, Frankie Faison, Francesca Neri', 'R', 'After having successfully eluded the authorities for years, Hannibal peacefully lives in Italy in disguise as an art scholar. Trouble strikes again when he''s discovered leaving a deserving few dead in the process. He returns to America to make contact with now disgraced Agent Clarice Starling, who is suffering the wrath of a malicious FBI rival as well as the media.', 'After having successfully eluded the authorities for years, Hannibal peacefully lives in Italy in disguise as an art scholar. Trouble strikes again when he''s discovered leaving a deserving few dead in the process. He returns to America to make contact with now disgraced Agent Clarice Starling, who is suffering the wrath of a malicious FBI rival as well as the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5wAZwRqpGWmyAaaJ8BBHYuNXnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9740'),
  ('961033568548018968', 'Hannibal and Jerry', 1997, 'Music, Comedy, Family', 'Steen Rasmussen, Michael Wikke, Steffen Led Sørensen', 'Steen Rasmussen, Michael Wikke', 'Jonathan Kvium, Paprika Steen, Martin Brygmann, Hella Joof, Peter Frödin, Sofie Bonde, Peter Mygind, Jytte Abildstrøm', null, 'Hannibal is a nice and polite boy, but Father and Mother think he hangs too much in front of the television. They therefore give him the dog Jerry, whom he is very pleased with. It turns out that Jerry, as the dog is called, is not an ordinary dog, because it can not bark, but on the other hand it can speak. The crafty toy maker Uncle Grandfather and his henchman Uncle Harry would like to grab Jerry, and it involves various conflicts involving a cheeky dog trader, an unlucky glazier and a distinct police cops.', 'Hannibal is a nice and polite boy, but Father and Mother think he hangs too much in front of the television. They therefore give him the dog Jerry, whom he is very pleased with. It turns out that Jerry, as the dog is called, is not an ordinary dog, because it can not bark, but on the other hand it can speak. The crafty toy maker Uncle Grandfather and his henchman Uncle Harry would like to grab Jerry, and it involves various conflicts involving a cheeky dog trader, an unlucky glazier and a distinct police cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwgxjnE5Kj8FlgwQEXH8PMWYDbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116357'),
  ('404059994544353008', 'Hannibal Brooks', 1969, 'Comedy, War', 'Michael Winner, Michael Dryhurst, Udo Graf Lambsdorff', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'Oliver Reed, Michael J. Pollard, Wolfgang Preiss, Karin Baal, Helmuth Lohner, Peter Carsten, Ralf Wolter, Jürgen Draeger', 'PG-13', 'A POW in World War II is put to work in a Munich zoo, looking after an Asian elephant. The zoo is bombed by the Americans and the director of the zoo decides it is not safe for his Asian elephant Lucy to remain there. So he sends Brooks to safety with Lucy. They escape and go on the run in order to get to Switzerland.', 'A POW in World War II is put to work in a Munich zoo, looking after an Asian elephant. The zoo is bombed by the Americans and the director of the zoo decides it is not safe for his Asian elephant Lucy to remain there. So he sends Brooks to safety with Lucy. They escape and go on the run in order to get to Switzerland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4wG7BG6anYd4XTyKZ75N6ZEJt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26972'),
  ('949657090826673055', 'Hannibal Buress: Comedy Camisado', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Lance Bangs, Cliff Charles', 'Hannibal Buress', 'Hannibal Buress', 'R', 'He''s a kamikaze gambler. A one-arm cuddler. And if his fly is down, so be it. A night of sly riffs and slow burns.', 'He''s a kamikaze gambler. A one-arm cuddler. And if his fly is down, so be it. A night of sly riffs and slow burns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUuUA4eA3aAwKOrP6JL3vcna6fg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378137'),
  ('411224705683910021', 'Hannibal Hopkins & Sir Anthony', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Clara Kuperberg, Julia Kuperberg', null, 'Anthony Hopkins, Elisabeth Wautlet, Francis Ford Coppola, Billy Crystal, Steven Spielberg, James Ivory, Annie Muriel Hopkins, Richard Arthur Hopkins', null, 'Hopkins’ career has spanned several decades, which is why we will also use many interviews that he gave throughout his life, allowing us to put him back into the context of each period and will be helpful in understanding his role in the history of cinema, because he was far from following the trends. He never belonged to any film movement; he is a chameleon that has always preferred natural acting, ‘non-acting’ when method acting was the fashion.', 'Hopkins’ career has spanned several decades, which is why we will also use many interviews that he gave throughout his life, allowing us to put him back into the context of each period and will be helpful in understanding his role in the history of cinema, because he was far from following the trends. He never belonged to any film movement; he is a chameleon that has always preferred natural acting, ‘non-acting’ when method acting was the fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ADPaqb6QBsZpG7fRWYOULVZMto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846652'),
  ('698484216561673528', 'Hannibal Rising', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Peter Webber, Samantha Smith McGrady, Miranda Colman', 'Thomas Harris', 'Gaspard Ulliel, Aaran Thomas, Gong Li, Dominic West, Rhys Ifans, Richard Brake, Kevin McKidd, Stephen Walters', 'R', 'The story of the early, murderous roots of the cannibalistic killer, Hannibal Lecter – from his hard-scrabble Lithuanian childhood, where he witnesses the repulsive lengths to which hungry soldiers will go to satiate themselves, through his sojourn in France, where as a medical student he hones his appetite for the kill.', 'The story of the early, murderous roots of the cannibalistic killer, Hannibal Lecter – from his hard-scrabble Lithuanian childhood, where he witnesses the repulsive lengths to which hungry soldiers will go to satiate themselves, through his sojourn in France, where as a medical student he hones his appetite for the kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FTDMQoac0uqJUquZk4KenDzLMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248'),
  ('324200449550175275', 'Hannibal: A March on Rome', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Carsten Gutschmidt, Judith Voelker, Cora Szielasko', 'Simone Schillinger', 'Josef Tratnik', null, 'Even today it is considered one of the greatest military feats ever. In 218 BC, a Carthaginian army of ninety thousand men and three dozen elephants set out to cross the Alps to challenge the might of Rome. The exact route chosen by Hannibal, its charismatic commander, has been a matter of dispute ever since. Now, researchers believe they might be able to track his route. It is one of the mysteries of history, which way the Carthaginian commander Hannibal took in 218 BC to cross the Alps.', 'Even today it is considered one of the greatest military feats ever. In 218 BC, a Carthaginian army of ninety thousand men and three dozen elephants set out to cross the Alps to challenge the might of Rome. The exact route chosen by Hannibal, its charismatic commander, has been a matter of dispute ever since. Now, researchers believe they might be able to track his route. It is one of the mysteries of history, which way the Carthaginian commander Hannibal took in 218 BC to cross the Alps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHsN8vVwyy2tc6rHDY3RDUOM2JA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513014'),
  ('238250889436937597', 'Hannibal: Rome''s Worst Nightmare', 2006, 'History, Action, TV Movie', 'Edward Bazalgette', null, 'Alexander Siddig, Emilio Doorgasingh, Bashar Rahal, Mido Hamada, Shaun Dingwall, Rob Dixon, Tristan Gemmill, Vincent Riotta', null, 'It is 200 years before the birth of Christ and Rome is the new superpower of the ancient world. She believes she is invincible - but one man is destined to change that. He is a man bound by oath to avenge the wrongs inflicted on his home and, in pursuit of revenge, he will stop at nothing. Hannibal explores the man behind the myth, revealing what drove the 26-year-old to mastermind one of the most audacious military moves in history. With 40,000 soldiers and 37 elephants, he marched 1,500 miles to challenge his enemies on their own soil. It was an act so daring that few people believed it possible.', 'It is 200 years before the birth of Christ and Rome is the new superpower of the ancient world. She believes she is invincible - but one man is destined to change that. He is a man bound by oath to avenge the wrongs inflicted on his home and, in pursuit of revenge, he will stop at nothing. Hannibal explores the man behind the myth, revealing what drove the 26-year-old to mastermind one of the most audacious military moves in history. With 40,000 soldiers and 37 elephants, he marched 1,500 miles to challenge his enemies on their own soil. It was an act so daring that few people believed it possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2FTj9DrSuaA3AM7Xt5LmnaPmZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45776'),
  ('215415620869661450', 'Hannie Caulder', 1971, 'Drama, Western, Crime', 'Burt Kennedy, Edward Scaife, Julio Sempere', 'David Haft, Burt Kennedy', 'Raquel Welch, Robert Culp, Ernest Borgnine, Jack Elam, Strother Martin, Christopher Lee, Diana Dors, Stephen Boyd', 'R', 'After she''s raped by the outlaw trio who murdered her husband, a frontierswoman hires a bounty hunter to instruct her in the ways of a gun in order to exact her revenge.', 'After she''s raped by the outlaw trio who murdered her husband, a frontierswoman hires a bounty hunter to instruct her in the ways of a gun in order to exact her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIjlG2lFDzBimhsPzuSnBXywWpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31283'),
  ('137185854491293544', 'Hanoi, Tuesday 13th', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Santiago Álvarez, Iván Nápoles', 'José Martí, Santiago Álvarez', 'Lyndon B. Johnson', null, 'In December 1967, a Cuban film crew led by Santiago Alvarez, the veteran polemicist, travelled to Hanoi. They shot the footage which constitutes this short documentary all in one day - Tuesday 13. The film is the story of that day and what happened to the North Vietnamese people in the course of it.', 'In December 1967, a Cuban film crew led by Santiago Alvarez, the veteran polemicist, travelled to Hanoi. They shot the footage which constitutes this short documentary all in one day - Tuesday 13. The film is the story of that day and what happened to the North Vietnamese people in the course of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCjY6Dnkj5hA7ERyDLujlErJxg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151490'),
  ('118326201515751845', 'Hanover Street', 1979, 'Drama, Romance, War, Action, Adventure', 'Peter Hyams, David Watkin', 'Peter Hyams', 'Harrison Ford, Lesley-Anne Down, Christopher Plummer, Alec McCowen, Max Wall, Patsy Kensit, Shane Rimmer, Sherrie Hewson', 'PG', 'Margaret is a nurse in England during WW2, and married to a secret agent. Things get complicated when she falls for David, an American pilot.', 'Margaret is a nurse in England during WW2, and married to a secret agent. Things get complicated when she falls for David, an American pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8esk5JZ2ARFF7YFGVgyFalJL86M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26659'),
  ('914309210533707191', 'Hans Christian Andersen', 1952, 'Music, Family, Comedy', 'Harry Stradling Sr., Charles Vidor', 'Moss Hart', 'Danny Kaye, Farley Granger, Zizi Jeanmaire, Joseph Walsh, Philip Tonge, John Qualen, Erik Bruhn, Roland Petit', 'NR', 'A small-town shoemaker with a knack for spinning yarns, Hans encounters happiness and heartbreak on his road to becoming a full-fledged writer.', 'A small-town shoemaker with a knack for spinning yarns, Hans encounters happiness and heartbreak on his road to becoming a full-fledged writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auHA8xsD452GDCY2KdHGgYPmDPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16618'),
  ('136721931244125990', 'Hans Christian Andersen''s The Little Mermaid', 1975, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Tim Reid, Tomoharu Katsumata, Reiko Okuyama', 'Ikuko Ōyabu, Mieko Osanai', 'Fumie Kashiyama, Mariko Miyagi, Tarō Shigaki, Ichiro Nagai, Kenichi Ogata, Haruko Kitahama, Miyoko Aso, Kazuko Sugiyama', 'NR', 'The story of a beautiful mermaid who gave up a kingdom for her beloved prince.', 'The story of a beautiful mermaid who gave up a kingdom for her beloved prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPuRx5wxlWixvAxy55EhDbmJGTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59593'),
  ('280083121880887883', 'Hans Zimmer & Friends: Diamond in the Desert', 2025, 'Music, Documentary', 'Paul Dugdale, Brett Turnbull', null, 'Hans Zimmer, Billie Eilish, Christopher Nolan, Denis Villeneuve, FINNEAS, Jerry Bruckheimer, Johnny Marr, Pharrell Williams', 'NR', 'An extraordinary live performance of Hans Zimmer''s most beloved and renowned movie soundtracks, including music from Dune, Gladiator, Interstellar, and The Lion King. Featuring conversations with creative collaborators Billie Eilish, Christopher Nolan, Denis Villeneuve, Finneas, Jerry Bruckheimer, Pharrell Williams, Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, and more.', 'An extraordinary live performance of Hans Zimmer''s most beloved and renowned movie soundtracks, including music from Dune, Gladiator, Interstellar, and The Lion King. Featuring conversations with creative collaborators Billie Eilish, Christopher Nolan, Denis Villeneuve, Finneas, Jerry Bruckheimer, Pharrell Williams, Timothée Chalamet, Zendaya, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAbU0BuIQa6CUPOqsvUoPK39apD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1425725'),
  ('268120553864947356', 'Hansan: Rising Dragon', 2022, 'War, Action, Drama, History', 'Kim Tae-sung, Kim Gyeong-seok, Jo Gyeong-hun', 'Kim Han-min, Yoon Hong-gi, Lee Na-ra', 'Park Hae-il, Byun Yo-han, Ahn Sung-ki, Son Hyun-joo, Kim Sung-kyu, Kim Sung-kyun, Kim Hyang-gi, Ok Taec-yeon', null, 'In 1592, admiral Yi Sun-sin and his fleet face off against the might of the invading Japanese navy and its formidable warships. As the Korean forces fall into crisis, the admiral resorts to using his secret weapon, the dragon head ships known as geobukseon, in order to change the tide of this epic battle at sea.', 'In 1592, admiral Yi Sun-sin and his fleet face off against the might of the invading Japanese navy and its formidable warships. As the Korean forces fall into crisis, the admiral resorts to using his secret weapon, the dragon head ships known as geobukseon, in order to change the tide of this epic battle at sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vH76IrIrZLHmO0WOD4U7nxBHgkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588108'),
  ('29882797853108877', 'Hansel & Gretel', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Gary J. Tunnicliffe, Brian Baugh', 'Jonathan Bogner, Gary J. Tunnicliffe, Timothy Dolan', 'Howie Mandel, Taylor Momsen, Jacob Smith, Delta Burke, Alana Austin, Gerald McRaney, Lynn Redgrave, Dakota Fanning', 'PG', 'Hansel and Gretel is a 2002 film adaptation of the Brothers Grimm children''s story. It stars Jacob Smith and Taylor Momsen as the eponymous characters. It includes the Sandman, played by Howie Mandel and Sinbad as a raven.', 'Hansel and Gretel is a 2002 film adaptation of the Brothers Grimm children''s story. It stars Jacob Smith and Taylor Momsen as the eponymous characters. It includes the Sandman, played by Howie Mandel and Sinbad as a raven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNY4aIyVuYnQWu1dGWds0nGeCBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49872'),
  ('504091567545022943', 'Hansel & Gretel', 2007, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Yim Pil-sung, Shin Sang-yeul, Kim Ji-yong', 'Kim Min-Sook', 'Chun Jung-myung, Eun Won-jae, Shim Eun-kyung, Jin Ji-hee, Park Hee-soon, Jang Young-nam, Kim Kyung-ik, Go Joon-hee', null, 'When Eun-soo gets lost in a country road, he meets a mysterious girl and is led to her fairytale ike house in the middle of the forest. There, Eun-soo is trapped with the girl and her siblings who never age. Eun-soo finally discovers a way out which is written on a fairy tale book. But the book tells a story of none other than himself!', 'When Eun-soo gets lost in a country road, he meets a mysterious girl and is led to her fairytale ike house in the middle of the forest. There, Eun-soo is trapped with the girl and her siblings who never age. Eun-soo finally discovers a way out which is written on a fairy tale book. But the book tells a story of none other than himself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iW7VspFI5yJxFZImQWZiNGuATaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25597'),
  ('236257152504519060', 'Hansel & Gretel', 2013, 'Horror', 'Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Jose Prendes', 'Dee Wallace, Stephanie Greco, Brent Lydic, Jasper Cole, Sara Fletcher, M. Steven Felty, Clark Perry, Frank Giarmona', 'PG-13', 'In this modern retelling of the classic horror tale, teen siblings are enslaved by a psychotic recluse within her gruesome house of horrors in the woods.', 'In this modern retelling of the classic horror tale, teen siblings are enslaved by a psychotic recluse within her gruesome house of horrors in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/I0emCZ9h9WIJLnZqDYP5MZJgwH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200462'),
  ('1056457569344385690', 'Hansel & Gretel: After Ever After', 2021, 'Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Noel Corbally, Andy Lumsden, Dan Zeff', 'David Walliams, Kevin Cecil', 'Lilly Aspell, Bill Bekele, Sophie Thompson, David Walliams, Robert Ryan, Mark Addy, Sheridan Smith, Lewis Macleod', null, 'Hansel and Gretel have fled the gingerbread house, but what if the wicked witch survived after all?', 'Hansel and Gretel have fled the gingerbread house, but what if the wicked witch survived after all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVAliRzR7fkZkrgderna2AN7mMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917376'),
  ('748934814533323369', 'Hansel & Gretel: Witch Hunters', 2013, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action', 'Tommy Wirkola, Michael Bonvillain, Andreas Olshausen', 'Tommy Wirkola', 'Jeremy Renner, Gemma Arterton, Famke Janssen, Pihla Viitala, Derek Mears, Robin Atkin Downes, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Joanna Kulig', 'R', 'After getting a taste for blood as children, Hansel and Gretel have become the ultimate vigilantes, hell-bent on retribution. Now, unbeknownst to them, Hansel and Gretel have become the hunted, and must face an evil far greater than witches... their past.', 'After getting a taste for blood as children, Hansel and Gretel have become the ultimate vigilantes, hell-bent on retribution. Now, unbeknownst to them, Hansel and Gretel have become the hunted, and must face an evil far greater than witches... their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j343Rpj3WeNvP0SV80zveve70io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60304'),
  ('275981922609723869', 'Hansel and Gretel', 1983, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tim Burton, Victor Abdalov', 'Julie Hickson', 'Michael Yama, Andy Lee, Alison Hong, Jim Ishida, Joe Ranft, David Koenigsberg, Linda Gary, Vincent Price', null, 'Tim Burton''s reimagined classic combines live action and stop motion, making for a creepy adventure into the woods. It is known for having aired only once on Disney Channel, on Halloween Night in 1983.', 'Tim Burton''s reimagined classic combines live action and stop motion, making for a creepy adventure into the woods. It is known for having aired only once on Disney Channel, on Halloween Night in 1983.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1l3o2CDJBKlpSWzuH3V9R3UaMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82309'),
  ('1142577942463820948', 'Hansel and Gretel', 1988, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Len Talan, Ilan Rosenberg, Avner Orshalimy', 'Nancy Weems, Len Talan', 'Hugh Pollard, Nicola Stapleton, Cloris Leachman, David Warner, Emily Richard, Susie Miller, Eugene Kline, Warren W. Feigin', null, 'Hansel and Gretel tells the tale of two young children driven from home by their scolding mother. Losing their way in the dark forest they stumble upon the cottage of a kindly old woman. But is this kindly old woman everything she seems...?', 'Hansel and Gretel tells the tale of two young children driven from home by their scolding mother. Losing their way in the dark forest they stumble upon the cottage of a kindly old woman. But is this kindly old woman everything she seems...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7JGa8XRHtBgDcIOnQp9ZMJu5yr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72984'),
  ('1103065305108867891', 'Hansel and Gretel', 1990, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Giovanni Simonelli, Silvano Tessicini', 'Giovanni Simonelli', 'Elisabete Pimenta Boaretto, Lucia Prato, Gaetano Russo, Giorgio Cerioni, Paul Müller, Maurice Poli, Silvia Cipollone, Massimiliano Cipollone', null, 'A farming community make their money through kidnapping children and selling their vital organs on the black market.', 'A farming community make their money through kidnapping children and selling their vital organs on the black market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YpUgnsLigdVWLvOsXgIwenPhVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29184'),
  ('850466275094129705', 'Hansel and Gretel Get Baked', 2013, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Duane Journey, John Smith', 'David Tillman', 'Molly C. Quinn, Michael Welch, Lara Flynn Boyle, Cary Elwes, Lochlyn Munro, Yancy Butler, Bianca Saad, Edward Zo', 'R', 'An intense new marijuana strain named “Black Forest” is taking Los Angeles by storm, and Gretel’s stoner boyfriend can’t get enough. But when the old woman growing the popular drug turns out to be an evil witch, cooking and eating her wasted patrons for their youth, Gretel and her brother Hansel must save him from a gruesome death — or face the last high of their lives.', 'An intense new marijuana strain named “Black Forest” is taking Los Angeles by storm, and Gretel’s stoner boyfriend can’t get enough. But when the old woman growing the popular drug turns out to be an evil witch, cooking and eating her wasted patrons for their youth, Gretel and her brother Hansel must save him from a gruesome death — or face the last high of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shYb3LezqJF4P90CGgp9zoD2MjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165864'),
  ('60328676936615474', 'Hänsel und Gretel', 2006, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Anne Wild, Wojciech Szepel', 'Peter Schwindt', 'Nastassja Revvo, Johann Storm, Henning Peker, Claudia Geisler-Bading, Christian Habicht, Christian Steyer, Sibylle Canonica', null, 'Brothers Grimms'' fairy tale about Hansel and Gretel, brother and sister, who struggle against the witches.', 'Brothers Grimms'' fairy tale about Hansel and Gretel, brother and sister, who struggle against the witches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfr31DqgMyr6v4SSNRIzCRiWgaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99475'),
  ('97785730515598330', 'Hanson and the Beast', 2017, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Wang Boxue, Xiao Yang, Viktor Petrov', null, 'Liu Yifei, William Feng, Li Guangjie, Guo Jingfei, Jiao Junyan, Xiong Naijin, Wang Shuangbao, Chen Yumi', null, 'Yuan Shuai, a debt-ridden animal-breeder, tries to get out of his financial predicament by finding a wealthy girlfriend through matchmaking dates. He unexpectedly meets and fall in love with the fox demon, Bai Xianchu, who has arrived to the mortal realm to repay her gratitude. However, the head of the Demon tribe Yun Zhonghe forbids a love relationship between a demon and a human; and takes Bai Xianchu away. To seek his lover, Yuan Shuai bravely crashes the demonic world.', 'Yuan Shuai, a debt-ridden animal-breeder, tries to get out of his financial predicament by finding a wealthy girlfriend through matchmaking dates. He unexpectedly meets and fall in love with the fox demon, Bai Xianchu, who has arrived to the mortal realm to repay her gratitude. However, the head of the Demon tribe Yun Zhonghe forbids a love relationship between a demon and a human; and takes Bai Xianchu away. To seek his lover, Yuan Shuai bravely crashes the demonic world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs4kWMWg5SWoqdQsP3EmY8LetLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492317'),
  ('430126795605376944', 'Hanu-Man', 2024, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Dasaradhi Sivendra, Prasanth Varma', 'Prasanth Varma', 'Teja Sajja, Vinay Rai, Amritha Aiyer, Varalaxmi Sarathkumar, Vennela Kishore, Getup Srinu, Deepak Shetty, Samuthirakani', null, 'In a small village, Hanumanthu, a petty thief, finds a mysterious gem, that gives him god-like powers. Will he succeed in keeping these powers from falling into the wrong hands and save his village?', 'In a small village, Hanumanthu, a petty thief, finds a mysterious gem, that gives him god-like powers. Will he succeed in keeping these powers from falling into the wrong hands and save his village?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1zq48rWSXxplzoJR8YtbXWnnHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869760'),
  ('1023346934310292042', 'Hanukkah on Rye', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ken Krawczyk, Peter DeLuise', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Jeremy Jordan, Yael Grobglas, Linda Darlow, David Eisner, Lisa Horner, Harry Nelken, Paula Shaw, Tim Nhlazane', 'G', 'A matchmaker connects Molly and Jacob, but their new romance is put to the test when they realize that they are competing deli owners. Will a Hanukkah miracle keep them together?', 'A matchmaker connects Molly and Jacob, but their new romance is put to the test when they realize that they are competing deli owners. Will a Hanukkah miracle keep them together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeVO65IjVBlMwObN2LSFCsoLlz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028555'),
  ('640317081429044374', 'Hanuman', 1998, 'Adventure, Family, Romance, Fantasy', 'Frédéric Fougea, Bernard Lutic', 'Michel Fessler, Frédéric Fougea, Eric Collins', 'Robert Cavanah, Tabu, Nathalie Auffret, Khalid Tyabji, Sidney Kean, Javed Jaffrey, Nithya Menen', null, 'Hanuman is the most lovable baby monkey one can imagine. He meets Tom who comes to visit the temple in the Valley of Monkeys and tries to protect it from the robbers. A warm relationship develops between the two.', 'Hanuman is the most lovable baby monkey one can imagine. He meets Tom who comes to visit the temple in the Valley of Monkeys and tries to protect it from the robbers. A warm relationship develops between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Awj3a9EGjNGrEFAQ9iBmF6gBnJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85998'),
  ('115700727398160941', 'Hanuman', 2005, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'V.G. Samant', 'Sulekha Bajpai, Milind Ukey, Shantanu Ganesh Rode', 'Mukesh Khanna, Chiranjeevi, Shahnawaz Pradhan, Viraj Adhav, Sumeet Pathak, Mona Ghosh Shetty, Rajesh Jolly, Manoj Pandey', null, 'After being granted immortality by the Hindu gods -- including his father, Vayu, the god of the wind -- Hanuman sets off on an epic journey.', 'After being granted immortality by the Hindu gods -- including his father, Vayu, the god of the wind -- Hanuman sets off on an epic journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnGhItGVyiet1Um0y2qfgEHihg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16111'),
  ('1149819511751840710', 'Hanuman and the Seven Ultramen', 1974, 'Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Shohei Tôjô, Sompote Sands, Kazuo Sagawa', 'Bunzô Wakatsuki, P. Piml', 'Sanit Kaewadee, Ouab Somchat, Yodchai Meksuwan, Pawana Chanajit, Sripouk, Srisuriya, Kaan Boonchoo, Prida Somthobsuuk', null, 'After a valiant Thai boy is brutally murdered by a gang of archeological looters, his soul is joined with the Hindu god Hanuman, who teams up with Ultraman and his brethren against familiar Ultra-foes unleashed by a weather control experiment gone awry, in this influential Thai-Japanese co-production.', 'After a valiant Thai boy is brutally murdered by a gang of archeological looters, his soul is joined with the Hindu god Hanuman, who teams up with Ultraman and his brethren against familiar Ultra-foes unleashed by a weather control experiment gone awry, in this influential Thai-Japanese co-production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aap7ygcvSIcVEiE9IqTw7a4XJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217086'),
  ('15749045072094091', 'Hanussen', 1988, 'Science Fiction, History, Drama, Fantasy', 'István Szabó, Lajos Koltai, Miklósné Miklós', 'István Szabó, Péter Dobai', 'Klaus Maria Brandauer, Erland Josephson, Ildikó Bánsági, Walter Schmidinger, Károly Eperjes, Grażyna Szapołowska, Colette Pilz-Warren, Adrianna Biedrzyńska', null, 'A man''s story parallels Hitler''s rise. Austrian Klaus Schneider, wounded in World War I, recovers in the care of Dr. Emil Bettleheim. Bettleheim discovers that Schneider possesses powers of empathy and of clairvoyance, such that could aid suicidal patients. After the war, with one friend as his manager and another as his lover, Schneider changes his name to Eric Jan Hanussen and goes to Berlin, as a hypnotist and clairvoyant performing in halls and theaters. He always speaks the truth, which brings him to the attention of powerful Nazis. He predicts their rise (good propaganda for them) and their violence (not so good). He''s in pain and at risk. What is Hanussen''s future?', 'A man''s story parallels Hitler''s rise. Austrian Klaus Schneider, wounded in World War I, recovers in the care of Dr. Emil Bettleheim. Bettleheim discovers that Schneider possesses powers of empathy and of clairvoyance, such that could aid suicidal patients. After the war, with one friend as his manager and another as his lover, Schneider changes his name to Eric Jan Hanussen and goes to Berlin, as a hypnotist and clairvoyant performing in halls and theaters. He always speaks the truth, which brings him to the attention of powerful Nazis. He predicts their rise (good propaganda for them) and their violence (not so good). He''s in pain and at risk. What is Hanussen''s future?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdehGdaBe86j9PRScCeyae1K0qB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29932'),
  ('190228391907817175', 'Hanzo', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Zeki Ökten, Hüseyin Özşahin', 'Suphi Tekniker', 'Kemal Sunal, Meral Zeren, Adile Naşit, Mümtaz Ener, Atilla Ergün, Ayşen Gruda, Ünal Gürel, Ajlan Aktuğ', null, 'Hanzo, who was lost as a baby and raised by bears in the wild forest, behaving like them, is captured one day by a group that comes to the village for excavation.', 'Hanzo, who was lost as a baby and raised by bears in the wild forest, behaving like them, is captured one day by a group that comes to the village for excavation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjEtA8AU6HudO8R8BYQojLGRlTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101217'),
  ('1011249343729210942', 'Hanzo the Razor: Sword of Justice', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Toshihiro Nabei, Chikashi Makiura', 'Kazuo Koike', 'Shintarō Katsu, Yukiji Asaoka, Mari Atsumi, Kō Nishimura, Akira Yamanouchi, Kamatari Fujiwara, Akiji Kobayashi, Zenpei Saga', null, 'Fearless Edo-period police inspector Hanzo Itami, nicknamed The Razor, has developed his own unique way of extracting information for his inquiries. His first adventure sees him investigating his superior officer''s mistress, whom he suspects of having ties with a reputed criminal on the loose.', 'Fearless Edo-period police inspector Hanzo Itami, nicknamed The Razor, has developed his own unique way of extracting information for his inquiries. His first adventure sees him investigating his superior officer''s mistress, whom he suspects of having ties with a reputed criminal on the loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5D8HTMkSJE3ul87D6pAeyXPqqxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17099'),
  ('1035009063026351835', 'Hanzo the Razor: The Snare', 1973, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Yasuzō Masumura', 'Shintarō Katsu, Toshio Kurosawa, Kō Nishimura, Kei Satō, Kazuko Inano, Keizo Kanie, Shin Kishida, Hōsei Komatsu', null, 'Against the backdrop of the Edo treasury devaluing currency and driving many into poverty, Hanzo Itami enforces the law without regard to status. He shows inadequate respect to the treasurer, who wants him dead.', 'Against the backdrop of the Edo treasury devaluing currency and driving many into poverty, Hanzo Itami enforces the law without regard to status. He shows inadequate respect to the treasurer, who wants him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvlWwZLgR2Ut1fUVSgoRJJyoOZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17128'),
  ('103045810206404270', 'Hanzo the Razor: Who''s Got the Gold?', 1974, 'Action, Drama', 'Yoshio Inoue', 'Yasuzō Masumura', 'Shintarō Katsu, Kō Nishimura, Mako Midori, Mikio Narita, Etsushi Takahashi, Daigo Kusano, Keizo Kanie, Asao Koike', null, 'Hanzo extracts a confession from a ghost using his assaulting methods, foils thieves, connects with Heisuke Takei a friend from his youth, offers protection to a forward-thinking physician Genan Sugino who has defamed his ruler, discovers a pleasure ring of young wives and a blind music teacher, and cuckolds a corrupt official under his very nose.', 'Hanzo extracts a confession from a ghost using his assaulting methods, foils thieves, connects with Heisuke Takei a friend from his youth, offers protection to a forward-thinking physician Genan Sugino who has defamed his ruler, discovers a pleasure ring of young wives and a blind music teacher, and cuckolds a corrupt official under his very nose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WJSNY14pA1ZlfcJD2auVqQ7Y5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17129'),
  ('143598494072085857', 'Hapax Legomena I: Nostalgia', 1971, 'Drama', 'Hollis Frampton', null, 'Michael Snow', null, 'Michael Snow narrates a series of Hollis Frampton''s photographs (speaking as Frampton, in the first person)—as each picture catches fire on a hot plate.', 'Michael Snow narrates a series of Hollis Frampton''s photographs (speaking as Frampton, in the first person)—as each picture catches fire on a hot plate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPQLcTNwOcoxKk7OfkTgz15Eqyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132161'),
  ('666979961746182810', 'Hapax Legomena II: Poetic Justice', 1972, 'Romance, Documentary', 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'Poetic Justice presents the viewer with an ordinary domestic scene: a stack of papers, a cup of coffee, and a potted cactus on a table. The sheets of paper compose a script that provides handwritten, frame-by-frame instructions for a film that unfolds only in the mind of the viewer.', 'Poetic Justice presents the viewer with an ordinary domestic scene: a stack of papers, a cup of coffee, and a potted cactus on a table. The sheets of paper compose a script that provides handwritten, frame-by-frame instructions for a film that unfolds only in the mind of the viewer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1EKOBNr10oElFjmGS1oraCVdBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145497'),
  ('925384245247606110', 'Hapax Legomena III: Critical Mass', 1971, 'Drama', 'Hollis Frampton', null, 'Frank Albetta, Barbara DiBenedetto', null, 'A man and a woman have been living together for six months. After disappearing for two days, the man returns and acts as if nothing has happened, refusing to say where he was.', 'A man and a woman have been living together for six months. After disappearing for two days, the man returns and acts as if nothing has happened, refusing to say where he was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfxL61IWFGIcn2723btrNU6JYi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151002'),
  ('864801968367840518', 'Hapkido', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Huang Feng, Shen Yuen, Danny Lee Yau-Tong', 'Ho Jen', 'Angela Mao Ying, Carter Huang Chia-Ta, Pai Ying, Ji Han-Jae, Nancy Sit Ka-Yin, Wei Ping-Ao, Hwang In-shik, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'R', 'Yu Ying, Kao and Fan return to China to start a martial arts school but are bullied by the Japanese competitor who runs the Black Bear school. The harassment leads to intense conflicts between them.', 'Yu Ying, Kao and Fan return to China to start a martial arts school but are bullied by the Japanese competitor who runs the Black Bear school. The harassment leads to intense conflicts between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT1OV1HZShs1j01D7RY342F0ivX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36682'),
  ('194930532426993498', 'Happening', 2021, 'Drama', 'Laurent Tangy, Audrey Diwan', 'Audrey Diwan, Marcia Romano', 'Anamaria Vartolomei, Kacey Mottet Klein, Luàna Bajrami, Louise Orry-Diquéro, Pio Marmaï, Sandrine Bonnaire, Cyril Metzger, Anna Mouglalis', 'R', 'France, 1963. Anne is a bright young student with a promising future ahead of her. But when she falls pregnant, she sees the opportunity to finish her studies and escape the constraints of her social background disappearing. With her final exams fast approaching and her belly growing, Anne resolves to act, even if she has to confront shame and pain, even if she must risk prison to do so.', 'France, 1963. Anne is a bright young student with a promising future ahead of her. But when she falls pregnant, she sees the opportunity to finish her studies and escape the constraints of her social background disappearing. With her final exams fast approaching and her belly growing, Anne resolves to act, even if she has to confront shame and pain, even if she must risk prison to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2lTAmLYpWpd8JxtJrMXFFGV9gZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793998'),
  ('646247933508509151', 'Happenstance', 2000, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Laurent Firode, Jean-René Duveau', 'Laurent Firode', 'Audrey Tautou, Faudel, Éric Savin, Nathalie Besançon, Lysiane Meis, Irène Ismaïloff, Éric Feldman, Frédéric Bouraly', null, 'How, thanks to what''s known as the "Butterfly theory" (a random series of unlinked events), can a young woman and a young man meet?', 'How, thanks to what''s known as the "Butterfly theory" (a random series of unlinked events), can a young woman and a young man meet?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS0D6cQ30kt1lz3YuRrBJnfwxzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24908'),
  ('486440109019713771', 'Happier Than Ever: A Love Letter to Los Angeles', 2021, 'Music, Documentary', 'Robert Rodriguez, Pablo Berron, Patrick Osborne', null, 'Billie Eilish, Gustavo Dudamel, FINNEAS, Romero Lubambo', 'PG', 'Fresh off the heels of her brand-new album, "Happier Than Ever," this cinematic concert experience features an intimate performance of every song in the album''s sequential order – for the first and only time – from the stage of the legendary Hollywood Bowl.', 'Fresh off the heels of her brand-new album, "Happier Than Ever," this cinematic concert experience features an intimate performance of every song in the album''s sequential order – for the first and only time – from the stage of the legendary Hollywood Bowl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0f9sDiwYlEtfhUWxc5F2ZW7wfq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853088'),
  ('470252887808233403', 'Happiest Season', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim H. Winther, Clea DuVall, Alyssa Batchelor', 'Clea DuVall, Mary Holland', 'Kristen Stewart, Mackenzie Davis, Mary Steenburgen, Victor Garber, Alison Brie, Mary Holland, Dan Levy, Burl Moseley', 'PG-13', 'A young woman''s plans to propose to her girlfriend while at her family''s annual holiday party are upended when she discovers her partner hasn''t yet come out to her conservative parents.', 'A young woman''s plans to propose to her girlfriend while at her family''s annual holiday party are upended when she discovers her partner hasn''t yet come out to her conservative parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzec9kkOSE93tygyfOktedkeOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520172'),
  ('161427869866562444', 'Happily', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael S. Chandler, Ricky Dean Monsey, Ian Campbell', 'BenDavid Grabinski', 'Kerry Bishé, Joel McHale, Al Madrigal, Natalie Zea, Paul Scheer, Stephen Root, Natalie Morales, Jon Daly', 'R', 'Tom and Janet have been happily married for years. But a visit from a mysterious stranger leads to a dead body, a lot of questions, and a tense couples'' trip with friends who may not actually be friends at all.', 'Tom and Janet have been happily married for years. But a visit from a mysterious stranger leads to a dead body, a lot of questions, and a tense couples'' trip with friends who may not actually be friends at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCV98jOIxwd0SMICfHFNcuo5CHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673319'),
  ('173958199647942211', 'Happily Ever After', 1989, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'John Howley', 'Martha Moran, Robby London', 'Irene Cara, Malcolm McDowell, Dom DeLuise, Carol Channing, Phyllis Diller, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Linda Gary, Ed Asner', 'G', 'In the aftermath of her more famous adventure, Snow White must team up with the dwarves'' seven female cousins to battle the late Evil Queen''s warlock brother and rescue the captured Prince.', 'In the aftermath of her more famous adventure, Snow White must team up with the dwarves'' seven female cousins to battle the late Evil Queen''s warlock brother and rescue the captured Prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCwebz8P7m5nq4r5XuKetqp3Gdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44283'),
