  ('858229964172451045', 'Happily Married', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Aluizio Abranches, Júnior Malta', null, 'Alexandre Borges, Camila Morgado, Bianca Comparato, Christine Fernandes, Luíza Mariani, João Gabriel Vasconcellos, Ingra Lyberato, Augusto Madeira', null, 'Heitor is a bachelor who shoots fancy weddings for a living, but gets in trouble when he meets Penélope, a woman desperate to stop her lover''s wedding.', 'Heitor is a bachelor who shoots fancy weddings for a living, but gets in trouble when he meets Penélope, a woman desperate to stop her lover''s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7VFTAlo6IEs83OwP3qWG1ZGfQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363733'),
  ('719315373904664506', 'Happily Mixed Up', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Alessandro Pesci, Matteo Russo', 'Edoardo Falcone, Massimiliano Bruno', 'Claudio Bisio, Marco Giallini, Anna Foglietta, Paola Minaccioni, Caterina Guzzanti, Pietro Sermonti, Massimiliano Bruno, Rocco Papaleo', null, 'A psychoanalyst learns to have an illness and as a consequence he decides to quit his job. All his patients get together to find a way to make him feel better.', 'A psychoanalyst learns to have an illness and as a consequence he decides to quit his job. All his patients get together to find a way to make him feel better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xDDVnfrSDTMXgdnH5m9kY8qE09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299847'),
  ('464360795838693061', 'Happily N''Ever After', 2007, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Dino Athanassiou, Yvette Kaplan, David Dulac', 'Robert Moreland', 'George Carlin, Andy Dick, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Lisa Kaplan, Michael McShane, Rob Paulsen, Freddie Prinze Jr., Wallace Shawn', 'PG', 'An alliance of evil-doers, led by Frieda, looks to take over Fairy Tale Land. But when Ella realizes her stepmother is out to ruin her storybook existence, she takes a dramatic turn and blossoms into the leader of the resistance effort.', 'An alliance of evil-doers, led by Frieda, looks to take over Fairy Tale Land. But when Ella realizes her stepmother is out to ruin her storybook existence, she takes a dramatic turn and blossoms into the leader of the resistance effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOOlHRhdEoJbPNE1jpocNawjnc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5393'),
