  ('665084104001160100', 'Happiness', 1935, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aleksandr Medvedkin, Gleb Troyanski', 'Aleksandr Medvedkin', 'Pyotr Zinovyev, Yelena Yegorova, Viktor Kulakov, Nikolai Cherkasov, Mikhail Gipsi, Lyubov Nenasheva, V. Lavrentyev, V. Uspensky', null, 'A hapless loser (with the surname of Loser) undergoes misadventures with avaracious clergy, a tired horse, and a walking granary (among other things) on his road to collectivized happiness.', 'A hapless loser (with the surname of Loser) undergoes misadventures with avaracious clergy, a tired horse, and a walking granary (among other things) on his road to collectivized happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpRuxg05Z5KTPlW5VkJjwOgnXaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93743'),
  ('340240364508006480', 'Happiness', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Agnès Varda, Claude Beausoleil, Jean Rabier', 'Agnès Varda', 'Jean-Claude Drouot, Claire Drouot, Olivier Drouot, Sandrine Drouot, Marie-France Boyer, Marcelle Faure-Bertin, Manon Lanclos, Sylvia Saurel', null, 'Though married to the good-natured, beautiful Thérèse, young husband and father François finds himself falling unquestioningly into an affair with an attractive postal worker. One of Agnès Varda''s most provocative films, ''Le bonheur'' examines, with a deceptively cheery palette and the spirited strains of Mozart, the ideas of fidelity and happiness in a modern, self-centered world.', 'Though married to the good-natured, beautiful Thérèse, young husband and father François finds himself falling unquestioningly into an affair with an attractive postal worker. One of Agnès Varda''s most provocative films, ''Le bonheur'' examines, with a deceptively cheery palette and the spirited strains of Mozart, the ideas of fidelity and happiness in a modern, self-centered world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6UYog9MruOe4X71AS57EhuJrFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53023'),
  ('15686431536332016', 'Happiness', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hur Jin-ho, Kim Hyung-koo, Jung Young-min', 'Hur Jin-ho', 'Hwang Jung-min, Lim Soo-jung, Kim Ki-cheon, Yoo Seung-mok, Gong Hyo-jin, Ryu Seung-su, Park In-hwan, Jang Jin-hee', null, 'Young, a careless person, suffers from terminal illness and gets admitted in a hospital for treatment. There, he falls in love with another patient. After recovering, will he get back to his former life?', 'Young, a careless person, suffers from terminal illness and gets admitted in a hospital for treatment. There, he falls in love with another patient. After recovering, will he get back to his former life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7uWshJUUMGJ4Dq4qapY6vm5Rn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95910'),
  ('732731947808671153', 'Happiness', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', 'Steve Cutts', null, null, null, 'The story of a rodent''s unrelenting quest for happiness and fulfillment.', 'The story of a rodent''s unrelenting quest for happiness and fulfillment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3Xv1IEZd46sMQSDRnXyBMwPqsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489533'),
  ('122386802810643624', 'Happiness', 2023, 'Drama', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Luca Bigazzi', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Isabella Cecchi, Alessandra Guidi', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Max Tortora, Anna Galiena, Matteo Olivetti, Sergio Rubini, Beatrice Vendramin, Marco Cocci, Massimiliano Franciosa', null, 'This is the story of a broken family, of egotistic and manipulative parents, a two-headed monster that devours every hope of freedom on the part of the children. Desirè is the only one who can save her brother Claudio and will go on fighting against everything and everyone in the name of the only love she knows, in pursuit of a bit of happiness.', 'This is the story of a broken family, of egotistic and manipulative parents, a two-headed monster that devours every hope of freedom on the part of the children. Desirè is the only one who can save her brother Claudio and will go on fighting against everything and everyone in the name of the only love she knows, in pursuit of a bit of happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVXhIE8dNmMjGUAkdq5LwkJwIXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084571'),
  ('890801623824977143', 'Happiness at Last', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Mark Melville, Federica Ciciarelli', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Leonardo Pieraccioni', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Ariadna Romero, Rocco Papaleo, Andrea Buscemi, Thyago Alves, Shel Shapiro, Michela Andreozzi, Maurizio Battista', null, 'A middle-aged man finds out his late mother was sponsoring a Brazilian girl who has now become a beautiful model and tries his best not to fall for her.', 'A middle-aged man finds out his late mother was sponsoring a Brazilian girl who has now become a beautiful model and tries his best not to fall for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7GoN0IqQGuAI5JoMIfiYT6gJWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79371'),
  ('1086823872005976165', 'Happiness Charge Precure! the Movie: Ballerina of the Doll Kingdom', 2014, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Chiaki Kon', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Megumi Nakajima, Megumi Han, Rina Kitagawa, Haruka Tomatsu, Daisuke Ono, Miyuki Kobori, Naoko Matsui, Ryosuke Kanemoto', null, 'While performing a puppet show at a nursery, the HappinessCharge Pretty Cures are surprised when one of the dolls starts talking. “Save our kingdom!” Tsumugi, the ballerina doll, pleads. The Pretty Cures accompany Tsumugi to the land of dolls, a girls’ paradise of cute stuffed animals, talking dolls, music and dance ruled by the noble Prince Zeke. But the kingdom is under attack by the forces of Black Fang, a mysterious man who wants to conquer the land for his own nefarious purposes. As sorrow spreads throughout the Kingdom of Dolls, the Pretty Cures come to the rescue.', 'While performing a puppet show at a nursery, the HappinessCharge Pretty Cures are surprised when one of the dolls starts talking. “Save our kingdom!” Tsumugi, the ballerina doll, pleads. The Pretty Cures accompany Tsumugi to the land of dolls, a girls’ paradise of cute stuffed animals, talking dolls, music and dance ruled by the noble Prince Zeke. But the kingdom is under attack by the forces of Black Fang, a mysterious man who wants to conquer the land for his own nefarious purposes. As sorrow spreads throughout the Kingdom of Dolls, the Pretty Cures come to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOqicHvCEm0XfvTWUHn4J6Objkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267962'),
  ('447485884276053567', 'Happiness Continues', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Anthony Mandler', null, 'Joe Jonas, Nick Jonas, Kevin Jonas, Sophie Turner, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Danielle Jonas', null, 'A live concert experience and exclusive look into life on the road with The Jonas Brothers during their Happiness Begins concert tour.', 'A live concert experience and exclusive look into life on the road with The Jonas Brothers during their Happiness Begins concert tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2moEkoXck5B0EsGa49TPhbQbNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696396'),
  ('337553690608916660', 'Happiness Ever After', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Thabang Moleya, Lance Gewer, Thabani Gigaba', 'Ayanda Halimana', 'Renate Stuurman, Khanyi Mbau, Nambitha Ben-Mazwi, Richard Lukunku, Daniel Etim Effiong, Yonda Thomas, Loyiso Macdonald, Xolile Tshabalala', 'R', 'This sequel to "Happiness is a Four-Letter Word" finds Zaza, Princess and Zim living new chapters of their lives amid loss, family grudges and new love.', 'This sequel to "Happiness is a Four-Letter Word" finds Zaza, Princess and Zim living new chapters of their lives amid loss, family grudges and new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WjFS2RHHif6zeiDZiUIb2CNDip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892342'),
  ('291460714711249055', 'Happiness for Beginners', 2023, 'Romance, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Allan Aguilar, Vicky Wight, Lemuel Fishburne', 'Vicky Wight', 'Ellie Kemper, Luke Grimes, Nico Santos, Blythe Danner, Ben Cook, Shayvawn Webster, Julia Shiplett, Gus Birney', 'PG-13', 'At a crossroads after her divorce, a schoolteacher ventures toward a fresh start in life — and love — when she signs up for a grueling group hiking trip.', 'At a crossroads after her divorce, a schoolteacher ventures toward a fresh start in life — and love — when she signs up for a grueling group hiking trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK4jb2t3J98IXjY9O3nc8bX9yqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881209'),
  ('473610696388206337', 'Happiness for Sale', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jeong Ik-hwan, Jeong Seok-won, Yoon Kyung-hyun', 'Bae Se-young', 'Choi Kang-hee, Bong Tae-gyu, Jeong Gyu-su, Kim Won-hae, Park Sa-rang, Goo Seung-hyun, Kim Dan-yul, Kim Young-sun', null, 'Mi-na takes over a small stationery store from her father when he suddenly falls down. She wants to sell the store because it seems only troublesome to her. But it is not as easy as she thought. The store''s regular costomers force her not to sell it. The objections of the little children is hard to resist.', 'Mi-na takes over a small stationery store from her father when he suddenly falls down. She wants to sell the store because it seems only troublesome to her. But it is not as easy as she thought. The store''s regular costomers force her not to sell it. The objections of the little children is hard to resist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uN5KwfRz3YG3RNUScM5yCQkXVea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196833'),
  ('1019937550447316792', 'Happiness Is a Warm Blanket, Charlie Brown', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Andrew Beall, Frank Molieri', 'Craig Schulz, Stephan Pastis', 'Austin Lux, Amanda Pace, Trenton Rogers, Grace Rolek, Ciara Bravo, Blesst Bowden, Andrew Beall, Andy Pessoa', 'G', 'Linus is pushed to his limits when he learns Grandma is coming to visit and plans on ridding him of his childish security blanket.', 'Linus is pushed to his limits when he learns Grandma is coming to visit and plans on ridding him of his childish security blanket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjRcn8painrtKiOy0zagyAwH4IH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60897'),
  ('120183886786199893', 'Happiness Is in the Field', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Philippe Welt', 'Florence Quentin', 'Michel Serrault, Eddy Mitchell, Sabine Azéma, Carmen Maura, François Morel, Patrick Bouchitey, Roger Gicquel, Catherine Jacob', null, 'Francis, the boss of a small plumbing supply company, is harassed by tax collectors, striking employees, and an impossible wife and daughter. His only joy is sharing lunch with his friend Gerard. Then a TV show called "where are you?" shows a woman from Gers who is searching for her husband who disappeared 28 years ago. The lost husband looks like an identical twin of Francis...', 'Francis, the boss of a small plumbing supply company, is harassed by tax collectors, striking employees, and an impossible wife and daughter. His only joy is sharing lunch with his friend Gerard. Then a TV show called "where are you?" shows a woman from Gers who is searching for her husband who disappeared 28 years ago. The lost husband looks like an identical twin of Francis...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjHn19RpFMBmzQx58SBO40nLvhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43612'),
  ('481494196723520453', 'Happiness Never Comes Alone', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Huth, Stéphane Le Parc', 'James Huth, Sonja Shillito', 'Gad Elmaleh, Sophie Marceau, Maurice Barthélemy, François Berléand, Michaël Abiteboul, Julie-Anne Roth, Macha Méril, Cyril Gueï', null, 'Sacha is a real seducer, a man with no ties or emotional or professional. Charlotte is a modern and independent woman, but barely has time to care for their three children. While Sacha and Charlotte are, at first glance, two incompatible beings, when they meet soon discover that they are quite complementary and need each other.', 'Sacha is a real seducer, a man with no ties or emotional or professional. Charlotte is a modern and independent woman, but barely has time to care for their three children. While Sacha and Charlotte are, at first glance, two incompatible beings, when they meet soon discover that they are quite complementary and need each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBFwkGYizI2jZLRpfL1i1cBLZY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121936'),
  ('840549174822038587', 'Happy', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy', 'A. Karunakaran, R. D. Rajasekhar', 'A. Karunakaran', 'Allu Arjun, Genelia D''Souza, Manoj Bajpayee, Brahmanandam, Kishore, Deepak Shirke, Rama Prabha, G. V. Sudhakar Naidu', null, 'A politician refrains his daughter from finishing college as it would affect his politics. He decides to get her married to a police officer of the same caste, but things don''t go as planned.', 'A politician refrains his daughter from finishing college as it would affect his politics. He decides to get her married to a police officer of the same caste, but things don''t go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLAm3iTltaHViglqcjUTJmmxHXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81060'),
  ('409473103255382667', 'Happy', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Roko Belic', 'Roko Belic', 'Gregory Berns, Roy Blanchard, Mihaly Csikszentmihalyi, Tenzin Gyatso, Richard Davison, Ed Diener, Daniel Gilbert, Tim Kasser', 'NR', 'Happy is a 2011 feature documentary film directed, written, and co-produced by Roko Belic. It explores human happiness through interviews with people from all walks of life in 14 different countries, weaving in the newest findings of positive psychology. Director Roko Belic was originally inspired to create the film after producer/director Tom Shadyac (Liar, Liar, Patch Adams, Bruce Almighty) showed him an article in the New York Times entitled "A New Measure of Well Being From a Happy Little Kingdom". The article ranks the United States as the 23rd happiest country in the world. Shadyac then suggested that Belic make a documentary about happiness. Belic spent several years interviewing over 20 people, ranging from leading happiness researchers to a rickshaw driver in Kolkatta, a family living in a "co-housing community" in Denmark, a woman who was run over by a truck, a Cajun fisherman, and more.', 'Happy is a 2011 feature documentary film directed, written, and co-produced by Roko Belic. It explores human happiness through interviews with people from all walks of life in 14 different countries, weaving in the newest findings of positive psychology. Director Roko Belic was originally inspired to create the film after producer/director Tom Shadyac (Liar, Liar, Patch Adams, Bruce Almighty) showed him an article in the New York Times entitled "A New Measure of Well Being From a Happy Little Kingdom". The article ranks the United States as the 23rd happiest country in the world. Shadyac then suggested that Belic make a documentary about happiness. Belic spent several years interviewing over 20 people, ranging from leading happiness researchers to a rickshaw driver in Kolkatta, a family living in a "co-housing community" in Denmark, a woman who was run over by a truck, a Cajun fisherman, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAz3VHk0nyeottwGc3lOFHi3Hky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86577'),
  ('42063330580786117', 'Happy 140', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gracia Querejeta, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'Santos Mercero, Gracia Querejeta', 'Maribel Verdú, Antonio de la Torre, Nora Navas, Eduard Fernández, Marian Álvarez, Paula Cancio, Ginés García Millán, Álex O''Dogherty', null, 'A group of friends and family reunite at the fancy new holiday home of a woman who is about to turn 40.', 'A group of friends and family reunite at the fancy new holiday home of a woman who is about to turn 40.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zH1qx4R9npBTbCUyl2m4jd7di4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327383'),
  ('667196305222645214', 'Happy 50', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Catherine Cambier, Arthur Dezanneau, Faustine Chevrin', 'Héctor Cabello Reyes, Eric Lavaine', 'Lambert Wilson, Franck Dubosc, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Jérôme Commandeur, Caroline Anglade, Lionel Abelanski, Lysiane Meis, Sophie Duez', null, 'To celebrate Yves’ 50th birthday, his friends plan to take him to the sunny paradise of Paros in Greece. But due to a cancelled flight, the holiday will take place in a far less glamorous and much rainier destination: Yves’ family home in Brittany. During the vacation, their bonds are challenged by Antoine’s constant complaining, Yves’ pride, Baptiste’s superstition and Laurent’s jealousy of Jean-Mich’s perfect life and family. On top of that, Antoine’s supposedly harmless joke – offering Yves a DNA ancestry test – has unforeseen consequences…', 'To celebrate Yves’ 50th birthday, his friends plan to take him to the sunny paradise of Paros in Greece. But due to a cancelled flight, the holiday will take place in a far less glamorous and much rainier destination: Yves’ family home in Brittany. During the vacation, their bonds are challenged by Antoine’s constant complaining, Yves’ pride, Baptiste’s superstition and Laurent’s jealousy of Jean-Mich’s perfect life and family. On top of that, Antoine’s supposedly harmless joke – offering Yves a DNA ancestry test – has unforeseen consequences…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGLD97c0Alof6Y4sHkeYsyELxzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926516'),
  ('21124407031501520', 'Happy Accidents', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Brad Anderson, Terry Stacey, Lisa Janowski', 'Brad Anderson', 'Marisa Tomei, Vincent D''Onofrio, Holland Taylor, Nadia Dajani, Tamara Jenkins, Cara Buono, Neal Huff, Sean Gullette', 'R', 'A comedy that pays tribute to the science fiction genre -- specifically, the sub-genre of time travel. But here the alternate reality is contemporary New York City where past and future experiences of trust, commitment and denial are cleverly put to the test. Just as Ruby is beginning to relish her first-ever healthy relationship, Sam begins muttering about being a time traveler from the year 2470.', 'A comedy that pays tribute to the science fiction genre -- specifically, the sub-genre of time travel. But here the alternate reality is contemporary New York City where past and future experiences of trust, commitment and denial are cleverly put to the test. Just as Ruby is beginning to relish her first-ever healthy relationship, Sam begins muttering about being a time traveler from the year 2470.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihDJpDbKpVjxx9bzo9i6MdhS5dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22230'),
  ('1102420784876260656', 'Happy Anniversary', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Levent, Pierre Étaix, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Pierre Étaix', 'Pierre Étaix, Georges Loriot, Laurence Lignières, Nono Zammit, Lucien Frégis, Ican Paillaud, Robert Blome', null, 'Heureux Anniversaire is a 1962 French short comedy film directed by Pierre Étaix. While his wife impatiently waits and gets drunk, a husband tries to get the appropriate anniversary gifts and fight his way home through traffic in time for their celebratory lunch. It won an Oscar in 1963 for Best Short Subject.', 'Heureux Anniversaire is a 1962 French short comedy film directed by Pierre Étaix. While his wife impatiently waits and gets drunk, a husband tries to get the appropriate anniversary gifts and fight his way home through traffic in time for their celebratory lunch. It won an Oscar in 1963 for Best Short Subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvDZMdeYOMQM4TVdDq42PdDjGaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139592'),
  ('845557423537309797', 'Happy Anniversary', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jared Stern', 'Jared Stern', 'Noël Wells, Ben Schwartz, Joe Pantoliano, Annie Potts, Leonardo Nam, Rahul Kohli, Kate Berlant, Isidora Goreshter', null, 'A quirky couple spends their three-year dating anniversary looking back at their relationship and contemplating whether they should break up.', 'A quirky couple spends their three-year dating anniversary looking back at their relationship and contemplating whether they should break up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQYX248aotb6ma6QxJ14utYEYoD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451563'),
  ('80472356699129184', 'Happy as Lazzaro', 2018, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Hélène Louvart, Alice Rohrwacher, Daniela Baldasarre', 'Alice Rohrwacher', 'Adriano Tardiolo, Agnese Graziani, Luke Chikovani, Alba Rohrwacher, Sergi López, Tommaso Ragno, Natalino Balasso, Nicoletta Braschi', 'PG-13', 'Purehearted teen Lazzaro is content living as a sharecropper in rural Italy, but an unlikely friendship with the marquise’s son will change his world.', 'Purehearted teen Lazzaro is content living as a sharecropper in rural Italy, but an unlikely friendship with the marquise’s son will change his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4x1O6G0cbchHQwNsEZ0DntOJMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481432'),
  ('7277740204730635', 'Happy Bhag Jayegi', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mudassar Aziz, Sohail Sen', 'Mudassar Aziz', 'Diana Penty, Abhay Deol, Jimmy Shergill, Ali Fazal, Piyush Mishra, Momal Sheikh, Kanwaljit Singh, Javed Sheikh', 'PG', 'After fleeing an arranged marriage, a feisty Indian woman finds herself stranded in Pakistan where the ex-governor''s son helps reunite her with her boyfriend.', 'After fleeing an arranged marriage, a feisty Indian woman finds herself stranded in Pakistan where the ex-governor''s son helps reunite her with her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEWDNSBe5BfUchkJ5BsJV6VUgwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406042'),
  ('650049801309064615', 'Happy Birthday', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pongpat Wachirabunjong, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom', 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee', 'Ananda Everingham, Chayanan Manomaisantiphap, Zerina Veesanun, Antwone Rommayanun', null, 'Destiny has brought Ten and Pao to meet through a story in touring book. Though they haven''t seen each other yet, the letters in the book was written and sent to both of them. Until one day, when they meet by chance, the acquaintance they''ve made through the book begins to blossom and develop into love. They vow not to be apart from one another no matter what would come. There''s a twist when Ten doesn''t get his birthday present that Pao sends to him, but they still hold on to the vow that one day they''ll be together forever.', 'Destiny has brought Ten and Pao to meet through a story in touring book. Though they haven''t seen each other yet, the letters in the book was written and sent to both of them. Until one day, when they meet by chance, the acquaintance they''ve made through the book begins to blossom and develop into love. They vow not to be apart from one another no matter what would come. There''s a twist when Ten doesn''t get his birthday present that Pao sends to him, but they still hold on to the vow that one day they''ll be together forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnvAzCiJomNvzgLEnxd1cYZIFxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99330'),
  ('605358254307264492', 'Happy Birthday', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cédric Kahn, Yves Cape', 'Cédric Kahn, Fanny Burdino, Samuel Doux', 'Catherine Deneuve, Emmanuelle Bercot, Vincent Macaigne, Cédric Kahn, Satya Dusaugey, Luàna Bajrami, Laetitia Colombani, Isabel Aimé González Sola', null, 'A mother of two gathers her loved ones to celebrate her birthday in her big house near the Loire Valley. The festivities are disrupted by the arrival of her daughter, who is known for her unpredictable outbursts.', 'A mother of two gathers her loved ones to celebrate her birthday in her big house near the Loire Valley. The festivities are disrupted by the arrival of her daughter, who is known for her unpredictable outbursts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlU8Cz18uRVp4XKIyNr6qLE05DW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505940'),
  ('448349640039403682', 'Happy Birthday to Me', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery', 'J. Lee Thompson, Miklós Lente, Charles Braive', 'John C.W. Saxton, Peter Jobin, Timothy Bond', 'Melissa Sue Anderson, Glenn Ford, Lawrence Dane, Sharon Acker, Frances Hyland, Tracey E. Bregman, Jack Blum, Matt Craven', 'R', 'Virginia is proud that she belongs to a clique. The best students at a private school. But before her 18th birthday, a gruesome set of murders take place and her friends are the ones who are falling prey. Could it be her? She suffers from blackouts due to a freak accident one year earlier. We soon learn the truth behind her accident and what is going on.', 'Virginia is proud that she belongs to a clique. The best students at a private school. But before her 18th birthday, a gruesome set of murders take place and her friends are the ones who are falling prey. Could it be her? She suffers from blackouts due to a freak accident one year earlier. We soon learn the truth behind her accident and what is going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s8Z58Xah3VSe4kfKZFTUJTT33g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37936'),
  ('297945386468595338', 'Happy Birthday to You!', 2006, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'David Alcalde, Roser Vila-Abadal, German Blanco', 'David Alcalde', 'Laura Domínguez, Ferran Lahoz, Pau Poch', 'R', 'A dark story about obsession, cats, and birthday presents.', 'A dark story about obsession, cats, and birthday presents.', null, 'tmdb:movie:408111'),
  ('7290748769168184', 'Happy Burnout', 2017, 'Comedy', 'André Erkau', null, 'Kostja Ullmann, Marleen Lohse, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Torben Liebrecht, Julia Koschitz, Michael Wittenborn, Anke Engelke, Victoria Trauttmansdorff', null, 'An unemployed with diagnosed burn-out is getting a therapy in a clinic.', 'An unemployed with diagnosed burn-out is getting a therapy in a clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDlRtP1VrXXUZiYT7doZLNVF9Z0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400552'),
  ('268837964829496182', 'Happy Bus Day', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Lee Seung-won', 'Lee Seung-won', 'Seo Gap-suk, Kim Sun-young, Lee Ju-won, Kim Kwon-hoo, Park Ji-hong, Kim Sung-min, Jang Sun, Lee Seung-won', null, 'For the final birthday party of the eldest son, a family gathers in the house to have a plan with a bus..... Mother asks each of them to stay in his room for 10 minutes. Each person reveals personal wounds and secrets.', 'For the final birthday party of the eldest son, a family gathers in the house to have a plan with a bus..... Mother asks each of them to stay in his room for 10 minutes. Each person reveals personal wounds and secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cX3rgRZ93rucZxPIQgQMlxU1zD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451923'),
  ('946530799153753074', 'Happy Camper', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime', 'André Ducharme, Guy A. Lepage, Serge Desrosiers', 'André Ducharme, Luc Déry', 'Guy A. Lepage, Sylvie Moreau, Normand D''Amour, Benoît Girard, Réal Bossé, Stéphane Jacques, Yves Pelletier, Emmanuel Bilodeau', null, 'Pierre-Louis Cinq-Mars is a successful stockbroker. Everything in his life is well-ordered -- stock investments, luxury car, the latest computer, stylish and tasteful clothes...well-ordered to the point of being utterly predictable. Jackie Pigeon, the owner of the Camping Pigeon campground, is a go-getter who always gets her way. She conducts her business with a sure hand and everything at the campground runs smoothly. Her life is the complete opposite of Pierre-Louis''s -- she''s rather messy, of modest means, wears flamboyant and sexy clothes...everything in her life hovers on the edge of bad taste. Two people from completely different worlds whose paths would not normally have been fated to cross.', 'Pierre-Louis Cinq-Mars is a successful stockbroker. Everything in his life is well-ordered -- stock investments, luxury car, the latest computer, stylish and tasteful clothes...well-ordered to the point of being utterly predictable. Jackie Pigeon, the owner of the Camping Pigeon campground, is a go-getter who always gets her way. She conducts her business with a sure hand and everything at the campground runs smoothly. Her life is the complete opposite of Pierre-Louis''s -- she''s rather messy, of modest means, wears flamboyant and sexy clothes...everything in her life hovers on the edge of bad taste. Two people from completely different worlds whose paths would not normally have been fated to cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja1t2Qe24ykYqCEFzu9EPfXvHO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40330'),
  ('750972977471936550', 'Happy Campers', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Daniel Waters, Elliot Davis', 'Daniel Waters', 'Brad Renfro, Dominique Swain, Keram Malicki-Sánchez, Emily Bergl, Jordan Bridges, Jaime King, Justin Long, Peter Stormare', 'R', 'Chaos and rampant hormones reign when teenage counselors are left in charge during their summer-camp director''s absence.', 'Chaos and rampant hormones reign when teenage counselors are left in charge during their summer-camp director''s absence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUB8brmv36Yk7rSiVdGuYIGSghf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24273'),
  ('707130307303788371', 'Happy Christmas', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe Swanberg, Ben Richardson', 'Joe Swanberg', 'Anna Kendrick, Melanie Lynskey, Mark Webber, Lena Dunham, Joe Swanberg, Jude Swanberg, Chris Swanson, Eldar Kim', 'R', 'After a breakup with her boyfriend, a young woman moves in with her older brother, his wife, and their 2-year-old son.', 'After a breakup with her boyfriend, a young woman moves in with her older brother, his wife, and their 2-year-old son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjOQUlsprWkmyZP4hhMGr0GP3LG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244534'),
  ('501618770503282652', 'Happy Day', 1976, 'Drama', 'Giorgos Panousopoulos, Takis Katselis, Petros Raptis', 'Pantelis Voulgaris', 'Zorz Sarri, Giorgos Moshidis, Stavros Kalaroglou, Nikos Bousdoukos, Kostas Fyssoun, Konstantinos Tzoumas, Stathis Giallelis, Dimos Avdeliodis', null, 'A concentration camp on a barren island is hell for the exiled political prisoners. The everyday life of the prisoners consists of interrogations, psychological and physical violence, arbitrary punishments and other torments. One of the prisoners who refuses to yield is subjected to torture. Trying to escape, he falls into the sea. When the Queen visits the island, the prison guards find the runaway and murder him without a second thought, since he is already assumed dead.', 'A concentration camp on a barren island is hell for the exiled political prisoners. The everyday life of the prisoners consists of interrogations, psychological and physical violence, arbitrary punishments and other torments. One of the prisoners who refuses to yield is subjected to torture. Trying to escape, he falls into the sea. When the Queen visits the island, the prison guards find the runaway and murder him without a second thought, since he is already assumed dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c38UlDP8z5MjqeVN1nwqEa9uBno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393330'),
  ('762923418211756375', 'Happy Days', 1991, 'Drama', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Sergey Astakhov', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Viktor Sukhorukov, Anzhelika Nevolina, Evgeniy Merkurev, Georgiy Teykh, Nikolay Lavrov, Arkady Sharogradsky, Alexey Olennikov, Milena Tontegode', null, 'An unnamed hero roaming the streets of St Petersburg is befriended by a beggar with a donkey and a slightly deranged prostitute.', 'An unnamed hero roaming the streets of St Petersburg is befriended by a beggar with a donkey and a slightly deranged prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMrZifdBz0ABHInIfQiMllpntPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31630'),
  ('111037936092450368', 'Happy Days', 2007, 'Drama', 'Sekhar Kammula, Suri Ravi Kumar, Praveena Rao', 'Sekhar Kammula', 'Varun Sandesh, Tamannaah Bhatia, Rahul Haridas, Sonia Deepti, Nikhil Siddhartha, Gayathri Rao, Vamsee Chaganti, Monali Chowdhary', 'G', 'Eight youngsters become a close-knit group after attending engineering college and sharing their experiences.', 'Eight youngsters become a close-knit group after attending engineering college and sharing their experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PTzngN3VOmxQg6vFOkAGFMSxWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199160'),
  ('1086768986900436856', 'Happy Death Day', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Christopher Landon, Toby Oliver, Seth Hansen', 'Scott Lobdell, Christopher Landon', 'Jessica Rothe, Israel Broussard, Charles Aitken, Ruby Modine, Blaine Kern III, Rachel Matthews, Billy Slaughter, Caleb Spillyards', 'PG-13', 'Caught in a bizarre and terrifying time warp, college student Tree finds herself repeatedly reliving the day of her murder, ultimately realizing that she must identify the killer and the reason for her death before her chances of survival run out.', 'Caught in a bizarre and terrifying time warp, college student Tree finds herself repeatedly reliving the day of her murder, ultimately realizing that she must identify the killer and the reason for her death before her chances of survival run out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTaEIUYTt52ooq9quVbAQ7NpGwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440021'),
  ('164050145002099212', 'Happy Death Day 2U', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Fernando Altschul, Alexander Salazar, Joe May', 'Christopher Landon', 'Jessica Rothe, Israel Broussard, Charles Aitken, Ruby Modine, Suraj Sharma, Rachel Matthews, Blaine Kern III, Phi Vu', 'PG-13', 'Collegian Tree Gelbman wakes up in horror to learn that she''s stuck in a parallel universe. Her boyfriend Carter is now with someone else, and her friends and fellow students seem to be completely different versions of themselves. When Tree discovers that Carter''s roommate has been altering time, she finds herself once again the target of a masked killer. When the psychopath starts to go after her inner circle, Tree soon realizes that she must die over and over again to save everyone.', 'Collegian Tree Gelbman wakes up in horror to learn that she''s stuck in a parallel universe. Her boyfriend Carter is now with someone else, and her friends and fellow students seem to be completely different versions of themselves. When Tree discovers that Carter''s roommate has been altering time, she finds herself once again the target of a masked killer. When the psychopath starts to go after her inner circle, Tree soon realizes that she must die over and over again to save everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tdnePOkOOzwuGPEOAHp8UA4vqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512196'),
  ('61363410825214624', 'Happy Easter', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Georges Lautner, Dominique Brunner, Anne Fournier', 'Georges Lautner, Jean Poiret', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Sophie Marceau, Marie Laforêt, Rosy Varte, Michel Beaune, Marie-Christine Descouard, Gérard Hernandez, Elisabeth Kolhammar', null, 'Chronic serial womanizer Stephane Margelle drops his wife Sophie off at the airport so she can go away for Easter weekend. He immediately picks up beautiful young Julie, who has just had a fight with her married boyfriend. He gets her back to his apartment and is preparing for a sexy weekend, when his wife suddenly returns home. He makes up a bizarre, on-the-spot, spur-of-the-moment story that the gorgeous girl is actually his long-lost daughter. Julie plays along, but this leads to a whole series of increasingly ridiculous lies and comical situations (such as when her real mother shows up).', 'Chronic serial womanizer Stephane Margelle drops his wife Sophie off at the airport so she can go away for Easter weekend. He immediately picks up beautiful young Julie, who has just had a fight with her married boyfriend. He gets her back to his apartment and is preparing for a sexy weekend, when his wife suddenly returns home. He makes up a bizarre, on-the-spot, spur-of-the-moment story that the gorgeous girl is actually his long-lost daughter. Julie plays along, but this leads to a whole series of increasingly ridiculous lies and comical situations (such as when her real mother shows up).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85SKkTXk5LzXvYdBQYnnWxdP47L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40061'),
  ('804844996138416476', 'Happy End', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Zdenka Karlovská, Eliška Štíbrová', 'Oldřich Lipský, Miloš Macourek', 'Vladimír Menšík, Jaroslava Obermaierová, Josef Abrhám, Bohuš Záhorský, Stella Zázvorková, Jiří Steimar, Martin Růžek, Bedřich Prokoš', null, 'A dark comedy about a murder and its consequences presented in a backwards manner, where death is actually a rebirth. The film starts with an "execution" of the main protagonist and goes back to explore his previous actions and motivations.', 'A dark comedy about a murder and its consequences presented in a backwards manner, where death is actually a rebirth. The film starts with an "execution" of the main protagonist and goes back to explore his previous actions and motivations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikM5PK5fahvlAfZhQdUINqBqboJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51578'),
  ('175732881744264802', 'Happy End', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jung Ji-woo, Kim Woo-hyung, Park Hyun-won', 'Jung Ji-woo', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Choi Min-sik, Ju Jin-mo, Joo Hyun, Yoo Yeon-soo, Park Ji-il, Kim Beong-choun, Park Nam-hee', null, 'When a wife becomes the breadwinner of her family after her husband loses his job, adultery becomes part of her life.', 'When a wife becomes the breadwinner of her family after her husband loses his job, adultery becomes part of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHqmSc7J9w4ZhoXyoSrpYWoxSTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27154'),
  ('1028060918149475647', 'Happy End', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amos Kollek, Ken Kelsch', 'Amos Kollek', 'Audrey Tautou, Justin Theroux, Jennifer Tilly, Laila Robins, Catherine Curtin, Frank Pellegrino, Jenna Lamia, Juan Carlos Hernández', null, 'Val is 23 years old and full of dreams. She travels to New York to become an actress. She is lonely in a strange country, in a strange city, with little money and no friends. In her path, she meets weird people who they, also, seek their dreams but everyday life gets in the way. Tired and hungry she sits on the corner of a building. Across the street a writer whose fantasy has dry out. In an instant she becomes his muse... At the Oscar''s night she will be the one with the Golden Globe in her hands.', 'Val is 23 years old and full of dreams. She travels to New York to become an actress. She is lonely in a strange country, in a strange city, with little money and no friends. In her path, she meets weird people who they, also, seek their dreams but everyday life gets in the way. Tired and hungry she sits on the corner of a building. Across the street a writer whose fantasy has dry out. In an instant she becomes his muse... At the Oscar''s night she will be the one with the Golden Globe in her hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbLxetPVJH03a8CZPpa0bw4E2tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29079'),
  ('999132505017666715', 'Happy End', 2009, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Thierry Arbogast, Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Jean-Marie Larrieu, Arnaud Larrieu', 'Mathieu Amalric, Catherine Frot, Sergi López, Karin Viard, Omahyra Mota, Clotilde Hesme, Sabine Azéma, Pierre Pellet', null, 'Robinson, appropriately named as we will soon discover, is on vacation in Biarritz with his wife. What follows is the story behind the loss of his arm, a story that becomes increasingly bizarre and eventually apocalyptic, leading us down a narrative path of labyrinthine complexity. The resulting film is an extraordinary feat of imagination and daring, set against the backdrop of a world on the verge of destruction.', 'Robinson, appropriately named as we will soon discover, is on vacation in Biarritz with his wife. What follows is the story behind the loss of his arm, a story that becomes increasingly bizarre and eventually apocalyptic, leading us down a narrative path of labyrinthine complexity. The resulting film is an extraordinary feat of imagination and daring, set against the backdrop of a world on the verge of destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNTtJdJgCgGweNEL6hHLcqBco1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51866'),
  ('675168568269963401', 'Happy End', 2017, 'Drama', 'Michael Haneke, Jean-Luc Baillet, Christian Berger', 'Michael Haneke', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Mathieu Kassovitz, Fantine Harduin, Franz Rogowski, Laura Verlinden, Toby Jones, Aurélia Petit', 'R', 'A well-to-do French family living in Calais deal with a series of setbacks and crises while paying little attention to the grim conditions in the refugee camps within a few miles of their home.', 'A well-to-do French family living in Calais deal with a series of setbacks and crises while paying little attention to the grim conditions in the refugee camps within a few miles of their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAHzP9O0MOswvWFv5jtWGTyMYXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399031'),
  ('1045153684743647055', 'Happy End?!', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Petra Clever, Karola Keller', 'Petra Clever', 'Sinha Gierke, Verena Wüstkamp, Madlen Kaniuth, Sascha Tschorn, Meike Gottschalk, Klaus Nierhoff, Michael Kühl', null, 'Lucca is in the middle of her A-level exams, heading for a career as a high-flying lawyer when she is mistakenly accused of criminal damage and sentenced to community service in a hospice. There she meets Valerie who is determined to carry out the last wishes of her friend Herma, despite Hermas son who is only interested in his inheritance. Lucca helps Valerie to kidnap Hermas ashes and they begin a journey which turns Luccas ideas and values upside down.', 'Lucca is in the middle of her A-level exams, heading for a career as a high-flying lawyer when she is mistakenly accused of criminal damage and sentenced to community service in a hospice. There she meets Valerie who is determined to carry out the last wishes of her friend Herma, despite Hermas son who is only interested in his inheritance. Lucca helps Valerie to kidnap Hermas ashes and they begin a journey which turns Luccas ideas and values upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3bvbHlbfqZdavq7BkoFvwOPG2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315890'),
  ('22369464463570548', 'Happy Ending', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Yaron Levy, Chase Bowman, Mahesh Limaye', 'Krishna D.K., Raj Nidimoru, Sita Menon', 'Saif Ali Khan, Ileana D''Cruz, Kalki Koechlin, Govinda, Ranvir Shorey, Preity Zinta, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Kim DeJesus', null, 'Yudi’s happy life is about to encounter a speed breaker-his BMW gets towed away and his dues have started piling up. He’s run out of money and luck! To make matters worse-his supposed ex-girlfriend isn’t really his ex.', 'Yudi’s happy life is about to encounter a speed breaker-his BMW gets towed away and his dues have started piling up. He’s run out of money and luck! To make matters worse-his supposed ex-girlfriend isn’t really his ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSHhlukG0bNhmlQMjPtXhBythDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303281'),
  ('1030540889818206890', 'Happy Ending', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Joosje Duk, Bo Wijgerts, Anna van Schijndel', 'Joosje Duk', 'Gaite Jansen, Martijn Lakemeier, Joy Delima, Claire Bender, Sinem Kavus, Sidar Toksöz, Boaz Kok', 'R', 'A young woman quietly unsatisfied in the bedroom by her boyfriend puts their relationship to the test when she proposes to open up their sex life to a third person.', 'A young woman quietly unsatisfied in the bedroom by her boyfriend puts their relationship to the test when she proposes to open up their sex life to a third person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rD3x0J6UCOhtv4Dj5AC7n8bxI5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139819'),
  ('1097843226790535143', 'Happy Ending', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Topel Lee, Jaque Carlos, Jeyow Evangelista', 'Rush Borja, Erick Castro', 'Ashley Lopez, Ghion Layug, Ada Hermosa, Amor Lapus, Horace Mendoza, Jero Flores, Tetai Roldan, Grace-Anne Villalobos', null, 'Want the special with VMX Beauty Ashley Lopez? Ina is a new masseuse who gains the fancy of first-time customer Joel. But while Joel pursues Ina relentlessly, Ina is unsure if she can give him the happy ending he wants.', 'Want the special with VMX Beauty Ashley Lopez? Ina is a new masseuse who gains the fancy of first-time customer Joel. But while Joel pursues Ina relentlessly, Ina is unsure if she can give him the happy ending he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpYoYJ4kWLGhSfS3ofn4xEPJbun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1588860'),
  ('1144825937728352201', 'Happy Endings', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Don Roos, Clark Mathis, Lorin Flemming', 'Don Roos', 'Lisa Kudrow, Steve Coogan, Jesse Bradford, Bobby Cannavale, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Jason Ritter, Tom Arnold, David Sutcliffe', 'R', 'Filmmaker Nicky offers to track down the son that Mamie gave up for adoption nearly two decades before. Meanwhile, Mamie''s stepbrother (and the father of her child), Charley, along with his boyfriend, Gil, try to find out what became of the sperm Gil donated to a lesbian couple. Finally, singer Jude becomes entangled in a love triangle with androgynous drummer Otis and his conservative father.', 'Filmmaker Nicky offers to track down the son that Mamie gave up for adoption nearly two decades before. Meanwhile, Mamie''s stepbrother (and the father of her child), Charley, along with his boyfriend, Gil, try to find out what became of the sperm Gil donated to a lesbian couple. Finally, singer Jude becomes entangled in a love triangle with androgynous drummer Otis and his conservative father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76Hq3Buq6SIOe5Z7f5APwh1s7vU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14922'),
  ('525483321591427008', 'Happy Ever After', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Mario Zampi, Stanley Pavey, Gus Agosti', 'Jack Davies, Michael Pertwee', 'David Niven, Yvonne De Carlo, Barry Fitzgerald, George Cole, Noelle Middleton, Robert Urquhart, Michael Shepley, Joseph Tomelty', 'NR', 'The whole village mourns when General O''Leary, owner of a hunting estate in South Ireland, is killed in an accident. His nephew, Jasper O''Leary, takes over the state and soon has aroused the displeasure of all, with the exception of Serena McGluskey, as much a schemer as he is a cad. Led by Thady O''Heggarty, the villagers plot to drive Jasper away. They use the occasion of "O''Leary Night", when the ghost of the first O''Leary walks the halls, to create general chaos.', 'The whole village mourns when General O''Leary, owner of a hunting estate in South Ireland, is killed in an accident. His nephew, Jasper O''Leary, takes over the state and soon has aroused the displeasure of all, with the exception of Serena McGluskey, as much a schemer as he is a cad. Led by Thady O''Heggarty, the villagers plot to drive Jasper away. They use the occasion of "O''Leary Night", when the ghost of the first O''Leary walks the halls, to create general chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lm06hCFKMYsXT4ReY5j1Cvo9mf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258410'),
  ('675763829348543599', 'Happy Ever Afters', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Stephen Burke', 'Stephen Burke', 'Sally Hawkins, Tom Riley, Sinead Maguire, Tina Kellegher, Phina Oruche, David Pearse', null, 'Two weddings collide when both receptions are held at one hotel.', 'Two weddings collide when both receptions are held at one hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBn124rXH4bqtjMEaHdjeJ58Qwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44223'),
  ('315931152739899257', 'Happy Family', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Italo Petriccione', 'Alessandro Genovesi, Gabriele Salvatores', 'Fabio De Luigi, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Margherita Buy, Alice Croci, Valeria Bilello, Diego Abatantuono, Carla Signoris, Corinna Agustoni', null, 'A blocked screenwriter, Ezio, is trying to finish a story about two off-kilter families thrown together when their teenage children announce they’re getting married. So Ezio writes himself into the story with a romantic part—a development his characters welcome, as they’ve got some ideas of their own for bigger and better roles.', 'A blocked screenwriter, Ezio, is trying to finish a story about two off-kilter families thrown together when their teenage children announce they’re getting married. So Ezio writes himself into the story with a romantic part—a development his characters welcome, as they’ve got some ideas of their own for bigger and better roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWrfIvygxbJTOrqMVqUDWvv1Ato.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42892'),
  ('787277085217448542', 'Happy Family Journal', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Nihat Durak, Mehmet Kurtuluş', 'Ali Demirel, Volkan Sümbül, Emre Özdür', 'Tuncel Kurtiz, İlker Aksum, Binnur Kaya, Bülent Emrah Parlak, Büşra Pekin, Öner Erkan, Goncagül Sunar, İlhamcan Çelikoğlu', null, 'Children of a retired colonel come together after their father falls from the rooftop. This constrained togetherness reveals their lies day by day.', 'Children of a retired colonel come together after their father falls from the rooftop. This constrained togetherness reveals their lies day by day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91HDig30jW991XqLrGaxgvgsN4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173031'),
  ('764813909861339309', 'Happy Feet', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'George Miller, David Peers, Warren Coleman', 'George Miller, John Collee, Judy Morris', 'Elijah Wood, Robin Williams, Brittany Murphy, Hugh Jackman, Nicole Kidman, Hugo Weaving, Anthony LaPaglia, E. G. Daily', 'PG', 'Into the world of the Emperor Penguins, who find their soul mates through song, a penguin is born who cannot sing. But he can tap dance something fierce!', 'Into the world of the Emperor Penguins, who find their soul mates through song, a penguin is born who cannot sing. But he can tap dance something fierce!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za41IHkj6LnkilfTzv5B2qmthKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9836'),
  ('16219791884850439', 'Happy Feet Two', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'George Miller, David Cunningham, Rob Coleman', 'George Miller, Gary Eck, Warren Coleman', 'Elijah Wood, Robin Williams, P!nk, E. G. Daily, Johnny A. Sanchez, Lombardo Boyar, Sofía Vergara, Common', 'PG', 'Mumble the penguin has a problem: his son Erik, who is reluctant to dance, encounters the Mighty Sven — a penguin who can fly! Things get worse for Mumble when the world is shaken by powerful forces, causing him to bring together the penguin nations and their allies to set things right.', 'Mumble the penguin has a problem: his son Erik, who is reluctant to dance, encounters the Mighty Sven — a penguin who can fly! Things get worse for Mumble when the world is shaken by powerful forces, causing him to bring together the penguin nations and their allies to set things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gWiQ4mn85jcXtREVePlVViupeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65759'),
  ('221992123903102919', 'Happy Flight', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Seiichi Tanabe, Saburo Tokito, Haruka Ayase, Kazue Fukiishi, Tomoko Tabata, Shinobu Terajima, Ittoku Kishibe, Takashi Sasano', null, 'A variety of aviation professionals such as pilots, flight attendants, the ground crew, mechanics, dispatchers, controllers, and the bird patrol crew all support a single flight. They have only one mission: to secure the safety of the passengers.', 'A variety of aviation professionals such as pilots, flight attendants, the ground crew, mechanics, dispatchers, controllers, and the bird patrol crew all support a single flight. They have only one mission: to secure the safety of the passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bBJDGNDkvjAQoxexHlsAEFMY5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18733'),
  ('322762138482576581', 'Happy Ghost II', 1985, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Bob Thompson', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Clifton Ko Chi-Sum', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, May Lo Mei-Wei, Gigi Fu Ming-Hin, Melvin Wong, Tang Kei-Chan, Jeanne Kanai, Mannor Chan Man-Na, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying', null, 'A high school teacher constantly has pranks played on him by the students. He becomes a ghost with magical powers, but they keep getting him in trouble with his superiors.', 'A high school teacher constantly has pranks played on him by the students. He becomes a ghost with magical powers, but they keep getting him in trouble with his superiors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95uAuZsCDTvlwobJO86YwBPPaky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154529'),
  ('822517328607394965', 'Happy Ghost III', 1986, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Johnnie To, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Bob Thompson', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Maggie Cheung, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Charine Chan Ka-Ling, Danny Poon Wang-Ban, Sabrina Ho Pui-Yi, Wing Lam, Mannor Chan Man-Na', null, 'A young, unsuccessful singer, after committing suicide, is to be reincarnated, this time into a musical family. Her spirit must get to the hospital where her future mother is currently ready to give birth to her, so that she can enter the womb and be born. Unfortunately, she misses her appointed birth time, twice, due to the accidental intervention of a young man, Mr. Hong. At first she is angry and makes life hard for him, but eventually they fall in love, although she can''t stay around long as she has one last chance to be born.', 'A young, unsuccessful singer, after committing suicide, is to be reincarnated, this time into a musical family. Her spirit must get to the hospital where her future mother is currently ready to give birth to her, so that she can enter the womb and be born. Unfortunately, she misses her appointed birth time, twice, due to the accidental intervention of a young man, Mr. Hong. At first she is angry and makes life hard for him, but eventually they fall in love, although she can''t stay around long as she has one last chance to be born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHlG6SM3buOWuI412yZeDPhviak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69594'),
  ('190276831192154614', 'Happy Ghost IV', 1990, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Sander Lee', 'Ng Man-Fai, Joe Ma Wai-Ho, Philip Cheng', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Pauline Yeung Bo-Ling, Lau Shun, Wong Ka-Kui, Steve Wong Ka-Keung, Paul Wong Koon-Chung, Yip Sai-Wing, Tommy Wong', null, 'A group of college kids discovers the remains of an evil warlord from an old cave and brings it to their dormitory, which ultimately awakens the warlord''s ghost. It is seeking to avenge his killer, who has since reincarnated as Mr. Hong''s snobby girlfriend Annie. With Hong and Annie endangered, Hong''s reincarnated spirit takes over to save him and Annie, and defeat the demon.', 'A group of college kids discovers the remains of an evil warlord from an old cave and brings it to their dormitory, which ultimately awakens the warlord''s ghost. It is seeking to avenge his killer, who has since reincarnated as Mr. Hong''s snobby girlfriend Annie. With Hong and Annie endangered, Hong''s reincarnated spirit takes over to save him and Annie, and defeat the demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stDAXKGuNrVygILnwgO0dOBhafx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154531'),
  ('124644610278984543', 'Happy Gilmore', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Albert, Dennis Dugan, Arlene L. Arnold', 'Tim Herlihy, Adam Sandler', 'Adam Sandler, Christopher McDonald, Julie Bowen, Frances Bay, Carl Weathers, Allen Covert, Robert Smigel, Bob Barker', 'PG-13', 'Failed hockey player-turned-golf whiz Happy Gilmore — whose unconventional approach and antics on the green courts the ire of rival Shooter McGavin — is determined to win a PGA tournament so he can save his granny''s house with the prize money. Meanwhile, an attractive tour publicist tries to soften Happy''s image.', 'Failed hockey player-turned-golf whiz Happy Gilmore — whose unconventional approach and antics on the green courts the ire of rival Shooter McGavin — is determined to win a PGA tournament so he can save his granny''s house with the prize money. Meanwhile, an attractive tour publicist tries to soften Happy''s image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RnCeRzvI1xk5tuNWjpDKzSnJDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9614'),
  ('251646009321163475', 'Happy Gilmore 2', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Kyle Newacheck, Zak Mulligan, Kaitlin Heins', 'Tim Herlihy, Adam Sandler', 'Adam Sandler, Julie Bowen, Christopher McDonald, Benny Safdie, Ben Stiller, Bad Bunny, John Daly, Dennis Dugan', 'PG-13', 'Happy Gilmore isn''t done with golf — not by a long shot. Since his retirement after his first Tour Championship win, Gilmore returns to finance his daughter''s ballet classes.', 'Happy Gilmore isn''t done with golf — not by a long shot. Since his retirement after his first Tour Championship win, Gilmore returns to finance his daughter''s ballet classes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRwDPfYUzzzUQarfMxvPlasxzpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1263256'),
  ('1095529740558869474', 'Happy Go Ducky', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Red Coffey', 'NR', 'The Easter bunny brings an egg for Tom and Jerry that hatches into the little duckling. He keeps getting into water he shouldn''t: the aquarium, water cooler, bathtub, sink, as the boys keep rescuing it. They try to give the duck back to the Easter bunny - no go. They leave it in the pond at the park and think they''re home free, until the duckling brings his friends home.', 'The Easter bunny brings an egg for Tom and Jerry that hatches into the little duckling. He keeps getting into water he shouldn''t: the aquarium, water cooler, bathtub, sink, as the boys keep rescuing it. They try to give the duck back to the Easter bunny - no go. They leave it in the pond at the park and think they''re home free, until the duckling brings his friends home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kihbs1YEYxHXI9guZafbj3jVf8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40531'),
  ('759744316050395283', 'Happy Go Lovely', 1951, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Erwin Hillier', 'Val Guest', 'David Niven, Vera-Ellen, Cesar Romero, Gordon Jackson, Bobby Howes, Diane Hart, Barbara Couper, Henry Hewitt', null, 'Rich bachelor B.G. Bruno, the head of a successful greeting-card company in Scotland, is essentially a kind man but respectable to the point of stodginess and extreme stuffiness. An American troupe visiting Edinburgh wants to produce a musical in town but has trouble getting financiers. Bruno meets several leading ladies; through a misunderstanding, he doesn''t correct their impression that he''s a newspaper reporter.', 'Rich bachelor B.G. Bruno, the head of a successful greeting-card company in Scotland, is essentially a kind man but respectable to the point of stodginess and extreme stuffiness. An American troupe visiting Edinburgh wants to produce a musical in town but has trouble getting financiers. Bruno meets several leading ladies; through a misunderstanding, he doesn''t correct their impression that he''s a newspaper reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alnkjFvq0DC7IaS6QKJTYRlanQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127602'),
  ('679677680287227007', 'Happy Go Lucky', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Stefano Anselmi, Claudio Zamarion, Giulio Cupperi', 'Paolo Vita, Andrea Lolli, Nunzio Fabrizio Rotondo', 'Nunzio Fabrizio Rotondo, Paolo Vita, Elisa Di Eusanio, Micol Azzurro, Giulia Di Quilio, Maurizio Lombardi, Yari Gugliucci, Maurizio Mattioli', null, 'Nunzio and Paolo have always been friends but their partnership has only produced a series of failed businesses financed by their wives, who are now threatening to throw them out of the house. The two seek redemption by opening a vegetarian restaurant until, to please a food critic on whom their destinies depend, they find themselves faced with the need to transform the place into a steakhouse. Convinced vegetarians, Nunzio and Paolo have no intention of actually cooking animals. Can vegetable steaks be passed off as real meat? It''s the beginning of a spiral of hilarious events.', 'Nunzio and Paolo have always been friends but their partnership has only produced a series of failed businesses financed by their wives, who are now threatening to throw them out of the house. The two seek redemption by opening a vegetarian restaurant until, to please a food critic on whom their destinies depend, they find themselves faced with the need to transform the place into a steakhouse. Convinced vegetarians, Nunzio and Paolo have no intention of actually cooking animals. Can vegetable steaks be passed off as real meat? It''s the beginning of a spiral of hilarious events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czDavzRkwqDcfsfSHneuGBbJPVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546652'),
  ('449317715114038039', 'Happy Halloween, Scooby-Doo!', 2020, 'Family, Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Horror', 'Maxwell Atoms', 'Maxwell Atoms', 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Kate Micucci, Cassandra Peterson, Bill Nye, Dwight Schultz, Kamali Minter', 'NR', 'Scooby-Doo and the gang team up with their pals, Bill Nye The Science Guy and Elvira Mistress of the Dark, to solve this mystery of gigantic proportions and save Crystal Cove!', 'Scooby-Doo and the gang team up with their pals, Bill Nye The Science Guy and Elvira Mistress of the Dark, to solve this mystery of gigantic proportions and save Crystal Cove!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojSrGq5qIBObrodYilJQPXSYv6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721656'),
  ('148608162959477709', 'Happy He Who Like Ulysses', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Henri Colpi, Roger Fellous', 'André Var, Henri Colpi', 'Fernandel, Rellys, Mireille Audibert, Gilberte Rivet, Evelyne Séléna, Henri Tisot, Hélène Tossy, Max Amyl', null, 'For 25 years now, under the Provence sun, Antonin, a farmhand, has shared his work and everyday life with a horse named Ulysse. What a shock when Pascal, the farmer, tells him he has decided to sell Ulysse to a picador for being too old. Not only will he be separated from his faithful companion, but he is well aware too that the arenas of Arles mean death for Ulysse. Being unable to stand such injustice, Antonin runs away from the farm in the company of Ulysse. Together, they go through the Lubéron, the Baux de Provence, the Alpilles, the Crau and the Vaccarès. Yet, their journey is no pleasure cruise, specially when it comes to crossing National Road 7. After a visit to Marcellin, an old friend of his, Antonin sets off again with Ulysse, this time towards the Rhône River.', 'For 25 years now, under the Provence sun, Antonin, a farmhand, has shared his work and everyday life with a horse named Ulysse. What a shock when Pascal, the farmer, tells him he has decided to sell Ulysse to a picador for being too old. Not only will he be separated from his faithful companion, but he is well aware too that the arenas of Arles mean death for Ulysse. Being unable to stand such injustice, Antonin runs away from the farm in the company of Ulysse. Together, they go through the Lubéron, the Baux de Provence, the Alpilles, the Crau and the Vaccarès. Yet, their journey is no pleasure cruise, specially when it comes to crossing National Road 7. After a visit to Marcellin, an old friend of his, Antonin sets off again with Ulysse, this time towards the Rhône River.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YWdWDKR7ZOpMGYIzapGpObd3iQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95444'),
  ('67291403045438461', 'Happy Hell Night', 1991, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Brian Owens, Sol Negrin', 'Brian Owens, Ron Petersen, Michael Fitzpatrick', 'Nick Gregory, Laura Carney, Sam Rockwell, Darren McGavin, Charles Cragin, Frank John Hughes, Ted Clark, Jorja Fox', null, '25 years ago at Winfield College, psycho-priest Zachary Malius murdered seven frat boys and was put away in the local asylum. Now, however, the same fraternity stages a prank from which Malius is inadvertently set free and returns to the house to repeat his crime...', '25 years ago at Winfield College, psycho-priest Zachary Malius murdered seven frat boys and was put away in the local asylum. Now, however, the same fraternity stages a prank from which Malius is inadvertently set free and returns to the house to repeat his crime...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KBH7erBJrqzaydlszf6lncea4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30519'),
  ('542124355885666779', 'Happy High School', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Abel Scotti, Carlos Alberto Oliveira, Horacio Guisado', 'José P. Dominiani, Alberto Alejandro', 'Susana Traverso, Guillermo Francella, Mónica Guido, Jorge Rossi, Ignacio Quirós, Marcela Luppi, Paola Papini, Carmen Barbieri', null, 'The plot involves the school director bringing in a female inspector to clean up the school. The students decide to kidnap her and replace her with the sexy stripper "aunt" of one of the girls (who is naturally sleeping with several of the guys). The real director meanwhile falls madly in lust with one of her male captors. Meanwhile a goody-good student and her hypocrite father begin to suspect the ruse . . . So will there be a lot of crazy hijinks? Will everything work out happily in the end? Will the entire female cast (and an unfortunate amount of the male cast) find some excuse to get naked?', 'The plot involves the school director bringing in a female inspector to clean up the school. The students decide to kidnap her and replace her with the sexy stripper "aunt" of one of the girls (who is naturally sleeping with several of the guys). The real director meanwhile falls madly in lust with one of her male captors. Meanwhile a goody-good student and her hypocrite father begin to suspect the ruse . . . So will there be a lot of crazy hijinks? Will everything work out happily in the end? Will the entire female cast (and an unfortunate amount of the male cast) find some excuse to get naked?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GWjLXanqaoc4gk1vQiV6b3YETh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268049'),
  ('1054837724052472852', 'Happy Hour', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Franz Müller, Bernhard Keller', 'Franz Müller', 'Simon Licht, Mehdi Nebbou, Alexander Hörbe, Susan Swanton, Daniela Lebang, Barbara Schwarz, Christine Deady, Tanya Flynn', null, 'The middle-aged family man Hans-Christian (HC) left by his wife goes to Ireland for a short break with his old friends Wolfgang and Nic. He should win at Guinness bonfires and fishing trips distance to the chaos at home. HC has to learn to say no and need other women, his friends believe, to get rid of his loser habitus. In the already tense situation, old competition fights, outbursts of anger and self-pity quickly come up. And Nic and Wolfgang seem to have needed the time-out almost as much as HC.', 'The middle-aged family man Hans-Christian (HC) left by his wife goes to Ireland for a short break with his old friends Wolfgang and Nic. He should win at Guinness bonfires and fishing trips distance to the chaos at home. HC has to learn to say no and need other women, his friends believe, to get rid of his loser habitus. In the already tense situation, old competition fights, outbursts of anger and self-pity quickly come up. And Nic and Wolfgang seem to have needed the time-out almost as much as HC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUtTcSKzKe9mDu3dP3UrsVY5vtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346914'),
  ('334445412392500316', 'Happy Hunting', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joe Dietsch, Louie Gibson, Joe Dietsch', 'Joe Dietsch, Louie Gibson', 'Martin Dingle Wall, Ken Lally, Kenny Wormald, Connor Williams, Gary Sturm, C.J. Baker, Jeremy Lawson, Michael Tipps', 'NR', 'An alcoholic drifter must battle withdrawal and psychotic rednecks after he becomes the target of a deranged sporting event.', 'An alcoholic drifter must battle withdrawal and psychotic rednecks after he becomes the target of a deranged sporting event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvFE9RlFHTobOEceRyf9iQLPHSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412762'),
  ('846191741109640976', 'Happy Lambs', 2015, 'Drama', 'Kadir Sözen', 'Kadir Sözen', 'Narges Rashidi, Benno Fürmann, Jascha Baum, Vedat Erincin, Marlene Metternich, David Hürten, Pauline Fuchs, Hans Martin Stier', null, 'The perfect world of a small family breaks, when Can discover that his mother works in a brothel. In a maelstrom of anger, guilt and despair Mother and son are forced to forgive himself.', 'The perfect world of a small family breaks, when Can discover that his mother works in a brothel. In a maelstrom of anger, guilt and despair Mother and son are forced to forgive himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp3CJvlEExRU2wgNDV5IBq2zpvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380436'),
  ('1105937315139905634', 'Happy New Year', 1973, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Claude Lelouch, Jean Collomb, Élie Chouraqui', 'Claude Lelouch, Pierre Uytterhoeven', 'Lino Ventura, Françoise Fabian, Charles Gérard, André Falcon, Mireille Mathieu, Lilo, Claude Mann, Frédéric de Pasquale', null, 'Released from prison under a New Year amnesty, a criminal tries to pick up the threads of a life changed not only by his daring plan to rob a jewelry store in out-of-season Cannes, but also by a very special someone he met there.', 'Released from prison under a New Year amnesty, a criminal tries to pick up the threads of a life changed not only by his daring plan to rob a jewelry store in out-of-season Cannes, but also by a very special someone he met there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JdSrp8qV1LhYIXKONT5iP4i4LV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76329'),
  ('749882386864130577', 'Happy New Year', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'John G. Avildsen, James Crabe', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Peter Falk, Charles Durning, Tom Courtenay, Tracy Brooks Swope, Ruben Rabasa, Wendy Hughes, Joan Copeland, Claude Lelouch', null, 'Small time crooksters Nick and Charlie have an elaborate plan to rob an exclusive jewelers store. Using a variety of disguises and posing as rich old men and women they begin the set-up, but then Nick falls for the owner of a neighboring antique store and things get a little complicated.', 'Small time crooksters Nick and Charlie have an elaborate plan to rob an exclusive jewelers store. Using a variety of disguises and posing as rich old men and women they begin the set-up, but then Nick falls for the owner of a neighboring antique store and things get a little complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4J33Qf5LsFbateO8T9x4uxyabso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133781'),
  ('1102499632482616608', 'Happy New Year', 2014, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Farah Khan, Varun Lalwani, Manush Nandan', 'Mayur Puri', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Deepika Padukone, Abhishek Bachchan, Sonu Sood, Boman Irani, Vivaan Shah, Jackie Shroff, Anupam Kher', 'PG-13', 'Six would-be thieves enter a prestigious dance competition as a cover for their larger goal of pulling off a major heist.', 'Six would-be thieves enter a prestigious dance competition as a cover for their larger goal of pulling off a major heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kv0trpR00030JmZbLnLMBKIrtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277432'),
  ('405344829430561754', 'Happy New Year, Charlie Brown', 1986, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez, Sam Jaimes', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Chad Allen, Kristie Baker, Jeremy Miller, Melissa Guzzi, Aron Mandelbaum, Jason Mendelson, Elizabeth Lyn Fraser, Bill Melendez', 'G', 'It''s the night of Peppermint Patty’s New Year’s Eve bash, but Charlie Brown has to write a book report about War and Peace. Hoping to join the fun for a special dance with the Little Red-Haired Girl, he tries desperately to finish in time.', 'It''s the night of Peppermint Patty’s New Year’s Eve bash, but Charlie Brown has to write a book report about War and Peace. Hoping to join the fun for a special dance with the Little Red-Haired Girl, he tries desperately to finish in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzkOg991CsVIakFmqSxUhQq2UbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51940'),
  ('911431878257777910', 'Happy New Year, Colin Burstead', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Ben Wheatley, Laurie Rose', 'Ben Wheatley', 'Neil Maskell, Sam Riley, Sura Dohnke, Bill Paterson, Doon Mackichan, Charles Dance, Hayley Squires, Mark Monero', null, 'Colin has rented a stately country home for his extended family’s New Year celebrations. He’s the centre of attention until his estranged brother David unexpectedly arrives, throwing the family dynamic far off orbit.', 'Colin has rented a stately country home for his extended family’s New Year celebrations. He’s the centre of attention until his estranged brother David unexpectedly arrives, throwing the family dynamic far off orbit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1RtxOgL3AKb6NY61nWlewmyqpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497863'),
  ('388543935234777383', 'Happy New York', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paweł Edelman, Janusz Zaorski, Adam Iwinski', 'Janusz Zaorski, Edward Redliński', 'Bogusław Linda, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Janusz Gajos, Cezary Pazura, Katarzyna Figura, Rafał Olbrychski, Eugeniusz Priwieziencew, Danuta Stenka', null, 'The story of six Polish emigrants living in New York City, who try to live their American Dream and cope with the realities of the Big Apple.', 'The story of six Polish emigrants living in New York City, who try to live their American Dream and cope with the realities of the Big Apple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QfFEgSd8jS58TMoF9jA11ZR7aX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153266'),
  ('295956053862132665', 'Happy Old Year', 2019, 'Drama', 'Niramon Ross, Thanakrit Wongwaraphan, Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit', 'Chutimon Chuengcharoensukying, Sunny Suwanmethanon, Apasiri Nitibhon, Sarika Sathsilpsupa, Thirawat Ngosawang, Patcha Kitchaicharoen, Wasu Pluemsakulthai, Bhumibhat Thavornsiri', null, 'While decluttering her home, a woman''s hefty house renovation leads her back to the past when she uncovers her ex-boyfriend''s belongings.', 'While decluttering her home, a woman''s hefty house renovation leads her back to the past when she uncovers her ex-boyfriend''s belongings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBXJwfgGwshKAHEqDXgj0pJ2LRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628053'),
  ('118250751835602952', 'Happy Patel: Khatarnak Jasoos', 2026, 'Comedy, Action, Romance', 'Vir Das, Kavi Shastri, Kavish Sinha', 'Vir Das, Amogh Ranadive', 'Vir Das, Mona Singh, Mithila Palkar, Sharib Hashmi, Srushti Tawade, Aamir Khan, Imran Khan, Andrew Sloman', null, 'Chronically unsuccessful MI7 operative Happy Patel is finally assigned a mission in Goa, where he uncovers his Indian roots and must rescue a high-profile scientist from crime lord Mama. Unaware of his Indian heritage and armed with a comically British accent, Happy’s blunders trigger a string of chaotic mishaps that could lead him to expose a criminal network.', 'Chronically unsuccessful MI7 operative Happy Patel is finally assigned a mission in Goa, where he uncovers his Indian roots and must rescue a high-profile scientist from crime lord Mama. Unaware of his Indian heritage and armed with a comically British accent, Happy’s blunders trigger a string of chaotic mishaps that could lead him to expose a criminal network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZJBXGNyDanSne6a2TLRU45Uhwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1282440'),
  ('555642654057901029', 'Happy People: A Year in the Taiga', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Gleb Stepanov, Alexey Matveev, Werner Herzog', 'Dmitry Vasyukov, Rudolph Herzog, Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Gennady Soloviev, Anatoly Blumei, Gennady Tiganov, Mikhail Tarkovsky', 'NR', 'In the center of the story is the life of the indigenous people of the village Bakhtia at the river Yenisei in the Siberian Taiga. The camera follows the protagonists in the village over a period of a year. The natives, whose daily routines have barely changed over the last centuries, keep living their lives according to their own cultural traditions.', 'In the center of the story is the life of the indigenous people of the village Bakhtia at the river Yenisei in the Siberian Taiga. The camera follows the protagonists in the village over a period of a year. The natives, whose daily routines have barely changed over the last centuries, keep living their lives according to their own cultural traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSDdllenxdsPiMONxEQEBfiLvio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89704'),
  ('162808998075881806', 'Happy Raj', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Maria Raja Elenchezhian, Madhan Christopher, MS Sathish Kumar', 'Maria Raja Elenchezhian', 'G. V. Prakash Kumar, Sri Gouri Priya Reddy, Abbas, George Mariyan, Akhilan', null, 'A city romance meets a rural family invasion. What follows is chaos, comedy, and heartfelt moments. The story unfolds as a joyful entertainer that explores love, cultural clashes, and the importance of family bonds.', 'A city romance meets a rural family invasion. What follows is chaos, comedy, and heartfelt moments. The story unfolds as a joyful entertainer that explores love, cultural clashes, and the importance of family bonds.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8hmB6KNUFFzChYJxngIp063H2YR.jpg', 'plex:movie:happy-raj'),
  ('690044202264905288', 'Happy Tears', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mitchell Lichtenstein, Jamie Anderson', 'Mitchell Lichtenstein', 'Parker Posey, Demi Moore, Ellen Barkin, Christian Camargo, Rip Torn, Billy Magnussen, Richard Barlow, Peter Patrikios', 'R', 'Two sisters return home to care for their aging father.', 'Two sisters return home to care for their aging father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeLEwPg2bgUIgUGSw4zXtU33XdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39072'),
  ('136706554403180355', 'Happy Times', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zhang Yimou, Hou Yong', 'Gai Zi', 'Zhao Benshan, Dong Jie, Dong Li-Fan, Fu Biao, Li Xuejian, Qibin Leng, Gong Jinghua, Niu Ben', null, 'Zhao is an ageing bachelor, who has not been fortunate in love. Believing that he has finally met the female of his dreams, Zhao makes her believe that he is opulent and consents to a lavish wedding.', 'Zhao is an ageing bachelor, who has not been fortunate in love. Believing that he has finally met the female of his dreams, Zhao makes her believe that he is opulent and consents to a lavish wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3R2mheIEHKmbrjDyohw88Z89d8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45861'),
  ('942841889076543044', 'Happy Times', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Luis Javier Henaine, Diego García', 'Alejandra Olvera Avila, Luis Javier Henaine', 'Luis Arrieta, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Miguel Rodarte, Bárbara de Regil, Humberto Busto, Iván Arana, Fernando Becerril, Elizabeth Guindi', null, 'A young man is unable to break up with his girlfriend and decides to hire an agency that specializes in ending relationships.', 'A young man is unable to break up with his girlfriend and decides to hire an agency that specializes in ending relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qK7MAppJ4WF6Y8VsPaPtBFVorlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265331'),
