  ('496255849659286627', 'Happy Times Will Come Soon', 2016, 'Drama', 'Alessandro Comodin, Tristan Bordmann, Alexandre Nazarian', 'Alessandro Comodin, Milena Magnani', 'Sabrina Seyvecou, Erikas Sizonovas, Luca Bernardi, Marco Giordana, Carlo Rigoni, Paolo Viano, Santo Gioffre'', Marinella Cichello', null, 'Tommaso and Arturo are on the run in a remote forest. They hunt for food, trying to survive and find their way through the lush nature. It’s quiet, almost peaceful, until the sound of gunshots… Many years later, this forest has a wolf problem. It’s here where Ariane discovers a strange hole in the ground. Could she be the woman referred to in the valley’s legends?', 'Tommaso and Arturo are on the run in a remote forest. They hunt for food, trying to survive and find their way through the lush nature. It’s quiet, almost peaceful, until the sound of gunshots… Many years later, this forest has a wolf problem. It’s here where Ariane discovers a strange hole in the ground. Could she be the woman referred to in the valley’s legends?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHG4bsTJh8WOpXdemhIkiHNzyGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393516'),
  ('80302579619453023', 'Happy Together', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mel Damski, Donald P.H. Eaton, Peter Berquist', 'Craig J. Nevius', 'Patrick Dempsey, Helen Slater, Brad Pitt, Dan Schneider, Marius Weyers, Barbara Babcock, Kevin Hardesty, Gloria Hayes', 'PG-13', 'Christopher is an ambitious college freshman, striving to become a writer. Through a computer fault he''s assigned the same room as Alex, a real party freak and... a girl! He''s annoyed and tries to get a different room as soon as possible, but when he learns to know her, he also starts to like her. She not only improves his sexual life, but also his writing skills', 'Christopher is an ambitious college freshman, striving to become a writer. Through a computer fault he''s assigned the same room as Alex, a real party freak and... a girl! He''s annoyed and tries to get a different room as soon as possible, but when he learns to know her, he also starts to like her. She not only improves his sexual life, but also his writing skills', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ekqpIww56hYDSsVFU7GcNfoBGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55059'),
  ('1126054471856022249', 'Happy Together', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Doyle, Wong Kar-Wai, Marcelo Bosco', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Leslie Cheung, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Chang Chen, Gregory Dayton', 'NR', 'A couple travels from Hong Kong to Argentina to revive their relationship but experience turbulence when both men''s lives drift in separate directions.', 'A couple travels from Hong Kong to Argentina to revive their relationship but experience turbulence when both men''s lives drift in separate directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kO4KjUkQOfWSBw06Bdl7m6AlEP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18329'),
  ('394165046710498736', 'Happy When You''re Not', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Igor Marchenko, Georgy Magala', 'Igor Marchenko', 'Aleksandra Bortich, Gosha Tokaev, Sonya Rayzman', null, 'Evgeny and Evgenia share the same name, difficult personalities, and complicated personal lives. He is in love with his best friend''s fiancée, she is having an affair with her boss. The young people meet by chance at a party and instantly feel mutual... antipathy toward each other. But that doesn''t stop them from ending up in the same bed. But afterwards everything becomes even more complicated.', 'Evgeny and Evgenia share the same name, difficult personalities, and complicated personal lives. He is in love with his best friend''s fiancée, she is having an affair with her boss. The young people meet by chance at a party and instantly feel mutual... antipathy toward each other. But that doesn''t stop them from ending up in the same bed. But afterwards everything becomes even more complicated.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmhnfY3EPCwF1uTmA7bcITkkhWHZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:schastliv-kogda-ty-net'),
  ('450264378942780074', 'Happy-Go-Lucky', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vasiliy Shukshin, Anatoliy Zabolotskiy, Aleksandr Matveyenko', 'Vasiliy Shukshin', 'Vasiliy Shukshin, Lidiya Fedoseyeva-Shukshina, Vsevolod Sanayev, Zinoviy Gerdt, Ivan Ryzhov, Stanislav Lyubshin, Lyubov Sokolova, Georgi Burkov', null, 'On their way to a Black Sea resort, a Siberian tractor driver and his wife make new friends and take a detour to Moscow.', 'On their way to a Black Sea resort, a Siberian tractor driver and his wife make new friends and take a detour to Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quLUkMJSbUqj04vpAr3J2hOfOoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105483'),
  ('70738506444599591', 'Happy-Go-Lucky', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mike Leigh, Dick Pope, Patrick Rolfe', 'Mike Leigh', 'Sally Hawkins, Eddie Marsan, Alexis Zegerman, Sylvestra Le Touzel, Stanley Townsend, Kate O''Flynn, Caroline Martin, Oliver Maltman', 'R', 'A look at a few chapters in the life of Poppy, a cheery, colorful, North London schoolteacher whose optimism tends to exasperate those around her.', 'A look at a few chapters in the life of Poppy, a cheery, colorful, North London schoolteacher whose optimism tends to exasperate those around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FdD4YClMPZponkvHuQOgEOaWcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10503'),
  ('13252007720011007', 'Happy-Go-Lucky Days', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Junpei Takatsu, Haruka Sagawa, Takuya Sato', 'Takuya Sato, Yoriko Tomita, Yasunori Ide', 'Kana Hanazawa, Mikako Komatsu, Takahiro Sakurai, Seiichiro Yamashita, Ibuki Kido, Kaori Ishihara, Fairouz Ai, Saori Hayami', null, 'Love is love. Someday, the pain of being in love will be an endearing memory. No matter who the feelings are towards, no matter what form it takes, all love and lifestyles have the same value. An omnibus anime tells the stories of “The wedding of an ex”, “a student and a teacher at an all-boys’ school” and “childhood friends whose bodies and hearts change with adolescence.”', 'Love is love. Someday, the pain of being in love will be an endearing memory. No matter who the feelings are towards, no matter what form it takes, all love and lifestyles have the same value. An omnibus anime tells the stories of “The wedding of an ex”, “a student and a teacher at an all-boys’ school” and “childhood friends whose bodies and hearts change with adolescence.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKMFum83Lf6upDBr74dCclHJlOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649523'),
  ('369270422908407698', 'Happy-Go-Nutty', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Wally Maher, Dick Nelson', null, 'Screwy Squirrel escapes from the nut house and leads the guard dog on a long and ridiculous chase.', 'Screwy Squirrel escapes from the nut house and leads the guard dog on a long and ridiculous chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5pv2oXT1D2L4Ge0G8ZQ8Vq8xZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84886'),
  ('888533759301202005', 'Happy, Happy', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Anna Myking, Anne Sewitsky, Binne Thoresen', 'Ragnhild Tronvoll', 'Agnes Kittelsen, Joachim Rafaelsen, Maibritt Saerens, Henrik Rafaelsen, Oskar Hernæs Brandsø, Ram Shibab Ebedy, Heine Totland, Hans Martin Austestad', 'R', 'A perfect housewife, who just happens to be sex-starved, struggles to keep her emotions in check when an attractive family moves in next door.', 'A perfect housewife, who just happens to be sex-starved, struggles to keep her emotions in check when an attractive family moves in next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npvqy3LZD9uDqyBb9pB5euzIcYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46147'),
  ('372868824103468326', 'Happy, Texas', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mark Illsley, Bruce Douglas Johnson, Jody Spilkoman', 'Ed Stone, Mark Illsley, Phil Reeves', 'Jeremy Northam, Steve Zahn, William H. Macy, Ally Walker, Illeana Douglas, M.C. Gainey, Ron Perlman, Mo Gaffney', null, 'Two escaped convicts roll into the village of Happy, Texas, where they''re mistaken for a gay couple who work as beauty pageant consultants. They go along with it to duck the police, but the local sheriff has a secret of his own.', 'Two escaped convicts roll into the village of Happy, Texas, where they''re mistaken for a gay couple who work as beauty pageant consultants. They go along with it to duck the police, but the local sheriff has a secret of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSEzKwTDQfmlIFJqKia2cSg88KH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24066'),
  ('171382368225283377', 'Happyend', 2024, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Bill Kirstein, Neo Sora, Rikiya Takano', 'Neo Sora', 'Hayato Kurihara, Yukito Hidaka, Yuta Hayashi, Shina Peng, ARAZI, Kilala Inori, Ayumu Nakajima, Masaru Yahagi', null, 'In a near-future Japanese city bracing for a devastating earthquake, a group of teenage friends navigate personal struggles and fractured bonds amid rising tension.', 'In a near-future Japanese city bracing for a devastating earthquake, a group of teenage friends navigate personal struggles and fractured bonds amid rising tension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRN6U0srlhNe0B69dJZ0seuv4GZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730251'),
  ('690273997282386652', 'Happythankyoumoreplease', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Josh Radnor, Seamus Tierney', 'Josh Radnor', 'Josh Radnor, Malin Åkerman, Kate Mara, Zoe Kazan, Pablo Schreiber, Tony Hale, Michael Algieri, Jakob Appelman', 'R', 'Captures a generational moment - young people on the cusp of truly growing up, tiring of their reflexive cynicism, each in their own ways struggling to connect and define what it means to love and be loved. Six New Yorkers juggle love, friendship, and the keenly challenging specter of adulthood. Sam Wexler is a struggling writer who''s having a particularly bad day. When a young boy gets separated from his family on the subway, Sam makes the questionable decision to bring the child back to his apartment and thus begins a rewarding, yet complicated, friendship. Sam''s life revolves around his friends — Annie, whose self-image keeps her from commitment; Charlie and Mary Catherine, a couple whose possible move to Los Angeles tests their relationship; and Mississippi, a cabaret singer who catches Sam''s eye.', 'Captures a generational moment - young people on the cusp of truly growing up, tiring of their reflexive cynicism, each in their own ways struggling to connect and define what it means to love and be loved. Six New Yorkers juggle love, friendship, and the keenly challenging specter of adulthood. Sam Wexler is a struggling writer who''s having a particularly bad day. When a young boy gets separated from his family on the subway, Sam makes the questionable decision to bring the child back to his apartment and thus begins a rewarding, yet complicated, friendship. Sam''s life revolves around his friends — Annie, whose self-image keeps her from commitment; Charlie and Mary Catherine, a couple whose possible move to Los Angeles tests their relationship; and Mississippi, a cabaret singer who catches Sam''s eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWZwKkrPNoSa7LIvUTwClmFUjBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47218'),
  ('490110003662781055', 'Häpy endkö? Eli kuinka Uuno Turhapuro sai niin kauniin ja rikkaan vaimon', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Pekka Aine', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Ritva Valkama, Tapio Hämäläinen, Olavi Ahonen, Helge Herala, Marja Korhonen, Pertti Palo', null, 'Uuno moves in flight cargo to Helsinki for the search of a rich, beautiful wife. He buys elegant clothes for eight marks from an estate auction and in two weeks becomes the most pursued bachelor in town, charming all the women. He also starts as a waiter in Vaaleanpunainen sika (Pink Pig), which starts the first quarrels between him and his father-in-law.', 'Uuno moves in flight cargo to Helsinki for the search of a rich, beautiful wife. He buys elegant clothes for eight marks from an estate auction and in two weeks becomes the most pursued bachelor in town, charming all the women. He also starts as a waiter in Vaaleanpunainen sika (Pink Pig), which starts the first quarrels between him and his father-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1o9fGuH2aOPKFlR44GL5hg4qczb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36767'),
  ('841141534816349513', 'Haq', 2025, 'Drama', 'Suparn Verma, Pratham Mehta, Shivam Gupta', 'Reshu Nath', 'Yami Gautam Dhar, Emraan Hashmi, Vartika Singh, Sheeba Chaddha, Danish Husain, Aseem Hattangady, Jaimini Pathak, Piloo Vidyarthi', 'PG', 'In 1980s India, Shazia Bano takes her husband to court after he abandons her and their children, sparking a national battle over faith, women’s rights, and justice.', 'In 1980s India, Shazia Bano takes her husband to court after he abandons her and their children, sparking a national battle over faith, women’s rights, and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO7OI5MyzPSiVmlXXnlBKlAJH92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1417941'),
  ('669437845994833405', 'Har Dil Jo Pyar Karega', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Raj Kanwar, Chetan Naidu, Gopal Kapil', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Salman Khan, Rani Mukerji, Preity Zinta, Neeraj Vora, Shakti Kapoor, Satish Shah, Vinay Pathak, Kamini Kaushal', null, 'Jahnvi’s best friend Pooja attempts suicide when her boyfriend jilts her. Raj, a struggling singer, saves Pooja but she still goes into a coma and Raj gets stuck into caring for her. Upon recovery, Pooja falls for Raj, but he is in love with Jahnvi.', 'Jahnvi’s best friend Pooja attempts suicide when her boyfriend jilts her. Raj, a struggling singer, saves Pooja but she still goes into a coma and Raj gets stuck into caring for her. Upon recovery, Pooja falls for Raj, but he is in love with Jahnvi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66CpsF2lrolmsHI2BgZH16Cb7EB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157800'),
  ('1098840337268593031', 'Hara-Kiri: Death of a Samurai', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'Takashi Miike, Ryosuke Kanesaki, Kaori Ohtagaki', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Koji Yakusho, Ichikawa Ebizo XI, Eita Nagayama, Hikari Mitsushima, Naoto Takenaka, Kazuki Namioka, Hirofumi Arai, Munetaka Aoki', 'NR', 'A tale of revenge, honor and disgrace, centering on a poverty-stricken samurai who discovers the fate of his ronin son-in-law, setting in motion a tense showdown of vengeance against the house of a feudal lord.', 'A tale of revenge, honor and disgrace, centering on a poverty-stricken samurai who discovers the fate of his ronin son-in-law, setting in motion a tense showdown of vengeance against the house of a feudal lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqIqSoxbsVTfcr6CgTtSpzJBkYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85836'),
  ('903456455024205126', 'Haraamkhor', 2015, 'Drama', 'Shlok Sharma, Siddharth Diwan', 'Shlok Sharma', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Trimala Adhikari, Harish Khanna, Mohammad Samad, Irfan Khan', null, 'When a vulnerable new student finds comfort in her brash teacher, their academic relationship takes a manipulative and troubling turn.', 'When a vulnerable new student finds comfort in her brash teacher, their academic relationship takes a manipulative and troubling turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZMrkB3Y2srTl4MwMOqQSnNBeVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314690'),
  ('776847657305797963', 'Harakiri', 1919, 'Drama', 'Fritz Lang, Max Fassbender', 'John Luther Long, David Belasco', 'Paul Biensfeldt, Lil Dagover, George John, Meinhart Maur, Rudolf Lettinger, Erner Huebsch, Kaete Juster, Niels Prien', null, 'The daughter of a daimyo, one forced to commit harakiri to secure her a future to choose her own destiny, falls in love with and marries a European officer. The officer returns to Europe but promises to come back for her and his new child, but when he comes back to Japan, he brings his European wife.', 'The daughter of a daimyo, one forced to commit harakiri to secure her a future to choose her own destiny, falls in love with and marries a European officer. The officer returns to Europe but promises to come back for her and his new child, but when he comes back to Japan, he brings his European wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDXMUdERs3uFtgO8P5J5WyWT554.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174958'),
  ('317569756925270696', 'Harakiri', 1962, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Kôji Niwa, Yoshio Miyajima', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Akira Ishihama, Shima Iwashita, Tetsuro Tamba, Masao Mishima, Ichirō Nakatani, Kei Satō, Yoshio Inaba', 'NR', 'Down-on-his-luck veteran Tsugumo Hanshirō enters the courtyard of the prosperous House of Iyi. Unemployed, and with no family, he hopes to find a place to commit seppuku—and a worthy second to deliver the coup de grâce in his suicide ritual. The senior counselor for the Iyi clan questions the ronin’s resolve and integrity, suspecting Hanshirō of seeking charity rather than an honorable end. What follows is a pair of interlocking stories which lay bare the difference between honor and respect, and promises to examine the legendary foundations of the Samurai code.', 'Down-on-his-luck veteran Tsugumo Hanshirō enters the courtyard of the prosperous House of Iyi. Unemployed, and with no family, he hopes to find a place to commit seppuku—and a worthy second to deliver the coup de grâce in his suicide ritual. The senior counselor for the Iyi clan questions the ronin’s resolve and integrity, suspecting Hanshirō of seeking charity rather than an honorable end. What follows is a pair of interlocking stories which lay bare the difference between honor and respect, and promises to examine the legendary foundations of the Samurai code.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nPwMd3KviJWaHzG9fZCqlwWMas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14537'),
  ('24926222406008865', 'Harbin', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, History, War', 'Hong Kyung-pyo, Woo Min-ho, Park Cheong-woo', 'Kim Kyung-chan, Woo Min-ho', 'Hyun Bin, Park Jeong-min, Jo Woo-jin, Jeon Yeo-been, Lee Dong-wook, Park Hoon, You Chea-myung, Lily Franky', 'NR', 'In 1909, several years after Korea is forced into becoming a Japanese colony, freedom fighters plot the daring assassination of Japan''s prime minister during their quest for independence.', 'In 1909, several years after Korea is forced into becoming a Japanese colony, freedom fighters plot the daring assassination of Japan''s prime minister during their quest for independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNA9eRaFCLlFKRZlzYEldPZlFpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610251'),
  ('797118829450181227', 'Harbinger Down', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Alec Gillis, Benjamin L. Brown', 'Alec Gillis', 'Lance Henriksen, Matt Winston, Camille Balsamo, Giovonnie Samuels, Winston James Francis, Morgana Ignis, Milla Bjorn', null, 'A group of grad students have booked passage on the fishing trawler Harbinger to study the effects of global warming on a pod of Orcas in the Bering Sea. When the ship''s crew dredges up a recently thawed piece of old Soviet space wreckage, things get downright deadly. It seems that the Russians experimented with tardigrades, tiny resilient animals able to withstand the extremes of space radiation. The creatures survived, but not without mutation. Now the crew is exposed to aggressively mutating organisms. And after being locked in ice for 3 decades, the creatures aren''t about to give up the warmth of human companionship.', 'A group of grad students have booked passage on the fishing trawler Harbinger to study the effects of global warming on a pod of Orcas in the Bering Sea. When the ship''s crew dredges up a recently thawed piece of old Soviet space wreckage, things get downright deadly. It seems that the Russians experimented with tardigrades, tiny resilient animals able to withstand the extremes of space radiation. The creatures survived, but not without mutation. Now the crew is exposed to aggressively mutating organisms. And after being locked in ice for 3 decades, the creatures aren''t about to give up the warmth of human companionship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vmjC5lfEdb26H8hjt73TWTvyNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296130'),
