  ('203014142106048247', 'Hard Boiled', 1992, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Woo, Sylvia Liu Jing-Yi, Patrick Leung Pak-Kin', 'Gordon Chan, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Philip Chan Yan-Kin, Stephen Tung Wai, Kwan Hoi-San, John Woo', 'NR', 'A cop who loses his partner in a shoot-out with gun smugglers goes on a mission to catch them. In order to get closer to the leaders of the ring he joins forces with an undercover cop who''s working as a gangster hitman. They use all means of excessive force to find them.', 'A cop who loses his partner in a shoot-out with gun smugglers goes on a mission to catch them. In order to get closer to the leaders of the ring he joins forces with an undercover cop who''s working as a gangster hitman. They use all means of excessive force to find them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMqr4CGGqVlfI8DdrSelK1e9aFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11782'),
