  ('900231875228697091', 'Hard Car - Desiderio sfrenato del piacere', 1989, 'Thriller', 'Alessio Carli, Giovanni Amadei', 'Giovanni Amadei', 'Valentine Demy, David D''Ingeo, Carmen Di Pietro, Alessandro Freyberger, Domenico Fortunato, Cristina Rinaldi', null, 'A young woman watching accidentally killing an unknown in the offices of her lover. From now on she''s on the run, chased by an SUV who seeks her after life. The woman is desperate to escape their fate and experienced a world of humiliation and fear. After being raped she takes her fate into their own hands - the hunted becomes the hunter.', 'A young woman watching accidentally killing an unknown in the offices of her lover. From now on she''s on the run, chased by an SUV who seeks her after life. The woman is desperate to escape their fate and experienced a world of humiliation and fear. After being raped she takes her fate into their own hands - the hunted becomes the hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUaeDt2jtrBzLdJYdtXN7xTYxSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370522'),
