  ('265921392007957427', 'Hard Luck', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Elgin Lessley', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Virginia Fox, Joe Roberts, Bull Montana', 'NR', 'A down on his luck young man makes several attempts at committing suicide but fails them too. He then finds himself becoming more confident through a series of petty adventures, to such an extent that this becomes his undoing.', 'A down on his luck young man makes several attempts at committing suicide but fails them too. He then finds himself becoming more confident through a series of petty adventures, to such an extent that this becomes his undoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0JoUtCg6TbeJg1bSCE4CQ8LWES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38812'),
