  ('135832405741251880', 'Hard Miles', 2024, 'Drama', 'R.J. Daniel Hanna, Tony Aronovitz, Phineas Palmer', 'R.J. Daniel Hanna, Christian Sander', 'Matthew Modine, Cynthia Kaye McWilliams, Jahking Guillory, Jackson Kelly, Zachary T. Robbins, Damien Diaz, Leslie David Baker, Sean Astin', 'PG-13', 'A strong-willed social worker at a youth prison assembles a cycling team of teenage convicts and takes them on a transformative 1000-mile ride. Inspired by the life of Greg Townsend and the Ridgeview Academy Cycling Team. This is the story of how these troubled young men found another gear.', 'A strong-willed social worker at a youth prison assembles a cycling team of teenage convicts and takes them on a transformative 1000-mile ride. Inspired by the life of Greg Townsend and the Ridgeview Academy Cycling Team. This is the story of how these troubled young men found another gear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pU50LpVZ7doTyJeC9JaqcbeH4ef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1009679'),
  ('1075871584768357674', 'Hard Night Falling', 2019, 'Thriller, Action', 'Giorgio Bruno, Rocco Mara, Angelo Stramaglia', 'Alessandro Riccardi, Giorgio Serafini', 'Dolph Lundgren, Hal Yamanouchi, Natalie Burn, Mario Opinato, Brice Martinet, Andrea Scarduzio, Sinne Mutsaers, Ralph Palka', 'R', 'Goro, a criminal mastermind, plot to steal a massive cache of gold from the Rossini family. Unbeknownst to Goro and his soldiers of fortune, one of Rossini''s guest is a highly trained foreign operative who fights to not only save the hostages and the gold, but his imperiled family.', 'Goro, a criminal mastermind, plot to steal a massive cache of gold from the Rossini family. Unbeknownst to Goro and his soldiers of fortune, one of Rossini''s guest is a highly trained foreign operative who fights to not only save the hostages and the gold, but his imperiled family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pux7s4pXUcTvxB1fAODSaEXeXRH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605368'),
  ('206861942252134215', 'Hard Paint', 2019, 'Drama', 'Marcio Reolon, Filipe Matzembacher, Glauco Firpo', 'Filipe Matzembacher, Marcio Reolon', 'Shico Menegat, Bruno Fernandes, Guega Peixoto, Sandra Dani, Frederico Vasques, Denis Gosch, Camila Falcão, Kaya Rodrigues', 'NR', 'Pedro earns a living in chat rooms. He transforms himself into NeonBoy in front of the webcam. Slowly, this young man dips his fingers into pots of coloured paint and glides them across his naked body. But things change when Pedro notices that somebody is imitating his performances. He agrees to go on a date with his mysterious rival. This rendezvous will have far-reaching consequences.', 'Pedro earns a living in chat rooms. He transforms himself into NeonBoy in front of the webcam. Slowly, this young man dips his fingers into pots of coloured paint and glides them across his naked body. But things change when Pedro notices that somebody is imitating his performances. He agrees to go on a date with his mysterious rival. This rendezvous will have far-reaching consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruLpOUGtPMFJKgE81bKahdKvcSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500854'),
  ('326991397119493438', 'Hard Pass', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'Joana Riva', 'Joana Riva', 'Morgan Follon-Hooghuis, Jaden Bryan, Josh Hallika, Nirian Lorente, Adrian Camacho Camacho, AL3X, Aldan Rossnagel, Kaitlyn Shay', null, 'Shy college student Ruby finds escape from her day-to-day life in her daydreams of the perfect boyfriend, at the expense of ever finding real world connection.', 'Shy college student Ruby finds escape from her day-to-day life in her daydreams of the perfect boyfriend, at the expense of ever finding real world connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hK35I5U9pT0aw58dxSa8mrbI0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1644320'),
  ('1037700984763686659', 'Hard Promises', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martin Davidson, Andrzej Bartkowiak', 'Jule Selbo', 'Sissy Spacek, William Petersen, Brian Kerwin, Mare Winningham, Jeff Perry, Olivia Burnette, Peter MacNicol, Ann Wedgeworth', 'PG', 'A man who doesn''t like stable work environments has been away for too many years, and finds out his wife has divorced him and is planning to remarry. He comes home to confront her, trying to convince her not to get married, aided by the daughter, who loves him despite his wandering ways. The couple finds out they still have feelings for each other but must decide how best to handle the contradiction of their lifestyles.', 'A man who doesn''t like stable work environments has been away for too many years, and finds out his wife has divorced him and is planning to remarry. He comes home to confront her, trying to convince her not to get married, aided by the daughter, who loves him despite his wandering ways. The couple finds out they still have feelings for each other but must decide how best to handle the contradiction of their lifestyles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPfXplEnUW2OIsOCydTmuxu2lw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89292'),
  ('1119475231441984393', 'Hard Rain', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Peter Menzies Jr., Mikael Salomon, David F. Klassen', 'Graham Yost', 'Morgan Freeman, Christian Slater, Minnie Driver, Randy Quaid, Ed Asner, Betty White, Richard Dysart, Dann Florek', 'R', 'An armored car driver tries to elude a gang of thieves while a flood ravages the countryside.', 'An armored car driver tries to elude a gang of thieves while a flood ravages the countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggMcOVSax4lBXjYqqQUJLCtrar3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11258'),
  ('1052470371114339433', 'Hard Revenge, Milly', 2008, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Takanori Tsujimoto, Hiroaki Yuasa, Takanori Tsujimoto', 'Takanori Tsujimoto', 'Miki Mizuno, Hirotsugu Imamura, Mitsuki Koga, Tetsuya Nakamura, Saaya, Hiroshi Ohguchi', null, 'At some point in the near future gun and weapon control laws are deregulated by public order. Asia quickly becomes the epicenter of criminal activity in the world. In Yokohama City this violence becomes so extreme that the population drops as people try to escape the criminal element that remain. When The Jack Brothers murder Milly''s husband and daughter in front of her, she vows revenge.', 'At some point in the near future gun and weapon control laws are deregulated by public order. Asia quickly becomes the epicenter of criminal activity in the world. In Yokohama City this violence becomes so extreme that the population drops as people try to escape the criminal element that remain. When The Jack Brothers murder Milly''s husband and daughter in front of her, she vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4yKwQRWutHhmWYVkK5ij166fSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20044'),
  ('354534310453180315', 'Hard Revenge, Milly: Bloody Battle', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Takanori Tsujimoto, Kensuke Sonomura', 'Takanori Tsujimoto', 'Miki Mizuno, Nao Nagasawa, Kazuki Tsujimoto, Ray Fujita, Masahiro Komoto, Mitsuki Koga, Mei Nagano', null, 'The story starts in the devastated rogue city of Yokohama, surrounded by rubble. After Milly killed Jack, the main villain from the first movie, and finally satisfied her thirst for revenge for the deaths of her husband and child, she seems to be on safe ground for the moment. But just as she starts to relax, she is targeted by strange guys. They are here to avenge Jack''s death.', 'The story starts in the devastated rogue city of Yokohama, surrounded by rubble. After Milly killed Jack, the main villain from the first movie, and finally satisfied her thirst for revenge for the deaths of her husband and child, she seems to be on safe ground for the moment. But just as she starts to relax, she is targeted by strange guys. They are here to avenge Jack''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lUKkf9GEv4uYe6DrXXPU5VnEYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76940'),
  ('186159495899643326', 'Hard Rock Nightmare', 1988, 'Horror', 'Dominick Brascia, Mark Mele, F. Smith Martin', 'Dominick Brascia', 'Greg Joujon-Roche, Troy Donahue, Johnny Venokur, Annie Mikan, Lisa Elaina, Robert D. Peverley, Bryan Kovacs, Tom Shell', 'NR', 'A young boy named John is tormented by his grandfather concerning vampires and werewolves, until he believes his grandfather is actually a vampire. This of course, leads to John killing his grandfather with a stake. Fast-forward and John is now the lead singer of a rock band who can no longer practice in their garage so they''re forced to a house in the middle of nowhere, left to John by his Grandmother. They soon begin to be picked off and Josh is convinced the stories his grandfather told him all those years ago may be true.', 'A young boy named John is tormented by his grandfather concerning vampires and werewolves, until he believes his grandfather is actually a vampire. This of course, leads to John killing his grandfather with a stake. Fast-forward and John is now the lead singer of a rock band who can no longer practice in their garage so they''re forced to a house in the middle of nowhere, left to John by his Grandmother. They soon begin to be picked off and Josh is convinced the stories his grandfather told him all those years ago may be true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndDQdAGdUnW9HlheoEBAEBWClYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106614'),
  ('182789810851084390', 'Hard Rock Zombies', 1985, 'Comedy, Horror, Music', 'Krishna Shah, Allison Jones, Tom Richmond', 'David Allen Ball, Krishna Shah', 'E.J. Curse, Geno Andrews, Sam Mann, Mick McMains, Lisa Toothman, Jennifer Coe, Ted Wells, Jack Bliesener', 'R', 'A hard rock band travels to the tiny and remote town of Grand Guignol to perform. Peopled by hicks, rubes, werewolves, murderous dwarves, sex perverts, and Hitler, the town is a strange place but that doesn''t stop the band''s lead singer from falling in love with a local girl named Cassie. After Nazi sex perverts kill the band to satisfy their lusts, Cassie calls the rockers back from the grave to save her, the town, and maybe the world.', 'A hard rock band travels to the tiny and remote town of Grand Guignol to perform. Peopled by hicks, rubes, werewolves, murderous dwarves, sex perverts, and Hitler, the town is a strange place but that doesn''t stop the band''s lead singer from falling in love with a local girl named Cassie. After Nazi sex perverts kill the band to satisfy their lusts, Cassie calls the rockers back from the grave to save her, the town, and maybe the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nWiQJbNVSIr7Py1gUKfUG8NQ5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28128'),
  ('307965557837285009', 'Hard Shell, Soft Shell', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Emma Benestan, Aurélien Marra', 'Emma Benestan, Nour Ben Salem', 'Yasin Houicha, Oulaya Amamra, Raphaël Quenard, Samira Sedira, Tiphaine Daviot, Bilel Chegrani, Tassadit Mandi, Diong-Kéba Tacu', null, 'Az works for an oyster farmer in Sète. He knows oysters by heart, he opens them by the hundreds. In one of them, Az decides to hide a ring, to ask his girlfriend Jess to marry him. She doesn''t say yes. Fortunately, his band of friends are ready to do anything to help him get his head out of the water.', 'Az works for an oyster farmer in Sète. He knows oysters by heart, he opens them by the hundreds. In one of them, Az decides to hide a ring, to ask his girlfriend Jess to marry him. She doesn''t say yes. Fortunately, his band of friends are ready to do anything to help him get his head out of the water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHJqNaABezjKTzUq8mDh7VVaPSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853791'),
  ('601271804492283393', 'Hard Target', 1993, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Woo, Russell Carpenter, Monroe Kelly', 'Chuck Pfarrer', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Arnold Vosloo, Lance Henriksen, Yancy Butler, Sven-Ole Thorsen, Wilford Brimley, Ted Raimi, Kasi Lemmons', 'R', 'When a woman''s father goes missing, she enlists a local to aid in her search. The pair soon discover that her father has died at the hands of a wealthy sportsman who hunts homeless men as a form of recreation.', 'When a woman''s father goes missing, she enlists a local to aid in her search. The pair soon discover that her father has died at the hands of a wealthy sportsman who hunts homeless men as a form of recreation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXCM7pmUFUGp7QzSmare3RITe6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2019'),
  ('488853799364341592', 'Hard Target 2', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné', 'Dominic Morgan, Matt Harvey, George Huang', 'Scott Adkins, Rhona Mitra, Robert Knepper, Temuera Morrison, Byron Gibson, Ann Truong, Adam Saunders, Sean Keenan', 'R', 'Forced into a deadly cat-and-mouse game, a disgraced mixed martial arts fighter is hunted through the jungles of Southeast Asia.', 'Forced into a deadly cat-and-mouse game, a disgraced mixed martial arts fighter is hunted through the jungles of Southeast Asia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO8C2AIIdFyi5ceI6whev0RYt0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402331'),
  ('35543702513895049', 'Hard Ticket to Hawaii', 1987, 'Action, Adventure', 'Howard Wexler, Andy Sidaris, Christian Drew Sidaris', 'Andy Sidaris', 'Ronn Moss, Dona Speir, Hope Marie Carlton, Harold Diamond, Rodrigo Obregón, Cynthia Brimhall, Patty Duffek, Wolf Larson', 'R', 'A Molokai-based civilian pilot and an undercover DEA agent intercept a delivery of diamonds intended for druglord Seth Romero. Seth, his henchmen, and other island undesirables launch a full-scale assault on the duo. If they''re going to survive, they''ll need the help of agent Rowdy Abilene and his partner/kickboxing expert Jade.', 'A Molokai-based civilian pilot and an undercover DEA agent intercept a delivery of diamonds intended for druglord Seth Romero. Seth, his henchmen, and other island undesirables launch a full-scale assault on the duo. If they''re going to survive, they''ll need the help of agent Rowdy Abilene and his partner/kickboxing expert Jade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZBHqhCZYAAihDBgMvQziITtLUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26011'),
  ('213324217568803434', 'Hard Time', 1998, 'Action, Crime, TV Movie', 'Burt Reynolds, Suki Medencevic, Tom Connors', 'David S. Cass Sr., Steve Wesley', 'Burt Reynolds, Charles Durning, Robert Loggia, Mia Sara, Billy Dee Williams, Michael Buie, Buck Taylor, John D''Aquino', null, 'Burt Reynolds plays Logan McQueen, a veteran, tough cop who likes to see justice done by his own ways. Things go bad after McQueen is framed for murder. Now he has to escape from a maximum security prison, and seek, on the deadly streets of a hot and dangerous Miami, for the man who wants him down...', 'Burt Reynolds plays Logan McQueen, a veteran, tough cop who likes to see justice done by his own ways. Things go bad after McQueen is framed for murder. Now he has to escape from a maximum security prison, and seek, on the deadly streets of a hot and dangerous Miami, for the man who wants him down...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5HS9oSvc8hvCxbZOAQ3kQq4g0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180907'),
  ('195289051384621673', 'Hard Time: Hostage Hotel', 1999, 'Action, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Eyal Gordin, Hal Needham, David S. Cass Sr.', 'Steven H. Berman', 'Burt Reynolds, Charles Durning, Keith Carradine, Michael Buie, David Rasche, Ted McGinley, Elizabeth Dennehy, Richard Riehle', null, 'A California congressman''s wife and daughter are abducted and held hostage in a historic hotel. Logan McQueen is rushed to the scene to assist his former partner, Charlie Duffy, who has been taken captive trying to broker the ransom deal. McQueen must risk his life to face the cunning killer and save the hostages and his long-time friend.', 'A California congressman''s wife and daughter are abducted and held hostage in a historic hotel. Logan McQueen is rushed to the scene to assist his former partner, Charlie Duffy, who has been taken captive trying to broker the ransom deal. McQueen must risk his life to face the cunning killer and save the hostages and his long-time friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stzlbfdSdTK8Fv7yTmAEjiZxZPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41241'),
  ('524060783251160951', 'Hard Times', 1975, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Walter Hill, Philip H. Lathrop, Donald C. Rogers', 'Walter Hill, Bryan Gindoff, Bruce Henstell', 'Charles Bronson, James Coburn, Jill Ireland, Strother Martin, Margaret Blye, Michael McGuire, Felice Orlandi, Edward Walsh', 'PG', 'In the depression, Chaney, a strong silent streetfighter, joins with Speed, a promoter of no-holds-barred street boxing bouts. They go to New Orleans where Speed borrows money to set up fights for Chaney, but Speed gambles away any winnings.', 'In the depression, Chaney, a strong silent streetfighter, joins with Speed, a promoter of no-holds-barred street boxing bouts. They go to New Orleans where Speed borrows money to set up fights for Chaney, but Speed gambles away any winnings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWIh8cMGd9XubkdhJB2TJ7buGy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22094'),
  ('226090339128627255', 'Hard Times', 2005, 'Drama', 'Manuel Martín Cuenca, David Carretero', 'Manuel Martín Cuenca, Alejandro Hernández', 'Javier Cámara, Nathalie Poza, Eman Xor Oña, Leonor Watling, Gonzalo Pedrosa, Yolanda Serrano, Xosé Manuel Esperante, Mikel Tello', null, 'When the troubled son of an NGO worker refuses to take a test and announces that he is not leaving his room, his concerned mother asks one of her clients, a Cuban exile, for help in setting the boy straight. Gonzalo has decided to drop out of school, and his mother Ana isn''t sure how to convince the boy that he''s making a crucial mistake. Ana''s client Carlos is a Cuban exile who makes his living selling cigars and artwork on the black market. When Carlos learns of Ana''s dilemma, he calls on recently released convict Mikel to teach the boy how to play chess. Perhaps is young Gonzalo can master the game, he can learn to start living again. As the lessons get underway, each of these characters learns that in order to truly move on with their lives they much first break free of the bonds that prevent them from being who they really are.', 'When the troubled son of an NGO worker refuses to take a test and announces that he is not leaving his room, his concerned mother asks one of her clients, a Cuban exile, for help in setting the boy straight. Gonzalo has decided to drop out of school, and his mother Ana isn''t sure how to convince the boy that he''s making a crucial mistake. Ana''s client Carlos is a Cuban exile who makes his living selling cigars and artwork on the black market. When Carlos learns of Ana''s dilemma, he calls on recently released convict Mikel to teach the boy how to play chess. Perhaps is young Gonzalo can master the game, he can learn to start living again. As the lessons get underway, each of these characters learns that in order to truly move on with their lives they much first break free of the bonds that prevent them from being who they really are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TFtQFDE31pLiIP8rIiLYwvaVfL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99387'),
  ('75874181696385776', 'Hard to Be a God', 1990, 'Drama, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Peter Fleischmann, Jerzy Hoffman, Jerzy Gościk', 'Peter Fleischmann, Jean-Claude Carrière, Pierre Christin', 'Edward Żentara, Aleksandr Filippenko, Andrei Boltnev, Mikhail Gluzskiy, Hugues Quester, Anne Gautier, Christine Kaufmann, Pierre Clémenti', null, 'Another planet in the period of medieval times. An employee of the institute of experimental history from Earth, who is send under the name of noble don Rumata of Estor as a spy with a mission to contact the local resident of the institute, arrives in the city of Arkanar. But the resident perishes under an unlucky attempt to make a palace coup, and Rumata have to take his place as the resident. Soon he meets all the horrors of the medieval society - a peasant war, palace coups, mass executions. To continue to be an indifferent watcher of all these horrors turns out to be simply impossible...', 'Another planet in the period of medieval times. An employee of the institute of experimental history from Earth, who is send under the name of noble don Rumata of Estor as a spy with a mission to contact the local resident of the institute, arrives in the city of Arkanar. But the resident perishes under an unlucky attempt to make a palace coup, and Rumata have to take his place as the resident. Soon he meets all the horrors of the medieval society - a peasant war, palace coups, mass executions. To continue to be an indifferent watcher of all these horrors turns out to be simply impossible...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Asun3ZgcoCZcDLlCaepc4senWya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64508'),
  ('1006369802886104353', 'Hard to Be a God', 2014, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Aleksei German, Yury Klimenko, Vladimir Ilin', 'Svetlana Karmalita, Aleksei German', 'Leonid Yarmolnik, Yuriy Tsurilo, Natalya Moteva, Aleksandr Chutko, Evgeniy Gerchakov, Pyotr Merkuryev, Juris Lauciņš, Vytautas Paukste', 'NR', 'A group of scientists is sent to the planet Arkanar to help the local civilization, which is in the Medieval phase of its own history, to find the right path to progress. Their task is a difficult one: they cannot interfere violently and in no case can they kill. The scientist Rumata tries to save the local intellectuals from their punishment and cannot avoid taking a position.', 'A group of scientists is sent to the planet Arkanar to help the local civilization, which is in the Medieval phase of its own history, to find the right path to progress. Their task is a difficult one: they cannot interfere violently and in no case can they kill. The scientist Rumata tries to save the local intellectuals from their punishment and cannot avoid taking a position.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmqx4l6JVKwtAe7CCoyzwTVcOpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110402'),
  ('1116768630318900723', 'Hard to Handle', 1933, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Barney McGill', 'Wilson Mizner, Robert Lord', 'James Cagney, Mary Brian, Allen Jenkins, Ruth Donnelly, Claire Dodd, Robert McWade, Clay Clement, Don Brodie', 'NR', 'A hustling public relations man promotes a series of fads.', 'A hustling public relations man promotes a series of fads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNb9zB6ZArG1QOSLoGKLYXZg9tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157343'),
  ('889995872746740305', 'Hard to Hold', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard H. Kline, Larry Peerce, Candace Allen', 'Thomas Hedley Jr.', 'Rick Springfield, Janet Eilber, Patti Hansen, Albert Salmi, Gregory Itzin, Peter Van Norden, Bill Mumy, Tony Fox Sales', 'PG', 'Jamie Roberts is a rock star living the highlife when he falls for an intellectual child psychologist who only has ears for classical music. Opposites attract, but his jealous ex-girlfriend isn''t ready to give up so easily.', 'Jamie Roberts is a rock star living the highlife when he falls for an intellectual child psychologist who only has ears for classical music. Opposites attract, but his jealous ex-girlfriend isn''t ready to give up so easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWY3JkwZHcZIA5JLm4Oompnflc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52734'),
  ('641626301520595810', 'Hard to Kill', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, Bruce Malmuth, Douglas E. Wise', 'Steven McKay', 'Steven Seagal, Kelly LeBrock, William Sadler, Frederick Coffin, Bonnie Burroughs, Andrew Bloch, Branscombe Richmond, Charles Boswell', 'R', 'Mason Storm, a ''go it alone'' cop, is gunned down at home. The intruders kill his wife, and think they''ve killed both Mason and his son too. Mason is secretly taken to a hospital where he spends several years in a coma. His son meanwhile is growing up thinking his father is dead. When Mason wakes up, everyone is in danger - himself, his son, his best friend, his nurse - but most of all those who arranged for his death', 'Mason Storm, a ''go it alone'' cop, is gunned down at home. The intruders kill his wife, and think they''ve killed both Mason and his son too. Mason is secretly taken to a hospital where he spends several years in a coma. His son meanwhile is growing up thinking his father is dead. When Mason wakes up, everyone is in danger - himself, his son, his best friend, his nurse - but most of all those who arranged for his death', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmtMNxslljllSTVtt7VIOXdxSZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9569'),
  ('260837711069057459', 'Hard Truths', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mike Leigh, Nina Gold, Dick Pope', 'Mike Leigh', 'Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Michele Austin, David Webber, Tuwaine Barrett, Ani Nelson, Sophia Brown, Jonathan Livingstone, Jo Martin', 'R', 'Pansy is a woman so full of rage that every interaction she has devolves into lashing out, whether at her utterly cowed husband and son, or random strangers who have the temerity to address her. In contrast, her younger sister Chantelle lives with her two vivacious daughters and plies a successful trade as a hairdresser, putting clients at their ease all day long. Yet beneath Pansy’s abrasive exterior are hints of a more fragile psyche, one motivated by fear and damaged by repressed pain.', 'Pansy is a woman so full of rage that every interaction she has devolves into lashing out, whether at her utterly cowed husband and son, or random strangers who have the temerity to address her. In contrast, her younger sister Chantelle lives with her two vivacious daughters and plies a successful trade as a hairdresser, putting clients at their ease all day long. Yet beneath Pansy’s abrasive exterior are hints of a more fragile psyche, one motivated by fear and damaged by repressed pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEj1TGrGc4IQ8bscFC17Ggdg6ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013154'),
  ('630547007208090846', 'Hard Vice', 1994, 'Crime, Drama', 'F. Smith Martin, Joey Travolta, Al Goto', 'Joey Travolta, Rich Dillon', 'Shannon Tweed, Sam J. Jones, James Gammon, Rebecca Ferratti, Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Tom Fridley, Branscombe Richmond, Jack Bannon', 'R', 'A vice cop and her partner investigate a string of murders apparently tied to high-priced Las Vegas call girls.', 'A vice cop and her partner investigate a string of murders apparently tied to high-priced Las Vegas call girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmW5TPB51leDgLSKNsQo7NkA2FR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287280'),
  ('975867558028784650', 'Hard-Core', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita', 'Kosuke Mukai', 'Takayuki Yamada, Takeru Satoh, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Takako Matsu, Kei Ishibashi, Suon Kan, Shohei Uno, Kisetsu Fujiwara', null, 'The life story of a treasure hunter who lives in the countryside of Gunma in Japan. He is pure and kind, but has no communication skills and has a mind of his own. His sole friend is his co-worker. This man has never had sex. The friends find a robot one day. The robot wants to stay with the men. A bond is formed. The men resolve to change their lives.', 'The life story of a treasure hunter who lives in the countryside of Gunma in Japan. He is pure and kind, but has no communication skills and has a mind of his own. His sole friend is his co-worker. This man has never had sex. The friends find a robot one day. The robot wants to stay with the men. A bond is formed. The men resolve to change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVkzFcFSmlhKa9LU4hEckQqB1qM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479184'),
  ('794545555950592696', 'Hard, Fast and Beautiful!', 1951, 'Drama', 'Ida Lupino, James H. Anderson, Archie Stout', 'Martha Wilkerson', 'Claire Trevor, Sally Forrest, Carleton G. Young, Robert Clarke, Kenneth Patterson, Marcella Cisney, Joseph Kearns, William Hudson', 'NR', 'When most people look at Florence Farley, they see a pretty teenager. But when Milly Farley looks at her daughter she sees something else: a tennis prodigy who could be Milly’s ticket to money and fame.', 'When most people look at Florence Farley, they see a pretty teenager. But when Milly Farley looks at her daughter she sees something else: a tennis prodigy who could be Milly’s ticket to money and fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQwbEqCiluAyS61CBZDqw23FP3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83670'),
  ('904992603590390091', 'Hardball', 2001, 'Drama', 'Brian Robbins, Tom Richmond', 'John Gatins', 'Keanu Reeves, Diane Lane, Michael B. Jordan, D. B. Sweeney, John Hawkes, Bryan Hearne, Julian Griffith, DeWayne Warren', 'PG-13', 'An aimless young man who is scalping tickets, gambling and drinking, agrees to coach a Little League team from the Cabrini Green housing project in Chicago as a condition of getting a loan from a friend.', 'An aimless young man who is scalping tickets, gambling and drinking, agrees to coach a Little League team from the Cabrini Green housing project in Chicago as a condition of getting a loan from a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RMcwwnK8a9WCt8dVlwmtNsFCg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20857'),
  ('589398404003841627', 'Hardbodies', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Michael Paul Clausen, Marianne Fisher, Vic Caesar', 'Steve Greene, Mark Griffiths, Eric Alter', 'Grant Cramer, Teal Roberts, Gary Wood, Michael Rapport, Sorrells Pickard, Roberta Collins, Cindy Silver, Courtney Gains', 'R', 'Three middle-aged daddies visit California to have a marvelous time at the beach. When they learn that a nice apartment and an expensive cabriolet isn''t enough for them to score with the chicks, they employ a student to help them. At first he''s as disgusted of them and his job as his girlfriend, but soon they find out how to use the situation to everyone''s benefit.', 'Three middle-aged daddies visit California to have a marvelous time at the beach. When they learn that a nice apartment and an expensive cabriolet isn''t enough for them to score with the chicks, they employ a student to help them. At first he''s as disgusted of them and his job as his girlfriend, but soon they find out how to use the situation to everyone''s benefit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9z7lbMRQSbcohiPV7WzMbTqhbnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52736'),
  ('256164538366480380', 'Hardbodies 2', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Mark Griffiths, Richard Hench, Tom Richmond', 'Mark Griffiths, Curtis Wilmot', 'Brad Zutaut, Fabiana Udenio, James Karen, Alba Francesca, Roberta Collins, Sorrells Pickard, Brenda Bakke, Sam Temeles', 'R', 'A film crew is travelling from America to Greece to produce a movie. Before their work is done they will have to face many unusual situations, along with numerous opportunities for the actresses to take their clothes off.', 'A film crew is travelling from America to Greece to produce a movie. Before their work is done they will have to face many unusual situations, along with numerous opportunities for the actresses to take their clothes off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rBv4zSyuXYflczYMUkKZsryEMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61117'),
  ('991658355063670569', 'Hardcore', 2004, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dennis Iliadis, Thimios Bakatakis', 'Dennis Iliadis', 'Katerina Tsavalou, Danae Skiadi, Ioannis Papazisis, Omiros Poulakis, Andreas Marianos, Dimitris Liolios, Konstadinos Avarikiotis, Yannis Stankoglou', 'R', 'Leaving behind a hard life with their families, two young girls end up in a brothel, fall in love and support one another against the adversities and violence of the night.', 'Leaving behind a hard life with their families, two young girls end up in a brothel, fall in love and support one another against the adversities and violence of the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbh1iQ7tWvQTtwn6SQG7IeY3dNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42318'),
  ('377328093008962074', 'Hardcore Henry', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ilya Naishuller, Ilya Farfel, Chris W. Johnson', 'Ilya Naishuller', 'Andrey Dementyev, Sharlto Copley, Danila Kozlovsky, Haley Bennett, Tim Roth, Svetlana Ustinova, Dasha Charusha, Oleg Poddubnyy', 'R', 'Henry, a newly resurrected cyborg who must save his wife/creator from the clutches of a psychotic tyrant with telekinetic powers, AKAN, and his army of mercenaries. Fighting alongside Henry is Jimmy, who is Henry''s only hope to make it through the day. Hardcore Henry takes place over the course of one day, in Moscow, Russia.', 'Henry, a newly resurrected cyborg who must save his wife/creator from the clutches of a psychotic tyrant with telekinetic powers, AKAN, and his army of mercenaries. Fighting alongside Henry is Jimmy, who is Henry''s only hope to make it through the day. Hardcore Henry takes place over the course of one day, in Moscow, Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik1uZyiMSxF9HqrgRKUNfMCfr3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325348'),
  ('537980108579160949', 'Hardcore Never Dies', 2023, 'Crime, Music, Drama, Thriller', 'Lennart Verstegen, Jim Taihuttu', 'Amira Duynhouwer, Victor D. Ponten, Jim Taihuttu', 'Joes Brauers, Jim Deddes, Rosa Stil, Jordy Dijkshoorn, Joenoes Polnaija, Huub Smit, Bob Schwarze, Antoinette Akkerman', null, '17-year-old Michael dreams of a future as a pianist, but his music education is not going smoothly. In his search for inspiration, he receives help from an unexpected source: his brother Danny introduces him to the emerging Rotterdam “gabber” music scene. Michael is drawn into a world of hard beats, brotherhood and drugs. When Danny''s drug business reaches international proportions, the brothers must fight for their lives.', '17-year-old Michael dreams of a future as a pianist, but his music education is not going smoothly. In his search for inspiration, he receives help from an unexpected source: his brother Danny introduces him to the emerging Rotterdam “gabber” music scene. Michael is drawn into a world of hard beats, brotherhood and drugs. When Danny''s drug business reaches international proportions, the brothers must fight for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x90Ef99FENmZHyCPqY2AohiYjm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103789'),
  ('631510786731554653', 'Hardcover', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Christian Zübert, Jules van den Steenhoven', 'Christian Zübert', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Justus von Dohnányi, Anna Dereszowska, Charly Hübner, Thea Schnering, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Sybille J. Schedwill, Jan Sosniok', null, 'Christoph, 31, a good-looking but frustrated single man and proud owner of a Renault Twingo, dreams of a grandiose career as a writer. But so far he hasn''t managed to write more than a few penny dreadful novels for the publishing house "Kemper und Bergmann", which publishes the crime series about the hero Nick Sturm. And since there''s not enough money to go around, he has to hire a car from the car rental...', 'Christoph, 31, a good-looking but frustrated single man and proud owner of a Renault Twingo, dreams of a grandiose career as a writer. But so far he hasn''t managed to write more than a few penny dreadful novels for the publishing house "Kemper und Bergmann", which publishes the crime series about the hero Nick Sturm. And since there''s not enough money to go around, he has to hire a car from the car rental...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Gfk6EIiayJB8UaH4H3YwCy04jI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7210'),
  ('46779517153375755', 'Hardly a Criminal', 1949, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hugo Fregonese, Luis Reny, Roque Giaccovino', 'José Ramón Luna, Raimundo Calcagno, Tulio Demicheli', 'Jorge Salcedo, Sebastián Chiola, Tito Alonso, Linda Lorena, Tito Grassi, Guillermo Casali, Mario Cozza, Rodolfo Crespi', null, 'A bank employee uses a loophole in Argentine law to concoct the perfect crime, planning to reap the rewards of his embezzlement after serving six years in prison…', 'A bank employee uses a loophole in Argentine law to concoct the perfect crime, planning to reap the rewards of his embezzlement after serving six years in prison…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6n6WwQ3cdvG58Gwjyh2LrTTkOoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252696'),
  ('970422720561649929', 'Hardly Working', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Lewis, James Pergola, Hal Bell', 'Jerry Lewis, Michael Janover', 'Jerry Lewis, Susan Oliver, Roger C. Carmel, Deanna Lund, Harold J. Stone, Steve Franken, Buddy Lester, Leonard Stone', 'PG', 'In Jerry Lewis''s first film in a decade, he plays Bo Hooper, an unemployed circus clown who can''t seem to hold down a job. The film opens with a brief montage of clips from past Lewis movies. He then moves into a succession of jobs that he gets himself fired from including a gas station attendant and a mailman - all with disastrous results.', 'In Jerry Lewis''s first film in a decade, he plays Bo Hooper, an unemployed circus clown who can''t seem to hold down a job. The film opens with a brief montage of clips from past Lewis movies. He then moves into a succession of jobs that he gets himself fired from including a gas station attendant and a mailman - all with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A58FZYvG7gYN9XDwVczOfmOQnli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130724'),
  ('1066459941912300495', 'Hardware', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Steven Chivers, Richard Stanley', 'Richard Stanley', 'Dylan McDermott, Stacey Travis, John Lynch, William Hootkins, Carl McCoy, Iggy Pop, Mark Northover, Paul McKenzie', 'R', 'Mark 13 is a government-built killing machine programmed with artificial intelligence, able to repair and recharge itself from any energy source. Through a series of coincidences, the cyborg''s head ends up in the home of a sculptress as a bizarre Christmas present from her boyfriend. Once inside its new home, the cyborg promptly reconstructs the rest of its body using a variety of household utensils and proceeds to go on a murderous rampage.', 'Mark 13 is a government-built killing machine programmed with artificial intelligence, able to repair and recharge itself from any energy source. Through a series of coincidences, the cyborg''s head ends up in the home of a sculptress as a bizarre Christmas present from her boyfriend. Once inside its new home, the cyborg promptly reconstructs the rest of its body using a variety of household utensils and proceeds to go on a murderous rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybauOsdo6ColZ1WsALqIYjpUg4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11309'),
  ('1053559127614558619', 'Hardware Wars', 1978, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Ernie Fosselius', 'Ernie Fosselius', 'Frank Robertson, Jeff Hale, Artie Deco, Scott Matthews, Cindy Furgatch, Bob Knickerbocker, Ernie Fosselius, Paul Frees', 'NR', 'A short film parody of the classic science fiction film Star Wars. It premiered in theaters only seven months after Star Wars and consisted of little more than inside jokes and visual puns that heavily depended upon audience familiarity with the original.', 'A short film parody of the classic science fiction film Star Wars. It premiered in theaters only seven months after Star Wars and consisted of little more than inside jokes and visual puns that heavily depended upon audience familiarity with the original.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gueOnWMxzg9ngNjsM1M557VzKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50157'),
  ('1119323977143651140', 'Hardwired', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Ernie Barbarash', 'Michael Hurst', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Val Kilmer, Alastair Gamble, Juan Riedinger, Michael Ironside, Tatiana Maslany, Rob Carpenter, Dave Cote', 'R', 'After a tragic accident Luke Gibson is left with critical injuries and complete amnesia. A new technological breakthrough from the Hexx Corporation - a Psi-Comp Implant that''s hardwired into Luke''s brain - saves his life, but Luke soon finds out that this new technology comes with a price and that the Hexx Corporation harbors sinister plans for the new device.', 'After a tragic accident Luke Gibson is left with critical injuries and complete amnesia. A new technological breakthrough from the Hexx Corporation - a Psi-Comp Implant that''s hardwired into Luke''s brain - saves his life, but Luke soon finds out that this new technology comes with a price and that the Hexx Corporation harbors sinister plans for the new device.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q93fo24fFxruqiHG2VybLengsmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24051'),
  ('1077690901865942196', 'Hare Brush', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', 'NR', 'The corporate board has Elmer committed to an asylum because he thinks he''s a rabbit. At the sanitarium, Bugs agrees to trade places with Elmer.', 'The corporate board has Elmer committed to an asylum because he thinks he''s a rabbit. At the sanitarium, Bugs agrees to trade places with Elmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZqZcCQIhL0MRKZcTVw7BqWym3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162511'),
  ('536045839595393513', 'Hare Conditioned', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Dick Nelson, Dave Barry', null, 'Bugs Bunny is working in the display window of a department store when the manager tries to move him to the taxidermy department and have him stuffed.', 'Bugs Bunny is working in the display window of a department store when the manager tries to move him to the taxidermy department and have him stuffed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11Y16oUxCeK0nYDqn56DQR5SgIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101511'),
