  ('87856131334745457', 'Hare Krishna', 1967, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jonas Mekas', null, 'Srila Prabhupada, Barbara Rubin, Philip Corner, Allen Ginsberg', null, 'Jonas Mekas captures an afternoon in New York as a Hare Krishna group fills the streets with chanting and song. Filmed with his characteristic freewheeling style and later incorporated into Walden, the short stands as an impressionistic sketch of spiritual fervor and Mekas’s participatory approach to cinema.', 'Jonas Mekas captures an afternoon in New York as a Hare Krishna group fills the streets with chanting and song. Filmed with his characteristic freewheeling style and later incorporated into Walden, the short stands as an impressionistic sketch of spiritual fervor and Mekas’s participatory approach to cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPLYymRwG07B8B2bqSb9HCZShnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270765'),
