  ('556586987618384598', 'Hare-um Scare-um', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ben Hardaway, Cal Dalton, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Facing high meat prices, a man decides to take his dog and go hunt for his own. Unfortunately, the crazy rabbit they are after is cleverer than they are.', 'Facing high meat prices, a man decides to take his dog and go hunt for his own. Unfortunately, the crazy rabbit they are after is cleverer than they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsxRmiN1GseeWQQqQLmkFdt2UDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152047'),
  ('793436568509873283', 'Hare-Way to the Stars', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny groggily climbs out of bed and his hole and, unknowingly, into a rocket ship that''s parked directly above. It transports him into outer space, where he is chased by martians.', 'Bugs Bunny groggily climbs out of bed and his hole and, unknowingly, into a rocket ship that''s parked directly above. It transports him into outer space, where he is chased by martians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6lFYSAWGQdVM2Aft0yxva7PyCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83794'),
  ('11544055043094772', 'Haredevil Hare', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', 'NR', 'Bugs is the test rabbit shot to the moon. There, he meets Commander X-2, who is intent on destroying the Earth with his Aludium Q-36 Explosive Space Modulator.', 'Bugs is the test rabbit shot to the moon. There, he meets Commander X-2, who is intent on destroying the Earth with his Aludium Q-36 Explosive Space Modulator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nENCj9KrOrTYTzrytZLDzoEnELg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83790'),
  ('763016428912476463', 'Harem', 1985, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Arthur Joffé, Pasqualino De Santis', 'Arthur Joffé', 'Nastassja Kinski, Ben Kingsley, Zohra Sehgal, Dennis Goldson, Michel Robin, Juliette Simpson, Rosanne Katon, Charmagne Eckert', 'NR', 'Diane is a sophisticated trainee on the New York Stock Exchange who is suddenly kidnapped and held captive in a North African desert hideaway by Selim, an Arab mogul.', 'Diane is a sophisticated trainee on the New York Stock Exchange who is suddenly kidnapped and held captive in a North African desert hideaway by Selim, an Arab mogul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqyeBkGW9OIO1I1NdGMdDhSgWBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33367'),
  ('306636339059836391', 'Harikrishnans', 1998, 'Mystery, Romance, Comedy, Thriller', 'Fazil, Anandakuttan', 'Fazil', 'Mammootty, Mohanlal, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Kunchacko Boban, Innocent, Nedumudi Venu, Rajiv Menon, Cochin Haneefa', null, 'When Guptan, a college lecturer, gets killed, the police suspect Gabriel to be the murderer. A girl takes help from her brothers, who are famous lawyers, in proving his innocence.', 'When Guptan, a college lecturer, gets killed, the police suspect Gabriel to be the murderer. A girl takes help from her brothers, who are famous lawyers, in proving his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRwQ0lY9lESyKLwvvd5MkKt0B6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269804'),
  ('85662983812313889', 'Harim Karim', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Walid Elnagar, Sameh El Sayed, Ali Idris', 'Zainab Aziz', 'Mostafa Qmar, Yasmin Abdulaziz, Ola Ghanem, Basma, Dalia AlBehery, Reham Abdelghafour, Talaat Zakaria, Edward', null, 'Kareem, a divorced young man, seeks the help of his girl friends from college to get back to his wife, Gigi. However, most of them like him, which makes the situation even more complicated as he tries to win Gigi back.', 'Kareem, a divorced young man, seeks the help of his girl friends from college to get back to his wife, Gigi. However, most of them like him, which makes the situation even more complicated as he tries to win Gigi back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MdRbjpqRn5WOvwjJukRKuTRAfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48653'),
  ('905069906759947523', 'Harishchandrachi Factory', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Paresh Mokashi, Amalendu Chaudhary, Ashish Avinash Bende', 'Paresh Mokashi', 'Nandu Madhav, Vibhavari Deshpande, Atharva Karve, Mohit Gokhale, Ketan Karande, Sandeep Mehta, Hrishikesh Joshi, Uday Lagoo', null, 'In 1913 India''s cinema industry is born from Dadasaheb Phalke''s efforts to make Raja Harishchandra (1913), India''s first feature-length B&W silent film.', 'In 1913 India''s cinema industry is born from Dadasaheb Phalke''s efforts to make Raja Harishchandra (1913), India''s first feature-length B&W silent film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRC3yCRlsETdnCvZiyXilLtMrdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35572'),
  ('999927304800654795', 'Harka', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lotfy Nathan, Maximilian Pittner, Becher Wissem', 'Lotfy Nathan', 'Adam Bessa, Najib Allagui, Salima Maatoug, Ikbal Harbi, Khaled Brahem, Hsouna Heni, Jamel Madani, Mohamed Ouni', null, 'Ali is a young Tunisian who dreams of a better life and ekes out a lonely existence selling contraband oil on the black market. When his father dies, he is forced to care for his two younger sisters who have been left to their own devices in a house from which they will soon be evicted. As he wrestles with the sudden weight of responsibility and the injustices he faces, anger and indignation stir within Ali – that of a generation still fighting to be heard more than a decade after the revolution…', 'Ali is a young Tunisian who dreams of a better life and ekes out a lonely existence selling contraband oil on the black market. When his father dies, he is forced to care for his two younger sisters who have been left to their own devices in a house from which they will soon be evicted. As he wrestles with the sudden weight of responsibility and the injustices he faces, anger and indignation stir within Ali – that of a generation still fighting to be heard more than a decade after the revolution…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kat9dKLuugG31msC1XD8AwT2xIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849242'),
  ('526035875812002883', 'Harkis', 2022, 'History, Drama, War', 'Laurent Fénart, Philippe Faucon', 'Samir Benyala, Philippe Faucon, Yasmina Nini-Faucon', 'Pierre Lottin, Théo Cholbi, Yannick Choirat, Omar Boulakirba, Amine Zorgane, Mohamed el Amine Mouffok, Vincent Choirat, Alaeddine Ouali', null, 'During the Algerian War (1954-1962), many impoverished young Algerian men, known as "Harkis", volunteered to join the French Army. Salah and Kaddour find themselves under the orders of Lieutenant Pascal. But as the conflict draws to an end, the prospect of independence looms. The outlook for Harkis seems bleak. Lieutenant Pascal confronts his superiors, insisting that every single man in his platoon must be evacuated to France.', 'During the Algerian War (1954-1962), many impoverished young Algerian men, known as "Harkis", volunteered to join the French Army. Salah and Kaddour find themselves under the orders of Lieutenant Pascal. But as the conflict draws to an end, the prospect of independence looms. The outlook for Harkis seems bleak. Lieutenant Pascal confronts his superiors, insisting that every single man in his platoon must be evacuated to France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93DtXQdmylr80TDjAzlER8uQ9Kk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934752'),
  ('220919476619200675', 'Harlan County U.S.A.', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Barbara Kopple, Kevin Keating, Hart Perry', null, 'Norman Yarborough, Houston Elmore, Phil Sparks, Bessie Lou Cornett Parker, Sudie Crusenberry, Mary Lou Fergerson, Basil Collins, Florence Reece', 'PG', 'This film documents the coal miners'' strike against the Brookside Mine of the Eastover Mining Company in Harlan County, Kentucky in June, 1973. Eastover''s refusal to sign a contract (when the miners joined with the United Mine Workers of America) led to the strike, which lasted more than a year and included violent battles between gun-toting company thugs/scabs and the picketing miners and their supportive women-folk. Director Barbara Kopple puts the strike into perspective by giving us some background on the historical plight of the miners and some history of the UMWA. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with New York Women in Film & Television in 2004.', 'This film documents the coal miners'' strike against the Brookside Mine of the Eastover Mining Company in Harlan County, Kentucky in June, 1973. Eastover''s refusal to sign a contract (when the miners joined with the United Mine Workers of America) led to the strike, which lasted more than a year and included violent battles between gun-toting company thugs/scabs and the picketing miners and their supportive women-folk. Director Barbara Kopple puts the strike into perspective by giving us some background on the historical plight of the miners and some history of the UMWA. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with New York Women in Film & Television in 2004.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0cyMNsoP5ap0omfhakhImBWTRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33324'),
  ('49494436405995304', 'Harlem Nights', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Eddie Murphy, Woody Omens', 'Eddie Murphy', 'Eddie Murphy, Richard Pryor, Redd Foxx, Danny Aiello, Michael Lerner, Della Reese, Berlinda Tolbert, Stan Shaw', 'R', '''Sugar'' Ray is the owner of an illegal casino and must contend with the pressure of vicious gangsters and corrupt police who want to see him go out of business. In the world of organised crime and police corruption in the 1920s, any dastardly trick is fair.', '''Sugar'' Ray is the owner of an illegal casino and must contend with the pressure of vicious gangsters and corrupt police who want to see him go out of business. In the world of organised crime and police corruption in the 1920s, any dastardly trick is fair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHX0aYjxc2cIOBfYBuaYN9SvbUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9085'),
  ('965478313195614269', 'Harlequin', 1980, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Simon Wincer, Gary Hansen, Grant Harris', 'Everett De Roche', 'Robert Powell, David Hemmings, Carmen Duncan, Broderick Crawford, Gus Mercurio, Alan Cassell, Mark Spain, Alyson Best', 'PG', 'Up-and-coming senator Nick Rast''s young son is terminally ill with leukemia. A mysterious faith healer, Gregory Wolfe, appears and seems to cure the boy. Rast''s wife Sandy falls in love with Wolfe, but the powerful interests behind Rast''s career, represented by geriatric monster Doc Wheelan are less happy with events.', 'Up-and-coming senator Nick Rast''s young son is terminally ill with leukemia. A mysterious faith healer, Gregory Wolfe, appears and seems to cure the boy. Rast''s wife Sandy falls in love with Wolfe, but the powerful interests behind Rast''s career, represented by geriatric monster Doc Wheelan are less happy with events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpKPjzuACboHbH0BEJgPz4EaH6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79785'),
  ('1133375464392617039', 'Harley', 2014, 'Drama', 'Beatrice Schreiber', 'Beatrice Schreiber', 'Hannah Elder, Caleb Hoffman, Lars Slind', null, 'Harley tries to deal with his tumultuous emotions after his gay best friend Lucas is horribly beaten in a hate crime. When Lucas is released from the hospital, Harley discovers his feeling have changed.', 'Harley tries to deal with his tumultuous emotions after his gay best friend Lucas is horribly beaten in a hate crime. When Lucas is released from the hospital, Harley discovers his feeling have changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLPplo1mWvwk9wdLykDMs5cvJKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470808'),
  ('197233848759206365', 'Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man', 1991, 'Action, Thriller', 'Simon Wincer, David Eggby', 'Don Michael Paul', 'Mickey Rourke, Don Johnson, Chelsea Field, Daniel Baldwin, Giancarlo Esposito, Vanessa Williams, Robert Ginty, Tom Sizemore', 'R', 'It''s the lawless future, and renegade biker Harley Davidson and his surly cowboy buddy, Marlboro, learn that a corrupt bank is about to foreclose on their friend''s bar to further an expanding empire. Harley and Marlboro decide to help by robbing the crooked bank. But when they accidentally filch a drug shipment, they find themselves on the run from criminal financiers and the mob in this rugged action adventure.', 'It''s the lawless future, and renegade biker Harley Davidson and his surly cowboy buddy, Marlboro, learn that a corrupt bank is about to foreclose on their friend''s bar to further an expanding empire. Harley and Marlboro decide to help by robbing the crooked bank. But when they accidentally filch a drug shipment, they find themselves on the run from criminal financiers and the mob in this rugged action adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WRdrjHyLuHRwep2UJWBoIn6KTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2453'),
  ('567714431996082749', 'Harley Queen', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Carolina Adriazola, José Luis Sepúlveda, Ronnie Fuentes', 'José Luis Sepúlveda, Carolina Adriazola', 'Catalina Flores, Cristián Donoso, Victoria Donoso', null, 'A woman yearns to find her identity through her character:a supervillain, dancer and mother, in the Mena sector, or what they call "the largest ghetto in Chile", in Puente Alto, Santiago.', 'A woman yearns to find her identity through her character:a supervillain, dancer and mother, in the Mena sector, or what they call "the largest ghetto in Chile", in Puente Alto, Santiago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VvKPamQ8dEyrJ6O92MVKTqVS1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623931'),
  ('169003430630481177', 'Harlow', 1965, 'Drama', 'Joseph Ruttenberg, Gordon Douglas, David Salven', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Carroll Baker, Red Buttons, Raf Vallone, Angela Lansbury, Peter Lawford, Mike Connors, Martin Balsam, Leslie Nielsen', null, 'Jean Harlow arrives in Los Angeles as a teenager, pushed into showbiz by her mother and stepfather. Kindhearted agent Arthur Landau becomes Jean''s mentor, while a devious Howard Hughes-like mogul grows infatuated with the beautiful young actress. Harlow herself falls for producer Paul Bern before tragedy strikes.', 'Jean Harlow arrives in Los Angeles as a teenager, pushed into showbiz by her mother and stepfather. Kindhearted agent Arthur Landau becomes Jean''s mentor, while a devious Howard Hughes-like mogul grows infatuated with the beautiful young actress. Harlow herself falls for producer Paul Bern before tragedy strikes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2sPkI179LpW5l4UMyAJfAtpMUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6971'),
  ('994360944501223235', 'Harmagedon', 1983, 'Horror, Action, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Rintaro, Takuo Noda, Iwao Yamaki', 'Makoto Naito, Chiho Katsura, Mori Masaki', 'Toru Furuya, Mami Koyama, Masako Ikeda, Keiko Han, Kaneto Shiozawa, Kenji Utsumi, Yasufumi Hayashi, Hideyuki Tanaka', null, 'From the depths of space he is coming... Ancient beyond understanding, his power is immeasurable. He has destroyed half the universe and is on his way here. He is… Genma. Only two people are aware of the imminent catastrophe: Princess Luna, a modern day prophetess and Vega, a cybernetic crusader from a world long since ravaged by Genma. Determined to spare the Earth from a similar fate, Luna and Vega must try to mobilize the most potent psychics in the world. Together, this army of fledging psychic warriors must succeed where billions have tried... and failed. But will they be able to gather their champions in time? Genma’s agents are already on Earth to ensure that their master meets with no opposition!', 'From the depths of space he is coming... Ancient beyond understanding, his power is immeasurable. He has destroyed half the universe and is on his way here. He is… Genma. Only two people are aware of the imminent catastrophe: Princess Luna, a modern day prophetess and Vega, a cybernetic crusader from a world long since ravaged by Genma. Determined to spare the Earth from a similar fate, Luna and Vega must try to mobilize the most potent psychics in the world. Together, this army of fledging psychic warriors must succeed where billions have tried... and failed. But will they be able to gather their champions in time? Genma’s agents are already on Earth to ensure that their master meets with no opposition!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/somqDjxUTbPB2xfaLcLPIW7CgAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42076'),
  ('613571472840163996', 'Harmful Insect', 2002, 'Drama', 'Akihiko Shiota, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Kiyono Yayoi', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Yu Aoi, Ryo, Seiichi Tanabe, Yuria Haga, Yūsuke Iseya, Eihi Shiina, Tetsu Sawaki', null, '13-year-old Sachiko is about to encounter the most difficult moments in her young life. Her father abandons her and her mother attempts to commit suicide by slashing her wrist. Her teacher, whom she relies on heavily, leaves for northern Japan to take another job. Other students start to gossip about Sachiko and her former teacher. Sachiko then drops out of school and attempts to find herself.', '13-year-old Sachiko is about to encounter the most difficult moments in her young life. Her father abandons her and her mother attempts to commit suicide by slashing her wrist. Her teacher, whom she relies on heavily, leaves for northern Japan to take another job. Other students start to gossip about Sachiko and her former teacher. Sachiko then drops out of school and attempts to find herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFAPMMw5JOii6t7nhBtJitLvK6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89800'),
  ('198319323092058943', 'Harmonica', 1974, 'Drama', 'Amir Naderi, Ali Reza Zarrindast', 'Amir Naderi', 'Masoud Gudarzi, Mehdi Javadi, Shahla Darvishi, Yaghoob Moradzadeh, Mohammad Moradzadeh, Abbas Pourahadi, Jameh Tanin, Abbas Raeissi', null, 'Set on the southern coast of Iran, "Harmonica" begins as a young boy receives a musical present from abroad. Fascinated and envious, his friends make him the leader of the pack, as they compete for the privilege of holding the harmonica or even blowing a few notes, until the games and horseplay begin to take on a sinister edge.', 'Set on the southern coast of Iran, "Harmonica" begins as a young boy receives a musical present from abroad. Fascinated and envious, his friends make him the leader of the pack, as they compete for the privilege of holding the harmonica or even blowing a few notes, until the games and horseplay begin to take on a sinister edge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfg41EAOPfmwHCSiGaRNQrrMtAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327194'),
  ('334272688168798908', 'Harmonie', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', 'Yasuhiro Yoshiura, Yasuhiro Yoshiura, Atsushi Ikariya', 'Yasuhiro Yoshiura', 'Reina Ueda, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kenta Matsumoto, Makoto Furukawa, Manami Numakura, Ryo Iwasaki', null, 'Every person has his or her own little world. Among the 34 bustling students of classroom 2-1, there are many such worlds. Akio Honjou''s world—my world—is filled with passionate talk about last night''s anime with Yoshida, Watanabe, and other friends. It''s an fun, comfortable place... But, I always wonder. Wonder about the world of Juri Makina, smiling and surrounded by gorgeous friends on the other side of the classroom. One day, I enter her world. But it''s not as simple as it sounds.', 'Every person has his or her own little world. Among the 34 bustling students of classroom 2-1, there are many such worlds. Akio Honjou''s world—my world—is filled with passionate talk about last night''s anime with Yoshida, Watanabe, and other friends. It''s an fun, comfortable place... But, I always wonder. Wonder about the world of Juri Makina, smiling and surrounded by gorgeous friends on the other side of the classroom. One day, I enter her world. But it''s not as simple as it sounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBBK520SbwMVBMTHaw4c1lW8t10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256765'),
  ('359088305888363646', 'Harmonium', 2016, 'Drama', 'Koji Fukada, Kenichi Negishi', 'Koji Fukada', 'Tadanobu Asano, Mariko Tsutsui, Taiga Nakano, Momone Shinokawa, Kana Mahiro, Kanji Furutachi, Takahiro Miura, Kenichi Akiyama', null, 'Toshio hires Yasaka to work in his workshop. But then this old acquaintance, who has just been released from prison, begins to meddle in Toshio''s family life.', 'Toshio hires Yasaka to work in his workshop. But then this old acquaintance, who has just been released from prison, begins to meddle in Toshio''s family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SRtaCHpAo9oPrEfuRksR4AWe5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392795'),
  ('1121342488157626496', 'Harmontown', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Neil Berkeley', null, 'Dan Harmon, Erin McGathy, Jeff Bryan Davis, Steve Agee, Jack Black, Joel McHale, Alison Brie, Gillian Jacobs', null, 'A comedic, brutally honest documentary following self-destructive TV writer Dan Harmon as he takes his live podcast on a national tour.', 'A comedic, brutally honest documentary following self-destructive TV writer Dan Harmon as he takes his live podcast on a national tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HlxDzy3LZ26r5as5pLX7jYVcyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253292'),
  ('655818886092296173', 'Harmony', 2010, 'Drama, Music', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Kang Dae-gyu, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Lee Seung-yun, JK Youn', 'Yunjin Kim, Jang Young-nam, Ji Sung-won, Jeong Soo-young, Lee Da-hee, Na Moon-hee, Kyeong-min Mun, Park Jun-myun', null, 'Jeong-hye gives a birth to a baby boy in the prison. Her and other inmates create a women''s choir to compete in the national choir contest, to meet and greet their families and loving ones.', 'Jeong-hye gives a birth to a baby boy in the prison. Her and other inmates create a women''s choir to compete in the national choir contest, to meet and greet their families and loving ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9mIMRw3jydJifcuNh09mzVqQUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40167'),
  ('968479766023691612', 'Harmony', 2015, 'Thriller, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuyoshi Takeuchi, Michael Arias, Takashi Nakamura', 'Koji Yamamoto', 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Reina Ueda, Aya Suzaki, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Shin-ichiro Miki, Cho, Junpei Morita, Akeno Watanabe', 'R', 'Set in a future world. Japan has created a great medical technology that controls ethics, health, and social interaction to create a perfect world. Three young girls attempt to stand up to this by committing suicide, but it doesn''t work. Years later, Tuan, one of the girls who attempted suicide must prevent a crisis that threatens this "perfect" world.', 'Set in a future world. Japan has created a great medical technology that controls ethics, health, and social interaction to create a perfect world. Three young girls attempt to stand up to this by committing suicide, but it doesn''t work. Years later, Tuan, one of the girls who attempted suicide must prevent a crisis that threatens this "perfect" world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UbCB4riPmrMxANyR3Zhd1176Nc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357411'),
  ('468571465515761316', 'Harmony From The Heart', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Randal Platt, Michael Robison', 'Jessica Lowndes', 'Jessica Lowndes, Jesse Metcalfe, Linden McMillan, Jesse Moss, Christie Burke, Susan Hogan, Michael St. John Smith, Colleen Winton', 'G', 'Violet is a woman chasing her dream job, not without getting a difficult task from her professor, she realizes that she loves helping people and her heart begins to open again.', 'Violet is a woman chasing her dream job, not without getting a difficult task from her professor, she realizes that she loves helping people and her heart begins to open again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vX36Q3AbLmlxS5AOOAUfwtzzJPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913346'),
  ('939349019750270363', 'Harodim', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Paul Finelli, Peter V. Meiselmann, Tomas Erhart', 'Paul Finelli', 'Peter Fonda, Travis Fimmel, Hani Al Naimi, Tayfun Bademsoy', null, 'Lazarus Fell, a former naval intelligence officer trained in black ops and tasked with tracking down the most wanted Terrorist in the world, has gone rogue, realizing his mission has been inexplicably compromised by his own chain of command. As a result, Lazarus has faked his own death, forsaken his life, his family and all that matters to him in the world, to continue his solitary pursuit. But he has personal motivations as well, believing his father, Solomon Fell, Chief of Operations for the Office of Naval Intelligence, was killed in the attacks of 9/11 – the event masterminded by the selfsame Terrorist.', 'Lazarus Fell, a former naval intelligence officer trained in black ops and tasked with tracking down the most wanted Terrorist in the world, has gone rogue, realizing his mission has been inexplicably compromised by his own chain of command. As a result, Lazarus has faked his own death, forsaken his life, his family and all that matters to him in the world, to continue his solitary pursuit. But he has personal motivations as well, believing his father, Solomon Fell, Chief of Operations for the Office of Naval Intelligence, was killed in the attacks of 9/11 – the event masterminded by the selfsame Terrorist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xISwVgq2f9qBsOg1yxaZ2iRLYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125966'),
  ('272870138518916522', 'Harold', 2008, 'Comedy', 'T. Sean Shannon, Christopher LaVasseur', 'Greg Fields, T. Sean Shannon', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Spencer Breslin, Nikki Blonsky, Ally Sheedy, Chris Parnell, Stella Maeve, Suzanne Shepherd, Rachel Dratch', null, 'A teenager with an early onset of male-pattern baldness befriends his high school''s janitor.', 'A teenager with an early onset of male-pattern baldness befriends his high school''s janitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGM5plNRXY6ORJVK1ovf2sALNlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13578'),
  ('272222516796102593', 'Harold & Kumar Escape from Guantanamo Bay', 2008, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Jon Hurwitz, Hayden Schlossberg, Daryn Okada', 'Jon Hurwitz, Hayden Schlossberg', 'John Cho, Kal Penn, Neil Patrick Harris, Rob Corddry, Roger Bart, Danneel Ackles, Eric Winter, Jon Reep', 'R', 'Having satisfied their urge for White Castle, Harold and Kumar jump on a plane to catch up with Harold''s love interest, who''s headed for the Netherlands. But the pair must change their plans when Kumar is accused of being a terrorist. Rob Corddry also stars in this wild comedy sequel that follows the hapless stoners'' misadventures as they try to avoid being captured by the Department of Homeland Security.', 'Having satisfied their urge for White Castle, Harold and Kumar jump on a plane to catch up with Harold''s love interest, who''s headed for the Netherlands. But the pair must change their plans when Kumar is accused of being a terrorist. Rob Corddry also stars in this wild comedy sequel that follows the hapless stoners'' misadventures as they try to avoid being captured by the Department of Homeland Security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmXKlm8c8O7JEISYP4WiWq2x3We.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13335'),
  ('1112976008116874063', 'Harold & Kumar Go to Amsterdam', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Hayden Schlossberg, Jon Hurwitz', 'Hayden Schlossberg, Jon Hurwitz', 'John Cho, Kal Penn, Paula Garcés, Danneel Ackles', null, 'Ever wonder what would have happened if Harold & Kumar had not been sent to Guantanamo and simply made it to Amsterdam? Here''s a little something director Jon Hurwitz shot guerrilla-style all over Amsterdam in 3 days.', 'Ever wonder what would have happened if Harold & Kumar had not been sent to Guantanamo and simply made it to Amsterdam? Here''s a little something director Jon Hurwitz shot guerrilla-style all over Amsterdam in 3 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lw78Kye9qawJdDfEvnjpZN0BoOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264139'),
  ('1016531501829410446', 'Harold & Kumar Go to White Castle', 2004, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Danny Leiner, Bruce Douglas Johnson', 'Jon Hurwitz, Hayden Schlossberg', 'John Cho, Kal Penn, Paula Garcés, Neil Patrick Harris, David Krumholtz, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Christopher Meloni, Malin Åkerman', 'R', 'Nerdy accountant Harold and his irrepressible friend, Kumar, get stoned watching television and find themselves utterly bewitched by a commercial for White Castle. Convinced there must be one nearby, the two set out on a late-night odyssey that takes them deep into New Jersey. Somehow, the boys manage to run afoul of rednecks, cops and even a car-stealing Neil Patrick Harris before getting anywhere near their beloved sliders.', 'Nerdy accountant Harold and his irrepressible friend, Kumar, get stoned watching television and find themselves utterly bewitched by a commercial for White Castle. Convinced there must be one nearby, the two set out on a late-night odyssey that takes them deep into New Jersey. Somehow, the boys manage to run afoul of rednecks, cops and even a car-stealing Neil Patrick Harris before getting anywhere near their beloved sliders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vO7R4xYlDipTp8gzfRbWegO8eb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11282'),
  ('910147469420427424', 'Harold and Maude', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hal Ashby, John A. Alonzo, Michael J. Dmytryk', 'Colin Higgins', 'Ruth Gordon, Bud Cort, Vivian Pickles, Cyril Cusack, Charles Tyner, Ellen Geer, Eric Christmas, G. Wood', 'PG', 'A deadpan young man obsessed with death meets an eccentric septuagenarian who teaches him to live life to the fullest.', 'A deadpan young man obsessed with death meets an eccentric septuagenarian who teaches him to live life to the fullest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7qEuGwDjcYu8ajaKZ68DeDnOxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343'),
  ('502407418736173972', 'Harold and the Purple Crayon', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gabriel Beristain, Carlos Saldanha', 'David Guion, Michael Handelman', 'Zachary Levi, Lil Rel Howery, Zooey Deschanel, Benjamin Bottani, Tanya Reynolds, Jemaine Clement, Alfred Molina, Pete Gardner', 'PG', 'Inside of his book, adventurous Harold can make anything come to life simply by drawing it. After he grows up and draws himself off the book''s pages and into the physical world, Harold finds he has a lot to learn about real life.', 'Inside of his book, adventurous Harold can make anything come to life simply by drawing it. After he grows up and draws himself off the book''s pages and into the physical world, Harold finds he has a lot to learn about real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtW6bWUEqfPLaD6KnetIlSG4adf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826510'),
  ('682758270216273462', 'Haroun', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Seralf Flares', null, 'Haroun', null, 'In this playfully provocative set, French comedian Haroun examines modern society - and wonders if humans have stopped evolving.', 'In this playfully provocative set, French comedian Haroun examines modern society - and wonders if humans have stopped evolving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dX976EbJSmRNog2uc2oPxKEBTsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890559'),
  ('99371292910976520', 'Harper', 1966, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Jack Smight, Conrad Hall, James H. Brown', 'William Goldman', 'Paul Newman, Lauren Bacall, Julie Harris, Arthur Hill, Janet Leigh, Pamela Tiffin, Robert Wagner, Robert Webber', 'NR', 'Harper is a cynical private eye in the best tradition of Bogart. He even has Bogie''s Baby hiring him to find her missing husband, getting involved along the way with an assortment of unsavory characters and an illegal-alien smuggling ring.', 'Harper is a cynical private eye in the best tradition of Bogart. He even has Bogie''s Baby hiring him to find her missing husband, getting involved along the way with an assortment of unsavory characters and an illegal-alien smuggling ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zy56CkGHBA9WubuJ7fjntTZCvRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26268'),
  ('533078396330755185', 'Harper Valley P.T.A.', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Richard C. Bennett, Steve Siporin, Tom McCrory', 'George Edwards, Barry Schneider', 'Barbara Eden, Ronny Cox, Nanette Fabray, Audrey Christie, Ron Masak, John Fiedler, Bob Hastings, Susan Swift', 'PG', 'Stella Johnson is a single mother living in the town of Harper Valley. Most of the townsfolk, particularly those on the school PTA, think she is a little too liberal so they''re making things tough for her and her daughter. So she runs for the position of PTA President, which infuriates them. Stella decides to get revenge with the help of her friends.', 'Stella Johnson is a single mother living in the town of Harper Valley. Most of the townsfolk, particularly those on the school PTA, think she is a little too liberal so they''re making things tough for her and her daughter. So she runs for the position of PTA President, which infuriates them. Stella decides to get revenge with the help of her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yp8pvtUrJNPfP21ir3FZrK4VGr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113777'),
  ('891936911427208220', 'Harpoon', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Grant, Kyle Cooper, Charles Hamilton', 'Mike Kovac', 'Munro Chambers, Emily Tyra, Chris Gray, Brett Gelman, Kurtis David Harder, Rob Grant, Michael Peterson, Robert Spina', null, 'Rivalries, dark secrets, and sexual tension emerge when three best friends find themselves stranded on a yacht in the middle of the ocean under suspicious circumstances.', 'Rivalries, dark secrets, and sexual tension emerge when three best friends find themselves stranded on a yacht in the middle of the ocean under suspicious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36zt0v54vRmgn1Zgvlfw0azQK9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574284'),
  ('360695405667817684', 'Harpy', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Raoul Servais, Walter Smets, Raoul Servais', 'Raoul Servais', 'Will Spoor, Fran Waller Zeper, Sjoert Schwibethus', null, 'An unknowing man rescues a rather aggressive and demanding harpy.', 'An unknowing man rescues a rather aggressive and demanding harpy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uemnCTJH2bJR9rFaKx49H1jyM7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163060'),
  ('377365637539685100', 'Harriet', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Michele Panelli-Venetis, Toi Whitaker, David Mendoza', 'Gregory Allen Howard, Kasi Lemmons', 'Cynthia Erivo, Leslie Odom Jr., Janelle Monáe, Clarke Peters, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Omar J. Dorsey, Henry Hunter Hall, Joseph Lee Anderson', 'PG-13', 'The extraordinary tale of Harriet Tubman''s escape from slavery and transformation into one of America''s greatest heroes. Her courage, ingenuity and tenacity freed hundreds of slaves and changed the course of history.', 'The extraordinary tale of Harriet Tubman''s escape from slavery and transformation into one of America''s greatest heroes. Her courage, ingenuity and tenacity freed hundreds of slaves and changed the course of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsUs58bDqpJJxZSOebZOMN9gzw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506528'),
  ('944483592450892515', 'Harriet Craig', 1950, 'Drama', 'Vincent Sherman, Joseph Walker, Frederick Briskin', 'Anne Froelich, James Gunn', 'Joan Crawford, Wendell Corey, Lucile Watson, Allyn Joslyn, William Bishop, K.T. Stevens, Viola Roache, Raymond Greenleaf', 'NR', 'A perfectionist woman''s devotion to her home drives away friends and family.', 'A perfectionist woman''s devotion to her home drives away friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrwq0en5FxedV2scMS7i9teDKVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85293'),
  ('265370763030086054', 'Harriet the Spy', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Bronwen Hughes, Francis Kenny, Andrew Shea', 'Douglas Petrie, Theresa Rebeck', 'Michelle Trachtenberg, Rosie O''Donnell, J. Smith-Cameron, Eartha Kitt, Vanessa Lee Chester, Gregory Smith, Robert Joy, Dov Tiefenbach', 'PG', 'When the secret notebook of a young girl who fancies herself a spy is found by her friends, her speculations make her very unpopular! Can she win her friends back?', 'When the secret notebook of a young girl who fancies herself a spy is found by her friends, her speculations make her very unpopular! Can she win her friends back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spTUUMgIVm4gOdWL35IoYWEuZQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38223'),
  ('799745832225697379', 'Harriet the Spy: Blog Wars', 2010, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Ron Oliver, Alwyn Kumst', 'Alexandra Clarke, Heather Conkie', 'Jennifer Stone, Vanessa Morgan, Wesley Morgan, Kiana Madeira, Kristin Booth, Doug Murray, Jason Blicker, Jayne Eastwood', 'PG', 'Young spy Harriet Welsch crosses paths with popular student Marion Hawthorne as the two girls vie to become the official blogger of their high school class.', 'Young spy Harriet Welsch crosses paths with popular student Marion Hawthorne as the two girls vie to become the official blogger of their high school class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEQp6YCUdadJJmF3PE38N6a52wd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49350'),
  ('212000779576274489', 'Harrison Bergeron', 1995, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Bruce Pittman, Michael Storey', 'Arthur Crimm, Jon Glascoe', 'Sean Astin, Miranda de Pencier, Eugene Levy, Howie Mandel, Andrea Martin, Christopher Plummer, Nigel Bennett, Peter Boretski', 'R', '"All men are not created equal. It is the purpose of the Government to make them so." This is the premise of the Showtime film adaption of Kurt Vonnegut''s futuristic short story Harrison Bergeron. The film centers around a young man (Harrison) who is smarter than his peers, and is not affected by the usual "Handicapping" which is used to train all Americans so everyone is of equal intelligence.', '"All men are not created equal. It is the purpose of the Government to make them so." This is the premise of the Showtime film adaption of Kurt Vonnegut''s futuristic short story Harrison Bergeron. The film centers around a young man (Harrison) who is smarter than his peers, and is not affected by the usual "Handicapping" which is used to train all Americans so everyone is of equal intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jc2mINVs86QrreRZw0tlPJp1FlC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24732'),
  ('710299604192574366', 'Harrison''s Flowers', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Élie Chouraqui, Lucie Pascu, Pavel Typolt', 'Isabel Ellsen, Didier Le Pêcheur, Élie Chouraqui', 'Andie MacDowell, Elias Koteas, Brendan Gleeson, Adrien Brody, David Strathairn, Quinn Shephard, Gerard Butler, Alun Armstrong', null, '1991. Harrison Lloyd, a renowned photojournalist covering the war in Yugoslavia, is reported missing. Sarah, his wife, convinced that he is not dead, decides to go to Bosnia to find him.', '1991. Harrison Lloyd, a renowned photojournalist covering the war in Yugoslavia, is reported missing. Sarah, his wife, convinced that he is not dead, decides to go to Bosnia to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7YO7LqMXrEsP33pQShzJMPbXLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25014'),
  ('17467897741894877', 'Harry', 2024, null, 'Roy Boucher, Stuart Smith', 'Roy Boucher', 'Roy Boucher', null, 'Leo realizes that there is no place like home.', 'Leo realizes that there is no place like home.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1339252'),
  ('877546292318182804', 'Harry & Meghan: A Royal Romance', 2018, 'Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Thomas M. Harting, Menhaj Huda', 'Scarlett Lacey, Terrence Coli', 'Parisa Fitz-Henley, Murray Fraser, Burgess Abernethy, Laura Mitchell, Steve Coulter, Clare Filipow, Trevor Lerner, Constance Ejuma', null, 'Examine the history of Prince Harry and Meghan Markle from the moment they met after being set up by friends, through their initial courtship when they were able to keep their romance under wraps, and ultimately the intense global media attention surrounding their relationship and Meghan’s life as a divorced American actress.', 'Examine the history of Prince Harry and Meghan Markle from the moment they met after being set up by friends, through their initial courtship when they were able to keep their romance under wraps, and ultimately the intense global media attention surrounding their relationship and Meghan’s life as a divorced American actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ODzSaM8EKF28mGjNTH3ptb3BJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518527'),
  ('68716077889445911', 'Harry & Son', 1984, 'Drama', 'Paul Newman, Donald McAlpine', 'Paul Newman, Ronald Buck', 'Paul Newman, Robby Benson, Ellen Barkin, Wilford Brimley, Judith Ivey, Ossie Davis, Morgan Freeman, Katherine Borowitz', 'PG', 'Widower Harry Keach is a construction worker who was raised to appreciate the importance of working for a living. He takes a dim view of his sensitive son Howard''s lackadaisical lifestyle and has a strained relationship with his daughter Nina as he does not approve of her husband. When Harry is fired from his job, his life changes drastically as he is made to focus on the relationships around him.', 'Widower Harry Keach is a construction worker who was raised to appreciate the importance of working for a living. He takes a dim view of his sensitive son Howard''s lackadaisical lifestyle and has a strained relationship with his daughter Nina as he does not approve of her husband. When Harry is fired from his job, his life changes drastically as he is made to focus on the relationships around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl9yUlWRBEyXNGIXav1WIRBy5te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91767'),
  ('234942817945439402', 'Harry and Harriet', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Cyril Frankel, Heinz Hölscher', 'Vivian Naefe, Frank Lenart', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Mandy Perryment, Fiona Fullerton, Heinz Hoenig, Heinz Marecek, Julia Kent, Charles Gray, Jochen Busse', null, 'A quiet, offbeat German dramedy about self-reinvention and the messy ways we try to escape ourselves. When a middle-aged woman decides to shed her old life and adopt the name “Harry,” her transformation unsettles family, friends, and lovers who can’t quite keep up. Blurring gender identity, midlife crisis, and dark humour, the film plays like a bittersweet character study — deadpan, gently absurd, and tinged with melancholy.', 'A quiet, offbeat German dramedy about self-reinvention and the messy ways we try to escape ourselves. When a middle-aged woman decides to shed her old life and adopt the name “Harry,” her transformation unsettles family, friends, and lovers who can’t quite keep up. Blurring gender identity, midlife crisis, and dark humour, the film plays like a bittersweet character study — deadpan, gently absurd, and tinged with melancholy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mtCwKI9GsUxDZlygHE9qXveYiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186744'),
  ('1115303813575403906', 'Harry and Max', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rob Sweeney, Christopher Münch', 'Christopher Münch', 'Bryce Johnson, Cole Williams, Rain Phoenix, Katherine Ellis, Roni Deitz, Tom Gilroy, Michelle Phillips, Justin Zachary', 'NR', 'Two brothers, Harry and Max, who are both teen idols, come to terms with their dysfunctional family past and deep affection for each other', 'Two brothers, Harry and Max, who are both teen idols, come to terms with their dysfunctional family past and deep affection for each other', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIamsnmqYgRLuosJFlWGiCMXS8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27091'),
  ('703631749897487341', 'Harry and Meghan: Escaping the Palace', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Menhaj Huda', 'Scarlett Lacey', 'Jordan Dean, Sydney Morton, Jordan Whalen, Steve Coulter, Melanie Nicholls-King, Laura Mitchell, James Dreyfus, Keegan Connor Tracy', null, 'The Duke and Duchess of Sussex are taking on the British monarchy in the third installment in Lifetime’s movie trilogy about the royal couple. The film explores what really happened inside the palace that drove Harry and Meghan to leave everything behind in order to make a future for themselves and their son Archie.', 'The Duke and Duchess of Sussex are taking on the British monarchy in the third installment in Lifetime’s movie trilogy about the royal couple. The film explores what really happened inside the palace that drove Harry and Meghan to leave everything behind in order to make a future for themselves and their son Archie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plfWQnlLaiPoayrj2a0EJOhPw97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858717'),
  ('194519828687015847', 'Harry and the Butler', 1961, 'Family, Comedy', 'Bent Christensen', null, 'Osvald Helmuth, Ebbe Rode, Gunnar Lauring, Lily Broberg, Olaf Ussing, Palle Kirk, Lise Ringheim, Henning Moritzen', null, 'A gentle comedy offering the promise of easy social consensus. Harry (Helmuth) is a simple old-time shop porter offered a chance at self-realisation when he''s bequeathed a sum by an unknown relative (via several levels of fiscal blood suckers). He decides to engage a butler to take good care of him for a time. This is a man of distinguished upper class service, but a generous nature which happily integrates with Harry''s small but colourful world of drinking buddies and crackpot neighbourhood kids.', 'A gentle comedy offering the promise of easy social consensus. Harry (Helmuth) is a simple old-time shop porter offered a chance at self-realisation when he''s bequeathed a sum by an unknown relative (via several levels of fiscal blood suckers). He decides to engage a butler to take good care of him for a time. This is a man of distinguished upper class service, but a generous nature which happily integrates with Harry''s small but colourful world of drinking buddies and crackpot neighbourhood kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5IIEZmpqZTnEI8YfTykHdO6d1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57911'),
  ('889768782330216557', 'Harry and the Hendersons', 1987, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Drama', 'Allen Daviau, William Dear, George Koblasa', 'Ezra D. Rappaport, Bill Martin, William Dear', 'John Lithgow, Melinda Dillon, Don Ameche, David Suchet, Margaret Langrick, Joshua Rudoy, M. Emmet Walsh, John Bloom', 'PG', 'Returning from a hunting trip in the forest, the Henderson family''s car hits an animal in the road. At first they fear it was a man, but when they examine the "body" they find it''s a "bigfoot". They think it''s dead so they decide to take it home (there could be some money in this). As you guessed, it isn''t dead. Far from being the ferocious monster they fear "Harry" to be, he''s a friendly giant.', 'Returning from a hunting trip in the forest, the Henderson family''s car hits an animal in the road. At first they fear it was a man, but when they examine the "body" they find it''s a "bigfoot". They think it''s dead so they decide to take it home (there could be some money in this). As you guessed, it isn''t dead. Far from being the ferocious monster they fear "Harry" to be, he''s a friendly giant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZNWhOEsuNHIQ1gbtwdTGK7srCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8989'),
  ('769224724822899163', 'Harry and Tonto', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Paul Mazursky, Anthony Ray, Dodie Fawley', 'Paul Mazursky, Josh Greenfeld', 'Art Carney, Ellen Burstyn, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Larry Hagman, Chief Dan George, René Enríquez, Herbert Berghof, Michael McCleery', 'R', 'Harry is a retired teacher in his 70s who has lived in the Upper West Side of New York City all his life. When his building is torn down to make way for a parking garage, Harry and his beloved cat Tonto begin a journey across the United States — visiting his children, seeing a world he never seemed to have the time to see before, making new friends, and saying goodbye to old friends.', 'Harry is a retired teacher in his 70s who has lived in the Upper West Side of New York City all his life. When his building is torn down to make way for a parking garage, Harry and his beloved cat Tonto begin a journey across the United States — visiting his children, seeing a world he never seemed to have the time to see before, making new friends, and saying goodbye to old friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JIy2g5UoHBnmNnFpSU7oq5xdTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42448'),
  ('692059086702697322', 'Harry and Walter Go to New York', 1976, 'Crime, Comedy', 'László Kovács, Mark Rydell', 'John Byrum, Robert Kaufman', 'Elliott Gould, James Caan, Diane Keaton, Michael Caine, Charles Durning, Lesley Ann Warren, Val Avery, Jack Gilford', 'PG', 'Two hopelessly out of their class con-men attempt to pull off the largest bank heist of the 19th century — by gaining the enmity of the most famous bank robber in the world and the affection of a crusading newspaperwoman.', 'Two hopelessly out of their class con-men attempt to pull off the largest bank heist of the 19th century — by gaining the enmity of the most famous bank robber in the world and the affection of a crusading newspaperwoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EUjz08MUVoZxekNnWZIasjZ5yh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149445'),
  ('853818623067595584', 'Harry Belafonte: Between Calypso and Justice', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Simone Unger', null, 'Harry Belafonte', null, 'Harry Belafonte wrote music history. How did the black boy from Harlem manage to become one of the greatest artists of the 20th century in the middle of racist America? The film portrait tells the story of the famous singer, actor, producer and activist.', 'Harry Belafonte wrote music history. How did the black boy from Harlem manage to become one of the greatest artists of the 20th century in the middle of racist America? The film portrait tells the story of the famous singer, actor, producer and activist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DGZNooSu4LwxjT3nfeo0IJP42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003152'),
  ('340765001805851268', 'Harry Brown', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Action', 'Daniel Barber, Martin Ruhe', 'Gary Young', 'Michael Caine, Emily Mortimer, Iain Glen, Lee Oakes, Liam Cunningham, Sean Harris, Charlie Creed-Miles, David Bradley', 'R', 'An elderly ex-serviceman and widower looks to avenge his best friend''s murder by doling out his own form of justice.', 'An elderly ex-serviceman and widower looks to avenge his best friend''s murder by doling out his own form of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk9qVzvPHuL2vX9ixNut9n0KfYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25941'),
  ('662084819356038018', 'Harry in Your Pocket', 1973, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Bruce Geller, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'James D. Buchanan, Ronald Austin', 'James Coburn, Michael Sarrazin, Trish Van Devere, Walter Pidgeon, Michael C. Gwynne, Tony Giorgio, Michael Stearns, Susan Mullen', 'PG', 'A master thief and his drug-addicted partner teach two aspiring crooks how to steal wallets.', 'A master thief and his drug-addicted partner teach two aspiring crooks how to steal wallets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvElfDmIxXvjjgnhUW7582w7m0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72460'),
  ('1068037357531414128', 'Harry Munter', 1969, 'Drama', 'Kjell Grede, Lasse Björne', 'Kjell Grede', 'Jan Nielsen, Carl-Gustaf Lindstedt, Gun Jönsson, Elina Salo, Georg Adelly, Alan Simon, Märta Allan-Johnson, Gerda Calander', null, 'Harry Munter, a sensitive, kind, appealing man in his twenties, lives with his parents. He''s an inventor, a bit of a mystic, maybe a genius, and a good son and grandson. He''s offered work in the U.S. But a friend has cancer and the world is changing in ways that provoke profound sadness. Written by Eileen Berdon', 'Harry Munter, a sensitive, kind, appealing man in his twenties, lives with his parents. He''s an inventor, a bit of a mystic, maybe a genius, and a good son and grandson. He''s offered work in the U.S. But a friend has cancer and the world is changing in ways that provoke profound sadness. Written by Eileen Berdon', null, 'tmdb:movie:180879'),
  ('729546680909837006', 'Harry Potter 20th Anniversary: Return to Hogwarts', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Joe Pearlman, Edgar Dubrovsky, Simon Fanthorpe', null, 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Bonnie Wright, Matthew Lewis, Tom Felton, James Phelps, Oliver Phelps', 'PG-13', 'An enchanting making-of story told through all-new in-depth interviews and cast conversations, inviting fans on a magical first-person journey through one of the most beloved film franchises of all time.', 'An enchanting making-of story told through all-new in-depth interviews and cast conversations, inviting fans on a magical first-person journey through one of the most beloved film franchises of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jntLBq0MLR3hrwKaTQswxACRPMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899082'),
  ('23238408989394798', 'Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets', 2002, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Chris Columbus, Roger Pratt, Peter Dorme', 'Steve Kloves', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Kenneth Branagh, Toby Jones, Robbie Coltrane, Richard Harris, Alan Rickman', 'PG', 'Cars fly, trees fight back, and a mysterious house-elf comes to warn Harry Potter at the start of his second year at Hogwarts. Adventure and danger await when bloody writing on a wall announces: The Chamber Of Secrets Has Been Opened. To save Hogwarts will require all of Harry, Ron and Hermione''s magical abilities and courage.', 'Cars fly, trees fight back, and a mysterious house-elf comes to warn Harry Potter at the start of his second year at Hogwarts. Adventure and danger await when bloody writing on a wall announces: The Chamber Of Secrets Has Been Opened. To save Hogwarts will require all of Harry, Ron and Hermione''s magical abilities and courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdEOH0992YZ0QSxgXNIGLq1ToUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672'),
  ('70387497472106284', 'Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 1', 2010, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'David Yates, Eduardo Serra, Jamie Christopher', 'Steve Kloves', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Emma Watson, Rupert Grint, Toby Jones, Helena Bonham Carter, Alan Rickman, Ralph Fiennes, Bill Nighy', 'PG-13', 'Harry, Ron and Hermione walk away from their last year at Hogwarts to find and destroy the remaining Horcruxes, putting an end to Voldemort''s bid for immortality. But with Harry''s beloved Dumbledore dead and Voldemort''s unscrupulous Death Eaters on the loose, the world is more dangerous than ever.', 'Harry, Ron and Hermione walk away from their last year at Hogwarts to find and destroy the remaining Horcruxes, putting an end to Voldemort''s bid for immortality. But with Harry''s beloved Dumbledore dead and Voldemort''s unscrupulous Death Eaters on the loose, the world is more dangerous than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGoXIpQb7Pot00EEdwpwPajheZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12444'),
  ('387985194987802794', 'Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2', 2011, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'David Yates, Eduardo Serra, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Steve Kloves', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Emma Watson, Rupert Grint, Ralph Fiennes, Alan Rickman, Michael Gambon, Warwick Davis, Helena Bonham Carter', 'PG-13', 'Harry, Ron and Hermione continue their quest to vanquish the evil Voldemort once and for all. Just as things begin to look hopeless for the young wizards, Harry discovers a trio of magical objects that endow him with powers to rival Voldemort''s formidable skills.', 'Harry, Ron and Hermione continue their quest to vanquish the evil Voldemort once and for all. Just as things begin to look hopeless for the young wizards, Harry discovers a trio of magical objects that endow him with powers to rival Voldemort''s formidable skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c54HpQmuwXjHq2C9wmoACjxoom3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12445'),
  ('395848515973890151', 'Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire', 2005, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Mike Newell, Roger Pratt, Rosie Hardwick', 'Steve Kloves', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Brendan Gleeson, Michael Gambon, Robert Pattinson, Ralph Fiennes, Robbie Coltrane', 'PG-13', 'When his name emerges from the Goblet of Fire, Harry Potter becomes a competitor in a grueling battle for glory among three wizarding schools—the Triwizard Tournament. But since Harry never submitted his name for the Tournament, who did? Now Harry must confront a deadly dragon, fierce water demons, and an enchanted maze only to find himself in the cruel grasp of He Who Must Not Be Named.', 'When his name emerges from the Goblet of Fire, Harry Potter becomes a competitor in a grueling battle for glory among three wizarding schools—the Triwizard Tournament. But since Harry never submitted his name for the Tournament, who did? Now Harry must confront a deadly dragon, fierce water demons, and an enchanted maze only to find himself in the cruel grasp of He Who Must Not Be Named.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fECBtHlr0RB3foNHDiCBXeg9Bv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674'),
  ('888510267156620796', 'Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'David Yates, Bruno Delbonnel, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Steve Kloves', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Jim Broadbent, Michael Gambon, Tom Felton, Alan Rickman, Bonnie Wright', 'PG', 'As Lord Voldemort tightens his grip on both the Muggle and wizarding worlds, Hogwarts is no longer a safe haven. Harry suspects perils may even lie within the castle, but Dumbledore is more intent upon preparing him for the final battle fast approaching. Together they work to find the key to unlock Voldemorts defenses and to this end, Dumbledore recruits his old friend and colleague Horace Slughorn, whom he believes holds crucial information. Even as the decisive showdown looms, romance blossoms for Harry, Ron, Hermione and their classmates. Love is in the air, but danger lies ahead and Hogwarts may never be the same again.', 'As Lord Voldemort tightens his grip on both the Muggle and wizarding worlds, Hogwarts is no longer a safe haven. Harry suspects perils may even lie within the castle, but Dumbledore is more intent upon preparing him for the final battle fast approaching. Together they work to find the key to unlock Voldemorts defenses and to this end, Dumbledore recruits his old friend and colleague Horace Slughorn, whom he believes holds crucial information. Even as the decisive showdown looms, romance blossoms for Harry, Ron, Hermione and their classmates. Love is in the air, but danger lies ahead and Hogwarts may never be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7uo9zmQdQwU5ZJHFpv2Upl30i1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767'),
  ('113294895114448831', 'Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix', 2007, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Sławomir Idziak, David Yates, Mike Brewster', 'Michael Goldenberg', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Imelda Staunton, Helena Bonham Carter, Robbie Coltrane, Gary Oldman, Ralph Fiennes', 'PG-13', 'Returning for his fifth year at Hogwarts, Harry is stunned to find that his warnings about the return of Lord Voldemort have been ignored. Left with no choice, Harry takes matters into his own hands, training a small group of motivated students to defend themselves against the Dark Arts.', 'Returning for his fifth year at Hogwarts, Harry is stunned to find that his warnings about the return of Lord Voldemort have been ignored. Left with no choice, Harry takes matters into his own hands, training a small group of motivated students to defend themselves against the Dark Arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aOyriWkPec0zUDxmHFP9qMmBaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675'),
  ('98785637839098276', 'Harry Potter and the Philosopher''s Stone', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Chris Columbus, John Seale, Ian Dray', 'Steve Kloves', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Richard Harris, Tom Felton, Alan Rickman, Robbie Coltrane, Maggie Smith', 'PG', 'Harry Potter has lived under the stairs at his aunt and uncle''s house his whole life. But on his 11th birthday, he learns he''s a powerful wizard—with a place waiting for him at the Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. As he learns to harness his newfound powers with the help of the school''s kindly headmaster, Harry uncovers the truth about his parents'' deaths—and about the villain who''s to blame.', 'Harry Potter has lived under the stairs at his aunt and uncle''s house his whole life. But on his 11th birthday, he learns he''s a powerful wizard—with a place waiting for him at the Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. As he learns to harness his newfound powers with the help of the school''s kindly headmaster, Harry uncovers the truth about his parents'' deaths—and about the villain who''s to blame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuMc08IPKEatf9rnMNXvIDxqP4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671'),
  ('499407281246812535', 'Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban', 2004, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Alfonso Cuarón, Michael Seresin, Alastair Bullock', 'Steve Kloves', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Rupert Grint, Emma Watson, Robbie Coltrane, Michael Gambon, Gary Oldman, David Thewlis, Timothy Spall', 'PG', 'Year three at Hogwarts means new fun and challenges as Harry learns the delicate art of approaching a Hippogriff, transforming shape-shifting Boggarts into hilarity and even turning back time. But the term also brings danger: soul-sucking Dementors hover over the school, an ally of the accursed He-Who-Cannot-Be-Named lurks within the castle walls, and fearsome wizard Sirius Black escapes Azkaban. And Harry will confront them all.', 'Year three at Hogwarts means new fun and challenges as Harry learns the delicate art of approaching a Hippogriff, transforming shape-shifting Boggarts into hilarity and even turning back time. But the term also brings danger: soul-sucking Dementors hover over the school, an ally of the accursed He-Who-Cannot-Be-Named lurks within the castle walls, and fearsome wizard Sirius Black escapes Azkaban. And Harry will confront them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWxwnYoe8p2d2fcxOqtvAtJ72Rw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673'),
  ('426238896215944024', 'Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', null, 'J K Rowling', 'Cush Jumbo, Louise Jameson, Jeremy Swift, Max Lester, Chris Lew Kum Hoi', null, 'An audiobook of ''Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban'' voiced by more than one hundred voice actors.', 'An audiobook of ''Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban'' voiced by more than one hundred voice actors.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:harry-potter-and-the-prisoner-of-azkaban-2026'),
  ('709801672162621738', 'Harry Potter: A History Of Magic', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jude Ho, Alex Harding', null, 'Imelda Staunton, J.K. Rowling, David Thewlis, Warwick Davis, Evanna Lynch, Mark Williams, Miriam Margolyes', 'PG', 'A thrilling journey through legends, belief and folklore, this film goes behind the scenes with the British Library as they search to tell that story through objects in their collection, in an ambitious new exhibition: Harry Potter: A History Of Magic. J.K. Rowling, who is lending unseen manuscripts, drawings and drafts from her private archives (which will sit alongside treasures from the British Library, as well as original drafts and drawings from Jim Kay) talks about some of the personal items she has lent to the exhibition and gives new insight into her writing, looking at some of the objects from the exhibition that have fired her imagination.', 'A thrilling journey through legends, belief and folklore, this film goes behind the scenes with the British Library as they search to tell that story through objects in their collection, in an ambitious new exhibition: Harry Potter: A History Of Magic. J.K. Rowling, who is lending unseen manuscripts, drawings and drafts from her private archives (which will sit alongside treasures from the British Library, as well as original drafts and drawings from Jim Kay) talks about some of the personal items she has lent to the exhibition and gives new insight into her writing, looking at some of the objects from the exhibition that have fired her imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkzDng2S8w2hT1gap7MdMdx7uUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482408'),
  ('124559989975730598', 'Harry Styles: Behind the Album', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Brett Turnbull, David Soutar, Hayley Collett', null, 'Harry Styles, Mitch Rowland, Sarah Jones, Alex Salibian, Adam Prendegast, Clare Uchima', null, 'Chronicles Harry’s musical journey while creating his much anticipated debut solo album. The film features exclusive interviews and behind the scenes footage shot in Jamaica, Los Angeles and London during the making of the album and is complemented by Harry and his band performing songs from it for the first time at the world famous Abbey Road Studios in London.', 'Chronicles Harry’s musical journey while creating his much anticipated debut solo album. The film features exclusive interviews and behind the scenes footage shot in Jamaica, Los Angeles and London during the making of the album and is complemented by Harry and his band performing songs from it for the first time at the world famous Abbey Road Studios in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaAvT8p0WeKRtyLBtgkgKnnrHBs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456806'),
  ('681305016364385573', 'Harry Styles. One Night in Manchester', 2026, 'Music, Documentary', 'Paul Dugdale, Brett Turnbull', null, 'Sarah Jones, Mitch Rowland, Pauli Lovejoy, Yaffra, Elin Sandberg', 'TV-14', 'Harry Styles performs his new album "Kiss All The Time. Disco, Occasionally" for the first time at a special one-off Manchester concert recorded March 6.', 'Harry Styles performs his new album "Kiss All The Time. Disco, Occasionally" for the first time at a special one-off Manchester concert recorded March 6.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FAigpusxLychNPHCdB8jRVTEQ1kS.jpg', 'plex:movie:harry-styles-one-night-in-manchester-2026'),
  ('438548483422700309', 'Harsh Couture', 2025, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Flávia Lacerda, Paulo Vainer, Leonardo Teatini', 'Marcelo Saback, Célio Porto, Ingrid Guimarães', 'Ingrid Guimarães, Filipe Bragança, Rafa Chalub, Michel Noher, Késia Estácio, Jonas Bloch, Cris Vianna, Giovanni Bianco', null, 'In the campaign that could change her career as fashion influencer, Paula Pratta only needs one essential item: her son. But he trades his business school in California for a permaculture institute in Amazon. With assistant Taylor, she sets off in search of the boy and finds a world without filters and much more than she expected, including the chance to reconsider what really matters in her life.', 'In the campaign that could change her career as fashion influencer, Paula Pratta only needs one essential item: her son. But he trades his business school in California for a permaculture institute in Amazon. With assistant Taylor, she sets off in search of the boy and finds a world without filters and much more than she expected, including the chance to reconsider what really matters in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVQ58sWH6c36D6YAQ552tHB2x97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380809'),
  ('892819885587561687', 'Harsh Times', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Action', 'David Ayer, Steve Mason', 'David Ayer', 'Christian Bale, Freddy Rodríguez, Eva Longoria, Chaka Forman, Tammy Trull, J.K. Simmons, Michael Monks, Samantha Esteban', 'R', 'Jim Davis is an ex-Army Ranger who finds himself slipping back into his old life of petty crime after a job offer from the LAPD evaporates. His best friend is pressured by his girlfriend Sylvia to find a job, but Jim is more interested in hanging out and making cash from small heists, while trying to get a law enforcement job so he can marry his Mexican girlfriend.', 'Jim Davis is an ex-Army Ranger who finds himself slipping back into his old life of petty crime after a job offer from the LAPD evaporates. His best friend is pressured by his girlfriend Sylvia to find a job, but Jim is more interested in hanging out and making cash from small heists, while trying to get a law enforcement job so he can marry his Mexican girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raBWBnGz2X6FQ3iUwPwYQE4FrkY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7873'),
  ('952702639409073619', 'Hart Beat', 2016, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Dirk-Jan Kerkkamp, Hans Somers', 'Ivo W. Punt, Jeroen van der Zee, Anjali Taneja', 'Vajèn van den Bosch, Rein van Duivenboden, Monsif Bakkali, Stephanie van Eer, Holly Mae Brood, Britt Scholte, Jelka van Houten, Vivienne van den Assem', null, 'Making music means everything for the shy Zoë. But since her father left, she never played guitar again. When she is hit by the bus from Mik, superstar Bieber size, sparks fly allthough she is not a fan at first. Off course, people around the two love birds dont exactly cooperate to make things work...', 'Making music means everything for the shy Zoë. But since her father left, she never played guitar again. When she is hit by the bus from Mik, superstar Bieber size, sparks fly allthough she is not a fan at first. Off course, people around the two love birds dont exactly cooperate to make things work...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1PBdhD1c6xnTV6c7B4d58OESYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414919'),
  ('1131889949434481035', 'Hart to Hart Returns', 1993, 'Adventure, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Peter Roger Hunt, Roy H. Wagner', 'James G. Hirsch, E. Jack Kaplan, Richard Chapman', 'Robert Wagner, Stefanie Powers, Lionel Stander, Mike Connors, Mike Connors, Lance Guest, Lance Guest, David Purdham', null, 'Jonathan Hart, the wealthy entrepreneur, and his charming investigative reporter wife, Jennifer, once again get caught up in a mystery, this time involving corrupt government contractors. Aided by their trusty servant Max, who is more family than employee, and their dog Freeway, the Harts try to resolve issues with an investigation into Jonathan’s business dealings with an old friend in the aerospace industry, and find themselves in the midst of a dark plot which will put Jonathan’s freedom, their home, and even their lives in jeopardy.', 'Jonathan Hart, the wealthy entrepreneur, and his charming investigative reporter wife, Jennifer, once again get caught up in a mystery, this time involving corrupt government contractors. Aided by their trusty servant Max, who is more family than employee, and their dog Freeway, the Harts try to resolve issues with an investigation into Jonathan’s business dealings with an old friend in the aerospace industry, and find themselves in the midst of a dark plot which will put Jonathan’s freedom, their home, and even their lives in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7U7KTr0SVsFNTLlo6S1hqnxA7nt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293636'),
  ('78872584688277116', 'Hart to Hart: Crimes of the Hart', 1994, 'Adventure, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Peter Roger Hunt', 'Lawrence Hertzog', 'Robert Wagner, Stefanie Powers, Lionel Stander, Alan Rachins, Richard Belzer, Audra Lindley, John Stockwell, Lew Ayres', 'NR', 'In their very last adventure, Jonathan and Jennifer Hart travel to The Big Apple, where a play she wrote in college is being produced on Broadway. But there''s sabotage going on, and when a stagehand is murdered, everyone''s a suspect - even Jonathan!', 'In their very last adventure, Jonathan and Jennifer Hart travel to The Big Apple, where a play she wrote in college is being produced on Broadway. But there''s sabotage going on, and when a stagehand is murdered, everyone''s a suspect - even Jonathan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gX0yida7FuE5rO3RcSEJxLnVpdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258867'),
  ('519675474666555820', 'Hart to Hart: Home Is Where the Hart Is', 1994, 'Adventure, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Peter Roger Hunt, Roy H. Wagner', 'Lawrence Hertzog', 'Robert Wagner, Stefanie Powers, Lionel Stander, Maureen O''Sullivan, Alan Young, Howard Keel, Tracey Ellis, Roddy McDowall', 'NR', 'When a mentor and friend of Jennifer''s dies, she and Jonathan return to the sleepy town where Jennifer once lived and worked as a reporter. Nearly immediately, they discover that all is not right within this picturesque town. The town''s economic troubles pale next to the danger the Harts find themselves in as they try to sort out whether their friend''s death was murder, and what sinister secrets may lie behind the truth.', 'When a mentor and friend of Jennifer''s dies, she and Jonathan return to the sleepy town where Jennifer once lived and worked as a reporter. Nearly immediately, they discover that all is not right within this picturesque town. The town''s economic troubles pale next to the danger the Harts find themselves in as they try to sort out whether their friend''s death was murder, and what sinister secrets may lie behind the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcUyMciDPkNIVmMuGfGlsGlsrPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259562'),
  ('270719544145584975', 'Hart to Hart: Old Friends Never Die', 1994, 'Mystery, Crime, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Peter Roger Hunt', 'Lawrence Hertzog', 'Robert Wagner, Stefanie Powers, Lionel Stander, David Rasche, James Shigeta, Fred Willard, Vicki Lawrence, Mike Farrell', 'NR', 'The Harts find themselves in the middle of a dangerous murder plot, but it isn''t clear if the plot it a famous author''s fictional murder-mystery, or an actual murder plot, until Jonathan finds himself the unsuspecting target of a killer. It begins to look like the culprit behind the plot is an old friend, Frank Crane, but there may be a connection to a corporate takeover of Hart Industries as well.', 'The Harts find themselves in the middle of a dangerous murder plot, but it isn''t clear if the plot it a famous author''s fictional murder-mystery, or an actual murder plot, until Jonathan finds himself the unsuspecting target of a killer. It begins to look like the culprit behind the plot is an old friend, Frank Crane, but there may be a connection to a corporate takeover of Hart Industries as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3X5lkRJdeThJRd2w4RpEjUK1qY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269699'),
  ('1089057605226757149', 'Hart to Hart: Secrets of the Hart', 1995, 'Mystery, Adventure, Crime, TV Movie', 'Kevin Connor, Douglas Milsome, Judith Vogelsang', 'Rob Gilmer', 'Robert Wagner, Stefanie Powers, Lionel Stander, Jason Bateman, Marion Ross, Wendie Malick, John Beck, Pat Morita', 'NR', 'Set in San Francisco, Jonathan and Jennifer Hart are faced with the prospect of being reunited with Jonathan''s long lost sister, and her nephew. Is it possible that Jonathan will finally discover a key to his past or will the "family" turn out to be after something, putting Jonathan and Jennifer in danger''s past one more time?', 'Set in San Francisco, Jonathan and Jennifer Hart are faced with the prospect of being reunited with Jonathan''s long lost sister, and her nephew. Is it possible that Jonathan will finally discover a key to his past or will the "family" turn out to be after something, putting Jonathan and Jennifer in danger''s past one more time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttgiFn5wnXLyeNYW3knNMpy0FSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269698'),
  ('962389719529271172', 'Hart''s War', 2002, 'Drama, War', 'Alar Kivilo, Gregory Hoblit, Petr Drozda', 'Billy Ray, Terry George', 'Bruce Willis, Colin Farrell, Terrence Howard, Marcel Iureș, Cole Hauser, Linus Roache, Vicellous Shannon, Rory Cochrane', 'R', 'When Col. William McNamara is stripped of his freedom in a German POW camp, he''s determined to keep on fighting even from behind enemy lines. Enlisting the help of a young lieutenant in a brilliant plot against his captors, McNamara risks everything on a mission to free his men and change the outcome of the war.', 'When Col. William McNamara is stripped of his freedom in a German POW camp, he''s determined to keep on fighting even from behind enemy lines. Enlisting the help of a young lieutenant in a brilliant plot against his captors, McNamara risks everything on a mission to free his men and change the outcome of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRUhSU7vzs5ePa72LNPcKKCCMZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10592'),
  ('278068772322837171', 'Harter Brocken', 2015, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Stephan Wagner, Julia Eplinius, Thomas Benesch', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Aljoscha Stadelmann, Julia Koschitz, Hinnerk Schönemann, Christoph Bach, Anna Schudt, Godehard Giese, Anna Drexler, Moritz Führmann', null, 'A landslide in the Harz releases a corpse. Commissioner Frank Koops leads the investigation. Vanessa Riemann, tourist guide and marksman from St. Andreasberg, sees a lot of money in the backpack of the two hikers and attacks. On her breakneck escape through the undergrowth she is shot and bleeding in the arms of her brother Marco. In her backpack this finds 1.4 million euros – the booty from a bank robbery.', 'A landslide in the Harz releases a corpse. Commissioner Frank Koops leads the investigation. Vanessa Riemann, tourist guide and marksman from St. Andreasberg, sees a lot of money in the backpack of the two hikers and attacks. On her breakneck escape through the undergrowth she is shot and bleeding in the arms of her brother Marco. In her backpack this finds 1.4 million euros – the booty from a bank robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yh89t5uF95LgR5s36fWJB2i8UG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329461'),
  ('904736987895037334', 'Harter Brocken: Der Geheimcode', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kristian Leschner, Markus Sehr', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Aljoscha Stadelmann, Moritz Führmann, Anna Fischer, Sibylle Canonica, Franziska Weisz, Holger Handtke, Maike Jüttendonk, Kailas Mahadevan', null, 'Policeman Koops witnesses a car accident. The dying driver gives him an envelope with the part of a code. Shortly thereafter, Koops gets in the sights of a contract killer.', 'Policeman Koops witnesses a car accident. The dying driver gives him an envelope with the part of a code. Shortly thereafter, Koops gets in the sights of a contract killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzGOm9tn15daH591iasyFSe5Rae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657202'),
  ('489897952313039570', 'Harter Brocken: Die Kronzeugin', 2017, 'TV Movie, Crime', 'Florian Baxmeyer, Peter Krause', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Aljoscha Stadelmann, Alwara Höfels, Anja Kling, Johannes Krisch, Stephan Grossmann, Moritz Führmann, Anna Fischer, Michael Klammer', null, 'A shootout, five fatalities and he himself wounded - in the otherwise quiet station of the village policeman Frank Koops, things are just like in the Wild West. The bloodbath was commissioned by the imprisoned mafia boss Petrovic, who wants to use all means to get rid of a key witness who was hidden in the tranquility of St. Andreasberg in the utmost secrecy.', 'A shootout, five fatalities and he himself wounded - in the otherwise quiet station of the village policeman Frank Koops, things are just like in the Wild West. The bloodbath was commissioned by the imprisoned mafia boss Petrovic, who wants to use all means to get rid of a key witness who was hidden in the tranquility of St. Andreasberg in the utmost secrecy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC3SKVOVQAfgac6Aux53T9dBMVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434106'),
  ('1040114458568176753', 'Haru', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoshimitsu Morita, Taiichi Sugiyama', 'Yoshimitsu Morita', 'Eri Fukatsu, Seiyo Uchino, Naho Toda, Kazufumi Miyazawa, Kotaro Takeshita, Masaharu Tsuruku, Sei Hiraizumi, Noriko Kojima', null, 'A young Tokyo businessman joins an online movie forum and develops a special bond with one of its members through back and forth e-mails.', 'A young Tokyo businessman joins an online movie forum and develops a special bond with one of its members through back and forth e-mails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzXoCe9Cjw30G76FGwW51tPP2RR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261560'),
  ('459023157896351862', 'HARU', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Myeong-seo', null, 'Kim Kyung-ik, Jin Hye-Kyung, Ayaka Tomoda, Heo Sung-tae, Yoo Sun-young', null, 'Young-Woong is a psychiatrist (Kim Kyeong-Ik). He has been married to Soo-Hyun (Jin Hye-Kyung) for 10 years, but their love has waned and they now feel indifferent towards each other. One day, Soo-Hyun''s daughter Haru (Ayaka Tomoda) appears before them. Soo-Hyun gave birth to Haru while she was studying in Japan. Haru carries a wounded heart from her boyfriend''s betrayal. Soo-Hyun asks Yoong-Woong to treat her daughter. Through their consultations, Young-Woong begins to dream of more than just a doctor and patient relationship.', 'Young-Woong is a psychiatrist (Kim Kyeong-Ik). He has been married to Soo-Hyun (Jin Hye-Kyung) for 10 years, but their love has waned and they now feel indifferent towards each other. One day, Soo-Hyun''s daughter Haru (Ayaka Tomoda) appears before them. Soo-Hyun gave birth to Haru while she was studying in Japan. Haru carries a wounded heart from her boyfriend''s betrayal. Soo-Hyun asks Yoong-Woong to treat her daughter. Through their consultations, Young-Woong begins to dream of more than just a doctor and patient relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFCnHBBjL2M1reccfOHdHY9TXP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293749'),
  ('385817484983677188', 'Haru''s Journey', 2010, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Kobayashi, Kenji Takama', 'Masahiro Kobayashi', 'Eri Tokunaga, Tatsuya Nakadai, Hideji Ōtaki, Kin Sugai, Kaoru Kobayashi, Yuko Tanaka, Chikage Awashima, Akira Emoto', null, 'Stuck in a fishing village in Hokkaido, Tadao''s grand-daughter Haru is desperate to visit Tokyo, a trip Tadao is reluctant to make.', 'Stuck in a fishing village in Hokkaido, Tadao''s grand-daughter Haru is desperate to visit Tokyo, a trip Tadao is reluctant to make.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EDc61sGbEV1jOMBCRXHCgXUswy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121094'),
  ('864213078911980305', 'Harum Scarum', 1965, 'Comedy, Crime, Music, Romance', 'Fred Jackman Jr., Gene Nelson, Eddie Saeta', 'Gerald Drayson Adams', 'Elvis Presley, Mary Ann Mobley, Fran Jeffries, Michael Ansara, Jay Novello, Phillip Reed, Theo Marcuse, Billy Barty', 'NR', 'Johnny Tyronne, action movie star and ladies man, is traveling through the Middle East on a goodwill tour to promote his latest movie, "Sands of the Desert". Once he arrives, however, he is kidnapped by a gang of assassins who were so impressed with his on-screen adventures that they want to hire him to carry out an assassination for them.', 'Johnny Tyronne, action movie star and ladies man, is traveling through the Middle East on a goodwill tour to promote his latest movie, "Sands of the Desert". Once he arrives, however, he is kidnapped by a gang of assassins who were so impressed with his on-screen adventures that they want to hire him to carry out an assassination for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9534MhbWoH3h4JttddrCqKhvIdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7506'),
  ('966277377567146344', 'Haruta & Chika', 2017, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Masahide Ichii', 'Masahiro Yamaura, Masahide Ichii', 'Shori Sato, Kanna Hashimoto, Yuri Tsunematsu, Hiroya Shimizu, Koki Maeda, Takuma Hiraoka, Moka Kamishiraishi, Himeru Nikaidô', null, 'Haruta is handsome and smart, Chika is bright and naive. When they were children, they were friends until Haruta''s family moved away while he was in the 3rd grade. They meet again during a high school entrance ceremony. After all of these years, Chika is eager to join the wind instrument club. Due to an incident, the wind instrument club is about to be disbanded. Chika can''t give up the flute so she attracts Haruta to her side and tries to recruit members from the wind instrument club. The group attempts to solve various cases taking place at their school while they plan to take part in a contest.', 'Haruta is handsome and smart, Chika is bright and naive. When they were children, they were friends until Haruta''s family moved away while he was in the 3rd grade. They meet again during a high school entrance ceremony. After all of these years, Chika is eager to join the wind instrument club. Due to an incident, the wind instrument club is about to be disbanded. Chika can''t give up the flute so she attracts Haruta to her side and tries to recruit members from the wind instrument club. The group attempts to solve various cases taking place at their school while they plan to take part in a contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPAymw5grT3RX3QPZOQTRPKh8wX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438553'),
  ('1000950775618151517', 'Harvard Man', 2001, 'Drama', 'James Toback, David M. Ferrara', 'James Toback', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Adrian Grenier, Joey Lauren Adams, Eric Stoltz, Rebecca Gayheart, John Neville, Gianni Russo, Michael Aparo', 'R', 'College has always been a time for experimentation, sexual, cultural and otherwise. "Harvard Man" plays out against a background of love, sex, basketball, crime and experimentation. Action and philosophy in young people''s quest to discover their true identity.', 'College has always been a time for experimentation, sexual, cultural and otherwise. "Harvard Man" plays out against a background of love, sex, basketball, crime and experimentation. Action and philosophy in young people''s quest to discover their true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxZG1UXh8gA3nYmrPNUWCHGGBFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27451'),
  ('1022484002796533062', 'Harvest', 1937, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcel Pagnol, Willy Faktorovitch', 'Jean Giono', 'Fernandel, Robert Le Vigan, Marguerite Moreno, Gabriel Gabrio, Orane Demazis, Henri Poupon, Odette Roger, Milly Mathis', null, 'In the 30s, a small village in the Provence is losing its inhabitants because young people prefer to go to the city to find easy jobs and escape from being farmers living in relative poverty. Only a few old people and the poacher Panturle remain. Panturle dreams of bringing the village back to life, finding a wife, founding a family and work as a farmer. One day, the village is visited by a traveling knife-grinder, Urbain Gedemus and a young woman, Arsule. Gedemus treats Arsule like a slave, but Arsule accept this because she has nowhere to go and -we guess- her ''work'' with Gedemus is the last thing that saves her from being a prostitute. When she meets Panturle and knows about his dreams, she escapes from Gedemus and decides to stay with him. Together, they start a new life, made of hard farming work but mostly of happiness to have each other, fulfilling the earlier dreams of Panturle. Can anything break the happiness of their new life?', 'In the 30s, a small village in the Provence is losing its inhabitants because young people prefer to go to the city to find easy jobs and escape from being farmers living in relative poverty. Only a few old people and the poacher Panturle remain. Panturle dreams of bringing the village back to life, finding a wife, founding a family and work as a farmer. One day, the village is visited by a traveling knife-grinder, Urbain Gedemus and a young woman, Arsule. Gedemus treats Arsule like a slave, but Arsule accept this because she has nowhere to go and -we guess- her ''work'' with Gedemus is the last thing that saves her from being a prostitute. When she meets Panturle and knows about his dreams, she escapes from Gedemus and decides to stay with him. Together, they start a new life, made of hard farming work but mostly of happiness to have each other, fulfilling the earlier dreams of Panturle. Can anything break the happiness of their new life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJxF6qc6MhR4C98Ryuj4HOX5EdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43153'),
  ('969241743931015138', 'Harvest', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Benjamin Cantu, Nina Hoffmann', 'Benjamin Cantu', 'Lukas Steltner, Kai Michael Müller, Steven Baade, Florian Born, Eric Fechner, Christian Hahn, Charlina Ingold, Jan Jendruschewitz', null, 'Breathtaking in its subtle beauty, Harvest is an achingly romantic tale of an innocent but ever increasingly passionate affair that develops between two simple farmhands. Life on a farm is all that sullen teen Marco knows- leading a perfunctory and quiet life of working, going to school and avoiding the advances of girls. However, his self-imposed solitude ends when curly-haired Jakob, rejecting the banking world for farming, arrives to train on the farm. Although initially cautious and tentative with each other, it is soon obvious that the unspoken sexual tension is becoming increasingly hard to resist - something a spontaneous trip to Berlin. Proving that true love can blossom in even the most unlikely of places, Harvest is as rich and rewarding as it is heart-warming.', 'Breathtaking in its subtle beauty, Harvest is an achingly romantic tale of an innocent but ever increasingly passionate affair that develops between two simple farmhands. Life on a farm is all that sullen teen Marco knows- leading a perfunctory and quiet life of working, going to school and avoiding the advances of girls. However, his self-imposed solitude ends when curly-haired Jakob, rejecting the banking world for farming, arrives to train on the farm. Although initially cautious and tentative with each other, it is soon obvious that the unspoken sexual tension is becoming increasingly hard to resist - something a spontaneous trip to Berlin. Proving that true love can blossom in even the most unlikely of places, Harvest is as rich and rewarding as it is heart-warming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alX7yu5tcGiCqgNT7OR7NXDyPMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79919'),
  ('22244623871908812', 'Harvest', 2025, 'Drama', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari, Sean Price Williams, Shaheen Baig', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari, Joslyn Barnes', 'Caleb Landry Jones, Harry Melling, Rosy McEwen, Arinzé Kene, Thalissa Teixeira, Frank Dillane, Stephen McMillan, Mitchell Robertson', null, 'Over seven hallucinatory days, a village with no name, in an undefined time and place, disappears.', 'Over seven hallucinatory days, a village with no name, in an undefined time and place, disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/semdbWe02N2vfUYsJ2gAPmlQTpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936946'),
  ('591577294356474677', 'Harvest', 2026, 'Drama', 'Paul Kampf, Mladen Šević, Radan Popović, Milica Stanković', 'Paul Kampf', 'Matthew McNulty, Angus Macfadyen, Aleksandar Jovanović, Jovana Gavrilović, Paul Leonard Murray', null, 'Harvest is based on an astonishing true story of a German Baron who is in desperate need of a heart transplant. In spite of astonishing circumstances, he goes on a journey through the Blackmarket underbelly to find hope in the darkness.', 'Harvest is based on an astonishing true story of a German Baron who is in desperate need of a heart transplant. In spite of astonishing circumstances, he goes on a journey through the Blackmarket underbelly to find hope in the darkness.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FyREvEWJUbJiWf3GznqhuYDWB1n5.jpg', 'plex:movie:harvest-2026'),
  ('526072024392959234', 'Harvest Moon', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter DeLuise, Kit Marlatt, Vince Coates', 'J.P. Martin, Ron Oliver', 'Jessy Schram, Jesse Hutch, Willie Aames, Lilah Fitzgerald, Barbara Pollard, Rowen Kahn, Patricia Isaac, Lynda Boyd', null, 'When her family goes bankrupt, privileged city girl Jen Stone travels to the country to try and fix up a struggling pumpkin farm that her father bought as an investment to get her money back. Not everyone is on board with her changes, least of all Brett, the farm''s handsome manager. By working with what she knows best, she discovers the magic of pumpkin skincare and turns the struggling farm around while also falling in love.', 'When her family goes bankrupt, privileged city girl Jen Stone travels to the country to try and fix up a struggling pumpkin farm that her father bought as an investment to get her money back. Not everyone is on board with her changes, least of all Brett, the farm''s handsome manager. By working with what she knows best, she discovers the magic of pumpkin skincare and turns the struggling farm around while also falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6vNuIcObszzgoAUd9ZMGGiGh5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361746'),
  ('255276385229405498', 'Harvest of Fire', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Arthur Allan Seidelman', null, 'Lolita Davidovich, Patty Duke, J.A. Preston, Jean Louisa Kelly, Tom Aldredge, Jennifer Garner', 'PG', 'In a small Amish community, three barns are burnt down almost simultaneously. FBI agent Sally Russwell is sent in to investigate this possible hate crime. What she finds however is a community that little trust for outsiders or "The English" as they call them. However, in her investigations, Agent Russell makes friends with one entrepreneurial widow, Annie Beiler who has her own curiosity about this stranger. Together, Annie introduces Russell in-depth to this close knit community bearing many appealing attributes. However, as Sally''s investigations continue, she discovers secrets that reveal uncomfortable truths about the religious community that are linked to the arson attacks.', 'In a small Amish community, three barns are burnt down almost simultaneously. FBI agent Sally Russwell is sent in to investigate this possible hate crime. What she finds however is a community that little trust for outsiders or "The English" as they call them. However, in her investigations, Agent Russell makes friends with one entrepreneurial widow, Annie Beiler who has her own curiosity about this stranger. Together, Annie introduces Russell in-depth to this close knit community bearing many appealing attributes. However, as Sally''s investigations continue, she discovers secrets that reveal uncomfortable truths about the religious community that are linked to the arson attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fMJHcLPLS7onj8BDQckX6ZtkzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145016'),
  ('540409514781098521', 'Harvest: 3,000 Years', 1975, 'Drama', 'Haile Gerima, Elliot Davis', 'Haile Gerima', 'Kasu Asfaw, Gebru Kasa, Worke Kasa, Melaku Makonen, Worke Kasa, Adane Melaku, Harege-Weyn Tafere', null, 'In this meditative film the everyday lives of poor Ethiopian peasants are shown using documentary as well as storytelling techniques, with its drama arising out of the timeless yet persistent issues of their lives.', 'In this meditative film the everyday lives of poor Ethiopian peasants are shown using documentary as well as storytelling techniques, with its drama arising out of the timeless yet persistent issues of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hD4pvRhjnaMHrtxVL3EI6R60miP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149155'),
  ('356917553635997084', 'Harvie Krumpet', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Adam Elliot', 'Adam Elliot', 'Geoffrey Rush, Kamahl, John Flaus, Julie Forsyth', null, 'The odd biography of Harvie Krumpet, a man who has Tourette''s Syndrome, chronic bad luck, menial jobs, nudist tendencies, and a book of "fakts" hung around his neck - but still optimistically lives own way and enjoys the small things life has to offer.', 'The odd biography of Harvie Krumpet, a man who has Tourette''s Syndrome, chronic bad luck, menial jobs, nudist tendencies, and a book of "fakts" hung around his neck - but still optimistically lives own way and enjoys the small things life has to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TWvqqncvw5azIwnSGl8i9xTFZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21131'),
  ('242800009786693310', 'Has Anybody Seen My Gal?', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Douglas Sirk, Clifford Stine', 'Joseph Hoffman', 'Charles Coburn, Piper Laurie, Rock Hudson, Gigi Perreau, Lynn Bari, Larry Gates, William Reynolds, Skip Homeier', 'PG', 'When a 1920s millionaire tests the fiber of his Vermont family, a young lady and her boyfriend feel the repercussions.', 'When a 1920s millionaire tests the fiber of his Vermont family, a young lady and her boyfriend feel the repercussions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZFk1jwxoZ7e6o5exhFIykDWyF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54670'),
  ('1019119254507582783', 'Hasan Minhaj: Homecoming King', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Storer, Andrew Wehde', 'Hasan Minhaj', 'Hasan Minhaj', null, 'Comic Hasan Minhaj of "The Daily Show" shares personal stories about racism, immigrant parents, prom night horrors and more in this stand-up special.', 'Comic Hasan Minhaj of "The Daily Show" shares personal stories about racism, immigrant parents, prom night horrors and more in this stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clFR57vfc0BXGYFIo3LYryopyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458310'),
  ('1034829585209805398', 'Hasee Toh Phasee', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vivek Soni, Vinil Mathew, Sanu John Varghese', 'Harshavardhan Kulkarni', 'Sidharth Malhotra, Parineeti Chopra, Adah Sharma, Manoj Joshi, Sharat Saxena, Nina Kulkarni, Anil Charanjeett, Sameer Kakkar', 'PG-13', 'On the eve of Nikhil and Karishma’s engagement, Karishma’s wealthy father, Devesh Solanki, expresses his disapproval, believing Nikhil to be a lackadaisical young man. With one week to prove himself worthy to marry Karishma, Nikhil and Karishma''s sister, Meeta, grow closer to each other.', 'On the eve of Nikhil and Karishma’s engagement, Karishma’s wealthy father, Devesh Solanki, expresses his disapproval, believing Nikhil to be a lackadaisical young man. With one week to prove himself worthy to marry Karishma, Nikhil and Karishma''s sister, Meeta, grow closer to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6s9Nb0bfuH1KqXvnG22FCAgrP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251626'),
  ('871846960769241403', 'Haseen Dillruba', 2021, 'Romance, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vikramjeet Dahiya, Vinil Mathew', 'Kanika Dhillon', 'Taapsee Pannu, Vikrant Massey, Harshvardhan Rane, Aditya Srivastava, Yamini Das, Daya Shankar Pandey, Ashish Verma, Deepesh Sumitra Jagdish', 'R', 'Under investigation as a suspect in her husband''s murder, a wife reveals details of their thorny marriage that seem to only further blur the truth.', 'Under investigation as a suspect in her husband''s murder, a wife reveals details of their thorny marriage that seem to only further blur the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYzaef514peQVZRWGkM3ZvJPqpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695969'),
  ('671179498713879449', 'Haseena Maan Jaayegi', 1999, 'Action, Comedy', 'David Dhawan', null, 'Govinda, Sanjay Dutt, Karisma Kapoor, Pooja Batra, Kader Khan, Paresh Rawal, Satish Kaushik, Aruna Irani', null, 'Brothers Sonu and Monu''s regular pranks worry their father. However, their lives take a turn when they fall in love and go to great lengths to impress the girls'' father.', 'Brothers Sonu and Monu''s regular pranks worry their father. However, their lives take a turn when they fall in love and go to great lengths to impress the girls'' father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNZkVQOpSFkOEVRIXJGUInFNE5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30321'),
  ('264774956989567248', 'Haseena Parkar', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Apoorva Lakhia, Fasahat Khan, Honey Trehan', 'Suresh Nair', 'Shraddha Kapoor, Siddhanth Kapoor, Ankur Bhatia, Rajesh Tailang, Daya Shankar Pandey, Samar Jai Singh, Sunil Upadhyay', null, 'Haseena is very close to her brother Dawood, who turns to a life of crime and rises to power in the Mumbai underworld. After the bomb blasts of 1993, Dawood escapes to Dubai and she falls in trouble.', 'Haseena is very close to her brother Dawood, who turns to a life of crime and rises to power in the Mumbai underworld. After the bomb blasts of 1993, Dawood escapes to Dubai and she falls in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZRo2gg0jiUTvhY7upFmhBwthIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461707'),
  ('636010097134363346', 'Hasenjagd - Vor lauter Feigheit gibt es kein Erbarmen', 1994, 'History, War, Drama', 'Andreas Gruber, Hermann Dunzendorfer', 'Andreas Gruber', 'Oliver Broumis, Elfriede Irrall, Merab Ninidze, Rüdiger Vogler, Rainer Egger, Kirsten Nehberg, Thierry van Werveke', null, 'This film is based on the actual events referred to as the "Mühlviertler Hasenjagd" (Hare-hunt in the Mühlviertel) which occurred in February 1945 around the Mauthausen concentration camp. 500 Soviet officers form death block 20 attempt to escape, but only 150 of them actually succeed. Following the tally-ho of the SS, a barbaric manhunt begins. Only very few fugitives survive. With a lot of good luck, the two young officers Michail and Nikolai reach the Karner family''s farm. Frau Karner persuades her husband to hide the two escapees.', 'This film is based on the actual events referred to as the "Mühlviertler Hasenjagd" (Hare-hunt in the Mühlviertel) which occurred in February 1945 around the Mauthausen concentration camp. 500 Soviet officers form death block 20 attempt to escape, but only 150 of them actually succeed. Following the tally-ho of the SS, a barbaric manhunt begins. Only very few fugitives survive. With a lot of good luck, the two young officers Michail and Nikolai reach the Karner family''s farm. Frau Karner persuades her husband to hide the two escapees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JLYc7t8NrLEyPLL2GwD9Hfpn1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107520'),
  ('810205235047273406', 'Hashima Project', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Piyapan Choopetch, Nattawut Kittikhun', 'Adirek Watleela', 'Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Mike Angelo, Alexander Rendell, Sushar Manaying, Mek Mekwattana, Shou Nishino, Bungo Sato, Pattanapon Kunjara', null, 'A group of teenagers will now step foot on this island to capture paranormal encounters on tape. On the island, the teenagers are thrilled as they explore. However, their excitement is short-lived. They realize something ominous is creeping up on them and the hair-raising truth unveils through the lens of the camera.', 'A group of teenagers will now step foot on this island to capture paranormal encounters on tape. On the island, the teenagers are thrilled as they explore. However, their excitement is short-lived. They realize something ominous is creeping up on them and the hair-raising truth unveils through the lens of the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxixWuAYQVPajExNhkdtvMoybcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255254'),
  ('470997538595860138', 'Hasip and Nasip', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Atıf Yılmaz', 'Umur Bugay', 'Zeki Alasya, Metin Akpınar, Güngör Bayrak, Şevket Altuğ, Erol Keskin, İhsan Yüce', null, 'After two families being at loggerheads for years, it is now Hasip and Nasip''s turn. They fight to win the mayor election, and to marry their common love interest, Perihan.', 'After two families being at loggerheads for years, it is now Hasip and Nasip''s turn. They fight to win the mayor election, and to marry their common love interest, Perihan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvvlUjr87kyUDkb9HL7rh5QDyY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428943'),
