  ('76016594071870964', 'Hasta la Victoria Siempre', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Santiago Álvarez', null, null, null, 'Created within forty-eight hours of Che Guevara’s death, Hasta la Victoria Siempre is a Cuban documentary tribute that combines archival footage, speeches, and images of revolutionary struggle to commemorate Guevara and reaffirm the ideals of the Cuban Revolution.', 'Created within forty-eight hours of Che Guevara’s death, Hasta la Victoria Siempre is a Cuban documentary tribute that combines archival footage, speeches, and images of revolutionary struggle to commemorate Guevara and reaffirm the ideals of the Cuban Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApeTl3vPWLBfXeAzIzAzYfelO33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255936'),
