  ('124364022255410189', 'Hatred', 2016, 'War, Drama, History', 'Wojtek Smarzowski, Piotr Sobociński Jr.', 'Wojtek Smarzowski', 'Michalina Łabacz, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Adrian Zaremba, Lech Dyblik, Dorota Liliental, Jacek Braciak, Izabela Kuna, Andrzej Popiel', null, 'Summer of 1939. Zosia is a young Polish girl who is deeply in love with Ukrainian Petro. Their great love will be put to the test when her father decides to marry her to a wealthy widower Skiba. Right after wedding she is left alone because her husband is drafted to the Polish army for the war with Germany. Meanwhile, tensions grow due to Jews, Poles, and Ukrainians living side by side.', 'Summer of 1939. Zosia is a young Polish girl who is deeply in love with Ukrainian Petro. Their great love will be put to the test when her father decides to marry her to a wealthy widower Skiba. Right after wedding she is left alone because her husband is drafted to the Polish army for the war with Germany. Meanwhile, tensions grow due to Jews, Poles, and Ukrainians living side by side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYk1YmXtUON1OiNveK6bqbIWUy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406449'),
  ('964198049114204216', 'Hats Off to Christmas!', 2013, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama, Romance', 'Ron Stannett, Terry Ingram', 'Deanna Talcott, Deborah Majinska, Jennifer Notas Shapiro', 'Haylie Duff, Antonio Cupo, Kendra Anderson, Sean Michael Kyer, Melanie Papalia, Jay Brazeau', 'PG', 'Mia, the loyal and hard-working manager of a quaint neighborhood Christmas hat shop, is blindsided when her boss asks her to train his son Nick for a vacant upper-management position that Mia had her eyes set on.', 'Mia, the loyal and hard-working manager of a quaint neighborhood Christmas hat shop, is blindsided when her boss asks her to train his son Nick for a vacant upper-management position that Mia had her eyes set on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M12HqmbA9yruOOQjJ9jZ7X1GrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244027'),
