  ('929853031023706869', 'Haunted School', 1995, 'Family, Horror', 'Hideyuki Hirayama, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Hironobu Nomura, Ayako Sugiyama, Masahiro Sato, Kimiko Yo, Kaoru Mizuki, Masumi Toyama, Hajime Atsuta, Shiori Yonezawa', null, 'A young girl wanders into a wing of her elementary school that has been abandoned for years and is rumored to be haunted. When she doesn''t come back, a group of her classmates go looking for her, only to find that they, too, are trapped inside. They must somehow find their way to safety, and quickly, because the rumors of ghosts are turning out to be true.', 'A young girl wanders into a wing of her elementary school that has been abandoned for years and is rumored to be haunted. When she doesn''t come back, a group of her classmates go looking for her, only to find that they, too, are trapped inside. They must somehow find their way to safety, and quickly, because the rumors of ghosts are turning out to be true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39zVYwXPaLJxgrKeBEpVwD8tsi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125165'),
  ('51625605747816937', 'Haunted Spooks', 1920, 'Comedy', 'Hal Roach, Alfred J. Goulding, Walter Lundin', 'H.M. Walker', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, Wally Howe, Sammy Brooks, William Gillespie, Mark Jones, Dee Lampton, Sam Lufkin', 'NR', 'After numerous failed attempts to commit suicide, our hero (Lloyd) runs into a lawyer who is looking for a stooge to stand in as a groom in order to secure an inheritance for his client (Davis). The inheritance is a house, which her scheming uncle "haunts" so that he can scare them off and claim the property.', 'After numerous failed attempts to commit suicide, our hero (Lloyd) runs into a lawyer who is looking for a stooge to stand in as a groom in order to secure an inheritance for his client (Davis). The inheritance is a house, which her scheming uncle "haunts" so that he can scare them off and claim the property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Mar6YrZFjoSe1k4xqtzOneWcG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53521'),
  ('49220363419768109', 'Haunted Tales For Wicked Kids: The Movie', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Horror', 'Victor-Hugo Borges, Marcelo Chuvisco Lima', 'Arthur Warren, Pedro Aguilera, Vitor Brandt', 'Charles Emmanuel, Nadia Carvalho, Iara Riça, Oberdan Júnior, Luiz Sérgio Vieira, Hélio Ribeiro, Garcia Júnior, Selma Lopes', null, 'Pepe is a 12-year-old boy who lives with his grandmother, a witch-businesswoman. After discovering that he is adopted and that his parents are alive, he decides to go in search of them, but thus ends up attracting the attention of Edmundo, a biomechanical villain who needs Pepe to realize his enormous evil plan: use the boy''s energy to conquer the immortality of its kind.', 'Pepe is a 12-year-old boy who lives with his grandmother, a witch-businesswoman. After discovering that he is adopted and that his parents are alive, he decides to go in search of them, but thus ends up attracting the attention of Edmundo, a biomechanical villain who needs Pepe to realize his enormous evil plan: use the boy''s energy to conquer the immortality of its kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ko8bZMi9GFgGDkwIN9Gl6YetaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477807'),
  ('357366328729706863', 'Haunted Universities', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Banjong Sintanamongkolgul, Suthiporn Taptim, Pramett Chankrasse', 'Banjong Sintanamongkolgul, Suthiporn Taptim', 'Chalad Na Songkhla, Atis Amornwetch, Pantila Fuglin, Marut Chuenchomboon, Wattana Koomkrong, Sipakan Photiphat, Nopparat Innochuek, Ashiraya Peerapatkunchaya', null, 'Based on various horror and ghost tales set in universities, the film centers around some students who encounter paranormal events in their university. They must fight against their fears and scary things that are haunting their university.', 'Based on various horror and ghost tales set in universities, the film centers around some students who encounter paranormal events in their university. They must fight against their fears and scary things that are haunting their university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uzk2y75OBdy6M8nA7XNEAj1VHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41899'),
  ('692667397751787225', 'Haunted-3D', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Vikram Bhatt', null, 'Mimoh Chakraborty, Tia Bajpai, Achint Kaur, Mohan Kapur, Prachee Shah, Arif Zakaria, Sanjay Sharma', null, 'A realtor finds himself accompanied by two ghostly entities inside a mansion. He learns of a violent event that took place years ago and is sent back in time to prevent it from happening.', 'A realtor finds himself accompanied by two ghostly entities inside a mansion. He learns of a violent event that took place years ago and is sent back in time to prevent it from happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enab9pHxda3bcaRpPDAnIJv1voa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68758'),
  ('292139367492466490', 'HauntedWeen', 1991, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Doug Robertson, Cory Lash', 'Kurt Andrew Swauger, Doug Robertson', 'Brien Blakely, Blake Pickett, Brad Hanks, Leslee Lacey, Ethan Adler, Bently Tittle, Tim Hubbard, Franklin Martin', 'NR', 'One Halloween night, a little girl visiting the Burber family''s "House of Horrors" attraction is brutally hacked to pieces by their young son, Eddie. Having fled the scene, Eddie is taken away by his mother to live in solitude at a remote cabin. Twenty years later, Tophill State College''s Sigma Phi fraternity are desperately trying to raise some cash, so they decide to throw a raucous fundraiser party for their peers. In the midst of the festivities, a mysterious figure arrives at the door, offering them the key to the old abandoned Burber house and suggesting that they turn it into a haunted house. Seizing the opportunity, the youngsters quickly set about transforming the property into an elaborate — and potentially lucrative — Halloween attraction. Little do they realize that Eddie Burber has returned home and intends to have some All Hallow''s Eve fun of his own — setting up his own "Kill Room," where the line between fantasy and reality quickly becomes blurred...', 'One Halloween night, a little girl visiting the Burber family''s "House of Horrors" attraction is brutally hacked to pieces by their young son, Eddie. Having fled the scene, Eddie is taken away by his mother to live in solitude at a remote cabin. Twenty years later, Tophill State College''s Sigma Phi fraternity are desperately trying to raise some cash, so they decide to throw a raucous fundraiser party for their peers. In the midst of the festivities, a mysterious figure arrives at the door, offering them the key to the old abandoned Burber house and suggesting that they turn it into a haunted house. Seizing the opportunity, the youngsters quickly set about transforming the property into an elaborate — and potentially lucrative — Halloween attraction. Little do they realize that Eddie Burber has returned home and intends to have some All Hallow''s Eve fun of his own — setting up his own "Kill Room," where the line between fantasy and reality quickly becomes blurred...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pu0p7Z2b3Et2GdhHXromgd5Sda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138998'),
  ('718711863151496344', 'Haunter', 2013, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vincenzo Natali, Jon Joffin', 'Brian King', 'Abigail Breslin, Stephen McHattie, David Hewlett, David Knoll, Peter Outerbridge, Michelle Nolden, Samantha Weinstein, Sarah Manninen', null, 'A teenager is stuck in a time loop that is not quite the same each time. She must uncover the truth but her actions have consequences for herself and others.', 'A teenager is stuck in a time loop that is not quite the same each time. She must uncover the truth but her actions have consequences for herself and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBsO7Sp3g1oOaxQ44pomsJLm7m7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166271'),
