  ('724377220692867900', 'Haunting of the Mary Celeste', 2020, 'Horror', 'Shana Betz, Raquel Fernández Nuñez, Jennifer Ricchiazzi', 'David Ross', 'Emily Swallow, Ava Acres, Richard Roundtree, Dominic DeVore, Alice Hunter, Pierre Adele', null, 'Rachel, a concerned researcher, and her team have set out to sea to prove that the disappearance of a family and crew from a merchant ship was for reasons having to do with the supernatural. Her theory that those on the Mary Celeste vanished into a "rift" between dimensions proves true as the boat breaks down and her crew begins to vanish one by one.', 'Rachel, a concerned researcher, and her team have set out to sea to prove that the disappearance of a family and crew from a merchant ship was for reasons having to do with the supernatural. Her theory that those on the Mary Celeste vanished into a "rift" between dimensions proves true as the boat breaks down and her crew begins to vanish one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67ITWm7Me4ThtT7v3W9BYCcP2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756278'),
  ('63965481724775184', 'Haunting of the Queen Mary', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Isaac Bauman, Gary Shore', 'Tom Vaughan, Gary Shore, Stephen Oliver', 'Alice Eve, Joel Fry, Nell Hudson, Angus Wright, Jim Piddock, Dorian Lough, William Shockley, Tim Downie', null, 'When photographers Erin and Patrick are brought aboard the ship with their young son Lukas, they unleash a series of events that entwines their family with the ship’s dark past. As the terror unfolds around them they begin to realise there is more to this sumptuous ocean liner than meets the eye: its remarkable legacy masking violent secrets.', 'When photographers Erin and Patrick are brought aboard the ship with their young son Lukas, they unleash a series of events that entwines their family with the ship’s dark past. As the terror unfolds around them they begin to realise there is more to this sumptuous ocean liner than meets the eye: its remarkable legacy masking violent secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8uEuy1NhOwltHePRqvxcDDUJg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977013'),
  ('1027678375513471600', 'Haunting of Winchester House', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mark Atkins, Howard Rosell, Burchenal Benton', 'Mark Atkins', 'Lira Kellerman, Michael Holmes, Tomas Boykin, Kimberly Ables Jindra, Patty Roberts, Jennifer Smart, Rob Ullett, David McIntyre', null, 'A family moves in to look after the Winchester mansion for a few months, and soon find themselves terrorized by vengeful spirits. With the help of a paranormal investigator they''ll unravel the mystery of the house.', 'A family moves in to look after the Winchester mansion for a few months, and soon find themselves terrorized by vengeful spirits. With the help of a paranormal investigator they''ll unravel the mystery of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrp5ZCcG8ebNRq0w04BltCr9yKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26482'),
