  ('322801788607329339', 'Hauptsache Ferien', 1972, 'Family, Comedy', 'Peter Weck, Hannes Staudinger', 'Reinhold Brandes, Mischa Mleinek, Rolf Ulrich', 'Peter Alexander, Christiane Hörbiger, Theo Lingen, Marietta Meade, Martin Held, Regina Claus, Hans Quest, Blandine Ebinger', null, 'On the last day of school, teachers and students have only one thing on their minds: finally, vacation. Corinna, the daughter of a prefabricated house manufacturer, has failed to pass her exams despite all her father''s attempts to bribe her. With a little trick, her classmates want to fulfill the greatest dream of Corinna''s teacher, Dr. Markus. A quick spin of the wheel of fortune and he has won a prefabricated house in a competition. Everything seems to be going well, but suddenly the deception is revealed.', 'On the last day of school, teachers and students have only one thing on their minds: finally, vacation. Corinna, the daughter of a prefabricated house manufacturer, has failed to pass her exams despite all her father''s attempts to bribe her. With a little trick, her classmates want to fulfill the greatest dream of Corinna''s teacher, Dr. Markus. A quick spin of the wheel of fortune and he has won a prefabricated house in a competition. Everything seems to be going well, but suddenly the deception is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4o9yMG4h6IeLJAJtHVycoDmPm6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102965'),
  ('1057788834307742905', 'Haute Couture', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sylvie Ohayon, Georges Lechaptois', 'Sylvie Ohayon, Sylvie Verheyde', 'Nathalie Baye, Lyna Khoudri, Pascale Arbillot, Soumaye Bocoum, Claude Perron, Adam Bessa, Virgile Bramly, Clotilde Courau', null, 'Esther is at the end of her career as Head Seamstress at Dior Avenue Montaigne workshop. One day, she gets her handbag stolen in the metro by a 20 years old girl, Jade. Instead of calling the police she decides to take care of Jade. She sees in her the opportunity to pass on her skills, the craft of dressmaking, her only wealth. In the frenetic world of Haute Couture, Esther will give Jade la beauté du geste, a way to reach beyond herself.', 'Esther is at the end of her career as Head Seamstress at Dior Avenue Montaigne workshop. One day, she gets her handbag stolen in the metro by a 20 years old girl, Jade. Instead of calling the police she decides to take care of Jade. She sees in her the opportunity to pass on her skills, the craft of dressmaking, her only wealth. In the frenetic world of Haute Couture, Esther will give Jade la beauté du geste, a way to reach beyond herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srN0iA97EfjZReGlGyDNcDh8ZPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719463'),
