  ('17979268101649992', 'Havenhurst', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Andrew C. Erin, Thomas Hencz, Allan Aguilar', 'Daniel Farrands, Andrew C. Erin', 'Julie Benz, Fionnula Flanagan, Belle Shouse, Josh Stamberg, Danielle Harris, Dendrie Taylor, Toby Huss, Matt Lasky', null, 'A troubled young woman takes up residence in a gothic apartment building where she must confront a terrifying evil.', 'A troubled young woman takes up residence in a gothic apartment building where she must confront a terrifying evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q9IqznNP8fgwvdWXwvNhNP5qK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403368'),
  ('991363292938757600', 'Having Wonderful Time', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alfred Santell, James H. Anderson, Perry Ferguson', 'Arthur Kober', 'Ginger Rogers, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Peggy Conklin, Lucille Ball, Lee Bowman, Eve Arden, Dorothea Kent, Red Skelton', null, 'Teddy Shaw, a bored New York office girl, goes to a camp in the Catskill Mountains for rest and finds Chick Kirkland.', 'Teddy Shaw, a bored New York office girl, goes to a camp in the Catskill Mountains for rest and finds Chick Kirkland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qayg3s2RdL8hvfrIqDSdJhwYSV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46617'),
  ('1043602788830352119', 'Havoc', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Barbara Kopple, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Stephen Gaghan', 'Anne Hathaway, Bijou Phillips, Shiri Appleby, Michael Biehn, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Matt O''Leary, Freddy Rodríguez, Laura San Giacomo', 'R', 'A wealthy Los Angeles teen and her superficial friends wants to break out of suburbia and experience Southern California''s "gangsta" lifestyle. But problems arise when the preppies get in over their heads and provoke the wrath of a violent Latino gang. Suddenly, their role-playing seems a little too real.', 'A wealthy Los Angeles teen and her superficial friends wants to break out of suburbia and experience Southern California''s "gangsta" lifestyle. But problems arise when the preppies get in over their heads and provoke the wrath of a violent Latino gang. Suddenly, their role-playing seems a little too real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY4c4bHPCRrwIvkxJ6qRLoyxQVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14695'),
  ('630702522039458129', 'Havoc', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Liam Lock, James McGeown, Sam Stokes', 'Gareth Evans', 'Tom Hardy, Jessie Mei Li, Timothy Olyphant, Forest Whitaker, Justin Cornwell, Quelin Sepulveda, Luis Guzmán, Sunny Pang', 'R', 'When a drug heist swerves lethally out of control, a jaded cop fights his way through a corrupt city''s criminal underworld to save a politician''s son.', 'When a drug heist swerves lethally out of control, a jaded cop fights his way through a corrupt city''s criminal underworld to save a politician''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubP2OsF3GlfqYPvXyLw9d78djGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668489'),
  ('293120016652076249', 'Hawa', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Maïmouna Doucouré, Antoine Sanier, Tom Cucuel', 'Maïmouna Doucouré', 'Sania Halifa, Oumou Sangaré, Titouan Gerbier, Yseult, Thomas Pesquet, Anitha Rangadamalou, Jérôme Pouly, Lola Zidi', null, 'A teenage girl lives with her grandmother and worries she will be removed by social services. She sets off to get adopted by someone she admires more than anything, one of the most powerful women in the world.', 'A teenage girl lives with her grandmother and worries she will be removed by social services. She sets off to get adopted by someone she admires more than anything, one of the most powerful women in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwtd4TPJXi26cnEgKf3pczx4kXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961707'),
  ('430512511423916681', 'Hawaa Hawaai', 2014, 'Drama, Family', 'Amole Gupte', 'Amole Gupte', 'Makrand Deshpande, Partho A. Gupte, Neha Joshi, Saqib Saleem, Srishti Sharma, Mahesh Balraj, Rekha Kamat, Anuj Sachdeva', 'G', 'Hawaa Hawaai is a story of the triumph of the human spirit; friendship and enjoying the journey of making ones dream come true. Arjun moves to the big city along with his mother and little sister. Out there he discovers a hidden world of in-line skating through coach Lucky, who mentors kids to become skating champions. While Arjun starts nursing the dream to learn skating under Lucky, his four friends get together to make this dream come true for him. In this endearing story of hope and aspirations, will Arjun''s dreams take flight?', 'Hawaa Hawaai is a story of the triumph of the human spirit; friendship and enjoying the journey of making ones dream come true. Arjun moves to the big city along with his mother and little sister. Out there he discovers a hidden world of in-line skating through coach Lucky, who mentors kids to become skating champions. While Arjun starts nursing the dream to learn skating under Lucky, his four friends get together to make this dream come true for him. In this endearing story of hope and aspirations, will Arjun''s dreams take flight?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqLf2SlhM02EEzY9ZjYMXxumJdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268860'),
  ('16223733136695052', 'Hawaii', 1966, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance, History', 'George Roy Hill, Russell Harlan, Ray Gosnell Jr.', 'Dalton Trumbo, Daniel Taradash', 'Julie Andrews, Max von Sydow, Richard Harris, Gene Hackman, Carroll O''Connor, Jocelyne LaGarde, Manu Tupou, Ted Nobriga', null, 'Abner Hale, a rigid and humorless New England missionary, marries the beautiful Jerusha Bromley and takes her to the exotic island kingdom of Hawaii, intent on converting the natives. But the clash between the two cultures is too great and instead of understanding there comes tragedy.', 'Abner Hale, a rigid and humorless New England missionary, marries the beautiful Jerusha Bromley and takes her to the exotic island kingdom of Hawaii, intent on converting the natives. But the clash between the two cultures is too great and instead of understanding there comes tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRqw7ajYhz7Kn4p0y559K6jR9Zi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14689'),
  ('149917250502357195', 'Hawaii', 2013, 'Romance', 'Marco Berger, Tomás Pérez Silva', 'Marco Berger', 'Manuel Vignau, Mateo Chiarino, Luz Palazón, Manuel Martínez Sobrado, Antonia De Michelis', null, 'Eugenio offers his childhood friend Martin work for the summer. With a game of power and desire a relationship starts to grow that goes beyond their friendship.', 'Eugenio offers his childhood friend Martin work for the summer. With a game of power and desire a relationship starts to grow that goes beyond their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpVWAVR8RKvPsr57sB8hx1U4fRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199851'),
  ('82489092309120401', 'Hawaii', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Myriam Vinocour, Okinawa Valérie Guerard, Frédéric Drouilhat', 'Mélissa Drigeard, Vincent Juillet', 'Manu Payet, Pierre Deladonchamps, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Élodie Bouchez, Émilie Caen, Bérénice Bejo, William Lebghil, Eye Haïdara', null, 'Nine friends gather every year in their friend Thomas’ hotel in Hawaii. Following a nuclear attack alert, they believe that their last moments are upon them. Years of hidden truths, resentment and bitterness starts to resurface and their friendly annual meeting soon turns into an aggressive score-setting shouting match.', 'Nine friends gather every year in their friend Thomas’ hotel in Hawaii. Following a nuclear attack alert, they believe that their last moments are upon them. Years of hidden truths, resentment and bitterness starts to resurface and their friendly annual meeting soon turns into an aggressive score-setting shouting match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvfyVL0SNSfMtfl56vuGGgTAzFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892505'),
  ('698186333251488726', 'Hawaii, Oslo', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erik Poppe, Ulf Brantås', 'Harald Rosenløw-Eeg', 'Trond Espen Seim, Jan Gunnar Røise, Evy Kasseth Røsten, Stig Henrik Hoff, Silje Torp, Petronella Barker, Robert Skjærstad, Benjamin Lønne Røsler', null, 'Hawaii, Oslo is the story of a handful of people who cross each other''s path without necessarily knowing each other, during the hottest day of the year, in Oslo. We follow Frode and Milla. They are having their first child, who they are told will not live long. We follow Bobbie-Pop, a faded singer who tries to commit suicide. We follow Leon, an institutionalized kleptomaniac who is loking for Åsa, to whom he has a ten year old deal to get married. We meet Leon''s brother, Trygve, who fetches Leon at the institution to celebrate his birthday, but who himself has plans to use his leave from prison to run away. And most of all we meet the angel Vidar, Leon''s best buddy at the institution, who sees things no one else can see, and who may be able to save everyone - except himself?', 'Hawaii, Oslo is the story of a handful of people who cross each other''s path without necessarily knowing each other, during the hottest day of the year, in Oslo. We follow Frode and Milla. They are having their first child, who they are told will not live long. We follow Bobbie-Pop, a faded singer who tries to commit suicide. We follow Leon, an institutionalized kleptomaniac who is loking for Åsa, to whom he has a ten year old deal to get married. We meet Leon''s brother, Trygve, who fetches Leon at the institution to celebrate his birthday, but who himself has plans to use his leave from prison to run away. And most of all we meet the angel Vidar, Leon''s best buddy at the institution, who sees things no one else can see, and who may be able to save everyone - except himself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxuaNcC4HNTFelky5yaDrhlLIKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14812'),
  ('287200319713348528', 'Hawaiian Aye Aye', 1964, 'Animation', 'Gerry Chiniquy', null, 'June Foray, Mel Blanc', null, 'Tweety Bird is on vacation with his mistress, Granny, in Hawaii, where Sylvester Cat is scrounging for food on a beach...', 'Tweety Bird is on vacation with his mistress, Granny, in Hawaii, where Sylvester Cat is scrounging for food on a beach...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zktyfZOZK2ut7bk9AV170b5Tgfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234416'),
  ('12104660346187155', 'Hawaiian Holiday', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', 'Vernon Stallings', 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Clarence Nash', 'G', 'Mickey, Donald, Goofy, and Pluto experience all that Hawaii has to offer. Donald tries hula dancing, Pluto explores the beach and Goofy takes up surfing!', 'Mickey, Donald, Goofy, and Pluto experience all that Hawaii has to offer. Donald tries hula dancing, Pluto explores the beach and Goofy takes up surfing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et1rPqSp6fBn4qSeREX7I7n3bMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66872'),
  ('730588734704693010', 'Hawaiian Vacation', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Gary Rydstrom', 'Jason Katz, Gary Rydstrom, Erik Benson', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack, Don Rickles, Estelle Harris, Wallace Shawn, John Ratzenberger, Blake Clark', 'G', 'The toys throw Ken and Barbie a Hawaiian vacation in Bonnie''s room.', 'The toys throw Ken and Barbie a Hawaiian vacation in Bonnie''s room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BQHDbU0JgiNS1QkMknKHhvNjcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77887'),
  ('241217280852619467', 'Hawaizaada', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy, History', 'Vibhu Puri, Savita Singh', 'Vibhu Puri', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Mithun Chakraborty, Jeffrey Goldberg, Pallavi Sharda, Naman Jain, Gaurav Dwivedi, Jayant Kripalani', 'PG', 'In 1895, Shivkar Bapuji Talpade constructs and flies India''s first unmanned plane, despite having the odds stacked against him.', 'In 1895, Shivkar Bapuji Talpade constructs and flies India''s first unmanned plane, despite having the odds stacked against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfva9KEVTRvYQpq7mdlTmM9KVLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318106'),
  ('466488441692333677', 'Hawk the Slayer', 1980, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Terry Marcel, Paul Beeson', 'Terry Marcel, Harry Robertson', 'Jack Palance, John Terry, Bernard Bresslaw, Ray Charleson, Peter O''Farrell, William Morgan Sheppard, Patricia Quinn, Cheryl Campbell', 'PG', 'Hawk the Slayer, after seeing both his father and bride die at the hands of his malevolent brother, Voltan, sets out for revenge and the chance to live up to his title. Tooling himself up with the "mind-sword" and recruiting a motley band of warriors — a giant, a dwarf, a one-armed man with a machine-crossbow, and an elf with the fastest bow in the land — Hawk leads the battle against Voltan to free the land from the forces of evil and avenge his loved ones.', 'Hawk the Slayer, after seeing both his father and bride die at the hands of his malevolent brother, Voltan, sets out for revenge and the chance to live up to his title. Tooling himself up with the "mind-sword" and recruiting a motley band of warriors — a giant, a dwarf, a one-armed man with a machine-crossbow, and an elf with the fastest bow in the land — Hawk leads the battle against Voltan to free the land from the forces of evil and avenge his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOuvXCzJoyR8eJnmArF5CtbLkN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25628'),
  ('737536630653322346', 'Hawken''s Breed', 1987, 'Adventure, Western, Drama', 'Charles B. Pierce', 'Charles B. Pierce', 'Peter Fonda, Jack Elam, Serene Hedin, Chuck Pierce Jr., Sue Ane Langdon, Dennis Fimple, Royce Clark, Bill Thurman', 'R', 'Hawken is a rugged drifter and loner who meets and comes to rescue a young Shawnee woman, named Spirit in 1840s Tennessee, whom he leaves after saving her from a rouge group of Shawnee Indians. After taking up residence with an old fur trapper and old friend named Jeb Kline, Hawken later meets Spirit again whom runs away from a local fur trader named Tackett, whom she is sold to. Soon, Hawken is up against Tackett and a posse of hired killers, as well as a greedy and racist land owner, named Hickman, who''s long abused son Noel whom narrates the entire story, comes to his and Spirit''s aid to help them survive.', 'Hawken is a rugged drifter and loner who meets and comes to rescue a young Shawnee woman, named Spirit in 1840s Tennessee, whom he leaves after saving her from a rouge group of Shawnee Indians. After taking up residence with an old fur trapper and old friend named Jeb Kline, Hawken later meets Spirit again whom runs away from a local fur trader named Tackett, whom she is sold to. Soon, Hawken is up against Tackett and a posse of hired killers, as well as a greedy and racist land owner, named Hickman, who''s long abused son Noel whom narrates the entire story, comes to his and Spirit''s aid to help them survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSYUmRidn0AT7I2oxRTayjwUC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90537'),
  ('580530161517332403', 'Hawking', 2004, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Philip Martin, Julian Court', 'Peter Moffat', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Peter Firth, Tom Ward, Lisa Dillon, John Sessions, Phoebe Nicholls, Michael Brandon, Tom Hodgkins', null, 'The story of Professor Stephen Hawking''s early years. It is 1963, and our young cosmologist celebrates his 21st birthday. At the party is a new friend, Jane Wilde - there is a strong attraction between the two. Jane is intrigued by Stephen''s talk of stars and the Universe. But she realises that there is something very wrong when Stephen suddenly finds that he is unable to stand up.', 'The story of Professor Stephen Hawking''s early years. It is 1963, and our young cosmologist celebrates his 21st birthday. At the party is a new friend, Jane Wilde - there is a strong attraction between the two. Jane is intrigued by Stephen''s talk of stars and the Universe. But she realises that there is something very wrong when Stephen suddenly finds that he is unable to stand up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqQZ050fNDnKzRWTo6Q0iLdDLMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34843'),
  ('1026625679106550137', 'Hawking', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Stephen Finnigan', 'Ben Bowie, Stephen Hawking, Stephen Finnigan', 'Stephen Hawking', 'R', 'The extraordinary story of the planet’s most famous contemporary scientist, told in his own words and by those closest to him. Made with unique access to Hawking’s private life, this is an intimate and moving journey into Stephen''s world, both past and present.', 'The extraordinary story of the planet’s most famous contemporary scientist, told in his own words and by those closest to him. Made with unique access to Hawking’s private life, this is an intimate and moving journey into Stephen''s world, both past and present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69CEPlNASk6YgcWmsO6sRHda6qN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176238'),
  ('665767770866221267', 'Hawks', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Robert Ellis Miller, Douglas Milsome', 'Roy Clarke', 'Timothy Dalton, Anthony Edwards, Janet McTeer, Camille Coduri, Julie T. Wallace, Connie Booth, Sheila Hancock, Robert Lang', 'R', 'Two terminally ill patients in a hospital yearn for relief from their predicament. With little or no friends, they form an uneasy alliance and plot an escape for one last wild time.', 'Two terminally ill patients in a hospital yearn for relief from their predicament. With little or no friends, they form an uneasy alliance and plot an escape for one last wild time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nSwYUFp1qEIULwtx2K8jg8DtnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115616'),
  ('838486034444112194', 'Häxan', 1922, 'Documentary, Horror, History', 'Benjamin Christensen, Johan Ankerstjerne', 'Benjamin Christensen', 'Benjamin Christensen, Ella La Cour, Emmy Schønfeld, Kate Fabian, Oscar Stribolt, Wilhelmine Henriksen, Elisabeth Christensen, Astrid Holm', null, 'Grave robbing, torture, possessed nuns, and a satanic Sabbath: Benjamin Christensen''s legendary film uses a series of dramatic vignettes to explore the scientific hypothesis that the witches of the Middle Ages suffered the same hysteria as turn-of-the-century psychiatric patients. But the film itself is far from serious-- instead it''s a witches'' brew of the scary, gross, and darkly humorous.', 'Grave robbing, torture, possessed nuns, and a satanic Sabbath: Benjamin Christensen''s legendary film uses a series of dramatic vignettes to explore the scientific hypothesis that the witches of the Middle Ages suffered the same hysteria as turn-of-the-century psychiatric patients. But the film itself is far from serious-- instead it''s a witches'' brew of the scary, gross, and darkly humorous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LtaPLlwlA5HX2FjqAb8lsaBI8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57283'),
  ('348118231196780834', 'Hay Fever', 2010, 'Romance', 'Laura Luchetti', 'Laura Luchetti', 'Andrea Bosca, Diane Fleri, Giulia Michelini, Giuseppe Gandini, Cecilia Cinardi, Camilla Filippi, Pietro Ragusa, Mauro Ursella', null, 'A group of Roman misfits spend the fall minding a vintage shop called Twinkled, a business that is failing in every way but in spirit. The owner strives to keep the store afloat, even as his wife insists that he sell the place and get a real job. One day a beautiful young woman named Camilla takes a job cleaning the store, and her presence has a profound effect on the lives of everyone, including Stefano, the well-meaning but unorganized shopkeeper, and Gigio, Camilla''s loving younger brother who has Down''s syndrome.', 'A group of Roman misfits spend the fall minding a vintage shop called Twinkled, a business that is failing in every way but in spirit. The owner strives to keep the store afloat, even as his wife insists that he sell the place and get a real job. One day a beautiful young woman named Camilla takes a job cleaning the store, and her presence has a profound effect on the lives of everyone, including Stefano, the well-meaning but unorganized shopkeeper, and Gigio, Camilla''s loving younger brother who has Down''s syndrome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cFaofO3L0Qgzx3MSIx5MiXnNso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65325'),
  ('132430389429631704', 'Hay que educar a Niní', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Luis César Amadori, Alberto Etchebehere', 'Tito Davison, René Garzón, Luis César Amadori', 'Niní Marshall, Francisco Álvarez, Pablo Palitos, Nury Montsé, Héctor Calcaño, Cirilo Etulain, Carlos Lagrotta, Elvira Quiroga', null, 'A young woman pretends to be the daughter of a financier and enters a rich girls'' college, where she commits a thousand mischiefs.', 'A young woman pretends to be the daughter of a financier and enters a rich girls'' college, where she commits a thousand mischiefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p939KcHaVdSQU1XxVz5KHeGilDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335368'),
  ('565631217246726191', 'Hay que educar a papá', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater, José Luis Pérez Tristán, Manuel Rojas', 'Vicente Coello, Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Julia Caba Alba, Máximo Valverde, Marta Baizán, María Isbert, Rafael López Somoza, Rafaela Aparicio, Emilio Laguna', null, 'A young woman who wants to marry an earl''s son wants to refine the habits of their parents, people from a village that has been enriched in the overnight by selling their land.', 'A young woman who wants to marry an earl''s son wants to refine the habits of their parents, people from a village that has been enriched in the overnight by selling their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WWUDkgRzjyFNt72wtAcqXTYU8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86042'),
  ('536439482873392800', 'Hay que romper la rutina', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Víctor Hugo Caula, Enrique Cahen Salaberry', 'Jorge Basurto', 'Alberto Olmedo, Jorge Porcel, Gogó Rojo, Ethel Rojo, Elizabeth Killian, Javier Portales, Tristán, Tito Climent', null, 'Friends Alberto and Jorge, who work together and live in the same building, are married to two sisters (Ethel and Gogó). Noticing that their sex life becomes boring, they cheat on them with co-workers. This is discovered and they are fired. Then, they get employed in a beauty institute, where they have many women at their disposal. Their wives learn of this mischief, and go to look for them at the institute, generating hilarious situations.', 'Friends Alberto and Jorge, who work together and live in the same building, are married to two sisters (Ethel and Gogó). Noticing that their sex life becomes boring, they cheat on them with co-workers. This is discovered and they are fired. Then, they get employed in a beauty institute, where they have many women at their disposal. Their wives learn of this mischief, and go to look for them at the institute, generating hilarious situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ai3fMmUF3ysxmvHwGINr2wgeP6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316073'),
  ('27411753123709839', 'Hayalet Dayı', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ali Yorgancıoğlu, Hayk Kirakosyan', 'Serkan Altuniğne', 'Settar Tanrıöğen, Ozan Özcan, Caner Özyurtlu, Ülkü Duru, Esra Dermancıoğlu, Tuğçe Karabacak, Nedim Saban, Serhan Arslan', null, 'Ozan and Caner, searching for a place to call home, finally find the perfect house after a long and arduous search. The house they find at an extraordinary price turns out to be truly extraordinary, and amusing events follow them everywhere. Unfortunately, the deceased owner of the old mansion they rented is stuck in limbo, and only Caner and Ozan can see him. Helping this old soul cross over peacefully is now the task of these two young men. The mission they embark on to find peace in the house drags them into a series of events that are as comical as they are emotional.', 'Ozan and Caner, searching for a place to call home, finally find the perfect house after a long and arduous search. The house they find at an extraordinary price turns out to be truly extraordinary, and amusing events follow them everywhere. Unfortunately, the deceased owner of the old mansion they rented is stuck in limbo, and only Caner and Ozan can see him. Helping this old soul cross over peacefully is now the task of these two young men. The mission they embark on to find peace in the house drags them into a series of events that are as comical as they are emotional.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQZqKrFwmsGQ4KLo6QRX5paoWgG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364394'),
  ('27752590258592301', 'Hayao Miyazaki and the Heron', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Kaku Arakawa, Kaku Arakawa, Taro Tokuhisa', null, 'Hayao Miyazaki, Toshio Suzuki, Isao Takahata, Takeshi Honda, Masaki Suda, Kenshi Yonezu, Takuya Kimura, Joe Hisaishi', 'PG-13', 'A documentary that chronicles the making of The Boy and the Heron, filmed with exclusive access to Studio Ghibli across an astonishing seven years.', 'A documentary that chronicles the making of The Boy and the Heron, filmed with exclusive access to Studio Ghibli across an astonishing seven years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Bw7jGthm637GqlRq5rT04GJrKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1292585'),
  ('995670710250695473', 'Haywire', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Gregory Jacobs', 'Lem Dobbs', 'Gina Carano, Michael Fassbender, Channing Tatum, Michael Douglas, Antonio Banderas, Ewan McGregor, Bill Paxton, Michael Angarano', null, 'A black ops soldier seeks payback after she is betrayed and left for dead.', 'A black ops soldier seeks payback after she is betrayed and left for dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9fJ0dYC30NnE9k2p61c0dqlZqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70435'),
  ('386859554731419643', 'Hazaaron Khwaishein Aisi', 2003, 'Drama', 'Ravi K. Chandran, Sudhir Mishra', 'Sudhir Mishra, Ruchi Narain, Shivkumar Subramaniam', 'Kay Kay Menon, Chitrangada Singh, Shiney Ahuja, Saurabh Shukla, Ram Kapoor, Yashpal Sharma, Arif Zakaria, Gajraj Rao', null, 'Set against the backdrop of the Indian Emergency, the movie tells the story of three youngsters in the 70s, when India was undergoing massive social and political changes.', 'Set against the backdrop of the Indian Emergency, the movie tells the story of three youngsters in the 70s, when India was undergoing massive social and political changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13psYxACQGcK0i1nzGkW6Jyx0ts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21557'),
  ('758222777686767555', 'Hazard', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sion Sono, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Kazuyoshi Kumakiri, Sion Sono', 'Joe Odagiri, Jai West, Motoki Fukami, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Rin Kurana, Kenjirou Ishimaru, Garth Burton, Rachel Germaine', null, 'Shin is a Japanese university student living a boring and meaningless life. One day, he spots a book titled Dangerous Ways to Walk the World, in which he finds a page written about hazards in New-York. Eager to get out, he jets off to New-York to find this inspiration.', 'Shin is a Japanese university student living a boring and meaningless life. One day, he spots a book titled Dangerous Ways to Walk the World, in which he finds a page written about hazards in New-York. Eager to get out, he jets off to New-York to find this inspiration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37UiCE8LyyRLlg9p50LL2QvBmzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70193'),
  ('14167653524492791', 'Hazard', 2022, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jonas Govaerts, Dries Delputte', 'Trent Haaga', 'Dimitri ''Vegas'' Thivaios, Jeroen Perceval, Jennifer Heylen, Mila Rooms, Frank Lammers, Monic Hendrickx, Tom Vermeir, Emilie De Roo', null, 'Noah loves his girlfriend Lea and their daughter Zita dearly, just about as much as his extremely pimped car with vanity plate “H4Z4RD”. When his cousin offers him a seemingly simple job as a driver, it soon turns into an unlikely and nerve-racking race through Antwerp, which can only result in the end of Noah, his family or the car…', 'Noah loves his girlfriend Lea and their daughter Zita dearly, just about as much as his extremely pimped car with vanity plate “H4Z4RD”. When his cousin offers him a seemingly simple job as a driver, it soon turns into an unlikely and nerve-racking race through Antwerp, which can only result in the end of Noah, his family or the car…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYghLn75Igcp4nUikdklooZyZpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869855'),
  ('816986523688529968', 'Haze', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Kaori Fujii, Takahiro Murase, Takahiro Kandaka, Masato Tsujioka, Mao Saito', 'R', 'A man awakes to find himself trapped in a dirty, confined crawlspace. He barely has enough room to move. He also has no memory of why he''s there, or why he''s bleeding from a stomach wound. Apparently drugged, he occasionally ''zones out'' of his surroundings as he tries to edge towards his way to freedom. But the more he explores, the more pain he has to endure, and the more frightening his predicament becomes.', 'A man awakes to find himself trapped in a dirty, confined crawlspace. He barely has enough room to move. He also has no memory of why he''s there, or why he''s bleeding from a stomach wound. Apparently drugged, he occasionally ''zones out'' of his surroundings as he tries to edge towards his way to freedom. But the more he explores, the more pain he has to endure, and the more frightening his predicament becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIqlsqwfcrAxGiVaZGK3ofI18fR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26040'),
  ('721157198935851299', 'Hazel''s Heart', 2025, 'Drama', 'Daniel Bielinski', 'Daniel Bielinski', 'Madelyn Dundon, Stelio Savante, Timothy E. Goodwin, Xavier Bielinski, Genevieve Bielinski, Lydia Pearl Pentz, Laurie Fortier, Todd Terry', 'NR', 'In March of 1920, just outside of Center, North Dakota, Hazel Miner and her two siblings – Emmet and Myrdith – are getting ready to leave school. The students have been sent home early as the weather has started to turn from a gentle snowfall to what looks like it could be a terrible snowstorm. The siblings struggle through the wind and snow, and their sled overturns into a coulee and the three take shelter to try and survive the night. As they fight to stay warm and awake, their parents and friends work furiously to try and find them before it’s too late.', 'In March of 1920, just outside of Center, North Dakota, Hazel Miner and her two siblings – Emmet and Myrdith – are getting ready to leave school. The students have been sent home early as the weather has started to turn from a gentle snowfall to what looks like it could be a terrible snowstorm. The siblings struggle through the wind and snow, and their sled overturns into a coulee and the three take shelter to try and survive the night. As they fight to stay warm and awake, their parents and friends work furiously to try and find them before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwQA3cTSbDq7i3zL09d5vGLS7x6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1552473'),
  ('184032707933578264', 'Hazing', 2015, 'Drama', 'Pablo Aragüés, Álex Sierra', 'Pablo Aragüés', 'Nicolás Coronado, Lucía Ramos, Alejandra Onieva, Emma Suárez, Javier Butler, Jorge Usón, Marta Larralde', null, 'The story of Alex, a fresher who rejects hazing, and Carla, a fresher who doesn''t care too much about it. Between them, two opposite ways of face hazing, will grow a loving relationship, who help them to overcome the problems.', 'The story of Alex, a fresher who rejects hazing, and Carla, a fresher who doesn''t care too much about it. Between them, two opposite ways of face hazing, will grow a loving relationship, who help them to overcome the problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peY5G0IRPF6X3UjnR8mh68c2oCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362617'),
  ('1125142431559314934', 'HBD Prathik Jain Tumkur March 19', 2026, 'Biography', null, null, 'Prathik Jain, Vimal Kumar', null, 'Dr. Prathik Jain from Tumkur is celebrated on his birthday, March 19, in a special tribute capturing moments of appreciation, celebration, and recognition. The film highlights the journey, achievements, and influence of Prathik Jain as an entrepreneur and public personality, while friends, supporters, and well-wishers come together to mark the occasion with joy, gratitude, and memorable moments in Tumkur and beyond.', 'Dr. Prathik Jain from Tumkur is celebrated on his birthday, March 19, in a special tribute capturing moments of appreciation, celebration, and recognition. The film highlights the journey, achievements, and influence of Prathik Jain as an entrepreneur and public personality, while friends, supporters, and well-wishers come together to mark the occasion with joy, gratitude, and memorable moments in Tumkur and beyond.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZDZhMTQ3YmMtZjRhNi00MzJhLThiYWQtNzE0ZjdlODFiOWQ4XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:hbd-prathik-jain-tumkur-march-19'),
  ('48771104556648128', 'He Ain''t Heavy, He''s My Father', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Lee Chi-Ngai, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Lee Chi-Ngai', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Carina Lau, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Lawrence Cheng Tan-Shui, Helen Young, Anita Lee Yuen-Wah, Chor Yuen', null, 'Yuen scorns his father, who he thinks is too generous and forgiving. Through a flashback/time travel gimmick, Yuen meets his parents during their joyous courtship. Yuen comes to understand and admire his dad, and reflect on his own moral defects.', 'Yuen scorns his father, who he thinks is too generous and forgiving. Through a flashback/time travel gimmick, Yuen meets his parents during their joyous courtship. Yuen comes to understand and admire his dad, and reflect on his own moral defects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBjF6GY68dz3ZhaaNdYYNfsDkQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118376'),
  ('231137861237221064', 'He Died with a Felafel in His Hand', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Richard Lowenstein, Angella McPherson, Andrew de Groot', 'Richard Lowenstein', 'Noah Taylor, Emily Hamilton, Romane Bohringer, Alex Menglet, Brett Stewart, Damian Walshe-Howling, Sophie Lee, Francis McMahon', null, 'A search for love, meaning and bathroom solitude. Danny goes through a series of shared housing experiences in a succession of cities on the east coast of Australia. Together these vignettes form a narrative that is surprisingly reflective.', 'A search for love, meaning and bathroom solitude. Danny goes through a series of shared housing experiences in a succession of cities on the east coast of Australia. Together these vignettes form a narrative that is surprisingly reflective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceB5SP5dmoeaQUq2RM1uANAwu0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13777'),
  ('973761760318882881', 'He Died with His Eyes Open', 1985, 'Crime', 'Jacques Deray, Jean Penzer', 'Jacques Deray, Michel Audiard', 'Michel Serrault, Charlotte Rampling, Xavier Deluc, Gérard Darmon, Elisabeth Depardieu, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Jean-Paul Roussillon', null, 'Police Inspector Staniland is investigating the death of a pianist. While conducting his investigation and looking through the victim''s apartment, he meets Barbara, the mistress of the murder victim. Barbara confesses to the crime, but Staniland, based on his observations and experience, does not believe her. He then sets out to find the truth.', 'Police Inspector Staniland is investigating the death of a pianist. While conducting his investigation and looking through the victim''s apartment, he meets Barbara, the mistress of the murder victim. Barbara confesses to the crime, but Staniland, based on his observations and experience, does not believe her. He then sets out to find the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHOTJVE2zEq7UCVQv6xCy8FptKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78538'),
  ('1083104628979744185', 'He Even Has Your Eyes', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Colin Wandersman, Valérie Aragües, Lucien Jean-Baptiste', 'Marie-Françoise Colombani, Sébastien Mounier', 'Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Aïssa Maïga, Zabou Breitman, Vincent Elbaz, Michel Jonasz, Marie-Philomène Nga, Bass Dhem, Delphine Théodore', null, 'Paul is married to Sali. Everything would be fine if they could get a child. Until the day when Sali receives the call that they have been waiting for so long: their adoption file is approved. He is adorable, he is 6 months old, his name is Benjamin. He is blond with blue eyes and white. They - are black.', 'Paul is married to Sali. Everything would be fine if they could get a child. Until the day when Sali receives the call that they have been waiting for so long: their adoption file is approved. He is adorable, he is 6 months old, his name is Benjamin. He is blond with blue eyes and white. They - are black.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coPbhwY0mThnZRen933LOBxapoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398920'),
  ('1138177808030671775', 'He Got Game', 1998, 'Drama', 'Spike Lee, Ellen Kuras, Malik Hassan Sayeed', 'Spike Lee', 'Denzel Washington, Ray Allen, Rosario Dawson, Milla Jovovich, Hill Harper, Ned Beatty, Jim Brown, Joseph Lyle Taylor', 'R', 'A basketball player''s father must try to convince him to go to a college so he can get a shorter prison sentence.', 'A basketball player''s father must try to convince him to go to a college so he can get a shorter prison sentence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kd8hRaysUQOz7AvSorZDJHuihcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9469'),
  ('1068596069806896382', 'He Killed My Sister', 2026, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Shannon Washington', 'Shannon Washington', 'Leilani Barnett, Christopher Slap Davis, Armando Martinez Jr.', null, 'Malorie''s sister Monica vanishes suddenly. Determined to learn the truth, Malorie investigates with her friend using clues Monica left behind. She becomes convinced Monica''s husband, a presidential candidate, caused her sister''s demise.', 'Malorie''s sister Monica vanishes suddenly. Determined to learn the truth, Malorie investigates with her friend using clues Monica left behind. She becomes convinced Monica''s husband, a presidential candidate, caused her sister''s demise.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6SxRshS69PeqwmS9XrH5lW1znmL.jpg', 'plex:movie:he-killed-my-sister'),
  ('529929674836409398', 'He Knows You''re Alone', 1980, 'Horror', 'Armand Mastroianni, Gerald Feil', 'Scotty Parker', 'Don Scardino, Caitlin O''Heaney, Elizabeth Kemp, Tom Rolfing, Lewis Arlt, Patsy Pease, James Rebhorn, Tom Hanks', 'R', 'A reluctant bride-to-be is stalked by a serial killer who only kills brides and the people around them. While her friends get whacked one by one, a hard-boiled renegade cop whose bride had been killed years before tries to hunt the killer down before it is too late.', 'A reluctant bride-to-be is stalked by a serial killer who only kills brides and the people around them. While her friends get whacked one by one, a hard-boiled renegade cop whose bride had been killed years before tries to hunt the killer down before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90rdztFCRAxQsEfy35cxH9qt3N1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65262'),
