  ('490637623314326422', 'He Loves Me… He Loves Me Not', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Pierre Aïm, Laetitia Colombani', 'Caroline Thivel, Laetitia Colombani', 'Audrey Tautou, Isabelle Carré, Samuel Le Bihan, Clément Sibony, Sophie Guillemin, Éric Savin, Élodie Navarre, Vania Vilers', null, 'A talented art student named Angélique is passionately in love with Dr. Loïc Le Garrec, a handsome married man whom she believes will leave his wife. When he eventually decides to stay in his marriage, it causes Angélique to spiral. However, as the story shifts from Angélique''s perspective to Loïc''s, the surprising truth about their relationship is revealed.', 'A talented art student named Angélique is passionately in love with Dr. Loïc Le Garrec, a handsome married man whom she believes will leave his wife. When he eventually decides to stay in his marriage, it causes Angélique to spiral. However, as the story shifts from Angélique''s perspective to Loïc''s, the surprising truth about their relationship is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dW5txTgCQADtHSyl2iRIc05iANX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12112'),
  ('529246959554793475', 'He Named Me Malala', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Davis Guggenheim', null, 'Malala Yousafzai, Ziauddin Yousafzai, Toor Pekai Yousafzai, Khushal Yousafzai, Atal Yousafzai, Mobin Khan', null, 'A look at the events leading up to the Taliban''s attack on the young Pakistani school girl, Malala Yousafzai, for speaking out on girls'' education and the aftermath, including her speech to the United Nations.', 'A look at the events leading up to the Taliban''s attack on the young Pakistani school girl, Malala Yousafzai, for speaking out on girls'' education and the aftermath, including her speech to the United Nations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOYrqRKhOrPd5RvWoyTw71KVI6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338928'),
