  ('212306014759882218', 'He Said, She Said', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marisa Silver, Ken Kwapis, Stephen H. Burum', 'Brian Hohlfeld', 'Kevin Bacon, Elizabeth Perkins, Nathan Lane, Anthony LaPaglia, Sharon Stone, Stanley Anderson, Charlayne Woodard, Danton Stone', 'PG-13', 'Womanising, right-wing Dan Hanson and quiet, liberal Lorie Bryer work for the Baltimore Sun. Rivals for the job of new writer of a vacant column, the paper ends up instead printing their very different opinions alongside each other, which leads to a similarly combative local TV show. At the same time their initial indifference to each other looks like it may evolve into something more romantic.', 'Womanising, right-wing Dan Hanson and quiet, liberal Lorie Bryer work for the Baltimore Sun. Rivals for the job of new writer of a vacant column, the paper ends up instead printing their very different opinions alongside each other, which leads to a similarly combative local TV show. At the same time their initial indifference to each other looks like it may evolve into something more romantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uYv11zTTa83WMWwI3B6EOZtI0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17956'),
  ('921859360201169165', 'He Thief, She Thief', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Zampa, Paolo Bianchini, Leonida Barboni', 'Alberto Sordi', 'Alberto Sordi, Sylva Koscina, Ettore Manni, Mario Riva, Marisa Merlini, Alberto Bonucci, Mario Carotenuto, Nando Bruno', null, 'Cencio, a roman pilferer, periodically is in prison. He meets Cesira that soon become his partner in crime. With Cesira''s help Cencio try the big hit to a jewelery. But the lucky break is over.', 'Cencio, a roman pilferer, periodically is in prison. He meets Cesira that soon become his partner in crime. With Cesira''s help Cencio try the big hit to a jewelery. But the lucky break is over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZlcBKs91jXoMK2U0CTj3lhQGVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68805'),
  ('619873784318736535', 'He Took His Skin Off for Me', 2014, 'Horror, Drama, Romance', 'Yiannis Manolopoulos, Ben Aston', 'Ben Aston, Maria Hummer', 'Anna Maguire, Sebastian Armesto, Sarah Barker', null, 'A simple, domestic love story about a man who takes his skin off for his girlfriend, and why it probably wasn''t the best idea...', 'A simple, domestic love story about a man who takes his skin off for his girlfriend, and why it probably wasn''t the best idea...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40WUxOfEpVFYTQ0xmK1E0ytL0Ny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298165'),
  ('601273006955685616', 'He Walked by Night', 1949, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Alfred L. Werker, John Alton, Howard W. Koch', 'John C. Higgins, Crane Wilbur', 'Richard Basehart, Scott Brady, Roy Roberts, Whit Bissell, James Cardwell, Jack Webb, Reed Hadley, Frank Cady', 'NR', 'Roy Martin aka Roy Morgan is a burglar and former war-time Radio & Electronics Engineer who listens in to radio police calls, allowing him to stay one step ahead of the cops.', 'Roy Martin aka Roy Morgan is a burglar and former war-time Radio & Electronics Engineer who listens in to radio police calls, allowing him to stay one step ahead of the cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAhLdEjC9iIvF6Oly42Qs3LXKuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31556'),
  ('838799573623610503', 'He Was a Quiet Man', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Brandon Trost, Frank A. Cappello', 'Frank A. Cappello', 'Christian Slater, Elisha Cuthbert, William H. Macy, Sascha Knopf, John Gulager, Jamison Jones, Michael DeLuise, K.C. Ramsey', null, 'An unhinged office worker who planned to go on a shooting spree at his workplace struggles with his newfound status as a hero after he ends up stopping a shooting spree instead.', 'An unhinged office worker who planned to go on a shooting spree at his workplace struggles with his newfound status as a hero after he ends up stopping a shooting spree instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZiQLBDum5SjlNmLlkHd61RKVLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10247'),
  ('505238123500347376', 'He Was Cool', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Lee Hwan-kyung', 'Lee Hwan-kyung', 'Song Seung-heon, Jeong Da-bin, Lee Ki-woo, Lee Jin-seong, Jeong Jun-ha, Park Yoon-Bae, Park No-shik, Kim Bo-yeon', null, 'When high school girl Han Ye-won finds an offensive note on the internet school board left by arrogant Ji Eun-seong from vocational school, she replies even more offensively. She doesn''t know he''s hot-tempered and well-known as a bully. So when Ji Eun-seong starts looking for her to teach her a lesson, Han Ye-won realizes how big her mistake was.', 'When high school girl Han Ye-won finds an offensive note on the internet school board left by arrogant Ji Eun-seong from vocational school, she replies even more offensively. She doesn''t know he''s hot-tempered and well-known as a bully. So when Ji Eun-seong starts looking for her to teach her a lesson, Han Ye-won realizes how big her mistake was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTlkvJm1VPvwaFzuwKQDs61vHfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45404'),
  ('132965411646290521', 'He Went That Way', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Jeff Darling, Sean Bagley, Kyle Shea', 'Evan M. Wiener', 'Jacob Elordi, Zachary Quinto, Patrick J. Adams, Troy Evans, Alexandra Doke, John Lee Ames, Roman Arabia, Nicolette Doke', null, 'Set in 1964, a three-day journey along Route 66 begins when Bobby Falls, a 19-year-old serial killer, hitches a ride with Jim Goodwin, a celebrity animal handler travelling with his precious cargo: his TV chimpanzee, Spanky.', 'Set in 1964, a three-day journey along Route 66 begins when Bobby Falls, a 19-year-old serial killer, hitches a ride with Jim Goodwin, a celebrity animal handler travelling with his precious cargo: his TV chimpanzee, Spanky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ii1DVzyj9uJOF9qBrnHCT6nAxUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836972'),
  ('132281177402267801', 'He Who Gets Slapped', 1924, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Victor Sjöström, Milton Moore', null, 'Lon Chaney, Norma Shearer, John Gilbert, Ruth King, Marc McDermott, Ford Sterling, Tully Marshall, Edward Arnold', 'NR', 'After a baron steals his scientific discoveries, runs away with his wife, and slaps him in public, a man joins a Parisian circus sideshow as a clown whose act consists of being slapped repeatedly and becomes infatuated with a showgirl colleague whose father intends to marry her off to the baron.', 'After a baron steals his scientific discoveries, runs away with his wife, and slaps him in public, a man joins a Parisian circus sideshow as a clown whose act consists of being slapped repeatedly and becomes infatuated with a showgirl colleague whose father intends to marry her off to the baron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ue7ce11Y6vEjZXKZeKCBKl6O9Dp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27511'),
  ('523013118743569299', 'He Who Hesitates Is Lost', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Marco Scarpelli, Mario Castellani', 'Dino De Palma', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Aroldo Tieri, Luigi De Filippo, Alberto Lionello, Alberto Talegalli, Angela Portaluri, Mario Castellani', null, 'After their boss'' death, two clerks eagerly await the arrival of the next one, each one of them hoping to become the apple of his eye. They compete in every possible way to impress him, which causes lots of trouble and many misunderstandings.', 'After their boss'' death, two clerks eagerly await the arrival of the next one, each one of them hoping to become the apple of his eye. They compete in every possible way to impress him, which causes lots of trouble and many misunderstandings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4tK5rVUa7qRBsdnqIb2n4ZO207.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61800'),
  ('72456745787667838', 'He Who Must Die', 1957, 'Drama', 'Jules Dassin, Jacques Natteau', 'Ben Barzman, Jules Dassin, André Obey', 'Jean Servais, Carl Möhner, Grégoire Aslan, Gert Fröbe, Melina Mercouri, Pierre Vaneck, Maurice Ronet, Roger Hanin', null, 'Greece, in the 1920s, is occupied by the Turks. The country is in turmoil with entire villages uprooted. The site of the movie is a Greek village that conducts a passion play each year. The leading citizens of the town, under the auspices of the Patriarch, choose those that will play the parts in the Passion. A stuttering shepherd is chosen to play Jesus. The town butcher (who wanted to be Jesus) is chosen as Judas. The town prostitute is chosen as Mary Magdalene. The rest of the disciples are also chosen. As the movie unfolds, the Passion Play becomes a reality. A group of villagers, uprooted by the war and impoverished, arrive at the village led by their priest. The wealthier citizens of the town want nothing with these people and manipulate a massacre. In the context of the 1920s, each of the characters plays out their biblical role in actuality.', 'Greece, in the 1920s, is occupied by the Turks. The country is in turmoil with entire villages uprooted. The site of the movie is a Greek village that conducts a passion play each year. The leading citizens of the town, under the auspices of the Patriarch, choose those that will play the parts in the Passion. A stuttering shepherd is chosen to play Jesus. The town butcher (who wanted to be Jesus) is chosen as Judas. The town prostitute is chosen as Mary Magdalene. The rest of the disciples are also chosen. As the movie unfolds, the Passion Play becomes a reality. A group of villagers, uprooted by the war and impoverished, arrive at the village led by their priest. The wealthier citizens of the town want nothing with these people and manipulate a massacre. In the context of the 1920s, each of the characters plays out their biblical role in actuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDC7rXN3iGDxFzZKXksMrb2jNfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119637'),
  ('771176675612337102', 'He Won''t Kill, She Won''t Die', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Keiichi Kobayashi', 'Keiichi Kobayashi', 'Shotaro Mamiya, Hinako Sakurai, Yuri Tsunematsu, Mayu Hotta, Yumena Yanai, Yutaro, Daichi Kaneko, Masaki Nakao', null, 'When a nihilistic guy crosses paths with a suicidal girl in high school, it marks the beginning of an unusual friendship that might take them both toward healing.', 'When a nihilistic guy crosses paths with a suicidal girl in high school, it marks the beginning of an unusual friendship that might take them both toward healing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iJj1wKbqtPBMrCsgV93mWiXFL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610438'),
  ('984165609727182908', 'He-Man and She-Ra: A Christmas Special', 1985, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Bill Reed, Ernie Schmidt, Erika Scheimer', 'Don Heckman, Bob Forward', 'John Erwin, Alan Oppenheimer, Linda Gary, Lana Beeson, Melendy Britt, George DiCenzo, Erika Scheimer, R.D. Robb', null, 'In this special Christmas episode of the He-Man and She-Ra cartoons, their sidekick Orko accidentally gets beamed to Earth during a test of a new spy satellite. Orko manages to get back Planet Eternia, but brings along two Earth children, Alisha and Manuel, with him. Since it''s Christmastime on Earth, the kids are naturally filled with the holiday spirit, but this overflowing goodwill attracts the unwelcome attention of the Horde Prime and Skeletor. Will the combined power of He-Man, She-Ra and the spirit of Christmas be enough to stop them?', 'In this special Christmas episode of the He-Man and She-Ra cartoons, their sidekick Orko accidentally gets beamed to Earth during a test of a new spy satellite. Orko manages to get back Planet Eternia, but brings along two Earth children, Alisha and Manuel, with him. Since it''s Christmastime on Earth, the kids are naturally filled with the holiday spirit, but this overflowing goodwill attracts the unwelcome attention of the Horde Prime and Skeletor. Will the combined power of He-Man, She-Ra and the spirit of Christmas be enough to stop them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocpYH0zbi7sISxsoUfCYZqcPwfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50063'),
  ('47176731260519756', 'He-Man and She-Ra: The Secret of the Sword', 1985, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Ed Friedman, Lou Kachivas, Marsh Lamore', 'Bob Forward, Larry DiTillio', 'John Erwin, Melendy Britt, Alan Oppenheimer, Linda Gary, George DiCenzo, Erika Scheimer, Lou Scheimer', 'G', 'After experiencing traumatic nightmares of a time now past, the Sorceress summons Prince Adam and Cringer to Castle Grayskull to give Adam a precious, jeweled sword and send the pair to the planet Etheria to investigate its secrets.', 'After experiencing traumatic nightmares of a time now past, the Sorceress summons Prince Adam and Cringer to Castle Grayskull to give Adam a precious, jeweled sword and send the pair to the planet Etheria to investigate its secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojQBGjDr8HDXp1etZTLKeUiYivl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19386'),
  ('766103421334075292', 'He''s a Woman, She''s a Man', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Henry Chan, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Kenneth Yee, Lee Chi-Ngai, James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Leslie Cheung, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Carina Lau, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Law Kar-Ying, Cheung Suet-Ling', null, 'Wing is a devoted fan of popular singer Rose who is involved in a topsy-turvy relationship with her charismatic producer Sam. Willing to go to any length to meet Rose, the willowy Wing disguises herself as a man, and with a twist of fate is chosen to be the next budding star for the record company.', 'Wing is a devoted fan of popular singer Rose who is involved in a topsy-turvy relationship with her charismatic producer Sam. Willing to go to any length to meet Rose, the willowy Wing disguises herself as a man, and with a twist of fate is chosen to be the next budding star for the record company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTIuaah4Sb8ma3jjblW1D3rE5hC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115156'),
