  ('81422498511236079', 'He''s in the Army Now', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mustafa Altıoklar, Soykut Turan', 'Mustafa Altıoklar, Levent Kazak', 'Özcan Deniz, Ali Poyrazoğlu, Yavuz Bingöl, Mehmet Günsür, Gökhan Özoğuz, Levent Kazak, Pelin Batu, Seray Sever', null, 'When the devastating Kocaeli earthquake occurs, the Turkish government passes a special law allowing people to complete their military service in a month.', 'When the devastating Kocaeli earthquake occurs, the Turkish government passes a special law allowing people to complete their military service in a month.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JgcEqfGE0yj0yQOzw1iufOg6yf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447073'),
  ('593272992463855986', 'He''s Just Not That Into You', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Ken Kwapis, John Bailey, Stephen P. Dunn', 'Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein', 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Justin Long, Jennifer Aniston, Ben Affleck, Jennifer Connelly, Bradley Cooper, Scarlett Johansson, Drew Barrymore', 'PG-13', 'Have you ever wondered why they said they would call but didn''t, or why they don''t want to sleep with you anymore, or why your relationship isn''t going to the next level? Maybe they''re just not that into you. Gigi wants a man who says he''ll call her - and actually does - while Alex advises her to stop waiting by the phone. Beth wants a proposal after years of a committed relationship with her boyfriend, Neil, who is just fine with the way things are. Janine''s not sure if she can trust her husband, Ben, who can''t quite trust himself around Anna. Anna can''t decide between the sexy married guy or her straightforward, no-sparks standby, Conor, who can''t get over the fact that he can''t have her. And Mary, who''s found an entire network of loving, supportive men, just needs to find one who''s straight.', 'Have you ever wondered why they said they would call but didn''t, or why they don''t want to sleep with you anymore, or why your relationship isn''t going to the next level? Maybe they''re just not that into you. Gigi wants a man who says he''ll call her - and actually does - while Alex advises her to stop waiting by the phone. Beth wants a proposal after years of a committed relationship with her boyfriend, Neil, who is just fine with the way things are. Janine''s not sure if she can trust her husband, Ben, who can''t quite trust himself around Anna. Anna can''t decide between the sexy married guy or her straightforward, no-sparks standby, Conor, who can''t get over the fact that he can''t have her. And Mary, who''s found an entire network of loving, supportive men, just needs to find one who''s straight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jip2ap24Y6JxEgzVRyNqyYssnyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10184'),
  ('910092143701038069', 'He''s My Girl', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Peter Lyons Collister, Gabrielle Beaumont, Gail Joyce Fortmuller', 'Charles F. Bohl, Taylor Ames', 'T.K. Carter, David Hallyday, David Clennon, Misha McK, Warwick Sims, Jennifer Tilly, Monica Parker, Bibi Besch', 'PG-13', 'Bryan and Reggie are best friends who are in the music business in Missouri. When Reggie enters Brian for a chance to go to L.A., Bryan wins the contest and wants to bring Reggie with him. However, Bryan must bring a girl. In an effort to make sure Bryan gets his shot, Reggie decides to pose as a girl. When the duo arrive in L.A., both fall in love with two women and they must stop the promoter of the contest when he steals Bryan''s song for his star, Simon Sledge.', 'Bryan and Reggie are best friends who are in the music business in Missouri. When Reggie enters Brian for a chance to go to L.A., Bryan wins the contest and wants to bring Reggie with him. However, Bryan must bring a girl. In an effort to make sure Bryan gets his shot, Reggie decides to pose as a girl. When the duo arrive in L.A., both fall in love with two women and they must stop the promoter of the contest when he steals Bryan''s song for his star, Simon Sledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dokAejva0YOH49wm9uLIeG6oLY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95630'),
