  ('1074814373998704919', 'He''s Out There', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chi Fung, Bruce Speyer, Mark Lukac', 'Mike Scannell', 'Yvonne Strahovski, Justin Bruening, Abigail Pniowsky, Julian Bailey, Anna Pniowsky, Stephanie Costa, Ryan McDonald', 'R', 'On vacation at a remote lake house, a mother and her two young daughters must fight for survival after falling into a terrifying and bizarre nightmare conceived by a psychopath.', 'On vacation at a remote lake house, a mother and her two young daughters must fight for survival after falling into a terrifying and bizarre nightmare conceived by a psychopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pi9Zo4uIATSe8cQ96cCOWJ1qdGw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431185'),
  ('88408495604337692', 'He''s Watching You', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jordon Foss, Jonathan Champion, Benjamin Kitchens', 'Jordon Foss', 'Gianni DeCenzo, Jan Luis Castellanos, Elizabeth Yu, Vanessa Rubio, Nicole Elizabeth Berger, Kevin Porter, Kaya Rosenthal, Tiana Le', 'R', 'When a string of murders rocks his quiet town, a teen''s search for answers leads him to a hidden stash of VHS tapes that may contain clues to solve the mystery of the serial killer known only as "The Pill."', 'When a string of murders rocks his quiet town, a teen''s search for answers leads him to a hidden stash of VHS tapes that may contain clues to solve the mystery of the serial killer known only as "The Pill."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGrxMTGzoO120uuHuYxwbv5Ypcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1370424'),
  ('984863708133219360', 'He''s Worse than Me', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Oldoini, Alessandro D''Eva, Roberto Palmerini', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Enrico Oldoini', 'Adriano Celentano, Renato Pozzetto, Kelly Van der Velden, Daniel Stephen, Sergio Renda, Lamotte Eugene Atkins, Vincenzo De Toma, Floriano Omobono', null, 'Two reckless friends Leonardo (Adriano Celentano) and Luciano (Renato Potstsetto) are just doing whatever they want and getting into endless alterations. When one of them decides to marry, their friendship is in a crisis ...', 'Two reckless friends Leonardo (Adriano Celentano) and Luciano (Renato Potstsetto) are just doing whatever they want and getting into endless alterations. When one of them decides to marry, their friendship is in a crisis ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF1o872Shzi4JdxzgkSLJ1lNwOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58191'),
  ('288544798621495908', 'He''s Your Dog, Charlie Brown', 1968, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Peter Robbins, Bill Melendez, Sally Dryer, Ann Altieri, Lisa DeFaria, Christopher Shea, Glenn Mendelson, Gail DeFaria', 'G', 'When the gang loses patience with Snoopy''s mischief, he suddenly finds himself back in obedience training. With a vengeance, Snoopy decides it''s time to run away to Peppermint Patty''s house, but soon realizes life might not be so bad with Charlie Brown after all.', 'When the gang loses patience with Snoopy''s mischief, he suddenly finds himself back in obedience training. With a vengeance, Snoopy decides it''s time to run away to Peppermint Patty''s house, but soon realizes life might not be so bad with Charlie Brown after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArJ5orVPd6gGKMajmlZ39gdERoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34228'),
  ('835920725086596379', 'Head', 1968, 'Comedy, Music', 'Bob Rafelson, Michel Hugo, Jon C. Andersen', 'Jack Nicholson, Bob Rafelson, Davy Jones', 'Peter Tork, Davy Jones, Micky Dolenz, Michael Nesmith, Annette Funicello, Timothy Carey, Logan Ramsey, Vito Scotti', 'G', 'In this surrealistic and free-form follow-up to the Monkees'' television show, the band frolic their way through a series of musical set pieces and vignettes containing humor and anti-establishment social commentary.', 'In this surrealistic and free-form follow-up to the Monkees'' television show, the band frolic their way through a series of musical set pieces and vignettes containing humor and anti-establishment social commentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvMy7sTqOEr7faJzDE5UD0zUiHA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18193'),
  ('909285485661858141', 'Head Above Water', 1993, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Nils Gaup', 'Geir Eriksen, Eirik Ildahl', 'Lene Elise Bergum, Svein Roger Karlsen, Morten Abel, Jon Skolmen, Reidar Sørensen', null, 'Einar and Bjørn leaves Lene on the island for a fishing trip. Then her former lover, Gaute, drops by unexpectedly. Drunk, he sleeps in the double bed. Lene sleeps on the couch and wakes up when the men come back. She tries to wake Gaute, but then discovers that he''s dead.', 'Einar and Bjørn leaves Lene on the island for a fishing trip. Then her former lover, Gaute, drops by unexpectedly. Drunk, he sleeps in the double bed. Lene sleeps on the couch and wakes up when the men come back. She tries to wake Gaute, but then discovers that he''s dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/birWMF4Axa3y958boSkg5l0mkv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40918'),
  ('637450190652820366', 'Head Above Water', 1996, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Jim Wilson, Richard Bowen, Trey Batchelor', 'Theresa Marie', 'Harvey Keitel, Cameron Diaz, Billy Zane, Craig Sheffer, Shay Duffin', 'PG-13', 'Judge George brings his young wife, Nathalie, to a remote island for a vacation. But while George accompanies their only neighbor -- Nathalie''s childhood friend Lance -- on a fishing trip, Nathalie spends time with her ex, Kent. When Kent ends up dead the next morning, Nathalie tries to hide the evidence before her husband gets home. After the body is found, the events of the previous night unravel, with unexpected revelations.', 'Judge George brings his young wife, Nathalie, to a remote island for a vacation. But while George accompanies their only neighbor -- Nathalie''s childhood friend Lance -- on a fishing trip, Nathalie spends time with her ex, Kent. When Kent ends up dead the next morning, Nathalie tries to hide the evidence before her husband gets home. After the body is found, the events of the previous night unravel, with unexpected revelations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snbpUmX63bbjko0j0NyugJPHd9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11103'),
  ('1127423820621322711', 'Head Above Water', 2018, 'Drama', 'Margaux Bonhomme', 'Margaux Bonhomme', 'Diane Rouxel, Cédric Kahn, Jeanne Cohendy, Pablo Pauly, Agathe Dronne, Clémentine Allain, Grégoire Monsaingeon, Etienne Diallo', null, 'Elisa, a fiery and passionate teenager, wants to enjoy the summer of her 17 years on the steep slopes of the Vercors where she grew up. But her mother leaves the house and leaves her alone with her father to look after her disabled sister. An increasingly heavy responsibility that makes love switch to hatred.', 'Elisa, a fiery and passionate teenager, wants to enjoy the summer of her 17 years on the steep slopes of the Vercors where she grew up. But her mother leaves the house and leaves her alone with her father to look after her disabled sister. An increasingly heavy responsibility that makes love switch to hatred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybXBtXLVTpdo4nnr2LHKyXI95CK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559967'),
  ('752041127270424301', 'Head Against the Wall', 1959, 'Drama', 'Georges Franju, Claude Zidi, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Hervé Bazin', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Pierre Brasseur, Paul Meurisse, Charles Aznavour, Anouk Aimée, Jean Galland, Jean Ozenne, Thomy Bourdelle', null, 'An aimless young man is committed to a psychiatric hospital by his father in an attempt to cure him of his delinquent tendencies.', 'An aimless young man is committed to a psychiatric hospital by his father in an attempt to cure him of his delinquent tendencies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ApkSr8ij0010pM6VLF3GfdHt3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77356'),
  ('844504092081650351', 'Head Burst', 2019, 'Drama', 'Savas Ceviz, Aljoscha Haupt', 'Savas Ceviz', 'Max Riemelt, Oskar Netzel, Isabell Gerschke, Luise Heyer, Ercan Durmaz, Michael Schenk, Joel Basman, Aris Diamanti', null, 'Markus is a handsome and respectable architect who has a secret: he is a pedophile. Despite feeling disgust of himself, Markus can''t help but feel attracted to young boys. When he thinks he won''t be able to suppress his deepest feelings, he decides to isolate himself.', 'Markus is a handsome and respectable architect who has a secret: he is a pedophile. Despite feeling disgust of himself, Markus can''t help but feel attracted to young boys. When he thinks he won''t be able to suppress his deepest feelings, he decides to isolate himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rpJeyKRSMxjD9iduOzn9G5WDaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636702'),
  ('1073545458910054509', 'Head Count', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Elle Callahan, Shelby Malone, Kyle Smithers', 'Michael Nader', 'Isaac Jay, Ashleigh Morghan, Chelcie May, Bevin Bru, Cooper Rowe, Tory Freeth, Billy Meade, Michael Alan Herman', null, 'Newcomer Evan joins a group of teens on a getaway in Joshua Tree. While exchanging ghost stories around the campfire, Evan reads aloud a mysterious chant from an internet site. From that moment, someone--or something--is among them.', 'Newcomer Evan joins a group of teens on a getaway in Joshua Tree. While exchanging ghost stories around the campfire, Evan reads aloud a mysterious chant from an internet site. From that moment, someone--or something--is among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oXyBgTZJGQ9eKmysvr0CnemYDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549935'),
