  ('529325577558762755', 'Head Full of Honey', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Til Schweiger, Martin Schlecht, Lars Gmehling', 'Hilly Martinek, Til Schweiger', 'Dieter Hallervorden, Emma Schweiger, Til Schweiger, Jan Josef Liefers, Jeanette Hain, Dar Salim, Pasquale Aleardi, Claudia Michelsen', null, 'Before eleven years old Tilda''s parents can put her beloved grandfather in an old people''s home due to his progressing Alzheimer disease, she takes him on one last adventure that subliminally threatens to tear her family apart.', 'Before eleven years old Tilda''s parents can put her beloved grandfather in an old people''s home due to his progressing Alzheimer disease, she takes him on one last adventure that subliminally threatens to tear her family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82T8Yax4blLICBPRcdzeJ6tZzxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269258'),
  ('863543313160698391', 'Head Full of Honey', 2018, 'Drama', 'Til Schweiger, René Richter', 'Lo Malinke, Jojo Moyes, Til Schweiger', 'Nick Nolte, Matt Dillon, Emily Mortimer, Sophie Lane Nolte, Jacqueline Bisset, Eric Roberts, Greta Scacchi, Julian Ovenden', null, 'A young girl tries to help her grandfather, who is suffering from Alzheimer’s, navigate his increasing forgetfulness, and ends up going on a remarkable adventure with him.', 'A young girl tries to help her grandfather, who is suffering from Alzheimer’s, navigate his increasing forgetfulness, and ends up going on a remarkable adventure with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tYVrPAplzu642OgNCkhHUy0gcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448677'),
  ('888648683164902019', 'Head in the Clouds', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'John Duigan, Paul Sarossy', 'John Duigan', 'Charlize Theron, Penélope Cruz, Stuart Townsend, Thomas Kretschmann, Peter Cockett, Gabriel Hogan, Karine Vanasse, David La Haye', 'R', 'Gilda Bessé shares her Paris apartment with an Irish schoolteacher, Guy Malyon, and Mia, a refugee from Spain. As the world drifts toward war, Gilda defiantly pursues her hedonistic lifestyle and her burgeoning career as a photographer. But Guy and Mia feel impelled to join the fight against fascism, and the three friends are separated.', 'Gilda Bessé shares her Paris apartment with an Irish schoolteacher, Guy Malyon, and Mia, a refugee from Spain. As the world drifts toward war, Gilda defiantly pursues her hedonistic lifestyle and her burgeoning career as a photographer. But Guy and Mia feel impelled to join the fight against fascism, and the three friends are separated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hife90EykgFaJ6KPY1DX8y7DVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18804'),
  ('918927646890884736', 'Head in the Stars', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jérôme Alméras, Laurent Cavallotto, Emmanuel Gillibert', 'Kamel Guemra, Adrien Piquet-Gauthier, Marion Thiéry', 'Hakim Jemili, Alice Pol, François-Xavier Demaison, Olivia Côte, Beatrice Rosen, Yongsou Cho, Nawell Madani, Brahim Bouhlel', null, 'Ali, a thirty-something from the suburbs, still lives with his mother and his 8-year-old daughter. Lazy and without any particular ambition, he scrapes by doing odd jobs as a fast-food delivery driver. Following a delivery, he finds himself, by a twist of fate, propelled into space aboard the ISS space station. The conquest of space is about to write a surprising and unprecedented chapter in its history...', 'Ali, a thirty-something from the suburbs, still lives with his mother and his 8-year-old daughter. Lazy and without any particular ambition, he scrapes by doing odd jobs as a fast-food delivery driver. Following a delivery, he finds himself, by a twist of fate, propelled into space aboard the ISS space station. The conquest of space is about to write a surprising and unprecedented chapter in its history...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeve0ujWfYpvytYRsy89or66Igs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035459'),
