  ('194475103436463995', 'Head On', 1998, 'Drama', 'Ana Kokkinos, Iain Pirret, Phil Jones', 'Mira Robertson, Ana Kokkinos, Andrew Bovell', 'Alex Dimitriades, Paul Capsis, Julian Garner, Elena Mandalis, Tony Nikolakopoulos, Damien Fotiou, Eugenia Fragos, Dora Kaskanis', null, 'Nineteen-year-old Ari confronts both his sexuality and his Greek family. Ari despises his once-beloved parents, former radical activists, for having entombed themselves in insular tradition. Ari is obsessed with gay sex, although he does make an unenthusiastic attempt to satisfy the sister of one of his best friends. While all of this is going on, he''s facing problems with his traditional Greek parents, who have no clue about his sexual activities.', 'Nineteen-year-old Ari confronts both his sexuality and his Greek family. Ari despises his once-beloved parents, former radical activists, for having entombed themselves in insular tradition. Ari is obsessed with gay sex, although he does make an unenthusiastic attempt to satisfy the sister of one of his best friends. While all of this is going on, he''s facing problems with his traditional Greek parents, who have no clue about his sexual activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kOpfb9oCiDP7LUWbthZhzjnh1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13817'),
  ('7951567117616716', 'Head Over Heels', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mark Waters, Mark Plummer', 'John J. Strauss, Ed Decter, Ron Burch', 'Monica Potter, Freddie Prinze Jr., Shalom Harlow, Ivana Miličević, Sarah Murdoch, Tomiko Fraser, China Chow, Timothy Olyphant', 'PG-13', 'Ordinary single girl Amanda Pierce unexpectedly finds herself sharing an awesome Manhattan apartment with four sexy supermodels. Determined to bring Amanda into their world, the models give her the ultimate makeover. The plan works fabulously as Amanda connects with next door charmer Jim Winston. That is, until one night while spying on him, Amanda thinks she sees the man of her dreams committing a cold blooded crime.', 'Ordinary single girl Amanda Pierce unexpectedly finds herself sharing an awesome Manhattan apartment with four sexy supermodels. Determined to bring Amanda into their world, the models give her the ultimate makeover. The plan works fabulously as Amanda connects with next door charmer Jim Winston. That is, until one night while spying on him, Amanda thinks she sees the man of her dreams committing a cold blooded crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5Ln7UmgKThD3QhPC6JS6WZgCXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24940'),
  ('554902234401834380', 'Head Over Heels', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, José Parras, Antonio Luiz Mendes', 'Paulo Cursino, Marcelo Saback', 'Ingrid Guimarães, Maria Paula, Bruno Garcia, Denise Weinberg, Antonio Pedro, Cristina Pereira, João Fernandes, Rodrigo Candelot', null, 'After being left by her husband and fired from her work, a workaholic, thirtysomething businesswoman is forced to go through a big change in her life and becomes a partner on a decadent sex shop.', 'After being left by her husband and fired from her work, a workaholic, thirtysomething businesswoman is forced to go through a big change in her life and becomes a partner on a decadent sex shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8tcxGK8liu31vj2vwidON5jPWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62156'),
