  ('328440483630455178', 'Headless Horseman', 2007, 'Horror', 'Anthony C. Ferrante, David Worth', 'Zachary Weintraub, Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Billy Aaron Brown, Rebecca Mozo, Richard Moll, Arianne Fraser, Lizzie Prestel, Brent Lydic, Vasile Albineț, Joe Hartzler', 'R', 'Seven college kids take a shortcut on their way to a party and unfortunately end up in Wormwood – a "lost" town in the middle of nowhere. They find something strange and sinister happening there – bones and weird decorations line Main Street. The cause: local Wormwood legend says on All Hallows Eve one hundred years ago, a crazed man tortured the youngsters in town and then cut off their heads. In retaliation, the townspeople killed him by cutting off his head. Seeking revenge every seven years, he returns and takes seven heads from children in the town. Now the seven visitors find themselves hunted one by one as the Headless Horseman claims his due.', 'Seven college kids take a shortcut on their way to a party and unfortunately end up in Wormwood – a "lost" town in the middle of nowhere. They find something strange and sinister happening there – bones and weird decorations line Main Street. The cause: local Wormwood legend says on All Hallows Eve one hundred years ago, a crazed man tortured the youngsters in town and then cut off their heads. In retaliation, the townspeople killed him by cutting off his head. Seeking revenge every seven years, he returns and takes seven heads from children in the town. Now the seven visitors find themselves hunted one by one as the Headless Horseman claims his due.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeixE2DRLuednYsaO8dHBwwYlcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43585'),
