  ('70793569511505473', 'Heads and Tails', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Yevgeniy Bazanov', 'Sergey Dernov, Georgiy Daneliya', 'Kirill Pirogov, Polina Kutepova, Stanislav Govorukhin, Natalya Rassiyeva, Sergey Shvydkoy, Leonid Yarmolnik, Oleg Basilashvili, Ivan Ryzhov', null, 'To earn money for married life, a young engaged man takes a job as an engineer on a privately operated oil drilling rig in the far North of Russia. A friend''s letter brings the sad news that his fiancée has already married someone else and in desperation he quits his job and flies back to Moscow. There all his vast efforts to win her back seem in vain...', 'To earn money for married life, a young engaged man takes a job as an engineer on a privately operated oil drilling rig in the far North of Russia. A friend''s letter brings the sad news that his fiancée has already married someone else and in desperation he quits his job and flies back to Moscow. There all his vast efforts to win her back seem in vain...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9tMpwcrc5biNfzqPwAafEjUvDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27928'),
