  ('269393503696150387', 'Heads of State', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Comedy', 'Ilya Naishuller, Ben Davis, Elaine Kusmishko', 'Josh Appelbaum, André Nemec, Harrison Query', 'John Cena, Idris Elba, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Paddy Considine, Carla Gugino, Stephen Root, Jack Quaid, Sarah Niles', 'PG-13', 'The UK Prime Minister and US President have a public rivalry that risks their countries'' alliance. But when they become targets of a powerful enemy, they''re forced to rely on each other as they go on a wild, multinational run. Allied with Noel, a brilliant MI6 agent, they must find a way to thwart a conspiracy that threatens the free world.', 'The UK Prime Minister and US President have a public rivalry that risks their countries'' alliance. But when they become targets of a powerful enemy, they''re forced to rely on each other as they go on a wild, multinational run. Allied with Noel, a brilliant MI6 agent, they must find a way to thwart a conspiracy that threatens the free world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVgE5oLzf7ABmzyASEVcjYyHI41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749170'),
  ('971098469292763815', 'Heads or Fails', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lenny Guit, Kinan Massarani, Angel Adhera', 'Harpo Guit, Lenny Guit', 'Maria Cavalier-Bazan, Axel Perin, Michael Zindel, Maxi Delmelle, Catherine Ringer, Melvil Poupaud, Claire Bodson, Gwladys Lefeuvre', null, 'Armande Pigeon, a queen of shenanigans in Brussels struggles to make ends meet because she can’t stop gambling on everything, always ending up on the wrong side of luck. When she teams up with Ronnie one night, everything changes — they win it all. And when you hit a winning streak, you have to know when to stop.', 'Armande Pigeon, a queen of shenanigans in Brussels struggles to make ends meet because she can’t stop gambling on everything, always ending up on the wrong side of luck. When she teams up with Ronnie one night, everything changes — they win it all. And when you hit a winning streak, you have to know when to stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p03nyFzLERXEeE7MfBsCzBVb266.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233354'),
  ('115228329846510738', 'Heads or Tails', 1980, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Enrico, Claire Denis, Didier Tarot', 'Michel Audiard', 'Philippe Noiret, Michel Serrault, Dorothée, Pierre Arditi, Bernard Le Coq, Gaëlle Legrand, Guilhaine Dubos, Fred Personne', null, 'Since his wife died, Inspector Louis Baroni (Philippe Noiret) has become a virtual recluse, preferring the solitude of his quiet house to the company of others. His period of mournful contemplation is broken when he is called out to look into the suspicious death of Madame Morlaix who, according to her husband Edouard (Michel Serrault), fell from an upstairs window. Curious to find out more, Baroni begins his inquiry.', 'Since his wife died, Inspector Louis Baroni (Philippe Noiret) has become a virtual recluse, preferring the solitude of his quiet house to the company of others. His period of mournful contemplation is broken when he is called out to look into the suspicious death of Madame Morlaix who, according to her husband Edouard (Michel Serrault), fell from an upstairs window. Curious to find out more, Baroni begins his inquiry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7scR6UhY1Gkhi47tKm0PgrS4GZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64220'),
  ('1144892520873820672', 'Heads or Tails', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Claude Fournier, Yves Castonguay, Mireille Goulet', 'Claude Fournier, Marie-José Raymond', 'Roy Dupuis, Patrick Huard, Albert Millaire, Charlotte Laurier, France Castel, Arielle Dombasle, Xavier Dolan, Guy Nadon', 'NR', 'A heterosexual man pretends to be gay in order to keep his career in the world of art, which causes many misunderstandings with his wife, and mother.', 'A heterosexual man pretends to be gay in order to keep his career in the world of art, which causes many misunderstandings with his wife, and mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBZB7BuKN7PhXGFgQVSe005LFKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151330'),
