  ('182744026575914962', 'HealtH', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Robert Altman, Edmond L. Koons, Bob Dahlin', 'Frank Barhydt, Robert Altman, Paul Dooley', 'Carol Burnett, Lauren Bacall, Glenda Jackson, James Garner, Paul Dooley, Henry Gibson, Alfre Woodard, Donald Moffat', 'PG', 'At a luxury Florida resort, health food lobbyists choose their new president at their annual convention. As the conference progresses, underhanded tricks, backroom corruption and bizarre personal behavior threaten to undermine the entire affair.', 'At a luxury Florida resort, health food lobbyists choose their new president at their annual convention. As the conference progresses, underhanded tricks, backroom corruption and bizarre personal behavior threaten to undermine the entire affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3cULqjYm8s7sShpqjKzynqXqDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91781'),
  ('948630976726790888', 'Healthy, Wealthy and Dumb', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Searle Kramer', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Bobby Burns, Bud Jamison, Jean Carmen', 'NR', 'Curly wins $50,000 in a radio contest and the stooges move into the Hotel Costa Plente. Their suite is furnished with many expensive items which they systematically wreck, running up quite a bill. When they discover that, minus tax deductions, the jackpot is only $4.85 they quickly agree to marry three pretty rich widows who are also living in the hotel. The "widows" are actually gold diggers conniving to the get the jackpot money. When the girls find out what the jackpot is really worth, the boys get conked with champagne bottles.', 'Curly wins $50,000 in a radio contest and the stooges move into the Hotel Costa Plente. Their suite is furnished with many expensive items which they systematically wreck, running up quite a bill. When they discover that, minus tax deductions, the jackpot is only $4.85 they quickly agree to marry three pretty rich widows who are also living in the hotel. The "widows" are actually gold diggers conniving to the get the jackpot money. When the girls find out what the jackpot is really worth, the boys get conked with champagne bottles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uMhhdBGUD8k7yxff6AVHcutHc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115917'),
  ('809441059417893292', 'Hear Me', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Cheng Fenfen, Chin Ting-chang', 'Cheng Fenfen', 'Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Ivy Chen, Michelle Chen Yan-Hsi, Lo Pei-an, Lin Mei-shiu', null, 'A delivery boy falls for a young girl who is hearing impaired. Comparing themselves with water birds and trees, together they are going to break the barrier and pursuit their dreams and take their relationship to the next level.', 'A delivery boy falls for a young girl who is hearing impaired. Comparing themselves with water birds and trees, together they are going to break the barrier and pursuit their dreams and take their relationship to the next level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKQjbe2xAB4wVBkUXr6wLOyaBhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41531'),
  ('177013060422902789', 'Hear Me Love', 2024, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Diastème, Philippe Guilbert, Jérôme Brière', 'Diastème, Alex Beaupain', 'Clara Luciani, William Lebghil, Laura Felpin, Victor Belmondo, Jeanne Rosa, José Garcia, Grégoire Ludig, Vincent Dedienne', null, 'Set between Paris and Rome’s Cinecitta’s Studios in the 1970s, a struggling writer seeks inspiration for his second novel, and falls in love with a famous movie star.', 'Set between Paris and Rome’s Cinecitta’s Studios in the 1970s, a struggling writer seeks inspiration for his second novel, and falls in love with a famous movie star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqtmi8hXYVe7zJhTs5e5NOKitSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217484'),
  ('874542372215587545', 'Hear Me Out', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pascal Elbé', 'Pascal Elbé', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Pascal Elbé, Valérie Donzelli, François Berléand, Emmanuelle Devos, Anne Azoulay, Claudia Tagbo, Marthe Villalonga', null, 'Antoine, a history teacher in his early 50s, learns that he has become very hard of hearing. Unable to own up to his handicap, he resigns himself to living in his bubble, even though his entourage finds his behavior increasingly odd. His encounter with Claire, widow and mother of a young girl who has stopped speaking, will lead him to open up to the world.', 'Antoine, a history teacher in his early 50s, learns that he has become very hard of hearing. Unable to own up to his handicap, he resigns himself to living in his bubble, even though his entourage finds his behavior increasingly odd. His encounter with Claire, widow and mother of a young girl who has stopped speaking, will lead him to open up to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dotqI3ZBAyEe00iUiSO0H3rp9jG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809733'),
  ('1092777073146975728', 'Hear Me: Our Summer', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Cho Sun-ho, Kang Min-woo, Lee Gyeong-won', 'Cho Sun-ho, Cheng Fenfen, Na Jae-won', 'Hong Kyung, Roh Yoon-seo, Kim Min-ju, Jung Yong-ju, Jeong Hye-young, Hyun Bong-sik, An Min-young, Go Gyeong-man', null, 'A job seeking dreamer Yong-jun works part-time at his parents'' lunch box house. Yeo-reum lives only to support for hearing-impaired swimmer sister. One day, Yong-jun meets Yeo-reum while delivering lunch boxes and falls in love at the first sight. Yeo-reum slowly opens her heart to warm-hearted Yong-jun.', 'A job seeking dreamer Yong-jun works part-time at his parents'' lunch box house. Yeo-reum lives only to support for hearing-impaired swimmer sister. One day, Yong-jun meets Yeo-reum while delivering lunch boxes and falls in love at the first sight. Yeo-reum slowly opens her heart to warm-hearted Yong-jun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNCp17yK9L0pANvKTb6tWECQj4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160981'),
  ('717610394136629426', 'Hear My Song', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Peter Chelsom, Sue Gibson, Lisa Mulcahy', 'Adrian Dunbar, Peter Chelsom', 'Ned Beatty, Adrian Dunbar, Tara Fitzgerald, William Hootkins, Shirley Anne Field, David McCallum, James Nesbitt, John Dair', 'R', 'Singer Josef Locke fled to Ireland 25 years ago to escape the clutches of the tax man and police Chief Jim Abbott. What he also left behind was the love of his life Cathleen Doyle. Now, Micky O’Neill is desperate to save both his ailing Liverpool nightclub ‘Heartly’s’ and his failing relationship with the beautiful Nancy, Cathleen’s daughter. The solution? Book the infamous Josef Locke.', 'Singer Josef Locke fled to Ireland 25 years ago to escape the clutches of the tax man and police Chief Jim Abbott. What he also left behind was the love of his life Cathleen Doyle. Now, Micky O’Neill is desperate to save both his ailing Liverpool nightclub ‘Heartly’s’ and his failing relationship with the beautiful Nancy, Cathleen’s daughter. The solution? Book the infamous Josef Locke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD8hh10Atodan4tzYg3K2QFCrJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54405'),
  ('742330174311745646', 'Hear No Evil', 1993, 'Thriller', 'Robert Greenwald, Steven Shaw', 'Danny Rubin, Randall M. Badat, Kathleen Rowell', 'Marlee Matlin, D. B. Sweeney, Martin Sheen, John C. McGinley, Christina Carlisi, Greg Wayne Elam, Charley Lang, Marge Redmond', 'R', 'Deaf Jillian Shanahan becomes the target of a ruthless and corrupt cop. The cop is looking for a stolen coin, which he plans to keep for himself. A journalist briefly acquires the coin and hides it in Jillian''s apartment, then his car explodes, now the cop is after her.', 'Deaf Jillian Shanahan becomes the target of a ruthless and corrupt cop. The cop is looking for a stolen coin, which he plans to keep for himself. A journalist briefly acquires the coin and hides it in Jillian''s apartment, then his car explodes, now the cop is after her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3cWYMacQAcDeF2x3NZLKm2Xq2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71140'),
  ('261155920560954731', 'Hear the Silence', 2016, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Ed Ehrenberg, Ludwig Franz', 'Axel Melzener, Julia Peters', 'Lars Doppler, Simon Hangartner, Clarissa Molocher, Antonia Langenohl, Ana Sanchez, Andreas Zahn, Andreas Erb', null, '1941, Ukraine. A group of German soldiers occupy a small town populated exclusively by women and children of German descent, way behind enemy lines. There''s tension from the beginning, that always threatens to erupt in violence from both sides.', '1941, Ukraine. A group of German soldiers occupy a small town populated exclusively by women and children of German descent, way behind enemy lines. There''s tension from the beginning, that always threatens to erupt in violence from both sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxcXorjoQsQtqqg4rYPPm6yifr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425927'),
  ('917129218827638732', 'Heart', 1999, 'Thriller', 'Charles McDougall, Julian Court', 'Jimmy McGovern', 'Christopher Eccleston, Saskia Reeves, Kate Hardie, Rhys Ifans, Anna Chancellor, Matthew Rhys, Jack Deam, Matthew Rhys', null, 'A woman, plastered in blood, is arrested by a grave, and a tale of loss, lust and jealousy slowly unfolds.', 'A woman, plastered in blood, is arrested by a grave, and a tale of loss, lust and jealousy slowly unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2boe7ECVzgv1UHkHY7nI1F6MIEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36988'),
  ('886046318303743198', 'Heart ''N'' SOUL', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'JayTee Thompson', 'Ariel Simone, Da Griot', 'Kendon Tillis, Tayy'' Blanson, Tonyae Meeks, Larry Ervin, Edward Peanutt Smith', null, 'After discovering her boyfriend of seven years has been unfaithful, a successful publicist struggles to rebuild her life and guard her heart. When she meets a soulful spoken word artist who believes in intentional love, their unexpected connection challenges them both to confront past wounds, redefine vulnerability, and discover whether true love requires leading with the heart, the soul or both.', 'After discovering her boyfriend of seven years has been unfaithful, a successful publicist struggles to rebuild her life and guard her heart. When she meets a soulful spoken word artist who believes in intentional love, their unexpected connection challenges them both to confront past wounds, redefine vulnerability, and discover whether true love requires leading with the heart, the soul or both.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzEwYzAzYzItOTc3Yi00YmFiLThkYWItYjhmOGNhN2NkNTE5XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:heart-n-soul'),
  ('203335996968948002', 'Heart and Souls', 1993, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Ron Underwood, Michael W. Watkins, Yudi Bennett', 'Brent Maddock, Erik Hansen, Gregory Hansen', 'Robert Downey Jr., Charles Grodin, Alfre Woodard, Kyra Sedgwick, Tom Sizemore, David Paymer, Elisabeth Shue, Bill Calvert', 'PG-13', 'A fateful night in 1959, four people die when the bus they are riding crashes. They continue as ghosts; their souls become eternally entwined to the life of a child born at the moment of their deaths as his guardians. Baby Thomas grows up to be a businessman who has memories of his playmates, but assumes they are products of his youthful imagination. When the ghosts realize they need Thomas'' help to move on to the afterlife, they decide to make an appearance once more.', 'A fateful night in 1959, four people die when the bus they are riding crashes. They continue as ghosts; their souls become eternally entwined to the life of a child born at the moment of their deaths as his guardians. Baby Thomas grows up to be a businessman who has memories of his playmates, but assumes they are products of his youthful imagination. When the ghosts realize they need Thomas'' help to move on to the afterlife, they decide to make an appearance once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik6GtJXMoq5tA581IMeBHr7Wocf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12187'),
  ('996441377485401982', 'Heart and Yummie', 2010, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Masaya Fujimori, Yoshiaki Yanagida, Toshihiko Nakajima', 'Osamu Murakami, Hiroaki Jinno', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Seishirou Katou, Tomoyo Harada, Tokuyoshi Kawashima, Tetsuya Bessho, Rikako Aikawa, Takuya Kirimoto, Maria Kawamura', 'G', 'Heart is a tyrannosaurus who is found and raised bv a herbivore mother. After learning his true nature as a meat eater, he runs away from home and finds a baby ankylosaurus egg that hatches and thinks Heart is his father. After accidentally naming the baby Yummie - thinking he looked tasty - their love for one another tests the bounds of nature vs. nurture.', 'Heart is a tyrannosaurus who is found and raised bv a herbivore mother. After learning his true nature as a meat eater, he runs away from home and finds a baby ankylosaurus egg that hatches and thinks Heart is his father. After accidentally naming the baby Yummie - thinking he looked tasty - their love for one another tests the bounds of nature vs. nurture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvJFoxEuhVd3HXXMWFJMeEpBYNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89825'),
  ('797432159065353071', 'Heart Attack', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Parama Malakul Na Ayudhaya, Therawit Srisiri, Niramon Ross', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit', 'Sunny Suwanmethanon, Davika Hoorne, Violette Wautier, Torpong Chantabubpha, Surattanavee Suviporn, Kornpassorn Ratanameathanont, Nottapon Boonprakob, Vichai Matakul', null, 'A hard-worker freelancer who falls in love with a doctor. While his life is getting worse every second. He must find the way to release his life to the beyond of everything.', 'A hard-worker freelancer who falls in love with a doctor. While his life is getting worse every second. He must find the way to release his life to the beyond of everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23t58wOGZY0zyaskKsd1Nxrs52L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357540'),
  ('132790268752982766', 'Heart Beat', 1980, 'Drama', 'John Byrum, László Kovács', 'John Byrum', 'Nick Nolte, Sissy Spacek, John Heard, Ray Sharkey, Ann Dusenberry, Margaret Fairchild, Tony Bill, Mary Margaret Amato', 'R', 'An exploration of the relationship between Beat Generation writers Jack Kerouac and Neal Cassady, and Cassady''s wife, Carolyn.', 'An exploration of the relationship between Beat Generation writers Jack Kerouac and Neal Cassady, and Cassady''s wife, Carolyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKNzhKlfy0OE9FhZKUVEsPZ9N4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190173'),
  ('1072722097066474291', 'Heart Beats', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hiroto Takahashi, Kazuyuki Kawasato, Shigetomo Madarame', 'Rie Yokota', 'Ukisho Hidaka, Sei Shiraishi, Mizuki Itagaki, Nanoka Hara, Hana Kawamura, Jiei Wakabayashi, Yumena Yanai, Kaito Irie', null, 'When Tsukasa was a middle school student, she had a crush on transfer student Hayato and even confessed her feelings to him. She was turned down by Hayato. Now, Tsukasa and Hayato are classmates in high school. Hayato treats Tsukasa as just a friend, but Tsukasa still has feelings for him. Meanwhile, Hayato becomes attracted to Tsukasa.', 'When Tsukasa was a middle school student, she had a crush on transfer student Hayato and even confessed her feelings to him. She was turned down by Hayato. Now, Tsukasa and Hayato are classmates in high school. Hayato treats Tsukasa as just a friend, but Tsukasa still has feelings for him. Meanwhile, Hayato becomes attracted to Tsukasa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rN38Pf2GQFvuqX5kaocF50F9S4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803279'),
  ('287575633931784141', 'Heart Blackened', 2017, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Hong Seung-chul, Jung Ji-woo, Lee Eun-jung', 'Jung Ji-woo', 'Choi Min-sik, Park Shin-hye, Ryu Jun-yeol, Lee Hanee, Lee Soo-kyung, Park Hae-joon, Cho Han-cheul, Jang Won-hyung', null, 'A father goes all out to clear his daughter from any wrong doing in the murder of his fiancée. When all evidence points to her, he takes matters into to his own hands to save his daughter and outwit the judiciary system.', 'A father goes all out to clear his daughter from any wrong doing in the murder of his fiancée. When all evidence points to her, he takes matters into to his own hands to save his daughter and outwit the judiciary system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CRwdPyw3vYwMApBr87vXcjwr67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437078'),
  ('523227470872704085', 'Heart Condition', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Fantasy', 'James D. Parriott, Arthur Albert', 'James D. Parriott', 'Bob Hoskins, Denzel Washington, Chloe Webb, Roger E. Mosley, Ja''net DuBois, Alan Rachins, Ray Baker, Jeffrey Meek', 'R', 'Racist police officer Jack Moony has a vendetta against Napoleon Stone, a charismatic black lawyer who is sleeping with Jack''s old flame Crystal Gerrity. Jack has a heart attack, but his life is saved when he receives Stone''s heart, since Stone died mysteriously the same night as Jack was stricken. Stone is not completely gone, however, and as a ghost he is all too happy to give Jack advice on how he should do his job and live his life.', 'Racist police officer Jack Moony has a vendetta against Napoleon Stone, a charismatic black lawyer who is sleeping with Jack''s old flame Crystal Gerrity. Jack has a heart attack, but his life is saved when he receives Stone''s heart, since Stone died mysteriously the same night as Jack was stricken. Stone is not completely gone, however, and as a ghost he is all too happy to give Jack advice on how he should do his job and live his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ApuvU24UEBlWeBiQGRyyOYFeqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41817'),
  ('779611123705218858', 'Heart Eyes', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance', 'Stephen Murphy, Josh Ruben, Lauren Sick', 'Christopher Landon, Michael Kennedy, Phillip Murphy', 'Olivia Holt, Mason Gooding, Gigi Zumbado, Michaela Watkins, Devon Sawa, Jordana Brewster, Yoson An, Alexander Walker', 'R', 'When the "Heart Eyes Killer" strikes Seattle, a pair of co-workers pulling overtime on Valentine''s Day are mistaken for a couple by the elusive couple-hunting killer. Now, they must spend the most romantic night of the year running for their lives.', 'When the "Heart Eyes Killer" strikes Seattle, a pair of co-workers pulling overtime on Valentine''s Day are mistaken for a couple by the elusive couple-hunting killer. Now, they must spend the most romantic night of the year running for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebqttF1Vjgde6uSFBEw9mta7Hd3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1302916'),
  ('775569515394249118', 'Heart for Heaven', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Johnnie Kong, Zhang Cheng', 'Zhang Cheng', 'Teng Shen, Ma Li, Du Xiaoyu, Lam Suet, Wang Zizi, 李元鹏, 苏志丹, Ruoqi Xu', null, 'After he is diagnosed with an incurable brain tumour, and told he has only three to six months to live, wannabe actor-cum-professional conman Shen Mo decides to spend his remaining time doing something more meaningful and for the benefit of society. In the past he has helped the police on several cases, though always kept a low personal profile; now he has decided, with his geeky partner Du Yu, to personally infiltrate some local criminal gangs, including one, led by Yao Dezhi, that sells fake medical supplies and another, led by gangster Jia, that practises phone scams.', 'After he is diagnosed with an incurable brain tumour, and told he has only three to six months to live, wannabe actor-cum-professional conman Shen Mo decides to spend his remaining time doing something more meaningful and for the benefit of society. In the past he has helped the police on several cases, though always kept a low personal profile; now he has decided, with his geeky partner Du Yu, to personally infiltrate some local criminal gangs, including one, led by Yao Dezhi, that sells fake medical supplies and another, led by gangster Jia, that practises phone scams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pk6RoI1tmYWUq6CPhhvaexZ2i7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380948'),
  ('596682179334206950', 'Heart Like a Wheel', 1983, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Kaplan, Tak Fujimoto, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Ken Friedman', 'Bonnie Bedelia, Beau Bridges, Leo Rossi, Hoyt Axton, Bill McKinney, Anthony Edwards, Elliott Mason, Creed Bratton', 'PG', 'Shirley Muldowney is determined to be a top-fuel drag racer, although no woman has ever raced them before. Despite the high risks of this kind of racing and the burden it places on her family life, she perseveres in her dream.', 'Shirley Muldowney is determined to be a top-fuel drag racer, although no woman has ever raced them before. Despite the high risks of this kind of racing and the burden it places on her family life, she perseveres in her dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P06Op4wLd4epWPuobdMUTRuf8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34599'),
  ('839672422937195218', 'Heart of a Dog', 1976, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Alberto Lattuada, Maurizio Rotundi, Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani', 'Mario Gallo, Alberto Lattuada, Viveca Melander', 'Max von Sydow, Eleonora Giorgi, Mario Adorf, Gina Rovere, Cochi Ponzoni, Vadim Glowna, Rena Niehaus, Enzo Robutti', null, 'Professor Preobrazhensky puts courageous experiences, trying to turn a dog in equal to in all of the person. As a result somebody turns out Doggies. Unfortunately, experience proves that it is better for dog to remain a dog.', 'Professor Preobrazhensky puts courageous experiences, trying to turn a dog in equal to in all of the person. As a result somebody turns out Doggies. Unfortunately, experience proves that it is better for dog to remain a dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLdE3ZwNBIIsCulLdny0RVF5gYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105687'),
  ('453647432204389257', 'Heart of a Dog', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Vladimir Bortko, Yuriy Shaygardanov, Yuri Vertlib', 'Nataliya Bortko', 'Evgeniy Evstigneev, Boris Plotnikov, Vladimir Tolokonnikov, Nina Ruslanova, Olga Melikhova, Aleksei Mironov, Roman Kartsev, Anzhelika Nevolina', null, '"Heart of a Dog" is a Soviet film adaptation of Mikhail Bulgakov’s iconic novella. Set in 1920s Moscow, it tells the satirical and darkly humorous story of a stray dog named Sharik, who is transformed into a human by Professor Preobrazhensky through a daring medical experiment. The resulting man, Poligraf Poligrafovich Sharikov, embodies the social and ideological tensions of early Soviet society. With its sharp critique of class struggle, human nature, and the perils of radical change, the film is celebrated for its faithful adaptation, brilliant performances, and rich allegorical depth.', '"Heart of a Dog" is a Soviet film adaptation of Mikhail Bulgakov’s iconic novella. Set in 1920s Moscow, it tells the satirical and darkly humorous story of a stray dog named Sharik, who is transformed into a human by Professor Preobrazhensky through a daring medical experiment. The resulting man, Poligraf Poligrafovich Sharikov, embodies the social and ideological tensions of early Soviet society. With its sharp critique of class struggle, human nature, and the perils of radical change, the film is celebrated for its faithful adaptation, brilliant performances, and rich allegorical depth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kG3DWJ5OIaUZ0RtFEz6O9hEYDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43680'),
  ('283856034834372870', 'Heart of a Dog', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Laurie Anderson', 'Laurie Anderson', 'Archie, Gatto, Lolabelle, Little Will, Nitro, Etta, Heung-Heung Chin, Jenni Muldaur', 'NR', 'Lyrical and powerfully personal essay film that reflects on the deaths of her husband Lou Reed, her mother, her beloved dog, and such diverse subjects as family memories, surveillance, and Buddhist teachings.', 'Lyrical and powerfully personal essay film that reflects on the deaths of her husband Lou Reed, her mother, her beloved dog, and such diverse subjects as family memories, surveillance, and Buddhist teachings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAeaTynkC8WPgna0UTTnb0WGswq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352197'),
  ('77675837242719887', 'Heart of a Lion', 2013, 'Drama', 'Dome Karukoski, Antti Lahtinen, Tommi Kilpiö', 'Aleksi Bardy', 'Peter Franzén, Laura Birn, Jasper Pääkkönen, Yusufa Sidibeh, Jussi Vatanen, Timo Lavikainen, Pamela Tola, Mikko Neuvonen', null, 'Neo-Nazi falls in love with a woman who has a black son and finds himself fighting with conflicting feelings.', 'Neo-Nazi falls in love with a woman who has a black son and finds himself fighting with conflicting feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpeD9IyFZMlxtYQnTc7P8FUJomM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214217'),
  ('1050383003821065623', 'Heart of a Lion', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emiliano T. Caballero, Maritza Daza Buitrago, Jeiver Pinto', 'Marcos Carnevale', 'Marlon Moreno, María Nela Sinisterra, Manolo Cardona, Majida Issa, Brian Moreno, María Eugenia Arboleda, Marcela Carvajal, Diego Trujillo', null, 'After she loses her mobile phone, a lawyer receives a call from the person who found it. They talk and hit it off very quickly. But she''s in shock when she sees that he''s very short.', 'After she loses her mobile phone, a lawyer receives a call from the person who found it. They talk and hit it off very quickly. But she''s in shock when she sees that he''s very short.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifCfsG3QTVxH8Mk3ItTJXRgHl3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440689'),
  ('1151803802188015213', 'Heart of America', 2003, 'Drama', 'Mathias Neumann, Uwe Boll, Colleen Bolton', 'Robert Dean Klein', 'Jürgen Prochnow, Michael Paré, Patrick Muldoon, Birkett Turton, Elisabeth Moss, María Conchita Alonso, Clint Howard, Brendan Fletcher', 'R', 'It is the last day of high school and the unthinkable is about to happen. Distraught at the constant abuse and bullying they have been subjected to, two students have made a suicide pact. But before they take their own lives, they are determined to cause chaos and murder amongst their fellow students.', 'It is the last day of high school and the unthinkable is about to happen. Distraught at the constant abuse and bullying they have been subjected to, two students have made a suicide pact. But before they take their own lives, they are determined to cause chaos and murder amongst their fellow students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDz2bQ60rbxLKuxgIKHucCsqWib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95466'),
  ('34365025081176935', 'Heart of an Oak', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Charbonnier, Michel Seydoux, Julien Le Roux', 'Dominique Mansion, Karine Winczura, Michel Fessler', null, null, 'Once upon a time, there was a pedunculate oak (Quercus robur), born in 1810, 210 years old and a pillar in its kingdom. This spectacular adventure features an extraordinary cast: squirrels, barnacles, jays, ants, field mice... This vibrant, whirring, marvelous little world seals its destiny around the majestic tree that welcomes them, feeds them and protects them from its roots to its crown. A poetic ode to life, in which nature alone expresses itself.', 'Once upon a time, there was a pedunculate oak (Quercus robur), born in 1810, 210 years old and a pillar in its kingdom. This spectacular adventure features an extraordinary cast: squirrels, barnacles, jays, ants, field mice... This vibrant, whirring, marvelous little world seals its destiny around the majestic tree that welcomes them, feeds them and protects them from its roots to its crown. A poetic ode to life, in which nature alone expresses itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lldwEaYQBH5bJGvApQyVG0AZJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916387'),
  ('821612000248101817', 'Heart of Champions', 2021, 'Drama', 'Michael Mailer', 'Vojin Gjaja', 'Michael Shannon, Alexander Ludwig, Charles Melton, Alex MacNicoll, Andrew Creer, Ash Santos, Lilly Krug, Caroline Cole', 'PG-13', 'During their last year at an Ivy League college in 1999, a group of friends and crew teammates'' lives are changed forever when an army vet takes over as coach of their dysfunctional rowing team.', 'During their last year at an Ivy League college in 1999, a group of friends and crew teammates'' lives are changed forever when an army vet takes over as coach of their dysfunctional rowing team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhBhe8DjdFspNjMOyrqD8i9Gy60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647581'),
  ('652399090722883160', 'Heart of Darkness', 1993, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nicolas Roeg, Anthony B. Richmond, Waldo Roeg', 'Benedict Fitzgerald', 'Tim Roth, John Malkovich, Isaach de Bankolé, James Fox, Morten Faldaas, Iman, Alan Scarfe, Patrick Ryecart', null, 'A trading company manager travels up an African river to find a missing outpost head and discovers the depth of evil in humanity''s soul.', 'A trading company manager travels up an African river to find a missing outpost head and discovers the depth of evil in humanity''s soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg2zS4fyoc0N214rjjFtY7Y7rb2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4782'),
  ('768351628372039887', 'Heart of Dixie', 1989, 'Drama', 'Martin Davidson, Robert Elswit, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Tom McCown', 'Ally Sheedy, Don Michael Paul, Virginia Madsen, Phoebe Cates, Treat Williams, Kyle Secor, Peter Berg, Kurtwood Smith', null, 'Three young sorority women try to find love with potential men, while worrying about changes in their way of life when integration begins at their college in 1957 segregated Alabama.', 'Three young sorority women try to find love with potential men, while worrying about changes in their way of life when integration begins at their college in 1957 segregated Alabama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3IadlQq4FeqwSy8unw6qrDhMFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73249'),
  ('87193237875215462', 'Heart of Dragon', 1985, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Mang Hoi, Yuen Wah', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Jackie Chan, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Emily Chu Bo-Yee, Mang Hoi, Melvin Wong, Lam Ching-Ying, Chin Ka-Lok, James Tien Chun', null, 'A policeman forsakes his dream of world travel to care for a mentally impaired brother, who is later kidnapped by gangsters.', 'A policeman forsakes his dream of world travel to care for a mentally impaired brother, who is later kidnapped by gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmMI1yb0yrpri1aanEjijdfxVL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18763'),
  ('634199315753064603', 'Heart of Fire', 2009, 'Drama', 'Luigi Falorni, Judith Kaufmann', 'Senait Mehari', 'Letekidan Micael, Solomie Micael, Seble Tilahun, Daniel Seyoum, Mekdes Wegene, Samuel Semere, Luca Morino', null, 'The true story of a young female soldier who comes of age during the Eritrean civil war.', 'The true story of a young female soldier who comes of age during the Eritrean civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayPWbJ7L25hD6Mn0Xd0HMVw18bN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52814'),
  ('978859406574190576', 'Heart of Glass', 1976, 'Drama', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein', 'Herbert Achternbusch, Werner Herzog', 'Josef Bierbichler, Stefan Güttler, Clemens Scheitz, Sonja Skiba, Volker Prechtel, Brunhilde Klöckner, Wolf Albrecht, Thomas Binkley', 'NR', 'A small Bavarian village is renowned for its "Ruby Glass" glass blowing works. When the foreman of the works dies suddenly without revealing the secret of the Ruby Glass, the town slides into a deep depression, and the owner of the glassworks becomes obssessed with the lost secret.', 'A small Bavarian village is renowned for its "Ruby Glass" glass blowing works. When the foreman of the works dies suddenly without revealing the secret of the Ruby Glass, the town slides into a deep depression, and the owner of the glassworks becomes obssessed with the lost secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaYs87zLoXTK1pPKSMfJQRnwxgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27378'),
  ('581133350112190359', 'Heart of Midnight', 1988, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Matthew Chapman, Ray Rivas, Richard Feury', 'Matthew Chapman', 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Brenda Vaccaro, Jack Hallett, Nicholas Love, James Rebhorn, Tico Wells, Sam Schacht, Nina Lora', 'R', 'A young woman who is getting back on her feet after a mental breakdown, Carol Rivers discovers that her late uncle has left her a rundown nightclub. Carol decides to renovate the venue, but, in the process, uncovers dark secrets about the club and her dead relative. After a series of disturbing events, Carol becomes increasingly unstable, but she finds some measure of comfort in Sharpe, an enigmatic older detective.', 'A young woman who is getting back on her feet after a mental breakdown, Carol Rivers discovers that her late uncle has left her a rundown nightclub. Carol decides to renovate the venue, but, in the process, uncovers dark secrets about the club and her dead relative. After a series of disturbing events, Carol becomes increasingly unstable, but she finds some measure of comfort in Sharpe, an enigmatic older detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6VYMx0fsWU3X8d9UePo1SHQqnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65572'),
  ('1126510408050485916', 'Heart of Paris', 1937, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Allégret', 'Marcel Achard', 'Raimu, Michèle Morgan, Gilbert Gil, Jean Worms, Julien Carette, Marcel André, Jacques Grétillat, Jacques Baumer', null, 'Camille Morestan serves as a jury member at a court in Paris. The attractive Natalie Roguin is accused of murder. Morestan doesn''t want to believe she really killed her lover. He succeeds in convincing the other jury members she was innocent. After her acquittal he takes her into his house. While he tries to keep her identity a secret for his family her presence leads to a number of unfortunate incidents.', 'Camille Morestan serves as a jury member at a court in Paris. The attractive Natalie Roguin is accused of murder. Morestan doesn''t want to believe she really killed her lover. He succeeds in convincing the other jury members she was innocent. After her acquittal he takes her into his house. While he tries to keep her identity a secret for his family her presence leads to a number of unfortunate incidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVFlbP68ClZDw3muyM5KEhWodTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138123'),
  ('534230007655592562', 'Heart of Stone', 1950, 'Family, Drama, Fantasy', 'Bruno Mondi, Paul Verhoeven, Hanna Bark', 'Wolff von Gordon, Paul Verhoeven', 'Lutz Moik, Hanna Rucker, Paul Esser, Paul Bildt, Erwin Geschonneck, Hannsgeorg Laubenthal, Walter Tarrach, Lotte Loebinger', null, 'Lavish adaptation of Wilhelm Hauff′s fairy tale: Young charburner Peter Munk dreams of joining the upper class. He makes a deal with the sinister Holländer-Michel, who offers to trade Peter′s human heart for one made of stone. Once he has the "cold heart" in his body, Peter eventually strikes a fortune and enjoys great wealth, but at the same time, he becomes a bitter and emotionless man – and, having lost all traces of humanity, even murders his wife Lisbeth. Only then does Peter Munk finally realize what has become of him, and he decides to regain his real heart from Holländer-Michel.', 'Lavish adaptation of Wilhelm Hauff′s fairy tale: Young charburner Peter Munk dreams of joining the upper class. He makes a deal with the sinister Holländer-Michel, who offers to trade Peter′s human heart for one made of stone. Once he has the "cold heart" in his body, Peter eventually strikes a fortune and enjoys great wealth, but at the same time, he becomes a bitter and emotionless man – and, having lost all traces of humanity, even murders his wife Lisbeth. Only then does Peter Munk finally realize what has become of him, and he decides to regain his real heart from Holländer-Michel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlkYm9ekfjqqxxSXx0JSvpflt1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13101'),
  ('1080051862562768065', 'Heart of Stone', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Johannes Naber, Pascal Schmit', 'Christian Zipperle, Andreas Marschall, Steffen Reuter', 'Frederick Lau, Henriette Confurius, Milan Peschel, Moritz Bleibtreu, Sebastian Blomberg, David Schütter, André Hennicke, Jule Böwe', null, 'Peter and Lisbeth are two young but unfortunate lovers living in a rigid rural community in the Black Forest. She comes from a wealthy family of glassblowers; he is a poor coal worker on the lower end of society. To become rich and respected, Peter makes a pact with a devil named Dutch Michael, who rips out his heart and replaces it with a stone. Robbed of all warmth and feeling, Peter becomes a cold-hearted go-getter who rapidly achieves his goals. Ruthlessly he strives for money and power.', 'Peter and Lisbeth are two young but unfortunate lovers living in a rigid rural community in the Black Forest. She comes from a wealthy family of glassblowers; he is a poor coal worker on the lower end of society. To become rich and respected, Peter makes a pact with a devil named Dutch Michael, who rips out his heart and replaces it with a stone. Robbed of all warmth and feeling, Peter becomes a cold-hearted go-getter who rapidly achieves his goals. Ruthlessly he strives for money and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WVQSVmXGtY3tJukP67zz9tgBgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382498'),
  ('1108814819163339298', 'Heart of Stone', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'George Steel, Dan Channing-Williams, Robert Alonzo', 'Greg Rucka, Allison Schroeder', 'Gal Gadot, Jamie Dornan, Alia Bhatt, Sophie Okonedo, Matthias Schweighöfer, Paul Ready, Jing Lusi, Enzo Cilenti', 'PG-13', 'An intelligence operative for a shadowy global peacekeeping agency races to stop a hacker from stealing its most valuable — and dangerous — weapon.', 'An intelligence operative for a shadowy global peacekeeping agency races to stop a hacker from stealing its most valuable — and dangerous — weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB8o2p4ETnrfiWEgVxHmHWP9yRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724209'),
  ('818697521008997709', 'Heart of the Holidays', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Corey Sevier, Stephen Chandler Whitehead', 'Kate Pragnell', 'Vanessa Lengies, Corey Sevier, René Escobar Jr., Paul Sun-Hyung Lee, Jayne Eastwood, Andrew Bushell, Tara Joshi, Maria Ricossa', null, 'After her life in New York unexpectedly falls apart, powerhouse stockbroker Sam Wallace returns to her small town for the holidays and reconnects with her high school sweetheart who helps reignite her humanitarian spirit just in time to help their community on Christmas.', 'After her life in New York unexpectedly falls apart, powerhouse stockbroker Sam Wallace returns to her small town for the holidays and reconnects with her high school sweetheart who helps reignite her humanitarian spirit just in time to help their community on Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6gsHd757ghfcZHpR9RjzYz2vBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756727'),
