  ('733741575906341534', 'Heartbeats', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Xavier Dolan, Stéphanie Weber Biron, Francine Langlois', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Monia Chokri, Niels Schneider, Xavier Dolan, Anne Dorval, Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Olivier Morin, Magalie Lépine-Blondeau, Éric Bruneau', 'NR', 'Francis is a young gay man, Marie is a young straight woman and the two of them are best friends -- until the day the gorgeous Nicolas walks into a Montreal coffee shop. The two friends, instantly and equally infatuated, compete for Nicolas'' indeterminate affections, a conflict that climaxes when the trio visit the vacation home of Nicolas'' mother. The frothy comedy unfolds through narrative, fantasy sequences and confessional monologues.', 'Francis is a young gay man, Marie is a young straight woman and the two of them are best friends -- until the day the gorgeous Nicolas walks into a Montreal coffee shop. The two friends, instantly and equally infatuated, compete for Nicolas'' indeterminate affections, a conflict that climaxes when the trio visit the vacation home of Nicolas'' mother. The frothy comedy unfolds through narrative, fantasy sequences and confessional monologues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBGbvzrP4lNV4BZc2wscmglNno2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51241'),
  ('448442311796891564', 'Heartbeats', 2017, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Duane Adler, Ravi Varman', 'Duane Adler', 'Krystal Ellsworth, Amitash Pradhan, Aneesha Joshi, Daphne Zuniga, Paul McGillion, Justin Chon, Prabal Panjabi, Maeve O''Brien', 'PG', 'When a bubbly American hip hop dancer goes to India with her family for a wedding, she is impressed by a new dance style and falls in love with the man who introduced her to it.', 'When a bubbly American hip hop dancer goes to India with her family for a wedding, she is impressed by a new dance style and falls in love with the man who introduced her to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DvBfOx4roI3jg6d1jnLApzEFZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457308'),
  ('537879651463574244', 'Heartbeeps', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Allan Arkush, Charles Rosher Jr., Don Zepfel', 'John Hill', 'Andy Kaufman, Bernadette Peters, Randy Quaid, Kenneth McMillan, Christopher Guest, Melanie Mayron, Richard B. Shull, Dick Miller', 'PG', 'Two domestic robots fall in love and run off together.', 'Two domestic robots fall in love and run off together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxK1jyN8apEUyYerMLStaHIM2z8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73247'),
  ('457314075827765338', 'Heartbreak Hotel', 1988, 'Comedy, Music', 'Chris Columbus, Steve Dobson', 'Chris Columbus', 'David Keith, Tuesday Weld, Charlie Schlatter, Angela Goethals, Jacque Lynn Colton, Chris Mulkey, Karen Landry, Tudor Sherrard', 'PG-13', 'When a teen tries to set up a band at his school, his mother - who was a big fan of Elvis Presley - gets in a wreck. He and his band members then decide to kidnap Elvis and hook him up with his mother.', 'When a teen tries to set up a band at his school, his mother - who was a big fan of Elvis Presley - gets in a wreck. He and his band members then decide to kidnap Elvis and hook him up with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FeHaHPHXsZZle8qAQWTJSGPOji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38615'),
  ('390215228386172127', 'Heartbreak Library', 2008, 'Romance', 'Kim Jeong-kwon, Choe Won-kyung, Yun Myeong-sik', 'Park Eun-young', 'Lee Dong-wook, Lee Jae-yong, Eugene, Ki Joo-bong, Park Hwi-sun, Jo Ah-ra, Yoo Da-in, Jo Deok-hyeon', null, 'Eun-soo, a librarian watches for book vandalism that currently happens in the library. One day, she catches Jun-oh tearing off certain page of books. Eun-soo accuses him of vandalism but soon discovers the complex story behind his actions. Jun-oh’s girlfriend suddenly leaves him with only a mysterious note. “Look up page 198”. Jun-oh’s girlfriend was a bibliophile and she checked out books regularly at the library. Jun-oh goes to the library and tears out page 198 from every book he comes in touch. As Eun-soo has just broken up, she gives him an advice saying that he has to let her go if she really meant it. However, looking at Jun-oh torn apart by his love, Eun-soo starts to help him decipher the messages on page 198 of all the books .', 'Eun-soo, a librarian watches for book vandalism that currently happens in the library. One day, she catches Jun-oh tearing off certain page of books. Eun-soo accuses him of vandalism but soon discovers the complex story behind his actions. Jun-oh’s girlfriend suddenly leaves him with only a mysterious note. “Look up page 198”. Jun-oh’s girlfriend was a bibliophile and she checked out books regularly at the library. Jun-oh goes to the library and tears out page 198 from every book he comes in touch. As Eun-soo has just broken up, she gives him an advice saying that he has to let her go if she really meant it. However, looking at Jun-oh torn apart by his love, Eun-soo starts to help him decipher the messages on page 198 of all the books .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZRdZM2oGS1my9nKVcqa3GpdJWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52426'),
  ('77568820981306715', 'Heartbreak Ridge', 1986, 'War, Drama', 'Clint Eastwood, Jack N. Green, Paul Moen', 'James Carabatsos, Joseph Stinson, Dennis Hackin', 'Clint Eastwood, Marsha Mason, Everett McGill, Moses Gunn, Mario Van Peebles, Eileen Heckart, Bo Svenson, Boyd Gaines', 'R', 'A hard-nosed, hard-living Marine gunnery sergeant clashes with his superiors and his ex-wife as he takes command of a spoiled recon platoon with a bad attitude.', 'A hard-nosed, hard-living Marine gunnery sergeant clashes with his superiors and his ex-wife as he takes command of a spoiled recon platoon with a bad attitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMr99UigkMCTSPnLTpkzJeLmpyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10015'),
  ('1040159313945419408', 'Heartbreaker', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Pascal Chaumeil, Thierry Arbogast', 'Laurent Zeitoun, Jeremy Doner, Yohan Gromb', 'Romain Duris, Vanessa Paradis, Julie Ferrier, François Damiens, Andrew Lincoln, Héléna Noguerra, Jacques Frantz, Jean-Yves Lafesse', null, 'Alex and his sister run a business designed to break up relationships. They are hired by a rich man to break up the wedding of his daughter. The only problem is that they only have one week to do so.', 'Alex and his sister run a business designed to break up relationships. They are hired by a rich man to break up the wedding of his daughter. The only problem is that they only have one week to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sw7Sc4u2A9Y0dZ1543MoGVaQdmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41211'),
  ('457469554302438424', 'Heartbreakers', 1984, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bobby Roth, Michael Ballhaus', 'Bobby Roth', 'Peter Coyote, Carole Laure, Nick Mancuso, Max Gail, James Laurenson, Carol Wayne, Jamie Rose, Kathryn Harrold', 'R', 'Blue, a yet-to-be discovered painter, is left by his longtime girlfriend because she considers him too immature for a lasting relationship. Eli, Blue''s best friend, works for his father''s garment business and is still searching for a woman who''s interesting enough to spend more than one night with. Blue and Eli''s friendship is put to the test when they both fall for Liliane, Blue''s exotic gallerist.', 'Blue, a yet-to-be discovered painter, is left by his longtime girlfriend because she considers him too immature for a lasting relationship. Eli, Blue''s best friend, works for his father''s garment business and is still searching for a woman who''s interesting enough to spend more than one night with. Blue and Eli''s friendship is put to the test when they both fall for Liliane, Blue''s exotic gallerist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiC4Hi0CAOGymKqHbazOVljZNST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91556'),
  ('1059894428867243278', 'Heartbreakers', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Dean Semler, David Mirkin', 'Paul Guay, Stephen Mazur, Robert Dunn', 'Sigourney Weaver, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Jason Lee, Gene Hackman, Ray Liotta, Anne Bancroft, Stacey Travis, Jeffrey Jones', 'PG-13', 'Max and Page are a brilliant mother/daughter con team who have their grift down to a fine science. Max targets wealthy, willing men and marries them. Page then seduces them, and Max catches her husband in the act. Then it''s off to palimony city and the next easy mark.', 'Max and Page are a brilliant mother/daughter con team who have their grift down to a fine science. Max targets wealthy, willing men and marries them. Page then seduces them, and Max catches her husband in the act. Then it''s off to palimony city and the next easy mark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwvec0gRMSpLakcPuxe0RWScNv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10833'),
  ('758061317054664742', 'Heartburn', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mike Nichols, Néstor Almendros, Joel Tuber', 'Nora Ephron', 'Meryl Streep, Jack Nicholson, Jeff Daniels, Maureen Stapleton, Stockard Channing, Richard Masur, Catherine O''Hara, Steven Hill', 'R', 'She''s a magazine writer who gives up her career for love and family. He''s a playboy newspaper columnist who can''t quite give up his old tricks. And if that combination doesn''t give a relationship heartburn, nothing will.', 'She''s a magazine writer who gives up her career for love and family. He''s a playboy newspaper columnist who can''t quite give up his old tricks. And if that combination doesn''t give a relationship heartburn, nothing will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pF1uPAi9TWRSRLf9SHfIDQle2NK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13818'),
  ('147946693388847275', 'HeartCatch PreCure! the Movie: Fashion Show in the City of Flowers!?', 2010, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Rie Matsumoto, Tomokazu Shiratori', 'Takashi Yamada', 'Nana Mizuki, Fumie Mizusawa, Houko Kuwashima, Aya Hisakawa, Taeko Kawata, Motoko Kumai, Cocoro Kikuchi, Yokote Kumiko', null, 'Sakura Kurumi, Erika''s mother, is preparing for a fashion show in Paris. The girls of the school''s fashion club are going to model there, including some high school students. While in Paris, they meet a mysterious boy named Oliver. However, Baron Salamander of the Desert Apostles appears, and the girls transform into Pretty Cures to defend Paris.', 'Sakura Kurumi, Erika''s mother, is preparing for a fashion show in Paris. The girls of the school''s fashion club are going to model there, including some high school students. While in Paris, they meet a mysterious boy named Oliver. However, Baron Salamander of the Desert Apostles appears, and the girls transform into Pretty Cures to defend Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Pedf3UI7SgoY5STeEBzNibZPEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59467'),
  ('989271146436937960', 'Hearth Fires', 1972, 'Drama', 'Jean-Jacques Tarbès, Serge Korber', 'Pierre Uytterhoeven', 'Annie Girardot, Jean Rochefort, Claude Jade, Bernard Le Coq, Bernard Fresson, Gabriella Boccardo, Ilaria Occhini, Jean Bouise', null, 'Alexandre Boursault, a provincial notary, would have been the happiest man alive if his wife did not openly display her political views and participate in all kinds of demonstrations.', 'Alexandre Boursault, a provincial notary, would have been the happiest man alive if his wife did not openly display her political views and participate in all kinds of demonstrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IOGr4Xy7qMUShZUNo0miymiDrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2382'),
  ('1083803545907976804', 'Heartland', 1979, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Richard Pearce, Fred Murphy', 'Beth Ferris', 'Rip Torn, Conchata Ferrell, Barry Primus, Megan Folsom, Lilia Skala, Amy Wright, Jerry Hardin, Mary Boylan', 'PG', 'Widowed Elinor Randall and her young daughter Jerrine arrive in a barren stretch of Wyoming in 1910 after Elinor''s application for work as a housekeeper is accepted by Clyde Stewart, a rancher. The work is back-breaking and the isolation is brutal, particularly as winter arrives. Elinor begins to think about homesteading her own property near Stewart''s ranch, but Stewart tries to dissuade her with explanations about the killing conditions and poor rewards, especially for a woman with no man to help her ranch. Although their temperaments are different and little affection exists, Elinor and Stewart agree to marry and combine homesteads. What lies ahead is the severest test of all.', 'Widowed Elinor Randall and her young daughter Jerrine arrive in a barren stretch of Wyoming in 1910 after Elinor''s application for work as a housekeeper is accepted by Clyde Stewart, a rancher. The work is back-breaking and the isolation is brutal, particularly as winter arrives. Elinor begins to think about homesteading her own property near Stewart''s ranch, but Stewart tries to dissuade her with explanations about the killing conditions and poor rewards, especially for a woman with no man to help her ranch. Although their temperaments are different and little affection exists, Elinor and Stewart agree to marry and combine homesteads. What lies ahead is the severest test of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNLBqiPJE5jpo6PPHKuTFDFfxtj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49427'),
  ('257610411650648756', 'Heartlands', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alwin H. Küchler, Damien O''Donnell', 'Paul Fraser', 'Michael Sheen, Mark Addy, Eric Bristow, Russ Bray, Jim Carter, Celia Imrie, Mark Strong, Phillipa Peak', null, 'Gentle Colin ''Col'' Lawes happily lead a quiet life, running a news agency with his soiled-rotten wife Sandra and playing competition darts in the Atletic Arms team. Colin catches her committing adultery with team captain Geoff, a cop, who pretends Colin abused her. Col is thrown off the team just after it qualified for the league finals in Blackpool. He decides to travel there alone, hoping to win her back.', 'Gentle Colin ''Col'' Lawes happily lead a quiet life, running a news agency with his soiled-rotten wife Sandra and playing competition darts in the Atletic Arms team. Colin catches her committing adultery with team captain Geoff, a cop, who pretends Colin abused her. Col is thrown off the team just after it qualified for the league finals in Blackpool. He decides to travel there alone, hoping to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KDKC1r7QTyzGNS5a7v33VQg4HY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54794'),
  ('464464664295687103', 'Heartless', 2010, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Philip Ridley, Matt Gray', 'Philip Ridley', 'Jim Sturgess, Luke Treadaway, Clémence Poésy, Justin Salinger, Fraser Ayres, Noel Clarke, Ruth Sheen, Dave Florez', null, 'Jamie Morgan is a troubled young man with a facial birthmark, which has left him isolated and fearful, hiding from the world outside. He lives in the East End, notorious for its violent hooded gangs. According to news reports, the gangs are now wearing demon masks. But, one night, after the murder of his mother, Jamie discovers the terrifying truth.', 'Jamie Morgan is a troubled young man with a facial birthmark, which has left him isolated and fearful, hiding from the world outside. He lives in the East End, notorious for its violent hooded gangs. According to news reports, the gangs are now wearing demon masks. But, one night, after the murder of his mother, Jamie discovers the terrifying truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kRaWKYqtx9nyqcIkdTf58igzVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38150'),
  ('258371078132913354', 'Heartless', 2024, 'Drama', 'Luiza Ramos, Laura Mansur, Evgenia Alexandrova', 'Nara Normande, Tião', 'Maya de Vicq, Eduarda Samara, Maeve Jinkings, Erom Cordeiro, Ian Boechat, Kaique Brito, Alaylson Emanuel, Lucas da Silva', null, 'Summer 1996, north-east coast of Brazil. Tamara is enjoying her last weeks at the fishing village she lives in before departing to Brasilia for her studies. One day, she hears about a teenager nicknamed Heartless after a scar she has on her chest. Over the course of the summer, Tamara feels a growing attraction for this mysterious girl.', 'Summer 1996, north-east coast of Brazil. Tamara is enjoying her last weeks at the fishing village she lives in before departing to Brasilia for her studies. One day, she hears about a teenager nicknamed Heartless after a scar she has on her chest. Over the course of the summer, Tamara feels a growing attraction for this mysterious girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCUTysMuTZ3qi4NnTEhxflQgVqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603531'),
  ('294069610446114941', 'Heartman: Rock and Love', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Choi Won-sub, Choi Won Sub', 'Mariano Vera, Pablo Solarz', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Moon Chae-won, Park Ji-hwan', null, 'Once known as the frontman of the rock band Ambulance during his college days, Seung-min now lives a quiet life running a small instrument shop. One day, his legendary first love Bo-na, the girl he never even had the courage to confess to before she suddenly disappeared, unexpectedly reappears in his life. From that moment on, Seung-min''s heart begins to race again. But as old feelings resurface, he finds himself trapped in an awkward predicament: a secret he must never let his first love discover… no matter what.', 'Once known as the frontman of the rock band Ambulance during his college days, Seung-min now lives a quiet life running a small instrument shop. One day, his legendary first love Bo-na, the girl he never even had the courage to confess to before she suddenly disappeared, unexpectedly reappears in his life. From that moment on, Seung-min''s heart begins to race again. But as old feelings resurface, he finds himself trapped in an awkward predicament: a secret he must never let his first love discover… no matter what.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjOLeXTbaI8jKFU5TshnKqFjyag4.jpg', 'plex:movie:no-kids-2026'),
  ('1071128214790890373', 'Hearts and Armour', 1983, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Dante Spinotti, Giacomo Battiato, Ignazio Agosta', 'Sergio Donati, Luciano Vincenzoni', 'Zeudi Araya, Barbara De Rossi, Rick Edwards, Leigh McCloskey, Ronn Moss, Maurizio Nichetti, Tanya Roberts, Giovanni Visentin', 'R', 'Love blossoms between crusader Bradamante—a woman knight wearing an invincible suit of armor—and Moorish prince Ruggero. But a sorceress predicts to Bradamante her beloved will die in battle at the hand of fellow Christian paladin Rolando, whom in turn is in love with Isabella, Ruggero''s sister.', 'Love blossoms between crusader Bradamante—a woman knight wearing an invincible suit of armor—and Moorish prince Ruggero. But a sorceress predicts to Bradamante her beloved will die in battle at the hand of fellow Christian paladin Rolando, whom in turn is in love with Isabella, Ruggero''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piS93N7loUuLpGLmYF3NCOggmHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109279'),
  ('613122842187825383', 'Hearts and Minds', 1974, 'Documentary, War', 'Don Lenzer, Ed Lynch, Eugene Marner', null, 'Clark Clifford, John Foster Dulles, Georges Bidault, Harry S. Truman, Dwight D. Eisenhower, John F. Kennedy, Richard Nixon, Lyndon B. Johnson', 'R', 'Many times during his presidency, Lyndon B. Johnson said that ultimate victory in the Vietnam War depended upon the U.S. military winning the "hearts and minds" of the Vietnamese people. Filmmaker Peter Davis uses Johnson''s phrase in an ironic context in this anti-war documentary, filmed and released while the Vietnam War was still under way, juxtaposing interviews with military figures like U.S. Army Chief of Staff William C. Westmoreland with shocking scenes of violence and brutality.', 'Many times during his presidency, Lyndon B. Johnson said that ultimate victory in the Vietnam War depended upon the U.S. military winning the "hearts and minds" of the Vietnamese people. Filmmaker Peter Davis uses Johnson''s phrase in an ironic context in this anti-war documentary, filmed and released while the Vietnam War was still under way, juxtaposing interviews with military figures like U.S. Army Chief of Staff William C. Westmoreland with shocking scenes of violence and brutality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXnpP2RAZbG3DQufUGcOM5hU4cF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42449'),
  ('7610198117785369', 'Hearts Beat Loud', 2018, 'Music, Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Tiffany Little Canfield, Nicole Real, Michael T. Meador', 'Marc Basch, Brett Haley', 'Nick Offerman, Kiersey Clemons, Blythe Danner, Toni Collette, Sasha Lane, Ted Danson, Jesse Patch, Alex Reznik', 'PG-13', 'In the hip Brooklyn neighborhood of Red Hook, single dad and record store owner Frank is preparing to send his hard-working daughter Sam off to college while being forced to close his vintage shop. Hoping to stay connected through their shared musical passions, Frank urges Sam to turn their weekly jam sessions into a father-daughter live act. After their first song becomes an internet breakout, the two embark on a journey of love, growing up and musical discovery.', 'In the hip Brooklyn neighborhood of Red Hook, single dad and record store owner Frank is preparing to send his hard-working daughter Sam off to college while being forced to close his vintage shop. Hoping to stay connected through their shared musical passions, Frank urges Sam to turn their weekly jam sessions into a father-daughter live act. After their first song becomes an internet breakout, the two embark on a journey of love, growing up and musical discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1wKptD8iXJbtAUSz9OlXS3q4Co.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470333'),
  ('1108581938566181128', 'Hearts in Atlantis', 2001, 'Drama', 'Scott Hicks, Piotr Sobociński, Courtenay Miles', 'William Goldman', 'Anthony Hopkins, Anton Yelchin, Hope Davis, Mika Boorem, David Morse, Alan Tudyk, Tom Bower, Celia Weston', 'PG-13', 'A widowed mother and her son change when a mysterious stranger enters their lives.', 'A widowed mother and her son change when a mysterious stranger enters their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPTEh8vutS5FSCDoR16MWVGHqTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11313'),
  ('92432358569148496', 'Hearts in the Game', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Stacey N. Harding, Jesse D.E. Young', 'Shelby Blake Bartelstein', 'Erin Cahill, Marco Grazzini, Sarah Smyth, Todd Thomson, Jason Fernandes, Olivia Steele-Falconer, Bethany Brown, Jason McKinnon', 'G', 'Hazel Miller is a top publicist in New York City looking to build her empire. Diego Vasquez is a top MLB pitcher for the New York Mets who froze during Game 7 of the World Series. He also happens to be the guy who shattered Hazel’s heart in high school. When Hazel is tasked with spinning Diego''s image, it might be her biggest challenge professionally, and personally, as she takes him back to their hometown in Ohio to deal with what they’ve both left behind.', 'Hazel Miller is a top publicist in New York City looking to build her empire. Diego Vasquez is a top MLB pitcher for the New York Mets who froze during Game 7 of the World Series. He also happens to be the guy who shattered Hazel’s heart in high school. When Hazel is tasked with spinning Diego''s image, it might be her biggest challenge professionally, and personally, as she takes him back to their hometown in Ohio to deal with what they’ve both left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/splXLiA6xejDrsFWmtLSAcsgDzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093768'),
  ('621680648169098298', 'Hearts of Darkness: A Filmmaker''s Apocalypse', 1991, 'Documentary', 'George Hickenlooper, Fax Bahr, Eleanor Coppola', 'George Hickenlooper, Fax Bahr', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Eleanor Coppola, John Milius, George Lucas, Sam Bottoms, Albert Hall, Frederic Forrest, Laurence Fishburne', 'R', 'A chronicle of the production problems — including bad weather, actors'' health, war near the filming locations, and more — which plagued the filming of Apocalypse Now, increasing costs and nearly destroying the life and career of Francis Ford Coppola.', 'A chronicle of the production problems — including bad weather, actors'' health, war near the filming locations, and more — which plagued the filming of Apocalypse Now, increasing costs and nearly destroying the life and career of Francis Ford Coppola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVMCtL3r2nj4fySihDDvamaVkfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4539'),
  ('477222805003788848', 'Hearts of Fire', 1987, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Richard Marquand, Alan Hume', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'Bob Dylan, Fiona, Rupert Everett, Julian Glover, Suzanne Bertish, Susannah Hoffmann, Larry Lamb, Maury Chaykin', 'R', 'A reclusive musician, once a huge rock star, takes a young female protegee. While on a tour she meets a younger, more popular rocker and switches her loyalties.', 'A reclusive musician, once a huge rock star, takes a young female protegee. While on a tour she meets a younger, more popular rocker and switches her loyalties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmQcmvGDqPafoJqGuy2VoibUe3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126836'),
  ('919659605162971539', 'Hearts of the West', 1975, 'Comedy, Western', 'Howard Zieff, Mario Tosi, Jack B. Bernstein', 'Rob Thompson', 'Jeff Bridges, Alan Arkin, Blythe Danner, Andy Griffith, Alex Rocco, Richard B. Shull, Anthony James, Donald Pleasence', 'PG', 'Lewis Tater writes Wild West dime novels and dreams of actually becoming a cowboy. When he goes west to find his dream he finds himself in possession of the loot box of two crooks who tried to rob him.', 'Lewis Tater writes Wild West dime novels and dreams of actually becoming a cowboy. When he goes west to find his dream he finds himself in possession of the loot box of two crooks who tried to rob him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOrOGtucFF39EAXXeM2kY5wGbTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84259'),
  ('629190457636423995', 'Hearts of Winter', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Dana Barnaby, Allan Harmon', 'Alison Spuck McNeeley, Casie Tabanou', 'Jill Wagner, Victor Webster, Rukiya Bernard, Lauren McNamara, Pauline Egan, Jake Guy, Lauren Jackson, Michael Karl Richards', null, 'An interior designer brings new life to the house of a widower and his daughter and finds love in the process.', 'An interior designer brings new life to the house of a widower and his daughter and finds love in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sbTpwoG0MtS8OpmOWx0t0GTF7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656851'),
  ('997721604143841786', 'Hearts on Fire', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aurélien Peyre, Inès Tabarin, Julie Richard', 'Aurélien Peyre, Charlotte Sanson', 'Félix Lefebvre, Anja Verderosa, Suzanne Jouannet, Victor Bonnel, Sarah Henochsberg, Jules Porier, Marie Bucas-Français, Nolan Masraf', null, 'Hugo is 19 years old. Like every summer, he spends his holidays on an Atlantic island, in the small family house. But this year is different: Hugo has undergone a physical transformation and arrives with his girlfriend, Queen, a beautician whose lively chatter and long, glittery nails contrast sharply with the young man’s modesty and shyness. Before long, the couple becomes the focus of everyone’s attention.', 'Hugo is 19 years old. Like every summer, he spends his holidays on an Atlantic island, in the small family house. But this year is different: Hugo has undergone a physical transformation and arrives with his girlfriend, Queen, a beautician whose lively chatter and long, glittery nails contrast sharply with the young man’s modesty and shyness. Before long, the couple becomes the focus of everyone’s attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDoCR7MoG1QX5PAQBorbj5aXR3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1303356'),
  ('952427527499110828', 'Heartsong', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Soner Caner, Vedat Özdemir', 'Soner Caner', 'Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Hazar Ergüçlü, Bülent Emin Yarar, Ali Seçkiner Alıcı, Selim Bayraktar, Şevval Sam, Asiye Dinçsoy, Nazmi Kırık', null, 'While serenading a wedding that quickly implodes, a nomadic musician falls for the bride, who runs afoul of her family. Now he has to save her life.', 'While serenading a wedding that quickly implodes, a nomadic musician falls for the bride, who runs afoul of her family. Now he has to save her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LMdLAReF10fxO1imTiVR9OllNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001692'),
  ('187682978096743701', 'Heartstone', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Guðmundur Arnar Guðmundsson, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Guðmundur Arnar Guðmundsson', 'Baldur Einarsson, Blær Hinriksson, Diljá Valsdóttir, Katla Njálsdóttir, Nína Dögg Filippusdóttir, Sveinn Ólafur Gunnarsson, Søren Malling, Nanna Kristín Magnúsdóttir', null, 'A remote fishing village in Iceland. Teenage boys Thór and Kristján experience a turbulent summer as one tries to win the heart of a girl while the other discovers new feelings toward his best friend. When summer ends and the harsh nature of Iceland takes back its rights, it''s time to leave the playground and face adulthood.', 'A remote fishing village in Iceland. Teenage boys Thór and Kristján experience a turbulent summer as one tries to win the heart of a girl while the other discovers new feelings toward his best friend. When summer ends and the harsh nature of Iceland takes back its rights, it''s time to leave the playground and face adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuYjPaP7RQGwfMQ2hH8Fn2vUgMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350060'),
  ('198090375619850003', 'Heartstopper', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bob Keen', null, 'Nathan Stephenson, James Binkley, Robert Englund, Meredith Henderson, Michael Cram, Ted Ludzik, Lori Hallier, Laura de Carteret', 'R', 'Two hospitalized young people discover that things can get even worse when the dilapidated institution is stranded by a severe storm and a maniac stalks the corridors butchering the patients and staff.', 'Two hospitalized young people discover that things can get even worse when the dilapidated institution is stranded by a severe storm and a maniac stalks the corridors butchering the patients and staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skjeHVCnU7fAym5HKkkl6Mx0uEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10124'),
  ('217818318646246991', 'Heartstrings', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vincent van Gelder, Michel Boujenah', 'Michel Boujenah', 'Charles Berling, Pascal Elbé, Alix Vaillot, Jean-Stan du Pac, Antoine Khorsand, Illan Levi, Vincent Taloche, Aude Ruyter', null, 'A talented cellist, Marie, is secretly losing her sight due to a degenerative eye disease. Determined to attend a prestigious music school, she strikes a pact with her struggling classmate Victor: she’ll help him with his homework if he becomes her “eyes,” helping her hide her condition as she prepares for the entrance exam. As the two grow closer, their arrangement begins to change both of their lives.', 'A talented cellist, Marie, is secretly losing her sight due to a degenerative eye disease. Determined to attend a prestigious music school, she strikes a pact with her struggling classmate Victor: she’ll help him with his homework if he becomes her “eyes,” helping her hide her condition as she prepares for the entrance exam. As the two grow closer, their arrangement begins to change both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9H1erM7Jkp6BLv5fELiTlngVEA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398366'),
  ('369135761314665889', 'Heartthrob', 2017, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Chris Sivertson', 'Chris Sivertson', 'Aubrey Shea, Keir Gilchrist, Peter Facinelli, Jimmy Bennett, Ione Skye, Reza Leal-Smartt, Taylor Dearden, Rebecca Huey', null, 'Sam Maddox, a troubled girl whose father committed suicide, has earned a reputation at her high school for being a bit promiscuous. When Sam begins seeing brilliant, MIT-bound Henry Sinclair, the two opposites really attract. Although Sam doesn''t realize it, Henry is in the grip of an insane romantic obsession, and he will kill anyone who tries to put an end to his star-crossed - and increasingly deadly - romance.', 'Sam Maddox, a troubled girl whose father committed suicide, has earned a reputation at her high school for being a bit promiscuous. When Sam begins seeing brilliant, MIT-bound Henry Sinclair, the two opposites really attract. Although Sam doesn''t realize it, Henry is in the grip of an insane romantic obsession, and he will kill anyone who tries to put an end to his star-crossed - and increasingly deadly - romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR46YGW8yuFwWa2N2ev5WUwzmza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496230'),
  ('10526502253698840', 'Heartworn Highways', 1976, 'Documentary, Music', 'James Szalapski', 'James Szalapski', 'Townes Van Zandt, Steve Earle, David Allan Coe, Peggy Brooks, Guy Clark, Rodney Crowell, Charlie Daniels, Wayne Moss', 'R', 'The music speaks for itself in this performance documentary that highlights some of the biggest names within the country-folk scene in Texas and Tennessee during the last weeks of 1975 and the first weeks of 1976, eschewing narration and staged interviews.', 'The music speaks for itself in this performance documentary that highlights some of the biggest names within the country-folk scene in Texas and Tennessee during the last weeks of 1975 and the first weeks of 1976, eschewing narration and staged interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGu5H4hDTHWSg1apik9OxObgoYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76498'),
  ('955122620867176785', 'Hearty Paws', 2006, 'Drama', 'Park Eun-hyung, Kim Sun-ryung, Bongsoo', 'Shin Dong-ik, Suh Shin-hye', 'Yoo Seung-ho, Kim Hyang-gi, An Kil-kang, Seo Young-hwa, Kim Nan-hwi, Jo Deok-jae, Shin Young-jin, Jung Min-ah', null, '11-year-old Chan-yi is looking after his lovely younger sister So-yi, by himself ever since their mother left them to find her own future. Despite their desperate situation of being abandoned by family and neighbors, these kids try their best to carry on life. One day, a little puppy joins this small family as Chan-yi steals it from an old couple''s kennel as a gift his sister''s birthday.', '11-year-old Chan-yi is looking after his lovely younger sister So-yi, by himself ever since their mother left them to find her own future. Despite their desperate situation of being abandoned by family and neighbors, these kids try their best to carry on life. One day, a little puppy joins this small family as Chan-yi steals it from an old couple''s kennel as a gift his sister''s birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ahh93XzZWbgX19TQlPohwOvf4ne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154326'),
  ('1138588614985695143', 'Heat', 1964, 'Comedy, Music', 'Kazimierz Kutz, Krystyna Krupska-Wysocka, Zbigniew Chmielewski', 'Jadwiga Berens, Jeremi Przybora', 'Barbara Krafftówna, Wiesław Michnikowski, Kalina Jędrusik, Wiesław Gołas, Jeremi Przybora, Jerzy Wasowski, Anna Górna, Jerzy Bielenia', null, 'Two Elderly Men are asked by the Prime Minister to take care of the city for one day. During this time, they have to deal with the heat, a diplomatic conflict, a love rivalry, and a lack of water. They do it in their style – with a song.', 'Two Elderly Men are asked by the Prime Minister to take care of the city for one day. During this time, they have to deal with the heat, a diplomatic conflict, a love rivalry, and a lack of water. They do it in their style – with a song.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpzDLnHDLr1ZWjRj00NNVY24lgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245076'),
  ('855151199325301147', 'Heat', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Morrissey, Paul Morrissey', null, 'Joe Dallesandro, Sylvia Miles, Andrea Feldman, Pat Ast, Eric Emerson, Ray Vestal, Lester Persky, Harold Childe', 'R', 'Former child star Joe Davis, reduced to living in a cheap Hollywood motel while struggling for acting jobs, is lusted after by nearly every woman he meets, including Jessica Todd, a tightly wound feminist who has recently come out as a lesbian. When Jessica''s mother, Sally, an emotionally needy has-been actress, meets Joe, she moves him into her enormous, tacky mansion as her new boy toy and attempts to get him acting work.', 'Former child star Joe Davis, reduced to living in a cheap Hollywood motel while struggling for acting jobs, is lusted after by nearly every woman he meets, including Jessica Todd, a tightly wound feminist who has recently come out as a lesbian. When Jessica''s mother, Sally, an emotionally needy has-been actress, meets Joe, she moves him into her enormous, tacky mansion as her new boy toy and attempts to get him acting work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tryvx6s8abwdJVj45DHjFSxiKZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4579'),
  ('1148630131257558994', 'Heat', 1986, 'Action, Thriller', 'Dick Richards, James A. Contner', 'William Goldman', 'Burt Reynolds, Karen Young, Peter MacNicol, Howard Hesseman, Neill Barry, Diana Scarwid, Joseph Mascolo, Alfie Wise', null, 'Reynolds plays an ex-soldier-of-fortunish character in Vegas, taking "Chaperone" jobs, fighting with the mob, and trying to get enough money together to move to Venice, Italy.', 'Reynolds plays an ex-soldier-of-fortunish character in Vegas, taking "Chaperone" jobs, fighting with the mob, and trying to get enough money together to move to Venice, Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsfL3kmdCbf34r2lykibFjavqVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42023'),
  ('540802528050859976', 'Heat', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Michael Mann, Dante Spinotti, Ami Canaan Mann', 'Michael Mann', 'Al Pacino, Robert De Niro, Val Kilmer, Jon Voight, Tom Sizemore, Diane Venora, Amy Brenneman, Ashley Judd', 'R', 'Obsessive master thief Neil McCauley leads a top-notch crew on various daring heists throughout Los Angeles while determined detective Vincent Hanna pursues him without rest. Each man recognizes and respects the ability and the dedication of the other even though they are aware their cat-and-mouse game may end in violence.', 'Obsessive master thief Neil McCauley leads a top-notch crew on various daring heists throughout Los Angeles while determined detective Vincent Hanna pursues him without rest. Each man recognizes and respects the ability and the dedication of the other even though they are aware their cat-and-mouse game may end in violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umSVjVdbVwtx5ryCA2QXL44Durm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949'),
  ('613279430393241229', 'Heat and Dust', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ivory, Walter Lassally, Kevan Barker', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Julie Christie, Greta Scacchi, Shashi Kapoor, Nickolas Grace, Christopher Cazenove, Zakir Hussain, Julian Glover, Susan Fleetwood', 'R', 'Anne is investigating the life of her grand-aunt Olivia, whose destiny has always been shrouded with scandal. As Anne delves into the history of her grand-aunt, she is led to reconsider her own life.', 'Anne is investigating the life of her grand-aunt Olivia, whose destiny has always been shrouded with scandal. As Anne delves into the history of her grand-aunt, she is led to reconsider her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97SCmQDukEQlyCnM7R3PvxhAgMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67794'),
  ('184664577483700193', 'Heat Lightning', 1934, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Sidney Hickox', 'Warren Duff, Brown Holmes', 'Aline MacMahon, Ann Dvorak, Preston Foster, Lyle Talbot, Glenda Farrell, Frank McHugh, Ruth Donnelly, Theodore Newton', null, 'Olga runs an isolated gas station and restaurant in the stifling hot American desert with her discontented younger sister Myra. When two escaped criminals stop for a bite to eat, Olga is reminded of the past she left behind.', 'Olga runs an isolated gas station and restaurant in the stifling hot American desert with her discontented younger sister Myra. When two escaped criminals stop for a bite to eat, Olga is reminded of the past she left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1EKoIv0q9fdVymPW04foZURkUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87123'),
  ('349707981208029312', 'Heat of Desire', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bernard Lutic, Luc Béraud', 'Jean-Louis Comolli, Jean-André Fieschi, José María Cunillés', 'Patrick Dewaere, Clio Goldsmith, Jeanne Moreau, Guy Marchand, Pierre Dux, José Luis López Vázquez, Luis Andrés, Roland Amstutz', null, 'In France in the near future, revolt and chaos erupt. A right-wing politician, Philippe Muphand, is set to take control when his lady friend Caroline walks out, announcing she will take up with the first fool she sees. The fool is Serge Laine, a professor and author of the prize-winning "Le voyage qui ne finit pas," headed to the train station for tickets to Barcelona where he and his wife will enjoy a second honeymoon and he will lecture at the university. Caroline seduces Serge, and he soon abandons wife, family, job, and honesty to embrace Caroline, the romanticism of Jack London, and murder.', 'In France in the near future, revolt and chaos erupt. A right-wing politician, Philippe Muphand, is set to take control when his lady friend Caroline walks out, announcing she will take up with the first fool she sees. The fool is Serge Laine, a professor and author of the prize-winning "Le voyage qui ne finit pas," headed to the train station for tickets to Barcelona where he and his wife will enjoy a second honeymoon and he will lecture at the university. Caroline seduces Serge, and he soon abandons wife, family, job, and honesty to embrace Caroline, the romanticism of Jack London, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5VmISCMQPnymn38k2iwLrSqUH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241792'),
  ('572144105142632838', 'Heat Vision and Jack', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Ben Stiller', 'Dan Harmon, Rob Schrab', 'Owen Wilson, Jack Black, Ben Stiller, Ron Silver, Christine Taylor, Vincent Schiavelli, O-Lan Jones, Sy Richardson', null, 'As the result of a NASA miscalculation, Astronaut Jack Austin flew too close to the sun, the rays expanding his mind and making him the smartest man on the planet. Now he and his talking motorcycle (who contains the mind of his former roommate) are on the run from NASA and their assassin, actor Ron Silver who want to take his brain. They travel from place to place solving paranormal mysteries with the help of Jack''s newfound ability to become a super genius when his brain absorbs sunlight.', 'As the result of a NASA miscalculation, Astronaut Jack Austin flew too close to the sun, the rays expanding his mind and making him the smartest man on the planet. Now he and his talking motorcycle (who contains the mind of his former roommate) are on the run from NASA and their assassin, actor Ron Silver who want to take his brain. They travel from place to place solving paranormal mysteries with the help of Jack''s newfound ability to become a super genius when his brain absorbs sunlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhy3UIunQbUlpSZQXSbDUc9ca8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184500'),
  ('538552390469623199', 'Heat Wave', 1991, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hideo Gosha, Fujio Morita', 'Kōji Takada', 'Kanako Higuchi, Tatsuya Nakadai, Keiko Oginome, Masahiro Motoki, Rino Katase, Naoto Takenaka, Takuzō Kawatani, Hakuryu', null, 'Rin Jyoshima lost her father to death-by-gambling; years later, she''s grown up in the Kosugi household and has fallen victim to gambling herself.', 'Rin Jyoshima lost her father to death-by-gambling; years later, she''s grown up in the Kosugi household and has fallen victim to gambling herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58wYgSBgnfWnUAI3ah8pWCCnkdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114941'),
  ('521040851263029556', 'Heat Wave', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Lorain, Alexis Durand-Brault', 'Michel Marc Bouchard', 'Marie-Thérèse Fortin, François Arnaud, Marie Brassard, Yvan Benoît, François Létourneau, Véronique Beaudet, Jeff Boudreault, Sophie Desmarais', null, 'After the death of her unfaithful husband, Gisele, a social worker of 52 years, falls madly in love with Yannick, one of her former customers and kleptomaniac addict. She tries to repress her feelings, but the attraction she has for this 19 year old boy is beyond comprehension. Her sister, her boss and two children will each turn, disrupt her secret meetings with her young lover.', 'After the death of her unfaithful husband, Gisele, a social worker of 52 years, falls madly in love with Yannick, one of her former customers and kleptomaniac addict. She tries to repress her feelings, but the attraction she has for this 19 year old boy is beyond comprehension. Her sister, her boss and two children will each turn, disrupt her secret meetings with her young lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xe6SJg2CiaoNfmROfcuWhPj3Oy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50609'),
  ('837244275595234236', 'Heat Wave', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jean-Jacques Jauffret', 'Jean-Jacques Jauffret', 'Adèle Haenel, Sylvie Lachat, Ulysse Grosjean, Yves Ruellan, Isalinde Giovangigli, Julien Bodet, Hubert Colas, Alain Lelouch', null, 'One hot afternoon in the south of France, several paths are converging towards a tragic conclusion. Those involved are: Stéphane and Luigi, two cousins who have just emerged from adolescence; Georges, a retired old man; Amélie, Luigi’s girlfriend; and Amélie’s mother Anne. Little do they know how their lives, scarred by fear, humiliation and weariness, will become intertwined and propel them to a terrible outcome...', 'One hot afternoon in the south of France, several paths are converging towards a tragic conclusion. Those involved are: Stéphane and Luigi, two cousins who have just emerged from adolescence; Georges, a retired old man; Amélie, Luigi’s girlfriend; and Amélie’s mother Anne. Little do they know how their lives, scarred by fear, humiliation and weariness, will become intertwined and propel them to a terrible outcome...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Sm9w8doSTAyxQnixNBvjpQpxqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110965'),
