  ('147273066620222419', 'Heatwave', 2015, 'Crime', 'Raphaël Jacoulot, Marc Le Hingrat', 'Raphaël Jacoulot', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Grégory Gadebois, Karim Leklou, Carole Franck, Isabelle Sadoyan, Serra Yılmaz, Camille Figuereo, Agathe Dronne', null, 'In a small village of the South of France, life is made difficult by a sweltering heat wave and its corollary, a worrisome lack of water. Everyone is under great pressure, especially the farmers whose fields are not irrigated. Which is the reason why the residents are less and less well-disposed toward one of them, Joseph, a young man whose never-ending antics are becoming, in such fraught context, something of an intolerable inconvenience. The mayor tries desperately to calm things down but nothing helps...', 'In a small village of the South of France, life is made difficult by a sweltering heat wave and its corollary, a worrisome lack of water. Everyone is under great pressure, especially the farmers whose fields are not irrigated. Which is the reason why the residents are less and less well-disposed toward one of them, Joseph, a young man whose never-ending antics are becoming, in such fraught context, something of an intolerable inconvenience. The mayor tries desperately to calm things down but nothing helps...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzV8SBukDHybdCqKqDdwRbvhUT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351186'),
  ('821305573644355968', 'Heatwave', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Tyler Walzak, Ernie Barbarash, John Milton Branton', 'Chris Sivertson', 'Kat Graham, Merritt Patterson, Sebastian Roché, Cardi Wong, Roger Cross, Aren Buchholz, Kayla Wallace, David James Lewis', 'R', 'A woman''s life takes an unexpected turn when she falls for her boss''s wife. She must soon defend herself as she becomes entangled in a web of malice.', 'A woman''s life takes an unexpected turn when she falls for her boss''s wife. She must soon defend herself as she becomes entangled in a web of malice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtbZAMcriHlHmB24GhBRlLa29dA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928270'),
  ('953429806971734607', 'Heaven', 1999, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Scott Reynolds', 'Scott Reynolds', 'Martin Donovan, Joanna Going, Daniel Edwards, Richard Schiff, Patrick Malahide, Karl Urban, Michael Langley, Barry Spring', 'R', 'A struggling architect, being sued for divorce by his wife and struggling with booze and gambling, finds work remodeling a friend''s strip club, the Paradise. There he meets a transsexual stripper who is bothered by accurate, but extremely violent visions of future events. The increasingly violent visions start including the architect, who doesn''t believe in the prophesy. One who does however is a psychiatrist who is seeing both the stripper and the architect and is sleeping with the ex-wife. He uses the prophecies for his own financial gain. Finally the scenes from the vision move into reality amidst many plot turns.', 'A struggling architect, being sued for divorce by his wife and struggling with booze and gambling, finds work remodeling a friend''s strip club, the Paradise. There he meets a transsexual stripper who is bothered by accurate, but extremely violent visions of future events. The increasingly violent visions start including the architect, who doesn''t believe in the prophesy. One who does however is a psychiatrist who is seeing both the stripper and the architect and is sleeping with the ex-wife. He uses the prophecies for his own financial gain. Finally the scenes from the vision move into reality amidst many plot turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqRpQjuV5oGaP4DXexXN4S0UgXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213985'),
  ('395019061516680977', 'Heaven', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance, Crime', 'Tom Tykwer, Frank Griebe', 'Krzysztof Piesiewicz, Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Cate Blanchett, Giovanni Ribisi, Remo Girone, Stefania Rocca, Alessandro Sperduti, Mattia Sbragia, Stefano Santospago, Alberto Di Stasio', 'R', 'A woman takes the law into her own hands after police ignore her pleas to arrest the man responsible for her husband''s death, and finds herself not only under arrest for murder but falling in love with an officer.', 'A woman takes the law into her own hands after police ignore her pleas to arrest the man responsible for her husband''s death, and finds herself not only under arrest for murder but falling in love with an officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPdtOuGtcQt655uRrmIdBkSRmVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10575'),
  ('965511360334888743', 'Heaven', 2018, 'Drama', 'Margarita Poseck, Edmundo Cofré, Jorge Aguilar', 'Eugenia Poseck', 'Alessandra Guerzoni, Lotte Haack, Gerardo Ebert, Bernardita Hurtado, Juan Ossa', null, 'Bastien returns to the place where she spent her childhood, that happy time when she fell in love with Juan, the maid’s son. Juan and Bastien establish a star-crossed love and hasten events that will lead her family to make dramatic decisions and put an end to a romance that oversteps accepted standards.', 'Bastien returns to the place where she spent her childhood, that happy time when she fell in love with Juan, the maid’s son. Juan and Bastien establish a star-crossed love and hasten events that will lead her family to make dramatic decisions and put an end to a romance that oversteps accepted standards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFWhcClKVO1LkpjUpL3yfhmMhuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552362'),
  ('1102263834800344470', 'Heaven & Earth', 1993, 'History, War, Drama', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson', 'Oliver Stone', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Joan Chen, Haing S. Ngor, Debbie Reynolds, Conchata Ferrell, Dustin Nguyễn, Vivian Wu, Robert John Burke', 'R', 'In a small Vietnamese village torn apart by war, a young woman faces unimaginable horrors before deciding to escape to the city. There, she encounters a compassionate Marine who offers her hope and a chance at a new life, igniting the possibility of a future together.', 'In a small Vietnamese village torn apart by war, a young woman faces unimaginable horrors before deciding to escape to the city. There, she encounters a compassionate Marine who offers her hope and a chance at a new life, igniting the possibility of a future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xn3Oc3GwZwWrpd6KbEEPrA4h6EY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31642'),
  ('428436408350736784', 'Heaven and Earth', 1990, 'Drama, History, War', 'Haruki Kadokawa, Yonezō Maeda, Mitsuyuki Yakushiji', 'Haruki Kadokawa, Toshio Kamata, Isao Yoshiwara', 'Takaaki Enoki, Masahiko Tsugawa, Atsuko Asano, Naomi Zaizen, Hironobu Nomura, Toshiya Ito, Akira Hamada, Masataka Naruse', null, 'Warlords Kagetora and Takeda each wish to prevent the other from gaining hegemony in feudal Japan. The two samurai leaders pursue one another across the countryside, engaging in massive battles of cavalry and infantry. Younger and less brutal, Kagetora must find the strength to be as brutal as his opponent, but at what cost?', 'Warlords Kagetora and Takeda each wish to prevent the other from gaining hegemony in feudal Japan. The two samurai leaders pursue one another across the countryside, engaging in massive battles of cavalry and infantry. Younger and less brutal, Kagetora must find the strength to be as brutal as his opponent, but at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp9OdVRSzol2kFo4I8VDzQnfBCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41845'),
  ('121047384178843403', 'Heaven and Earth', 1994, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'David Lai Tai-Wai, Mau Kin-Tak, Ling Yun', 'Aychi Chan', 'Andy Lau, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Cherie Chan Siu-Ha, Ku Pao-Ming, King Shih-chieh, Yu Feihong, Hon San', null, 'Cheung Ye Pang (Andy Lau) is a Cantonese detective out to combat opium sellers. Encountering high-level corruption along with close friends being murdered, Pang sets out to stop the dealers.', 'Cheung Ye Pang (Andy Lau) is a Cantonese detective out to combat opium sellers. Encountering high-level corruption along with close friends being murdered, Pang sets out to stop the dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRGN5bAkH5KvFGQzsgAvPpqrlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261288'),
  ('956515442606226918', 'Heaven and Earth Magic', 1962, 'Animation', 'Harry Smith', null, null, null, 'The first part depicts the heroine''s toothache consequent to the loss of a very valuable watermelon, her dentistry and transportation to heaven. Next follows an elaborate exposition of the heavenly land, in terms of Israel and Montreal. The second part depicts the return to Earth from being eaten by Max Müller on the day Edward VII dedicated the Great Sewer of London.', 'The first part depicts the heroine''s toothache consequent to the loss of a very valuable watermelon, her dentistry and transportation to heaven. Next follows an elaborate exposition of the heavenly land, in terms of Israel and Montreal. The second part depicts the return to Earth from being eaten by Max Müller on the day Edward VII dedicated the Great Sewer of London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRmNclmohml4V4pSPhVcw2ki0y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85428'),
  ('258181803450979070', 'Heaven and Hell', 2012, 'Horror', 'Yuthlert Sippapak, Tiwa Moeithaisong, Puttipong Nakthong', 'Kosess Chalidtiporn, Kiattisak Sriranosung, Kiradej Ketakinta', 'Akarin Akaranitimaytharatt, Natta Bangkhomnet, Nattaya Bangkhomnet, Taweewat Wantha, Pornchai Hongrattanaporn, Jampar Saenprom, Prinya Ngamwongwarn, Sukhapat Lohwacharin', null, 'Three short horror tales make up Heaven and Hell. The movie use images from surveillance cameras set up in a person''s home and in a convenience store.', 'Three short horror tales make up Heaven and Hell. The movie use images from surveillance cameras set up in a person''s home and in a convenience store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vLtOVUzwhaRasTfnepFq5Yp2bC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148882'),
  ('954182977130663887', 'Heaven Can Wait', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Edward Cronjager, Henry Weinberger', 'Samson Raphaelson', 'Don Ameche, Gene Tierney, Charles Coburn, Marjorie Main, Laird Cregar, Spring Byington, Allyn Joslyn, Eugene Pallette', 'NR', 'Spoiled playboy Henry van Cleve dies and arrives at the entrance to Hell, a final destination he is sure he deserves after living a life of profligacy. The devil, however, isn''t so sure Henry meets Hell''s standards. Convinced he is where he belongs, Henry recounts his life''s deeds, both good and bad, including an act of indiscretion during his 25-year marriage to his wife, Martha, with the hope that "His Excellency" will arrive at the proper judgment.', 'Spoiled playboy Henry van Cleve dies and arrives at the entrance to Hell, a final destination he is sure he deserves after living a life of profligacy. The devil, however, isn''t so sure Henry meets Hell''s standards. Convinced he is where he belongs, Henry recounts his life''s deeds, both good and bad, including an act of indiscretion during his 25-year marriage to his wife, Martha, with the hope that "His Excellency" will arrive at the proper judgment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4kM8PSYhUbZAsfmFu5WrSgGDUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18727'),
  ('958598715168603836', 'Heaven Can Wait', 1978, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Buck Henry, William A. Fraker, Warren Beatty', 'Elaine May, Warren Beatty', 'Warren Beatty, Julie Christie, James Mason, Jack Warden, Charles Grodin, Dyan Cannon, Buck Henry, Vincent Gardenia', 'PG', 'Joe Pendleton is a quarterback preparing to lead his team to the superbowl when he is almost killed in an accident. An overanxious angel plucks him to heaven only to discover that he wasn''t ready to die, and that his body has been cremated. A new body must be found, and that of a recently-murdered millionaire is chosen. His wife and accountant—the murderers—are confused by this development, as he buys the L.A. Rams in order to once again quarterback them into the Superbowl.', 'Joe Pendleton is a quarterback preparing to lead his team to the superbowl when he is almost killed in an accident. An overanxious angel plucks him to heaven only to discover that he wasn''t ready to die, and that his body has been cremated. A new body must be found, and that of a recently-murdered millionaire is chosen. His wife and accountant—the murderers—are confused by this development, as he buys the L.A. Rams in order to once again quarterback them into the Superbowl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1yOiO9cow6gwmGxSAWvPdY4lhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12185'),
  ('177448631102916202', 'Heaven Can''t Wait', 2023, 'Documentary', 'José María Zavala', null, null, null, 'The moving story of Carlo Acutis, a young British-Italian amateur computer programmer who died in 2006, aged 15, as a result of leukemia. However, even though he is no longer here, to this day Carlo continues to be a great symbol of strength among young people. The documentary brings together a series of reports from people who entrusted themselves to the intercession of the boy, beatified by the Catholic Church in 2020, and had their lives transformed.', 'The moving story of Carlo Acutis, a young British-Italian amateur computer programmer who died in 2006, aged 15, as a result of leukemia. However, even though he is no longer here, to this day Carlo continues to be a great symbol of strength among young people. The documentary brings together a series of reports from people who entrusted themselves to the intercession of the boy, beatified by the Catholic Church in 2020, and had their lives transformed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCbNscxh1Em6iDA3n64ZSceHc7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089835'),
  ('120616813156548143', 'Heaven Help Us', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Dinner, Miroslav Ondříček', 'Charles Purpura', 'Donald Sutherland, John Heard, Andrew McCarthy, Mary Stuart Masterson, Kevin Dillon, Malcolm Danare, Jennifer Dundas, Kate Reid', 'R', 'Sixteen-year-old Michael Dunn arrives at St. Basil''s Catholic Boys School in Brooklyn circa 1965. There, he befriends all of the misfits in his class as they collide with the repressive faculty and discover the opposite sex as they come of age.', 'Sixteen-year-old Michael Dunn arrives at St. Basil''s Catholic Boys School in Brooklyn circa 1965. There, he befriends all of the misfits in his class as they collide with the repressive faculty and discover the opposite sex as they come of age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZ345bJOpi30Nb5ZN6qDGySOAOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40929'),
  ('1046284559170803859', 'Heaven in Hell', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Norberto Ramos del Val, César Montegrifo', 'Pablo Vázquez', 'Álvaro Lafora, Belén Riquelme, Mariu Bárcena, Isabel Morán', null, 'Romeo and Desi love each other ... in their own way ... The irreverent Norberto Ramos'' latest work is a black comedy about abuse, completely excessive like any good giallo, confit with the strange and gloomy sounds of the most bizarre and deranged synthesizers. A sort of Vangelis hangover after partying with Edgar Froese and John Carpenter at Georgio Moroder''s house.', 'Romeo and Desi love each other ... in their own way ... The irreverent Norberto Ramos'' latest work is a black comedy about abuse, completely excessive like any good giallo, confit with the strange and gloomy sounds of the most bizarre and deranged synthesizers. A sort of Vangelis hangover after partying with Edgar Froese and John Carpenter at Georgio Moroder''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rs9nR3bZlc5MnEdm6eTHNzJGPqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456809'),
  ('29450136987000700', 'Heaven In Your Eyes', 2012, null, 'Pedro Pablo Ibarra, Fido Pérez-Gavilán', 'Rafael Gaytán, Enrique Chmelnik', 'Aislinn Derbez, Mané de la Parra, Jaime Camil, Danna García, Natalia Lafourcade, Juan Pablo Raba', null, 'Pepe, a very talented singer, but not very sure about himself, is going to sing on FICLA and he is very nervous. The same day of the contest, he meets Abril, a very beautiful astronomer. Pepe thinks she is the perfect woman for him, because there is a lot of chemistry between both of them, and he thinks it’s love at first sight. Nevertheless she is getting married that night. What could Pepe do in a very short time? Which plans does the destiny have for him?', 'Pepe, a very talented singer, but not very sure about himself, is going to sing on FICLA and he is very nervous. The same day of the contest, he meets Abril, a very beautiful astronomer. Pepe thinks she is the perfect woman for him, because there is a lot of chemistry between both of them, and he thinks it’s love at first sight. Nevertheless she is getting married that night. What could Pepe do in a very short time? Which plans does the destiny have for him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiDSmAL4g1LyhMXOHthkkdh89Wv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154181'),
  ('587980346064245649', 'Heaven Is for Real', 2014, 'Drama', 'Randall Wallace, Dean Semler', 'Chris Parker, Randall Wallace', 'Greg Kinnear, Kelly Reilly, Connor Corum, Thomas Haden Church, Jacob Vargas, Lane Styles, Darren Felbel, Ali Tataryn', 'PG', 'After their young son, Colton, undergoes emergency surgery, small-town parents Todd and Sonja Burpo are overjoyed at the child''s miraculous recovery. However, the Burpos are unprepared for what happens next... Colton says that during his surgery he went to heaven and back, and tells his parents things that he couldn''t possibly know. Can Todd find the courage and conviction to share his son''s extraordinary, life-changing experience with the world?', 'After their young son, Colton, undergoes emergency surgery, small-town parents Todd and Sonja Burpo are overjoyed at the child''s miraculous recovery. However, the Burpos are unprepared for what happens next... Colton says that during his surgery he went to heaven and back, and tells his parents things that he couldn''t possibly know. Can Todd find the courage and conviction to share his son''s extraordinary, life-changing experience with the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsFovEJuZHVgpvFTHXb37l7ma4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236751'),
  ('27048643295755433', 'Heaven Is Still Far Away', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi, Toru Takano, Yoshio Kitagawa', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi', 'Nao Okabe, An Ogawa, Hyunri', null, 'Yuzo and Mitsuki live together in Yuzo''s small apartment, their constant companionship tender and indifferent in turn. Then Yuzo receives a call from Satsuki, a documentarian resolved to make a film about a now-distant family tragedy, and the three meet, to search for some way to account for their relationship with one another, the memories they share, and those they''ve kept to themselves.', 'Yuzo and Mitsuki live together in Yuzo''s small apartment, their constant companionship tender and indifferent in turn. Then Yuzo receives a call from Satsuki, a documentarian resolved to make a film about a now-distant family tragedy, and the three meet, to search for some way to account for their relationship with one another, the memories they share, and those they''ve kept to themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2X3vSRCXw5WNM1Ldb4ZGT4liYGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524501'),
  ('778973692282807246', 'Heaven Knows What', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Josh Safdie, Benny Safdie, Sean Price Williams', 'Josh Safdie, Ronald Bronstein', 'Arielle Holmes, Caleb Landry Jones, Eléonore Hendricks, Buddy Duress, Necro, Isaac Adams, Diana Singh, Benjamin Hampton', 'R', 'A young heroin addict roams the streets of New York to panhandle and get her next fix, while her unstable boyfriend drifts in and out of her life at random.', 'A young heroin addict roams the streets of New York to panhandle and get her next fix, while her unstable boyfriend drifts in and out of her life at random.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oyWMOWJ6trsRuyzn5cHPv50zVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285024'),
  ('39902399020839369', 'Heaven Knows, Mr. Allison', 1957, 'Adventure, War, Drama', 'John Huston, Oswald Morris, Adrian Pryce-Jones', 'John Lee Mahin, John Huston', 'Deborah Kerr, Robert Mitchum', null, 'A Roman Catholic nun and a hard-bitten US Marine are stranded together on a Japanese-occupied island in the South Pacific during World War II. Under constant threat of discovery by a ruthless enemy, they hide in a cave and forage for food together. Their forced companionship and the struggle for survival forge a powerful emotional bond between them.', 'A Roman Catholic nun and a hard-bitten US Marine are stranded together on a Japanese-occupied island in the South Pacific during World War II. Under constant threat of discovery by a ruthless enemy, they hide in a cave and forage for food together. Their forced companionship and the struggle for survival forge a powerful emotional bond between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90jAEsc3teDWpDr5wiAmcxAjuVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37103'),
  ('935796065361503026', 'Heaven Scent', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'On the French Riviera, a female cat is frightened by sudden outbursts of barking by every dog around her. So, to scare them away, she paints her back with a white stripe like that of a skunk. But she doesn''t receive the peace she''d expected, because Pepé Le Pew, the amorous French skunk, sees her, thinks she''s a girl skunk, and pursues her.', 'On the French Riviera, a female cat is frightened by sudden outbursts of barking by every dog around her. So, to scare them away, she paints her back with a white stripe like that of a skunk. But she doesn''t receive the peace she''d expected, because Pepé Le Pew, the amorous French skunk, sees her, thinks she''s a girl skunk, and pursues her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aqhdtq9VWqPbkO79jlegIzbebJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147285'),
  ('716423420175573849', 'Heaven Sent', 1994, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Craig Clyde', 'Craig Clyde, James Hennessy', 'David Bowe, Wilford Brimley, Mary Elizabeth McDonough, Vincent Kartheiser, William Christopher, K.C. Clyde, David "Shark" Fralick, Geoffrey Lower', 'PG', 'Eddie, a fourteen-year-old juvenile delinquent of sorts, collides with a car during a petty theft and dies in the hospital. Due to some confusion in heaven, however, he is given three days to clean up his life with the help of a beginner angel - and save his mom.', 'Eddie, a fourteen-year-old juvenile delinquent of sorts, collides with a car during a petty theft and dies in the hospital. Due to some confusion in heaven, however, he is given three days to clean up his life with the help of a beginner angel - and save his mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LczF3vSmgPWsCDLnMjS6cBoXDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193956'),
  ('491890087214390991', 'Heaven Will Wait', 2016, 'Drama', 'Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar, Myriam Vinocour', 'Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar, Émilie Frèche', 'Noémie Merlant, Naomi Amarger, Sandrine Bonnaire, Clotilde Courau, Zinedine Soualem, Yvan Attal, Ariane Ascaride, Samia Sassi', null, 'Mélanie, 16 years old, lives with her mother. She likes going to school, her friends, playing the cello, and she wants to change the world. But when she meets a boy on the Internet and falls in love with him, her world changes as she is gradually recruited by Daesh. Sonia is 17 years old, and she almost did something irrevocable to “guarantee” her family a place in paradise. These teenage girls might be called Anaïs, Manon or Leila, and one day they all might go some way down the recruitment process. But can they ever come back from it?', 'Mélanie, 16 years old, lives with her mother. She likes going to school, her friends, playing the cello, and she wants to change the world. But when she meets a boy on the Internet and falls in love with him, her world changes as she is gradually recruited by Daesh. Sonia is 17 years old, and she almost did something irrevocable to “guarantee” her family a place in paradise. These teenage girls might be called Anaïs, Manon or Leila, and one day they all might go some way down the recruitment process. But can they ever come back from it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFQTCXF9dEZyDSai6cA286daszr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408299'),
  ('179404788872042927', 'Heaven with a Gun', 1969, 'Western', 'Lee H. Katzin, Fred J. Koenekamp, William P. Owens', 'Richard Carr', 'Glenn Ford, Carolyn Jones, Barbara Hershey, John Anderson, David Carradine, J.D. Cannon, Noah Beery Jr., Harry Townes', null, 'Jim Killian arrives in a small Arizona town hoping to establish a peaceful life as the local preacher, but he soon finds himself in the middle of a feud between sheep ranchers and cattlemen. Leloopa, a young Native American woman, pleads for Killian''s help after her shepherd father is hung by Coke Beck, the vicious son of the head cattle rancher. Killian must weigh his actions carefully lest he perpetuate the cycle of retribution and revenge.', 'Jim Killian arrives in a small Arizona town hoping to establish a peaceful life as the local preacher, but he soon finds himself in the middle of a feud between sheep ranchers and cattlemen. Leloopa, a young Native American woman, pleads for Killian''s help after her shepherd father is hung by Coke Beck, the vicious son of the head cattle rancher. Killian must weigh his actions carefully lest he perpetuate the cycle of retribution and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwqCdQmOrQuVOuhKaYELqONlwlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1790'),
  ('362458818492047162', 'Heaven''s Bookstore', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tetsuo Shinohara, Shogo Ueno, Masaaki Taniguchi', 'Tetsuo Shinohara, Kyoko Inukai', 'Yuko Takeuchi, Tetsuji Tamayama, Karina, Hirofumi Arai, Koji Ohkura, Yoichiro Saito, Ayumu Saito, Kazuko Kato', null, 'Kenta, a young pianist who has just lost his job, is drowning his woes at a bar, when he meets a man in a Hawaiian shirt named Yamaki. He invites Kenta to work with him, and the next thing he knows, Kenta wakes up to find himself in a room he has never been in before. It is a strange room that seems to have no connection to life. He descends a staircase to find many shelves of books.', 'Kenta, a young pianist who has just lost his job, is drowning his woes at a bar, when he meets a man in a Hawaiian shirt named Yamaki. He invites Kenta to work with him, and the next thing he knows, Kenta wakes up to find himself in a room he has never been in before. It is a strange room that seems to have no connection to life. He descends a staircase to find many shelves of books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAtigKwPuLKwar6pS0NjSQ31otS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110850'),
  ('847786773156137454', 'Heaven''s Burning', 1997, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Craig Lahiff, Brian J. Breheny', 'Louis Nowra', 'Russell Crowe, Youki Kudoh, Kenji Isomura, Ray Barrett, Robert Mammone, Petru Gheorghiu, Anthony Phelan, Matthew Dyktynski', 'R', 'In Sydney, the newly married Midori is honeymooning with her husband, Yukio. She does not love him and fakes her own kidnapping to escape the marriage. Her lover is supposed to meet her, but fails to appear. She goes to a bank to get some cash, only to become a hostage in an unfolding robbery, until the getaway driver, Colin, saves her from his fellow robbers. They hit the road together, with the cops, her husband and the robbers in pursuit.', 'In Sydney, the newly married Midori is honeymooning with her husband, Yukio. She does not love him and fakes her own kidnapping to escape the marriage. Her lover is supposed to meet her, but fails to appear. She goes to a bank to get some cash, only to become a hostage in an unfolding robbery, until the getaway driver, Colin, saves her from his fellow robbers. They hit the road together, with the cops, her husband and the robbers in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7l2BgeJCNhiFwRrK5p5FhjliG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70581'),
  ('232395528924418396', 'Heaven''s Door', 2009, 'Drama', 'Michael Arias, Toru Yamamoto', 'Thomas Jahn', 'Tomoya Nagase, Mayuko Fukuda, Keishi Nagatsuka, Koji Ohkura, Soko Wada, Masaya Kikawada, Min Tanaka, Tomokazu Miura', null, 'A young man Tomoya Nagase and a girl Mayuko Fukuda both learn that they have an untreatable illness and are nearing death. When one reveals that they have never been to the ocean, they embark on a comical adventure to see the sea.', 'A young man Tomoya Nagase and a girl Mayuko Fukuda both learn that they have an untreatable illness and are nearing death. When one reveals that they have never been to the ocean, they embark on a comical adventure to see the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZuZLeRZbeg5vRWBm6At5NrNMFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39799'),
  ('820569171261860188', 'Heaven''s Gate', 1980, 'Drama, Western, History', 'Michael Cimino, Vilmos Zsigmond, Michael Grillo', 'Michael Cimino', 'Kris Kristofferson, Christopher Walken, John Hurt, Sam Waterston, Brad Dourif, Isabelle Huppert, Joseph Cotten, Jeff Bridges', 'R', 'Harvard graduate James Averill serves as the sheriff of prosperous Jackson County, Wyoming, standing at the center of a conflict between impoverished immigrants and affluent cattle farmers. Politically connected ranchers enlist mercenary Nathan Champion—who is also vying for the affections of local madam Ella Watson—to combat the immigrant uprising. As tensions escalate, both Averill and Champion start to question their decisions.', 'Harvard graduate James Averill serves as the sheriff of prosperous Jackson County, Wyoming, standing at the center of a conflict between impoverished immigrants and affluent cattle farmers. Politically connected ranchers enlist mercenary Nathan Champion—who is also vying for the affections of local madam Ella Watson—to combat the immigrant uprising. As tensions escalate, both Averill and Champion start to question their decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW4Vk31nhtKPKGuYMaVATq3wcHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10935'),
  ('302762389190140713', 'Heaven''s Lost Property Final – The Movie: Eternally My Master', 2014, 'Animation, Romance, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Nozomi Shitara, Tsubasa Yokoyama, Hisashi Saito', 'Suu Minazuki', 'Saori Hayami, Soichiro Hoshi, Aki Toyosaki, Yoko Hikasa, Mina, Iori Nomizu, Ayahi Takagaki, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', null, 'Ikaros is an Angeloid and falls out of the sky. Tomoki Sakurai is a boy who believes the most important thing is to live a peaceful life. The two live tougher. Tomoki Sakurai has never seen Ikaros smile. Tomoki Sakurai sees Nymph and Astraea laugh after they got free from the master’s rule. He hopes Ikaros can laugh like an ordinary girl. This movie wraps up the story of Tomoki Sakurai and his relationship with the Angeloid from the sky, Ikaros.', 'Ikaros is an Angeloid and falls out of the sky. Tomoki Sakurai is a boy who believes the most important thing is to live a peaceful life. The two live tougher. Tomoki Sakurai has never seen Ikaros smile. Tomoki Sakurai sees Nymph and Astraea laugh after they got free from the master’s rule. He hopes Ikaros can laugh like an ordinary girl. This movie wraps up the story of Tomoki Sakurai and his relationship with the Angeloid from the sky, Ikaros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZt3jMOzTG1MyF9bPfKEE67VB7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246464'),
  ('847683154461256757', 'Heaven''s Lost Property the Movie: The Angeloid of Clockwork', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Nanae Hirabayashi, Tetsuya Yanagisawa, Hideki Imaizumi', 'Yuko Kakihara', 'Soichiro Hoshi, Saori Hayami, Mina, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Ayahi Takagaki, Iori Nomizu, Asuka Ohgame, Yoko Hikasa', 'R', 'Sakurai Tomoki goes on a trip to a hot spring, and is soon up to his usual perverted antics. In addition, he''s about to receive his first love confession! However, his desire to pass his days peacefully is challenged once again by another Angeloid. Compared with the hostile Angeloids he had encountered in the past, this new Type Zeta Angeloid is by far the most powerful!', 'Sakurai Tomoki goes on a trip to a hot spring, and is soon up to his usual perverted antics. In addition, he''s about to receive his first love confession! However, his desire to pass his days peacefully is challenged once again by another Angeloid. Compared with the hostile Angeloids he had encountered in the past, this new Type Zeta Angeloid is by far the most powerful!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCchfbNVbH2cinjZWd2P3nMeda5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95170'),
  ('952339989470666385', 'Heaven''s Postman', 2009, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jin Jin, Lee Hyung-min', 'Eriko Kitagawa', 'HERO Jaejoong, Han Hyo-joo, Shin Gu, Kim Chang-wan, Yook Mi-ra, Ju Jin-mo, Lee Du-il, Jang Jung-hee', null, 'Jae-jun delivers letters to heaven from those who can''t get over the loss of their loved ones. One day Ha-na, who writes to her late boyfriend, discovers Jae-jun''s secret identity. He offers her a part-time job assisting him, and they set off on a 14-day journey.', 'Jae-jun delivers letters to heaven from those who can''t get over the loss of their loved ones. One day Ha-na, who writes to her late boyfriend, discovers Jae-jun''s secret identity. He offers her a part-time job assisting him, and they set off on a 14-day journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIIT2KFvsKos0n4BCCutHT9y7ft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64979'),
  ('764356701090972750', 'Heaven''s Prisoners', 1996, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Phil Joanou, Harris Savides', 'Harley Peyton, Scott Frank', 'Alec Baldwin, Kelly Lynch, Eric Roberts, Teri Hatcher, Mary Stuart Masterson, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Badja Djola, Samantha Lagpacan', 'R', 'A hardened New Orleans cop, Dave Robicheaux, finally tosses in the badge and settles into life on the bayou with his wife. But a bizarre plane crash draws him back into the fray when his family is viciously threatened.', 'A hardened New Orleans cop, Dave Robicheaux, finally tosses in the badge and settles into life on the bayou with his wife. But a bizarre plane crash draws him back into the fray when his family is viciously threatened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUWVNHA3dVc1CmxNIcXZWqbqWc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36915'),
  ('243147247329617649', 'Heaven''s Soldiers', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Min Joon-ki', 'Min Joon-ki', 'Park Joong-hoon, Kim Seung-woo, Hwang Jung-min, Gong Hyo-jin, Kim Seung-cheol, Kim Beong-choun, Kim Su-hyun, Don Lee', null, 'Modern day soldiers travel back in time and meet Admiral Lee, the greatest soldier of all time, and motivate him to drive out invaders.', 'Modern day soldiers travel back in time and meet Admiral Lee, the greatest soldier of all time, and motivate him to drive out invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bL7WcHtBWmlUenu6s0Ypd3Tzok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37502'),
  ('627466024610951855', 'Heavenly Bodies', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer', 'Russ Meyer', 'Ken Parker, Gaby Martone, Don Cochran, Werner Kirsch, Fred Owens, Billy A. Newhouse, Orville Hallberg, Althea Currier', null, 'A group of filmmakers shadow some glamour photographers in order to discover the skill involved in getting ''magic'' to appear on the photos.', 'A group of filmmakers shadow some glamour photographers in order to discover the skill involved in getting ''magic'' to appear on the photos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82mdVfn45Tio4A88nfhKpdvLULC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5711'),
  ('504578808371009893', 'Heavenly Bodies', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lawrence Dane, Thomas Burstyn, Mac Bradden', 'Lawrence Dane, Ron Base', 'Cynthia Dale, Richard Rebiere, Walter George Alton, Laura Henry, Stuart Stone, Patricia Idlette, Pam Henry, Reiner Schwartz', 'R', 'A small dance studio fights for its existence against the unscrupulous owner of a rival club.', 'A small dance studio fights for its existence against the unscrupulous owner of a rival club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYBlAam2nVfqIs6yB3AAPI2BrAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77168'),
  ('871690658918674234', 'Heavenly Creatures', 1994, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Peter Jackson, Alun Bollinger', 'Peter Jackson, Fran Walsh', 'Melanie Lynskey, Kate Winslet, Sarah Peirse, Diana Kent, Clive Merrison, Simon O''Connor, Jed Brophy, Peter Elliott', 'R', 'Precocious teenager Juliet moves to New Zealand with her family and soon befriends the quiet, brooding Pauline through their shared love of fantasy and literature. This friendship gradually develops into an intense and obsessive bond.', 'Precocious teenager Juliet moves to New Zealand with her family and soon befriends the quiet, brooding Pauline through their shared love of fantasy and literature. This friendship gradually develops into an intense and obsessive bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvb86wVCIqD3Rlbr0GTNgWDF7Zo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024'),
  ('642354301694353776', 'Heavenly Forest', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takehiko Shinjo, Mitsuru Komiyama, Tatsuya Ogishima', 'Kenji Bando', 'Hiroshi Tamaki, Aoi Miyazaki, Meisa Kuroki, Munetaka Aoki, Keisuke Koide, Yûya Ogawa, Asae Oonishi, Misa Uehara', null, 'Amateur photographer Makoto and the homely but endearing Shizuru meet during their university entrance ceremony and become instant friends. Shy by nature, Makoto finds himself opening up around Shizuru, who is secretly in love with him.', 'Amateur photographer Makoto and the homely but endearing Shizuru meet during their university entrance ceremony and become instant friends. Shy by nature, Makoto finds himself opening up around Shizuru, who is secretly in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqcKoM8KlgKeMw0XvKhjp3qwUag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40243'),
  ('174116237085084711', 'Heavenly Music', 1943, 'Fantasy, Music', 'Josef Berne, Robert Surtees', 'Edward James, Paul Gerard Smith, Michael L. Simmons', 'Frederick Brady, Mary Elliott, Eric Blore, Steven Geray, Fritz Feld, Elmer Jerome, Eric Mayne, Lionel Royce', 'NR', 'Bandleader/singer/songwriter Ted Barry arrives to heaven. The receptionist tells him that before he can take his place in the Hall of Music, a committee must review his work and decide whether he is worthy of admittance.', 'Bandleader/singer/songwriter Ted Barry arrives to heaven. The receptionist tells him that before he can take his place in the Hall of Music, a committee must review his work and decide whether he is worthy of admittance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk5u7MvKW0E31qTrbgfEmQ0A5Oz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236865'),
  ('250900038108065018', 'Heavenly Puss', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'During yet another pursuit of Jerry, Tom ends up being killed when an upright piano slides down the stairs and slams into him. He meets a feline St. Peter at the gate of the Heavenly Express, but is initially turned away due to his constant torture. However, he will be allowed onto the train if he can have Jerry sign a letter of forgiveness within one hour. If not, it''s Hell for Tom. Will he go up or down?', 'During yet another pursuit of Jerry, Tom ends up being killed when an upright piano slides down the stairs and slams into him. He meets a feline St. Peter at the gate of the Heavenly Express, but is initially turned away due to his constant torture. However, he will be allowed onto the train if he can have Jerry sign a letter of forgiveness within one hour. If not, it''s Hell for Tom. Will he go up or down?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DXreaQQCPCzRreCsa4pV6nLHzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67824'),
  ('91005932145939896', 'Heavenly Swallows', 1976, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Leonid Kvinikhidze, Nikolay Zhilin', 'Leonid Kvinikhidze', 'Iya Ninidze, Andrey Mironov, Aleksandr Shirvindt, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Irina Gubanova, Era Ziganshina, Sergei Zakharov, Galina Ilieva', null, 'Denise de Flavigny, a young convent student, discovers a double-life of the organist Célestin, who teaches her music at the convent. He secretly composes popular operettas for his mistress Corinne. Célestin visits the city to witness the premiere of his latest effort; Denise escapes the convent as well. Following a quarrel with Célestin, Corinne walks out and instead, Denise appears in her role, taking the name Mam''zelle Nitouche. Denise falls in love with Fernand, a handsome young soldier. Both Denise and Célestin are mistaken for soldiers absent without leave and shipped off to an army camp. A series of coincidences brings happiness to all concerned.', 'Denise de Flavigny, a young convent student, discovers a double-life of the organist Célestin, who teaches her music at the convent. He secretly composes popular operettas for his mistress Corinne. Célestin visits the city to witness the premiere of his latest effort; Denise escapes the convent as well. Following a quarrel with Célestin, Corinne walks out and instead, Denise appears in her role, taking the name Mam''zelle Nitouche. Denise falls in love with Fernand, a handsome young soldier. Both Denise and Célestin are mistaken for soldiers absent without leave and shipped off to an army camp. A series of coincidences brings happiness to all concerned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAji4p6kPIXAgwWvewxo9A1ZDjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85332'),
  ('606964899294285104', 'Heavenly Sword', 2014, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Jang Gun-ho', 'Todd Farmer', 'Anna Torv, Alfred Molina, Thomas Jane, Ashleigh Ball, Barry Dennen, Renae Geerlings, Nolan North', 'NR', 'The film''s plot follows that of the game closely. Nariko, a member of an ancient tribe who have guarded an ancient magical sword for thousands of years, is charged with bringing the sword to its destined wielder, a deity reincarnated who will bring peace to the land. But on her quest, Nariko must wield the sword herself against the forces of King Bohan, who wishes to possess the weapon himself.', 'The film''s plot follows that of the game closely. Nariko, a member of an ancient tribe who have guarded an ancient magical sword for thousands of years, is charged with bringing the sword to its destined wielder, a deity reincarnated who will bring peace to the land. But on her quest, Nariko must wield the sword herself against the forces of King Bohan, who wishes to possess the weapon himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZzMbYDomCgj6LUN1b33ha7BiGh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256766'),
  ('1145880701180929797', 'Heavenly Touch', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joel Lamangan, Journalie Payonan', 'Enrique Ramos', 'Paolo Serrano, Joash Balejado, Marco Morales, Gwen Garci, Paolo Rivero, Jeffrey Santos, Jim Pebanco, Irma Adlawan', null, 'Jonard is having trouble making ends meet. His mother is suffering from depression, and he and his sister are forced to quit school in order to take care of her. One day, Jonard meets up his friend Rodel, and Rodel introduces him to the world of massage parlors. Rodel teaches him massage, and brings him to Heavenly Touch, a syndicate-run massage parlor that mostly caters to homosexuals.', 'Jonard is having trouble making ends meet. His mother is suffering from depression, and he and his sister are forced to quit school in order to take care of her. One day, Jonard meets up his friend Rodel, and Rodel introduces him to the world of massage parlors. Rodel teaches him massage, and brings him to Heavenly Touch, a syndicate-run massage parlor that mostly caters to homosexuals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ory8WuAqznTE7lfopTSymHpop2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179387'),
  ('362747604299480319', 'Heavenquest: A Pilgrim''s Progress', 2020, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Chris Ellison, Matt Bilen', 'Michael Tang, Dan Mark', 'Patrick Thompson, Peta Sergeant, Alan Powell, Cha In-pyo, Karyme Lozano, Ricky Kim, Fernanda Romero, Asger Folmann', null, 'A regal man named Vangel is thrust on a journey against his will when he is suddenly and mysteriously arrested. Injured and lost after escaping the dark king’s men, Vangel begins to have strange dreams and visions of a mysterious woman in white calling him from the unknown territory of the North. Armed with a book called “The Record of the Ancients” that he receives from a wise sage named Elder, Vangel embarks on an adventure that takes him through treacherous mountain range, unending deserts, the Lake of Doubts, and the Forest of No Return. Along the way, Vangel learns about a fabled good king and his son in the North, but first he must make it there alive.', 'A regal man named Vangel is thrust on a journey against his will when he is suddenly and mysteriously arrested. Injured and lost after escaping the dark king’s men, Vangel begins to have strange dreams and visions of a mysterious woman in white calling him from the unknown territory of the North. Armed with a book called “The Record of the Ancients” that he receives from a wise sage named Elder, Vangel embarks on an adventure that takes him through treacherous mountain range, unending deserts, the Lake of Doubts, and the Forest of No Return. Along the way, Vangel learns about a fabled good king and his son in the North, but first he must make it there alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLDPLia17AwMqSaRHccyAlInkch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634244'),
  ('848572846351394034', 'Heavens Above!', 1963, 'Comedy', 'John Boulting, Roy Boulting, Mutz Greenbaum', 'Frank Harvey, John Boulting', 'Peter Sellers, Cecil Parker, Isabel Jeans, Ian Carmichael, Bernard Miles, Brock Peters, Eric Sykes, Irene Handl', null, 'A clerical error leads to the appointment of a left-leaning small-town priest to a rich village, where he immediately horrifies his snobby parishioners by appointing a dustman and a black man as vicar''s wardens and throwing open the vicarage to the sprawling, disreputable Smith family, who have just been evicted from their caravan site. He converts the dowager aristocrat to works of absurd charity but he soon has the town and much of the country in uproar.', 'A clerical error leads to the appointment of a left-leaning small-town priest to a rich village, where he immediately horrifies his snobby parishioners by appointing a dustman and a black man as vicar''s wardens and throwing open the vicarage to the sprawling, disreputable Smith family, who have just been evicted from their caravan site. He converts the dowager aristocrat to works of absurd charity but he soon has the town and much of the country in uproar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNM2se70dpwcOVLHWHrIBRXOehj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42800'),
  ('448700259243870682', 'Heavier Trip', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Juuso Laatio, Jukka Vidgren, Anssi Leino', 'Juuso Laatio, Jukka Vidgren', 'Johannes Holopainen, Samuli Jaskio, Chike Ohanwe, Max Ovaska, Anatole Taubman, Helén Vikstvedt, David Bredin, Karolis Kasperavičius', null, 'The world''s hardest - and weirdest - heavy metal band Impaled Rektum is serving their sentence in Norway''s nicest prison. They receive word that guitarist Lotvonen''s parents'' reindeer herding farm is about to come under the hammer. It will take a big gig and big money to save the farm. A breakout ensues and a trip to the world''s biggest heavy festival, Wacken in northern Germany begins. The higher the target, the bigger the obstacles. This is what the boys will experience on their epic journey to the main stage of Wacken - every metalhead''s heaven.', 'The world''s hardest - and weirdest - heavy metal band Impaled Rektum is serving their sentence in Norway''s nicest prison. They receive word that guitarist Lotvonen''s parents'' reindeer herding farm is about to come under the hammer. It will take a big gig and big money to save the farm. A breakout ensues and a trip to the world''s biggest heavy festival, Wacken in northern Germany begins. The higher the target, the bigger the obstacles. This is what the boys will experience on their epic journey to the main stage of Wacken - every metalhead''s heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSCxOGXm7mfEU6Y5VEAufnDZPOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716808'),
  ('1152305757527062844', 'Heavy', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Mangold, Michael F. Barrow', 'James Mangold', 'Pruitt Taylor Vince, Shelley Winters, Liv Tyler, Debbie Harry, Joe Grifasi, Evan Dando, David Patrick Kelly, Marian Quinn', 'R', 'Victor is a cook who works in a greasy roadside restaurant owned by his mother, Dolly. It''s just the two of them, a waitress named Delores, and a heavy drinking regular, Leo. But things change when Callie, a beautiful college dropout, shows up as a new waitress and steals Victor''s heart. But Victor is too shy to do anything about it, and too self-consciously overweight to dream of winning Callie away.', 'Victor is a cook who works in a greasy roadside restaurant owned by his mother, Dolly. It''s just the two of them, a waitress named Delores, and a heavy drinking regular, Leo. But things change when Callie, a beautiful college dropout, shows up as a new waitress and steals Victor''s heart. But Victor is too shy to do anything about it, and too self-consciously overweight to dream of winning Callie away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xo2KsY7hOHDqpgYlDStL56zmgaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22621'),
  ('788718310954814447', 'Heavy Metal', 1981, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure, Fantasy, Music', 'Gerald Potterton, Tayk Kim, John Bruno', 'Len Blum, Daniel Goldberg', 'Rodger Bumpass, John Candy, Jackie Burroughs, Joe Flaherty, Don Francks, Marilyn Lightstone, Eugene Levy, Harold Ramis', 'R', 'The embodiment of ultimate evil, a glowing orb terrorizes a young girl with bizarre stories of dark fantasy, eroticism and horror.', 'The embodiment of ultimate evil, a glowing orb terrorizes a young girl with bizarre stories of dark fantasy, eroticism and horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atUtWrDlLzT1yeVK2EoYtvbS963.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11827'),
  ('607979090253656920', 'Heavy Metal 2000', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Michel Lemire, Bruno Philip, Michael Coldewey', 'R. Payne Cabeen, Carl Macek', 'Michael Ironside, Julie Strain, Billy Idol, Pier Paquette, Sonja Ball, Brady Moffatt, Rick Jones, Arthur Holden', 'R', 'Upon discovery of a shard of what could be the Loc-Nar, a miner named Tyler becomes possessed with an insatiable hunger for power and a thirst for immortality. On his way to the planet of youth, Tyler wipes out most of a space colony and kidnaps a beautiful young woman. His only mistake is that he doesn''t kill her sister, Julie, who then sets out on a mission of rescue and revenge.', 'Upon discovery of a shard of what could be the Loc-Nar, a miner named Tyler becomes possessed with an insatiable hunger for power and a thirst for immortality. On his way to the planet of youth, Tyler wipes out most of a space colony and kidnaps a beautiful young woman. His only mistake is that he doesn''t kill her sister, Julie, who then sets out on a mission of rescue and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCggUkmi3Fyc1HrSnyaSxKPrG4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16225'),
  ('647192772997978299', 'Heavy Metal Mater', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'John Lasseter, Rob Gibbs', null, 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, George Carlin, Lori Alan, John Cygan, Laraine Newman, Mickie McGowan, Jack Angel', null, 'Mater and Lightning McQueen are ready to rock! When Mater''s garage band, Mater and the Gas Caps, records a hit song, Mater becomes a rock legend. Then Lightning joins Mater''s band for the rock concert of the century!', 'Mater and Lightning McQueen are ready to rock! When Mater''s garage band, Mater and the Gas Caps, records a hit song, Mater becomes a rock legend. Then Lightning joins Mater''s band for the rock concert of the century!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WFqQ6VhbPP1JGDe0RDWW5PPLgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148607'),
  ('990460130694951763', 'Heavy Metal Parking Lot', 1986, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jeff Krulik, John Heyn', null, null, null, 'Heavy Metal Parking Lot documents heavy metal music fans tailgating in the parking lot outside the Capital Centre (since demolished) in Landover, Maryland, on May 31, 1986, before a Judas Priest concert (with opening act Dokken).', 'Heavy Metal Parking Lot documents heavy metal music fans tailgating in the parking lot outside the Capital Centre (since demolished) in Landover, Maryland, on May 31, 1986, before a Judas Priest concert (with opening act Dokken).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8rvA1e1oNQhO9hjiJu2ip34VdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54642'),
  ('812099550212247408', 'Heavy Petting', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marcel Sarmiento, Tim Ives, Josh Newport', 'Marcel Sarmiento', 'Malin Åkerman, Brendan Hines, Kevin Sussman, Mike Doyle, Juan Carlos Hernández, Sam Coppola, Jennifer Ikeda, Krysten Ritter', null, 'Charlie thinks he''s met the perfect woman, but in order to be with her, he must first get past her dog. Just when he thinks all is lost, he realizes that he loves the dog too! Now he must do everything he can to keep them both.', 'Charlie thinks he''s met the perfect woman, but in order to be with her, he must first get past her dog. Just when he thinks all is lost, he realizes that he loves the dog too! Now he must do everything he can to keep them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m828dZSo4HAc6qo4Ksr7VxUIKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33586'),
  ('225097346795999019', 'Heavy Snow', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yun Su-ik, Yang Jung-hun, Kim Ji-eon', 'Yun Su-ik', 'Han Hae-in, Han So-hee, Kim Geu-lim, Hwang Yong-wook, Roh Yang-ho, Lee Kwang-youn, Park In-ha, Kang Hong-suk', null, 'Su-an, a performing arts high school student, becomes close with Seol, an actress and celebrity. During a trip, they realize that they have feelings for each other. However, misunderstandings pile up too much, and Seol leaves Su-an. Su-an later becomes an actress and returns to the winter sea, longing for Seol.', 'Su-an, a performing arts high school student, becomes close with Seol, an actress and celebrity. During a trip, they realize that they have feelings for each other. However, misunderstandings pile up too much, and Seol leaves Su-an. Su-an later becomes an actress and returns to the winter sea, longing for Seol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8Ras7nAG4ufFXJQ3KrfkiXZE6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104331'),
  ('1111705394199116085', 'Heavy Trip', 2018, 'Comedy, Music', 'Harri Räty, Paula Haukinen, Iiris Orasmaa', 'Aleksi Puranen, Juuso Laatio, Jari Rantala', 'Johannes Holopainen, Samuli Jaskio, Antti Tuomas Heikkinen, Max Ovaska, Minka Kuustonen, Ville Tiihonen, Kai Lehtinen, Chike Ohanwe', null, 'Turo is stuck in a small village and the best thing in his life is being the lead vocalist for the amateur metal band Impaled Rektum. He and his bandmates have practiced for 12 years without playing a single gig. The guys get a surprise visitor from Norway -- the promoter for a huge heavy metal music festival -- and decide it''s now or never. They steal a van, a corpse, and even a new drummer to make their dreams a reality.', 'Turo is stuck in a small village and the best thing in his life is being the lead vocalist for the amateur metal band Impaled Rektum. He and his bandmates have practiced for 12 years without playing a single gig. The guys get a surprise visitor from Norway -- the promoter for a huge heavy metal music festival -- and decide it''s now or never. They steal a van, a corpse, and even a new drummer to make their dreams a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owdppgwOYuuXAXHHY7YvvS0rOJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460048'),
  ('149026834000837508', 'Heavyweight', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Christopher Anthony, Chas Appeti', 'Christopher Anthony', 'Jordan Bolger, Osy Ikhile, Jason Isaacs, Rob Malone, Joplin Sibtain', null, 'Heavyweight follows wildcard boxing contender, ''Diamond'' Derek Douglas, and his support team ahead of a title fight he doubts he can win. The pressure escalates in real-time, as dirty tricks and revelations are revealed. Heavyweight is an intense and visceral experience exploring a side of elite sport rarely seen.', 'Heavyweight follows wildcard boxing contender, ''Diamond'' Derek Douglas, and his support team ahead of a title fight he doubts he can win. The pressure escalates in real-time, as dirty tricks and revelations are revealed. Heavyweight is an intense and visceral experience exploring a side of elite sport rarely seen.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fqixkli0qArq37kYHkJSRHWX0lwW.jpg', 'plex:movie:heavyweight-2026'),
  ('1055852791551373166', 'Heavyweights', 1995, 'Family, Comedy', 'Steven Brill, Victor Hammer, Richard Oswald', 'Steven Brill, Judd Apatow', 'David Goldman, Tom McGowan, Joseph Wayne Miller, Cody Burger, Aaron Schwartz, Allen Covert, Kenan Thompson, Tim Blake Nelson', 'PG', 'Camp Hope is a summer retreat for overweight boys run by a kindly couple who make the campers feel comfortable with their extra pounds. But when tyrannical fitness guru Tony buys the camp, he puts the kids on a cruel regimen that goes too far. Sick of the endless weeks of "all work and no play," the kids stage a coup and reclaim their summer of fun.', 'Camp Hope is a summer retreat for overweight boys run by a kindly couple who make the campers feel comfortable with their extra pounds. But when tyrannical fitness guru Tony buys the camp, he puts the kids on a cruel regimen that goes too far. Sick of the endless weeks of "all work and no play," the kids stage a coup and reclaim their summer of fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uN65XQzyPknLZs2R6koZ2Cu6eGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14819'),
  ('1073216255428094930', 'Heavyweights', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller', null, 'Sebastian Bezzel, Michael Grimm, Antoine Monot Jr., Simon Schwarz, Nicholas Ofczarek, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Bastian Pastewka, Denise Zich', null, 'In 1952, four passionate bobsledders - Gamser, Franzl, Gustl and Leusl Peter prepare for the Winter Olympics in Oslo. There, the veteran Bavarian Gamser wants to finally put his archrival Dorfler in his place and show him his class. While the two men constantly get into your hair, the women Rosi and Anna try to calm things down. In Oslo, there is finally a big showdown, which will take place not only on a bobsled.', 'In 1952, four passionate bobsledders - Gamser, Franzl, Gustl and Leusl Peter prepare for the Winter Olympics in Oslo. There, the veteran Bavarian Gamser wants to finally put his archrival Dorfler in his place and show him his class. While the two men constantly get into your hair, the women Rosi and Anna try to calm things down. In Oslo, there is finally a big showdown, which will take place not only on a bobsled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBQVMqRlUIztSaL8HID3ksU1ua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13914'),
  ('697548448498562548', 'Hebe', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Marina Watson-Wood, Maurício Farias, Inti Briones', 'Carolina Kotscho', 'Andréa Beltrão, Marco Ricca, Caio Horowicz, Danton Mello, Danilo Grangheia, Stella Miranda, Karine Teles, Cláudia Missura', null, 'Hebe Camargo is one of the most emblematic entertainments in Brazil. At her 60s, she went on to control her own career and, despite the criticism, the dreadful husband and the powerful and sexist bosses, she revealed herself to the public as an extraordinary woman, capable of overcoming any personal or professional crisis.', 'Hebe Camargo is one of the most emblematic entertainments in Brazil. At her 60s, she went on to control her own career and, despite the criticism, the dreadful husband and the powerful and sexist bosses, she revealed herself to the public as an extraordinary woman, capable of overcoming any personal or professional crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fluPCFFNON9w0YeDg9VUnubFyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568985'),
  ('921159885228076085', 'Hecate', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Schmid, Renato Berta', 'Pascal Jardin, Daniel Schmid', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Lauren Hutton, Jean Bouise, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Gérard Desarthe, Juliette Brac, Patrick Thursfield, Suzanne Thau', null, 'Set amid the European community in an unspecified North African country, a colony on the verge of nationalism just before the war. And colonized is what happens to a French diplomat, Julien Rochelle, when he meets the mysterious beauty Clothilde de Watteville. Schmid ''s favorite axiom, that love is projection, never had such a thorough airing. Is Clothilde really the wife of a French official now holed up in Siberia? Or is she Hecate, goddess of black magic and devourer of the Arab boys she meets far from the European quarter? Only our projections know for sure; for the rest, she is a "woman looking out into the night." Drawn from a novel by Paul Morand, who based the main character on his wife Helene, Schmid''s film achieves an atmosphere of magic in which psychological credibility is not so much absent as irrelevant-a film that distances itself from the drama it invokes, perhaps as the elusive Clothilde turns her back on the madness she provokes.', 'Set amid the European community in an unspecified North African country, a colony on the verge of nationalism just before the war. And colonized is what happens to a French diplomat, Julien Rochelle, when he meets the mysterious beauty Clothilde de Watteville. Schmid ''s favorite axiom, that love is projection, never had such a thorough airing. Is Clothilde really the wife of a French official now holed up in Siberia? Or is she Hecate, goddess of black magic and devourer of the Arab boys she meets far from the European quarter? Only our projections know for sure; for the rest, she is a "woman looking out into the night." Drawn from a novel by Paul Morand, who based the main character on his wife Helene, Schmid''s film achieves an atmosphere of magic in which psychological credibility is not so much absent as irrelevant-a film that distances itself from the drama it invokes, perhaps as the elusive Clothilde turns her back on the madness she provokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zDAdJaml0Hl9N2StjONRjXi33C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64100'),
  ('984584444420571358', 'Heckler', 2007, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Michael Addis', null, 'Stephen Burrows, Criss Angel, Louie Anderson, Simon Rex, Dave Attell, Maria Bamford, Lewis Black, Chingy', 'R', 'HECKLER is a comedic feature documentary exploring the increasingly critical world we live in. After starring in a film that was critically bashed, Jamie Kennedy takes on hecklers and critics and ask some interesting questions of people such as George Lucas, Bill Maher, Mike Ditka, Rob Zombie, Howie Mandel and many more. This fast moving, hilarious documentary pulls no punches as you see an uncensored look at just how nasty and mean the fight is between those in the spotlight and those in the dark.', 'HECKLER is a comedic feature documentary exploring the increasingly critical world we live in. After starring in a film that was critically bashed, Jamie Kennedy takes on hecklers and critics and ask some interesting questions of people such as George Lucas, Bill Maher, Mike Ditka, Rob Zombie, Howie Mandel and many more. This fast moving, hilarious documentary pulls no punches as you see an uncensored look at just how nasty and mean the fight is between those in the spotlight and those in the dark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDcnCvPTBqAhMqyfpxVtA2WZwd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13611'),
  ('639397201707593790', 'Hector', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Stijn Coninx, Willy Stassen', 'Stijn Coninx, Urbanus, Walter Van Den Broeck', 'Urbanus, Sylvia Millecam, Frank Aendenboom, Herbert Flack, Marc Van Eeghem, Hein van der Heijden, Ann Petersen, Kees Hulst', null, 'Hector''s parents sent him to an orphanage in treatment for smallpox but... they never picked him up. 35 years later, he still lives in the orphanage, surrounded by children, his playmates. Till a forgotten aunt remembers that he exists. She''ll get him to participate in the bakery of her husband, Achilles, to work. Hector shows his skills on the basis of unexpected inventions. So he helps Jos, the son of Achilles, to accomplish his dream to be a cycling champion. Hector''s good humor and childlike manner overcomes all resistance and pulls his entire entourage along on the path to success. From now on he can learn what love is...', 'Hector''s parents sent him to an orphanage in treatment for smallpox but... they never picked him up. 35 years later, he still lives in the orphanage, surrounded by children, his playmates. Till a forgotten aunt remembers that he exists. She''ll get him to participate in the bakery of her husband, Achilles, to work. Hector shows his skills on the basis of unexpected inventions. So he helps Jos, the son of Achilles, to accomplish his dream to be a cycling champion. Hector''s good humor and childlike manner overcomes all resistance and pulls his entire entourage along on the path to success. From now on he can learn what love is...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fB477SW0unE2IZJ7dQ64R7THAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44417'),
  ('34037408444044344', 'Héctor', 2004, 'Drama', 'Gracia Querejeta, Ángel Iguacel', 'David Planell, Gracia Querejeta', 'Adriana Ozores, Nilo Mur, Joaquín Climent, Unax Ugalde, Núria Gago, Pepo Oliva, José Luis García Pérez, Damián Alcázar', null, 'Adolescent Hector faces a major lifestyle change after moving into his aunt''s flat in a blue-collar suburb of Madrid.', 'Adolescent Hector faces a major lifestyle change after moving into his aunt''s flat in a blue-collar suburb of Madrid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2HrzQPc7tXed5QVjcsJDOEOGBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189346'),
  ('482457648142062775', 'Hector and the Search for Happiness', 2014, 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Chelsom, Kolja Brandt, Paula Antil', 'Maria von Heland, Peter Chelsom, Tinker Lindsay', 'Simon Pegg, Rosamund Pike, Toni Collette, Stellan Skarsgård, Christopher Plummer, Jean Reno, Barry Atsma, Veronica Ferres', 'R', 'Hector is a quirky psychiatrist who has become increasingly tired of his humdrum life. As he tells his girlfriend, Clara, he feels like a fraud: he hasn’t really tasted life, and yet he’s offering advice to patients who are just not getting any happier. So Hector decides to break out of his deluded and routine driven life. Armed with buckets of courage and child-like curiosity, he embarks on a global quest in hopes of uncovering the elusive secret formula for true happiness. And so begins a larger than life adventure with riotously funny results.', 'Hector is a quirky psychiatrist who has become increasingly tired of his humdrum life. As he tells his girlfriend, Clara, he feels like a fraud: he hasn’t really tasted life, and yet he’s offering advice to patients who are just not getting any happier. So Hector decides to break out of his deluded and routine driven life. Armed with buckets of courage and child-like curiosity, he embarks on a global quest in hopes of uncovering the elusive secret formula for true happiness. And so begins a larger than life adventure with riotously funny results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lymRg46xAt6s9ApWa9MBcgnzXAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254375'),
  ('732513989837657234', 'Héctor el Father: Conocerás la verdad', 2018, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Joel Antonio Colón', 'C.J. Lozada', 'Héctor "El Father", Lian Machín, Rainier Quintana, Daddy Yankee, Wisin, Tito El Bambino', null, 'This autobiography of Hector Delgado runs from his childhood to become one of the greatest exponents of the urban genre, but the results of that life did not please him and led him to try to take his life .After being victim of a firefight at a service station in Aguada, a city hall in Puerto Rico, he stopped earning at least two hundred American dollars for presentation and being "devout of Jesus"', 'This autobiography of Hector Delgado runs from his childhood to become one of the greatest exponents of the urban genre, but the results of that life did not please him and led him to try to take his life .After being victim of a firefight at a service station in Aguada, a city hall in Puerto Rico, he stopped earning at least two hundred American dollars for presentation and being "devout of Jesus"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkP0FzEivLxsUYt8BlaL8Sh7ceY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511679'),
  ('46297086285800120', 'Hector''s Hectic Life', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bill Tytla', null, 'Mae Questel', null, 'Hector is a dog with an easy life and the run of the house when the lady of the house gives him a warning...one more mess and you''re out. Hector would be okay if not for the fact that three little puppies have been left on their doorstep. Hector has a hectic time keeping them in line and cleaning up their messes without alerting the lady.', 'Hector is a dog with an easy life and the run of the house when the lady of the house gives him a warning...one more mess and you''re out. Hector would be okay if not for the fact that three little puppies have been left on their doorstep. Hector has a hectic time keeping them in line and cleaning up their messes without alerting the lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IOoa9RsOpwaySHAQUwZXJ1ifnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205652'),
  ('444171735339951235', 'Hedd Wyn', 1992, 'War, Drama', 'Michás Koc, Geoff Skelding, Roger Pugh Evans', 'Alan Llwyd', 'Huw Garmon, Catrin Fychan, Ceri Cunnington, Llio Silyn, Grey Evans, Gwen Ellis, Emma Kelly, Sioned Jonês Williams', null, '''Hedd Wyn'' is a 1992 Welsh anti-war biopic. Ellis Humphrey Evans, a farmer''s son and poet living at Trawsfynydd in the Meirionydd countryside of upland Wales, competes for the most coveted prize of all in Welsh Poetry - that of the chair of the National Eisteddfod, which in August 1917 was due to be held in Birkenhead (one of the rare occasions when it was held in England). After submitting his entry, under his bardic name "Hedd Wyn" ("Blessed Peace") Evans later departs from Meirionydd by train to join the Royal Welsh Fusiliers in Liverpool, despite his initial misgivings about the war. Ellis is sent to fight in the trenches of Flanders. ''Hedd Wyn'' was the first Welsh-language film to be nominated for an Oscar.', '''Hedd Wyn'' is a 1992 Welsh anti-war biopic. Ellis Humphrey Evans, a farmer''s son and poet living at Trawsfynydd in the Meirionydd countryside of upland Wales, competes for the most coveted prize of all in Welsh Poetry - that of the chair of the National Eisteddfod, which in August 1917 was due to be held in Birkenhead (one of the rare occasions when it was held in England). After submitting his entry, under his bardic name "Hedd Wyn" ("Blessed Peace") Evans later departs from Meirionydd by train to join the Royal Welsh Fusiliers in Liverpool, despite his initial misgivings about the war. Ellis is sent to fight in the trenches of Flanders. ''Hedd Wyn'' was the first Welsh-language film to be nominated for an Oscar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkQJVqXittOKXTubdiID5cRFExr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151489'),
  ('71930186081525891', 'Hedda', 1975, 'Drama', 'Trevor Nunn, Ken Baker, Douglas Slocombe', 'Henrik Ibsen', 'Glenda Jackson, Timothy West, Peter Eyre, Patrick Stewart, Constance Chapman, Pam St. Clement, Jennie Linden, Fidelis Morgan', 'PG', 'Returning from her honeymoon with her husband, scholar Jorgen, the cold and manipulative Hedda Gabler is unmoved by the sacrifices he''s made to provide her with an elegant home. But when she learns that Jorgen''s rival for a university position, Ejlert, has made a surprising comeback with a recent publication, she''s quick to push him back into his former alcoholism, steal the sequel to his book and even encourage the writer to kill himself.', 'Returning from her honeymoon with her husband, scholar Jorgen, the cold and manipulative Hedda Gabler is unmoved by the sacrifices he''s made to provide her with an elegant home. But when she learns that Jorgen''s rival for a university position, Ejlert, has made a surprising comeback with a recent publication, she''s quick to push him back into his former alcoholism, steal the sequel to his book and even encourage the writer to kill himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRfvRWX5jnYLaKOXxj74G9eJ8IG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42256'),
  ('1136532905130080274', 'Hedda', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Nia DaCosta, Sean Bobbitt, William Dodds', 'Nia DaCosta', 'Tessa Thompson, Nina Hoss, Imogen Poots, Nicholas Pinnock, Tom Bateman, Finbar Lynch, Mirren Mack, Jamael Westman', 'R', 'Hedda Gabler finds herself torn between the lingering ache of a past love and the quiet suffocation of her present life. Over the course of one charged night, long-repressed desires and hidden tensions erupt—pulling her and everyone around her into a spiral of manipulation, passion, and betrayal.', 'Hedda Gabler finds herself torn between the lingering ache of a past love and the quiet suffocation of her present life. Over the course of one charged night, long-repressed desires and hidden tensions erupt—pulling her and everyone around her into a spiral of manipulation, passion, and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecflk7AZf0ij205yDswjlvdxlCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997113'),
  ('364667398077991378', 'Hedda Gabler', 1962, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Alex Segal, Phil Ward', 'Philip H. Reisman Jr.', 'Ingrid Bergman, Michael Redgrave, Ralph Richardson, Trevor Howard, Dilys Hamlett, Ursula Jeans, Beatrice Varley', null, 'Hedda Gabler has just come back from her honeymoon, married to boring but reliable academic George Tesman. Refusing to tie herself down in life and name, Hedda is banking on George being appointed a professorship to secure a better life for the young couple, However, the arrival of cleaned up ex-lover Eilert threatens to destroy everything.', 'Hedda Gabler has just come back from her honeymoon, married to boring but reliable academic George Tesman. Refusing to tie herself down in life and name, Hedda is banking on George being appointed a professorship to secure a better life for the young couple, However, the arrival of cleaned up ex-lover Eilert threatens to destroy everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWHcvhdhW7mf87EmQ9hGNsXfOsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120539'),
  ('962323266309436183', 'Hedgehog in the Fog', 1975, 'Animation, Adventure, Mystery, Family', 'Yuri Norstein, Aleksandr Zhukovskiy', 'Yuri Norstein', 'Aleksey Batalov, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Mariya Vinogradova', null, 'A little hedgehog, on the way to visit his friend the bear, gets lost in thick fog, where horses, dogs and even falling leaves take on a terrifying new aspect...', 'A little hedgehog, on the way to visit his friend the bear, gets lost in thick fog, where horses, dogs and even falling leaves take on a terrifying new aspect...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sMh4bpyy5zhOS7G48WOsOBIhIH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36129'),
  ('15739730255238575', 'Hedi Schneider Is Stuck', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sonja Heiss, Nikolai von Graevenitz', 'Sonja Heiss', 'Laura Tonke, Hans Löw, Leander Nitsche, Margarita Broich, Matthias Bundschuh, Melanie Straub, Simon Schwarz, Rosa Enskat', null, 'A model family''s happy life unexpectedly goes off the rails when the carefree Hedi, played by Laura Tonke, suddenly starts having panic attacks. First mental illness and then drug dependency – the happiness that these happy-go-lucky thirty-somethings once took for granted suddenly seems unattainable, and their world fragile and uncertain.', 'A model family''s happy life unexpectedly goes off the rails when the carefree Hedi, played by Laura Tonke, suddenly starts having panic attacks. First mental illness and then drug dependency – the happiness that these happy-go-lucky thirty-somethings once took for granted suddenly seems unattainable, and their world fragile and uncertain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63wPoy2SAgso20KwxtH9W2vJpbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324586'),
  ('110814702361844204', 'Hedon', 2019, 'Drama', 'Julian Dieterich', 'Julian Dieterich', 'Tanju Bilir, Saladin Dellers, Peter Kotthaus, David Hugo Schmitz', null, 'On the hunt for an emotional spark, Fynn sets out to lose himself in various sexual encounters of the night. As day is dawning he stumbles across young Tom, but by this point he wonders if he is still in control of his bodily impulses.', 'On the hunt for an emotional spark, Fynn sets out to lose himself in various sexual encounters of the night. As day is dawning he stumbles across young Tom, but by this point he wonders if he is still in control of his bodily impulses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wm3o2zyf5inp0017JVVKRJUwxip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740300'),
  ('39785839325062607', 'Hedwig and the Angry Inch', 2001, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'John Cameron Mitchell, Frankie DeMarco, Patrick Tidy', 'John Cameron Mitchell', 'John Cameron Mitchell, Miriam Shor, Stephen Trask, Theodore Liscinski, Rob Campbell, Michael Aronov, Andrea Martin, Ben Mayer-Goodman', 'R', 'Raised a boy in East Berlin, Hedwig undergoes a personal transformation in order to emigrate to the U.S., where she reinvents herself as an ''internationally ignored'' but divinely talented rock diva, inhabiting a ''beautiful gender of one''.', 'Raised a boy in East Berlin, Hedwig undergoes a personal transformation in order to emigrate to the U.S., where she reinvents herself as an ''internationally ignored'' but divinely talented rock diva, inhabiting a ''beautiful gender of one''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jafIFAW8sHQkzWPGoMDR4892dFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13403'),
  ('208972053579291979', 'Heel', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Suspense', 'Jan Komasa, Michał Dymek, Michał Piłat, Anna Kwiatkowska, Kamajli Nguyen', 'Bartek Bartosik, Naqqash Khalid', 'Stephen Graham, Andrea Riseborough, Anson Boon, Kit Rakusen, Monika Frajczyk', 'Not Rated', 'Tommy, a volatile 19-year-old, revels in drugs, parties and violence. After getting separated from his friends on a drunken bender, he is abducted by a shadowy figure. He wakes to find himself imprisoned in the basement of a remote Yorkshire house, inhabited by a very strange family. But what unfolds is not what he could possibly expect.', 'Tommy, a volatile 19-year-old, revels in drugs, parties and violence. After getting separated from his friends on a drunken bender, he is abducted by a shadowy figure. He wakes to find himself imprisoned in the basement of a remote Yorkshire house, inhabited by a very strange family. But what unfolds is not what he could possibly expect.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fa%2Fgracenote%2Fa1281be2bab330452f6c32b838182881.jpg', 'plex:movie:heel-2026'),
  ('1003260218870933466', 'Heer Ranjha', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harmesh Malhotra, W. B. Rao', 'Mangal Dhillon', 'Anil Kapoor, Sridevi, Anupam Kher, Shammi Kapoor, Gufi Paintal, Pankaj Dheer, Tinnu Anand, Sushma Seth', null, 'A newer version of the popular love story of Heer (Sridevi) and Deedho (Anil Kapoor), who calls himself Ranjha after leaving his house and living incognito in Heer''s village as a labourer in her father''s (Shammi Kapoor) house. Heer and Deedho were childhood sweethearts, separated because of family animosities, which have grown over the years and kept on the boil by Kaheda (Anupam Kher), whose leg was irreparably fractured by Deedho''s family and friends.', 'A newer version of the popular love story of Heer (Sridevi) and Deedho (Anil Kapoor), who calls himself Ranjha after leaving his house and living incognito in Heer''s village as a labourer in her father''s (Shammi Kapoor) house. Heer and Deedho were childhood sweethearts, separated because of family animosities, which have grown over the years and kept on the boil by Kaheda (Anupam Kher), whose leg was irreparably fractured by Deedho''s family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bEiMJUkt5WANB6UoyhOKcf8re2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612806'),
  ('803532928921418776', 'Heidi', 1937, 'Drama, Family, Music', 'Allan Dwan', 'Walter Ferris', 'Shirley Temple, Jean Hersholt, Delmar Watson, Marcia Mae Jones, Arthur Treacher, Helen Westley, Thomas Beck, Mary Nash', 'G', 'Heidi is orphaned and her uncaring maternal Aunt Dete takes her to the mountains to live with her reclusive, grumpy paternal grandfather, Adolph Kramer. Heidi brings her grandfather back into mountain society through her sweet ways and sheer love. When Dete later returns and steals Heidi away to become the companion of a rich man''s wheelchair-bound daughter, the grandfather is heartsick to discover his little girl missing and immediately sets out to get her back.', 'Heidi is orphaned and her uncaring maternal Aunt Dete takes her to the mountains to live with her reclusive, grumpy paternal grandfather, Adolph Kramer. Heidi brings her grandfather back into mountain society through her sweet ways and sheer love. When Dete later returns and steals Heidi away to become the companion of a rich man''s wheelchair-bound daughter, the grandfather is heartsick to discover his little girl missing and immediately sets out to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIfA5X4pYJOHyFPZFqWLOu7yfiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28345'),
  ('408901636743458247', 'Heidi', 1952, 'Drama, Family', 'Luigi Comencini, Emil Berna, Peter Frischknecht', 'Richard Schweizer', 'Elsbeth Sigmund, Heinrich Gretler, Thomas Klameth, Elsie Attenhofer, Margrit Rainer, Fred Tanner, Isa Günther, Willy Birgel', null, 'Heidi, a young orphan girl living with her aunt in Frankfurt, is forced to move to the Swiss Alps to live with her ornery grandfather. At first, he resents her presence, but, after a short while, Heidi manages to pierce his gruff exterior, and the two become close. She also befriends a young shepherd named Peter. After three years, Heidi''s aunt arrives and demands Heidi''s return to Frankfurt.', 'Heidi, a young orphan girl living with her aunt in Frankfurt, is forced to move to the Swiss Alps to live with her ornery grandfather. At first, he resents her presence, but, after a short while, Heidi manages to pierce his gruff exterior, and the two become close. She also befriends a young shepherd named Peter. After three years, Heidi''s aunt arrives and demands Heidi''s return to Frankfurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fS5WULSOZ6FxVO47G93BUqSxeIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58757'),
  ('828101089795522578', 'Heidi', 1965, 'Drama, Family', 'Werner Jacobs', null, 'Eva Maria Singhammer , Gustav Knuth, Michaela May, Jan Koester, Margot Trooger, Rudolf Vogel, Lotte Ledl, Margarete Haagen', null, 'After her mother''s death, the five year old orphan Heidi is brought by her aunt to her grumpy grandfather Alp, who leads a hermit life in the beautiful Swiss mountains. Heidi''s natural cheerfulness quickly brings renewed joy in grandfather Alps life. Heidi becomes friends with the goatherd Peter who is about the same age as her and spent two beautiful years in the pasture. But then she is sent by her aunt to Frankfurt in the house of Consul Sesemann where Heidi should get a proper education and upbringing. After some initial difficulties Heidi eventually adjusts to her new situation and makes friends with Clara, the paralyzed daughter of the consul. Only with the strict governess Miss Rottingmeier she keeps getting in trouble. Miss Rottingmeier clearly can not cope with the free and outdoors spirit of Heidi. But Heidi lets a fresh wind blow through the Sesemann house and even causes Clara to overcome her illness.', 'After her mother''s death, the five year old orphan Heidi is brought by her aunt to her grumpy grandfather Alp, who leads a hermit life in the beautiful Swiss mountains. Heidi''s natural cheerfulness quickly brings renewed joy in grandfather Alps life. Heidi becomes friends with the goatherd Peter who is about the same age as her and spent two beautiful years in the pasture. But then she is sent by her aunt to Frankfurt in the house of Consul Sesemann where Heidi should get a proper education and upbringing. After some initial difficulties Heidi eventually adjusts to her new situation and makes friends with Clara, the paralyzed daughter of the consul. Only with the strict governess Miss Rottingmeier she keeps getting in trouble. Miss Rottingmeier clearly can not cope with the free and outdoors spirit of Heidi. But Heidi lets a fresh wind blow through the Sesemann house and even causes Clara to overcome her illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f078ylpJ7UuXFfBpVIZuXIzeHbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94995'),
  ('994226519818679081', 'Heidi', 1968, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Delbert Mann, Klaus von Rautenfeld', null, 'Jennifer Edwards, Michael Redgrave, Maximilian Schell, Jean Simmons, Walter Slezak, Peter van Eyck, Zuleika Robson, John Moulder-Brown', 'G', 'Heidi is an orphaned girl initially raised by her aunt Dete in Maienfeld, Switzerland. In order to get a job in Frankfurt, Dete brings 5-year-old Heidi to her grandfather, who has been at odds with the villagers for years and lives in seclusion on the alm. He at first resents Heidi''s arrival, but the girl manages to penetrate his harsh exterior and subsequently has a delightful stay with him and her best friend, young Peter the goat-herd.', 'Heidi is an orphaned girl initially raised by her aunt Dete in Maienfeld, Switzerland. In order to get a job in Frankfurt, Dete brings 5-year-old Heidi to her grandfather, who has been at odds with the villagers for years and lives in seclusion on the alm. He at first resents Heidi''s arrival, but the girl manages to penetrate his harsh exterior and subsequently has a delightful stay with him and her best friend, young Peter the goat-herd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNP3wP7WwFNUAuL1wA2LQ7gaHEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38427'),
  ('1083373242395794127', 'Heidi', 1995, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Family', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga', 'Jack Olesker', 'Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Bailee Reid, Kathleen Barr, Lillian Carlson, Garry Chalk, Ian James Corlett, Michael Donovan', null, 'After charming her reclusive grandfather and falling in love with the beautiful mountain he calls home, Heidi is uprooted and sent to Frankfurt where she befriends Klara, a young girl confined to a wheelchair.', 'After charming her reclusive grandfather and falling in love with the beautiful mountain he calls home, Heidi is uprooted and sent to Frankfurt where she befriends Klara, a young girl confined to a wheelchair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6lufpT7uALAsiMFiWrw14uNeiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109420'),
  ('973523201229781479', 'Heidi', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Paul Marcus, Peter Sinclair', 'Johanna Spyri', 'Emma Bolger, Max von Sydow, Pauline McLynn, Geraldine Chaplin, Sam Friend, Jessica Claridge, Peter Wight, Karl Johnson', null, 'Swiss girl Adelheid ''Heidi'' is orphaned young. Aunt Detie brings her to grandpa Alp and his wife, who live isolated in the Alps since his murder charge. Heidi soon takes to the wild country, especially accompanying young goatherd Peter. Grandpa refuses to send her to school in the city, but aunt Detie returns and forces him to give in. She''s sent to a posh lady in Frankfurt, where she''ll be a companion for crippled daughter Clara after school hours.', 'Swiss girl Adelheid ''Heidi'' is orphaned young. Aunt Detie brings her to grandpa Alp and his wife, who live isolated in the Alps since his murder charge. Heidi soon takes to the wild country, especially accompanying young goatherd Peter. Grandpa refuses to send her to school in the city, but aunt Detie returns and forces him to give in. She''s sent to a posh lady in Frankfurt, where she''ll be a companion for crippled daughter Clara after school hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2VZt4f1u2qsn2I62I4arTdlgQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43625'),
  ('463730160115426661', 'Heidi', 2015, 'Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Annette Stefan, Alain Gsponer, Matthias Fleischer', 'Petra Biondina Volpe', 'Anuk Steffen, Bruno Ganz, Quirin Agrippi, Isabelle Ottmann, Katharina Schüttler, Maxim Mehmet, Hannelore Hoger, Jella Haase', 'G', 'Heidi, is an eight-year-old Swiss orphan who is given by her aunt to her mountain-dwelling grandfather. She is then stolen back by her aunt from her grandfather to live in the wealthy Sesemann household in Frankfurt, Germany as a companion to Klara, a sheltered, disabled girl in a wheelchair. Heidi is unhappy but makes the best of the situation, always longing for her grandfather.', 'Heidi, is an eight-year-old Swiss orphan who is given by her aunt to her mountain-dwelling grandfather. She is then stolen back by her aunt from her grandfather to live in the wealthy Sesemann household in Frankfurt, Germany as a companion to Klara, a sheltered, disabled girl in a wheelchair. Heidi is unhappy but makes the best of the situation, always longing for her grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ue6L0x3C9V4c5kIiWnEIOPwtGhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365045'),
  ('516841230816121254', 'Heidi Fleiss: Hollywood Madam', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Nick Broomfield', null, 'Nick Broomfield, Heidi Fleiss, Madam Alex, Ivan Nagy, Corinne Bohrer, Ron Jeremy, Daryl Gates, Nina Xining Zuo', 'R', 'A documentary crew from the BBC arrives in L.A. intent on interviewing Heidi Fleiss, a year after her arrest for running a brothel but before her trial. Several months elapse before the interview, so the crew searches for anyone who''ll talk about the young woman. Two people have a lot to say to the camera: a retired madam named Alex for whom Fleiss once worked and Fleiss''s one-time boyfriend, Ivan Nagy, who introduced her to Alex. Alex and Nagy don''t like each other, so the crew shuttles between them with "she said" and "he said." When they finally interview Fleiss, they spend their time reciting what Alex and Nagy have had to say and asking her reaction.', 'A documentary crew from the BBC arrives in L.A. intent on interviewing Heidi Fleiss, a year after her arrest for running a brothel but before her trial. Several months elapse before the interview, so the crew searches for anyone who''ll talk about the young woman. Two people have a lot to say to the camera: a retired madam named Alex for whom Fleiss once worked and Fleiss''s one-time boyfriend, Ivan Nagy, who introduced her to Alex. Alex and Nagy don''t like each other, so the crew shuttles between them with "she said" and "he said." When they finally interview Fleiss, they spend their time reciting what Alex and Nagy have had to say and asking her reaction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laPSb9I8TuYslOh1OcgaTByWKnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63076'),
  ('391694590456541826', 'Height', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aleksandr Zarkhi, Vladimir Monakhov, Mikhail Gomorov', 'Mikhail Papava', 'Nikolai Rybnikov, Inna Makarova, Gennadi Karnovich-Valua, Marianna Strizhenova, Vasiliy Makarov, Boris Sitko, Sergei Romodanov, Elena Maksimova', null, 'For the construction of the plant comes a team of ironworkers, they will carry out the installation of the blast furnace according to the new method. A film about the difficult characters of ordinary Soviet people who know how to work, dream, love - to build a great human happiness.', 'For the construction of the plant comes a team of ironworkers, they will carry out the installation of the blast furnace according to the new method. A film about the difficult characters of ordinary Soviet people who know how to work, dream, love - to build a great human happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4vyl3zpyDbBtEWGdCbMSfLTKds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142797'),
  ('1086785303545161868', 'Heights', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chris Terrio, Jim Denault, David Blazina', 'Amy Fox', 'Glenn Close, Elizabeth Banks, Eric Bogosian, Jesse Bradford, Matthew Davis, Andrew Howard, Thomas Lennon, John Light', 'R', 'Spanning twenty-four hours, HEIGHTS follows five New Yorkers challenged to choose their destiny before the sun comes up the next day.', 'Spanning twenty-four hours, HEIGHTS follows five New Yorkers challenged to choose their destiny before the sun comes up the next day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMXCgZjJiHnXtBCdKM9WbKqYmbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29080'),
  ('26503759183751207', 'Heights', 2013, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Inti Aldasoro, Israel Cárdenas, Gabriel Nuncio', 'Gabriel Nuncio', 'Aglae Lingow, Ivanna Michel, Abdul Marcos, Sergio Quiñones, Ganzo Cepeda Javier, Alexandro Aldrete, Edwin Carcano, Iván González Quaker', null, 'Miriana “Miwi" awakens at midnight to find out her sister Juliana had an accident. We don''t have more information, just the vertiginous impulse of Miwi to take some food, money, a cell phone and start the car in order to accompany her sister on a trip where she will find some clues about what happened. We view the history from Miwi''s point of view while we found out the events that occurred sharing with her the pain and bewilderment.', 'Miriana “Miwi" awakens at midnight to find out her sister Juliana had an accident. We don''t have more information, just the vertiginous impulse of Miwi to take some food, money, a cell phone and start the car in order to accompany her sister on a trip where she will find some clues about what happened. We view the history from Miwi''s point of view while we found out the events that occurred sharing with her the pain and bewilderment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75W0N6qa47DAKHK7uXTqvZw01mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202665'),
  ('898288045884378885', 'Heil', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Dietrich Brüggemann, Alexander Sass', 'Dietrich Brüggemann', 'Benno Fürmann, Michael Gwisdek, Michael Kind, Anna Brüggemann, Hanns Zischler, Liv Lisa Fries, Jerry Hoffmann, Jacob Matschenz', null, 'An African-German Author loses his memory and is used by a modern National Socialist Party as promotion-figure for more political power over Germany.', 'An African-German Author loses his memory and is used by a modern National Socialist Party as promotion-figure for more political power over Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuBbB6inXvafrQ80jtIcTxWvdVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346239'),
  ('229170297205462274', 'Heima', 2007, 'Documentary, Music', 'Dean DeBlois, Alan Calzatti', null, 'Jon Thor Birgisson, Orri P. Dyrason, Georg Hólm, Kjartan Sveinsson, Hildur Ársælsdóttir, María Huld Markan Sigfúsdóttir, Edda Rún Ólafsdóttir, Sólrún Sumarliðadóttir', null, 'Ethereal post-rock pioneers Sigur Rós play a string of impromptu gigs in their native Iceland after finishing a world tour in 2006. As they travel through the country, the band visits a wide variety of venues, from a large outdoor festival to a coffee shop.', 'Ethereal post-rock pioneers Sigur Rós play a string of impromptu gigs in their native Iceland after finishing a world tour in 2006. As they travel through the country, the band visits a wide variety of venues, from a large outdoor festival to a coffee shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hopfH0rWbTTNYJmEb8R07f3ZUzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14793'),
  ('1076078870471232086', 'Heimat Is a Space in Time', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Thomas Heise, Stefan Neuberger', 'Thomas Heise', 'Thomas Heise', null, 'Director Thomas Heise picks up the biographical pieces left by his family, and composes an epic picture of four generations of his family, of a country, of a century.', 'Director Thomas Heise picks up the biographical pieces left by his family, and composes an epic picture of four generations of his family, of a country, of a century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fB6vQ9Lbfj85vs8giLXb8pDvTRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576308'),
  ('127823869928046001', 'Heimatkunde', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Andreas Coerper', null, 'Peter Bieringer, Martin Sonneborn', null, 'Former "Titanic" satire magazine editor Martin Sonneborn takes an undercover trip around Berlin and discovers the East-German mentality and what is left of the socialist German Democratic Republic.', 'Former "Titanic" satire magazine editor Martin Sonneborn takes an undercover trip around Berlin and discovers the East-German mentality and what is left of the socialist German Democratic Republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cte0tJLn7RHSWFu1DiC0r4eM5bb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16554'),
  ('666371533250341225', 'Heinrich', 1977, 'Drama', 'Thomas Mauch, Helma Sanders-Brahms', 'Helma Sanders-Brahms', 'Heinrich Giskes, Grischa Huber, Hannelore Hoger, Lina Carstens, Sigfrit Steiner, Heinz Hoenig, Henning Schlüter, Elisabeth Stepanek', null, 'The life and struggles of the German writer Heinrich von Kleist.', 'The life and struggles of the German writer Heinrich von Kleist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKfqKVszMWwxupTI2Z2IU6mKdzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346322'),
  ('387803477872564358', 'Heintje - Einmal wird die Sonne wieder scheinen', 1970, 'Family, Music', 'Hans Heinrich, Heinz Hölscher', 'Barbara Anders', 'Heintje Simons, Heinz Reincke, Gerlinde Locker, Paul Dahlke, Helmut Förnbacher, Christiane Rücker, Jan Hendriks, Agnes Windeck', null, 'When the bank clerk Klaus Helwig is arrested on suspicion of embezzlement, his son Heintje, whose mother died at birth, comes to his grumpy grandfather''s house. Heintje manages to win his heart and prove his father''s innocence..', 'When the bank clerk Klaus Helwig is arrested on suspicion of embezzlement, his son Heintje, whose mother died at birth, comes to his grumpy grandfather''s house. Heintje manages to win his heart and prove his father''s innocence..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1KhN1AgW9XSDeRqfNefRUhXibn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198935'),
  ('804136996014043202', 'Heir-Conditioned', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Sylvester is a rich cat, courtesy of his deceased mistress, who has left him $3 million. His alley cat friends, hope to sponge off his good fortune, and Sylvester is eager to share with them. But Elmer Fudd, as Sylvester''s new financial advisor, lectures him on investing his wealth in business and industry.', 'Sylvester is a rich cat, courtesy of his deceased mistress, who has left him $3 million. His alley cat friends, hope to sponge off his good fortune, and Sylvester is eager to share with them. But Elmer Fudd, as Sylvester''s new financial advisor, lectures him on investing his wealth in business and industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syG094CZUgm56M7tvv3oXrk721P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180078'),
  ('972541143096537038', 'Heiress of the Wind', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Gloria Carrión Fonseca', 'Gloria Carrión Fonseca', null, null, 'The rise and fall of the Sandinista revolutionary dream estranged a daughter from her parents. Thirty years later, the daughter takes a camera to tell their story and, indirectly, the story of Nicaragua.', 'The rise and fall of the Sandinista revolutionary dream estranged a daughter from her parents. Thirty years later, the daughter takes a camera to tell their story and, indirectly, the story of Nicaragua.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFfja6UG6kTgwl3fI3YQyPTb1JV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488602'),
  ('891669200369127323', 'Heisei Rider vs. Showa Rider: Kamen Rider Wars feat. Super Sentai', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Takayuki Shibasaki, Masao Inokuma', 'Shotaro Ishinomori', 'Gaku Sano, Hiroshi Fujioka, Itsuji Itao, Masahiro Inoue, Kento Handa, Renn Kiriyama, Yutaka Kobayashi, Mahiro Takasugi', null, 'The Underground Empire Badan makes its move, intending to invert the world. Kouta and Mai are pulled through one of these inversions where the discover a boy named Shu, who also holds the power to invert the world. As the Riders fight to protect Shu, Fifteen appears again, seeking Shu. As Kouta flees, past Riders gather and fight one another, split between the Showa and Heisei era Riders. But, the truth of Badan is not as it seems…', 'The Underground Empire Badan makes its move, intending to invert the world. Kouta and Mai are pulled through one of these inversions where the discover a boy named Shu, who also holds the power to invert the world. As the Riders fight to protect Shu, Fifteen appears again, seeking Shu. As Kouta flees, past Riders gather and fight one another, split between the Showa and Heisei era Riders. But, the truth of Badan is not as it seems…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aizl6PWROQ3bGUnOpXiamkkyZfs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270313'),
  ('74443221481792862', 'Heist', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Mamet, Robert Elswit, Isabelle Guay', 'David Mamet', 'Gene Hackman, Danny DeVito, Delroy Lindo, Sam Rockwell, Rebecca Pidgeon, Ricky Jay, Patti LuPone, Alan Bilzerian', 'R', 'Joe Moore has a job he loves. He''s a thief. His job goes sour when he gets caught on security camera tape. His fence, Bergman, reneges on the money he''s owed, and his wife may be betraying him with the fence''s young lieutenant. Moore and his partner, Bobby Blane, and their utility man, Pinky Pincus, find themselves broke, betrayed, and blackmailed. Moore is forced to commit his crew to do one last big job.', 'Joe Moore has a job he loves. He''s a thief. His job goes sour when he gets caught on security camera tape. His fence, Bergman, reneges on the money he''s owed, and his wife may be betraying him with the fence''s young lieutenant. Moore and his partner, Bobby Blane, and their utility man, Pinky Pincus, find themselves broke, betrayed, and blackmailed. Moore is forced to commit his crew to do one last big job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yKomryA4Oak54fPjBS9TXBmYji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11088'),
  ('790806200220328368', 'Heist', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Scott Mann, Brandon Cox, Lawrence Gough', 'Max Adams, Stephen C. Sepher', 'Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Robert De Niro, Kate Bosworth, Dave Bautista, Gina Carano, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, D. B. Sweeney, Morris Chestnut', 'R', 'A father is without the means to pay for his daughter''s medical treatment. As a last resort, he partners with a greedy co-worker to rob a casino. When things go awry they''re forced to hijack a city bus.', 'A father is without the means to pay for his daughter''s medical treatment. As a last resort, he partners with a greedy co-worker to rob a casino. When things go awry they''re forced to hijack a city bus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKdz5i9gbzJthAxUZBBj5SVbzKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336004'),
  ('236938576998447117', 'Heist 88', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Menhaj Huda', 'Dwayne Johnson-Cochran', 'Courtney B. Vance, Keesha Sharp, Keith David, Xavier Clyde, Bentley Green, Nican Robinson, Precious Way, Dwayne Johnson-Cochran', null, 'A criminal mastermind recruits a group of young bank employees to steal 80 million dollars in one of the largest bank heist in US history.', 'A criminal mastermind recruits a group of young bank employees to steal 80 million dollars in one of the largest bank heist in US history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ueFteb6V38fnSWTN4jIbLOlMlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1170944'),
  ('923695987662674460', 'Heist School', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ömer Faruk Sorak', 'Yiğit Güralp', 'İsmail Hacıoğlu, Yağmur Atacan, Rüya Önal, Caner Özyurtlu, Volkan Demirok, Hümeyra, Altan Erkekli, Güven Kıraç', null, 'Five high school students plans to steal University Entrance Exam booklets.', 'Five high school students plans to steal University Entrance Exam booklets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t53xz110VXSYtBciCuRkYvZsw9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27959'),
  ('258792294315668716', 'Held', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kyle Gentz, Travis Cluff, Chris Lofing', 'Jill Awbrey', 'Jill Awbrey, Bart Johnson, Travis Cluff, Zack Gold, Rez Kempton, Jener Dasilva, Jana Claire Price, Ian Jones', 'R', 'A couple''s ailing marriage is put to the test when they are held hostage in an isolated vacation rental by an unseen Voice that commands their every move and threatens harm if they don’t obey.', 'A couple''s ailing marriage is put to the test when they are held hostage in an isolated vacation rental by an unseen Voice that commands their every move and threatens harm if they don’t obey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8NqVX14i0d9gmKsZFcTRa8xuac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744750'),
  ('925007593956138863', 'Held for Ransom', 2019, 'Drama', 'Niels Arden Oplev, Anders W. Berthelsen', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Esben Smed, Toby Kebbell, Amir El-Masry, Sara Hjort Ditlevsen, Charlie Carrick, Anders W. Berthelsen, Fady Elsayed, Rafael Pettersson', null, 'HELD FOR RANSOM tells the true story of Danish photojournalist Daniel Rye who was held hostage for 398 days in Syria by the terror organization ISIS along with several other foreign nationals including the American journalist, James Foley. The film follows Daniel’s struggle to survive in captivity, his friendship with James, and the nightmare of the Rye family back home in Denmark as they try to do everything in their power to save their son. At the center of this crisis, we find hostage negotiator, Arthur, who plays a pivotal role in securing Daniel’s release.', 'HELD FOR RANSOM tells the true story of Danish photojournalist Daniel Rye who was held hostage for 398 days in Syria by the terror organization ISIS along with several other foreign nationals including the American journalist, James Foley. The film follows Daniel’s struggle to survive in captivity, his friendship with James, and the nightmare of the Rye family back home in Denmark as they try to do everything in their power to save their son. At the center of this crisis, we find hostage negotiator, Arthur, who plays a pivotal role in securing Daniel’s release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUmXSyhZzq3Yd5n6615mhfMgy6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607528'),
  ('665560561595542857', 'Held Up', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Steve Rash, David A. Makin', 'Jeff Eastin', 'Jamie Foxx, Nia Long, Barry Corbin, John Cullum, Jake Busey, Roselyn Sánchez, Eduardo Yáñez, Sarah Paulson', 'PG-13', 'What should have been a romantic getaway turns into one hilarious debacle after another when Michael''s woman dumps him in the desert where he gets carjacked by a teenager and he is taken hostage in a stickup at the local Sip and Zip.', 'What should have been a romantic getaway turns into one hilarious debacle after another when Michael''s woman dumps him in the desert where he gets carjacked by a teenager and he is taken hostage in a stickup at the local Sip and Zip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95AseMukZsjgDXC9NtgVQESAVgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19489'),
  ('368674538741668904', 'Helden - Wenn Dein Land Dich braucht', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Hansjörg Thurn, Peter Krause', 'Simon X. Rost', 'Christiane Paul, Hannes Jaenicke, Emilia Schüle, Jannis Niewöhner, Christine Neubauer, Armin Rohde, Heiner Lauterbach, Yvonne Catterfeld', null, 'Scientists try to simulate the Big Bang and the experiment gets out of control. While satellites come down and chaos arises, the stories of several people trying to survive is told.', 'Scientists try to simulate the Big Bang and the experiment gets out of control. While satellites come down and chaos arises, the stories of several people trying to survive is told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LGcn4jJ49dd3P7gQiTqqpNaPFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225755'),
  ('1086062705768515036', 'Helen', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sandra Nettelbeck, Michael Bertl, Rachel Leiterman', 'Sandra Nettelbeck', 'Ashley Judd, Goran Višnjić, Lauren Lee Smith, Alexia Fast, Alberta Watson, Leah Cairns, David Hewlett, David Nykl', null, 'On the outside, Helen has it all – a loving family and a successful career – but when her suppressed mental illness resurfaces, the world crumbles around her. Crippled by depression, Helen finds solace through her friendship with Mathilda, a kindred spirit struggling with bipolar disorder.', 'On the outside, Helen has it all – a loving family and a successful career – but when her suppressed mental illness resurfaces, the world crumbles around her. Crippled by depression, Helen finds solace through her friendship with Mathilda, a kindred spirit struggling with bipolar disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEs97E6NlySjkMEWsDYs0BhQ9Mw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1731'),
  ('320444589812940950', 'Helen', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Family', 'Mathukutty Xavier, Anend C Chandran, Anil Abraham', 'Alfred Kurian Joseph, Mathukutty Xavier, Noble Babu Thomas', 'Anna Ben, Lal, Noble Babu Thomas, Aju Varghese, Rony David Raj, Binu Pappu, Bonny Mary Mathew, Vineeth Sreenivasan', null, 'An ordinary suburban girl faces the biggest battle of her life when her sudden disappearance for a brief period leads to a desperate search by her loved ones.', 'An ordinary suburban girl faces the biggest battle of her life when her sudden disappearance for a brief period leads to a desperate search by her loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/166Gz2EQFwvGEyWU1sDtxOiGVAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640052'),
  ('558789712161300064', 'Helen of Troy', 1956, 'Adventure, War, Romance, History', 'Robert Wise, Harry Stradling Sr., Sergio Leone', 'Hugh Gray, John Twist', 'Rossana Podestà, Jacques Sernas, Cedric Hardwicke, Stanley Baker, Niall MacGinnis, Nora Swinburne, Robert Douglas, Torin Thatcher', 'PG', 'Prince Paris of Troy, shipwrecked on a mission to the king of Sparta, meets and falls for Queen Helen before he knows who she is. Rudely received by the royal Greeks, he must flee...but fate and their mutual passions lead him to take Helen along. This gives the Greeks just the excuse they need for much-desired war.', 'Prince Paris of Troy, shipwrecked on a mission to the king of Sparta, meets and falls for Queen Helen before he knows who she is. Rudely received by the royal Greeks, he must flee...but fate and their mutual passions lead him to take Helen along. This gives the Greeks just the excuse they need for much-desired war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0JgGavnWfisAkFEhGfu9xbzceS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42658'),
  ('988991765424407018', 'Helena', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alejandro Sugich', null, 'Alfonso Dosal, Natalia Varela, Pedro de Tavira, Alfonso André', null, 'Julieta meets Ivan will visiting Mexico and Ivan tries to get Julieta to fall in love with him as he takes her on a tour of Mexico City.', 'Julieta meets Ivan will visiting Mexico and Ivan tries to get Julieta to fall in love with him as he takes her on a tour of Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5FcZuPq43PiAz5iZChj72vacJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488411'),
  ('928372805928556063', 'Heleno', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'José Henrique Fonseca, Walter Carvalho, Marcos Pimenta', 'L.G. Bayão', 'Rodrigo Santoro, Alinne Moraes, Angie Cepeda, Erom Cordeiro, Mauricio Tizumba, Duda Ribeiro, Orã Figueiredo, Jean Pierre Noher', 'R', 'José Henrique Fonseca crafts an ambitious and long overdue homage to a central icon in Brazil’s 20th century history. Reminiscent of film noir classics, the biopic tells the glorious and tragic story of the legendary football striker Heleno de Freitas. The sumptuous black and white cinematography reflects the chic life of Rio de Janeiro in the 1940s as it fell under the spell of sports royalty. Heleno was no doubt one of the most popular players of his time for his bravura in the field and magnificent goal-scoring that lead the Botafogo team to the top and himself into a vicious downward spiral.', 'José Henrique Fonseca crafts an ambitious and long overdue homage to a central icon in Brazil’s 20th century history. Reminiscent of film noir classics, the biopic tells the glorious and tragic story of the legendary football striker Heleno de Freitas. The sumptuous black and white cinematography reflects the chic life of Rio de Janeiro in the 1940s as it fell under the spell of sports royalty. Heleno was no doubt one of the most popular players of his time for his bravura in the field and magnificent goal-scoring that lead the Botafogo team to the top and himself into a vicious downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vD3LrZAhvCfVNBXixGxQz8RPRcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98525'),
  ('359838964176897682', 'Helga: She Wolf of Stilberg', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Alain Hardy, Patrice Rhomm, Alain Payet', 'H.L. Rostaine', 'Patrizia Gori, Malisa Longo, Claude Janna, Dominique Aveline, Alban Ceray, Jacques Marbeuf, Richard Lemieuvre, Olivier Mathot', null, 'Helga, a woman who runs a strict prison camp, forces her female prisoners into slave labor and to be love toys for her own personal pleasure, as well as for her soldiers. Issuing torture and whippings to anyone who dares defy her, man or woman.', 'Helga, a woman who runs a strict prison camp, forces her female prisoners into slave labor and to be love toys for her own personal pleasure, as well as for her soldiers. Issuing torture and whippings to anyone who dares defy her, man or woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6UsjINEgL0Ox7LOOr29Z9KMwvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117550'),
  ('142496383333763262', 'Heli', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Amat Escalante, Lorenzo Hagerman, Inti Aldasoro', 'Amat Escalante', 'Armando Espitia, Andrea Vergara, Linda Gonzalez, Juan Eduardo Palacios, Kenny Johnston, Reina Julieta Torres, Gabriel Reyes, Ramón Álvarez Escudero', 'NR', 'Heli must try and protect his young family when his 12-year-old sister inadvertently involves them in the brutal drug world. He must battle against the drug cartel that have been angered as well as the corrupt police force.', 'Heli must try and protect his young family when his 12-year-old sister inadvertently involves them in the brutal drug world. He must battle against the drug cartel that have been angered as well as the corrupt police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cblCQ0h5oFYlufWoYeFJZAYm0bZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186935'),
  ('629979113457964084', 'Helicopter Eela', 2018, 'Drama', 'Pradeep Sarkar, Sirsha Ray, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Anand Gandhi', 'Kajol, Riddhi Sen, Tota Roy Chowdhury, Neha Dhupia, Mukesh Rishi, Shataf Figar, Atul Kulkarni, Imran Khan', null, 'Eela, an aspiring playback singer, and single mother has given up all her dreams to raise her only son, who backlashes her for invading his privacy.', 'Eela, an aspiring playback singer, and single mother has given up all her dreams to raise her only son, who backlashes her for invading his privacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nl4RpcRKROSvqkoJzthUAhJ7NG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545273'),
  ('1016212410291263675', 'Helios', 2015, 'Action, Mystery, Adventure, Thriller', 'Sunny Luk Kim-Ching, Leung Lok-Man, Pakie Chan', 'Sunny Luk Kim-Ching, Leung Lok-Man', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Chang Chen, Wang Xueqi, Ji Jin-hee, Choi Si-won, Janice Man Wing-San', null, 'Wanted criminal "Helios" and his assistant stole a quantity of uranium and plan to produce weapons of mass destruction. They are planning to trade with a terrorist organization in Hong Kong. Chief Inspector Lee Yinming and Inspector Fan Kaming lead the Counter Terrorism Response Unit of the Hong Kong Police Force. Along with a Chinese senior official, a physics professor, and two South Korean weapon experts, they hope to defuse a crisis sufficient to destroy the world.', 'Wanted criminal "Helios" and his assistant stole a quantity of uranium and plan to produce weapons of mass destruction. They are planning to trade with a terrorist organization in Hong Kong. Chief Inspector Lee Yinming and Inspector Fan Kaming lead the Counter Terrorism Response Unit of the Hong Kong Police Force. Along with a Chinese senior official, a physics professor, and two South Korean weapon experts, they hope to defuse a crisis sufficient to destroy the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIL0ggdzO1Y7kOMEZIUV1XzvJ92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315509'),
  ('741040297065037947', 'Hell', 1983, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Music', 'Rein Raamat, Sigrun Alaots, Janno Põldma', 'Rein Raamat', null, null, 'Rein Raamat’s Hell adapts the engravings of Estonian graphic artist Eduard Wiiralt into a surreal, grotesque, and heavily sexual animated short. Wiiralt’s three source works, “The Preacher,” “Cabaret,” and “Hell,” date back to the early 1930s and portray a cacophony of bacchanalia, hysteria, and violence in the final years of Estonian independence amid the unrest of the Great Depression and European instability.', 'Rein Raamat’s Hell adapts the engravings of Estonian graphic artist Eduard Wiiralt into a surreal, grotesque, and heavily sexual animated short. Wiiralt’s three source works, “The Preacher,” “Cabaret,” and “Hell,” date back to the early 1930s and portray a cacophony of bacchanalia, hysteria, and violence in the final years of Estonian independence amid the unrest of the Great Depression and European instability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OGn2WW2GzCz6rCUNmYmrQwoBmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127358'),
  ('302878761565802753', 'Hell', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Sathit Praditsarn, Teekayu Thamnitayakul, Krieangsak Sukpan', 'Marisa Mallikamarl', 'Natchukorn Maikan, Nathawan Woravit, Punyapon Dhajsonk, Akom Preedakul, Sittichai Laungesalee, Baworanrit Chantasakda, Dollaya Polthipattayakul, Kanjanaporn Plodpai', null, 'While traveling, a crew of documentary makers meet a horrible fate when their van falls off a cliff. Though only one of them really dies, the rest are ''accidentally'' dragged into hell where each are tortured according to their sins.', 'While traveling, a crew of documentary makers meet a horrible fate when their van falls off a cliff. Though only one of them really dies, the rest are ''accidentally'' dragged into hell where each are tortured according to their sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MyBdL7qYZK1RQa1AsHbIHB3tUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40356'),
  ('732030459668245043', 'Hell', 2006, 'Drama', 'Bruno Chiche', 'Lolita Pille, Bruno Chiche', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Christiane Millet, Didier Sandre, Anne-Marie Philipe, Louise Monot, May Alexandrov, Sara Forestier', null, 'Hell is a rich girl from Paris’ posh neighbourhoods living in the fast lane to compensate the void of her life: sex, drugs & rock’ n’ roll. She meets her male counterpart in the person of Andrea, a seductive young man, and they both fall madly in love.', 'Hell is a rich girl from Paris’ posh neighbourhoods living in the fast lane to compensate the void of her life: sex, drugs & rock’ n’ roll. She meets her male counterpart in the person of Andrea, a seductive young man, and they both fall madly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfawObR1WhWyGb2Pg2Oz0VzveWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33753'),
  ('177062859300472392', 'Hell', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Tim Fehlbaum, Markus Förderer', 'Tim Fehlbaum, Oliver Kahl, Thomas Wöbke', 'Hannah Herzsprung, Lars Eidinger, Stipe Erceg, Lisa Vicari, Angela Winkler, Yoann Blanc, Christoph Gaugler, Ellen Schweiger', 'R', 'In 2016 the sun has turned the entire world into a scorched and barren wasteland. The humans who have survived are either resourceful or violent, and sometimes both. Marie, her little sister Leonie, and best friend Phillip, are in a car headed to the mountains - rumor has it there is water there. Along the way they meet Tom, a first-rate mechanic. But can they trust him? Fraught with deep distrust, the group is lured into an ambush where their real battle for survival begins.', 'In 2016 the sun has turned the entire world into a scorched and barren wasteland. The humans who have survived are either resourceful or violent, and sometimes both. Marie, her little sister Leonie, and best friend Phillip, are in a car headed to the mountains - rumor has it there is water there. Along the way they meet Tom, a first-rate mechanic. But can they trust him? Fraught with deep distrust, the group is lured into an ambush where their real battle for survival begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJulOgsQxehjHhAdhIi9SgLLFHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73262'),
  ('203190707777394252', 'Hell and Back', 2015, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Animation, Adventure', 'Tom Gianas, Greg Cahill, Misha Klein', 'Hugh Sterbakov, Zeb Wells', 'Nick Swardson, T.J. Miller, Mila Kunis, Bob Odenkirk, Susan Sarandon, Danny McBride, Rob Riggle, Jennifer Coolidge', 'R', 'Two best friends set out to rescue their pal after he''s accidentally dragged to hell.', 'Two best friends set out to rescue their pal after he''s accidentally dragged to hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Sjz7cDxQOv4IMiWkEcknDjLC18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336313'),
  ('502092835616097708', 'Hell and High Water', 1954, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Samuel Fuller, Joseph MacDonald', 'Samuel Fuller, Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Richard Widmark, Bella Darvi, Victor Francen, Cameron Mitchell, Gene Evans, David Wayne, Stephen Bekassy, Richard Loo', 'NR', 'A privately-financed scientist and his colleagues hire an ex-Navy officer to conduct an Alaskan submarine expedition in order to prevent a Red Chinese anti-American plot that may lead to World War III. Mixes deviously plotted schoolboy fiction with submarine spectacle and cold war heroics.', 'A privately-financed scientist and his colleagues hire an ex-Navy officer to conduct an Alaskan submarine expedition in order to prevent a Red Chinese anti-American plot that may lead to World War III. Mixes deviously plotted schoolboy fiction with submarine spectacle and cold war heroics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umpMY57hbbBxHfg5tjNuZeTCAA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23097'),
  ('500365397249242404', 'Hell Baby', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Robert Ben Garant, Thomas Lennon, David Lincoln', 'Thomas Lennon, Robert Ben Garant', 'Rob Corddry, Leslie Bibb, Keegan-Michael Key, Paul Scheer, Rob Huebel, Thomas Lennon, Michael Ian Black, Riki Lindhome', 'R', 'After she and her husband move into a haunted house, a woman gives birth to a demonic infant that wreaks havoc.', 'After she and her husband move into a haunted house, a woman gives birth to a demonic infant that wreaks havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQTBwT8T26fuIr0T9iV7PYTUHmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159092'),
  ('59300717888217657', 'Hell Behind the Bars', 1984, 'Action, Drama', 'Gianni Siragusa', 'Sergio Garrone', 'Rita Silva, Ajita Wilson, Linda Jones, Leo Annibali, Aperio Bella Olivia, Enrica Saltutti, Alessandro Freyberger, Leda Simonetti', null, 'A woman murders her boyfriends and steals some diamonds he has smuggled. She gets found out though, and locked in a prison with an evil sadistic lesbian warden. She immediately sets about planning her escape with some of her fellow inmates, but the plans are even more difficult than they seemed when set in motion.', 'A woman murders her boyfriends and steals some diamonds he has smuggled. She gets found out though, and locked in a prison with an evil sadistic lesbian warden. She immediately sets about planning her escape with some of her fellow inmates, but the plans are even more difficult than they seemed when set in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5tDm1QVysYOMxzLVSIqkadBgEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125141'),
  ('493394820473690531', 'Hell Below', 1933, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'Jack Conway, Paul Wilkins', 'Raymond L. Schrock, Laird Doyle', 'Robert Montgomery, Walter Huston, Madge Evans, Jimmy Durante, Eugene Pallette, Robert Young, Edwin Styles, John Lee Mahin', 'NR', 'On leave in Italy, Lt. Tommy Knowlton falls in love with Jean Standish, who''s not only married, but is the daughter of his submarine''s commander. Friction between the two officers becomes intolerable once at sea and after Commander Toler is forced to abandon Tommy''s best friend topside while the sub dives to escape enemy planes, Tommy is no longer able to contain his anger.', 'On leave in Italy, Lt. Tommy Knowlton falls in love with Jean Standish, who''s not only married, but is the daughter of his submarine''s commander. Friction between the two officers becomes intolerable once at sea and after Commander Toler is forced to abandon Tommy''s best friend topside while the sub dives to escape enemy planes, Tommy is no longer able to contain his anger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6umrteNk6RrJ4BdB5fLobdTWft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223816'),
  ('75286276200528918', 'Hell Bent for Leather', 1960, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Clifford Stine, Phil Bowles', 'Christopher Knopf', 'Audie Murphy, Felicia Farr, Stephen McNally, Robert Middleton, James Westmoreland, Jan Merlin, Herbert Rudley, Malcolm Atterbury', 'PG', 'When Clay Santell stops in the town of Sutterville after having his horse stolen, he is mistaken by townspeople for a murderer named Travers. The townspeople capture Santell, and turn him over to lawman Harry Deckett. Deckett, who is tired of chasing the real Travers, decides to kill Santell and pass him off as Travers. Santell escapes from Deckett, taking lovely Janet Gifford hostage in the process. Janet comes to believe Santell''s story, and helps him in his struggle to prove his real identity.', 'When Clay Santell stops in the town of Sutterville after having his horse stolen, he is mistaken by townspeople for a murderer named Travers. The townspeople capture Santell, and turn him over to lawman Harry Deckett. Deckett, who is tired of chasing the real Travers, decides to kill Santell and pass him off as Travers. Santell escapes from Deckett, taking lovely Janet Gifford hostage in the process. Janet comes to believe Santell''s story, and helps him in his struggle to prove his real identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMBhOicw9PxTN1MMvpohBdAYlNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118653'),
  ('1026316780281786217', 'Hell Boats', 1970, 'War, Drama', 'Paul Wendkos', 'Anthony Spinner, Donald Ford', 'James Franciscus, Elizabeth Shepherd, Ronald Allen, Magda Konopka, Drewe Henley, Reuven Bar-Yotam, Inigo Jackson, Philip Madoc', 'PG-13', 'A war drama of motor torpedo boats which did much unsung work in WW2, but the naval battles merely provide an exciting story in which an even more special romantic drama is wrapped up.', 'A war drama of motor torpedo boats which did much unsung work in WW2, but the naval battles merely provide an exciting story in which an even more special romantic drama is wrapped up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gj98uuiOttTGHw4JAy9Jh3mIq6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99356'),
  ('501952626417906127', 'Hell Bound', 1957, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'William J. Hole Jr., Carl E. Guthrie, Paul Wurtzel', 'Richard H. Landau', 'John Russell, June Blair, Stuart Whitman, Margo Woode, George E. Mather, Stanley Adams, Frank Fenton, Virginia De Lee', null, 'After WW2, a Los Angeles crime ring uses a complex scheme, involving a freight ship, a junkie, and a corrupt health officer, to smuggle drugs into the USA.', 'After WW2, a Los Angeles crime ring uses a complex scheme, involving a freight ship, a junkie, and a corrupt health officer, to smuggle drugs into the USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ap0gaOtt5BraX7PW9dpmvdyuJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47056'),
  ('1122541464231371903', 'Hell Camp: Teen Nightmare', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Liza Williams, Stefano Ferrari', null, 'Steve Cartisano, Paris Hilton', null, 'Out-of-control teens across America were sent to a therapy camp in the harsh Utah desert. The conditions were brutal, but the staff were even worse.', 'Out-of-control teens across America were sent to a therapy camp in the harsh Utah desert. The conditions were brutal, but the staff were even worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2U72kQYYeBU2QAfAaPRkJP5fr5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1215278'),
  ('679467346282866483', 'Hell Comes to Frogtown', 1988, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Donald G. Jackson, R.J. Kizer, Donald G. Jackson', 'Randall Frakes', 'Roddy Piper, Sandahl Bergman, Cec Verrell, William Smith, Rory Calhoun, Nicholas Worth, Kristi Somers, Cliff Bemis', 'R', '''Hell'' is the name of the hero of the story. He''s a prisoner of the women who now run the USA after a nuclear/biological war. Results of the war are that mutants have evolved, and the human race is in danger of extinction due to infertility. Hell is given the task of helping in the rescue of a group of fertile women from the harem of the mutant leader (resembling a frog). Hell cannot escape since he has a bomb attached to his private parts which will detonate if he strays more than a few hundred yards from his guard.', '''Hell'' is the name of the hero of the story. He''s a prisoner of the women who now run the USA after a nuclear/biological war. Results of the war are that mutants have evolved, and the human race is in danger of extinction due to infertility. Hell is given the task of helping in the rescue of a group of fertile women from the harem of the mutant leader (resembling a frog). Hell cannot escape since he has a bomb attached to his private parts which will detonate if he strays more than a few hundred yards from his guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ry5Sh2oFBUj8zqWzAx5Xm8j79i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22572'),
  ('360378730345954086', 'Hell Divers', 1932, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'George W. Hill, Harold Wenstrom, Harold Lipstein', 'Harvey Gates, Malcolm Stuart Boylan', 'Wallace Beery, Clark Gable, Conrad Nagel, Dorothy Jordan, Marie Prevost, Marjorie Rambeau, Cliff Edwards, John Miljan', 'NR', 'The story of two Naval crewmen who work hard at sea and play harder on land.', 'The story of two Naval crewmen who work hard at sea and play harder on land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCe3AMEXtJ5f62e8LRgRWv4RWFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172883'),
  ('244169652464556472', 'Hell Dogs', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Masato Harada, Takahide Shibanushi, Takuro Doi', 'Masato Harada', 'Junichi Okada, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Mayu Matsuoka, Kazuki Kitamura, Shinobu Otake, MIYAVI, Satoshi Kanada, Mitsuo Yoshihara', null, 'Bent on revenge, a traumatized ex-police officer must infiltrate a yakuza organization by befriending one of the group''s most unhinged members.', 'Bent on revenge, a traumatized ex-police officer must infiltrate a yakuza organization by befriending one of the group''s most unhinged members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2V1WlBuYcTjkXNS3i3IPvT4xQJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910371'),
  ('163929441120471971', 'Hell Drivers', 1957, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Cy Endfield, Geoffrey Unsworth, Stanley Hosgood', 'John Kruse, Cy Endfield', 'Stanley Baker, Herbert Lom, Peggy Cummins, Patrick McGoohan, William Hartnell, Wilfrid Lawson, Sidney James, Jill Ireland', 'NR', 'An ex-con trying to go clean ends up working for a crooked trucking company swindling money.', 'An ex-con trying to go clean ends up working for a crooked trucking company swindling money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zsGqmJVY0b4Ycdxz753zalUd5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44940'),
  ('430913673288865784', 'Hell Fest', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gregory Plotkin, José David Montero, Tim Fitzgerald', 'Seth M. Sherwood, Blair Butler, Akela Cooper', 'Amy Forsyth, Christian James, Reign Edwards, Roby Attal, Bex Taylor-Klaus, Matt Mercurio, Courtney Dietz, Cynthea Mercado', 'R', 'On Halloween night at a horror theme park, a costumed killer begins slaying innocent patrons who believe that it''s all part of the festivities.', 'On Halloween night at a horror theme park, a costumed killer begins slaying innocent patrons who believe that it''s all part of the festivities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgLlnlrUtTKXkdrgMBwUfkyAkya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429476'),
  ('867533171888787687', 'Hell Girl', 2019, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Koji Shiraishi, Takahiro Kobayashi', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Tina Tamashiro, Manami Hashimoto, Raiku, Akaji Maro, Nana Mori, Nimura Sawa, Mina Ōba, Yusaku Mori', null, 'Tormented and bullied people can access a special website, run by a Hell Girl who will enable them to take revenge on their torturers. The price for such a service is only that the person must join their torturer in damnation.', 'Tormented and bullied people can access a special website, run by a Hell Girl who will enable them to take revenge on their torturers. The price for such a service is only that the person must join their torturer in damnation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejR46fMxskeUvAwvybmO5KwPQjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548784'),
  ('1077258375794002883', 'Hell Harbor', 1930, 'Romance, Drama', 'Henry King', 'Clarke Silvernail', 'Lupe Vélez, Jean Hersholt, John Holland, Gibson Gowland, Harry Allen, Al St. John, Rondo Hatton, Paul E. Burns', 'NR', 'Lovely Anita dreams of escaping the monotony of her island home and sailing to bustling Havana. But when her abusive father promises her to the greasy local merchant, Anita does everything in her power to make her dream a reality.', 'Lovely Anita dreams of escaping the monotony of her island home and sailing to bustling Havana. But when her abusive father promises her to the greasy local merchant, Anita does everything in her power to make her dream a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LmqXzZuOrs1jnVAmVgUvvy84La.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166623'),
  ('171702966347774961', 'Hell Hath No Fury', 2021, 'Action, War', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Jonathan Hall', 'Romain Serir, Katharine Lee McEwan', 'Nina Bergman, Daniel Bernhardt, Louis Mandylor, Timothy V. Murphy, Dominique Vandenberg, Josef Cannon, Luke LaFontaine, Charles Fathy', 'R', 'Branded a traitor by her countrymen, French national Marie DuJardin is rescued by American soldiers on one condition: to survive, she must lead them to a cache of gold - before the Nazis return to claim it for themselves.', 'Branded a traitor by her countrymen, French national Marie DuJardin is rescued by American soldiers on one condition: to survive, she must lead them to a cache of gold - before the Nazis return to claim it for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wltdRZfeKDux9yKThlGKwjWhUil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877013'),
  ('777707994457641376', 'Hell High', 1989, 'Horror', 'Douglas Grossman, Steven Fierberg', 'Douglas Grossman, Leo Evans', 'Maureen Mooney, Christopher Stryker, Christopher Cousins, Millie Prezioso, Jason Brill, Kathryn Rossetter, J.R. Horne, Daniel Beer', 'R', 'A teacher still haunted by the death of two teens that she accidentally caused as a young girl goes berserk when four teens start harassing her and then attack her in her home.', 'A teacher still haunted by the death of two teens that she accidentally caused as a young girl goes berserk when four teens start harassing her and then attack her in her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajQi43EMdGnzt2HJLo1ZCo6vb6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78253'),
  ('435562575486428985', 'Hell Hole', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Adams, Toby Poser, Sean Dahlberg', 'Lulu Adams, John Adams, Toby Poser', 'Toby Poser, John Adams, Max Portman, Anders Hove, Olivera Peruničić, Aleksandar Trmčić, Petar Arsić, Bruno Veljanovski', null, 'Far away, in the desolate Serbian wilderness, a U.S.-led fracking crew uncover a dormant monster gestating inside a centuries-old French soldier. Now awakened and exposed in its most dangerously fragile state, it tears through the men on the grounds in search of a new womb.', 'Far away, in the desolate Serbian wilderness, a U.S.-led fracking crew uncover a dormant monster gestating inside a centuries-old French soldier. Now awakened and exposed in its most dangerously fragile state, it tears through the men on the grounds in search of a new womb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dT2xGjrjITvvApNnBsBE5ikO1im.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287850'),
  ('215472511633215165', 'Hell House', 2001, 'Documentary', 'George Ratliff', null, null, null, 'A look at the "Hell House" performed annually in October by the youth members of Trinity Church (Assemblies of God) in Cedar Hill, Texas (a Dallas suburb) — seen by over 10,000 visitors each year.', 'A look at the "Hell House" performed annually in October by the youth members of Trinity Church (Assemblies of God) in Cedar Hill, Texas (a Dallas suburb) — seen by over 10,000 visitors each year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xw3KHTA3daJeRS6VN2egiE59ZFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33068'),
  ('699328230009479089', 'Hell House LLC', 2015, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Stephen Cognetti, Jay Capece, Brian C. Harnick', 'Stephen Cognetti', 'Danny Bellini, Ryan Jennifer Jones, Gore Abrams, Jared Hacker, Adam Schneider, Alice Bahlke, Jeb Kreager, Lauren A. Kennedy', 'NR', 'Five years after an unexplained malfunction causes the death of 15 tour-goers and staff on the opening night of a Halloween haunted house tour, a documentary crew travels back to the scene of the tragedy to find out what really happened.', 'Five years after an unexplained malfunction causes the death of 15 tour-goers and staff on the opening night of a Halloween haunted house tour, a documentary crew travels back to the scene of the tragedy to find out what really happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUSCQEbbAy3Lv6r00RfXtdxhRDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359246'),
  ('225628812104432790', 'Hell House LLC II: The Abaddon Hotel', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Joe Schufreider, Cameron Munson, Stephen Cognetti', 'Stephen Cognetti', 'Vas Eli, Jillian Geurts, Joy Shatz, Dustin Austen, Brian David Tracy, Kyle Ingleman, Amanda K. Morales, Laura Frenzer', 'NR', 'Eight years after the opening night tragedy of HELL HOUSE LLC, many unanswered questions remain. Thanks to an anonymous tip, an investigative journalist is convinced that key evidence is hidden inside the abandoned Abaddon Hotel. She assembles a team to break into the hotel in hopes of discovering the truth. But the source of the tip and the secrets of the Abaddon Hotel are more horrifying than any of them could have imagined.', 'Eight years after the opening night tragedy of HELL HOUSE LLC, many unanswered questions remain. Thanks to an anonymous tip, an investigative journalist is convinced that key evidence is hidden inside the abandoned Abaddon Hotel. She assembles a team to break into the hotel in hopes of discovering the truth. But the source of the tip and the secrets of the Abaddon Hotel are more horrifying than any of them could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFPkQLUq8wmNOL2XMow4WF5tOpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532973'),
  ('863181814527662592', 'Hell House LLC III: Lake of Fire', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Stephen Cognetti, Carlos Garcia de Dios, Cameron Munson', 'Stephen Cognetti', 'Gabriel Chytry, Elizabeth Vermilyea, Sam Kazzi, Ryan Jennifer Jones, Theodore Bouloukos, Brian David Tracy, Bridgid Abrams, Joy Shatz', 'NR', 'Set one year after the events of Hell House LLC II, the hotel is on the verge of being torn down when it is purchased by billionaire Russell Wynn as the new home for his popular interactive show, Insomnia. He invites journalist Venessa Sheppard and her crew to record everything happening inside the hotel leading up to the performance - but they soon encounter a more nefarious plot, one that threatens to unleash a veritable hell on earth.', 'Set one year after the events of Hell House LLC II, the hotel is on the verge of being torn down when it is purchased by billionaire Russell Wynn as the new home for his popular interactive show, Insomnia. He invites journalist Venessa Sheppard and her crew to record everything happening inside the hotel leading up to the performance - but they soon encounter a more nefarious plot, one that threatens to unleash a veritable hell on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gchygJq6AnzGFg0uYRDKn7mqsyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614722'),
  ('589765674980840272', 'Hell House LLC Origins: The Carmichael Manor', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Josh Layton, Cameron Munson, Stephen Cognetti', 'Stephen Cognetti', 'Bridget Rose Perrotta, Destiny Leilani Brown, James Liddell, Gideon Berger, Cayla Berejikian, Victoria Andrunik, Darin F. Earl II, Searra Sawka', null, 'A group of cold case investigators stay at the Carmichael Manor, site of the grisly and unsolved murders of the Carmichael family back in the eighties. After four nights, the group was never heard from again. What is discovered on their footage is even more disturbing than anything found on the Hell House tapes.', 'A group of cold case investigators stay at the Carmichael Manor, site of the grisly and unsolved murders of the Carmichael family back in the eighties. After four nights, the group was never heard from again. What is discovered on their footage is even more disturbing than anything found on the Hell House tapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsd1ovBNOhYpQElhlZAqpMo51q6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035982'),
  ('1080800642275965590', 'Hell House LLC: Lineage', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Stephen Cognetti, Cameron Munson, Brian Keenan', 'Stephen Cognetti', 'Elizabeth Vermilyea, Searra Sawka, Mike Sutton, Joe Bandelli, Cayla Berejikian, Victoria Andrunik, Gideon Berger, Bridget Rose Perrotta', null, 'After a near-death experience, Vanessa Shepherd faces nightmares in Abaddon. As mysterious deaths occur around her, she discovers her connection to the Abaddon Hotel, Carmichael Manor, and decades of unexplained murders.', 'After a near-death experience, Vanessa Shepherd faces nightmares in Abaddon. As mysterious deaths occur around her, she discovers her connection to the Abaddon Hotel, Carmichael Manor, and decades of unexplained murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFZo2cUEF16gsY5lhewOLFA7CBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1202306'),
  ('270666347754090347', 'Hell in the City', 1959, 'Drama', 'Renato Castellani, Leonida Barboni, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Anna Magnani, Giulietta Masina, Myriam Bru, Cristina Gaïoni, Anita Durante, Milly, Marcella Rovena, Miranda Campa', null, 'A young girl comes to prison and experiences the entire prison subculture. The inmates she befriends vary from big tough dangerous dames to smaller submissive ladies who are totally lost in prison life.', 'A young girl comes to prison and experiences the entire prison subculture. The inmates she befriends vary from big tough dangerous dames to smaller submissive ladies who are totally lost in prison life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xM0uZQ9UnIvAHFXlCKhQ3lFvNKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82486'),
  ('73566958590143223', 'Hell in the Pacific', 1968, 'Drama, War, Adventure', 'John Boorman, Conrad Hall, Yōichi Matsue', 'Alexander Jacobs, Eric Bercovici', 'Lee Marvin, Toshirō Mifune', 'G', 'During World War II, a shot-down American pilot and a marooned Japanese navy captain find themselves stranded on the same small uninhabited island in the Pacific Ocean.', 'During World War II, a shot-down American pilot and a marooned Japanese navy captain find themselves stranded on the same small uninhabited island in the Pacific Ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEiJRrDP6m0o96v7n2UMtad4sAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31681'),
  ('635389969027391062', 'Hell Is a City', 1960, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Arthur Grant, Val Guest', 'Val Guest', 'Stanley Baker, John Crawford, Donald Pleasence, Maxine Audley, Billie Whitelaw, Joseph Tomelty, George A. Cooper, Vanda Godsell', 'NR', 'Set in Manchester, heartland of England''s industrial north, Don Starling escapes from jail becoming England''s most wanted man. Ruthless villain Starling together with his cronies engineered a robbery that resulted in the violent death of a young girl. Detective Inspector Martineau has been assigned to hunt him down and bring him in. From seedy barrooms, through gambling dens the trail leads to an explosive climax high on the rooftops of the city.', 'Set in Manchester, heartland of England''s industrial north, Don Starling escapes from jail becoming England''s most wanted man. Ruthless villain Starling together with his cronies engineered a robbery that resulted in the violent death of a young girl. Detective Inspector Martineau has been assigned to hunt him down and bring him in. From seedy barrooms, through gambling dens the trail leads to an explosive climax high on the rooftops of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iG0rItDagvFyU3bVyaAwiXOTk2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28784'),
  ('1041125194849441832', 'Hell Is for Heroes', 1962, 'War', 'Don Siegel, Harold Lipstein, William McGarry', 'Robert Pirosh, Richard Carr', 'Steve McQueen, Bobby Darin, Fess Parker, Harry Guardino, James Coburn, Mike Kellin, Joseph Hoover, Bill Mullikin', 'NR', 'World War II drama where the action centers around a single maneuver by a squad of GIs in retaliation against the force of the German Siegfried line. Reese joins a group of weary GIs unexpectedly ordered back into the line when on their way to a rest area. While most of the men withdraw from their positions facing a German pillbox at the far side of a mine-field, half a dozen men are left to protect a wide front. By various ruses, they manage to convince the Germans that a large force is still holding the position. Then Reese leads two of the men in an unauthorized and unsuccessful attack on the pillbox, in which the other two are killed; and when the main platoon returns, he is threatened with court-martial. Rather that face the disgrace, and in an attempt to show he was right, he makes a one-man attack on the pillbox.', 'World War II drama where the action centers around a single maneuver by a squad of GIs in retaliation against the force of the German Siegfried line. Reese joins a group of weary GIs unexpectedly ordered back into the line when on their way to a rest area. While most of the men withdraw from their positions facing a German pillbox at the far side of a mine-field, half a dozen men are left to protect a wide front. By various ruses, they manage to convince the Germans that a large force is still holding the position. Then Reese leads two of the men in an unauthorized and unsuccessful attack on the pillbox, in which the other two are killed; and when the main platoon returns, he is threatened with court-martial. Rather that face the disgrace, and in an attempt to show he was right, he makes a one-man attack on the pillbox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZ0h8V0jsS5NLKdUZIZ2I2xMWtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32041'),
  ('1139481258111287953', 'Hell Night', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tom DeSimone, Mac Ahlberg, Johanna Ray', 'Randy Feldman', 'Linda Blair, Vincent Van Patten, Peter Barton, Suki Goodwin, Kevin Brophy, Jenny Neumann, Jimmy Sturtevant, Hal Ralston', 'R', 'As an initiation rite into Alpha Sigma Rho fraternity, four pledges must spend a night in Garth Manor, twelve years to the day after the previous resident murdered his entire family.', 'As an initiation rite into Alpha Sigma Rho fraternity, four pledges must spend a night in Garth Manor, twelve years to the day after the previous resident murdered his entire family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IqqzSQmZFAon2C1lQZeZCUUx8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28377'),
  ('176935094342213675', 'Hell of a Summer', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy, Mystery', 'Kristofer Bonnell, Finn Wolfhard, Billy Bryk', 'Billy Bryk, Finn Wolfhard', 'Finn Wolfhard, Billy Bryk, Fred Hechinger, Abby Quinn, Krista Nazaire, Daniel Gravelle, Pardis Saremi, Julia Lalonde', 'R', 'When 24-year-old Jason Hochberg arrives for counsellor weekend at his beloved Camp Pineway, his biggest problem is feeling out of touch with his teenage co-workers. Little does he know; a masked killer has murdered camp owners John and Kathy and is preparing to strike again.', 'When 24-year-old Jason Hochberg arrives for counsellor weekend at his beloved Camp Pineway, his biggest problem is feeling out of touch with his teenage co-workers. Little does he know; a masked killer has murdered camp owners John and Kathy and is preparing to strike again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9rRLc9pRDR8H6YoJTmXrBmivxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999243'),
  ('938816009079050853', 'Hell of Boomerang', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Osman Sınav, Tevfik Şenol', 'Raci Şaşmaz, Osman Sınav', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Oktay Kaynarca, Zara, Zafer Ergin, Melda Bekcan, Selçuk Yöntem, Macit Sonkan, Emin Gürsoy', null, 'Yusuf Miroğlu and Zeynep travel to Diyarbakır in southeast Turkey to attend his best friend Cemal''s wedding. While performing the traditional halay dance at the wedding, Cemal is killed by an assassin. Cemal''s widowed wife Leyla pleads Yusuf to find the people behind the murder and bring them to justice. Yusuf finds himself caught in a struggle against the PKK and other terrorist groups in the area.', 'Yusuf Miroğlu and Zeynep travel to Diyarbakır in southeast Turkey to attend his best friend Cemal''s wedding. While performing the traditional halay dance at the wedding, Cemal is killed by an assassin. Cemal''s widowed wife Leyla pleads Yusuf to find the people behind the murder and bring them to justice. Yusuf finds himself caught in a struggle against the PKK and other terrorist groups in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nI9U0teyntTLf5dC1rp8U5vcKzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199326'),
  ('846391659365874181', 'Hell on Frisco Bay', 1955, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Frank Tuttle, John F. Seitz, William Kissell', 'Sydney Boehm, Martin Rackin', 'Alan Ladd, Edward G. Robinson, Joanne Dru, William Demarest, Paul Stewart, Perry Lopez, Fay Wray, Renata Vanni', 'NR', 'A cop framed for a murder he did not commit hunts the San Francisco waterfront for the Mob racketeers who are responsible.', 'A cop framed for a murder he did not commit hunts the San Francisco waterfront for the Mob racketeers who are responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21o3KxIckSKUq3csuW3dHyEaLbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72778'),
  ('433109682735454354', 'Hell on the Border', 2019, 'Western, Adventure', 'Wes Miller, Michael Brouphy, William Washington', 'Wes Miller', 'Ron Perlman, Frank Grillo, David Gyasi, Randy Wayne, Manu Intiraymi, Gianni Capaldi, Jaqueline Fleming, Alexander Kane', 'PG-13', 'In the late 1800s, legendary marshal Bass Reeves sets out on the trail of notorious outlaw Bob Dozier.', 'In the late 1800s, legendary marshal Bass Reeves sets out on the trail of notorious outlaw Bob Dozier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43fhV5lUAUlz5Jx8fXm4vytspr3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576379'),
  ('950022560775734222', 'Hell or High Water', 2016, 'Western, Crime, Drama', 'David Mackenzie, Giles Nuttgens', 'Taylor Sheridan', 'Jeff Bridges, Chris Pine, Ben Foster, Gil Birmingham, Marin Ireland, Kevin Rankin, Dale Dickey, William Sterchi', 'R', 'A divorced dad and his ex-con brother resort to a desperate scheme in order to save their family''s farm in West Texas.', 'A divorced dad and his ex-con brother resort to a desperate scheme in order to save their family''s farm in West Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljRRxqy2aXIkIBXLmOVifcOR021.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338766'),
  ('19541689566706677', 'Hell Penitentiary', 1984, 'Action, Drama', 'Gianni Siragusa, Richard Eames', 'Sergio Garrone', 'Ajita Wilson, Rita Silva, Linda Jones, Alessandro Freyberger, Cesare Di Vito, Leo Annibali, Helen Johansson, Adriana Giuffrè', null, 'When her sister turns up dead, Julia (Linda Jones) tries to convince the cops that a notorious gangster is to blame by going undercover as a prisoner to unearth the only witness to the crime. Problems arise when the sexually perverse warden (Rita Silva) adopts Julia as her new plaything and throws her noble mission off-course. Ajita Wilson and Alessandro Freyberger co-star in this erotically charged thriller.', 'When her sister turns up dead, Julia (Linda Jones) tries to convince the cops that a notorious gangster is to blame by going undercover as a prisoner to unearth the only witness to the crime. Problems arise when the sexually perverse warden (Rita Silva) adopts Julia as her new plaything and throws her noble mission off-course. Ajita Wilson and Alessandro Freyberger co-star in this erotically charged thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Rheh390otTEIj1NHucEyIsaXL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167092'),
  ('893179403873143297', 'Hell Ride', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Larry Bishop, Scott Kevan', 'Larry Bishop', 'Larry Bishop, Michael Madsen, Eric Balfour, Dennis Hopper, Leonor Varela, David Carradine, Michael Beach, Vinnie Jones', 'R', 'Two rival bikers gangs, the Victors and the Six-Six-Six''s, refuel their decades-old rivalry.', 'Two rival bikers gangs, the Victors and the Six-Six-Six''s, refuel their decades-old rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZcKg8Zai9J4vFq1fAbbtGOOqix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13300'),
  ('543633290804533368', 'Hell River', 1974, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Stole Janković', 'Howard Berk', 'Rod Taylor, Adam West, Velimir Živojinović, Brioni Farrell, Peter Carsten, Olivera Katarina, Branko Pleša, Marinko Šebez', null, 'Yugoslav partisans battle Nazi invaders in a series of bloody confrontations which eventually culminate in the Battle at Hell River.', 'Yugoslav partisans battle Nazi invaders in a series of bloody confrontations which eventually culminate in the Battle at Hell River.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KADDF0xM0r6FYhe6d52DVgrafo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84361'),
  ('1132618753850153497', 'Hell Squad', 1985, 'Action, Thriller, War', 'John McCoy, Kenneth Hartford', null, 'Bainbridge Scott, Marvin Miller, Glen Hartford, Kimberly Baucum, Madeline Parquette, Walter Cox, William Bryant, Frank Romano', 'R', 'In order to rescue the son of a diplomat who has been kidnapped by terrorists, a group of Las Vegas showgirls undergo commando training and organize a rescue operation.', 'In order to rescue the son of a diplomat who has been kidnapped by terrorists, a group of Las Vegas showgirls undergo commando training and organize a rescue operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vj9rYFhz0HBrRxEfQYj1xlyMVTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126034'),
  ('601011810741163178', 'Hell to Eternity', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Phil Karlson, Burnett Guffey', 'Ted Sherdeman, Walter Roeber Schmidt', 'Jeffrey Hunter, David Janssen, Sessue Hayakawa, Vic Damone, George Takei, Reiko Sato, Patricia Owens, Richard Eyer', 'NR', 'Based on the story about Guy Gabaldon, a Los Angeles Hispanic boy raised in the 1930s by a Japanese-American foster family. After Pearl Harbor, his foster family is interned at the Manzanar camp for Japanese Americans, while he enlists in the Marines, where his ability to speak Japanese becomes a vital asset. During the Battle of Saipan, he convinces 800 Japanese to surrender after their general commits suicide.', 'Based on the story about Guy Gabaldon, a Los Angeles Hispanic boy raised in the 1930s by a Japanese-American foster family. After Pearl Harbor, his foster family is interned at the Manzanar camp for Japanese Americans, while he enlists in the Marines, where his ability to speak Japanese becomes a vital asset. During the Battle of Saipan, he convinces 800 Japanese to surrender after their general commits suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBZ4etannpLgRK9MhAqHyt5CZMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43034'),
  ('227426098527571832', 'Hell Torture', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Enggar Budiono, Pilip Tenonet, Anggy Umbara', 'Lele Laila', 'Safira Ratu Sofya, Slamet Rahardjo, Kiesha Alvaro, Ariyo Wahab, Nayla D. Purnama, Rizky Fachrel, Astri Nurdin, Ingrid Widjanarko', null, 'Four siblings go missing and wake up in the afterlife, undergoing punishment for their worldly sins in the depths of hell.', 'Four siblings go missing and wake up in the afterlife, undergoing punishment for their worldly sins in the depths of hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gt0zaEuYDgr5AbgHkLKmTfliBdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058063'),
